ctor, a talented young drummer begins to pursue perfection at any cost, even his humanity.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Drama","Music","Thriller"],"release_date":"2014-10-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fRGxZuo7jJUWQsVg9PREb98Aclp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7fn624j5lj3xTme2SgiLCeuedmO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fRGxZuo7jJUWQsVg9PREb98Aclp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7fn624j5lj3xTme2SgiLCeuedmO.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":27205,"title":"Inception","description":"Cobb, a skilled thief who commits corporate espionage by infiltrating the subconscious of his targets is offered a chance to regain his old life as payment for a task considered to be impossible: \"inception\", the implantation of another person''s idea into a target''s subconscious.","duration":"2:28:00","genre":["Action","Science Fiction","Crime"],"release_date":"2010-07-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8ZTVqvKDQ8emSGUEMjsS4yHAwrp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xlaY2zyzMfkhk0HSC5VUwzoZPU1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8ZTVqvKDQ8emSGUEMjsS4yHAwrp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xlaY2zyzMfkhk0HSC5VUwzoZPU1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1150394,"title":"La Leyenda de los Chaneques","description":"Five years after giving up his powers and separating from his friends, Leo San Juan has started a new life trying to focus on his family and their bakery, staying away from danger and adventures. However, Leo knows that his plans are rarely fulfilled and this time is no exception: while traveling with Nando to Veracruz, things start to get weird, and from the depths of the Tuxtlas jungle, an ancient curse has returned and only Leo can face it.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Family","Horror"],"release_date":"2023-07-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.o