ario Galaxy Movie","description":"Having thwarted Bowser''s previous plot to marry Princess Peach, Mario and Luigi now face a fresh threat in Bowser Jr., who is determined to liberate his father from captivity and restore the family legacy. Alongside companions new and old, the brothers travel across the stars to stop the young heir''s crusade.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Family","Comedy","Adventure","Fantasy","Animation"],"release_date":"2026-04-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kxQiIJ4gVcD3K6o14MJ72p5yRcE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eJGWx219ZcEMVQJhAgMiqo8tYY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kxQiIJ4gVcD3K6o14MJ72p5yRcE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eJGWx219ZcEMVQJhAgMiqo8tYY.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":110420,"title":"Wolf Children","description":"After her werewolf lover unexpectedly dies in an accident, a woman must find a way to raise the son and daughter that she had with him. However, their inheritance of their father''s traits prove to be a challenge for her.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Drama","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2012-07-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oMqgJMCaNIqeJtilc71D4nRqdmt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vHMvBkr42Gh3OORcnmfCFfqJ1E.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oMqgJMCaNIqeJtilc71D4nRqdmt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vHMvBkr42Gh3OORcnmfCFfqJ1E.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":508965,"title":"Klaus","description":"A selfish postman and a reclusive toymaker form an unlikely friendship, delivering joy to a cold, dark town that desperately needs it.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Comedy"],"release_date":"2019-11-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cYQvXNPZLow73lhspVQ7CYlT3Mi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/q1