tion":"Seventeen-year-old Stella spends most of her time in the hospital as a cystic fibrosis patient. Her life is full of routines, boundaries and self-control — all of which get put to the test when she meets Will, an impossibly charming teen who has the same illness. There''s an instant flirtation, though restrictions dictate that they must maintain a safe distance between them. As their connection intensifies, so does the temptation to throw the rules out the window and embrace that attraction.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2019-03-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cYdHaKx6Ihj1BIvbxpCxIGXfZ02.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kreTuJBkUjVWePRfhHZuYfhNE1T.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cYdHaKx6Ihj1BIvbxpCxIGXfZ02.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kreTuJBkUjVWePRfhHZuYfhNE1T.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1124,"title":"The Prestige","description":"A mysterious story of two magicians whose intense rivalry leads them on a life-long battle for supremacy -- full of obsession, deceit and jealousy with dangerous and deadly consequences.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Drama","Mystery","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2006-10-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yaExZh6qE2cfyK3o4kAMEq0mkgy.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/Ag2B2KHKQPukjH7WutmgnnSNurZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yaExZh6qE2cfyK3o4kAMEq0mkgy.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//Ag2B2KHKQPukjH7WutmgnnSNurZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":494656,"title":"The Legend of the Black Charro","description":"After releasing the Chupacabras, Leo San Juan decides that it is time to return together with his brother Nando to his grandmother''s house. Halfway down the road, Charro Negro manages to confuse Leo and because of him, an innocent girl is dragged into the underworld. Leo 