ger to crack down on juvenile crime, gives an incarcerated Alex the option to undergo an invasive procedure that''ll rob him of all personal agency. In a time when conscience is a commodity, can Alex change his tune?","duration":"2:17:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Crime"],"release_date":"1971-10-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nLFxvLokHe3bQmrmAfljIfax2jQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uBB2SoceeHndk1lgBgTxXpMocFg.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nLFxvLokHe3bQmrmAfljIfax2jQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uBB2SoceeHndk1lgBgTxXpMocFg.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":851644,"title":"20th Century Girl","description":"In 1999, a teen girl keeps close tabs on a boy in school on behalf of her deeply smitten best friend – then she gets swept up in a love story of her own.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2022-10-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/37y53Jt8K6MvN6s4zJVFa61luO2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/od22ftNnyag0TTxcnJhlsu3aLoU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//37y53Jt8K6MvN6s4zJVFa61luO2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//od22ftNnyag0TTxcnJhlsu3aLoU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":441130,"title":"Wolfwalkers","description":"In a time of superstition and magic, when wolves are seen as demonic and nature an evil to be tamed, a young apprentice hunter comes to Ireland with her father to wipe out the last pack. But when she saves a wild native girl, their friendship leads her to discover the world of the Wolfwalkers and transform her into the very thing her father is tasked to destroy.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2020-10-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3zTbERSBLh7waK9811RTKGAcG86.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_