e":"Kill Bill: The Whole Bloody Affair","description":"A former assassin, known simply as The Bride, wakes from a coma four years after her jealous ex-lover Bill attempts to murder her on her wedding day. Fueled by an insatiable desire for revenge, she vows to get even with every person who contributed to the loss of her unborn child, her entire wedding party, and four years of her life.  After devising a hit list, The Bride sets off on her quest, enduring unspeakable injury and unscrupulous enemies.","duration":"4:14:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2011-03-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gxSWwZyYPA50f5T2IJzFX4NzxAG.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nSOJfWJCdVFZQwXQA7RXn7FIIiY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gxSWwZyYPA50f5T2IJzFX4NzxAG.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nSOJfWJCdVFZQwXQA7RXn7FIIiY.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":146233,"title":"Prisoners","description":"After his six-year-old daughter is abducted, a desperate father takes justice into his own hands when he loses faith in the detective leading the investigation, setting both men on a collision course as the search descends into obsession and moral compromise.","duration":"2:33:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2013-09-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3RFmTz5h2UuFWEV4oH00XICBR9y.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uhviyknTT5cEQXbn6vWIqfM4vGm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3RFmTz5h2UuFWEV4oH00XICBR9y.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uhviyknTT5cEQXbn6vWIqfM4vGm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":810693,"title":"Jujutsu Kaisen 0","description":"Yuta Okkotsu is a nervous high school student who is suffering from a serious problem—his childhood friend Rika has turned into a curse and won''t leave him alone. Since Rika is no ordinary curse, his plight is noticed by Satoru Gojo, a teacher at Jujutsu High, a school where fledgling exorcists learn how to combat curses. Gojo convinces Yuta to enroll, but can he learn enough in time to confront the curse that haunts him?","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2021-12-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rcEDPOOOUTLFxLLQJggfLffbofe.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/23oJaeBh0FDk2mQ2P240PU9Xxfh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rcEDPOOOUTLFxLLQJggfLffbofe.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//23oJaeBh0FDk2mQ2P240PU9Xxfh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":46738,"title":"Incendies","description":"A mother''s last wishes send twins Jeanne and Simon on a journey to Middle East in search of their tangled roots. Adapted from Wajdi Mouawad''s acclaimed play, Incendies tells the powerful and moving tale of two young adults'' voyage to the core of deep-rooted hatred, never-ending wars and enduring love.","duration":"2:11:00","genre":["Drama","War","Mystery"],"release_date":"2010-09-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/f3ATwil5vmUeTsogBaMEKbBYBth.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yH6DAQVgbyj72S66gN4WWVoTjuf.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//f3ATwil5vmUeTsogBaMEKbBYBth.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yH6DAQVgbyj72S66gN4WWVoTjuf.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":292177,"title":"My Little Pony: Equestria Girls – Rainbow Rocks","description":"Music rules and rainbows rock as Twilight Sparkle and pals compete for the top spot in the Canterlot High \"Mane Event\" talent show. The girls must rock their way to the top, and outshine rival Adagio Dazzle and her band The Dazzlings, to restore harmony back to Canterlot High.","duration":"1:13:00","genre":["Family","Animation","Music"],"release_date":"2014-09-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_a