c serial rapist and murderer of young women terrorizes a small province in 1980s South Korea. To prevent further crimes, three increasingly desperate detectives with conflicting methods race against time to unravel the violent mind of the killer in a futile effort to solve the case.","duration":"2:11:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2003-04-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6Kn6qW3an3DkPl3MahWemTzrjCt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jcgUjx1QcupGzjntTVlnQ15lHqy.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6Kn6qW3an3DkPl3MahWemTzrjCt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jcgUjx1QcupGzjntTVlnQ15lHqy.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":7345,"title":"There Will Be Blood","description":"Ruthless silver miner, turned oil prospector, Daniel Plainview, moves to oil-rich California. Using his son to project a trustworthy, family-man image, Plainview cons local landowners into selling him their valuable properties for a pittance. However, local preacher Eli Sunday suspects Plainview''s motives and intentions, starting a slow-burning feud that threatens both their lives.","duration":"2:38:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2007-12-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9UAKA6ceZi6TgQwTAAMt7DWwYPI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fa0RDkAlCec0STeMNAhPaF89q6U.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9UAKA6ceZi6TgQwTAAMt7DWwYPI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fa0RDkAlCec0STeMNAhPaF89q6U.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":21634,"title":"Prayers for Bobby","description":"Bobby Griffith was his mother''s favorite son, the perfect all-American boy growing up under deeply religious influences in Walnut Creek, California. Bobby was also gay. Struggling with a conflict no one knew of, much less understood, Bobby finally came out to his family.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Drama","History","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2009-01-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9BrhCgffilZPr3VOnDAKP9vBrU1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1viFwXluAettogGDsTrSUUg29lZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9BrhCgffilZPr3VOnDAKP9vBrU1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1viFwXluAettogGDsTrSUUg29lZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":20334,"title":"The Shop Around the Corner","description":"Two employees at a gift shop can barely stand one another, without realising that they are falling in love through the post as each other''s anonymous pen pal.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1940-01-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wqgZSvgoctaadgwUdPYVsksivxn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dZ1aEzGYRiqJwPfjS6VL7wUkHmF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wqgZSvgoctaadgwUdPYVsksivxn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dZ1aEzGYRiqJwPfjS6VL7wUkHmF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":7347,"title":"Elite Squad","description":"In 1997, before the visit of the pope to Rio de Janeiro, Captain Nascimento from BOPE (Special Police Operations Battalion) is assigned to eliminate the risks of the drug dealers in a dangerous slum nearby where the pope intends to be lodged.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Drama","Action","Crime"],"release_date":"2007-10-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/huUgrGkCetYSkDl5fMvZCXCbFKl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lwIXz785N2fXi8hsBr1IXciFlkM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//huUgrGkCetYSkDl5fMvZCXCbFKl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lwIXz785N2fXi8hsBr1IXciFlkM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":800,"title":"The Young and the Damned","description":"A group of juvenile delinquents live a violent life in the infamous slums of Mexico City; among them Pedro, whose morality is gradually corrupted and destroyed by the others.","duration":"1:22:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"1950-12-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5jewDz5RxdarX45djYc8kjGa5Ia.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cDCvmYoyqFg4CuSMtGMvCpfOIEw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5jewDz5RxdarX45djYc8kjGa5Ia.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cDCvmYoyqFg4CuSMtGMvCpfOIEw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":832,"title":"M","description":"In this classic German thriller, Hans Beckert, a serial killer who preys on children, becomes the focus of a massive Berlin police manhunt. Beckert''s heinous crimes are so repellant and disruptive to city life that he is even targeted by others in the seedy underworld network. With both cops and criminals in pursuit, the murderer soon realizes that people are on his trail, sending him into a tense, panicked attempt to escape justice.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"1931-05-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5Pk1rGAtyblh9Xaq72T7ARCQSDQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bTdZk3q2DWpBRnLiaaItKFWOVhI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5Pk1rGAtyblh9Xaq72T7ARCQSDQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bTdZk3q2DWpBRnLiaaItKFWOVhI.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":381284,"title":"Hidden Figures","description":"The untold story of Katherine G. Johnson, Dorothy Vaughan and Mary Jackson – brilliant African-American women working at NASA and serving as the brains behind one of the greatest operations in history – the launch of astronaut John Glenn into orbit. The visionary trio crossed all gender and race lines to inspire generations to dream big.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2016-12-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rfk