s a large bounty on his head.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Western"],"release_date":"1965-12-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hs6OPto38fF589ScpGhl7uSU4MI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ooqASvA7qxlTVKL3KwOzBwy57Dh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hs6OPto38fF589ScpGhl7uSU4MI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ooqASvA7qxlTVKL3KwOzBwy57Dh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":437068,"title":"A Taxi Driver","description":"May, 1980. Man-seob is a taxi driver in Seoul who lives from hand to mouth, raising his young daughter alone. One day, he hears that there is a foreigner who will pay big money for a drive down to Gwangju city. Not knowing that he’s a German journalist with a hidden agenda, Man-seob takes the job.","duration":"2:18:00","genre":["Action","Drama","History"],"release_date":"2017-08-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dbXjTu5J00kCggPnQlDpVZmDBil.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iXVaWbxmyPk4KZGZk5GGDGFieMX.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dbXjTu5J00kCggPnQlDpVZmDBil.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iXVaWbxmyPk4KZGZk5GGDGFieMX.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":106646,"title":"The Wolf of Wall Street","description":"A New York stockbroker refuses to cooperate in a large securities fraud case involving corruption on Wall Street, corporate banking world and mob infiltration. Based on Jordan Belfort''s autobiography.","duration":"3:00:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2013-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7Nwnmyzrtd0FkcRyPqmdzTPppQa.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kW9LmvYHAaS9iA0tHmZVq8hQYoq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7Nwnmyzrtd0FkcRyPqmdzTPppQa.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kW9LmvYHAaS9iA0tHmZVq8hQYoq.jpg"},{"