 Hogwarts.","duration":"2:21:00","genre":["Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2004-05-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vbk5CfaAHOjQPSAcYm6AoRRz2Af.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aWxwnYoe8p2d2fcxOqtvAtJ72Rw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vbk5CfaAHOjQPSAcYm6AoRRz2Af.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aWxwnYoe8p2d2fcxOqtvAtJ72Rw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":893941,"title":"Misfit","description":"Julia, a teenager from Latin America, has lived in the U.S. most of her life. She is popular, a successful Youtuber and wants to become prom queen. Everything changes abruptly when her family has to return to Ecuador. What will she have to face? Getting used to a new culture and a catholic high school will not be easy. The \"gringa\" becomes the target of \"La Reinas\", three popular bullies who rule the school. Julia is now a misfit who will have to earn her new friends'' affection in order to survive.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2021-10-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/h23pHmUwv7JEpDGwHr5ogR8bpQX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yDwDiovi6qLcluB4EI3bJp1zOwa.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//h23pHmUwv7JEpDGwHr5ogR8bpQX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yDwDiovi6qLcluB4EI3bJp1zOwa.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":33251,"title":"The Way Home","description":"This is the story of a 7-year-old boy, Sang-woo, born and raised in the big city, and his mute grandmother, who has spent her whole life in a small rural village.","duration":"1:26:00","genre":["Drama","Family"],"release_date":"2002-04-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u4uANfkQL69QWLtvEvZS6D0pHLY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/z2NTGih179RkIN7EQntiFy5RZiF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/