udios to soap operas, he finally finds success and fame when he becomes \"Bingo\", a TV host clown from one of the audience leader TV shows for children. It turns out that behind the rice powder and red nose, nobody knows who he is.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2017-08-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/96el06riGUnHRJGXxhP9StZzhFt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/izz36X4Hg7JCei5BOVeXTjVuQzF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//96el06riGUnHRJGXxhP9StZzhFt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//izz36X4Hg7JCei5BOVeXTjVuQzF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":530915,"title":"1917","description":"At the height of the First World War, two young British soldiers must cross enemy territory and deliver a message that will stop a deadly attack on hundreds of soldiers.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["War","Drama","History"],"release_date":"2019-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2lBOQK06tltt8SQaswgb8d657Mv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iZf0KyrE25z1sage4SYFLCCrMi9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2lBOQK06tltt8SQaswgb8d657Mv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iZf0KyrE25z1sage4SYFLCCrMi9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":339877,"title":"Loving Vincent","description":"A young man arrives at the last hometown of painter Vincent van Gogh to deliver the troubled artist''s final letter and ends up investigating his final days there.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Animation","Drama","History"],"release_date":"2017-06-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/KKrsUGDXZfpeL3ddXTeGibmUHS.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/56sq57kDm7XgyXBYrgJLumo0Jac.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//KKrsUGDXZfpeL3ddXTeGibmUHS.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//56sq57kDm7XgyXBYrgJLumo0Jac.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":110416,"title":"Song of the Sea","description":"The story of the last Seal Child’s journey home. After their mother’s disappearance, Ben and Saoirse are sent to live with Granny in the city. When they resolve to return to their home by the sea, their journey becomes a race against time as they are drawn into a world Ben knows only from his mother’s folktales. But this is no bedtime story; these fairy folk have been in our world far too long. It soon becomes clear to Ben that Saoirse is the key to their survival.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Family","Animation","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2014-06-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mVLZvSe1Aa8CFKx0cInTamVZJrW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/16LQC6zpqB0l74mVWb93a2oMFnX.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mVLZvSe1Aa8CFKx0cInTamVZJrW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//16LQC6zpqB0l74mVWb93a2oMFnX.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1059,"title":"The Hidden Fortress","description":"In feudal Japan, during a bloody war between clans, two cowardly and greedy peasants, soldiers of a defeated army, stumble upon a mysterious man who guides them to a fortress hidden in the mountains.","duration":"2:19:00","genre":["Drama","Action","Adventure"],"release_date":"1958-12-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aYD6bR1xs9OAK3lA5WHbvIX2gMN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uQHej0cFJHwSuaENizIZpYtsuNa.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aYD6bR1xs9OAK3lA5WHbvIX2gMN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uQHej0cFJHwSuaENizIZpYtsuNa.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":20544,"title":"Something the Lord Made","description":"A dramatization of the relationship between heart surgery pioneers Alfred Blalock and Vivien Thomas.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["TV Movie","Drama"],"release_date":"2004-05-30","backdrop_path":"https://im