ad of the ballet company plots to drive them apart.","duration":"2:13:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1948-09-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/Aa1jUhkenqspgGQlqbsXFax6iW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vPvpBWFWDvEXuQBkoYgA6A89GVp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//Aa1jUhkenqspgGQlqbsXFax6iW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vPvpBWFWDvEXuQBkoYgA6A89GVp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":640,"title":"Catch Me If You Can","description":"A true story about Frank Abagnale Jr. who, before his 19th birthday, successfully conned millions of dollars worth of checks as a Pan Am pilot, doctor, and legal prosecutor. An FBI agent makes it his mission to put him behind bars. But Frank not only eludes capture, he revels in the pursuit.","duration":"2:21:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"2002-12-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ggC3Brchf4RqPitEh7cROFoeAWn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ctjEj2xM32OvBXCq8zAdK3ZrsAj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ggC3Brchf4RqPitEh7cROFoeAWn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ctjEj2xM32OvBXCq8zAdK3ZrsAj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":329,"title":"Jurassic Park","description":"A wealthy entrepreneur secretly creates a theme park featuring living dinosaurs drawn from prehistoric DNA. Before opening day, he invites a team of experts and his two eager grandchildren to experience the park and help calm anxious investors. However, the park is anything but amusing as the security systems go off-line and the dinosaurs escape.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Adventure","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1993-06-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4SyDTF02R5BepqSdQmOaNCHObzF.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/d9mtMGQDLANKieb9PbD3yK7xxzo.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"htt