baf—as the basis for a stunning, multilayered investigation into movies, identity, artistic creation, and existence, in which the real people from the case play themselves.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"1990-05-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3t1qZqP1e17wQshpPKSqII1OogM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/m9HG2N9ZKCmNN9qOHJTNyy18wn3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3t1qZqP1e17wQshpPKSqII1OogM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//m9HG2N9ZKCmNN9qOHJTNyy18wn3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":46592,"title":"Ballad of a Soldier","description":"During World War II, earnest young Russian soldier Alyosha Skvortsov is rewarded with a short leave of absence for performing a heroic deed on the battlefield. Feeling homesick, he decides to visit his mother. Due to his kindhearted nature, however, Alyosha is repeatedly sidetracked by his efforts to help those he encounters, including a lovely girl named Shura. In his tour of a country devastated by war, he struggles to keep hope alive.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","War"],"release_date":"1959-12-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dt580H0MCP5Epuc0sI9TxmtjqnU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9teeqzdIgPkWsykRapYkqhdefmm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dt580H0MCP5Epuc0sI9TxmtjqnU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9teeqzdIgPkWsykRapYkqhdefmm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12761,"title":"Autumn Sonata","description":"After a seven-year absence, Charlotte Andergast travels to Sweden to reunite with her daughter Eva. The pair have a troubled relationship: Charlotte sacrificed the responsibilities of motherhood for a career as a classical pianist. Over an emotional night, the pair reopen the wounds of the past. Charlotte gets another shock when she finds out that her mentally impaired daughter, Helena, is out of the asylum and living with Eva.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1978-10-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ozNapY9iczRr6FYKRbLLM00szCW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6beNbtCXv3GkzHkxkGYf38ib7v8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ozNapY9iczRr6FYKRbLLM00szCW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6beNbtCXv3GkzHkxkGYf38ib7v8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":679,"title":"Aliens","description":"Ripley, the sole survivor of the Nostromo''s deadly encounter with the monstrous Alien, returns to Earth after drifting through space in hypersleep for 57 years. Although her story is initially met with skepticism, she agrees to accompany a team of Colonial Marines back to LV-426.","duration":"2:17:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1986-07-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4kix6fAblJIH6eMs0Ku2loyZJXK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/r1x5JGpyqZU8PYhbs4UcrO1Xb6x.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4kix6fAblJIH6eMs0Ku2loyZJXK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//r1x5JGpyqZU8PYhbs4UcrO1Xb6x.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":24,"title":"Kill Bill: Vol. 1","description":"An assassin is shot by her ruthless employer, Bill, and other members of their assassination circle – but she lives to plot her vengeance.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Action","Crime"],"release_date":"2003-10-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iffzIhuLAO38Po6sh1s6ZEVwlNL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/v7TaX8kXMXs5yFFGR41guUDNcnB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iffzIhuLAO38Po6sh1s6ZEVwlNL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//v7TaX8kXMXs5yFFGR41guUDNcnB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":52629,"title":"El Infierno","description":"After being deported back to Mexico, a man has no choice but to join the vicious drug cartel that has corrupted his hometown in order to survive.","duration":"2:28:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Western","Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2010-09-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bQObbnj0TY2Q1c55w78m1AN6VNX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ar8BpJ5xAzTIw9bqD9Sra6TjBvw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bQObbnj0TY2Q1c55w78m1AN6VNX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ar8BpJ5xAzTIw9bqD9Sra6TjBvw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":780,"title":"The Passion of Joan of Arc","description":"A classic of the silent age, this film tells the story of the doomed but ultimately canonized 15th-century teenage warrior. On trial for claiming she''d spoken to God, Jeanne d''Arc is subjected to inhumane treatment and scare tactics at the hands of church court officials. Initially bullied into changing her story, Jeanne eventually opts for what she sees as the truth. Her punishment, a famously brutal execution, earns her perpetual martyrdom.","duration":"1:21:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"1928-04-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5YyWhr5cgVeYYHbsWjyQ0OGKkmu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tAgV9yxY6AC1bsPt3qJJQpD4s8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5YyWhr5cgVeYYHbsWjyQ0OGKkmu.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tAgV9yxY6AC1bsPt3qJJQpD4s8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":76,"title":"Before Sunrise","description":"An unexpected meeting on a train leads two travelers to spend an evening wandering through Vienna. As the night unfolds, they share stories and conversations about life and love, exploring new ideas while a quiet intimacy grows between them, knowing it may be their only night together.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1995-01-27","backdrop_path":"https: