g","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rA9QYI7yTV2F2AvaqBcq1vL3MOr.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hop0dsM4nxyNENGhBhpJWTCJ5rS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5925,"title":"The Great Escape","description":"The Nazis, exasperated at the number of escapes from their prison camps by a relatively small number of Allied prisoners, relocate them to a high-security ''escape-proof'' camp to sit out the remainder of the war. Undaunted, the prisoners plan one of the most ambitious escape attempts of World War II. Based on a true story.","duration":"2:53:00","genre":["Adventure","Drama","War"],"release_date":"1963-07-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zlg0d4pnq1xDOU4cQxqGG8bX5l0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gBH4H8UMFxl139HaLz6lRuvsel8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zlg0d4pnq1xDOU4cQxqGG8bX5l0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gBH4H8UMFxl139HaLz6lRuvsel8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":3777,"title":"Throne of Blood","description":"Returning to their lord''s castle, samurai warriors Washizu and Miki are waylaid by a spirit who predicts their futures. When the first part of the spirit''s prophecy comes true, Washizu''s scheming wife, Asaji, presses him to speed up the rest of the spirit''s prophecy by murdering his lord and usurping his place. Director Akira Kurosawa''s resetting of William Shakespeare''s \"Macbeth\" in feudal Japan is one of his most acclaimed films.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"1957-01-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rohRr9XqTRF8YwLMGAnTprg3GnL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zaZFMNxJST0TtPd68yF7fNt1he8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rohRr9XqTRF8YwLMGAnTprg3GnL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zaZFMNxJST0TtPd68yF7fNt1he8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":194,"title":"Amélie","description":"At a tiny Parisian café, the adorable yet painfully shy Amélie accidentally discovers a gift for helping others. Soon Amelie is spending her days as a matchmaker, guardian angel, and all-around do-gooder. But when she bumps into a handsome stranger, will she find the courage to become the star of her very own love story?","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2001-04-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6n53UI4mX9QMfe2S0Pgt8mGebY1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nSxDa3M9aMvGVLoItzWTepQ5h5d.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6n53UI4mX9QMfe2S0Pgt8mGebY1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nSxDa3M9aMvGVLoItzWTepQ5h5d.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":38360,"title":"The Cranes Are Flying","description":"Veronika and Boris come together in Moscow shortly before World War II. Walking along the river, they watch cranes fly overhead, and promise to rendezvous before Boris leaves to fight. Boris misses the meeting and is off to the front lines, while Veronika waits patiently, sending letters faithfully. After her house is bombed, Veronika moves in with Boris'' family, into the company of a cousin with his own intentions.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","War"],"release_date":"1957-10-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/r6bIGLFJ2ml9L970RNpuwDyb4Af.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/foXYOdXEJ0rvtTDo4LLnsUnvPLB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//r6bIGLFJ2ml9L970RNpuwDyb4Af.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//foXYOdXEJ0rvtTDo4LLnsUnvPLB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":49964,"title":"Where Is The Friend''s House?","description":"An 8-year-old boy must return his friend''s notebook he took by mistake, lest his friend be punished by expulsion from school.","duration":"1:23:00","genre":["Drama","Adventure"],"release_date":"1987-07-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ylBiGZhgBsly0frseG2PvqoYM4o.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lrrtMVv2X8PNO7UA0Ce0gTtfuC8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ylBiGZhgBsly0frseG2PvqoYM4o.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lrrtMVv2X8PNO7UA0Ce0gTtfuC8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8290,"title":"Don''t Look Now... We''re Being Shot At!","description":"During World War II, two French civilians and a downed British Bomber Crew set out from Paris to cross the demarcation line between Nazi-occupied Northern France and the South. From there they will be able to escape to England. First, they must avoid German troops – and the consequences of their own blunders.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Comedy","War"],"release_date":"1966-12-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7db8Z5jgPbTErb0bdezzxhI8qg7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/91l4Sf3WJwrb0tSVPsOqnBXG8E6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7db8Z5jgPbTErb0bdezzxhI8qg7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//91l4Sf3WJwrb0tSVPsOqnBXG8E6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":520594,"title":"John Mulaney: Kid Gorgeous at Radio City","description":"John Mulaney relays stories from his childhood and \"SNL,\" eviscerates the value of college and laments getting older in this electric comedy special.","duration":"1:05:00","genre":["Comedy","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2018-05-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vDNRa1QAQqExIzmaYpGlkZw1vGL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fERO7sktbElVbGS1SGDKzQJWxtn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vDNRa1QAQqExIzmaYpGlkZw1vGL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fERO7sktbElVbGS1SGDKzQJWxtn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":961,"title":"The General","description":"During America’s Civil War, Union spies steal engineer Johnny Gray''s