.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ze7GsNSv418o7pzqc9fb00LWWDk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2p3AFtOHFvP6OeVMqlnL1zLKOqL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":33,"title":"Unforgiven","description":"William Munny is a retired, once-ruthless killer turned gentle widower and hog farmer. To help support his two motherless children, he accepts one last bounty-hunter mission to find the men who brutalized a prostitute. Joined by his former partner and a cocky greenhorn, he takes on a corrupt sheriff.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Western"],"release_date":"1992-08-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5zkrI7P70j8C03ThBOvrEG6VF8M.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/54roTwbX9fltg85zjsmrooXAs12.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5zkrI7P70j8C03ThBOvrEG6VF8M.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//54roTwbX9fltg85zjsmrooXAs12.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1607,"title":"A Bronx Tale","description":"Set in the Bronx during the tumultuous 1960s, an adolescent boy is torn between his honest, working-class father and a violent yet charismatic crime boss. Complicating matters is the youngster''s growing attraction - forbidden in his neighborhood - for a beautiful black girl.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"1993-10-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ggzzn1Hf4zBz1VVywpQhGtDxKtA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7Obzc6svsHSR1za0LqzkpwFsEhw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ggzzn1Hf4zBz1VVywpQhGtDxKtA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7Obzc6svsHSR1za0LqzkpwFsEhw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":315465,"title":"The Boy and the Beast","description":"Kyuta, a boy living in Shibuya, and Kumatetsu, a lonesome beast from Jutengai, an imaginary world. One day, Kyuta forays into the imaginary world and, as he''s looking for his way back, meets Kumatetsu who becomes his spirit guide. That encounter leads them to many adventures.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Animation","Drama","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2015-07-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5qNBH6tY6Jihzo9SqzvrJFHMPgz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kRofx67xkbnJ6pAVcHdeMyBm4OM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5qNBH6tY6Jihzo9SqzvrJFHMPgz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kRofx67xkbnJ6pAVcHdeMyBm4OM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":237791,"title":"The Way He Looks","description":"Leonardo is a blind teenager dealing with an overprotective mother while trying to live a more independent life. To the disappointment of his best friend, Giovana, he plans to go on an exchange program abroad. When Gabriel, a new student in town, arrives at their classroom, new feelings blossom in Leonardo making him question his plans.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2014-04-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wMDg5cm1xIieCTINQo6drZWIy8n.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2BhhlAYwKvONGW7tr16ZhnD0sym.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wMDg5cm1xIieCTINQo6drZWIy8n.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2BhhlAYwKvONGW7tr16ZhnD0sym.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":43680,"title":"Heart of a Dog","description":"In 1920s Moscow, shortly after the October Revolution, a stray dog named Sharik is taken in by Professor Preobrazhensky, a wealthy and respected surgeon. The professor performs a daring medical experiment on the dog that changes him into a human being. As the newly transformed Sharikov begins to navigate life in the professor’s apartment, his crude behavior and revolutionary ideas turn the household upside down.","duration":"2:16:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Science Fiction","TV Movie"],"release_date":"1988-11-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/v9UtQvfasBZ40kQRTF2Tzx2FnVz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2kG3DWJ5OIaUZ0RtFEz6O9hEYDf.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//v9UtQvfasBZ40kQRTF2Tzx2FnVz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2kG3DWJ5OIaUZ0RtFEz6O9hEYDf.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1892,"title":"Return of the Jedi","description":"Luke Skywalker leads a mission to rescue his friend Han Solo from the clutches of Jabba the Hutt, the Emperor prepares to crush the Rebellion with a more powerful Death Star, and the Rebel fleet mounts a massive attack on the space station. Luke Skywalker confronts Darth Vader in a final climactic duel before the evil Emperor.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Adventure","Action","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1983-05-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ziECpBRIyclmBNaFSWlvCfsKbMD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jQYlydvHm3kUix1f8prMucrplhm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ziECpBRIyclmBNaFSWlvCfsKbMD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jQYlydvHm3kUix1f8prMucrplhm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":105203,"title":"Violet Perfume: Nobody Hears You","description":"Yessica is a rebellious girl who forms an unlikely friendship with quiet schoolmate Miriam. Yessica''s home life is ruled by her brutal stepfather and her amoral stepbrother, Jorge, while Miriam shares a calm, loving household with her mother. The girls'' friendship is shattered after Jorge arranges to have one of his friends rape Yessica.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2001-03-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1fJZzkyOKNv4ExSf7uXQNUzycr9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gWuhAHj0vK4UNZvJZevxobkmGDq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1fJZzkyOKNv4ExSf7uXQNUzycr9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gWuhAHj0vK4UNZvJZevxobkmGDq.jpg"}]'::jsonb
