.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hC4nTxdhXqFWzgqynGvvXVMiMNp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//b9qGMCOrMbxUjD6xDAYPoIPnYcC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hC4nTxdhXqFWzgqynGvvXVMiMNp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":404378,"title":"A Street Cat Named Bob","description":"James Bowen, a homeless busker and recovering drug addict, has his life transformed when he meets a stray ginger cat.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Family","Drama"],"release_date":"2016-11-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3YDuN1mhQpYtCym4QatX0gkHahL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nBYG0D2FcbL1m926sIj7RN4m0sb.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3YDuN1mhQpYtCym4QatX0gkHahL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nBYG0D2FcbL1m926sIj7RN4m0sb.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":69335,"title":"Estômago: A Gastronomic Story","description":"In a dog-eat-dog world, Raimundo Nonato has found an alternative way to move ahead: he cooks. No matter what social strata this deceptively innocent young man inhabits, he hones his skills and sharpens his knives—and then he falls in love. Jorge''s nimble comic fable provides a smartly constructed gastronomic allegory for ambition and survival.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Mystery","Crime"],"release_date":"2008-04-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3Os2EXMHcV9EkO0PWNIvT4phksL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mo9utQQ9nurl2ELWUzS4e3WHGDm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3Os2EXMHcV9EkO0PWNIvT4phksL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mo9utQQ9nurl2ELWUzS4e3WHGDm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15383,"title":"Army of Shadows","description":"Betrayed by an informant, Philippe Gerbier finds himself trapped in a torturous Nazi prison camp. Though Gerbier escapes to rejoin the Resistance in occupied Marseilles, France, and exacts his re