cken instead of dying in a frying pan; so he starts a quest to return to the farms along with his new friend, the noisy egg Willy and a crazy bacon stripe. The three friends will face lot of obstacles in their quest.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"2006-04-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bdo313RjHEymI0W5tKYBKE54Las.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eHqGqr5xBat3P2b9YdRbKMLli4J.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bdo313RjHEymI0W5tKYBKE54Las.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eHqGqr5xBat3P2b9YdRbKMLli4J.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":573730,"title":"Made in Abyss: Dawn of the Deep Soul","description":"A continuation of the epic adventure of plucky Riko and Reg who are joined by their new friend Nanachi. Together they descend into the Abyss'' treacherous fifth layer, the Sea of Corpses, and encounter the mysterious Bondrewd, a legendary White Whistle whose shadow looms over Nanachi''s troubled past. Bondrewd is ingratiatingly hospitable, but the brave adventurers know things are not always as they seem in the enigmatic Abyss.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Animation","Adventure","Fantasy","Mystery"],"release_date":"2020-01-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tQprwIKzFx83JpM5dVrGRC4UpF.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/k4riqNEEd5rnkbNytf02wkF4W8i.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tQprwIKzFx83JpM5dVrGRC4UpF.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//k4riqNEEd5rnkbNytf02wkF4W8i.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":323272,"title":"War Room","description":"The family-friendly movie explores the transformational role prayer plays in the lives of the Jordan family. Tony and Elizabeth Jordan, a middle-class couple who seemingly have it all – great jobs, a beautiful daughter, their dream home. But appearances can be deceiving. In reality, the Jordan’s marriage has become a war zone and their daughter is collateral damage. With the help of Miss Clara, an older, wiser woman, Elizabeth discovers she can start fighting for her family instead of against them. Through a newly energized faith, Elizabeth and Tony’s real enemy doesn’t have a prayer.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2015-08-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oCCvZEbqCCcALQtah8HJm9Ja4HT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/unxQeVUi5DH01r7ZNvAHwpvX7UK.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oCCvZEbqCCcALQtah8HJm9Ja4HT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//unxQeVUi5DH01r7ZNvAHwpvX7UK.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10191,"title":"How to Train Your Dragon","description":"As the son of a Viking leader on the cusp of manhood, shy Hiccup Horrendous Haddock III faces a rite of passage: he must kill a dragon to prove his warrior mettle. But after downing a feared dragon, he realizes that he no longer wants to destroy it, and instead befriends the beast – which he names Toothless – much to the chagrin of his warrior father.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Fantasy","Adventure","Animation","Family"],"release_date":"2010-03-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/59vDC1BuEQvti24OMr0ZvtAK6R1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ygGmAO60t8GyqUo9xYeYxSZAR3b.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//59vDC1BuEQvti24OMr0ZvtAK6R1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ygGmAO60t8GyqUo9xYeYxSZAR3b.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":7857,"title":"Amarcord","description":"In an Italian seaside town, young Titta gets into trouble with his friends and watches various local eccentrics as they engage in often absurd behavior. Frequently clashing with his stern father and defended by his doting mother, Titta witnesses the actions of a wide range of characters, from his extended family to Fascist 