eat Depression, a con man finds himself saddled with a young girl who may or may not be his daughter, and the two forge an unlikely partnership.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"1973-05-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2Cf8V0iQx0c52IxeLdxOvjI2bBf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3GHG0kTcBWHKdXjj3RdK8GjBCd6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2Cf8V0iQx0c52IxeLdxOvjI2bBf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3GHG0kTcBWHKdXjj3RdK8GjBCd6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":613,"title":"Downfall","description":"In April of 1945, Germany stands at the brink of defeat with the Russian Army closing in from the east and the Allied Expeditionary Force attacking from the west. In Berlin, capital of the Third Reich, Adolf Hitler proclaims that Germany will still achieve victory and orders his generals and advisers to fight to the last man. When the end finally does come, and Hitler lies dead by his own hand, what is left of his military must find a way to end the killing that is the Battle of Berlin, and lay down their arms in surrender.","duration":"2:35:00","genre":["Drama","History","War"],"release_date":"2004-09-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cT80aGpjWZLn8rd7cLtsbktFMhf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cP1ElGjBhbZAAqmueXjHDKlSwiP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cT80aGpjWZLn8rd7cLtsbktFMhf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cP1ElGjBhbZAAqmueXjHDKlSwiP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":360814,"title":"Dangal","description":"Dangal is an extraordinary true story based on the life of Mahavir Singh and his two daughters, Geeta and Babita Phogat. The film traces the inspirational journey of a father who trains his daughters to become world class wrestlers.","duration":"2:41:00","genre":["Drama","Family","Comedy"],"release_date":"2016-12-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/l0fNAHLOFReQJsxCOmGWvJDnimn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cJRPOLEexI7qp2DKtFfCh7YaaUG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//l0fNAHLOFReQJsxCOmGWvJDnimn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cJRPOLEexI7qp2DKtFfCh7YaaUG.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":581791,"title":"The Blonde One","description":"Gabriel has just moved in with Juan. Shy and reserved, Gabo resists Juan’s wandering hands and intense gaze. With a parade of beauties filing out of Juan’s bedroom, his machismo seems firmly entrenched. Yet, the attraction between the two men is undeniable. What begins as a sexual arrangement born of proximity soon evolves into a captivating, tender, and intimate relationship - one that is as sweet as it is heartbreaking.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2019-07-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lXajaGvX9fZXEFZ7yd4CgsPWkav.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5QiRL7YWh2FDbUcT9N3q7zg6U7U.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lXajaGvX9fZXEFZ7yd4CgsPWkav.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5QiRL7YWh2FDbUcT9N3q7zg6U7U.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":564427,"title":"Minha Vida em Marte","description":"Fernanda is married to Tom, with whom she has a five-year-old daughter, Joana. The couple is in the midst of wear and tear caused by living together for many years, which generates constant friction. Who helps Fernanda to overcome the crisis is her partner Aníbal, inseparable partner during the arduous journey between saving the marriage or putting an end to it.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2018-12-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5McQn3WUJCBVf58nKi6pf3i4q6o.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tJHWvQOdOj7G52wMKwq7heRUrkj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5McQn3WUJCBVf58nKi6pf3i4q6o.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tJHWvQOdOj7G52wMKwq7heRUrkj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":66105,"title":"Saint Seiya: Legend of Crimson Youth","description":"The Sun God Abel returns to life, bent on punishing the humans and cleansing Earth from their presence. When Athena joins him, leaving humans to their fate, the Bronze Saints must defend the world in their greatest battle yet.","duration":"1:15:00","genre":["Action","Animation","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1988-07-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/l4oOfCiMqIaaL0Vyx8dnu4FENra.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qDqk23o8qOljUetnCkQCQk7kElk.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//l4oOfCiMqIaaL0Vyx8dnu4FENra.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qDqk23o8qOljUetnCkQCQk7kElk.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":777,"title":"Grand Illusion","description":"A group of French soldiers, including the patrician Captain de Boeldieu and the working-class Lieutenant Maréchal, grapple with their own class differences after being captured and held in a World War I German prison camp. When the men are transferred to a high-security fortress, they must concoct a plan to escape beneath the watchful eye of aristocratic German officer von Rauffenstein, who has formed an unexpected bond with de Boeldieu.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Drama","History","War"],"release_date":"1937-06-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9eHg5qX7LkjW2Zrejvap2RmFGlD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lWg41zE0FVixkNsFgxnlRyvDYv9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9eHg5qX7LkjW2Zrejvap2RmFGlD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lWg41zE0FVixkNsFgxnlRyvDYv9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":615457,"title":"Nobody","description":"Hutch Mansell, a suburban dad, overlooked husband, nothing neighbor — a 