/p/w600_and_h900_face/qKVOTKPPtvoXd75L1HOSBPLtKWS.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yD9RhgIVydQNBK7OLEbCWYcWMUd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qKVOTKPPtvoXd75L1HOSBPLtKWS.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yD9RhgIVydQNBK7OLEbCWYcWMUd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":30969,"title":"Louis C.K.: Chewed Up","description":"Profane, vulgar and obscenely funny, Louis C.K. insists on telling the truth, whether you like it or not! Join the Emmy Award-winning stand-up comic and TV star (Lucky Louie) as he shares his thoughts on the stuff everyone thinks about -- male bodily fluids, the joys of being white, the difference between women and girls -- but never has the nerve to say. It''s Louis C.K. at his risk-taking best: fearless, honest and totally outrageous! Nominated for the 2009 Emmy for Outstanding Writing for a Variety, Music or Comedy Special","duration":"1:00:00","genre":["Comedy","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2008-10-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/miFsgaP3u8CKiwQ0aSMrefNnM7R.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jJpTrCHb4ETP2zzjA5RQgJHBxed.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//miFsgaP3u8CKiwQ0aSMrefNnM7R.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jJpTrCHb4ETP2zzjA5RQgJHBxed.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":22,"title":"Pirates of the Caribbean: The Curse of the Black Pearl","description":"When wily pirate Captain Barbossa seizes Jack Sparrow’s beloved ship, the Black Pearl, and kidnaps the governor’s daughter, Elizabeth Swann, blacksmith Will Turner reluctantly teams up with the unpredictable pirate Jack to rescue her—only to uncover a terrifying curse that turns Barbossa’s crew into the undead.","duration":"2:23:00","genre":["Adventure","Fantasy","Action"],"release_date":"2003-07-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uRNgkJSkNBFbbn9fPsEjDIy8Sh3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org