erything","description":"Once a healthy, active young man, Hawking received an earth-shattering diagnosis at 21 years of age. With Jane fighting tirelessly by his side, Stephen embarks on his most ambitious scientific work, studying the very thing he now has precious little of – time.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2014-11-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dh2QT3TPtAQf057yeLpNMuaJlmp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7kwcLFNt887saoQAL7EY0XnW7VI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dh2QT3TPtAQf057yeLpNMuaJlmp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7kwcLFNt887saoQAL7EY0XnW7VI.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":263115,"title":"Logan","description":"In the near future, a weary Logan cares for an ailing Professor X in a hideout on the Mexican border. But Logan''s attempts to hide from the world and his legacy are upended when a young mutant arrives, pursued by dark forces.","duration":"2:17:00","genre":["Action","Drama","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2017-02-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4DZxWNSAyksN6N3JkvpJ53Yq6zU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fnbjcRDYn6YviCcePDnGdyAkYsB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4DZxWNSAyksN6N3JkvpJ53Yq6zU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fnbjcRDYn6YviCcePDnGdyAkYsB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":56231,"title":"The Working Class Goes to Heaven","description":"After losing a finger in a work accident, an Italian worker becomes increasingly involved in political and revolutionary groups.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1971-09-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jrbVNlRiZUMn1BamUWBqMe1LNn9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2RMjWY4CknXmLRI5qJpsTA6sKy3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jrbVNlRiZUMn1