ration":"2:05:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"1955-08-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wadoNHCMPElgYuOqLxqDQqXpTMx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/frZj5djlU9hFEjMcL21RJZVuG5O.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wadoNHCMPElgYuOqLxqDQqXpTMx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//frZj5djlU9hFEjMcL21RJZVuG5O.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":522402,"title":"Finch","description":"On a post-apocalyptic Earth, a robot, built to protect the life of his dying creator''s beloved dog, learns about life, love, friendship, and what it means to be human.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Drama","Adventure"],"release_date":"2021-11-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uoc358GH6Yl7TufbUKHkETPu64B.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eEJtzD1F05xDipFEDY98CTH5yZn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uoc358GH6Yl7TufbUKHkETPu64B.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eEJtzD1F05xDipFEDY98CTH5yZn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":31442,"title":"Ivan''s Childhood","description":"In WW2, twelve year old Soviet orphan Ivan Bondarev works for the Soviet army as a scout behind the German lines and strikes a friendship with three sympathetic Soviet officers.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Drama","War"],"release_date":"1962-05-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jOulpNwtoJP5fF1LJX1ojw6BxBq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/trY9ADhXgSExH3DLlFhV5C8aDtw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jOulpNwtoJP5fF1LJX1ojw6BxBq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//trY9ADhXgSExH3DLlFhV5C8aDtw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":826,"title":"The Bridge on the River Kwai","description":"The classic story of English POWs in Burma forced to build a bridge to aid the war effort of their Japanese captors. British and