ce Fiction"],"release_date":"2002-04-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2Gx0IssZeGhpwvULplQuf9UiI26.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AbgADjLIYoLAc3mayVWGBWSbjT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2Gx0IssZeGhpwvULplQuf9UiI26.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AbgADjLIYoLAc3mayVWGBWSbjT.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13855,"title":"The Chaser","description":"Joong-ho is a dirty detective turned pimp, who''s in financial trouble as several of his girls have recently disappeared without clearing their debts. While trying to track them down, he finds a clue that the vanished girls were all called up by the same client, whom one of his girls is meeting with right now.","duration":"2:05:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller","Action"],"release_date":"2008-02-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/urBBFQrrVxy7T8uytrn7dOoHqZn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hy49xJiKN1nakkN1ZmKuOf6vQYR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//urBBFQrrVxy7T8uytrn7dOoHqZn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hy49xJiKN1nakkN1ZmKuOf6vQYR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11005,"title":"Awakenings","description":"Dr. Malcolm Sayer, a shy research physician, uses an experimental drug to \"awaken\" the catatonic victims of a rare disease. Leonard is the first patient to receive the controversial treatment. His awakening, filled with awe and enthusiasm, proves a rebirth for Sayer too, as the exuberant patient reveals life''s simple but unutterably sweet pleasures to the introverted doctor.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1990-12-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tRKTlMoTsAhYpuq19V8Wk3RFY4O.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9gztZXuHLG6AJ0fgqGd7Q43cWRI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tRKTlMoTsAhYpuq19V8Wk3RFY4