ces explode into conflict over the planet''s exclusive supply of the most precious resource in existence - a commodity capable of unlocking humanity''s greatest potential - only those who can conquer their fear will survive.","duration":"2:35:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Adventure"],"release_date":"2021-09-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zRKQW58MBEY078AxkHxEJzUskCl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/v1tRXZ4JtD2Iv6fjkPvT4GiwslV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zRKQW58MBEY078AxkHxEJzUskCl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//v1tRXZ4JtD2Iv6fjkPvT4GiwslV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":149870,"title":"The Wind Rises","description":"A lifelong love of flight inspires Japanese aviation engineer Jiro Horikoshi, whose storied career includes the creation of the A-6M World War II fighter plane.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Animation","Drama","History","Romance"],"release_date":"2013-07-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zZiflZpuaZerugtfdyXcg6dcylD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jfwSexzlIzaOgxP9A8bTA6t8YYb.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zZiflZpuaZerugtfdyXcg6dcylD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jfwSexzlIzaOgxP9A8bTA6t8YYb.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":934,"title":"Rififi","description":"Out of prison after a five-year stretch, jewel thief Tony turns down a quick job his friend Jo offers him, until he discovers that his old girlfriend Mado has become the lover of local gangster Pierre Grutter during Tony''s absence. Expanding a minor smash-and-grab into a full-scale jewel heist, Tony and his crew appear to get away clean, but their actions after the job is completed threaten the lives of everyone involved.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"1955-04-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cVPBT3Fq