ugh","description":"An aging doorman, after being fired from his prestigious job at a luxurious hotel, is forced to face the scorn of his friends, neighbours and society.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1924-12-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sTyt7e2PB5nfY02reL1iZUYPbly.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7Y6Dxr3oYt1w7ew70YNdLLDYEjk.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sTyt7e2PB5nfY02reL1iZUYPbly.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7Y6Dxr3oYt1w7ew70YNdLLDYEjk.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":141,"title":"Donnie Darko","description":"After narrowly escaping a bizarre accident, a troubled teenager is plagued by visions of a large bunny rabbit that manipulates him to commit a series of crimes.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Fantasy","Drama","Mystery"],"release_date":"2001-01-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/msCHK5Kh1YbdZ0zPJ2nzPUhhSN9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/j2AtZFsflxiluaNtajMTI0Avm8C.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//msCHK5Kh1YbdZ0zPJ2nzPUhhSN9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//j2AtZFsflxiluaNtajMTI0Avm8C.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":726759,"title":"Tetris","description":"In 1988, American video game salesman Henk Rogers discovers the video game Tetris. When he sets out to bring the game to the world, he enters a dangerous web of lies and corruption behind the Iron Curtain.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Thriller","History","Drama"],"release_date":"2023-03-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4avmIRBBOs9b4DKoenf8SWWJJP7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4F2QwCOYHJJjecSvdOjStuVLkpu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4avmIRBBOs9b4DKoenf8SWWJJP7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4F2QwCOYHJJjecSvdOjStuVLkpu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":652722,"title":"In the Arms of an Assassin","description":"Victor (William Levy) is one of the world’s most handsome  men, but he has a deep secret – he is a cold blooded assassin. Smooth talking and seductive, Victor was raised to do one thing only, which is to kill for money. When he is sent to the home of a brutal drug lord to collect payment for his most recent hit, he encounters the beautiful Sarai (Alicia Sanz), who has been forced to spend the last 9 years of her life with the drug lord.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Romance","Thriller"],"release_date":"2019-12-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6cqogY7SYppI0ZNchaTKszSkxwH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vOF2dVniPoc2Y5yVG1F3GvbP4Y9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6cqogY7SYppI0ZNchaTKszSkxwH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vOF2dVniPoc2Y5yVG1F3GvbP4Y9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":28571,"title":"The Heiress","description":"In 1840s New York, the uneventful and boring days of the daughter of a wealthy doctor come to an end when she meets a dashing poorer man — who may or may not be after her inheritance.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","History"],"release_date":"1949-10-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/56eHAxXfZTz5pGiVDCFnuiHw2fp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1oN0zsjw3iS1HaOLoZbmptzrD1W.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//56eHAxXfZTz5pGiVDCFnuiHw2fp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1oN0zsjw3iS1HaOLoZbmptzrD1W.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5961,"title":"Fanny and Alexander","description":"As children in the loving Ekdahl family, Fanny and Alexander enjoy a happy life with their parents, who run a theater company. After their father dies unexpectedly, however, the siblings end up in a joyless home when their mother, Emilie, marries a stern bishop. The bleak situation gradually grows worse as the bishop becomes more controlling, but dedicated relatives make a valiant attempt to aid Emilie, Fanny and Alexander.","duration":"3:08:00","genre":["Fantasy","Drama","Mystery"],"release_date":"1982-12-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8reX3CMog1QHqGoym2Esvuk5MnK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/q8jlA3Wc1Z987hNKRFA44g5OugC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8reX3CMog1QHqGoym2Esvuk5MnK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//q8jlA3Wc1Z987hNKRFA44g5OugC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":144,"title":"Wings of Desire","description":"Two angels, Damiel and Cassiel, glide through the streets of Berlin, observing the bustling population, providing invisible rays of hope to the distressed but never interacting with them. When Damiel falls in love with lonely trapeze artist Marion, the angel longs to experience life in the physical world, and finds — with some words of wisdom from actor Peter Falk — that it might be possible for him to take human form.","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["Drama","Fantasy","Romance"],"release_date":"1987-09-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7TlGXrB4WQ3wbpOCUQnBXseCuOl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iZQs2vUeCzvS1KfZJ6uYNCGJBBV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7TlGXrB4WQ3wbpOCUQnBXseCuOl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iZQs2vUeCzvS1KfZJ6uYNCGJBBV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":523781,"title":"Words on Bathroom Walls","description":"Diagnosed with a mental illness halfway through his senior year of high school, a witty, introspective teen struggles to keep it a secret while falling in love with a brilliant classmate who inspires him to open his heart and not be defined by his condition.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2020-08-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ecpdYiF4DxGW4BDC