ma","Crime"],"release_date":"2011-10-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1nR9mCsJD02j13wet0yAnVhEG6Y.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cKs3XSFVbFeZcH3g9geAvr6ApOl.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1nR9mCsJD02j13wet0yAnVhEG6Y.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cKs3XSFVbFeZcH3g9geAvr6ApOl.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":22137,"title":"The Kingdom","description":"At The Kingdom, Denmark''s most technologically advanced hospital, a number of strange and otherworldly events begin occurring, much to the dismay of its doctors and patients. A ghostly ambulance appears and disappears, the voice of a little girl calls to a patient in an elevator shaft, and a doctor''s fetus begins growing at an alarming rate.","duration":"4:35:00","genre":["Drama","Fantasy","Horror","Mystery"],"release_date":"1994-11-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nQ1woqbLcKjkpfEbfAEoAey6W3n.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zfXVe3dSvkR3YAp3g6E5q2R5swy.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nQ1woqbLcKjkpfEbfAEoAey6W3n.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zfXVe3dSvkR3YAp3g6E5q2R5swy.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":117,"title":"The Untouchables","description":"Elliot Ness, an ambitious prohibition agent, is determined to take down Al Capone. In order to achieve this goal, he forms a group given the nickname “The Untouchables”.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Crime","History","Thriller"],"release_date":"1987-06-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/i1oWUGVDNBhGBykcCRBlX326udb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tPq0R4jTO4Ey8ZspFaWK9wGA4Ls.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//i1oWUGVDNBhGBykcCRBlX326udb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tPq0R4jTO4Ey8ZspFaWK9wGA4Ls.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":785084,"title":"The Whale","descri