u Hanashiro, who is struggling to reconcile her ideal image and true-to-heart attitude, team up to investigate the Urashima Tunnel and get what they want. This is an unforgettable summer story of nostalgia and sprinting in a remote countryside.","duration":"1:23:00","genre":["Animation","Drama","Romance","Fantasy","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2022-09-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rWJc5BkI7Op1IYMb3gW6qGjOnIp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5AGA6pbBKXZTI8k1c6odx30JuQR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rWJc5BkI7Op1IYMb3gW6qGjOnIp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5AGA6pbBKXZTI8k1c6odx30JuQR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":613868,"title":"Cousins","description":"Lucas is a young man who lives with his religious aunt Lourdes in a quiet country town. He helps his aunt by holding religious meetings with the ladies of the area, in the living room, playing biblical songs on the keyboard. This quiet life will end as soon as the charitable aunt communicates the arrival of another nephew, Mario, just out of jail. The clash of reality between the cousins ends up causing unusual situations, and an unexpected attraction among the boys.","duration":"1:23:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2019-12-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1QrEQHXX8nqquTBam25HiMrTRTH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2o0pzmuQKFhuPnz4hvpfjd3BlNR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1QrEQHXX8nqquTBam25HiMrTRTH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2o0pzmuQKFhuPnz4hvpfjd3BlNR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":25253,"title":"Crooks in Clover","description":"An aging gangster, Fernand Naudin is hoping for a quiet retirement when he suddenly inherits a fortune from an old friend, a former gangster supremo known as the Mexican. If he is ambivalent about his new found wealth, Fernand is posi