er company. Having met his wife’s killers, he emotionally breaks down and arranges “sniper terror” for the enemy.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["War","Action","Drama"],"release_date":"2022-05-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oal5fDK90yX6b8yunj6JahBqX2J.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lZOODJzwuQo0etJJyBBZJOSdZcW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oal5fDK90yX6b8yunj6JahBqX2J.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lZOODJzwuQo0etJJyBBZJOSdZcW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":609242,"title":"The Heist of the Century","description":"In 2006, a group of thieves performed what is considered one of the most famous and smart bank heists in the history of Argentina. How they robbed the Rio bank is as surprising as what happened afterwards. This is their story.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Comedy","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2020-01-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wEVSupeNO7EjjCFieEv2zt4oJei.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1zL4VCVin4S8kOXhszMDqfwWPCM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wEVSupeNO7EjjCFieEv2zt4oJei.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1zL4VCVin4S8kOXhszMDqfwWPCM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":56068,"title":"The Band of Honest Men","description":"Italy, mid ''60s. Three guys from a poor neighbourhood try to get rich by printing fake money using the fact that one of them works as a typographer. The story unravels around their embarrassed efforts to spend the money, their little family issues and ends with a surprise.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1956-04-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yxP7WzDU2sKwW9jx3FUofvH8N0X.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eIxcQHq9WDWmcDoJ1qVxhQWlstX.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yxP7WzDU2sKwW9jx3FUofvH8N0X.jpg