sor, the Amusphere. A next-gen wearable device, the Augma doesn''t have a full-dive function like its predecessors. Instead, it uses Augmented Reality to get players into the game. It is safe, user-friendly and lets users play while they are conscious, making it an instant hit on the market. The most popular game on the system is “Ordinal Scale” an ARMMORPG developed exclusively for the Augma. Asuna and the gang have already been playing OS for a while, by the time Kirito decides to join them. They’re about to find out that Ordinal Scale isn’t all fun and games…","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2017-02-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yFZG86Zvdy6JuIlMW9eHxlVkct5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2szdEK0Mr0RG0nWGFVTseNQHbnP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yFZG86Zvdy6JuIlMW9eHxlVkct5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2szdEK0Mr0RG0nWGFVTseNQHbnP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":382591,"title":"Two Is a Family","description":"A man without attachments or responsibilities suddenly finds himself with an abandoned baby and leaves for London to try and find the mother. Eight years later after he and his daughter become inseparable Gloria''s mother reappears.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2016-12-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fO0qXJnBJYuWJ5dvWWGXfRF8MXA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aFgtdhuzgI2eqnIVWtRB03x3pnt.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fO0qXJnBJYuWJ5dvWWGXfRF8MXA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aFgtdhuzgI2eqnIVWtRB03x3pnt.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":205,"title":"Hotel Rwanda","description":"Inspired by true events, this film takes place in Rwanda in the 1990s when more than a million Tutsis were killed in a genocide that went mostly unnoticed by the rest of the world. Hotel owner Paul Rusesabagina houses over a thousand refuges in his hotel in attempt to save their lives.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Drama","History","War"],"release_date":"2004-12-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jkvvXaN7FPVKGlk8oj9PL0FHNtj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/p3pHw85UMZPegfMZBA6dZ06yarm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jkvvXaN7FPVKGlk8oj9PL0FHNtj.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//p3pHw85UMZPegfMZBA6dZ06yarm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":162,"title":"Edward Scissorhands","description":"A small suburban town receives a visit from a castaway unfinished science experiment named Edward.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Fantasy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1990-12-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uNLIMPxknsV4n3IAEDpS1iqF5dm.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e0FqKFvGPdQNWG8tF9cZBtev9Em.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uNLIMPxknsV4n3IAEDpS1iqF5dm.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e0FqKFvGPdQNWG8tF9cZBtev9Em.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":554972,"title":"Unstoppable","description":"Dong-chul and Ji-soo are a happily married couple. One day, Dong-chul comes home to find his house in disarray and his wife missing.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Crime","Action","Thriller","Comedy"],"release_date":"2018-11-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3XPgvbWGlEJfgmEBzQHLtcEZfLt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/csle64zkLObsdRoabreC6bBRxLI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3XPgvbWGlEJfgmEBzQHLtcEZfLt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//csle64zkLObsdRoabreC6bBRxLI.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":882569,"title":"Guy Ritchie''s The Covenant","description":"After an ambush, Afghan interpreter Ahmed goes to Herculean lengths to save US 