ghter of a convicted German war criminal, as a spy. As they begin to fall for one another, Alicia is instructed to win the affections of Alexander Sebastian, a Nazi hiding out in Brazil. When Sebastian becomes serious about his relationship with Alicia, the stakes get higher, and Devlin must watch her slip further undercover.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Thriller"],"release_date":"1946-08-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6jRd6vT3NhwIeyqaiWCYzi64lSP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e7DHQGgivZyMvM4z7mA7gMNvOHg.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6jRd6vT3NhwIeyqaiWCYzi64lSP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e7DHQGgivZyMvM4z7mA7gMNvOHg.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":357786,"title":"Kizumonogatari Part 1: Tekketsu","description":"One day, Koyomi Araragi encounters the horrifying vampire, Kiss-shot Acerola-orion Heart-under-blade A.K.A. the \"King of Apparitions.\" He saves the fatally wounded Kiss-shot by offering his blood at the expense of his own life as a human. Now Koyomi has to face the vampire hunters to retrieve Kiss-shot’s limbs which were taken by these hunters...","duration":"1:03:00","genre":["Animation","Fantasy","Drama","Mystery","Action"],"release_date":"2016-01-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tDM4UAaHxMrvODGIUj9ZixmyVmw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vftYhVOdvMCmb0dQIRIKmUYG9TU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tDM4UAaHxMrvODGIUj9ZixmyVmw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vftYhVOdvMCmb0dQIRIKmUYG9TU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":72660,"title":"I Don''t Want to Go Back Alone","description":"The arrival of a new student in school changes Leonardo''s life. This 15 year-old blind teenager has to deal with the jealousy of his friend Giovana while figuring out the new feelings he''s having towards his new friend, Gabriel.","duration":"0:17:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2011-10-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jb2i8OdcWP2gIF6dgtCA5JP7zC2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zcTp4w9OzAqD1G4lugOtG8sqm3T.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jb2i8OdcWP2gIF6dgtCA5JP7zC2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zcTp4w9OzAqD1G4lugOtG8sqm3T.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":688,"title":"The Bridges of Madison County","description":"Photographer Robert Kincaid wanders into the life of housewife Francesca Johnson for four days in the 1960s.","duration":"2:15:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1995-06-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/70N7NT8JPiOD2gr9BzRX8uXwcng.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aCBrhOQjhG397GLkEZ49zReQEKX.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//70N7NT8JPiOD2gr9BzRX8uXwcng.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aCBrhOQjhG397GLkEZ49zReQEKX.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":570503,"title":"Tune in for Love","description":"During the 1990s, hardworking Mi-soo and optimistic Hyun-woo meet at a bakery and fall in love while exchanging stories on a radio station, but while their paths keep crossing, the timing never seems to work out.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2019-08-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5sSCPzLhX9Ho7Llpj5N3ECjqYai.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7yaF5BOtPjQH8JDSSiVbzdrsWM4.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5sSCPzLhX9Ho7Llpj5N3ECjqYai.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7yaF5BOtPjQH8JDSSiVbzdrsWM4.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12491,"title":"Accattone","description":"A pimp with no other means to provide for himself finds his life spiralling out of control when his prostitute is sent to prison.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Drama"],"