d participant to become the star of his own story. Aiding him in his effort is Nina, a TV-news veteran.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2014-10-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bdI6U1mT0kCdTJ6TWtiFxQ42GSn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/j9HrX8f7GbZQm1BrBiR40uFQZSb.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bdI6U1mT0kCdTJ6TWtiFxQ42GSn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//j9HrX8f7GbZQm1BrBiR40uFQZSb.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":30020,"title":"Taste of Cherry","description":"A middle-aged Tehranian man, Mr. Badii is intent on killing himself and seeks someone to bury him after his demise. Driving around the city, the seemingly well-to-do Badii meets with numerous people, including a Muslim student, asking them to take on the job, but initially he has little luck. Eventually, Badii finds a man who is up for the task because he needs the money, but his new associate soon tries to talk him out of committing suicide.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1997-10-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/44SNTCSZTdbF5bzgUy4IfPV3DUq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vgPwjgbSdbYWrS1ty8TIZtmi6Tn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//44SNTCSZTdbF5bzgUy4IfPV3DUq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vgPwjgbSdbYWrS1ty8TIZtmi6Tn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":851,"title":"Brief Encounter","description":"Returning home from a shopping trip to a nearby town, bored suburban housewife Laura Jesson is thrown by happenstance into an acquaintance with virtuous doctor Alec Harvey. Their casual friendship soon develops during their weekly visits into something more emotionally fulfilling than either expected, and they must wrestle with the potential havoc their deepening relationship would have on their lives and the lives of those they love.","duration":"1:26:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1945-11-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vKvoOlhhaZCsiGQDvaZQqyGq1oA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jC9EwLJcGhYMSQAHu2LxkKN5v7O.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vKvoOlhhaZCsiGQDvaZQqyGq1oA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jC9EwLJcGhYMSQAHu2LxkKN5v7O.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":502033,"title":"Sound of Metal","description":"Metal drummer Ruben begins to lose his hearing. When a doctor tells him his condition will worsen, he thinks his career and life is over. His girlfriend Lou checks the former addict into a rehab for the deaf hoping it will prevent a relapse and help him adapt to his new life. After being welcomed and accepted just as he is, Ruben must choose between his new normal and the life he once knew.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Drama","Music"],"release_date":"2020-11-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7b5R8FfGUzlxfhOkPpL3xyIeuyF.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3178oOJKKPDeQ2legWQvMPpllv.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7b5R8FfGUzlxfhOkPpL3xyIeuyF.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3178oOJKKPDeQ2legWQvMPpllv.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":360404,"title":"Monster High: Boo York, Boo York","description":"It''s fright lights, big city when the Monster High ghouls head to Boo York! Cleo de Nile is invited to attend a gancy gala celebrating the return of the magical comet and, of course, she brings along her beast friends. But their trip isn''t all fun and frightseeing because Nefera, Cleo''s sister, uses the comet''s power for her own spooktacularly sneaky plans. Can the monsters unwrap the mystery of the comet in time to stop Nefera? Find out in Booy York, Boo York, the first-ever Monster High musical, featuring eight original songs.","duration":"1:12:00","genre":["Animation","Family","M