n":"0:25:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Comedy","TV Movie"],"release_date":"1965-12-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ucWnzjWWWd6CmRal8J3tWz6m1A7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6fDmxNVFGSYlVR01zbYSZ4M0lU0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ucWnzjWWWd6CmRal8J3tWz6m1A7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6fDmxNVFGSYlVR01zbYSZ4M0lU0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":40619,"title":"Day & Night","description":"When Day, a sunny fellow, encounters Night, a stranger of distinctly darker moods, sparks fly! Day and Night are frightened and suspicious of each other at first, and quickly get off on the wrong foot. But as they discover each other''s unique qualities--and come to realize that each of them offers a different window onto the same world-the friendship helps both to gain a new perspective.","duration":"0:06:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Comedy","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2010-06-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/i05QKKn8GqAdmQSeAztxhuqN6dt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hn2tOtidoYZ0D56jR4yknpdP1mU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//i05QKKn8GqAdmQSeAztxhuqN6dt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hn2tOtidoYZ0D56jR4yknpdP1mU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14438,"title":"Fireproof","description":"A heroic fire captain values dedication and service to others above all else, but the most important partnership in his life, his marriage, is about to go up in smoke.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2008-09-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3gMtnO5vDznlKsUW7sU9EfRufIc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hfoCG75j1YaNyfZGPg0rWy3nFmU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3gMtnO5vDznlKsUW7sU9EfRufIc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hfoCG75j1YaNyfZGPg0rWy3nFmU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":49687,"title":"Marriage Italian Style","description":"During the bombing of Naples in World War II, a cynical businessman helps a naive prostitute, who spends the next two decades desperate to have him reciprocate her feelings.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"1964-12-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eOJb6uspOUEbs4wdMTAfuoOyTg2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1VVQFXwr4i6QSAoPnCs9UmGTUVw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eOJb6uspOUEbs4wdMTAfuoOyTg2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1VVQFXwr4i6QSAoPnCs9UmGTUVw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11787,"title":"Harvey","description":"The story of Elwood P. Dowd who makes friends with a spirit taking the form of a human-sized rabbit named Harvey that only he sees (and a few privileged others on occasion also.) After his sister tries to commit him to a mental institution, a comedy of errors ensues. Elwood and Harvey become the catalysts for a family mending its wounds and for romance blossoming in unexpected places.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Comedy","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1950-12-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/Ah7uiN6ws2QcBZhLdDfkiSJIX35.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dgd82hYmpiXDM1G867HqNaWe8wj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//Ah7uiN6ws2QcBZhLdDfkiSJIX35.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dgd82hYmpiXDM1G867HqNaWe8wj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":773,"title":"Little Miss Sunshine","description":"A family loaded with quirky, colorful characters piles into an old van and road trips to California for little Olive to compete in a beauty pageant.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2006-07-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/twdtjJm31AExNx73DXaD4KRNU9c.jpg","pos