ney Island gang called the Warriors is wrongly blamed for Cyrus'' death. Before you know it, the cops and every gangbanger in town is hot on the Warriors'' trail.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"1979-02-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7GDAldgmycOxNfEcycEX9IvVvIk.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/d6YZpBq4BhQr1K985J3CuL1cA8J.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7GDAldgmycOxNfEcycEX9IvVvIk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//d6YZpBq4BhQr1K985J3CuL1cA8J.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11362,"title":"The Count of Monte Cristo","description":"Young sailor Edmond Dantès is wrongfully imprisoned, escapes, finds treasure, and reinvents himself as the wealthy Count of Monte Cristo to exact revenge on those who betrayed him.","duration":"2:11:00","genre":["Adventure","Drama","History","Action"],"release_date":"2002-01-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AmN8ozRE0AbMGgZhqBu4fUjZkRt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ifMgDAUXVQLY4DeOu3VTTi55jSP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AmN8ozRE0AbMGgZhqBu4fUjZkRt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ifMgDAUXVQLY4DeOu3VTTi55jSP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":336804,"title":"Mustang","description":"In a Turkish village, five orphaned sisters live under strict rule while members of their family prepare their arranged marriages.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2015-06-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e26lUsaE9Ni7MmdhaVHVNbuzVyo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8lrsjdydRxhKlKiGuMbbzuFKrdN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e26lUsaE9Ni7MmdhaVHVNbuzVyo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8lrsjdydRxhKlKiGuMbbzuFKrdN.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1208348,"title":"Rental Family","description":"