e.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//whDdYx3lh1LHTN0VlPFt51fX29g.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10633,"title":"In the Heat of the Night","description":"African-American Philadelphia police detective Virgil Tibbs is arrested on suspicion of murder by Bill Gillespie, the racist police chief of tiny Sparta, Mississippi. After Tibbs proves not only his own innocence but that of another man, he joins forces with Gillespie to track down the real killer. Their investigation takes them through every social level of the town, with Tibbs making enemies as well as unlikely friends as he hunts for the truth.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"1967-08-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xY5sgU09cOsvEAgJZaYo2aOZEFi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qFpfALhprXmOAbA5upTNupZw8rq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xY5sgU09cOsvEAgJZaYo2aOZEFi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qFpfALhprXmOAbA5upTNupZw8rq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":158,"title":"Knockin'' on Heaven''s Door","description":"Two young men, Martin and Rudi, both suffering from terminal cancer, get to know each other in a hospital room. They drown their desperation in tequila and decide to take one last trip to the sea. Drunk and still in pajamas they steal the first fancy car they find, a 60''s Mercedes convertible. The car happens to belong to a bunch of gangsters, which immediately start to chase it, since it contains more than the pistol Martin finds in the glove box.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime","Action","Drama"],"release_date":"1997-02-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yXnlw2SB0QhYUC4QDyuRZh3CQlU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oiaGyQtjI5rnFDI7BVngXyfmVhc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yXnlw2SB0QhYUC4QDyuRZh3CQlU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oiaGyQtjI5rnF