land community is turned upside down in more ways than anyone can handle.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2012-05-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bsYv9IFIGfpAV0oUbe7YTiyxhox.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/y4SXcbNl6CEF2t36icuzuBioj7K.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bsYv9IFIGfpAV0oUbe7YTiyxhox.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//y4SXcbNl6CEF2t36icuzuBioj7K.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13151,"title":"Scooby-Doo on Zombie Island","description":"After going their separate ways, Scooby-Doo, Shaggy, Velma, Daphne, and Fred reunite to investigate the ghost of Moonscar the pirate on a haunted bayou island, but it turns out the swashbuckler''s spirit isn''t the only creepy character on the island. The sleuths also meet up with cat creatures and zombies... and it looks like for the first time in their lives, these ghouls might actually be real.","duration":"1:17:00","genre":["Animation","Mystery","Family","Horror"],"release_date":"1998-09-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jiWfL7ilvshB5i9wUhVRZZNJb5l.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7EdvFUGvT5Pn8rUFRKCrdUzNthf.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jiWfL7ilvshB5i9wUhVRZZNJb5l.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7EdvFUGvT5Pn8rUFRKCrdUzNthf.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1632,"title":"Mississippi Burning","description":"Two FBI agents investigating the murder of civil rights workers during the 60s seek to breach the conspiracy of silence in a small Southern town where segregation divides black and white. The younger agent trained in FBI school runs up against the small town ways of his partner, a former sheriff.","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["Drama","Crime","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"1988-12-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sYpNbnOlIKW5nlr