ess hungry!","duration":"1:15:00","genre":["Animation","Mystery","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"2011-09-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bUaS3K2WrKmgcTvEwmGCdQOd7Er.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zER4fuEw6qlMkC3mBGcht0r2Iqw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bUaS3K2WrKmgcTvEwmGCdQOd7Er.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zER4fuEw6qlMkC3mBGcht0r2Iqw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":974036,"title":"Ordinary Angels","description":"Inspired by the incredible true story of a hairdresser who single-handedly rallies an entire community to help a widowed father save the life of his critically ill young daughter.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2024-02-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rBo0yYQTruIYEuXdyCAyVVlNb2H.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wdi9kEU4W2UeBTtdqOPZISGMtDR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rBo0yYQTruIYEuXdyCAyVVlNb2H.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wdi9kEU4W2UeBTtdqOPZISGMtDR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":20139,"title":"The Children''s Hour","description":"An unruly student at a private all-girls boarding school scandalously accuses the two women who run it of having a romantic relationship.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1961-12-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/RkMXpjQD9ww1b5hUAkzlCaVGUd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/goyEWixvULM2IRN4KsKibyrJE4J.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//RkMXpjQD9ww1b5hUAkzlCaVGUd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//goyEWixvULM2IRN4KsKibyrJE4J.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5544,"title":"Hiroshima Mon Amour","description":"The deep conversation between a Japanese architect and a French actress forms the basis of this celebrated French film, considered one of the vanguard productions of the French New Wave. Set in Hiroshima after the end of World War II, the couple -- lovers turned friends -- recount, over many hours, previous romances and life experiences. The two intertwine their stories about the past with pondering the devastation wrought by the atomic bomb dropped on the city.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Drama","History","Romance"],"release_date":"1959-06-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4fynFAYPPYCkyIdt0bsCwWn3Hxv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zieczjWnvalaxwX5EQASEx0on5f.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4fynFAYPPYCkyIdt0bsCwWn3Hxv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zieczjWnvalaxwX5EQASEx0on5f.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1579,"title":"Apocalypto","description":"Set in the Mayan civilization, when a man''s idyllic presence is brutally disrupted by a violent invading force, he is taken on a perilous journey to a world ruled by fear and oppression where a harrowing end awaits him. Through a twist of fate and spurred by the power of his love for his woman and his family he will make a desperate break to return home and to ultimately save his way of life.","duration":"2:18:00","genre":["Action","Drama","History"],"release_date":"2006-12-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nnmbJvYyDS1VkMOCbxSpdBi3WbJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cRY25Q32kDNPFDkFkxAs6bgCq3L.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nnmbJvYyDS1VkMOCbxSpdBi3WbJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cRY25Q32kDNPFDkFkxAs6bgCq3L.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":486589,"title":"Red Shoes and the Seven Dwarfs","description":"Princes who have been turned into Dwarfs seek the red shoes of a lady in order to break the spell, although it will not be easy.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Animation","Fantasy","Family","Comedy","Romance","Adventure"],"release_date":"2019-07-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nN4Gs3vZAOJ1D6FRtrwbU9VGYwU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/MBiKqTsouYqAACLYNDadsjhhC0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nN4Gs3vZAOJ1D6FRtrwbU9VGYwU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//MBiKqTsouYqAACLYNDadsjhhC0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":336808,"title":"Embrace of the Serpent","description":"The epic story of the first contact, encounter, approach, betrayal and, eventually, life-transcending friendship, between Karamakate, an Amazonian shaman, last survivor of his people, and two scientists that, over the course of 40 years, travel through the Amazon in search of a sacred plant that can heal them. Inspired by the journals of the first explorers of the Colombian Amazon, Theodor Koch-Grunberg and Richard Evans Schultes.","duration":"2:05:00","genre":["Drama","Adventure"],"release_date":"2015-05-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zhXmJnPIoncBQ2TY8IEWc4s9vbh.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/t3Lmw8jvm7tpik0lSkub8hU4oRW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zhXmJnPIoncBQ2TY8IEWc4s9vbh.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//t3Lmw8jvm7tpik0lSkub8hU4oRW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":33409,"title":"The Stoning of Soraya M.","description":"In 1986 Iran, Sahebjam, whose car breaks down in a remote village, enters into a conversation with Zahra, who relays to him the story about her niece, Soraya, whose arranged marriage to an abusive tyrant ended in tragedy.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2009-06-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/67ln5E2D32XFHegFwmFjxT3wvqU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/m4CfYBh1ZnYqZbt7ziYjHf53P4.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//67ln5E2D32XFHegFwmFjxT3wvqU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//m4CfYBh1ZnYqZbt7ziYjHf53P4.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":587272,"title":"Father There Is Only One","description":"Javier is what we have dubbed as a \"husband-in-law.\" That is that without taking care of the care of the house and children at all, he knows exactly what needs to be done, and that he continuously collects a sum of sentences from the type: \"It is that you do not organize\", or \"do not get nervous\", you already consider that overflowing woman drowns in a glass of water. Javier will have to face the reality of dealing with five children (between four and twelve years old) when his wife decides to go on a trip and leave him alone with them. The chaotic situation that takes place at home will progressively evolve ecologically to the most absolute disaster, but at the same time it will give parents and children the opportunity to meet and enjoy themselves for the first time.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"2019-08-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kZhAFnyPDdQxHzlWZHzBZOgwFgk.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tW6V8C81lzYuRy8yFe1dvvGhL4j.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kZhAFnyPDdQxHzlWZHzBZOgwFgk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tW6V8C81lzYuRy8yFe1dvvGhL4j.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10637,"title":"Remember the Titans","description":"After leading his football team to 15 winning seasons, coach Bill Yoast is demoted and replaced by Herman Boone – tough, opinionated and as different from the beloved Yoast as he could be. The two men learn to overcome their differences and turn a group of hostile young men into champions.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2000-09-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7lwo8VLHD8Va49DKuszabpm41V9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/825ohvC4wZ3gCuncCaqkWeQnK8h.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7lwo8VLHD8Va49DKuszabpm41V9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//825ohvC4wZ3gCuncCaqkWeQnK8h.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8358,"title":"Cast Away","description":"Chuck Noland, a top international manager for FedEx, and Kelly, a Ph.D. student, are in love and heading towards marriage. Then Chuck''s plane to Malaysia crashes at sea during a terrible storm. He''s the only survivor, and finds himself marooned on a desolate island. With no way to escape, Chuck must find ways to survive in his new home.","duration":"2:23:00","genre":["Adventure","Drama"],"release_date":"2000-12-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oCFVYPXI4IfhtF3GapU2jkDicDI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7lLJgKnAicAcR5UEuo8xhSMj18w.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oCFVYPXI4IfhtF3GapU2jkDicDI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7lLJgKnAicAcR5UEuo8xhSMj18w.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":144288,"title":"Berserk: The Golden Age Arc III - The Advent","description":"One year has passed since Guts left the Band of the Hawk and Griffith was imprisoned by the Kingdom of Midland for treason. In the dead of night, at a camping site where they hide, the Band of the Hawk is attacked by Bakiraka assassins led by Silat. When all seems lost, Guts returns from his journey. \"You destroyed everything.\" Crying that Griffith is nothing without Guts, Casca and Guts are joined together body and soul. Griffith is imprisoned in the oldest building in Wyndham Catle, the Tower of Rebirth.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2013-02-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mrVUkTJHY8MeZRvBDxxmnAhRcxa.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hZ7bjwg3x4uQHVmeeyoGgifWdyS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mrVUkTJHY8MeZRvBDxxmnAhRcxa.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hZ7bjwg3x4uQHVmeeyoGgifWdyS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14813,"title":"Mickey''s Christmas Carol","description":"Ebenezer Scrooge is far too greedy to understand that Christmas is a time for kindness and generosity. But with the guidance of some new found friends, Scrooge learns to embrace the spirit of the season. A retelling of the classic Dickens tale with Disney''s classic characters.","duration":"0:25:00","genre":["Family","Animation"],"release_date":"1983-10-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/41ocXijKgjMS17QXydzKdwCaTsU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hOuEgnB9jfVneEsulMcqEJE4kSL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//41ocXijKgjMS17QXydzKdwCaTsU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hOuEgnB9jfVneEsulMcqEJE4kSL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10227,"title":"PlayTime","description":"Clumsy Monsieur Hulot finds himself perplexed by the intimidating complexity of a gadget-filled Paris. He attempts to meet with a business contact but soon becomes lost. His roundabout journey parallels that of an American tourist, and as they weave through the inventive urban environment, they intermittently meet, developing an interest in one another. They eventually get together at a chaotic restaurant, along with several other quirky characters.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1967-12-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pKX8G6IN8ZCRvKeHh6ctqoHZl0K.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kQOrS0DLUXYsqPMedM2G6NJcJBq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pKX8G6IN8ZCRvKeHh6ctqoHZl0K.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kQOrS0DLUXYsqPMedM2G6NJcJBq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":336,"title":"Duck, You Sucker","description":"At the beginning of the 1913 Mexican Revolution, greedy bandit Juan Miranda and idealist John H. Mallory, an Irish Republican Army explosives expert on the lam 