 on the noon train. Knowing the outlaw and his gang are coming to kill him, Kane is determined to stand his ground, so he attempts to gather a posse from among the local townspeople.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Western"],"release_date":"1952-06-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/raYHhtIDyh3qDS6WdyRzeqjLyIK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qETSMQ4IXBSAS409Z9OL0ppXWTW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//raYHhtIDyh3qDS6WdyRzeqjLyIK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qETSMQ4IXBSAS409Z9OL0ppXWTW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":68,"title":"Brazil","description":"Low-level bureaucrat Sam Lowry escapes the monotony of his day-to-day life through a recurring daydream of himself as a virtuous hero saving a beautiful damsel. Investigating a case that led to the wrongful arrest and eventual death of an innocent man instead of wanted terrorist Harry Tuttle, he meets the woman from his daydream, and in trying to help her gets caught in a web of mistaken identities, mindless bureaucracy and lies.","duration":"2:23:00","genre":["Comedy","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1985-02-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9IYyCLf5NNAQFK9pNtqzEU9HWzM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2w09J0KUnVtJvqPYu8N63XjAyCR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9IYyCLf5NNAQFK9pNtqzEU9HWzM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2w09J0KUnVtJvqPYu8N63XjAyCR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":128246,"title":"A Werewolf Boy","description":"An unexpected phone call brings an elderly woman to her childhood country cottage, and memories of an orphan boy she knew 47 years ago come flooding back to her.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Romance","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2012-10-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8wKDBmmSoLRMtf42dhu7uUDKS1c.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and