e gangsters arrive, start terrorizing civilians, and usurping territory. The beleaguered local gangsters team up with the police, lead by the badass loose cannon Ma Seok-do, to bring them down. Based on a true story.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2017-10-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xord8lZ7mK8ctki6FBgNYrbpWCO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9yi66KlKsDrsu2KuSgtBUmk6Seo.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xord8lZ7mK8ctki6FBgNYrbpWCO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9yi66KlKsDrsu2KuSgtBUmk6Seo.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":393729,"title":"Divines","description":"In a ghetto where religion and drug trafficking rub shoulders, Dounia has a lust for power and success. Supported by Maimouna, her best friend, she decides to follow in the footsteps of Rebecca, a respected dealer. But her encounter with Djigui, a young, disturbingly sensual dancer, throws her off course.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2016-08-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3uIHgW5SAaa8kP24aoFvgf9hjOX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gOwIZPNFstt9BWUyekMzSF2Wzd1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3uIHgW5SAaa8kP24aoFvgf9hjOX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gOwIZPNFstt9BWUyekMzSF2Wzd1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":313297,"title":"Kubo and the Two Strings","description":"Kubo mesmerizes the people in his village with his magical gift for spinning wild tales with origami. When he accidentally summons an evil spirit seeking vengeance, Kubo is forced to go on a quest to solve the mystery of his fallen samurai father and his mystical weaponry, as well as discover his own magical powers.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Animation","Adventure","Family"],"release_date":"2016-08-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bhspYsRMHgMqzUlxiVpIY8OrqMt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/la6QA9tk4Foq8OBH2Dyh5dTcw6H.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bhspYsRMHgMqzUlxiVpIY8OrqMt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//la6QA9tk4Foq8OBH2Dyh5dTcw6H.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":83533,"title":"Avatar: Fire and Ash","description":"In the wake of the devastating war against the RDA and the loss of their eldest son, Jake Sully and Neytiri face a new threat on Pandora: the Ash People, a violent and power-hungry Na''vi tribe led by the ruthless Varang. Jake''s family must fight for their survival and the future of Pandora in a conflict that pushes them to their emotional and physical limits.","duration":"3:18:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2025-12-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u8DU5fkLoM5tTRukzPC31oGPxaQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bRBeSHfGHwkEpImlhxPmOcUsaeg.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u8DU5fkLoM5tTRukzPC31oGPxaQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bRBeSHfGHwkEpImlhxPmOcUsaeg.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14087,"title":"Barefoot Gen","description":"A story about the effect of the atomic bombing of Hiroshima on a boy''s life and the lives of the Japanese people.","duration":"1:23:00","genre":["Animation","Drama","War","History"],"release_date":"1983-07-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bWui2Vgxp4f3REKQZcwwWAA5Pd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kVqQToQ47e27b9uoryttWgTPiik.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bWui2Vgxp4f3REKQZcwwWAA5Pd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kVqQToQ47e27b9uoryttWgTPiik.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":55,"title":"Amores Perros","description":"A fatalistic car crash in Mexico city sets off a chain of events in the lives of three people: a supermodel, a young man wanting to run off with his sister-in-law, and a homeless man.","duration":"2:34:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2000-06-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iTkxwBriD9YKg4Q35qWEIlLXd6e.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1lX74fPZsBoOyyE5fWL5xT7k9sV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iTkxwBriD9YKg4Q35qWEIlLXd6e.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1lX74fPZsBoOyyE5fWL5xT7k9sV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":81900,"title":"Scooby-Doo! Music of the Vampire","description":"Scooby and the gang have their first musical mystery in “Scooby Doo: Music of the Vampire.” It begins when they take a sing-a-long road trip into bayou country to attend the “Vampire-Palooza Festival” – an outdoor fair dedicated to all things Draculian. At first it looks as if they’re in for some fun and lots of Southern snacks, but events soon turn scary when a real live vampire comes to life, bursts from his coffin and threatens all the townsfolk. On top of that, this baritone blood sucker seems intent on taking Daphne as his vampire bride! Could the vampire be a descendant of a famous vampire hunter who is trying to sell his book? Or perhaps he’s the local politician, who has been trying to make his name in the press by attacking the vampires as downright unwholesome. The answers are to be found in a final song-filled showdown in the swamp in which our heroes unmask one of their most macabre monsters yet.","duration":"1:19:00","genre":["Family","Animation","Mystery","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2012-03-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/d5RN3KFPnMLGtIIHoGpNHUMtbsL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rgbshmGOSWmMx8G9H0OD2q1Z7Mr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//d5RN3KFPnMLGtIIHoGpNHUMtbsL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rgbshmGOSWmMx8G9H0OD2q1Z7Mr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":728118,"title":"Quo Vadis, Aida?","description":"Bosnia, July 1995. Aida is a translator for the UN in the small town of Srebrenica. When the Serbian army takes over the town, her family is among the thousands of citizens looking for shelter in the UN camp. As an insider to the negotiations Aida has access to crucial information that she needs to interpret. What is at the horizon for her family and people – rescue or death? Which move should she take?","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["War","Drama","History"],"release_date":"2021-02-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/awElIr61fFpbudzlCfobIpbwEro.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eQy2Tgvmx0FkK8vMMqMW4aX5UXQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//awElIr61fFpbudzlCfobIpbwEro.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eQy2Tgvmx0FkK8vMMqMW4aX5UXQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":48211,"title":"Sacco & Vanzetti","description":"Boston, 1920. Italian immigrants Nicola Sacco and Bartolomeo Vanzetti are charged and unfairly tried for murder on the basis of their anarchist political beliefs.","duration":"2:05:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"1971-03-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pJlI4IrHTOWvph6pxUe6dZAqhAz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pgAoI8h6lKLKenW8aKmdNd7AFwJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pJlI4IrHTOWvph6pxUe6dZAqhAz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pgAoI8h6lKLKenW8aKmdNd7AFwJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":20874,"title":"Kin-dza-dza!","description":"Two Soviet humans previously unknown to each other are transported to the planet Pluke in the Kin-dza-dza galaxy due to a chance encounter with an alien teleportation device. They must come to grips with a language barrier and Plukian social norms (not to mention the laws of space and time) if they ever hope to return to Earth.","duration":"2:15:00","ge