parting modes of knowledge, but never staying long enough to form any semblance of sentient attachment.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2011-04-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iJwtR94Yq9U83ET0TzirsGWTewH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bC5H2dabnHrQJD1KmQUSUUeuCXU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iJwtR94Yq9U83ET0TzirsGWTewH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bC5H2dabnHrQJD1KmQUSUUeuCXU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13363,"title":"The Man from Earth","description":"A departing professor gathers his closest colleagues for an intimate farewell, but the night takes an unexpected turn when he shares a stunning secret about his past. As the conversation unfolds, skepticism and curiosity collide, challenging everything they thought they knew about history, science, and belief.","duration":"1:27:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Drama"],"release_date":"2007-06-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gt4EnUGbbGbNOX0q47YII3WxB48.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/V086R82gNgWrotaXZFO4JhdgB1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gt4EnUGbbGbNOX0q47YII3WxB48.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//V086R82gNgWrotaXZFO4JhdgB1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":869626,"title":"Marcel the Shell with Shoes On","description":"Marcel is an adorable one-inch-tall shell who ekes out a colorful existence with his grandmother Connie and their pet lint, Alan. Once part of a sprawling community of shells, they now live alone as the sole survivors of a mysterious tragedy. When a documentarian discovers them amongst the clutter of his Airbnb, his resulting short film brings Marcel millions of passionate fans, as well as unprecedented dangers and a new hope at finding his long-lost family.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Drama","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2022-06-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1PRWW60yQparK1I8Soyy9Evf7Dv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jaYmP4Ct8YLnxWAW2oYkUjeXtzm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1PRWW60yQparK1I8Soyy9Evf7Dv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jaYmP4Ct8YLnxWAW2oYkUjeXtzm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":20719,"title":"Day of the Wacko","description":"It is a bitter story about a middle-aged man, who hates his life and other people, including himself. Adam Miauczynski, the character known from director Marek Koterski''s previous films, is a 49 year-old teacher, who reads poetry during school lessons and later goes home swearing and calling his neighbours'' names. The worst pain for him is the next 5 minutes of living. He doesn''t accept himself and even everyday contacts with others cause his aggression. Though constantly dreaming of a romantic love, he is not bold enough to make his dreams come true. The desperate Miauczynski personalizes our own fears and obsessions, which have become so visible recently.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2002-06-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mE3Z5CkndqNObVwyv6HKMUcz0ow.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2FT8jX2bPHTv8VDC6c4AvBEEq65.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mE3Z5CkndqNObVwyv6HKMUcz0ow.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2FT8jX2bPHTv8VDC6c4AvBEEq65.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12093,"title":"Lilya 4-ever","description":"In a struggling post-Soviet community, Lilya a teenage girl is abandoned when her mother moves to the United States with her boyfriend. Facing neglect and poverty, she meets Andrei, who offers her a job in Sweden, giving her hope for a better life — and a journey that will change everything.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"2002-08-23","backdrop_path":"https://imag