 looking to change her ways, and has one goal: go back home to her mother. When anger management trainer Micha is hired to help, suddenly there is hope.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2019-09-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fliLEpVMbHPWLuW1J0aiJl3WtpB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/YqbeGd7ojtxRukKhvoq6Bgf4t8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fliLEpVMbHPWLuW1J0aiJl3WtpB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//YqbeGd7ojtxRukKhvoq6Bgf4t8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":776305,"title":"Belle","description":"Suzu is a 17-year-old high-school student living in a rural town with her father. Wounded by the loss of her mother at a young age, Suzu one day discovers the massive online world \"U\" and dives into this alternate reality as her avatar, Belle. Before long, all of U''s eyes are fixed on Belle, when, suddenly, a mysterious, dragon-like figure appears before her.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Animation","Science Fiction","Drama","Music"],"release_date":"2021-07-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7aiVtavsu145yo6n4ZpazwMDLXL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fYHOD4pxZQk4rsP2tQrZI5uBlZV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7aiVtavsu145yo6n4ZpazwMDLXL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fYHOD4pxZQk4rsP2tQrZI5uBlZV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":581577,"title":"Persian Lessons","description":"Occupied France, 1942. Gilles is arrested by SS soldiers alongside other Jews and sent to a camp in Germany. He narrowly avoids sudden execution by swearing to the guards that he is not Jewish, but Persian. This lie temporarily saves him, but Gilles gets assigned a life-or-death mission: to teach Farsi to Head of Camp Koch, who dreams of opening a restaurant in Iran once the war is over. Through an ingenious trick, Gilles manages to survive by inventing words of \"Farsi\" every day and teaching them to Koch.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["War","Drama"],"release_date":"2020-04-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kgP4YOUWKhJZWL0Z8LJ6G6LBMEM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ppReRGszmdZC2194keN4cGoLIPQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kgP4YOUWKhJZWL0Z8LJ6G6LBMEM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ppReRGszmdZC2194keN4cGoLIPQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":38251,"title":"Mediterraneo","description":"Greek Sea, World War II. An Italian ship leaves a handful of soldiers in a little island; their mission is to spot enemy ships and to hold the island in case of attack. The village of the island seems abandoned and there isn''t a single enemy in sight, so the soldiers begin to relax a little. Things change when their ship is hit and destroyed by the enemy, and the soldiers find themselves abandoned there.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance","War"],"release_date":"1991-02-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/o2alIK1pBH0xVQIswPXWJwLGy48.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/omFU47TZSR7xAAZcDHKM48SmVwe.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//o2alIK1pBH0xVQIswPXWJwLGy48.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//omFU47TZSR7xAAZcDHKM48SmVwe.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1062722,"title":"Frankenstein","description":"Dr. Victor Frankenstein, a brilliant but egotistical scientist, brings a creature to life in a monstrous experiment that ultimately leads to the undoing of both the creator and his tragic creation.","duration":"2:30:00","genre":["Drama","Fantasy","Horror"],"release_date":"2025-10-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hpXBJxLD2SEf8l2CspmSeiHrBKX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/g4JtvGlQO7DByTI6frUobqvSL3R.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hpXBJxLD2