s that when the Allied invasion comes they must be stopped on the beach. \"For the Allies as well as the Germans, it will be the longest day\"","duration":"2:58:00","genre":["War","Drama","History"],"release_date":"1962-09-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yt9FIS2Osm97M7w4dLFkBu7YxW8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5zmvEofdIlgXrQl9A7e5IOzlnFU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yt9FIS2Osm97M7w4dLFkBu7YxW8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5zmvEofdIlgXrQl9A7e5IOzlnFU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":348678,"title":"A Man Called Ove","description":"Despite being deposed as president of his condominium association, grumpy 59-year-old Ove continues to watch over his neighbourhood with an iron fist. When pregnant Parvaneh and her family move into the terraced house opposite Ove and she accidentally backs into Ove’s mailbox, it sets off a series of unexpected changes in his life.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2015-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aWNknDl5kGZTgjqfeIKxdZaKGmm.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a41uvFqze4PI7N3E9jPNwN9ypV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aWNknDl5kGZTgjqfeIKxdZaKGmm.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//a41uvFqze4PI7N3E9jPNwN9ypV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":25768,"title":"Steamboat Bill, Jr.","description":"The just-out-of-college, effete son of a no-nonsense steamboat captain comes to visit his father whom he''s not seen since he was a child.","duration":"1:10:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"1928-05-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kmZjw9hbo8ErovofQvPB21HRyRf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zygJMsmXxeyDc1N67OCZc8xtq4I.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kmZjw9hbo8ErovofQvPB21HRyRf.jpg","small_post