//image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2E2WTX0TJEflAged6kzErwqX1kt.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":498249,"title":"Bad Seeds","description":"Wael, a former street child, makes a living from small scams with his adoptive mother and partner-in-crime Monique. When this unconventional duo swindles the wrong guy, Victor, an old acquaintance of Monique now in charge of a support organization for troubled teens, they have no choice but to become his interim secretary and educator in order to redeem themselves.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2018-11-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sWPxNdAgKfTIeZ3H17EheDAsci6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sJJWdXTi7ybxLd3mSILD7XxwYzh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sWPxNdAgKfTIeZ3H17EheDAsci6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sJJWdXTi7ybxLd3mSILD7XxwYzh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":33997,"title":"Desert Flower","description":"The autobiography of a Somalian nomad who was sold in marriage at 13, fled from Africa a while later to become finally an American supermodel and is now at the age of 38, the UN spokeswoman against female genital mutilation.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2009-09-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ivgsXGoQDskwfvyMJy7jgSfEsW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ciH58y8eF7XG5GBg9m8ILNQImAq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ivgsXGoQDskwfvyMJy7jgSfEsW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ciH58y8eF7XG5GBg9m8ILNQImAq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":38234,"title":"Undisputed III: Redemption","description":"Russian inmate Boyka, now severely hobbled by the knee injury suffered at the end of Undisputed 2. No longer the feared prison fighter he was, he has declined so far that he is now good only for cleaning toilets. But when a new prison fight tournament begins - an international affair, matching the best fighters from prisons around the globe, enticing them with the promise of freedom for the winner - Boyka must reclaim his dignity and fight for his position in the tournament.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2010-04-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fTZlSRATSk7QJyUrpbmjScDtY8Z.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/g8KB77SPA7SyU8eid6TAEpt9skU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fTZlSRATSk7QJyUrpbmjScDtY8Z.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//g8KB77SPA7SyU8eid6TAEpt9skU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9444,"title":"Anastasia","description":"Ten years after she was separated from her family, an eighteen-year-old orphan with vague memories of the past sets out to Paris in hopes of reuniting with her grandmother. She is accompanied by two con men, who intend to pass her off as the Grand Duchess Anastasia to the Dowager Empress for a reward.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Fantasy","Adventure"],"release_date":"1997-11-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/h6VshReCGaGQoaGZwT2wqiqrcZW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bppGWGA8zq1sRvTdDJnUzVW9GcH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//h6VshReCGaGQoaGZwT2wqiqrcZW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bppGWGA8zq1sRvTdDJnUzVW9GcH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":819,"title":"Sleepers","description":"Two gangsters seek revenge on the state jail worker who during their stay at a youth prison sexually abused them. A sensational court hearing takes place to charge him for the crimes.","duration":"2:27:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1996-10-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sDhABATFQX8nfTHShTfH8HeqKY1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yUpiEk2EojS9ZEXb3nIQonQCYYF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sDhABATFQX8nfTHShTfH8HeqKY1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yUpiEk2EojS9ZEXb3nIQonQCYYF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":99,"title":"All About My Mother","description":"Following the tragic death of her teenage son, Manuela travels from Madrid to Barcelona in an attempt to contact the long-estranged father the boy never knew. She reunites with an old friend, an outspoken transgender sex worker, and befriends a troubled actress and a pregnant, HIV-positive nun.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1999-04-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tilClWjFZeUTGJu0pxgF72fvUmN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hjQhzhkGYXPNM96k0mOgob6HMmn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tilClWjFZeUTGJu0pxgF72fvUmN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hjQhzhkGYXPNM96k0mOgob6HMmn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11321,"title":"Seven Pounds","description":"An IRS agent with a fateful secret embarks on an extraordinary journey of redemption by forever changing the lives of seven strangers.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2008-12-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mDu3nkdjzkJ9loy3QyppGcLjaI7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/85zUipgVy2QbvAJ6djZXYaGckMv.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mDu3nkdjzkJ9loy3QyppGcLjaI7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//85zUipgVy2QbvAJ6djZXYaGckMv.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2593,"title":"The Fire Within","description":"Depressed Alain Leroy leaves the clinic where he was detoxified. He meets friends, acquaintances and women, trying to find a reason to continue living.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1963-10-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aHMsHOCPSVD4Mv5rLf5k4JetPAv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9iHsReoh2VuHihDmNXgLXCi18rR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aHMsHOCPSVD4Mv5rLf5k4JetPAv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9iHsReoh2VuHihDmNXgLXCi18rR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":17058,"title":"Scarlet Street","description":"Cashier and part-time starving artist Christopher Cross is absolutely smitten with the beautiful Kitty March. Kitty plays along, but she''s really only interested in Johnny, a two-bit crook. When Kitty and Johnny find out that art dealers are interested in Chris''s work, they con him into letting Kitty take credit for the paintings. Cross allows it because he is in love with Kitty, but his love will only let her get away with so much.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"1945-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/g0phljbAcccz7bkSZpFEPVLuIRP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eGEDor1BWSQGaLtOntPHUSqNzRC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//g0phljbAcccz7bkSZpFEPVLuIRP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eGEDor1BWSQGaLtOntPHUSqNzRC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4951,"title":"10 Things I Hate About You","description":"On the first day at his new school, Cameron instantly falls for Bianca, the gorgeous girl of his dreams. The only problem is that Bianca is forbidden to date until her ill-tempered, completely un-dateable older sister Kat goes out, too. In an attempt to solve his problem, Cameron singles out the only guy who could possibly be a match for Kat: a mysterious bad boy with a nasty reputation of his own.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"1999-03-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yvPbncYhMu9FfTjDhq0N5lgnVkO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ujERk3aKABXU3NDXOAxEQYTHe9A.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yvPbncYhMu9FfTjDhq0N5lgnVkO