","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Action","Animation","History"],"release_date":"2007-09-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mfu8cTvpJwrnu3sm2vDqh7o4yXX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lMsUYZq5ITW3rAqF3tB7v74KEnH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mfu8cTvpJwrnu3sm2vDqh7o4yXX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lMsUYZq5ITW3rAqF3tB7v74KEnH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":995,"title":"Stagecoach","description":"A group of people traveling on a stagecoach find their journey complicated by the threat of Geronimo, and learn something about each other in the process.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Western"],"release_date":"1939-03-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7SYNEG50fKODsTP6h9phYM3BueV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zgMnfnwWZ3nkx4t0bUDEKtW24O8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7SYNEG50fKODsTP6h9phYM3BueV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zgMnfnwWZ3nkx4t0bUDEKtW24O8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":18,"title":"The Fifth Element","description":"In 2257, a taxi driver is unintentionally given the task of saving a young girl who is part of the key that will ensure the survival of humanity.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Action","Adventure"],"release_date":"1997-05-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jW21PoKwqs79wk6bfiYezox63mK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fPtlCO1yQtnoLHOwKtWz7db6RGU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jW21PoKwqs79wk6bfiYezox63mK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fPtlCO1yQtnoLHOwKtWz7db6RGU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9343,"title":"Fitzcarraldo","description":"Fitzcarraldo is a dreamer who plans to build an opera house in Iquitos, in the Peruvian Amazon, so, in order to finance his project, he embarks on an epic adventure to collect