claimed show on FX, Louie.  Performed in the round in front of a live audience, he discusses such topics as the food chain, animals, divorce, strange anecdotes, broken morality, murder and mortality.","duration":"0:58:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2013-04-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fEMUwqYwHQq5lokxGI1BsSG0LFK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4roFbQgNik1M8oTN7anqihfNF2i.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fEMUwqYwHQq5lokxGI1BsSG0LFK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4roFbQgNik1M8oTN7anqihfNF2i.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10322,"title":"Being There","description":"A simple-minded gardener named Chance has spent all his life in the Washington D.C. house of an old man. When the man dies, Chance is put out on the street with no knowledge of the world except what he has learned from television.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1979-12-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hddFwpiSpmAsVtCvKuKEUEmXAlr.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yFHi5wiCB45loSa1D1O6KAFMC3A.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hddFwpiSpmAsVtCvKuKEUEmXAlr.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yFHi5wiCB45loSa1D1O6KAFMC3A.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":576,"title":"The Wild Bunch","description":"An aging group of outlaws look for one last big score as the \"traditional\" American West is disappearing around them.","duration":"2:25:00","genre":["Western"],"release_date":"1969-06-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nkgWcfOeQnVnxak5xCKvkRDLt5H.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8j9yEC3xjy1PJDSizIbaxcHaSph.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nkgWcfOeQnVnxak5xCKvkRDLt5H.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8j9yEC3xjy1PJDSizIbaxcHaSph.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":588648,"title":"Dragonkeeper","description":"Set in Han Imperial China, the plot follows the adventures of enslaved girl Ping with ancient dragon Long Danzi. Dragons had been banished from the kingdom. Ping, an orphan, finds one of the last remaining dragon eggs. Palace guards force Ping to run away in order to return the dragon egg to the ocean and save all dragons from extinction. Ping discovers that she is a true Dragonkeeper.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2024-04-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/h9YlRHAZWOWtGonllmj6JJg1FrE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ggZGnJLzO3BTu7ysuuIzou3Oex5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//h9YlRHAZWOWtGonllmj6JJg1FrE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ggZGnJLzO3BTu7ysuuIzou3Oex5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":502356,"title":"The Super Mario Bros. Movie","description":"While working underground to fix a water main, Brooklyn plumbers—and brothers—Mario and Luigi are transported down a mysterious pipe and wander into a magical new world. But when the brothers are separated, Mario embarks on an epic quest to find Luigi.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Family","Comedy","Adventure","Fantasy","Animation"],"release_date":"2023-04-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9n2tJBplPbgR2ca05hS5CKXwP2c.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qNBAXBIQlnOThrVvA6mA2B5ggV6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9n2tJBplPbgR2ca05hS5CKXwP2c.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qNBAXBIQlnOThrVvA6mA2B5ggV6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":364111,"title":"The Anthem of the Heart","description":"A young girl had her voice magically taken away so that she would never hurt people with it, but her outlook changes when she encounters music and friendship. Will Naruse be able to convey the anthem of her heart?","duration":"1: