 fired. As Irene falls for her new butler, Godfrey turns the tables and teaches the frivolous Bullocks a lesson or two.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1936-09-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/96cNUk1Uj8fQcmbOTnpBauUdqzC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wtfOW7fIxBZWY78rvUoPpWhMSiR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//96cNUk1Uj8fQcmbOTnpBauUdqzC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wtfOW7fIxBZWY78rvUoPpWhMSiR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12206,"title":"The Testament of Dr. Mabuse","description":"After a detective is assaulted by thugs and placed in an asylum run by Professor Baum, he observes the professor''s preoccupation with another patient, the criminal genius Dr. Mabuse the hypnotist. When Mabuse''s notes are found to be connected with a rash of recent crimes, Commissioner Lohmann must determine how Mabuse is communicating with the criminals, despite conflicting reports on the doctor''s whereabouts, and capture him for good.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Crime","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"1933-04-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1cqCq9KJUeeygcUpip4qfokmQG2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tc2ET7j6X066VCjdHblSwLr8sEz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1cqCq9KJUeeygcUpip4qfokmQG2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tc2ET7j6X066VCjdHblSwLr8sEz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":244,"title":"King Kong","description":"Adventurous filmmaker Carl Denham sets out to produce a motion picture unlike anything the world has seen before. Alongside his leading lady Ann Darrow and his first mate Jack Driscoll, they arrive on an island and discover a legendary creature said to be neither beast nor man. Denham captures the monster to be displayed on Broadway as King Kong, the eighth wonder of the world.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Adventure","