ung demon into the infamous monster Janemba. Goku and Vegeta make solo attempts to defeat the monster, but realize their only option is fusion.","duration":"0:55:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1995-03-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/t9z8Wm8c0HnxfPN9YvXgmueG6De.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rCU5ddP3FVSDJy81UldUsBuf3ag.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//t9z8Wm8c0HnxfPN9YvXgmueG6De.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rCU5ddP3FVSDJy81UldUsBuf3ag.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":30368,"title":"Stray Dog","description":"A bad day gets worse for young detective Murakami when a pickpocket steals his gun on a hot, crowded bus. Desperate to right the wrong, he goes undercover, scavenging Tokyo’s sweltering streets for the stray dog whose desperation has led him to a life of crime. With each step, cop and criminal’s lives become more intertwined and the investigation becomes an examination of Murakami’s own dark side.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller","Mystery"],"release_date":"1949-10-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pKeatSUHRrlcTmkAOQ9tvESbCCe.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/riBzUgeYawBDi2q9PjARjHrQM7Z.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pKeatSUHRrlcTmkAOQ9tvESbCCe.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//riBzUgeYawBDi2q9PjARjHrQM7Z.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":234567,"title":"Get a Horse!","description":"Mickey, Minnie, Horace Horsecollar, and Clarabelle Cow go on a musical wagon ride until Peg-Leg Pete tries to run them off the road.","duration":"0:08:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Comedy"],"release_date":"2013-11-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vZ2GrFaDDUqpYzd5lFqz5wiOGx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/axVSbOZxa6Xp0ticSJA6faVeyDY.jpg","smal