":"1:48:00","genre":["Drama","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2015-01-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uqOuJ50EtTj7kkDIXP8LCg7G45D.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dmJW8IAKHKxFNiUnoDR7JfsK7Rp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uqOuJ50EtTj7kkDIXP8LCg7G45D.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dmJW8IAKHKxFNiUnoDR7JfsK7Rp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":27040,"title":"Meshes of the Afternoon","description":"A woman returning home falls asleep and has vivid dreams that may or may not be happening in reality. Through repetitive images and complete mismatching of the objective view of time and space, her dark inner desires play out on-screen.","duration":"0:14:00","genre":["Mystery","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1943-01-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/otRHDr3aMJboh9N4AMbuKKnlHYL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yHjEjRU81RcxKFNU5hhiPYMzlsu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//otRHDr3aMJboh9N4AMbuKKnlHYL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yHjEjRU81RcxKFNU5hhiPYMzlsu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4638,"title":"Hot Fuzz","description":"Former London constable Nicholas Angel finds it difficult to adapt to his new assignment in the sleepy British village of Sandford. Not only does he miss the excitement of the big city, but he also has a well-meaning oaf for a partner. However, when a series of grisly accidents rocks Sandford, Angel smells something rotten in the idyllic village.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Crime","Action","Comedy"],"release_date":"2007-02-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9rMSCFH9zhv1vILpEZQlUJs9iUm.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zPib4ukTSdXvHP9pxGkFCe34f3y.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9rMSCFH9zhv1vILpEZQlUJs9iUm.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org