t/p/w342//mZj8EUr6F1x2PWZjKPxaeYd5WRw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wwbgkXQBEKtnyIJapk6gUgWkVw8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":568124,"title":"Encanto","description":"The tale of an extraordinary family, the Madrigals, who live hidden in the mountains of Colombia, in a magical house, in a vibrant town, in a wondrous, charmed place called an Encanto. The magic of the Encanto has blessed every child in the family—every child except one, Mirabel. But when she discovers that the magic surrounding the Encanto is in danger, Mirabel decides that she, the only ordinary Madrigal, might just be her exceptional family''s last hope.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2021-11-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3G1Q5xF40HkUBJXxt2DQgQzKTp5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4j0PNHkMr5ax3IA8tjtxcmPU3QT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3G1Q5xF40HkUBJXxt2DQgQzKTp5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4j0PNHkMr5ax3IA8tjtxcmPU3QT.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":277834,"title":"Moana","description":"In Ancient Polynesia, when a terrible curse incurred by Maui reaches an impetuous Chieftain''s daughter''s island, she answers the Ocean''s call to seek out the demigod to set things right.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Adventure","Comedy","Family","Animation"],"release_date":"2016-10-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qLVNZFHYUR6Li64He67SWl6BHQe.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4JeejGugONWpJkbnvL12hVoYEDa.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qLVNZFHYUR6Li64He67SWl6BHQe.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4JeejGugONWpJkbnvL12hVoYEDa.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":221731,"title":"Rurouni Kenshin Part II: Kyoto Inferno","description":"Kenshin has settled into his new life with Kaoru and his other friends when he is approached with a request from the Meiji government. Makoto Shishio, a former assassin like Kenshin, was betrayed, set on fire and left for dead. He survived, and is now in Kyoto, plotting with his gathered warriors to overthrow the new government. Against Kaoru''s wishes, Kenshin reluctantly agrees to go to Kyoto and help keep his country from falling back into civil war.","duration":"2:18:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2014-08-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/q3jiq1PRpOGnRScbj3cur7RkZYv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gI2xYpJPQOsmFblvowkW2IgEHkC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//q3jiq1PRpOGnRScbj3cur7RkZYv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gI2xYpJPQOsmFblvowkW2IgEHkC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1122573,"title":"In the Grey","description":"A covert team of elite operatives are living in the shadows. When a ruthless despot steals a billion-dollar fortune, they''re sent to take it back—an impossible heist that erupts into a deadly game of strategy, deception and survival.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2026-05-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qcIKxhqGMIj8uujsSoSMZWr8QqU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dQgIcW6Th08kMRf2HBoYWoFE6OD.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qcIKxhqGMIj8uujsSoSMZWr8QqU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dQgIcW6Th08kMRf2HBoYWoFE6OD.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":864101,"title":"Mira","description":"Near future. Lera Arabova is a 15-year-old girl who lives with her family in Vladivostok. Lera''s father has been working at the orbiting space station \"Mira\" for many years and has long lost contact with his daughter, turning only into a voice on the phone. After a meteor shower hits the city, Lera has only one chance to save her loved ones and the city from a new disaster. Her father helps her in this - through satellite surveillance systems and the telephone, he uses every opportunity to send a message to his daughter, watching from above from the station her every step.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Drama","Adventure","Family"],"release_date":"2022-12-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/y4eT4VDavpwuqEP7w1A2iOJUPah.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mv2DFhsaLeNgFzNe2G5CJhzbrkt.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//y4eT4VDavpwuqEP7w1A2iOJUPah.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mv2DFhsaLeNgFzNe2G5CJhzbrkt.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":489999,"title":"Searching","description":"After David Kim''s 16-year-old daughter goes missing, a local investigation is opened and a detective is assigned to the case. But 37 hours later and without a single lead, David decides to search the one place no one has looked yet, where all secrets are kept today: his daughter''s laptop.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Drama","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2018-08-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jOqOduY1tLhXgVZo7ypCtDVr0mM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yuAPCsCGJGSxA7YOW4elF5JNrzK.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jOqOduY1tLhXgVZo7ypCtDVr0mM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yuAPCsCGJGSxA7YOW4elF5JNrzK.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12102,"title":"Kramer vs. Kramer","description":"Ted Kramer is a career man for whom his work comes before his family. His wife Joanna cannot take this anymore, so she decides to leave him. Ted is now faced with the tasks of housekeeping and taking care of himself and their young son Billy.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1979-12-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9pUh1fC8TqVtYPeKpdfNyVK0qnn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3CU