b.org/t/p/w342//o9VXYOuaJxCEKOxbA86xqtwmqYn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":21575,"title":"A Prophet","description":"Sentenced to six years in prison, Malik El Djebena is alone in the world and can neither read nor write. On his arrival at the prison, he seems younger and more brittle than the others detained there. At once he falls under the sway of a group of Corsicans who enforce their rule in the prison. As the ''missions'' go by, he toughens himself and wins the confidence of the Corsican group.","duration":"2:35:00","genre":["Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2009-08-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jEJDjDBT6KCoS4WOBq68vZMbFk2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/x9Jb8kewBHPzjTtgCQvoQoDsy4d.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jEJDjDBT6KCoS4WOBq68vZMbFk2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//x9Jb8kewBHPzjTtgCQvoQoDsy4d.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1883,"title":"Malcolm X","description":"A tribute to the controversial black activist and leader of the struggle for black liberation. He hit bottom during his imprisonment in the ''50s, he became a Black Muslim and then a leader in the Nation of Islam. His assassination in 1965 left a legacy of self-determination and racial pride.","duration":"3:22:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"1992-11-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yj9VAqzlA0kasae8rK1VG3NvDZk.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/o2s9ow0uRRm1BcF3teznk5twd90.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yj9VAqzlA0kasae8rK1VG3NvDZk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//o2s9ow0uRRm1BcF3teznk5twd90.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":42360,"title":"Inuyasha the Movie: Affections Touching Across Time","description":"InuYasha is a half-demon who was trapped in the Legendary Tree and was set free by Kagome, a girl who traveled 500 years through time. This time, both of them will have to face Menomaru, a Chinese demon whose father, known as Hyoga, came 300 years ago to invade Japan, but was stopped by InuYasha''s Father. InuYasha and Kagome, along with Sango, Miroku, Shippou, Kaede and Myoga, will try to stop Menomaru in his becoming the most powerful demon ever.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Action","Animation","Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2001-12-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aWg40fkUvghFwrCya2fHvAEvjud.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gl8TvgVL6B2PR71cnrG7PbAUPls.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aWg40fkUvghFwrCya2fHvAEvjud.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gl8TvgVL6B2PR71cnrG7PbAUPls.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13345,"title":"A Chinese Odyssey Part One: Pandora''s Box","description":"When the Goddess of Happiness tosses the Longevity Monk and his disciples out of heaven (because the Monkey King tried to attain immortality), the Monkey King is reincarnated as the Joker. He now spends his time chasing two jealous women. When one of them is dying, the Joker goes back in time in an attempt to save her.","duration":"1:28:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Comedy","Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"1995-01-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cvpq5L0LSrTvLBokQ0tsFdEysJ6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wIDDJ3FXPmVnNpxVoZOvjjcKVqj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cvpq5L0LSrTvLBokQ0tsFdEysJ6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wIDDJ3FXPmVnNpxVoZOvjjcKVqj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11178,"title":"My Sassy Girl","description":"A young man’s world is turned upside down when a female force of nature takes his life by storm in this outrageous and uplifting ode to true love.","duration":"2:17:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2001-07-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/13uKAt4M87HQi1lMZAwBmsNZRGg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/i964xFDEMwZ5uaweParv8ItBfbJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//13uKAt4M87HQi1lMZAwBmsNZRGg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//i964xFDEMwZ5uaweParv8ItBfbJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":228150,"title":"Fury","description":"April, 1945. As the Allies make their final push in the European Theater, a battle-hardened army sergeant commands a Sherman tank with a five-man crew on a deadly mission behind enemy lines.","duration":"2:15:00","genre":["War","Drama","Action"],"release_date":"2014-10-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/95ckrV6wQgbffurAVmETQ5YKASL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pfte7wdMobMF4CVHuOxyu6oqeeA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//95ckrV6wQgbffurAVmETQ5YKASL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pfte7wdMobMF4CVHuOxyu6oqeeA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":29084,"title":"Le Corbeau","description":"Remy Germain is a doctor in a French town who becomes the focus of a vicious smear campaign, as letters accusing him of having an affair and performing unlawful abortions are mailed to village leaders. The mysterious writer, who signs each letter as \"Le Corbeau\" (The Raven) soon targets the whole town, exposing everyone''s dark secrets.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Mystery","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1943-09-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sUvL8Qhl349pRBr4WESwN9LkAYw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6Oh4hCD2nni5JJpGGIhD3CutfNI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sUvL8Qhl349pRBr4WESwN9LkAYw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6Oh4hCD2nni5JJpGGIhD3CutfNI.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":20108,"title":"Au Hasard Balthazar","description":"The story of a donkey Balthazar as he is passed from owner to owner, some kind and some cruel but all with motivations beyond his understanding. Balthazar, whose life parallels that of his first keeper, Marie, is truly a beast of burden, suffering the sins of humankind. But despite his powerlessness, he accepts his fate nobly.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1966-05-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7LPz7NEYtLXcV44j0kRLLkZ54yH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lkLO1HDzzaXpTXtAgnGpVqIQkvF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7LPz7NEYtLXcV44j0kRLLkZ54yH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lkLO1HDzzaXpTXtAgnGpVqIQkvF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1556,"title":"Funeral Parade of Roses","description":"In 1960s Tokyo, Gonda owns a bar in which the gay, cross-dresser, and trans scenes meet. Gonda is in a relationship with the madam of the bar, Leda. As the younger Eddie starts a passionate affair with Gonda, she ignites the jealousy of Leda, unaware of another kind of history between them.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1969-09-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wRBjG7wFxb4ewOWKWAarfbKARtK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7cRQ6rSGajW2soWDr3voEN2rgYO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wRBjG7wFxb4ewOWKWAarfbKARtK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7cRQ6rSGajW2soWDr3voEN2rgYO.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":747,"title":"Shaun of the Dead","description":"Shaun lives a supremely uneventful life, which revolves around his girlfriend, his mother, and, above all, his local pub. This gentle routine is threatened when the dead return to life and make strenuous attempts to snack on ordinary Londoners.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Horror","Comedy"],"release_date":"2004-04-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wb34q3VgzHgL8frVMywrN3wXmqx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dgXPhzNJH8HFTBjX