ements for a black market abortion.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2007-08-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/phYwx0HKSdcQyOuK5bMMO8woETT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/acEtvzFPeOQwbzRWncjRLenhnKV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//phYwx0HKSdcQyOuK5bMMO8woETT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//acEtvzFPeOQwbzRWncjRLenhnKV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":615,"title":"The Passion of the Christ","description":"A graphic portrayal of the last twelve hours of Jesus of Nazareth''s life.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2004-02-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4840rkbpsiuow5ew155oVKcqJwj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rBM5o2HpmCfDejuIPybI09tkY3V.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4840rkbpsiuow5ew155oVKcqJwj.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rBM5o2HpmCfDejuIPybI09tkY3V.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":127585,"title":"X-Men: Days of Future Past","description":"The ultimate X-Men ensemble fights a war for the survival of the species across two time periods as they join forces with their younger selves in an epic battle that must change the past – to save our future.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2014-05-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3czpqXzFy5UcNuD1AubecRLWkwD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tYfijzolzgoMOtegh1Y7j2Enorg.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3czpqXzFy5UcNuD1AubecRLWkwD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tYfijzolzgoMOtegh1Y7j2Enorg.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":22292,"title":"The Ghost and Mrs. Muir","description":"In 1900, young widow Lucy Muir learns that her seaside cottage is haunted and forms a unique relationship with the ghost.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Romance","Fantasy","Drama"],"release_date":"1947-05-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/m1QTfbKD90j63Gh9bOJt0g67LvA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/idoD3cwfwj86BPvVoWVgWhnT2xq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//m1QTfbKD90j63Gh9bOJt0g67LvA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//idoD3cwfwj86BPvVoWVgWhnT2xq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10161,"title":"My Left Foot: The Story of Christy Brown","description":"No one expects much from Christy Brown, a boy with cerebral palsy born into a working-class Irish family. Though Christy is a spastic quadriplegic and essentially paralyzed, a miraculous event occurs when, at the age of 5, he demonstrates control of his left foot by using chalk to scrawl a word on the floor. With the help of his steely mother — and no shortage of grit and determination — Christy overcomes his infirmity to become a painter, poet and author.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1989-04-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zjKg04EquTcnVZUfjHboXnXzjcF.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/GRAAl0bMQFoFIjV3aunc5jsM5u.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zjKg04EquTcnVZUfjHboXnXzjcF.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//GRAAl0bMQFoFIjV3aunc5jsM5u.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":344,"title":"Bang, Boom, Bang","description":"Bank robber Kalle Grabowski escapes from prison while his unemployed smalltime crook buddy is sitting around doing nothing after he just lost all their money. A fast paced comedy from German director Peter Thorwarth.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Crime","Action","Comedy"],"release_date":"1999-08-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/y57A6U4lbmSTXHejwFQjD8KDhHk.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/c1bkOK9z6s3ZSkFEejUw76eeuwZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//y57A6U4lbmSTXHejwFQjD8KDhHk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//c1bkOK9z6s3ZSkFEejUw76eeuwZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":608317,"title":"Hidden Away","description":"The film tackles the life journey of Toni Ligabue, visionary naïf painter who used to draw tigers, lions and jaguars while living among the poplar trees of the boundless Po valley. A harsh life that is a fairy tale too, as a lonely and marginalized kid finds redemption in his art, and a way to express himself and be admired by the world.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2020-02-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yGPNJns2G4j7FuJw3vDVYJhIgxa.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/znkT7ke3WKz6wfvBCoCA7s8cvz8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yGPNJns2G4j7FuJw3vDVYJhIgxa.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//znkT7ke3WKz6wfvBCoCA7s8cvz8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":24807,"title":"Mr. Deeds Goes to Town","description":"Longfellow Deeds lives in a small town, leading a small town kind of life. When a relative dies and leaves Deeds a fortune, Longfellow moves to the big city where he becomes an instant target for everyone. Deeds outwits them all until Babe Bennett comes along. When small-town boy meets big-city girl anything can, and does, happen.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1936-04-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4HndddVOLbvifowXjNpdkkF8Q71.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/20p5Cxib8wX0AyGl5i1uwPm6UwC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4HndddVOLbvifowXjNpdkkF8Q71.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//20p5Cxib8wX0AyGl5i1uwPm6UwC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12163,"title":"The Wrestler","description":"Aging wrestler Randy \"The Ram\" Robinson is long past his prime but still ready and rarin'' to go on the pro-wrestling circuit. After a particularly brutal beating, however, Randy hangs up his tights, pursues a serious relationship with a long-in-the-tooth stripper, and tries to reconnect with his estranged daughter. But he can''t resist the lure of the ring and readies himself for a comeback.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2008-12-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wcJmFsz8RqIhozMwvU81hreTX4i.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7QH5p5BF582k6qHufCKjftfkqWH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wcJmFsz8RqIhozMwvU81hreTX4i.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7QH5p5BF582k6qHufCKjftfkqWH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":870360,"title":"The Day the Earth Blew Up: A Looney Tunes Movie","description":"Porky and Daffy, the classic animated odd couple, turn into unlikely heroes when their antics at the local bubble gum factory uncover a secret alien mind control plot. Against all odds, the two are determined to save their town (and the world!)...that is if they don''t drive each other crazy in the process.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Family","Comedy","Adventure","Animation","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2024-08-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5U3VLeWr2H4Nd3G7IkHItFimsIz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/s2lB1kaYCdGSnZX5meQCiOR6HfX.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5U3VLeWr2H4Nd3G7IkHItFimsIz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//s2lB1kaYCdGSnZX5meQCiOR6HfX.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":429450,"title":"Pandora","description":"When an earthquake hits a Korean village housing a run-down nuclear power plant, a man risks his life to save the country from imminent disaster.","duration":"2:16:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama","Action"],"release_date":"2016-12-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yc8Fl1P5aQwBHEAtB49MO9fpjmw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/elTrkTm5GjynK3H26cpOZsWDYjy.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yc8Fl1P5aQwBHEAtB49MO9fpjmw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//elTrkTm5GjynK3H26cpOZsWDYjy.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15472,"title":"The Girl with the Dragon Tattoo","description":"Swedish thriller based on Stieg Larsson''s novel about a male journalist and a young female hacker. In the opening of the movie, Mikael Blomkvist, a middle-aged publisher for the magazine Millennium, loses a libel case brought by corrupt Swedish industrialist Hans-Erik Wennerström. Nevertheless, he is hired by Henrik Vanger in order to solve a cold case, the disappearance of Vanger''s niece","duration":"2:32:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Crime","Mystery"],"release_date":"2009-02-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dPE25PbaeE6fCR2SQb4H4MeBmml.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/r2pFUXKK20KD9RE3yybpQsNynRE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dPE25PbaeE6fCR2SQb4H4MeBmml.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//r2pFUXKK20KD9RE3yybpQsNynRE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":507569,"title":"The Seven Deadly Sins: Prisoners of the Sky","description":"Traveling in search of the rare ingredient, “sky fish”  Meliodas and Hawk arrive at a palace that floats above the clouds. The people there are busy preparing a ceremony, meant to protect their home from a ferocious beast that awakens once every 3,000 years. But before the ritual is complete, the Six Knights of Black—a Demon Clan army—removes the seal on the beast, threatening the lives of everyone in the Sky Palace.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Animation"],"release_date":"2018-08-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e6CnfsN7wnhZEMqh5EnCfTDXQ7g.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/63NOOAkaZAK8h93Sg7Ucq6XLJGP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e6CnfsN7wnhZEMqh5EnCfTDXQ7g.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//63NOOAkaZAK8h93Sg7Ucq6XLJGP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":433471,"title":"Lou","description":"A lost-and-found box holds a mysterious and unseen monster within.","duration":"0:06:00","genre":["Family","Fantasy","Animation","Comedy"],"release_date":"2017-06-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/f13RF99zjorGVJnSSsOqyj5dzYh.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4l9wSwvabTefMJ3TkXnh9evzmVV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//f13RF99zjorGVJnSSsOqyj5dzYh.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4l9wSwvabTefMJ3TkXnh9evzmVV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":306819,"title":"The Danish Girl","description":"When Gerda Wegener asks her husband Einar to fill in as a portrait model, Einar discovers the person she''s meant to be and begins living her life as Lili Elbe. Having realized her true self and with Gerda''s love and support, Lili embarks on a groundbreaking journey as a transgender pioneer.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2015-11-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/d0tzLbn62WANaq5mnyLpCJsJq1B.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kiJTZ5oFRO961wWn7mLxjUcRlf3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//d0tzLbn62WANaq5mnyLpCJsJq1B.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kiJTZ5oFRO961wWn7mLxjUcRlf3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":109424,"title":"Captain Phillips","description":"The true story of Captain Richard Phillips and the 2009 hijacking by Somali pirates of the US-flagged MV Maersk Alabama, the first American cargo ship to be hijacked in two hundred years.","duration":"2:14:00","genre":["Action","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2013-10-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fLrGQzvfhTwn9m7AqlJh65FMFfG.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8Td0kkocW6sD3uRpzwfMfkqMWhx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fLrGQzvfhTwn9m7AqlJh65FMFfG.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8Td0kkocW6sD3uRpzwfMfkqMWhx.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":319,"title":"True Romance","description":"Clarence marries hooker Alabama, steals cocaine from her pimp, and tries to sell it in Hollywood, while the owners of the coke try to reclaim it.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Romance"],"release_date":"1993-09-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1Uh8yuXlFcMDpVHWZJidjanT06e.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/39lXk6ud6KiJgGbbWI2PUKS7y2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1Uh8yuXlFcMDpVHWZJidjanT06e.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//39lXk6ud6KiJgGbbWI2PUKS7y2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1266127,"title":"Ready or Not: Here I Come","description":"Moments after surviving an all-out attack from the Le Domas family, Grace discovers she’s reached the next level of the nightmarish game — and this time with her estranged sister Faith at her side. Grace has one chance to survive, keep her sister alive, and claim the High Seat of the Council that controls the world. Four rival families are hunting her for the throne, and whoever wins rules it all.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Horror","Comedy"],"release_date":"2026-03-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fx2cEuadZK28VHKkc0F1nFR96i0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/13ZcJzSGEqVgDSqsS9U5EkQwPkV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fx2cEuadZK28VHKkc0F1nFR96i0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//13ZcJzSGEqVgDSqsS9U5EkQwPkV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":352173,"title":"Drishyam","description":"When his family stares down the barrel of criminal charges, a commoner channels his street smarts and knowledge of action films to tie the long arm of the law into an investigative Gordian knot.","duration":"2:43:00","genre":["Mystery","Thriller","Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"2015-07-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5jxesZtbjNtsDitSBvK1amtd7o2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gIClWRv5OSe8rl5Koi0AeUcCZ9Z.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5jxesZtbjNtsDitSBvK1amtd7o2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gIClWRv5OSe8rl5Koi0AeUcCZ9Z.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":37698,"title":"The Roaring Twenties","description":"After World War I, Armistice Lloyd Hart goes back to practice law, former saloon keeper George Hally turns to bootlegging, and out-of-work Eddie Bartlett becomes a cab driver. Eddie builds a fleet of cabs through delivery of bootleg liquor and hires Lloyd as his lawyer. George becomes Eddie''s partner and the rackets flourish until love and rivalry interfere.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1939-10-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ujZtDH8CSiVETuK9ancFTPAmZr6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nkymdElqwJBm2bl3F6hJp4xJggD.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ujZtDH8CSiVETuK9ancFTPAmZr6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nkymdElqwJBm2bl3F6hJp4xJggD.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":967,"title":"Spartacus","description":"The rebellious Thracian Spartacus, born and raised a slave, is sold to Gladiator trainer Batiatus. After weeks of being trained to kill for the arena, Spartacus turns on his owners and leads the other slaves in rebellion. As the rebels move from town to town, their numbers swell as escaped slaves join their ranks. Under the leadership of Spartacus, they make their way to southern Italy, where they will cross the sea and return to their homes.","duration":"3:17:00","genre":["History","Drama","Adventure"],"release_date":"1960-10-13","backdrop_path":