jective. It''s The Hill, a manmade instrument of torture, a tower of sand seared by a white-hot sun. And the troops'' tormentors are not the enemy, but their own comrades-at-arms.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Drama","War"],"release_date":"1965-06-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mOi2oONVYBPNa7Y55PGrqbaKczp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cmBpImAjHJnuHXMVByzqnxtDcae.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mOi2oONVYBPNa7Y55PGrqbaKczp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cmBpImAjHJnuHXMVByzqnxtDcae.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5165,"title":"L''Avventura","description":"Claudia and Anna join Anna''s lover, Sandro, on a boat trip to a remote volcanic island. When Anna goes missing, a search is launched. In the meantime, Sandro and Claudia become involved in a romance despite Anna''s disappearance, though the relationship suffers from guilt and tension.","duration":"2:24:00","genre":["Drama","Mystery","Romance"],"release_date":"1960-09-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kF5AeKG5XIZkAXY0kRgm57qEbJI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7kUXAS8K7Ihw1T1mhARjnLuMVk3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kF5AeKG5XIZkAXY0kRgm57qEbJI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7kUXAS8K7Ihw1T1mhARjnLuMVk3.jpg"}]'::jsonb
