ls into an alternate universe in order to recover a crown that was stolen from the Crystal Empire. Upon her arrival she is horrified to learn that she has turned into a human.","duration":"1:12:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Family","Fantasy","Music"],"release_date":"2013-06-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sCCv0SGBFygz9CJYHuz012a0vHz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3tQM3PUDn9i2iq0HP7yLlQsQ0ya.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sCCv0SGBFygz9CJYHuz012a0vHz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3tQM3PUDn9i2iq0HP7yLlQsQ0ya.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":41411,"title":"The Round Up","description":"A faithful retelling of the 1942 \"Vel'' d''Hiv Roundup\" and the events surrounding it.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Drama","History","War"],"release_date":"2010-03-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/b1yxcZAjoU9ArgxWDjVrVgpupv0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9osPoGTddZZfMUzFDs82n57y2wQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//b1yxcZAjoU9ArgxWDjVrVgpupv0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9osPoGTddZZfMUzFDs82n57y2wQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":19413,"title":"Ugly, Dirty and Bad","description":"Giacinto lives with his wife, their ten children and various other family members in a shack on the hills of Rome. Some time ago he has lost his left eye while at work, and got a consistent sum of money from the insurance company, which he keeps hidden from the rest of the family. His whole life is now based on defending the money he sees as his own, while the rest of the family tries to kill him.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1976-09-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lZzW1Y6sDGhbnOh8NuMwUlOVVVe.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rl2wUqZAZSEXymyvH3U7onEQfMN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"h