d_h900_face/xjoYc9umKoZHTVr2B0uBbn3bCXj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1gAIPtpuHSYWJ6PjF8r9jOJdSmG.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xjoYc9umKoZHTVr2B0uBbn3bCXj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":21028,"title":"Moscow Does Not Believe in Tears","description":"Living together in a workers'' dorm, Katerina and her friends are determined to make it in Moscow. But when a boorish cameraman forces himself on her, Katerina finds herself pregnant and alone as her friends move on. Twenty years later, Katerina is a factory director, outpacing her old roommates career-wise, yet still alone but for her daughter. Love seems possible again when she meets a genial mechanic.","duration":"2:22:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"1980-02-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eVbDEVjNIj2fRBiWObMTcuI5bI3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/r0VULHcfJ2njqOI0GuQHe4TNF5e.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eVbDEVjNIj2fRBiWObMTcuI5bI3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//r0VULHcfJ2njqOI0GuQHe4TNF5e.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9470,"title":"Kung Fu Hustle","description":"It''s the 1940s, and the notorious Axe Gang terrorizes Shanghai. Small-time criminals Sing and Bone hope to join, but they only manage to make lots of very dangerous enemies. Fortunately for them, kung fu masters and hidden strength can be found in unlikely places. Now they just have to take on the entire Axe Gang.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Action","Comedy","Crime","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2004-02-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9XhZhoSnFJ3AjpfzdIiZVHLQIS4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/exbyTbrvRUDKN2mcNEuVor4VFQW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9XhZhoSnFJ3AjpfzdIiZVHLQIS4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//exbyTbrvRUDKN2mcNEuVor4VFQW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1613798,"title":"Vengeance","description":"The brutal murder of the wife of “Toro,” a military hero in the special forces, turns him into a man with a single purpose: revenge. After a stroke of fate makes him a millionaire, Carlos transforms his fortune into an arsenal and, together with his closest soldiers, sets out to hunt down those responsible.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2026-02-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xyW8rJO3rwG2EGcTO6eaUEa8b9d.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ygWXPL0RS91JyJPNOfK34eV3bRE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xyW8rJO3rwG2EGcTO6eaUEa8b9d.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ygWXPL0RS91JyJPNOfK34eV3bRE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":36210,"title":"Not One Less","description":"Set in the People''s Republic of China during the 1990s, the film centers on a 13-year-old substitute teacher, Wei Minzhi, in the Chinese countryside. Called in to substitute for a village teacher for one month, Wei is told not to lose any students.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1999-10-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3YtzK8eWLjJ23xxXqkqxtaSnKYE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eERKaWCIRh3a8rPjUu1z34OYZD8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3YtzK8eWLjJ23xxXqkqxtaSnKYE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eERKaWCIRh3a8rPjUu1z34OYZD8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5062,"title":"The Inquisitor","description":"Martinaud, an illustrious notary suspected of being the perpetrator of two horrendous crimes, voluntarily agrees to be questioned by Inspector Gallien on New Year''s Eve. What initially is a routine procedure, soon becomes a harsh interrogation that seems to confirm the initial suspicions.","duration":"1:24:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1981-09-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fTWPF5adhbRaflQLEygH4IU15Wv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lKB8bOpJhTTxfiK5OWjilZeZ0Kc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fTWPF5adhbRaflQLEygH4IU15Wv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lKB8bOpJhTTxfiK5OWjilZeZ0Kc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13377,"title":"How the Grinch Stole Christmas!","description":"Bitter and hateful, the Grinch is irritated at the thought of a nearby village having a happy time celebrating Christmas. Disguised as Santa Claus, with his dog made to look like a reindeer, he decides to raid the village to steal all the Christmas things.","duration":"0:25:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Comedy"],"release_date":"1966-12-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1Q5b34cge5nClCpamxf3HkU18W1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7ir0iRuPK9OEuH569cp0nF5CJce.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1Q5b34cge5nClCpamxf3HkU18W1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7ir0iRuPK9OEuH569cp0nF5CJce.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":870,"title":"Dolls","description":"Dolls takes puppeteering as its overriding motif, which relates thematically to the action provided by the live characters. Chief among those tales is the story of Matsumoto and Sawako, a young couple whose relationship is about to be broken apart by the former''s parents, who have insisted their son take part in an arranged marriage to his boss'' daughter.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2002-10-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cxULojvpOWYX8AUG5eJpTYS8IbX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vQ9XBpH88jvO3hpHt9Zm5IHe5NP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cxULojvpOWYX8AUG5eJpTYS8IbX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vQ9XBpH88jvO3hpHt9Zm5IHe5NP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":722778,"title":"The Hand of God","description":"In 1980s Naples, an awkward teen struggling to find his place experiences heartbreak and liberation after he''s inadvertently saved from a freak accident by football legend Diego Maradona.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2021-11-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dTvGUMFc5WCziTzXZKZ2EfW2bEM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kreVxr5moB7K52IGGV1BGAn6nq1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dTvGUMFc5WCziTzXZKZ2EfW2bEM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kreVxr5moB7K52IGGV1BGAn6nq1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":379779,"title":"The Present","description":"The short tells the story of a boy who rather spends his time indoors playing videogames instead of discovering whats waiting in front of the door. One day his Mum decides to get a little surprise for her son, which makes it hard for him to concentrate on his video game.","duration":"0:04:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy"],"release_date":"2014-04-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gq00KEVXn58m7vNAZaZxVCL3unc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3CdUyjIhcW3dMYCzxBzlehfgWu8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gq00KEVXn58m7vNAZaZxVCL3unc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3CdUyjIhcW3dMYCzxBzlehfgWu8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":16858,"title":"All That Jazz","description":"Joe Gideon is at the top of the heap, one of the most successful directors and choreographers in musical theater. But he can feel his world slowly collapsing around him - his obsession with work has almost destroyed his personal life, and only his bottles of pills keep him going.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1979-12-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u218sykbUQIh6EWtTdJzguU5LcG.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_