en Bianca, a new teacher at the local high school, enters his life, Michele finds himself falling in love. At the same time, a string of murders rocks the neighborhood, casting suspicion on him.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Mystery"],"release_date":"1984-02-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rQY1Rkjxa7EJXYrv2jbUjLcCC4l.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lnXZLkJ3MFgAFAiyVJGfTUykNkU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rQY1Rkjxa7EJXYrv2jbUjLcCC4l.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lnXZLkJ3MFgAFAiyVJGfTUykNkU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1368,"title":"First Blood","description":"When former Green Beret John Rambo is harassed by local law enforcement and arrested for vagrancy, he is forced to flee into the mountains and wage an escalating one-man war against his pursuers.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"1982-10-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hCxxOJojCUFyuahDx167glJgp7E.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a9sa6ERZCpplbPEO7OMWE763CLD.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hCxxOJojCUFyuahDx167glJgp7E.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//a9sa6ERZCpplbPEO7OMWE763CLD.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":399566,"title":"Godzilla vs. Kong","description":"In a time when monsters walk the Earth, humanity’s fight for its future sets Godzilla and Kong on a collision course that will see the two most powerful forces of nature on the planet collide in a spectacular battle for the ages.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Action","Science Fiction","Adventure"],"release_date":"2021-03-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wWqTMWkEw6HouLd1zPZbZWxtAPr.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pgqgaUx1cJb5oZQQ5v0tNARCeBp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wWqTMWkEw6H