nd MercyMe.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Music","Drama"],"release_date":"2018-02-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AjtQdUX41skfo8tthtrnJZI9bXV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/veZszwMZu8d3WMU6TJX9sV5w1Y4.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AjtQdUX41skfo8tthtrnJZI9bXV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//veZszwMZu8d3WMU6TJX9sV5w1Y4.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":111083,"title":"The Body","description":"A woman’s body disappears mysteriously from the morgue without a trace. Police inspector Jaime Peña investigates the strange occurrence with the help of Álex Ulloa, the widower of the missing woman.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Thriller","Mystery"],"release_date":"2012-12-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/z3gZRm7ZnWVyKpZHJ4vho7wRZW3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/du9zczcShf4WIuljDR0Aib7AYtX.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//z3gZRm7ZnWVyKpZHJ4vho7wRZW3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//du9zczcShf4WIuljDR0Aib7AYtX.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11782,"title":"Hard Boiled","description":"A cop who loses his partner in a shoot-out with gun smugglers goes on a mission to catch them. In order to get closer to the leaders of the ring he joins forces with an undercover cop who''s working as a gangster hitman. They use all means of excessive force to find them.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"1992-04-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bL3rgYFs0NTAoLBMpCBIJ7aX6hp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oMqr4CGGqVlfI8DdrSelK1e9aFM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bL3rgYFs0NTAoLBMpCBIJ7aX6hp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oMqr4CGGqVlfI8DdrSelK1e9aFM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":7500,"title":"Sonatine","description":"Murakawa, an aging Tokyo yakuza tiring of gangster life, is sent by his boss to Okinawa along with a few of his henchmen to help end a gang war, supposedly as mediators between two warring clans. He finds that the dispute between the clans is insignificant and whilst wondering why he was sent to Okinawa at all, his group is attacked in an ambush. The survivors flee and make a decision to lay low at the beach while they await further instructions.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"1993-09-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wVQbMLpczyxlPKJWo6Qk3A1v2rB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mX9E4fEuG17L2e7bZmhBc0XdRbw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wVQbMLpczyxlPKJWo6Qk3A1v2rB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mX9E4fEuG17L2e7bZmhBc0XdRbw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4553,"title":"The Machinist","description":"Trevor, an insomniac lathe operator, experiences unusual occurrences at work and home. A strange man follows him everywhere, but no one else seems to notice him.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"2004-09-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hi3lxLd93iKwCmVAfhMV9m1k2jr.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/diAYqR4xdF9Hnj7qun6DEQhRrT2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hi3lxLd93iKwCmVAfhMV9m1k2jr.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//diAYqR4xdF9Hnj7qun6DEQhRrT2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":824,"title":"Moulin Rouge!","description":"A celebration of love and creative inspiration takes place in the infamous, gaudy and glamorous Parisian nightclub, at the cusp of the 20th century. A young poet, who is plunged into the heady world of Moulin Rouge, begins a passionate affair with the club''s most notorious and beautiful star.","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Music"],"release_date":"2001-05-18","backdrop_