urg. Ice-covered rivers and canals of the capital seethe with festive activities. On the eve of the new century those who should not be destined to meet, come together. They are people from different worlds: Matvey, the son of a lamplighter, whose only treasure is his silver-plated skates; Alice is the daughter of a high-ranking official dreaming of science. Each of them has his own difficult life-story, but having accidentally met they rush forward together in pursuit of their dreams.","duration":"2:16:00","genre":["Adventure","Drama","Romance","History","Crime","Family"],"release_date":"2020-12-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/n96Mu6w9yGO3MM9yuBrYlVvc6gb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gZSlt41YjSTQE7ah03usHsvmWFs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//n96Mu6w9yGO3MM9yuBrYlVvc6gb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gZSlt41YjSTQE7ah03usHsvmWFs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":500664,"title":"Upgrade","description":"A brutal mugging leaves Grey Trace paralyzed in the hospital and his beloved wife dead. A billionaire inventor soon offers Trace a cure — an artificial intelligence implant called STEM that will enhance his body. Now able to walk, Grey finds that he also has superhuman strength and agility — skills he uses to seek revenge against the thugs who destroyed his life.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2018-05-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oiPUcD1IIZrYGTSIpvTmd3dRmPo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/woLGROUdPWdBnLVFKYdGD3kFkPY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oiPUcD1IIZrYGTSIpvTmd3dRmPo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//woLGROUdPWdBnLVFKYdGD3kFkPY.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":37769,"title":"The Second Tragic Fantozzi","description":"The frustrating adventures of a humble employee who all the time has to fullfill the wishes and desires of his bosses.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1976-04-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/b5YMMlMP9Yb5opqmTsmSDqlV4JH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3qzZwMfwbcwsVYSLWzRJSGQqpfh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//b5YMMlMP9Yb5opqmTsmSDqlV4JH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3qzZwMfwbcwsVYSLWzRJSGQqpfh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":18900,"title":"In Cold Blood","description":"After a botched robbery results in the brutal murder of a rural family, two drifters elude police, in the end coming to terms with their own mortality and the repercussions of their vile atrocity.","duration":"2:14:00","genre":["Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"1967-12-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gQYsE1Zu89fbi3yUL4bubxoRjbh.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sPEvsif5Y70mfVvtU39iOyrVJdF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gQYsE1Zu89fbi3yUL4bubxoRjbh.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sPEvsif5Y70mfVvtU39iOyrVJdF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4960,"title":"Synecdoche, New York","description":"A theater director struggles with his work, and the women in his life, as he attempts to create a life-size replica of New York inside a warehouse as part of his new play.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2008-10-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/insPcjOIWFf6Uc9DR0ORgXATqSM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5UwdhrjXhUgsiDhe1dpS9z4yj7q.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//insPcjOIWFf6Uc9DR0ORgXATqSM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5UwdhrjXhUgsiDhe1dpS9z4yj7q.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":54898,"title":"The Green Ray","description":"A lonely Parisian woman comes to terms with her isolation and anxieties during a long summer vacation.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1986-08-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jfDTQuovn57QIBvoGDom6FNQrkl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1E3pliSC7lXWw6zJhMvG6ba0UNX.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jfDTQuovn57QIBvoGDom6FNQrkl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1E3pliSC7lXWw6zJhMvG6ba0UNX.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9516,"title":"Menace II Society","description":"A young street hustler attempts to escape the rigors and temptations of the ghetto in a quest for a better life.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Drama","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"1993-05-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/s5PP0ryxAo12jzvPntSEybahpCw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/guvPiEOeXwROpfCb2LkHkVEvOck.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//s5PP0ryxAo12jzvPntSEybahpCw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//guvPiEOeXwROpfCb2LkHkVEvOck.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1292415,"title":"Beast","description":"MMA legend Patton James, now a commercial fisherman, is pulled back into the cage when his brother is in danger. Reuniting with his old coach Sammy, he commits to one final fight in one championship against the brutal champion Xavier Grau.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Action","Drama"],"release_date":"2026-04-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vmdt6nUXYX4mM0Ahcvh4bgHOjUt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7NrvUI3vnW8H3rD7ExKcTL7KRcQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vmdt6nUXYX4mM0Ahcvh4bgHOjUt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7NrvUI3vnW8H3rD7ExKcTL7KRcQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":556901,"title":"Teen Titans Go! vs. Teen Titans","description":"The comedic modern-day quintet takes on their 2003 counterparts when villains from each of their worlds join forces