image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mvTXhTddHIZbOU9pmrcPODI1kRx.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1265609,"title":"War Machine","description":"On one last grueling mission during Army Ranger training, a combat engineer must lead his unit in a fight against a giant otherworldly killing machine.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Action","Science Fiction","Thriller"],"release_date":"2026-02-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6yeVcxFR0j08vlv2OlL6zbewm4D.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rFhKkXhk7ClU03jQ5rHIApJDwev.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6yeVcxFR0j08vlv2OlL6zbewm4D.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rFhKkXhk7ClU03jQ5rHIApJDwev.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":484468,"title":"The Wolf''s Call","description":"Shown from the perspective of a young submariner with unusually sensitive hearing and uncannily precise sound recognition. The fate of many often depends on his ability, and one time, whilst highly stressed, he makes a incorrect call which put his entire crew in mortal danger.  Trying to regain the confidence of his comrades, he conducts an unauthorised investigation of an apparent plot which, it turns out, risks escalating into a nuclear apocalypse. Suddenly working under pressure with the fleet admiral, they must do whatever is necessary, even the unthinkable, to prevent a nuclear war, since a confirmed nuclear strike order cannot be countermanded.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Thriller","Action","Adventure"],"release_date":"2019-02-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ujd2rMIVb0Z8orWrEbMWdJsBRYd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8bxIzp9w9l9ZzGVwNaIKOaem05A.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ujd2rMIVb0Z8orWrEbMWdJsBRYd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8bxIzp9w9l9ZzGVwNaIKOaem05A.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":44892,"title":"The Music Box","description":"The Laurel & Hardy Moving Co. have a challenging job on their hands (and backs): hauling a player piano up a monumental flight of stairs to Prof. von Schwarzenhoffen''s house. Their task is complicated by a sassy nursemaid and, unbeknownst to them, the impatient Prof. von Schwarzenhoffen himself. But the biggest problem is the force of gravity, which repeatedly pulls the piano back down to the bottom of the stairs.","duration":"0:29:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1932-04-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/d59HQSKIle5PzIdAiHFY6m3yIk1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zwU0Y7VS3d326v1pYY7kif1y7xQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//d59HQSKIle5PzIdAiHFY6m3yIk1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zwU0Y7VS3d326v1pYY7kif1y7xQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":21712,"title":"Mind Game","description":"Nishi is a loser who has a crush on his childhood girlfriend. After an encounter with the Japanese mafia, he journeys to heaven and back, and ends up trapped in an even more unlikely place.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Animation","Romance","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2004-08-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/19SRSM2ybfVpCBxBFLXwyD18WkM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e5mV1iVcjg7nkpJrskQOnFCR4H9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//19SRSM2ybfVpCBxBFLXwyD18WkM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e5mV1iVcjg7nkpJrskQOnFCR4H9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4291,"title":"Kikujiro","description":"Brash, loudmouthed and opportunistic, Kikujiro is the unlikely companion for Masao who is determined to see the mother he has never met. The two begin a series of adventures which soon turns out to be a whimsical journey of laughter and tears with a wide array of surprises and unique characters along the way.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1999-06-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/maxp4hu52uhfNuJmumD5NpZyrRo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zTelT1xAO4Owxk1jHJM4puoei5N.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//maxp4hu52uhfNuJmumD5NpZyrRo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zTelT1xAO4Owxk1jHJM4puoei5N.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":483983,"title":"Balloon","description":"Two families attempt a daredevil plan to escape the GDR with a homemade hot air balloon, but it crashes just before the border. The Stasi finds traces of this attempt to escape and immediately starts investigations, while the two families are forced to build a new escape balloon. With each passing day the Stasi is closer on their heels – a nerve-wracking race against time begins.","duration":"2:05:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama","History"],"release_date":"2018-09-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sKK1fb08uCcTc0w6PlVsx3BXJdg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nRs8A0zp0jU211j8Zay3ApIzlpx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sKK1fb08uCcTc0w6PlVsx3BXJdg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nRs8A0zp0jU211j8Zay3ApIzlpx.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":206324,"title":"Bhaag Milkha Bhaag","description":"The true story of the \"Flying Sikh\" world champion runner and Olympian Milkha Singh who overcame the massacre of his family, civil war during the India-Pakistan partition, and homelessness to become one of India''s most iconic athletes.","duration":"3:06:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2013-07-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eryhpwnyvEWnsDapQ9jwbam8itA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bXywc0CEzS1fIshPWWi4V8A58U3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eryhpwnyvEWnsDapQ9jwbam8itA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bXywc0CEzS1fIshPWWi4V8A58U3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":83389,"