ith a local man, while the boy, left to himself, has a series of enigmatic encounters that heighten the growing air of isolation.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1963-09-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mNpd8763X64KKGXnrdnBHdON9np.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2KkHAsBVZVoMO1Zauvm5rFSxp09.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mNpd8763X64KKGXnrdnBHdON9np.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2KkHAsBVZVoMO1Zauvm5rFSxp09.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1291335,"title":"Solo Mio","description":"After Matt''s dreams of a picturesque Italian wedding are shattered when his fiancée leaves him at the altar, he embarks on his planned honeymoon across Italy alone, immersing himself in the country''s vibrant culture, food, and beauty, meeting Gia along the way.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"2026-02-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eVXBp5BBskAj0RJ6pDSNPcBs1uI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/efSsZJaddeq0LOABZqpCXdMxv9P.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eVXBp5BBskAj0RJ6pDSNPcBs1uI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//efSsZJaddeq0LOABZqpCXdMxv9P.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":915935,"title":"Anatomy of a Fall","description":"A woman is suspected of her husband''s murder, and their blind son faces a moral dilemma as the sole witness.","duration":"2:31:00","genre":["Thriller","Mystery","Crime"],"release_date":"2023-08-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lDVl2jf6VB8ODl1olZ6FLvOV1gX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1ho0d4LNZw3Y0voeKmSvPSgJOJ2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lDVl2jf6VB8ODl1olZ6FLvOV1gX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1ho0d4LNZw3Y0voeKmSvPSgJOJ2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":409122,"title":"Scooby-Doo! and WWE: Curse of the Speed Demon","description":"When Scooby and Mystery Inc. visit an off-road racing competition, it''s not long before strange events start to occur. A mysterious phantom racer, known only as Inferno, is causing chaos and is determined to sabotage the race. It''s up to Scooby-Doo, Shaggy and their new driving partner, The Undertaker, to save the race and solve the mystery.","duration":"1:20:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Comedy","Mystery"],"release_date":"2016-07-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jXlyxmwM39pNUupSMrZiXXy70ah.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wRrvPis7C8YfbOBuuyUoZel7MC4.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jXlyxmwM39pNUupSMrZiXXy70ah.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wRrvPis7C8YfbOBuuyUoZel7MC4.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":261470,"title":"Sorry If I Call You Love","description":"A successful, attractive, intelligent and brilliant advertising executive is longing to finally find emotional stability in his life, and decides to propose to his girlfriend. After she refuses his proposal, his life takes a turn when a new young lady enters his life.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2014-06-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pq9opXVeTveQLchlHK1jcqyO9e8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ekvI7HVl0RcA4iaZOqNa8vqFwAN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pq9opXVeTveQLchlHK1jcqyO9e8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ekvI7HVl0RcA4iaZOqNa8vqFwAN.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9559,"title":"A Perfect World","description":"A kidnapped boy strikes up a friendship with his captor: an escaped convict on the run from the law, headed by an honorable U.S. Marshal.","duration":"2:18:00","genre":["Drama","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"1993-11-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xTZvY5