imum security prison located on a rocky island. Although no one has ever managed to escape from there, Frank and other inmates begin to carefully prepare an escape plan.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1979-06-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lfLVH3F8Xt8nITqG9cn97b54au1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uORr2GXQnyqgBOg6tVsRCJD2qxc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lfLVH3F8Xt8nITqG9cn97b54au1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uORr2GXQnyqgBOg6tVsRCJD2qxc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":79,"title":"Hero","description":"During China''s Warring States period, a district prefect arrives at the palace of Qin Shi Huang, claiming to have killed the three assassins who had made an attempt on the king''s life three years ago.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Drama","Adventure","Action","History"],"release_date":"2002-12-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jDz6RYN3nKYtlo7J9IMvGoJit7B.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vxgZto2Cz7ILHAlmRXt50I2brB2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jDz6RYN3nKYtlo7J9IMvGoJit7B.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vxgZto2Cz7ILHAlmRXt50I2brB2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":682507,"title":"Where the Crawdads Sing","description":"Abandoned by her family, Kya raises herself all alone in the marshes outside of her small town. When her former boyfriend is found dead, Kya is instantly branded by the local townspeople and law enforcement as the prime suspect for his murder.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Drama","Mystery","Romance"],"release_date":"2022-07-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fsHxHpREPdE299Bl7RvKb1HKk9U.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/n1el846gLDXfhOvrRCsyvaAOQWv.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fsHxHpREPdE299Bl7RvKb1HKk9