e at a conference to find that several monks have been murdered under mysterious circumstances. To solve the crimes, William must rise up against the Church''s authority and fight the shadowy conspiracy of monastery monks using only his intelligence; which is considerable.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Mystery"],"release_date":"1986-09-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/v4d6PPfqHeUNSdcyBVQ2Xb8yBk0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2BuVu0j6v2kNY2gGxtO3sDGyob2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//v4d6PPfqHeUNSdcyBVQ2Xb8yBk0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2BuVu0j6v2kNY2gGxtO3sDGyob2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":69,"title":"Walk the Line","description":"A chronicle of country music legend Johnny Cash''s life, from his early days on an Arkansas cotton farm to his rise to fame with Sun Records in Memphis, where he recorded alongside Elvis Presley, Jerry Lee Lewis and Carl Perkins.","duration":"2:16:00","genre":["Drama","Music","Romance"],"release_date":"2005-09-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pMBKzEotLUzk3NuQiyVjZEDlH70.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zMkD6FVikyPNnigoupO7vD5ti9p.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pMBKzEotLUzk3NuQiyVjZEDlH70.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zMkD6FVikyPNnigoupO7vD5ti9p.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1278263,"title":"The Seed of the Sacred Fig","description":"Investigating judge Iman grapples with paranoia amid political unrest in Tehran. When his gun vanishes, he suspects his wife and daughters, imposing draconian measures that strain family ties as societal rules crumble.","duration":"2:47:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2024-09-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zqZzYVE4DWv92xrYSCEELPcLnUP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/