/w342//whNjsTOUVg2lZLCKgGhnACnmV8E.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//21sC2assImQIYCEDA84Qh9d1RsK.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":132344,"title":"Before Midnight","description":"It has been nine years since we last met Jesse and Celine, the French-American couple who once met on a train in Vienna. They now live in Paris with twin daughters but have spent a summer in Greece at the invitation of an author colleague of Jesse''s. When the vacation is over and Jesse must send his teenage son off to the States, he begins to question his life decisions, and his relationship with Celine is at risk.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2013-04-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aPSGg0ZGirS0sSxGlwTGTAo0ruV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qbGKJmNUroDz75kh5Oafoall89e.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aPSGg0ZGirS0sSxGlwTGTAo0ruV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qbGKJmNUroDz75kh5Oafoall89e.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":31216,"title":"I Can''t Think Straight","description":"Tala, a London-based Palestinian, is preparing for her elaborate Middle Eastern wedding when she meets Leyla, a young British Indian woman who is dating her best friend. Spirited Christian Tala and shy Muslim Leyla could not be more different from each other, but the attraction is immediate and goes deeper than friendship. But Tala is not ready to accept the implications of the choice her heart has made for her and escapes back to Jordan, while Leyla tries to move on with her new-found life, to the shock of her tradition-loving parents. As Tala''s wedding day approaches, simmering tensions come to boiling point and the pressure mounts for Tala to be true to herself.","duration":"1:22:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2008-06-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/crUMmliCpduKqMKsAcT3tPx6e3H.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ePbH29RdMlz8mDEQyUkxRVcsB73.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//crUMmliCpduKqMKsAcT3tPx6e3H.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ePbH29RdMlz8mDEQyUkxRVcsB73.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":614409,"title":"To All the Boys: Always and Forever","description":"Senior year of high school takes center stage as Lara Jean returns from a family trip to Korea and considers her college plans — with and without Peter.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2021-02-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qjhcTGnjxYJqwBGlDzZkYWmne6e.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iepqdM52f4w75fNcvgRF5QoIAjm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qjhcTGnjxYJqwBGlDzZkYWmne6e.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iepqdM52f4w75fNcvgRF5QoIAjm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":564147,"title":"K.G.F: Chapter 1","description":"A period drama set in the 1970s, KGF follows the story of a fierce rebel who rises against the brutal oppression in Kolar Gold Fields and becomes the symbol of hope to legions of downtrodden people.","duration":"2:36:00","genre":["Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2018-12-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4i1ofsSpfTuswHXcgPtXbZrSnoe.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ltHlJwvxKv7d0ooCiKSAvfwV9tX.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4i1ofsSpfTuswHXcgPtXbZrSnoe.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ltHlJwvxKv7d0ooCiKSAvfwV9tX.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":42113,"title":"The Ballad of Narayama","description":"In a small village in a valley everyone who reaches the age of 70 must leave the village and go to a certain mountain top to die. If anyone should refuse they would disgrace their family. Old Orin is 69. This winter it is her turn to go to the mountain. But first she must make sure that her eldest son Ta