ppelle: Equanimity","description":"Comedy legend Dave Chappelle returns to his roots with an all-new stand-up special filmed at the Warner Theatre in Washington, D.C.","duration":"1:04:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2017-12-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wiRJsxQd5pFUmjw77IR9n0Lv0IX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4EaNffvPj5uTxRbFcmiTkor1lZW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wiRJsxQd5pFUmjw77IR9n0Lv0IX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4EaNffvPj5uTxRbFcmiTkor1lZW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":21734,"title":"Shadow of a Doubt","description":"In sleepy Santa Rosa, restless young Charlie’s world brightens when her sophisticated Uncle Charlie arrives for a long visit. But as his behavior grows increasingly strange, she begins to suspect that her beloved uncle may be hiding a terrible secret—and that danger has quietly entered her home.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Thriller","Mystery","Crime"],"release_date":"1943-01-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1p78xI6mywlqhb3tfw6oTJt7X3t.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ptyWagbWE8jSGyV2tGEzAdVbRCj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1p78xI6mywlqhb3tfw6oTJt7X3t.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ptyWagbWE8jSGyV2tGEzAdVbRCj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":19460,"title":"Son of the Bride","description":"At age 42, Rafael Belvedere is having a crisis. He lives in the shadow of his father, he feels guilty about rarely visiting his aging mother, his ex-wife says he doesn''t spend enough time with their daughter and he has yet to make a commitment to his girlfriend. At his lowest point, a minor heart attack reunites him with Juan Carlos, a childhood friend, who helps Rafael to reconstruct his past.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2001-08-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org