entor, Dr. Pretorius, who insists the now-chastened doctor resume his experiments in creating new life. Meanwhile, the Monster remains on the run from those who wish to destroy him.","duration":"1:15:00","genre":["Horror","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1935-04-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hrED8MSOn4xJP9Cpk7WomUcFKGI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5241zUwe7rC17MNc2QpCBKKdp1N.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hrED8MSOn4xJP9Cpk7WomUcFKGI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5241zUwe7rC17MNc2QpCBKKdp1N.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":499537,"title":"The Wolf House","description":"After escaping from a religious colony in Chile, Maria seeks shelter in a mansion where she’s taken in by two pigs, its only inhabitants. Like in a stop-motion dream, the universe of the house reacts to her feelings. The animals slowly morph into humans and the house into a dark, menacing world.","duration":"1:14:00","genre":["Animation","Horror","Drama"],"release_date":"2018-11-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u4CVC9VVpbfxxFqf8fcaPVegUmZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kvgch2e25cd6dWhRJ6G8BCJ1Wcq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u4CVC9VVpbfxxFqf8fcaPVegUmZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kvgch2e25cd6dWhRJ6G8BCJ1Wcq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":364137,"title":"All Three of Us","description":"An Iranian family survives the shah and the ayatollah and moves to France. This story follows the family through it all. Despite the politics, revolution, prison, beatings, assassinations and suicides this is a comedy.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2015-11-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9ADmkRHERE3zsy6hrfFfOIRNHJ3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aPYtRdJwt85OgZIUBZ5tHgmfyCO.jpg","small_b