.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hRwpFexKGTrxYpVmDd8Z0lrGHkp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gGE0keq8oCx4jbRamyMcdHpyEPW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hRwpFexKGTrxYpVmDd8Z0lrGHkp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gGE0keq8oCx4jbRamyMcdHpyEPW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":34106,"title":"You Can''t Take It with You","description":"Alice, the only relatively normal member of the eccentric Sycamore family, falls in love with Tony Kirby, but his wealthy banker father and snobbish mother strongly disapprove of the match. When the Kirbys are invited to dinner to become better acquainted with their future in-laws, things don''t turn out the way Alice had hoped.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"1938-09-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/As4GJO5V3SxbSDW8ZEWPnYtSZIg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9JltqbDyWstYW6gnvqDO6L5bOrx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//As4GJO5V3SxbSDW8ZEWPnYtSZIg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9JltqbDyWstYW6gnvqDO6L5bOrx.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14615,"title":"Fury","description":"Joe, who owns a gas station along with his brothers and is about to marry Katherine, travels to the small town where she lives to visit her, but is wrongly mistaken for a wanted kidnapper and arrested.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1936-06-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nRBw8JYA3Li1d40kJN4AFMi5TT3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u1kjLTUqmqjDMlRxcwCqWagjf6r.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nRBw8JYA3Li1d40kJN4AFMi5TT3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u1kjLTUqmqjDMlRxcwCqWagjf6r.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":654739,"title":"Hard Hit","description":"On his way to work, a bank manager receives an anonymous call