/w600_and_h900_face/l8ubUlfzlB5R2j9cJ3CN7tj0gmd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bAQ8O5Uw6FedtlCbJTutenzPVKd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//l8ubUlfzlB5R2j9cJ3CN7tj0gmd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bAQ8O5Uw6FedtlCbJTutenzPVKd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":276624,"title":"I Am a Hero","description":"A man witnesses a fatal traffic accident on his way home from work, and the victim is clearly killed on impact. A moment later, when the corpse stands up and walks away, it could be a hallucination or something far more extraordinary.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Action","Horror","Drama"],"release_date":"2016-04-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jBeCis93wE55vsvHxkLY3jbeO7A.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4RnmHtCLtbBHD9jagVlcSzJTWX6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jBeCis93wE55vsvHxkLY3jbeO7A.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4RnmHtCLtbBHD9jagVlcSzJTWX6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":239571,"title":"The Best of Me","description":"A pair of former high school sweethearts reunite after many years when they return to visit their small hometown.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2014-10-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dz4axZNgbtxvhIKBJBbHIM1bBCB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gSr79jDrR073FmLjIrZWar1lFD2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dz4axZNgbtxvhIKBJBbHIM1bBCB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gSr79jDrR073FmLjIrZWar1lFD2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":63311,"title":"The Skin I Live In","description":"A brilliant plastic surgeon creates a synthetic skin that withstands any kind of damage. His guinea pig: a mysterious and volatile woman who holds the key to his obsession.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Drama","Horror","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_dat