h":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2b7oexm173SF1FSEq0DdgxZZNRH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":38396,"title":"That''s Life","description":"While on the run from the police, an unlikely companionship blossoms between a funny con man who just broke out of jail, the bumbling cop whose car he seized at gunpoint, and a nitpicking civilian he unwittingly took hostage.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1998-12-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/WH9AZVrIXX3FiDyLb5S4Gv6YES.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zcZxzcl79S3gaWWDGGHcFkjT9m2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//WH9AZVrIXX3FiDyLb5S4Gv6YES.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zcZxzcl79S3gaWWDGGHcFkjT9m2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":32761,"title":"The Seventh Continent","description":"Chronicles three years of a middle-class family seemingly caught up in their daily routines, troubled only by minor incidents. Behind their apparent calm and repetitive existence, however, they''re planning something much more sinister.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1989-10-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aI4PZbPUeuOc91OCi7TmjFza5Rk.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hPwtcwwmOnW7Mqr1s170LHxa74A.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aI4PZbPUeuOc91OCi7TmjFza5Rk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hPwtcwwmOnW7Mqr1s170LHxa74A.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":28569,"title":"Splendor in the Grass","description":"A fragile Kansas girl''s unrequited and forbidden love for a handsome young man from the town''s most powerful family drives her to heartbreak and madness.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1961-10-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3I5Dsam910xWbTEk69o04i8lVkC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/n6Kw8Ui93SMhrk1MupCFwUg