 develop a mind of its own. When it emerges that a vengeful figure from the past might be masterminding things, it falls to Gromit to battle sinister forces and save his master… or Wallace may never be able to invent again!","duration":"1:19:00","genre":["Animation","Adventure","Comedy","Science Fiction","Family"],"release_date":"2024-12-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kO8auxMzNXrs4YqHdD08lefXIUV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jUWFSBxTOiCinPdTOh3IDUXVemZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kO8auxMzNXrs4YqHdD08lefXIUV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jUWFSBxTOiCinPdTOh3IDUXVemZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":401698,"title":"Hidden Kisses","description":"Nathan, 16, lives alone with his father Stephane. A newcomer in high school, he is invited to a party and falls in love with Louis, a boy in his class. They find themselves out of sight and kiss each other, but someone takes a picture of them. Soon, the photo is published on Facebook and a storm overtakes their lives as they face bullying and rejection.","duration":"1:27:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2016-02-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3dzpw2dpLbB3goixNYJIB8jdaE1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1VixWTXYRLLBgmPuph80Qzcuffb.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3dzpw2dpLbB3goixNYJIB8jdaE1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1VixWTXYRLLBgmPuph80Qzcuffb.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":301528,"title":"Toy Story 4","description":"Woody has always been confident about his place in the world, devoted to taking care of his kid—whether that''s Andy or Bonnie. But after Bonnie creates a reluctant new toy called \"Forky\", a road trip adventure alongside old and new friends challenges everything Woody believes about loyalty, purpose, and what it truly means to be a toy.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Family","Comedy","Animation","Adventure"],"release_date":"2019-06-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/q62bpQ67qaXY0u6b2wFEnQYIbPd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/w9kR8qbmQ01HwnvK4alvnQ2ca0L.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//q62bpQ67qaXY0u6b2wFEnQYIbPd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//w9kR8qbmQ01HwnvK4alvnQ2ca0L.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4689,"title":"Sympathy for Mr. Vengeance","description":"A deaf man and his girlfriend resort to desperate measures in order to fund a kidney transplant for his sister. Things go horribly wrong, and the situation spirals rapidly into a cycle of violence and revenge.","duration":"2:09:00","genre":["Action","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2002-03-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/b6elu2cz2Be9PqgX0MzggMCH4fk.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uj42ubGbgVL65T10SvPVr0p9mJc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//b6elu2cz2Be9PqgX0MzggMCH4fk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uj42ubGbgVL65T10SvPVr0p9mJc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":187,"title":"Sin City","description":"Welcome to Sin City. This town beckons to the tough, the corrupt, the brokenhearted. Some call it dark… Hard-boiled. Then there are those who call it home — Crooked cops, sexy dames, desperate vigilantes. Some are seeking revenge, others lust after redemption, and then there are those hoping for a little of both. A universe of unlikely and reluctant heroes still trying to do the right thing in a city that refuses to care.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2005-04-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/t9kQnqiaxQ8TLB25rTzDKLd0fdM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/i66G50wATMmPrvpP95f0XP6ZdVS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//t9kQnqiaxQ8TLB25rTzDKL