 saga of heroism. Drifting more than 200,000 miles from Earth, the astronauts work furiously with the ground crew to avert tragedy.","duration":"2:20:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"1995-06-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/n0FDJI9c0uWiZwm8wgXVjaMBn96.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tVeKscCm2fY1xDXZk8PgnZ87h9S.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//n0FDJI9c0uWiZwm8wgXVjaMBn96.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tVeKscCm2fY1xDXZk8PgnZ87h9S.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1462322,"title":"The Last One for the Road","description":"A couple of jovial life-long drunkards run into a shy architecture undergrad, whose way of seeing things will be transformed as the trio wanders from pub to pub in search of a buried treasure.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2025-09-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/105dMBJGgkM0SzgjV62KzlMDdG8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/b0oS5FReEJ3rhGzGKY16Qz0Q7w1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//105dMBJGgkM0SzgjV62KzlMDdG8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//b0oS5FReEJ3rhGzGKY16Qz0Q7w1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":916405,"title":"The Quiet Girl","description":"A quiet, neglected girl is sent away from her dysfunctional family to live with relatives for the summer. She blossoms in their care, but in this house where there are meant to be no secrets, she discovers one.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2022-05-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/23jok5sYloPEBwKd6Bp4V8Y1O9I.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6Njyz53N417cgxE0d7cBEWHUEjc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//23jok5sYloPEBwKd6Bp4V8Y1O9I.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6Njyz53N417cgxE0d7cBEWHUEjc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":503919,"title":"The Lighthouse","description":"Two lighthouse keepers try to maintain their sanity while living on a remote and mysterious New England island in the 1890s.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Drama","Fantasy","Thriller"],"release_date":"2019-10-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sYLzRuEcwSz0L1Z92wQNrETHU9O.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dwXmOYJVM1VIkkSXHY5zYSaLJLC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sYLzRuEcwSz0L1Z92wQNrETHU9O.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dwXmOYJVM1VIkkSXHY5zYSaLJLC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9454,"title":"EverAfter","description":"Danielle, a vibrant young woman, was forced into servitude after the death of her father when she was a young girl. Danielle''s stepmother, Rodmilla, is a heartless woman who forces Danielle to do the cooking and cleaning, while she tries to marry off the eldest of her two daughters to the prince. But Danielle''s life takes a wonderful turn when, under the guise of a visiting royal, she meets the charming Prince Henry.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"1998-07-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lhpokM60CnLWcNETQqKMz2q9ryL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9TspO5dThMBioF0DFrvy6YqrngH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lhpokM60CnLWcNETQqKMz2q9ryL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9TspO5dThMBioF0DFrvy6YqrngH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1902,"title":"Open Your Eyes","description":"Handsome 25-year-old Cesar had it all -- a successful career, expensive cars, a swank bachelor''s pad, and an endless string of beautiful and willing women -- until he is thrown into a strange psychological mystery after a car accident scars his face and lands him in prison.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1997-12-19","backdrop_path":"https:/