fter uncovering secrets about aliens, putting him on the run from a corporation. Meanwhile, a meteorologist experiencing strange phenomena joins forces with him to prove there''s life beyond our understanding.","duration":"2:26:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Thriller"],"release_date":"2026-06-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1e0KDRYKRPHiVNj8yQKYuU2jVyQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AnJ8IQJI23hNpYXVNaythu061Ru.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1e0KDRYKRPHiVNj8yQKYuU2jVyQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AnJ8IQJI23hNpYXVNaythu061Ru.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":25934,"title":"To Sir, with Love","description":"A British Guianese engineer starts a job as a high school teacher in London’s East End, where his uninterested and delinquent pupils are in desperate need of attention and care.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1967-06-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vUZbARc0xY3MjwZnZtybpqbAoK9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xMaVwTfgETmPs5yp3lNK5SeWCtB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vUZbARc0xY3MjwZnZtybpqbAoK9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xMaVwTfgETmPs5yp3lNK5SeWCtB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":22584,"title":"To Have and Have Not","description":"A Martinique charter boat skipper gets mixed up with the underground French resistance operatives during WWII.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Adventure","Romance","War"],"release_date":"1945-01-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uYRnUnBE4kk5ocvyBckRfMAsZpJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/m6EjBAY7gA6tx5RMutXGtZWFzyI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uYRnUnBE4kk5ocvyBckRfMAsZpJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//m6EjBAY7gA6tx5RMutXGtZWFzyI.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9426,"title":"The Fly","description":"When brilliant, eccentric scientist Seth Brundle makes a huge technological breakthrough in teleportation, he decides to test it on himself. Unbeknownst to him, a common housefly manages to get inside the device and the two become one.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Horror","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1986-08-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/g1FzhbtWYKk9WMJYi1X26kf2Q4Q.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8gZWMhJHRvaXdXsNhERtqNHYpH3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//g1FzhbtWYKk9WMJYi1X26kf2Q4Q.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8gZWMhJHRvaXdXsNhERtqNHYpH3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":615173,"title":"The Witch: Part 2. The Other One","description":"A girl wakes up in a huge secret laboratory, then accidentally meets another girl who is trying to protect her house from a gang. The mystery girl overthrows the gang with her unexpected powers, and laboratory staff set out to find her.","duration":"2:17:00","genre":["Action","Mystery","Thriller","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2022-06-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iryef4LKiPQkvhNJS1EtLlay3br.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9YTuscJXmr9Iua62amCgGSU8PDW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iryef4LKiPQkvhNJS1EtLlay3br.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9YTuscJXmr9Iua62amCgGSU8PDW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":16619,"title":"Ordinary People","description":"Beth, Calvin, and their son Conrad are living in the aftermath of the death of the other son. Conrad is overcome by grief and misplaced guilt to the extent of a suicide attempt. He is in therapy. Beth had always preferred his brother and is having difficulty being supportive to Conrad. Calvin is trapped between the two trying to hold the family together.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1980-09-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/81LV5HJ9nUXGCMhrJpFNjwvbEZl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5gQLGRmBV8XoqWgkxuRFwe3jZV7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//81LV5HJ9nUXGCMhrJpFNjwvbEZl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5gQLGRmBV8XoqWgkxuRFwe3jZV7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11610,"title":"Play It Again, Sam","description":"A neurotic film critic obsessed with the movie Casablanca attempts to get over his wife leaving him by dating again with the help of a married couple and his illusory idol, Humphrey Bogart.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"1972-05-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6YaphqLSVChdWgF7csZVjM0b08Y.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yZFz5rwrdVmEoHVkVU7EkZedDfz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6YaphqLSVChdWgF7csZVjM0b08Y.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yZFz5rwrdVmEoHVkVU7EkZedDfz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5558,"title":"The Phantom of Liberty","description":"This Surrealist film, with a title referencing the Communist Manifesto, strings together short incidents based on the life of director Luis Buñuel. Presented as chance encounters, these loosely related, intersecting situations, all without a consistent protagonist, reach from the 19th century to the 1970s. Touching briefly on subjects such as execution, pedophilia, incest, and sex, the film features an array of characters, including a sick father and incompetent police officers.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1974-09-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/Ai3fiCnWzHl3bL4CZQQ1pt2uiOU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/f6cON5ebistPm6AS1XcZZMmKpIi.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//Ai3fiCnWzHl3bL4CZQQ1pt2uiOU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//f6cON5ebistPm6AS1XcZZMmKpIi.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":375785,"title":"Then Came You","description":"An American hypochondriac who is working as a baggage handler is forced to confront his fears when a British teenager with a terminal illness enlists him to help her carry out her eccentric bucket list.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2018-12-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9oI4ImMclu3l0OHaK7o9eELfL3l.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/658QP5tmBRUlE5JvxOnnmITfG1F.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9oI4ImMclu3l0OHaK7o9eELfL3l.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//658QP5tmBRUlE5JvxOnnmITfG1F.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":129670,"title":"Nebraska","description":"An aging, booze-addled father takes a trip from Montana to Nebraska with his estranged son in order to claim what he believes to be a million-dollar sweepstakes prize.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Drama","Adventure"],"release_date":"2013-09-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yePsFcldyZ6VnxaBr8ZbVEaOt4W.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/o1t2Mw18EEBnl8v4Nby3PFjxnM1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yePsFcldyZ6VnxaBr8ZbVEaOt4W.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//o1t2Mw18EEBnl8v4Nby3PFjxnM1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":43231,"title":"White Nights","description":"A middle-aged man meets a young woman who is waiting on a canal bridge for her lover''s return.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1957-11-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fWkNhudvl6dtEHWSdQD6nl92GnD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sAFR7LbXnPSjZGpG1ihSAN7vrfR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fWkNhudvl6dtEHWSdQD6nl92GnD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sAFR7LbXnPSjZGpG1ihSAN7vrfR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":38580,"title":"The Little Matchgirl","description":"An animated short based on Hans Christian Andersen''s tale about a poor young girl with a burning desire to find comfort and happiness in her life. Desperate to keep warm, the girl lights the matches she sells, and envisions a very different life for herself in the fiery flames filled with images of loving relatives, bountiful food, and a place to call home.","duration":"0:07:00","genre":["Animation","Drama","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2006-09-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dcGTfPk5NYqDmCP01ddzwl5m2V1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/GmeFUrGNdbXbWWjd78iDCmE4Ec.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dcGTfPk5NYqDmCP01ddzwl5m2V1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//GmeFUrGNdbXbWWjd78iDCmE4Ec.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":28205,"title":"The Class","description":"An average guy of an Estonian high-school decides to defend his bullied classmate. This starts a war between him and the informal leader of the class.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2007-03-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/w072p8uyKx0SYP55PBTCRrFqqOP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AogHMwGObAqXgXoqtj2Zg90fX5K.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//w072p8uyKx0SYP55PBTCRrFqqOP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AogHMwGObAqXgXoqtj2Zg90fX5K.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9075,"title":"Black Book","description":"Israel, 1956: Jewish teacher Rachel Stein rather unexpectedly meets an old friend at the kibbutz. It brings back memories of her experiences in the Netherlands during the war, memories of betrayal. In September 1944, Rachel''s hiding place is bombed by Allied troops; she makes contact with a resistance member and joins a group of Jews to be smuggled across the Biesbosch to the freed South Netherlands. Only Rachel escapes a massacre by patrol Germans, and is rescued by a resistance group under the leadership of Gerben Kuipers, whose son is captured trying to smuggle weapons. Kuipers asks Rachel to seduce SS-hauptsturmführer Ludwig Müntze, a mission that she will soon learn that the boat attack wasn''t a coincidence.","duration":"2:25:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","War"],"release_date":"2006-09-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vT39NcxIWHL5XVNQGRMbS8NxXs0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vZaYDWa3IqTNKsHCsUr72J4zTJ6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vT39NcxIWHL5XVNQGRMbS8NxXs0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vZaYDWa3IqTNKsHCsUr72J4zTJ6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":6114,"title":"Bram Stoker''s Dracula","description":"Count Dracula, a 15th-century prince, is condemned to live off the blood of the living for eternity. Young lawyer Jonathan Harker is sent to Dracula''s castle to finalise a land deal, but when the Count sees a photo of Harker''s fiancée, Mina, the spitting image of his dead wife, he imprisons him and sets off for London to track her down.","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["Romance","Horror"],"release_date":"1992-11-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fGuhbAlDpvmNuC0vkz1vsIzYwsq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wpRrdm6g8zWtJnzVqME5QwSKkn7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fGuhbAlDpvmNuC0vkz1vsIzYwsq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wpRrdm6g8zWtJnzVqME5QwSKkn7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4593,"title":"The Discreet Charm of the Bourgeoisie","description":"In Luis Buñuel’s deliciously satiric masterpiece, an upper-class sextet sits down to dinner but never eats, their attempts continually thwarted by a vaudevillian mixture of events both actual and imagined.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1972-09-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/z6NI6n5MvQZMZJbXKLiyFl1yDeA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zN4ILX2x64PvT2jIOAHXxCOi5WA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//z6NI6n5MvQZMZJbXKLiyFl1yDeA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zN4ILX2x64PvT2jIOAHXxCOi5WA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":736073,"title":"Batman: The Long Halloween, Part One","description":"Following a brutal series of murders taking place on Halloween, Thanksgiving, and Christmas, Gotham City''s young vigilante known as the Batman sets out to pursue the mysterious serial killer alongside police officer James Gordon and district attorney Harvey Dent.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Animation","Mystery","Action","Crime"],"release_date":"2021-06-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uS9apevOgs2fuYghf9szOoK1u63.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sR7gppb0YGjwLvE6Vnj6wYv5MnW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uS9apevOgs2fuYghf9szOoK1u63.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sR7gppb0YGjwLvE6Vnj6wYv5MnW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":339403,"title":"Baby Driver","description":"After being coerced into working for a crime boss, a young getaway driver finds himself taking part in a heist doomed to fail.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Action","Crime"],"release_date":"2017-06-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yir5430WblZSZuIMd9C6pIZerfA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tYzFuYXmT8LOYASlFCkaPiAFAl0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yir5430WblZSZuIMd9C6pIZerfA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tYzFuYXmT8LOYASlFCkaPiAFAl0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":65218,"title":"Lemonade Mouth","description":"When five ragtag freshman first meet in detention, it seems they have nothing in common. But, through music, they form an unbreakable bond and discover they have the makings of the greatest high school garage band in history! In the face of incredible odds, Olivia, Stella, Wen, Mohini and Charlie find they can make a real difference when they learn to lean on each other and let go of everything holding back their dreams.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Music","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2011-04-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lBy0tIjlc3rAy4dih74RFDIpxoP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5Tbbxf38c16kbfezmXkPYS2tYRN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lBy0tIjlc3rAy4dih74RFDIpxoP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5Tbbxf38c16kbfezmXkPYS2tYRN.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":53023,"title":"Happiness","description":"Though married to the good-natured, beautiful Thérèse, young husband and father François finds himself falling unquestioningly into an affair with an attractive postal worker. One of Agnès Varda''s most provocative films, ''Le bonheur'' examines, with a deceptively cheery palette and the spirited strains of Mozart, the ideas of fidelity and happiness in a modern, self-centered world.","duration":"1:20:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1965-02-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wPliKFiYaUEYCWWIIFW9mxjiz0G.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nNW4ewpsqxEQQoHXv4PAUsFuDmd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wPliKFiYaUEYCWWIIFW9mxjiz0G.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nNW4ewpsqxEQQoHXv4PAUsFuDmd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13403,"title":"Hedwig and the Angry Inch","description":"Raised a boy in East Berlin, Hedwig undergoes a personal transformation in order to emigrate to the U.S., where she reinvents herself as an ''internationally ignored'' but divinely talented rock diva, inhabiting a ''beautiful gender of one''.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Comedy","Music","Drama"],"release_date":"2001-07-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uY5EB9VIX8lT03MdYcR9DzlhEGM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jafIFAW8sHQkzWPGoMDR4892dFI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uY5EB9VIX8lT03MdYcR9DzlhEGM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jafIFAW8sHQkzWPGoMDR4892dFI.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2503,"title":"The Bourne Ultimatum","description":"Bourne is brought out of hiding once again by reporter Simon Ross who is trying to unveil Operation Blackbriar, an upgrade to Project Treadstone, in a series of newspaper columns. Information from the reporter stirs a new set of memories, and Bourne must finally uncover his dark past while dodging The Company''s best efforts to eradicate him.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Action","Drama","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2007-08-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qiBILuWhv7ipF0pxiEqIJdkQzj8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/15rMz5MRXFp7CP4VxhjYw4y0FUn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qiBILuWhv7ipF0pxiEqIJdkQzj8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//15rMz5MRXFp7CP4VxhjYw4y0FUn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":434616,"title":"Patients","description":"After a serious sport accident in a swimming pool, Ben, now an incomplete quadriplegic, arrives in a rehabilitation center. He meets with other handicapped persons (tetraplegics, paraplegics, traumatized crania), all victims of accidents, as well as a handicapped since his early childhood. They go through impotence, despair and resignation, with their daily struggle to learn how to move a finger or to hold a fork. Some of them slowly find a little mobility while others receive the verdict of the handicap for life. Despite everything, hope and friendship help them endure their difficulties.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2017-03-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_