rt, a brash 17-year-old, is confused and torn by a love-hate relationship with his mother that consumes him more and more each day. After distressing ordeals and tragic episodes, Hubert will find his mother on the banks of Saint Lawrence river, where he grew up, and where a murder will be committed: the murder of childhood.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2009-06-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/72G2cjD0sVmpkQqFkSmADUz0g5s.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nB6OuDdERS95aQtoxPExXxsW3Ov.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//72G2cjD0sVmpkQqFkSmADUz0g5s.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nB6OuDdERS95aQtoxPExXxsW3Ov.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10400,"title":"The Hurricane","description":"The story of Rubin \"Hurricane\" Carter, a boxer wrongly imprisoned for murder, and the people who aided in his fight to prove his innocence.","duration":"2:26:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1999-09-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ffAL7ZiUnCay51SeHFTrTEUpUkO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zhnxjsNnnpsBMF5V1H7Pzkec45Y.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ffAL7ZiUnCay51SeHFTrTEUpUkO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zhnxjsNnnpsBMF5V1H7Pzkec45Y.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8741,"title":"The Thin Red Line","description":"The story of a group of men, an Army Rifle company called C-for-Charlie, who change, suffer, and ultimately make essential discoveries about themselves during the fierce World War II battle of Guadalcanal. It follows their journey, from the surprise of an unopposed landing, through the bloody and exhausting battles that follow, to the ultimate departure of those who survived.","duration":"2:51:00","genre":["Drama","History","War"],"release_date":"1998-12-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hsDyfAk2ml82IrpPC4AHv