an whose life takes a dramatic turn when polio leaves him paralyzed.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2017-10-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/quVfDYktBYQfojgZ3E9pYrclGse.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wLu2N0QVfSpk10RJ17HLHyRUmww.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//quVfDYktBYQfojgZ3E9pYrclGse.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wLu2N0QVfSpk10RJ17HLHyRUmww.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":217993,"title":"Justice League: War","description":"The world is under attack by an alien armada led by the powerful Apokoliptian, Darkseid. A group of superheroes consisting of Superman, Batman, Wonder Woman, The Flash, Green Lantern, Cyborg, and Shazam must set aside their differences and gather together to defend Earth.","duration":"1:19:00","genre":["Animation","Action"],"release_date":"2014-01-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uD6AG36ykWAwKfSrLBuaVmpRC0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pdNprWYdgcB8z4FLD3BhRmhEys1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uD6AG36ykWAwKfSrLBuaVmpRC0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pdNprWYdgcB8z4FLD3BhRmhEys1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":18333,"title":"Hour of the Wolf","description":"While vacationing on a remote German island with his younger pregnant wife, an artist has an emotional breakdown while confronting his repressed desires.","duration":"1:28:00","genre":["Drama","Horror"],"release_date":"1968-02-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pEHxojfy6EGOZ3e7TU9lREpWvNN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jSqTnEP1x1OcOglqrInYvGSF1tL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pEHxojfy6EGOZ3e7TU9lREpWvNN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jSqTnEP1x1OcOglqrInYvGSF1tL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13475,"title":"Star Trek","description":"The fate of the galaxy rests in the hands of bitter rivals. One, James Kirk, is a delinquent, thrill-seeking Iowa farm boy. The other, Spock, a Vulcan, was raised in a logic-based society that rejects all emotion. As fiery instinct clashes with calm reason, their unlikely but powerful partnership is the only thing capable of leading their crew through unimaginable danger, boldly going where no one has gone before. The human adventure has begun again.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Action","Adventure"],"release_date":"2009-05-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cqXEwYFcwyKPZCKl1jAPaG3cMsl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lV5OpzAss1z06YNagOVap1I35mH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cqXEwYFcwyKPZCKl1jAPaG3cMsl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lV5OpzAss1z06YNagOVap1I35mH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11202,"title":"Patton","description":"\"Patton\" tells the tale of General George S. Patton, famous tank commander of World War II. The film begins with Patton''s career in North Africa and progresses through the invasion of Germany and the fall of the Third Reich. Side plots also speak of Patton''s numerous faults such his temper and habit towards insubordination.","duration":"2:52:00","genre":["War","Drama","History"],"release_date":"1970-01-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/txXPooNu7fr4YhLwx7AlXkU0PnN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rLM7jIEPTjj4CF7F1IrzzNjLUCu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//txXPooNu7fr4YhLwx7AlXkU0PnN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rLM7jIEPTjj4CF7F1IrzzNjLUCu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4024,"title":"Last Year at Marienbad","description":"At a weekend gathering, a man tells a woman that they had spent time there together a year prior. But, the woman has no recollection whatsoever and is convinced that he is simply fabricating the encounter. The more he speaks about their activities the previous year however, the more compelling he becomes. The question remains however – did they meet previously or not?","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1961-09-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/h1ov8VcVCiZsnWRu4EjZ74R33GP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/syIJCqiSkGRJTlyaBtyI5jqPtE7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//h1ov8VcVCiZsnWRu4EjZ74R33GP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//syIJCqiSkGRJTlyaBtyI5jqPtE7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1923,"title":"Twin Peaks: Fire Walk with Me","description":"In the questionable town of Deer Meadow, Washington, FBI Agent Desmond inexplicably disappears while hunting for the man who murdered a teen girl. The killer is never apprehended, and, after experiencing dark visions and supernatural encounters, Agent Dale Cooper chillingly predicts that the culprit will claim another life. Meanwhile, in the more cozy town of Twin Peaks, hedonistic beauty Laura Palmer hangs with lowlifes and seems destined for a grisly fate.","duration":"2:15:00","genre":["Drama","Mystery","Horror"],"release_date":"1992-06-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/amGU1FpELmenVvNmPShW58Orepy.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mxsGXqetGnirf99qapYd5MMY1VL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//amGU1FpELmenVvNmPShW58Orepy.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mxsGXqetGnirf99qapYd5MMY1VL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":614934,"title":"Elvis","description":"The life story of Elvis Presley as seen through the complicated relationship with his enigmatic manager, Colonel Tom Parker.","duration":"2:39:00","genre":["Music","History","Drama"],"release_date":"2022-06-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rLo9T9jEg67UZPq3midjLnTUYYi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qBOKWqAFbveZ4ryjJJwbie6tXkQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rLo9T9jEg67UZPq3midjLnTUYYi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qBOKWqAFbveZ4ryjJJwbie6tXkQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5781,"title":"That Obscure Object of Desire","description":"After dumping a bucket of water on a beautiful young woman from the window of a train car, wealthy Frenchman Mathieu, regales his fellow passengers with the story of the dysfunctional relationship between himself and the young woman in question, a fiery 19-year-old flamenco dancer named Conchita. What follows is a tale of cruelty, depravity and lies -- the very building blocks of love.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1977-08-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/79ofDLTW1ozMSYDNWhDYe5cQzAa.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9iUdC4dftkjYSBUJq5DAxC6WqB9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//79ofDLTW1ozMSYDNWhDYe5cQzAa.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9iUdC4dftkjYSBUJq5DAxC6WqB9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5123,"title":"August Rush","description":"Evan, a musically gifted orphan, runs away from his orphanage and searches New York City for his birth parents. On his journey, he''s taken under the wing of the Wizard, a homeless man who lives in an abandoned theater. After discovering his talent, the Wizard gives Evan the name \"August Rush\" and devises a plan to profit from his talent. Little does Evan know that his parents, Lyla and Louis, are searching for him too.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Family","Drama","Music"],"release_date":"2007-11-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/i3pONuqGZSR3UYOOdBeU2CiQnxj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oA6ZeICPINiS6YtD5WZeBaGVmuT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//i3pONuqGZSR3UYOOdBeU2CiQn