"small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bYimqNnizPUCnL5HOdoCW02IGmH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xYMYV8lMIeQMymuNPBvq3hOnqXw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":41585,"title":"Mary Forever","description":"Marco, a teacher from Milan, relocates to Palermo and takes a temporary job teaching in a juvenile detention centre while he waits for a high school teaching position. He tries to understand and motivate his handful of students, encouraging them to stand up for their rights, finding out about their histories: Natale, in for murder and enamored with the Mafia; Pietro, who can''t seem to stay out of jail; Claudio, barely 14 and learning to stand up for himself; and Mery, a trans sex worker, who was arrested after a fight with a trick who didn''t want to pay her, and is now stuck in a male prison.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"1989-05-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5y98LdgXJPSo2n4vLJhTLCN78PS.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iGgJH7580UkEaqrwxMolpqQ7a1X.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5y98LdgXJPSo2n4vLJhTLCN78PS.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iGgJH7580UkEaqrwxMolpqQ7a1X.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":21422,"title":"Detective Conan: The Time Bombed Skyscraper","description":"Once brilliant teenage detective Shinichi Kudo was given a poison that reverted him to a 4-year-old. He''s adopted the pseudonym Conan Edogawa so no one (save for an eccentric inventor) will know. Now he''s got to solve a series of bombings before his loved ones become victims. Who is this madman and why is he doing this? Only the young genius can save the day but will even he be up to the task?","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Animation","Crime","Mystery","Adventure"],"release_date":"1997-04-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fUHuBNqTFGCohCuHDEqHs1pDPj7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/