amily now face the terrors of the outside world. Forced to venture into the unknown, they realize that the creatures that hunt by sound are not the only threats that lurk beyond the sand path.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Thriller","Horror"],"release_date":"2021-05-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uuBYYlbfiYD7ny5VNj46NG14ykR.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4q2hz2m8hubgvijz8Ez0T2Os2Yv.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uuBYYlbfiYD7ny5VNj46NG14ykR.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4q2hz2m8hubgvijz8Ez0T2Os2Yv.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":84111,"title":"You Are the Apple of My Eye","description":"A group of close friends who attend a private school all have a debilitating crush on the sunny star pupil, Shen Chia-yi. The only member of the group who claims not to is Ko Ching-teng, but he ends up loving her as well.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2011-08-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iwGecI7d8rii2DQe3m3sLnBySQh.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mQ07Y4KlYZlJjVSEp2AFTYZA9i.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iwGecI7d8rii2DQe3m3sLnBySQh.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mQ07Y4KlYZlJjVSEp2AFTYZA9i.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":47848,"title":"Scent of a Woman","description":"An army cadet accompanies an irascible, blind captain on a week-long trip from Turin to Naples.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1974-12-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/k0b3YNvv6G1p3aUqywJ2wRoh844.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sfjOK5n0eaS04MMCiNz43xbbydc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//k0b3YNvv6G1p3aUqywJ2wRoh844.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sfjOK5n0eaS04MMCiNz43xbbydc.jpg"}