e. Holed up in a hotel in a fictional European country, young Iris befriends elderly Miss Froy. When the train resumes, Iris suffers a bout of unconsciousness and wakes to find the old woman has disappeared. The other passengers ominously deny Miss Froy ever existed, so Iris begins to investigate with another traveler and, as the pair sleuth, romantic sparks fly.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"1938-10-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/15HEZcSKtLcl69avXfmjoIJBuay.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/c1t9LB76LvEARPanfEzXmkm7fwY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//15HEZcSKtLcl69avXfmjoIJBuay.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//c1t9LB76LvEARPanfEzXmkm7fwY.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":853,"title":"Enemy at the Gates","description":"A Russian and a German sniper play a game of cat-and-mouse during the Battle of Stalingrad in WWII.","duration":"2:11:00","genre":["War","History"],"release_date":"2001-02-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pnEMDuaZeDXUQPPhhGTo9QMfMeA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cHRAbVdsCWFaQrswRsBP7Bn255W.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pnEMDuaZeDXUQPPhhGTo9QMfMeA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cHRAbVdsCWFaQrswRsBP7Bn255W.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":627087,"title":"Lunana: A Yak in the Classroom","description":"A teacher, in search of inspiration, travels to the most remote school in the world, where he ends up realizing how important his job is and appreciating the value of yak dung.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2019-11-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/boGRStbspjqtNtDVpqvj28sI5V3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mL1OQc1cxGsOIVHgjDvyvmPSmad.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//boGRStbspjqtNtDVpqv