the initial sketches of what will become one of the world’s most legendary weapons. A self-taught inventor is only 29 when he develops the now iconic assault riffle — the AK-47. Shot in occupied Crimea.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["War","History","Drama"],"release_date":"2020-02-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dUasP5TGFk1dhTgtNhk5uLRPRx6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wck8uKybfkHttcjoNlKoC0f7oBw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dUasP5TGFk1dhTgtNhk5uLRPRx6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wck8uKybfkHttcjoNlKoC0f7oBw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":440298,"title":"Cold War","description":"A man and a woman meet in the ruins of post-war Poland. With vastly different backgrounds and temperaments, they are fatally mismatched and yet drawn to each other.","duration":"1:28:00","genre":["Romance","Music","Drama"],"release_date":"2018-06-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5z8LDc5XIxP57cUCHIsIkYFmVZf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6rbS8oPIgUMhQgIX8oGVTtlNgLR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5z8LDc5XIxP57cUCHIsIkYFmVZf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6rbS8oPIgUMhQgIX8oGVTtlNgLR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":23383,"title":"Hamlet","description":"Winner of four Academy Awards, including Best Picture and Best Actor, Sir Laurence Olivier’s Hamlet continues to be the most compelling version of Shakespeare’s beloved tragedy. Olivier is at his most inspired—both as director and as the melancholy Dane himself—as he breathes new life into the words of one of the world’s greatest dramatists.","duration":"2:33:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1948-12-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tFfucMJh4Me1JYBIRJcOokWWuLs.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/woO9SgU2vTRMZeG0YqOLeoIqlzC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tFfucMJh4Me1JYBIRJcOokWWuLs.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//woO9SgU2vTRMZeG0YqOLeoIqlzC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4032,"title":"My Girl","description":"Vada Sultenfuss is obsessed with death. Her mother is dead, and her father runs a funeral parlor. She is also in love with her English teacher, and joins a poetry class over the summer just to impress him. Thomas J., her best friend, is \"allergic to everything\", and sticks with Vada despite her hangups. When Vada''s father hires Shelly, and begins to fall for her, things take a turn to the worse...","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1991-11-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vSd89kiENYeFa6mPHzsM5BgliPm.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qyJJNHteA7BUwQSey05t7qP4vRV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vSd89kiENYeFa6mPHzsM5BgliPm.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qyJJNHteA7BUwQSey05t7qP4vRV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":626872,"title":"Emergency Declaration","description":"While investigating a terroristic threat that goes viral online, Korean authorities discover that a suspect has recently boarded an international flight bound for the United States. When a healthy passenger on the same flight suddenly dies a gruesome death of unknown cause, panic erupts both in-flight and on the ground. With steadily decreasing fuel and international refusals to offer aid, the captain and crew will be forced to take unprecedented emergency measures in an attempt to save the lives of their passengers.","duration":"2:20:00","genre":["Action","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2022-08-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fI8hv1IqWUIUjx4YRfl6TWhdqHW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/h7kaQG5MbraSLibOuTpo0gtMxRz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fI8hv1IqWUIUjx4YRfl6TWhdqHW.j