osses paths with Hiiro, a survivor of the Ogre race, an incredible adventure packed with new characters begins. The power of bonds will be put to the test!","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Animation","Fantasy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2022-11-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/g03h9TULzJZOoXA34Abp5LE7lvt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xITip9n9uMAUA0TU6niMXU2tbh0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//g03h9TULzJZOoXA34Abp5LE7lvt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xITip9n9uMAUA0TU6niMXU2tbh0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":21345,"title":"City of Life and Death","description":"In 1937, during the height of the Second Sino-Japanese War, the Imperial Japanese Army has just captured Nanjing, then-capital of the Republic of China. What followed was known as the Nanking Massacre, or the Rape of Nanking, a six week period wherein tens of thousands of Chinese soldiers and civilians were killed.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Drama","History","War"],"release_date":"2009-04-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bUxiZrkdLbDAV89ICbKNsuvnfu4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xY6OUM2aRCmmq1ySTg2eu5rVmcq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bUxiZrkdLbDAV89ICbKNsuvnfu4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xY6OUM2aRCmmq1ySTg2eu5rVmcq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11700,"title":"Smiles of a Summer Night","description":"Early in the 20th century, middle-aged lawyer Fredrik Egerman and his young wife, Anne, have still not consummated their marriage, while Fredrik''s son finds himself increasingly attracted to his new stepmother. To make matters worse, Fredrik''s old flame Desiree makes a public bet that she can seduce him at a romantic weekend retreat where four couples convene, swapping partners and pairing off in unexpected ways.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"1955-12-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mPpEL0P0JSw8AdjB2fx4NzIUIFZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wKeV8lKz8k9DDBCw6MJ9MkhvhqF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mPpEL0P0JSw8AdjB2fx4NzIUIFZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wKeV8lKz8k9DDBCw6MJ9MkhvhqF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1561,"title":"Mouchette","description":"A young girl living in the French countryside suffers constant indignities at the hand of alcoholism and her fellow man.","duration":"1:21:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1967-03-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uwF6l5rNtxwkgA2TuXoSJXJrchD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cITZsSQ7VG122xQ0xAN3NHZF0OH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uwF6l5rNtxwkgA2TuXoSJXJrchD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cITZsSQ7VG122xQ0xAN3NHZF0OH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":195,"title":"Trouble in Paradise","description":"Thief Gaston Monescu and pickpocket Lily are partners in crime and love. Working for perfume company executive Mariette Colet, the two crooks decide to combine their criminal talents to rob their employer. Under the alias of Monsieur Laval, Gaston uses his position as Mariette''s personal secretary to become closer to her. However, he takes things too far when he actually falls in love with Mariette, and has to choose between her and Lily.","duration":"1:23:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime","Romance"],"release_date":"1932-10-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8xFIubJoxyidKaGjO1dc0btC9e7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/FBxuoLRD3Biyul14unT5m3PYNS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8xFIubJoxyidKaGjO1dc0btC9e7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//FBxuoLRD3Biyul14unT5m3PYNS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":430214,"title":"Night Is Short, Walk On Girl","description":"As a group of university students go out for a night on the town, a sophomore known only as \"The Girl with Black Hair\" experiences a series of surreal encounters with the local nightlife – all the while unaware of the romantic longings of \"Senpai\", a senior student who has been creating increasingly fantastic and contrived reasons to run into her in an effort to win her heart.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance","Animation","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2017-04-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iBl3hhtHC7qQX7jGphIAYLpmpPC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cDp45WZNqgAli3u4GTnUhsqFn5K.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iBl3hhtHC7qQX7jGphIAYLpmpPC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cDp45WZNqgAli3u4GTnUhsqFn5K.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":394117,"title":"The Florida Project","description":"The story of a precocious six year-old and her ragtag group of friends whose summer break is filled with childhood wonder, possibility and a sense of adventure while the adults around them struggle with hard times.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2017-10-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/GOwNU7Z9G3ORjNxdZnURfuIGS6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5QnDxdJg1fi6uMSkSi4x8tHsltm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//GOwNU7Z9G3ORjNxdZnURfuIGS6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5QnDxdJg1fi6uMSkSi4x8tHsltm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":42602,"title":"The Passion of Anna","description":"A recently divorced man and an emotionally devastated widow begin a love affair.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1969-11-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gmbk9C6ge97Wx48lLnGq6TciaJF.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cr01316AyxUZyZrdLwzz3AXrgJc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gmbk9C6ge97Wx48lLnGq6TciaJF.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cr01316AyxUZyZrdLwzz3AXrgJc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":19223,"title":"A Pure Formality","description":"Famous writer Onoff is now a recluse. The Inspector is suspicious when Onoff is brought into the station one night, disoriented and suffering a kind of amnesia. In an isolated, rural police station, the Inspector tries to establish the events surrounding a killing, to reach a startling resolution.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Mystery","Thriller","Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"1994-05-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/88FnsK3iF9rWdR36N3anp1oYVYJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bAd56dYln4cgoJBa1r60cb9S5xR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//88FnsK3iF9rWdR36N3anp1oYVYJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bAd56dYln4cgoJBa1r60cb9S5xR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9918,"title":"Glory Road","description":"In 1966, Texas Western coach Don Haskins led the first all-black starting line-up for a college basketball team to the NCAA national championship.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2006-01-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bWN6ZBr6nJNEuHigL9fQWhZ78hd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bGRSV5tStxDNPRLCewnOeeiZzrY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bWN6ZBr6nJNEuHigL9fQWhZ78hd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bGRSV5tStxDNPRLCewnOeeiZzrY.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":7294,"title":"The Man Without a Past","description":"Arriving in Helsinki, a nameless man is beaten within an inch of his life by thugs, miraculously recovering only to find that he has completely lost his memory. Back on the streets, he attempts to begin again from zero, befriending a moody dog and becoming besotted with a Salvation Army volunteer.","duration":"