ption":"ZIM discovers his almighty leaders never had any intention of coming to Earth and he loses confidence in himself for the first time in his life, which is the big break his human nemesis, Dib has been waiting for.","duration":"1:11:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2019-08-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1CDdClx0DGembBYjRWFH7HB2uff.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lYy5EBxl8cwpyejcy85LgSdf34m.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1CDdClx0DGembBYjRWFH7HB2uff.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lYy5EBxl8cwpyejcy85LgSdf34m.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":51828,"title":"One Day","description":"After spending the night together on the eve of their college graduation, Dexter and Emma are shown each year on the same date to see where they are in their lives. They are sometimes together, and sometimes not.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2011-03-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1PJtX1UUieACKg3eKxuNBb3QEo7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/n9jMwSg4IavdD8wqdYnyW5w3Mvp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1PJtX1UUieACKg3eKxuNBb3QEo7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//n9jMwSg4IavdD8wqdYnyW5w3Mvp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":860159,"title":"Crush","description":"When an aspiring young artist is forced to join her high school track team, she uses it as an opportunity to pursue the girl she''s been harboring a long-time crush on. But she soon finds herself falling for an unexpected teammate and discovers what real love feels like.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2022-04-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aozj1tYuAIgopkiSPogePgSxZkR.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hayr56csDzCSADaejgrRMVPHyDy.jpg","small_backdrop