an''s rape of Nanking in 1937. Posing as a priest, he attempts to lead the women to safety.","duration":"2:26:00","genre":["Drama","History","War"],"release_date":"2011-12-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ca0a79cbCGWJdan3SEBKkQBSwKi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7NVgVX663tdareijAiv0eLiLn6d.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ca0a79cbCGWJdan3SEBKkQBSwKi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7NVgVX663tdareijAiv0eLiLn6d.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5723,"title":"Once","description":"A vacuum repairman moonlights as a street musician and hopes for his big break. One day a Czech immigrant, who earns a living selling flowers, approaches him with the news that she is also an aspiring singer-songwriter. The pair decide to collaborate, and the songs that they compose reflect the story of their blossoming love.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Drama","Music","Romance"],"release_date":"2007-03-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/p1XSyBriqz7oBWoVcRqYlB6Kve3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7nW363kSYRCkr4VGOMvuSGwtzKs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//p1XSyBriqz7oBWoVcRqYlB6Kve3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7nW363kSYRCkr4VGOMvuSGwtzKs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":489418,"title":"In Safe Hands","description":"Théo is given up for adoption by his biological mother on the very day he is born. After this anonymous birth, the mother has two months to change her mind… Or not. The child welfare services and adoption service spring into action… The former have to take care of the baby and support it during this limbo-like time, this period of uncertainty, while the latter must find a woman to become his adoptive mother. She is called Alice, and she has spent the last ten years fighting to have a child.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2018-12-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fozq5WDVQQZ8C1K3rrvgB6IM5O9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/andgp8cnHZPAwx3zPUDaZ0pn6Go.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fozq5WDVQQZ8C1K3rrvgB6IM5O9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//andgp8cnHZPAwx3zPUDaZ0pn6Go.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":87827,"title":"Life of Pi","description":"The story of an Indian boy named Pi, a zookeeper''s son who finds himself in the company of a hyena, zebra, orangutan, and a Bengal tiger after a shipwreck sets them adrift in the Pacific Ocean.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Adventure","Drama"],"release_date":"2012-11-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/21YsCNMub5455NQCn3jh9SmRFyG.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iLgRu4hhSr6V1uManX6ukDriiSc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//21YsCNMub5455NQCn3jh9SmRFyG.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iLgRu4hhSr6V1uManX6ukDriiSc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":42801,"title":"Yesterday, Today and Tomorrow","description":"Three tales of very different women using their sexuality as a means to getting what they want.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"1963-12-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/i7awVEzUulqDX35EDKtXijRCpzM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uRJuHGtdNES7OgCoBpTXkOTO9IL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//i7awVEzUulqDX35EDKtXijRCpzM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uRJuHGtdNES7OgCoBpTXkOTO9IL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":516486,"title":"Greyhound","description":"A first-time captain leads a convoy of allied ships carrying thousands of soldiers across the treacherous waters of the \"Black Pit\" to the front lines of WWII. With no air cover protection for 5 days, the captain and his convoy must battle the surrounding enemy Nazi U-boats in 