n David Mann angers the driver of a rusty tanker while crossing the California desert. A simple trip turns deadly, as Mann struggles to stay on the road while the tanker plays cat and mouse with his life.","duration":"1:14:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","TV Movie"],"release_date":"1971-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AoGLKkPvBcZP27jwSA85fY8emvJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/w9Vk1Txx14vWvACELFYFlixrsfr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AoGLKkPvBcZP27jwSA85fY8emvJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//w9Vk1Txx14vWvACELFYFlixrsfr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":645886,"title":"The Unforgivable","description":"A woman is released from prison after serving a sentence for a violent crime and re-enters a society that refuses to forgive her past.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"2021-11-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kbOB9DGl8qwhDRcXOmXfmcmadeD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1b3dNFDuE7i05TJlXrIC571yR01.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kbOB9DGl8qwhDRcXOmXfmcmadeD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1b3dNFDuE7i05TJlXrIC571yR01.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":644089,"title":"Blue Bayou","description":"As a Korean-American man raised in the Louisiana bayou works hard to make a life for his family, he must confront the ghosts of his past as he discovers that he could be deported from the only country he has ever called home.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2021-09-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wETWXzbvn0LhrPGLeRqyIeIl0E8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a4xykTie8BOSW0y6K5u1AcmW4HW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wETWXzbvn0LhrPGLeRqyIeIl0E8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//a4xykTie8BOSW0y6K5u1AcmW4HW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":206487,"title":"Predestination","description":"Predestination chronicles the life of a Temporal Agent sent on an intricate series of time-travel journeys designed to prevent future killers from committing their crimes. Now, on his final assignment, the Agent must stop the one criminal that has eluded him throughout time and prevent a devastating attack in which thousands of lives will be lost.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Thriller"],"release_date":"2014-08-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cvq9cRMDJIGzNpHaPVGFftqPcLj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/38Xr1JnV1ZcLQ55zmdSp6n475cZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cvq9cRMDJIGzNpHaPVGFftqPcLj.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//38Xr1JnV1ZcLQ55zmdSp6n475cZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":21832,"title":"Neon Genesis Evangelion: Death and Rebirth","description":"Originally a collection of clips from the Neon Genesis Evangelion TV series, Death was created as a precursor to the re-worked ending of the series. Rebirth was intended as that re-worked ending, but after production overruns Rebirth became only the first half of the first part of The End of Evangelion, with some minor differences.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Animation","Drama","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1997-03-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/74wyAwiWTGLpJGQIPMKjYjvSyl4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lXBjqzo6c4NyLuJtqOiH39kswji.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//74wyAwiWTGLpJGQIPMKjYjvSyl4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lXBjqzo6c4NyLuJtqOiH39kswji.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10784,"title":"Cabaret","description":"Inside the Kit Kat Club of 1931 Berlin, starry-eyed singer Sally Bowles and an impish emcee sound the clarion call to decadent fun, while outside a certain political party grows into a brutal force.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Music","Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"1972-02-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yInvVRrCmEypIt5hm0WvXkjxsQX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fMhOeJ2TvuY46iYGmsowhgRXfnr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yInvVRrCmEypIt5hm0WvXkjxsQX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fMhOeJ2TvuY46iYGmsowhgRXfnr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4584,"title":"Sense and Sensibility","description":"The Dashwood sisters, sensible Elinor and passionate Marianne, learn that their prospects of marriage seem doomed by their family''s sudden loss of fortune. After Henry Dashwood dies unexpectedly, his estate must pass on by law to his son. These circumstances leave Mr. Dashwood''s wife and daughters without a home and with barely enough money to live on. As Elinor and Marianne struggle to find romantic fulfillment in a society obsessed with financial and social status, they must learn to mix sense with sensibility in their dealings with both money and men.","duration":"2:16:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1995-12-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cFnyfWHL6HjOOVal6lp8e5gqibK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9YdQ73YmvInxpXZVNjEKePw9tRO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cFnyfWHL6HjOOVal6lp8e5gqibK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9YdQ73YmvInxpXZVNjEKePw9tRO.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":227306,"title":"Unbroken","description":"A chronicle of the life of Louis Zamperini, an Olympic runner who was taken prisoner by Japanese forces during World War II.","duration":"2:17:00","genre":["Drama","War"],"release_date":"2014-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wxdtjlapI0d1vsXhNN0LhLMsaGw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vAlHUjHwLWMV5mg4epGR9WSIfiy.jpg","small_backdrop_path":