 during the racially-charged summer of 1971. The incredible events that unfolded would change Durham and the lives of Atwater and Ellis forever.","duration":"2:13:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2019-04-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hvFdjSEPveRmYXu4jazOQFjjDu3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4pA9318BY7CSnXVi3xKBtPYMe1T.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hvFdjSEPveRmYXu4jazOQFjjDu3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4pA9318BY7CSnXVi3xKBtPYMe1T.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":264525,"title":"The Perfect Dictatorship","description":"TV MX, the most powerful Mexican Television Corporation, discloses a scandalous story involving Governor Carmelo Vargas in serious crimes and illicit business. Governor Vargas worried about his political future, decides to clean his image and negotiates a billionaire secret agreement with the owners of the TV Corporation. Carlos Rojo, an ambitious young news producer, and Ricardo Diaz, TV network star reporter, are responsible for making a dirty campaign to change the image the public has of the corrupt Governor and make him, at any cost, a political star and a great presidential candidate. Mexican Television believes that democracy is a farce and has already placed one President... Will they do it again?","duration":"2:23:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2014-10-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/smwA94FaQBSVy4W4yjyZjU8aRT5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cgg9WVENbrSmNsX8BlBfrhTY0IA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//smwA94FaQBSVy4W4yjyZjU8aRT5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cgg9WVENbrSmNsX8BlBfrhTY0IA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":250219,"title":"I Can Quit Whenever I Want","description":"A university researcher is fired because of the cuts to university. To earn a living he decides to produce drugs recruiting his former colleagues, who despite their skills are living at the margins of society.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2014-02-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6BHQS2rofh2kQrktroBH4TGrtXY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zcDqnuSpdRoXuw3kmbMDxLkdgXR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6BHQS2rofh2kQrktroBH4TGrtXY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zcDqnuSpdRoXuw3kmbMDxLkdgXR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":94329,"title":"The Raid","description":"Deep in the heart of Jakarta''s slums lies an impenetrable safe house for the world''s most dangerous killers and gangsters. Until now, the run-down apartment block has been considered untouchable to even the bravest of police. Cloaked under the cover of pre-dawn darkness and silence, an elite swat team is tasked with raiding the safe house in order to take down the notorious drug lord that runs it.  But when a chance encounter with a spotter blows their cover and news of their assault reaches the drug lord, the building''s lights are cut and all the exits blocked. Stranded on the sixth floor with no way out, the unit must fight their way through the city''s worst to survive their mission. Starring Indonesian martial arts sensation Iko Uwais.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2012-03-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3wf5wV222vqTmz10y1vbrPgrGDf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/Abnm1Ws3JH0ReCfEhLMPwPcMcGO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3wf5wV222vqTmz10y1vbrPgrGDf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//Abnm1Ws3JH0ReCfEhLMPwPcMcGO.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":456570,"title":"Hindi Medium","description":"Mita and Raj Batra, an affluent couple from Delhi’s Chandni Chowk, are grappling with getting their daughter admission into an English medium school. Bu