 Angels (Seima Tenshi in Japanese) in the process.","duration":"0:45:00","genre":["Action","Animation","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1989-03-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1FdYcvnpyk8vxBbw583ZzwVQ5Ev.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a1ftT2mM219UvZ86jgF19mBoUT1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1FdYcvnpyk8vxBbw583ZzwVQ5Ev.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//a1ftT2mM219UvZ86jgF19mBoUT1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9549,"title":"The Right Stuff","description":"At the dawn of the Space Race, seven test pilots set out to become the first American astronauts to enter space. However, the road to making history brings momentous challenges.","duration":"3:13:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"1983-10-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jPdRlbRBHGl2POLLk6Oylbav7ac.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/htEr0vyHbU7FMr8qvTguTmaTvES.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jPdRlbRBHGl2POLLk6Oylbav7ac.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//htEr0vyHbU7FMr8qvTguTmaTvES.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":855400,"title":"Jai Bhim","description":"A pregnant woman from a primitive tribal community, searches desperately for her husband, who is missing from police custody. So as to find her husband and seek justice for them, as their voice, a High Court advocate rises in support. Will their battle for justice succeed?","duration":"2:44:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Mystery","History"],"release_date":"2021-11-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/40lmQ5vzKJhj5k7i0hvZuglneyj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ehybiOtBUtrMkmtB39zQEtq1Jie.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//40lmQ5vzKJhj5k7i0hvZuglneyj.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ehybiOtBUtrMkmtB39zQEtq1Jie.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":630220,"title":"18 Presents","description":"Elisa is only forty when an incurable disease takes her from her husband and their daughter. Before her heart stops, Elisa finds a way to stay close to her: a gift for every birthday up to her adult age, 18 gifts to try to accompany her child''s growth year after year.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Drama","Family"],"release_date":"2020-01-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oZibPrp183EI5yjKvVFZ1lhA3Pj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lS7lqDT3NF2LcSPdxXNJY9pMxZ6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oZibPrp183EI5yjKvVFZ1lhA3Pj.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lS7lqDT3NF2LcSPdxXNJY9pMxZ6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":400728,"title":"Unknown Soldier","description":"The film follows Finnish army machine gun company in Continuation War against Soviet Union, 1941–1944. Based on Väinö Linna''s best selling novel Tuntematon Sotilas (The Unknown Soldier) and the novel''s uncensored version, Sotaromaani (A War Novel).","duration":"2:59:00","genre":["War","Drama"],"release_date":"2017-10-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4lI768UFQXijUf9TlfWDnxS1nlk.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dR37hrF6YDMSJCT4r30tOYzVath.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4lI768UFQXijUf9TlfWDnxS1nlk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dR37hrF6YDMSJCT4r30tOYzVath.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":340666,"title":"Nocturnal Animals","description":"Susan Morrow receives a book manuscript from her ex-husband – a man she left 20 years earlier – asking for her opinion of his writing. As she reads, she is drawn into the fictional life of Tony Hastings, a mathematics professor whose family vacation turns violent.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2016-11-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5d6m8CIBQcHeiwr6R5ou4wxO9Vn.jpg","