iff gamekeeper of a vast estate in Sologne, the city child, recalcitrant and stubborn, arrives in a mysterious and disturbing world, that of a sovereign and wild region. The huge forest, misty ponds, heaths, and fields all belong to the Count de la Fresnaye, an elderly taciturn man who lives alone in his manor.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"2017-02-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5KGtBcI4twwyZIB1dAXznQiqXsL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rBjy3aR5EvKVvbuwfiZyK3w7vvJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5KGtBcI4twwyZIB1dAXznQiqXsL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rBjy3aR5EvKVvbuwfiZyK3w7vvJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":44012,"title":"Jeanne Dielman, 23, quai du Commerce, 1080 Bruxelles","description":"A lonely young widow lives with her son following an immutable order: while the boy is in school, she cares for their apartment, does chores, and receives clients in the afternoon.","duration":"3:22:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1976-01-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2qL6rsvq29ueZ0ITh47Jj2F985R.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fqfSu8Y1YSVFkoCJyiTXI6woYma.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2qL6rsvq29ueZ0ITh47Jj2F985R.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fqfSu8Y1YSVFkoCJyiTXI6woYma.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12650,"title":"Il Mare","description":"A man and a woman realize they are separated by two years of time when they exchange letters from different years in a mailbox.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2000-09-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7oIJumqySs4xdYa6NWSgVxuZM09.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/csJ2BCbQaaNL4n8dk3W91QiAWmV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7oIJumqySs4