ZLenbKhTNvcH0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4XdoWg7vAsjWwC9OKg8gqVKI6JV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//m3EweWiLJ93m4CZLenbKhTNvcH0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14638,"title":"The Killers","description":"Two hit men walk into a diner asking for a man called \"the Swede\". When the killers find the Swede, he''s expecting them and doesn''t put up a fight. Since the Swede had a life insurance policy, an investigator, on a hunch, decides to look into the murder. As the Swede''s past is laid bare, it comes to light that he was in love with a beautiful woman who may have lured him into pulling off a bank robbery overseen by another man.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Crime","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"1946-08-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/w6XdWl6L2WDHJGw2FKySbi86WDg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uXnuc6pW01s1MDwb6QwBWg2JQeX.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//w6XdWl6L2WDHJGw2FKySbi86WDg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uXnuc6pW01s1MDwb6QwBWg2JQeX.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4174,"title":"Spellbound","description":"When Dr. Anthony Edwardes arrives at a Vermont mental hospital to replace the outgoing hospital director, Dr. Constance Peterson, a psychoanalyst, discovers Edwardes is actually an impostor. The man confesses that the real Dr. Edwardes is dead and fears he may have killed him, but cannot recall anything. Dr. Peterson, however is convinced his impostor is innocent of the man''s murder, and joins him on a quest to unravel his amnesia through psychoanalysis.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Drama","Crime","Mystery","Romance","Thriller"],"release_date":"1945-10-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/45HFziT30x25QxQdWPkhSIqFbKR.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dPAox7jGScLBvxKLeRptJIBF7v.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//45HFziT30x25QxQdWPkhSIqFbKR.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dPAox7jGScLBvxKLeRptJIBF7v.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":519010,"title":"Pain and Glory","description":"Salvador Mallo, a filmmaker in the twilight of his career, remembers his life: his mother, his lovers, the actors he worked with. The sixties in a small village in Valencia, the eighties in Madrid, the present, when he feels an immeasurable emptiness, facing his mortality, the incapability of continuing filming, the impossibility of separating creation from his own life. The need of narrating his past can be his salvation.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2019-03-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/o1JapnInSBCgedfWnj15ytjGC70.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cMlueArJXXwZbeLpb4NhC3pxmBk.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//o1JapnInSBCgedfWnj15ytjGC70.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cMlueArJXXwZbeLpb4NhC3pxmBk.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":77461,"title":"Where Do We Go Now?","description":"In a remote, isolated Lebanese village surrounded by land mines, Muslims and Christians live together in peace. As civil strife starts to engulf the country around them, the women in the village try, by various means and to varying success, to keep their men in the dark by sabotaging the village radio, and then destroying the village TV.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2011-09-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dnWowXHGJ0AmeD5CLdJQHRVxTSW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/crYsh9vt7ujWoI4o91bfclYp7WM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dnWowXHGJ0AmeD5CLdJQHRVxTSW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//crYsh9vt7ujWoI4o91bfclYp7WM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":50337,"title":"Firebreather","description":"It''s not easy being a teen like Duncan. His mom wants him to pay more attention to his homework, while his dad - a 120-foot-tall monster known as a Kaiju - wants him to become the next King of All Monsters. When these worlds collide, Duncan must use his human wits and his Kaiju powers - including super strength, agility and the ability to breathe fire - to protect his family and friends from a giant monster rampage.","duration":"1:09:00","genre":["Fantasy","Animation","Action","Family"],"release_date":"2010-11-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lYasFduyooJu9Ebi9w8TpLaJT8y.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mTPC0ysx6pa91BK6dnnKvoynjb3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lYasFduyooJu9Ebi9w8TpLaJT8y.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mTPC0ysx6pa91BK6dnnKvoynjb3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":45005,"title":"The Monsters","description":"The myths of the sixties are satirized in 20 episodes.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1963-10-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ic3hMvpouz2sIDrrlEnMYSZ8Sl9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6ojy9P8zp1Fz8byLqACux5H2cVP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ic3hMvpouz2sIDrrlEnMYSZ8Sl9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6ojy9P8zp1Fz8byLqACux5H2cVP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":25955,"title":"Pickup on South Street","description":"In New York City, an insolent pickpocket, Skip McCoy, inadvertently sets off a chain of events when he targets ex-prostitute Candy and steals her wallet. Unaware that she has been making deliveries of highly classified information to the communists, Candy, who has been trailed by FBI agents for months in hopes of nabbing the spy ringleader, is sent by her ex-boyfriend, Joey, to find Skip and retrieve the valuable microfilm he now holds.","duration":"1:20:00","genre":["Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"1953-05-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wrX24LRWYGZyvPr3W3SSM35QOd7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/et4fY4BxLyAPwxvUFUbzCUrGsjR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wrX24LRWYGZyvPr3W3SSM35QOd7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//et4fY4BxLyAPwxvUFUbzCUrGsjR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15774,"title":"Swades","description":"A successful Indian scientist returns home to his village to take his nanny back to America with him, and in the process rediscovers his roots.","duration":"3:15:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2004-12-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AmRfsOyEXpVhnaYXZMoDlZd9Siq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yUSL24kpHc9Nls4Pohia4shgcIM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AmRfsOyEXpVhnaYXZMoDlZd9Siq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yUSL24kpHc9Nls4Pohia4shgcIM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13354,"title":"Chill Out, Scooby-Doo!","description":"The gang''s vacation to Paris takes a wrong turn when Scooby and Shaggy miss their flight and end up on a skydiving expedition in the Himalayas. To make matters worse, upon arrival they must outrun the Abominable Snowmonster.","duration":"1:13:00","genre":["Family","Comedy","Animation","Adventure","Mystery"],"release_date":"2007-08-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/b3YTgRg33zNzn60Fi44Z1LpwAUO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/n1SgvnX4SJ6gZEpDSQEbcmQOslJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//b3YTgRg33zNzn60Fi44Z1LpwAUO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//n1SgvnX4SJ6gZEpDSQEbcmQOslJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1253971,"title":"Cunk on Life","description":"Pioneering documentary maker Philomena Cunk returns with her most ambitious quest to date: venturing right up the universe and everything to examine life and existence in an attempt to find out the point of it all. Along the way, she interrogates experts on subjects from the big bang to biology and art to artificial intelligence. Really get to the nub of it.","duration":"1:10:00","genre":["Comedy","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2024-12-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gNxxsgs8RaREKmUk4xsvJaKC41g.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zZx5a595bYuNxd8TdoRflxATFML.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gNxxsgs8RaREKmUk4xsvJaKC41g.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zZx5a595bYuNxd8TdoRflxATFML.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":989596,"title":"The Braid","description":"India. Smita is an untouchable. She dreams of seeing her daughter escape her miserable condition and enter school. Italy. Giulia works in her father’s workshop. When he has an accident, she discovers that the family business is ruined. Canada. Sarah, a successful lawyer, is about to be promoted to the head of her firm when she learns that she is ill. Three lives, three women, three continents. Three battles to fight. Although they don’t know each other, Smita, Giulia and Sarah are unknowingly linked by their most intimate and singular bond.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2023-11-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rjLH5lztozxEtLuWhXCMSFpnPt9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tJnYgLeefl3ebgB5mHwSstSRreF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rjLH5lztozxEtLuWhXCMSFpnPt9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tJnYgLeefl3ebgB5mHwSstSRreF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":876716,"title":"Ciao Alberto","description":"With his best friend Luca away at school, Alberto is enjoying his new life in Portorosso working alongside Massimo—the imposing, tattooed, one-armed fisherman of few words—who''s quite possibly the coolest human in the entire world as far as Alberto is concerned. He wants more than anything to impress his mentor, but it''s easier said than done.","duration":"0:07:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2021-11-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3yxXZSnjGKcMt8hSBEU16L0s8oe.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9RKPB9IKDHaTxWQgjkS4IJao08a.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3yxXZSnjGKcMt8hSBEU16L0s8oe.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9RKPB9IKDHaTxWQgjkS4IJao08a.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":53168,"title":"King of Comedy","description":"Wan Tin-Sau is an actor who cannot seem to catch a break, since his only professional jobs are limited to being a movie extra. As well as being an actor, he is also the head of his village''s community center.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1999-02-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/n0bleUycxAsw4tg5fBTijnFrRN2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dmJWvKNgeCrIwJH6AapdSMiZHop.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//n0bleUycxAsw4tg5fBTijnFrRN2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dmJWvKNgeCrIwJH6AapdSMiZHop.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":48282,"title":"Ecce Bombo","description":"Four friends, former 1968 student protesters who have checked out of politics and struggle to come to terms with the present, try self-criticism to figure out what to do with themselves, only to end up doing what they do best: sinking into endless talk without ever reaching a conclusion.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1978-03-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gP1gBa01NNvqmehpxHuZqySxWIq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/c7t4aNyvRkLFVAE4XiPiY2U6RpP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gP1gBa01NNvqmehpxHuZqySxWIq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//c7t4aNyvRkLFVAE4X