_id":11881,"title":"Miracle on 34th Street","description":"Kris Kringle, seemingly the embodiment of Santa Claus, is asked to portray the jolly old fellow at Macy''s following his performance in the Thanksgiving Day parade. His portrayal is so complete that many begin to question if he truly is Santa Claus, while others question his sanity.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Family"],"release_date":"1947-06-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rSnMQ82mFlpBLRt2UvohO6sgemd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vehuIm3y6BeMI7mYjxzaA1H8M0k.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rSnMQ82mFlpBLRt2UvohO6sgemd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vehuIm3y6BeMI7mYjxzaA1H8M0k.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1371185,"title":"Song Sung Blue","description":"Based on a true story, two down-on-their-luck musicians form a joyous Neil Diamond tribute band, proving it''s never too late to find love and follow your dreams.","duration":"2:13:00","genre":["Music","Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2025-12-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8dlna8rRcf5gDCRzEsjtHizpj1X.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xStmzLprgzqjzfvpBI7uTbcRpwQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8dlna8rRcf5gDCRzEsjtHizpj1X.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xStmzLprgzqjzfvpBI7uTbcRpwQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":582014,"title":"Promising Young Woman","description":"A young woman, traumatized by a tragic event in her past, seeks out vengeance against those who crossed her path.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Thriller","Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2020-12-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gESm6yc2MZpSXakgqLF0OlLaRn1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2h4EkRxy36zSsBDkijXSUMJFDaz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gESm6yc2MZpSXakgq