e":"1996-08-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2NU8w8djgX6SzLrg7rN6yMXWAzC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6uosW3xgGk2BnQVq84D3ix5FH2j.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2NU8w8djgX6SzLrg7rN6yMXWAzC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6uosW3xgGk2BnQVq84D3ix5FH2j.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1407,"title":"La Vie en Rose","description":"From the mean streets of the Belleville district of Paris to the dazzling limelight of New York''s most famous concert halls, Edith Piaf''s life was a constant battle to sing and survive, to live and love. Raised in her grandmother''s brothel, Piaf was discovered in 1935 by nightclub owner Louis Leplee, who persuaded her to sing despite her extreme nervousness. Piaf became one of France''s immortal icons, her voice one of the indelible signatures of the 20th century.","duration":"2:20:00","genre":["Music","Drama"],"release_date":"2007-02-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a9t1DRjU04RMzqcp5li9bIA2MaA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3b9DAONAsFRhJKu25R33PE3VwDh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//a9t1DRjU04RMzqcp5li9bIA2MaA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3b9DAONAsFRhJKu25R33PE3VwDh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":877957,"title":"Drifting Home","description":"One fateful summer, a group of elementary school kids set adrift on an abandoned apartment building must look within themselves to find a way back home.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Animation","Fantasy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2022-09-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7id7oE3gqZuO0piWN20Ev7V90wl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iNf1wC8cK6e8zgNyuMUqWFT7Din.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7id7oE3gqZuO0piWN20Ev7V90wl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iNf1wC8cK