rn out to be a warrior named Tapion who had sealed himself inside along with a monster called Hildegarn. Goku must now perfect a new technique to defeat the evil monster.","duration":"0:51:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1995-07-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/b6u42A4TkZzv3TNhZfmfu5bjuFK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7uRu9EA3nie0n2mlVDDLlTI3IzC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//b6u42A4TkZzv3TNhZfmfu5bjuFK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7uRu9EA3nie0n2mlVDDLlTI3IzC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2252,"title":"Eastern Promises","description":"A Russian teenager living in London dies during childbirth but leaves clues in her diary that could tie her child to a rape involving a violent Russian mob family.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Thriller","Crime","Mystery"],"release_date":"2007-09-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1ckHUJ6ztq5XJRKM2nIAW0UjJNH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nLwv1pxRCRZucQaqs6oPkq7HH3K.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1ckHUJ6ztq5XJRKM2nIAW0UjJNH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nLwv1pxRCRZucQaqs6oPkq7HH3K.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1236045,"title":"Animals","description":"When the son of an L.A. mayoral candidate is kidnapped, he and his wife have a few hours to come up with the ransom payment. With most of their money spent on his political campaign, they have to get their hands dirty and expose a side of their lives they never intended to see the light of day.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"2026-10-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tzoarEu7TsG959upiELyYPm5kO9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iISM36voS1E8gX9BM0DVK0kgi3E.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tzoarEu7TsG9