, but that doesn''t mean the fun has to end for Bernard, Nathalie, Gigi, Jerome, Popeye, Jean-Claude, and Christiane.","duration":"1:27:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1979-11-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3EJJClmGZwu7e6nsj1l0OBNdXfT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tEiNHF6SqfguCKBdxwukrK10KbH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3EJJClmGZwu7e6nsj1l0OBNdXfT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tEiNHF6SqfguCKBdxwukrK10KbH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":28808,"title":"Detective Conan: The Last Wizard of the Century","description":"Kaitou Kid dares to challenge the police once more, setting his sights on the Russian Imperial Easter Egg. With the date, time, and place, the Osaka police force scrambles to stop him. But this time, Kid may have bitten off more than he can chew—Conan Edogawa, Heiji Hattori, and numerous others are also trying to get their hands on the jeweled egg.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Adventure","Animation","Crime","Drama","Mystery"],"release_date":"1999-04-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uAzdAGerv6i1XVl4ACfpuoWtq21.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/q2v6JmGMVQR0UhUirXuuzXUcAnN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uAzdAGerv6i1XVl4ACfpuoWtq21.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//q2v6JmGMVQR0UhUirXuuzXUcAnN.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14283,"title":"The Red Violin","description":"300 years of a remarkable musical instrument. Crafted by the Italian master Bussotti (Cecchi) in 1681, the red violin has traveled through Austria, England, China, and Canada, leaving both beauty and tragedy in its wake. In Montreal, Samuel L Jackson plays an appraiser going over its complex history.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Drama","Mystery","Thriller","Music","Romance"],"release_date":"1998-11-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kOpaLjBnfpRqgo4vE9ViIZINt5J.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uPjq8PaNDhFQTzOu4Ce91f6BFgZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kOpaLjBnfpRqgo4vE9ViIZINt5J.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uPjq8PaNDhFQTzOu4Ce91f6BFgZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":3089,"title":"Red River","description":"Following the Civil War, headstrong rancher Thomas Dunson decides to lead a perilous cattle drive from Texas to Missouri. During the exhausting journey, his persistence becomes tyrannical in the eyes of Matthew Garth, his adopted son and protégé.","duration":"2:13:00","genre":["Western","Drama","Adventure"],"release_date":"1948-09-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jnwIO4HasO9APdBaGeMcZi0JFXs.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jyNTsAzrIWB441OtvfbgKtx1kFS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jnwIO4HasO9APdBaGeMcZi0JFXs.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jyNTsAzrIWB441OtvfbgKtx1kFS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":169881,"title":"The Physician","description":"England, 1021: Born in a miserable mining town, Robert Cole swears to become a physician and vanquish disease and death. His harsh path of many years, a quest for knowledge besieged by countless challenges and sacrifices, leads him to the remote Isfahan, in Persia, where he meets Ibn Sina, the greatest healer of his time.","duration":"2:35:00","genre":["Adventure","Drama","History"],"release_date":"2013-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5VuOmxGfqu7yf05q8Q6SUKOh7oe.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/18eJr4Fc4HKymLgKLgGQbD37SPK.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5VuOmxGfqu7yf05q8Q6SUKOh7oe.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//18eJr4Fc4HKymLgKLgGQbD37SPK.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11101,"title":"Stalingrad","description":"A German Platoon is explored through the brutal fighting of the Battle of Stalingrad. After half of their number is wiped out and they''re placed under the command of a sadistic captain, the platoon lieutenant leads his men to desert. The platoon members attempt escape from the city, now surrounded by the Soviet Army.","duration":"2:14:00","genre":["Drama","History","War"],"release_date":"1993-01-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mo2O5ESdB7PWnY3OBS9jjvjeskB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hEHmXFMOBJv5c6Gd5m6mDiLAxsy.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mo2O5ESdB7PWnY3OBS9jjvjeskB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hEHmXFMOBJv5c6Gd5m6mDiLAxsy.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":514575,"title":"A Twelve-Year Night","description":"Uruguay, 1973. Having been crushed by the military dictatorship, surviving members of the Tupamaro guerillas are imprisoned and tortured. They must find a way to endure the coming 12 years.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Drama","Crime","History"],"release_date":"2018-09-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cdGuUnVxlngUNjfl7APfZLrQiZx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/k1SEABHjk34flsBQigm9ygMuUM4.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cdGuUnVxlngUNjfl7APfZLrQiZx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//k1SEABHjk34flsBQigm9ygMuUM4.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":334354,"title":"Windstorm 2","description":"Summer vacation. Mika is overjoyed to see Windstorm again. But then she discovers strange wounds on the belly of Windstorm, for which no one has an explanation. Yet this is Kaltenbach verge of bankruptcy! With a heavy heart Mika decides to participate in a variety tournament in which beckons a high prize money. But during training affects Windstorm distracted, often he runs away easily. Mika pursued the black stallion until deep into the forest and is quite surprised: From the thicket a seemingly magical gray mare appears and the two horses dance around lovingly. Suddenly, a strange boy named Milan appears, who says the mare had escaped him. He claimed that he could Help Mika to win the tournament. But is there still time to save Kaltenbach?","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Family","Adventure","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2015-05-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fPjsLSiD8iXhLX3PaR8USs5Cxkh.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8OBjiVZwjGlYDMG5bGmtJkdpr6B.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fPjsLSiD8iXhLX3PaR8USs5Cxkh.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8OBjiVZwjGlYDMG5bGmtJkdpr6B.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":321594,"title":"Louis C.K.: Live at The Comedy Store","description":"This material was developed and prepared over the last year or so, mostly in comedy clubs. This special kind of goes back to when he used to just make noises and be funny for no particular reason. It felt right to him to shoot this special in a club to give it that live immediate intimate feeling. The show is about an hour long. The opening act, who is seen at the beginning (good place for an opening act) is Jay London. One of his favorite club comics going way back to the late 80s when he first started in working in New York.","duration":"1:06:00","genre":["Comedy","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2015-01-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/b0gVgI3ptWba6xME5rmCuvFVw0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9ULqaND2rzNFL4OAxCbSrY7UWem.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//b0gVgI3ptWba6xME5rmCuvFVw0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9ULqaND2rzNFL4OAxCbSrY7UWem.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9502,"title":"Kung Fu Panda","description":"Chosen by prophecy but doubted by all, Po is an unlikely choice for the mystical title of the Dragon Warrior—a clumsy panda thrust into the world of kung fu as a deadly enemy threatens t