as Howie’s religious views clash with those of the island’s residents.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Horror"],"release_date":"1973-12-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qhPuXbHCIbE94doMxYsY2W3wMry.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wwtrXRL8SiOWxhwLEvw7iBgYh0g.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qhPuXbHCIbE94doMxYsY2W3wMry.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wwtrXRL8SiOWxhwLEvw7iBgYh0g.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9065,"title":"Europa","description":"In 1945 Germany, following the end of World War II, Leopold Kessler, an American of German descent, is hired by his uncle as a sleeping car conductor on the Zentropa train line. Leopold''s wish is to be neutral to the ongoing purges of loyalists by Allied forces and do what he can to help a hurting country, but ultimately finds himself being used by both sides.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1991-06-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9vOfO3CP8mqqq0oqCNl9R7M07xE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pyFtuYQReoSmhNs55kRJedA5wEJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9vOfO3CP8mqqq0oqCNl9R7M07xE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pyFtuYQReoSmhNs55kRJedA5wEJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":7979,"title":"The Kite Runner","description":"After spending years in California, Amir returns to his homeland in Afghanistan to help his old friend Hassan, whose son is in trouble.","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2007-12-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/CAC2F6C6R8hZ3AoByDX6Jj2VOw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dom2esWWW8C9jS2v7dOhW48LwHh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//CAC2F6C6R8hZ3AoByDX6Jj2VOw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dom2esWWW8C9jS2v7dOhW48LwHh.jpg"},{