-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sPantp0oQ9idos7Jdwko2r6ZOIa.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3K93GWotLXe4FqpErri0xkpLaD5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sPantp0oQ9idos7Jdwko2r6ZOIa.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3K93GWotLXe4FqpErri0xkpLaD5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":29453,"title":"The Magician","description":"A traveling magician and his troupe arrive in a Swedish town in the 1840s, where their act is scrutinized by local authorities and a skeptical medical official. Their stay leads to a series of confrontations that test the boundaries between performance, belief, and deception.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1958-12-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eEPY5W9ZSMHk48kaowcRNbzCilf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/46DEYkr96MxzUmdwgmj2U7gWokZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eEPY5W9ZSMHk48kaowcRNbzCilf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//46DEYkr96MxzUmdwgmj2U7gWokZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15157,"title":"Another Cinderella Story","description":"A guy who danced with what could be the girl of his dreams at a costume ball only has one hint at her identity: the Zune she left behind as she rushed home in order to make her curfew. And with a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity in front of him, he sets out to find his masked beauty.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Music","Comedy","Romance","Family"],"release_date":"2008-09-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bR0GpnGUCN7uxRmXtnJr9s19Jrb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bW957WNXiiUvIGFaUVL7wMeD776.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bR0GpnGUCN7uxRmXtnJr9s19Jrb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bW957WNXiiUvIGFaUVL7wMeD776.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11901,"title":"High Plains Drifter","