403,"title":"Caro diario","description":"Nanni Moretti recounts in his diary three slice-of-life stories marked by a dry, ironic gaze: in the first, he rides his Vespa through a deserted, sun-drenched summertime Rome; in the second, he visits a reclusive friend on an island, who ropes him into an impromptu journey between islets in search of quiet; and in the last, he finds himself grappling with an unknown illness.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1993-11-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dsMqUvdYGeXSky9cQO26JJOhFZa.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fpuOq1YN7LHjctGFniOK8OPnwgs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dsMqUvdYGeXSky9cQO26JJOhFZa.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fpuOq1YN7LHjctGFniOK8OPnwgs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9504,"title":"Glengarry Glen Ross","description":"An examination of the machinations behind the scenes at a real estate office. Unscrupulous salesmen try to hawk dubious real estate to suckers.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Mystery"],"release_date":"1992-09-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qukaw3P4MOFNdxjhNpClhT9unr8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zcaEDx8KlVfh4vKfMNLhiSi5Oz4.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qukaw3P4MOFNdxjhNpClhT9unr8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zcaEDx8KlVfh4vKfMNLhiSi5Oz4.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":7452,"title":"The Cook, the Thief, His Wife & Her Lover","description":"When churlish mobster Albert Spica acquires an upscale French restaurant in London, he dines there nightly, effectively scaring off the clientele with his bad manners. His wife, Georgina, is especially disgusted by him, and soon begins an affair with regular guest Michael. Despite their best efforts to keep it secret, Spica learns about their trysts, and he plots a terrible revenge.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"1989-10-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rzaf3eCT8pVCGvuS7P8g2nPitqC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/15xMqAnFsROopAT66zdRyu2Dtek.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rzaf3eCT8pVCGvuS7P8g2nPitqC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//15xMqAnFsROopAT66zdRyu2Dtek.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":874,"title":"A Man for All Seasons","description":"A depiction of the conflict between King Henry VIII of England and his Lord Chancellor, Sir Thomas More, who refuses to swear the Oath of Supremacy declaring Henry Supreme Head of the Church in England.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"1966-12-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/o8Pc05f7zwgZCLrcfqszHWEQF0w.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kcwcqMitcnRO1SySlX1HKVn7yUV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//o8Pc05f7zwgZCLrcfqszHWEQF0w.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kcwcqMitcnRO1SySlX1HKVn7yUV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":134,"title":"O Brother, Where Art Thou?","description":"In the deep south during the 1930s, three escaped convicts search for hidden treasure while a relentless lawman pursues them.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Adventure","Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"2000-08-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rbsm633lnt3hKHEpk7FOt3dy82a.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2YztYilviFCYcEtDAnrOstUWGie.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rbsm633lnt3hKHEpk7FOt3dy82a.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2YztYilviFCYcEtDAnrOstUWGie.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":638449,"title":"The Last Letter from Your Lover","description":"A young journalist in London becomes obsessed with a series of letters she discovers that recounts an intense star-crossed love affair from the 1960s.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2021-07-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AmzVV7kqds8BJBXwnQtx5YpqFdU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fDKK51YdOfu9pTmSRw7sHUhGFxm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AmzVV7kqds8BJBXwnQtx5YpqFdU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fDKK51YdOfu9pTmSRw7sHUhGFxm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":522369,"title":"Sorry We Missed You","description":"Hoping that self-employment through gig economy can solve their financial woes, a hard-up delivery driver and his wife struggling to raise a family end up trapped in the vicious circle of modern-day labour exploitation.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2019-10-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bO7uK55yHE7hZobRN798rytCQuq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jNvlqNDnXH8aqBeiBxNNP0wWWO3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bO7uK55yHE7hZobRN798rytCQuq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jNvlqNDnXH8aqBeiBxNNP0wWWO3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":508947,"title":"Turning Red","description":"Thirteen-year-old Mei is experiencing the awkwardness of being a teenager with a twist – when she gets too excited, she transforms into a giant red panda.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Comedy","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2022-03-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fOy2Jurz9k6RnJnMUMRDAgBwru2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qsdjk9oAKSQMWs0Vt5Pyfh6O4GZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fOy2Jurz9k6RnJnMUMRDAgBwru2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qsdjk9oAKSQMWs0Vt5Pyfh6O4GZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13008,"title":"An American Crime","description":"The true story of suburban housewife Gertrude Baniszewski, who kept a teenage girl locked in the basement of her Indiana home during the 1960s.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Horror"],"release_date":"2007-07-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7Ww2p8mXVVOyj3RLKRg6GzeYIAv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/de8angoHVE5GHcK0OO37D4pMkkJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7Ww2p8mXVVOyj3RLKRg6GzeYIAv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//de8angoHVE5GHcK0OO37D4pMkkJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12776,"title":"Johnny Stecchino","description":"Good hearted but not very wordly-wise, Dante is happy driving the school bus for a group of mentally handicapped children, while feeling he is somehow missing out on life and love. So he is very excited when after nearly being knocked down by her car he meets Maria, who seems immediately enamoured of him. He is soon invited to her sumptuous Palermo villa, little suspecting that this is part of a plot. He bears an amazing likeness to Maria''s stool-pigeon gangster husband and it would be convenient for them if the mobster, in the shape of Dante, was seen to be dead and buried.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1991-10-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aKNctt6HWvN152JQUf7JrbVxuQg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5scWsRsH5MUJEgXB52w0fM6I2gM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aKNctt6HWvN152JQUf7JrbVxuQg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5scWsRsH5MUJEgXB52w0fM6I2gM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9837,"title":"The Prince of Egypt","description":"The strong bond between two Royal Egyptian brothers is challenged when their chosen responsibilities set them at odds, with extraordinary consequences.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Adventure","Animation","Drama","Family"],"release_date":"1998-12-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/565DYYXgdRYMiETLi2EDx4p7s92.jp