ne he left behind; Roman civil servant Furio''s relentless nitpicking threatens to push his wife Magda over the edge; young Mimmo''s journey is repeatedly interrupted by concerns about his grandmother''s health.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1981-02-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kjxnYiITXakTCeu2Ob8JIidGrAe.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tS5ca077KEMbJHBVNLa1nCnycXJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kjxnYiITXakTCeu2Ob8JIidGrAe.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tS5ca077KEMbJHBVNLa1nCnycXJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11673,"title":"Cyrano de Bergerac","description":"Famed swordsman and poet Cyrano de Bergerac is in love with his cousin Roxane. He has never expressed his love for her as he his large nose undermines his self-confidence. Then he finds a way to express his love to her, indirectly.","duration":"2:17:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","History","Romance"],"release_date":"1990-03-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bvpYJgsC5jcMJd43HRHXUQw7j5O.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/80XJ5UkGuYTKDuALeG03BLk1OT1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bvpYJgsC5jcMJd43HRHXUQw7j5O.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//80XJ5UkGuYTKDuALeG03BLk1OT1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11305,"title":"Mystery Train","description":"In Memphis, Tennessee, over the course of a single night, the Arcade Hotel, run by an eccentric night clerk and a clueless bellboy, is visited by a young Japanese couple traveling in search of the roots of rock; an Italian woman in mourning who stumbles upon a fleeing charlatan girl; and a comical trio of accidental thieves looking for a place to hide.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1989-09-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/t0GxYLiPkTtFBuzoPLmLU3HSKEN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/f11xq7dBGhz9UDc3dabldAGeXVH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//t0GxYLiPkTtFBuzoPLmLU3HSKEN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//f11xq7dBGhz9UDc3dabldAGeXVH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11197,"title":"Evil","description":"Stockholm, in the 1950s.  Erik is expelled from the local school for getting into one brawl too many. To protect Erik from his violent stepfather’s reaction to his expulsion, Erik''s mother arranges for Erik to spend a year at Stjärnsberg Boarding School, the only school willing to accept him. This is Erik''s last chance to graduate to Upper School and he promises his mother, for his and her sake, to do all he can to stay out of trouble.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2003-09-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2EIiauBZJspEHEJQeSw7OvrFG3d.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1qqI4qh3VP7jUBRTGsIxh1miNKJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2EIiauBZJspEHEJQeSw7OvrFG3d.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1qqI4qh3VP7jUBRTGsIxh1miNKJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4034,"title":"That Man from Rio","description":"French military man Adrien Dufourquet gets an eight-day furlough to visit his fiancée, Agnès. But when he arrives in Paris, he learns that her late father''s partner, museum curator Professor Catalan, has just been kidnapped by a group of Amazon tribesmen who have also stolen a priceless statue from the museum. Adrien and Agnès pursue the kidnappers to Brazil, where they learn that the statue is the key to a hidden Amazon treasure.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Adventure","Action","Comedy"],"release_date":"1964-02-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1oziVuVtJc7BgHRCVLhVJ53u9u3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AhaUqqHTIMSXG6WOMRCreitQ1ZX.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p