_face/zprLOtwwjjTF84YOGIZxakRu9Mc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8cg1VtHc2fdiRJYchbvvo2srswZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zprLOtwwjjTF84YOGIZxakRu9Mc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":31685,"title":"The Hunchback of Notre Dame","description":"Paris, France, 1482. Frollo, Chief Justice of benevolent King Louis XI, gets infatuated by the beauty of Esmeralda, a young Romani girl. The hunchback Quasimodo, Frollo''s protege and bell-ringer of Notre Dame, lives in peace among the bells in the heights of the immense cathedral until he is involved by the twisted magistrate in his malicious plans to free himself from Esmeralda''s alleged spell, which he believes to be the devil''s work.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Horror"],"release_date":"1939-08-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mt1RJGw7LvAoIGflIqYG87u84Xq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/m6fsyHeqSQs4tktk9q3awgo7IzF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mt1RJGw7LvAoIGflIqYG87u84Xq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//m6fsyHeqSQs4tktk9q3awgo7IzF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":88,"title":"Dirty Dancing","description":"Expecting the usual tedium that accompanies a summer in the Catskills with her family, 17-year-old Frances ''Baby'' Houseman is surprised to find herself stepping into the shoes of a professional hoofer—and unexpectedly falling in love.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Drama","Music","Romance"],"release_date":"1987-08-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6iDQCBUSZKzY8Rnu8ECwl2gXcfG.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9Jw6jys7q9gjzVX5zm1z0gC8gY9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6iDQCBUSZKzY8Rnu8ECwl2gXcfG.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9Jw6jys7q9gjzVX5zm1z0gC8gY9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1127110,"title":"Diablo","description":"Ex-con Kris Chaney seizes the daughter of a Colombian gangster to fulfill a noble promise to the young girl''s mother. When her father enlists both the criminal underworld and a psychotic killer to exact his revenge, Kris relies on everything he''s ever learned to stay alive and keep his word.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2025-06-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5AB4EfS39K7aQYtUim0CFfKBU6r.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uFQduVyYIinJy3eLjozgfl6Xtcn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5AB4EfS39K7aQYtUim0CFfKBU6r.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uFQduVyYIinJy3eLjozgfl6Xtcn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":615643,"title":"Minari","description":"A Korean American family moves to an Arkansas farm in search of its own American dream. Amidst the challenges of this new life in the strange and rugged Ozarks, they discover the undeniable resilience of family and what really makes a home.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2021-02-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bKCpRjjTKcr3KAITmwjVMobbBYg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6mPNdmjdbVKPITv3LLCmQoKs9Zw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bKCpRjjTKcr3KAITmwjVMobbBYg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6mPNdmjdbVKPITv3LLCmQoKs9Zw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":242643,"title":"Batman: Assault on Arkham","description":"Batman works desperately to find a bomb planted by the Joker while Amanda Waller sends her newly-formed Suicide Squad to break into Arkham Asylum and recover vital information stolen by the Riddler.","duration":"1:16:00","genre":["Thriller","Animation","Action","Crime"],"release_date":"2014-08-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9AciCs5rFHvFbCIqThfq281sUOw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/b9KxvIAZkl2f5