tic teenage girl with powerful martial arts skills, gets money to pay for her sick mother Zin''s treatment by seeking out all the people who owe Zin money and making them pay.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Action","Crime"],"release_date":"2008-02-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/umEjgwcWIjWHoxrKTS8QPMMJjDz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/t6G2SGFZArIkMibcpGV9K8ke7rV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//umEjgwcWIjWHoxrKTS8QPMMJjDz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//t6G2SGFZArIkMibcpGV9K8ke7rV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1061474,"title":"Superman","description":"Superman, a journalist in Metropolis, embarks on a journey to reconcile his Kryptonian heritage with his human upbringing as Clark Kent.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Adventure","Action"],"release_date":"2025-07-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yRBc6WY3r1Fz5Cjd6DhSvzqunED.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ldyfo0BKmz5rWtJJKCvwaNS4cJT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yRBc6WY3r1Fz5Cjd6DhSvzqunED.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ldyfo0BKmz5rWtJJKCvwaNS4cJT.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":705996,"title":"Decision to Leave","description":"From a mountain peak in South Korea, a man plummets to his death. Did he jump, or was he pushed? When detective Hae-joon arrives on the scene, he begins to suspect the dead man’s wife Seo-rae. But as he digs deeper into the investigation, he finds himself trapped in a web of deception and desire.","duration":"2:19:00","genre":["Thriller","Mystery","Romance"],"release_date":"2022-06-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/y7efrL5RlIRsGfrhcaiP35V1x2g.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zI8KZ4EdLUymWKX1YEkpZ0gtPUa.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//y7efrL5RlIRsGfrhcaiP35V1x2g.