 the balance of night and day in great peril. Now with the help of a wax-child named Glim and the warrior, Sohone who also became the Sun Guardian, they go out on an exciting journey to get the Sun back and restore the Moon to their rightful place in the sky.","duration":"1:26:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2015-02-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oqblGh9vRXFBV9Auu8St5i50njr.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fWjm8AH9YqkRUR2yf4y1mDIvj0O.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oqblGh9vRXFBV9Auu8St5i50njr.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fWjm8AH9YqkRUR2yf4y1mDIvj0O.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":112198,"title":"What''s in a Name","description":"Vincent, a wealthy real estate agent, is invited to dinner by his sister Elizabeth and her husband Peter, both professors in Paris. Claude, a childhood friend and trombonist in a symphony orchestra, is also present. Vincent brings news from the prenatal examination of his and his wife Anna''s unborn son.  The name chosen by the soon-to-be parents strongly offends the others for many reasons. The dispute between the guests quickly escalates and before long the resurgence of old grudges and hidden secrets is unavoidable...","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2012-04-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ll1d1AXoQganpzphgUVuWGo3Nmi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5xKkDkv506CiSp99SxmHLsnaoFs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ll1d1AXoQganpzphgUVuWGo3Nmi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5xKkDkv506CiSp99SxmHLsnaoFs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":79464,"title":"Rockstar","description":"College student Janardhan is a simpleton who desperately seeks inspiration for the musician inside him. Although heartbreak helps him reach his goal, it also leads him to self-destruction.","duration":"2:39:00","genre":["Drama","Music","Romance"],"release_date":"2011-11-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3UseBwzKsUmMN37XcahJSVYRWkf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cJZC9riwrdATBUonkZJZD6y9g40.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3UseBwzKsUmMN37XcahJSVYRWkf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cJZC9riwrdATBUonkZJZD6y9g40.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":54138,"title":"Star Trek Into Darkness","description":"When the crew of the Enterprise is called back home, they find an unstoppable force of terror from within their own organization has detonated the fleet and everything it stands for, leaving our world in a state of crisis.  With a personal score to settle, Captain Kirk leads a manhunt to a war-zone world to capture a one man weapon of mass destruction. As our heroes are propelled into an epic chess game of life and death, love will be challenged, friendships will be torn apart, and sacrifices must be made for the only family Kirk has left: his crew.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2013-05-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/npDrIM6ZbuD7nUxI7ZzNBxs4IRF.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/Aim3kVNh1MPIxPEFeJrl9e9Uf1a.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//npDrIM6ZbuD7nUxI7ZzNBxs4IRF.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//Aim3kVNh1MPIxPEFeJrl9e9Uf1a.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":25623,"title":"House","description":"Hoping to find a sense of connection to her late mother, Gorgeous takes a trip with her friends to visit her aunt''s ancestral house in the countryside. The girls soon discover that there is more to the old house than meets the eye.","duration":"1:28:00","genre":["Comedy","Fantasy","Horror"],"release_date":"1977-08-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5040XNTvwARvLq1KtfCgJXBj3LC.jpg",