 dead. Back home, brother Tommy steps in to look over Sam’s wife, Grace, and two children. Sam’s surprise homecoming triggers domestic mayhem.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","War"],"release_date":"2009-12-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xERofiEyzGekTNi3oIppQvdLDZB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/skHqceAFYee0JZuYd9MVk2IQggi.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xERofiEyzGekTNi3oIppQvdLDZB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//skHqceAFYee0JZuYd9MVk2IQggi.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":3131,"title":"Gangs of New York","description":"In early 1860s New York, Irish immigrant Amsterdam Vallon is released from prison and returns to the Five Points, seeking revenge against his father''s killer, William Cutting, a powerful anti-immigrant gang leader. He knows that revenge can only be attained by infiltrating Cutting''s inner circle. Vallon''s journey becomes a fight for personal survival and to find a place for the Irish people.","duration":"2:48:00","genre":["Drama","History","Crime"],"release_date":"2002-12-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/p8yXQse3IDZiwEjWRHda3EzDQjA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lemqKtcCuAano5aqrzxYiKC8kkn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//p8yXQse3IDZiwEjWRHda3EzDQjA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lemqKtcCuAano5aqrzxYiKC8kkn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":3063,"title":"Duck Soup","description":"Rufus T. Firefly is named president/dictator of bankrupt Freedonia and declares war on neighboring Sylvania over the love of wealthy Mrs. Teasdale.","duration":"1:08:00","genre":["Comedy","War"],"release_date":"1933-11-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nVpp3ZcIFtJJ3fJp65eJczehIN8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/31t63plEGKHhYuuCpC9bFWO9SBS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nVpp3ZcIFtJJ3fJp65eJczehIN8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//31t63plEGKHhYuuCpC9bFWO9SBS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2798,"title":"Oscar","description":"This film originated as a play in Paris. The story focuses on the one-day adventures of Bertrand Barnier played with a genius of French cinema, Louis de Funes. In the same morning he learns that his daughter is pregnant, an employee stole a large amount of money from his company, his maid is about to resign in order to marry a wealthy neighbor and his body builder is interested in marrying his daughter. The seemingly complicated story-line is full of comedy or errors and some of the most hilarious mime scenes of the French cinema.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1967-10-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/k0hmRQYWTxc3TvQ7QuvYt2wXZvA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/imsP4Vl1UpsLf27DPxX1atIubBB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//k0hmRQYWTxc3TvQ7QuvYt2wXZvA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//imsP4Vl1UpsLf27DPxX1atIubBB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2977,"title":"Becoming Jane","description":"Though young Jane Austen''s financially strapped parents expect her to marry the nephew of wealthy Lady Gresham, Jane herself knows that such a union will destroy her creativity and sense of self-worth. Instead, she becomes involved with Tom Lefroy, a charming but penniless apprentice lawyer who gives her the knowledge of the heart she needs for her future career as a novelist.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2007-03-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/r95IP56O3j8fz9a09x55lymr9uJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yHA6JEn57MBGp2yGFgYyopJvk2O.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//r95IP56O3j8fz9a09x55lymr9uJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yHA6JEn57MBGp2yGFgYyopJvk2O.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1116,"title":"The Wind That Shakes the Barley","description":"In 1920s Ireland young doctor Damien O''Donovan prepares to depart for a new job in a London hospital. As he says his goodbyes at a friend''s farm, British Black and Tans arrive, and a young man is killed. Damien joins his brother Teddy in the Irish Republican Army, but political events are soon set in motion that tear the brothers apart.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Drama","War"],"release_date":"2006-06-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fKrFGB96kVeJ9uE83Jc4fIWBgqO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yCb4LweL6U7KTgSda3Wb7vHiA9J.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fKrFGB96kVeJ9uE83Jc4fIWBgqO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yCb4LweL6U7KTgSda3Wb7vHiA9J.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":57892,"title":"Vizontele","description":"The story takes place in the small town of Hakkari in Turkey at the beginning of the ''70s. The time has come to bring technology to that small town. The first Television (called Visiontele by the citizens) arrives and the chaos begins.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2001-02-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wRMnG0b5LVS9qZC27xn4azcEh43.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wbULza7DtchFu3bZKlroJsCVVh8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wRMnG0b5LVS9qZC27xn4azcEh43.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wbULza7DtchFu3bZKlroJsCVVh8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10312,"title":"Patch Adams","description":"The true story of Dr. Hunter \"Patch\" Adams, who in the 1970s found that humor is the best medicine, and was willing to do just anything to make his patients laugh—even if it meant risking his own career.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1998-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sPGgJ0w1oCVPBOW41dN0hpMouhI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xN1aKur5ddWQSXTqvzDPJD2TCxe.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sPGgJ0w1oCVPBOW41dN0hpMouhI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xN1aKur5ddWQSXTqvzDPJD2TCxe.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1405,"title":"Greed","description":"When housewife Trina wins the lottery, her comfortable life with her dentist husband John slowly deteriorates, in part by her own increasing paranoia and partly by the machinations of villainous acquaintance Marcus.","duration":"2:20:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"1924-12-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zc5vjonSbXUUazuQSi0R2bUfWNP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eur2vc2BGiOocBuBLVPXySO7lRh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zc5vjonSbXUUazuQSi0R2bUfWNP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eur2vc2BGiOocBuBLVPXySO7lRh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":866,"title":"Finding Neverland","description":"During a writing slump, playwright J.M. Barrie meets a widow and her four children, all young boys—who soon become an important part of Barrie’s life and the inspiration that lead him to create his masterpiece. Peter Pan.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Drama","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2004-10-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ursbJ6xP9YnmtlTFKf77KPxmw7U.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/A9jgLICNCEb3lvWdNaIKAG9pRdp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ursbJ6xP9YnmtlTFKf77KPxmw7U.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//A9jgLICNCEb3lvWdNaIKAG9pRdp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":470,"title":"21 Grams","description":"Paul Rivers, an ailing mathematician lovelessly married to an English émigré; Christina Peck, an upper-middle-class suburban housewife and mother of two girls; and Jack Jordan, a born-again ex-con, are brought together by a terrible accident that changes their lives.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Drama","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2003-11-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5SgrtPH6kBmmHao0PofxpvOYfWC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wZ0l6or5juuVWqDkLEgaghs4f9l.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5SgrtPH6kBmmHao0PofxpvOYfWC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wZ0l6or5juuVWqDkLEgaghs4f9l.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":614587,"title":"Lupin III: The First","description":"The iconic \"gentleman thief\" Lupin III returns in an action-packed, continent-spanning adventure, as Lupin III and his colorful underworld companions race to uncover the secrets of the mysterious Bresson Diary, before it falls into the hands of a dark cabal that will stop at nothing to resurrect the Third Reich.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Adventure","Animation","Comedy","Crime","Mystery"],"release_date":"2019-12-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sk5KCRdQ0GVP6fngh03PVkRMBb6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yEKzkOF0uImcs4CdhPQpF8TwVDE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sk5KCRdQ0GVP6fngh03PVkRMBb6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yEKzkOF0uImcs4CdhPQpF8TwVDE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":469651,"title":"What Will People Say","description":"Sixteen year-old Nisha lives a double life. At home with her family she is the perfect Pakistani daughter, but when out with her friends, she is a normal Norwegian teenager. When her father catches her in bed with her boyfriend, Nisha''s two worlds brutally collide. To set an example, Nisha''s parents decide to kidnap her and place her with relatives in Pakistan. Here, in a country she has never been to before, Nisha is forced to adapt to her parents'' culture.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2017-10-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ro5WQZrjuDZpoZ0FaYjNVtFDpzu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3aUuot6sJCQqk1bK4UYPs8omMId.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ro5WQZrjuDZpoZ0FaYjNVtFDpzu.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3aUuot6sJCQqk1bK4UYPs8omMId.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11943,"title":"Jeremiah Johnson","description":"While slowly adapting to the grueling life of a mountain man in the Rocky Mountains, Jeremiah Johnson encounters the Crow and Flathead tribes as well as hunters, trappers and settlers, all of whom call these mountains home.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Western"],"release_date":"1972-09-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gSFkUGrgCSDDQpsQ6HbrEQ41tMl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fANj1S3UmBB51wnKxYRKtw8LMBn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gSFkUGrgCSDDQpsQ6HbrEQ41tMl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fANj1S3UmBB51wnKxYRKtw8LMBn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10669,"title":"Deliverance","description":"Intent on seeing the Cahulawassee River before it''s turned into one huge lake, outdoor fanatic Lewis Medlock takes his friends on a river-rafting trip they''ll never forget into the dangerous American back-country.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Drama","Adventure","Thriller"],"release_date":"1972-08-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aaqbyTRo1bZB34ZdjeWyqnL0qz0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2TrAzNJlHyNYYSkQf6asg3rs2Xr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aaqbyTRo1bZB34ZdjeWyqnL0qz0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2TrAzNJlHyNYYSkQf6asg3rs2Xr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":132363,"title":"The Butler","description":"Cecil Gaines was a sharecropper''s son who grew up in the 1920s as a domestic servant for the white family who casually destroyed his. Eventually striking out on his own, Cecil becomes a hotel valet of such efficiency and discreteness in the 1950s that he becomes a butler in the White House itself. There, Cecil would serve numerous US Presidents over the decades as a passive witness of history with the American Civil Rights Movement gaining momentum even as his family has troubles of its own. As his wife, Gloria, struggles with alcoholism and his defiant eldest son, Louis, strives for a just world, Cecil must decide whether he should take action in his own way.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2013-08-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/g0nLh5eQjTcffJUavvatBNkaSpy.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pAi8Bl3ZKX6pANPVhNwbhbQANop.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//g0nLh5eQjTcffJUavvatBNkaSpy.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pAi8Bl3ZKX6pANPVhNwbhbQANop.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":45612,"title":"Source Code","description":"When decorated soldier Captain Colter Stevens wakes up in the body of an unknown man, he discovers he''s part of a mission to find the bomber of a Chicago commuter train.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Thriller","Science Fiction","Mystery"],"release_date":"2011-03-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mDb4uku4zEElsITXDpbir4fR0HW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nTr0lvAzeQmUjgSgDEHTJpnrxTz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mDb4uku4zEElsITXDpbir4fR0HW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nTr0lvAzeQmUjgSgDEHTJpnrxTz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":228,"title":"The Blue Angel","description":"Prim professor Immanuel Rath finds some of his students ogling racy photos of cabaret performer Lola Lola and visits a local club, The Blue Angel, in an attempt to catch them there. Seeing Lola perform, the teacher is filled with lust, eventually resigning his position at the school to marry the young woman. However, his marriage to a coquette -- whose job is to entice men -- proves to be more difficult than Rath imagined.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1930-04-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jLvlD6ABDESFfYl3F1TqCoiBaig.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/khz2rKLAPDVu9auJt1sR1HO9SCG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jLvlD6ABDESFfYl3F1TqCoiBaig.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//khz2rKLAPDVu9auJt1sR1HO9SCG.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":604605,"title":"Hello World","description":"A shy high schooler in Kyoto meets a man claiming to be his future self, who tells him he’s hacked into the past to save their first love.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Animation","Romance","Science Fiction","Drama"],"release_date":"2019-09-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cXEZWZSxiD7w96p1sCd23FL2O9y.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vmizP4G4EWsxNf6PLOvGNaFJ89Y.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cXEZWZSxiD7w96p1sCd23FL2O9y.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vmizP4G4EWsxNf6PLOvGNaFJ89Y.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":400617,"title":"Phantom Thread","description":"In 1950s London, a renowned dressmaker''s meticulous lifestyle begins drastically changing as his relationship with his young muse intensifies.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2017-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sJZd1H4cl2Nxhj0nutVCK5pMczL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hgoWjp9Sh0MI97eAMZCnIoVfgvq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sJZd1H4cl2Nxhj0nutVCK5pMczL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hgoWjp9Sh0MI97eAMZCnIoVfgvq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":165904,"title":"Special 26","description":"During the 1980s in India, a group of con artists rob businessmen and politicians by conducting fake raids, posing as officers of the CBI or Income Tax Department . They plan to execute their biggest con as a final job while a relentless cop is on their trail.","duration":"2:24:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2013-02-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yQxYnMCIsjd0rXm5hyXZzmE549O.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cOo6lOiZXO0zldPKsih9asKPWDo.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yQxYnMCIsjd0rXm5hyXZzmE549O.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cOo6lOiZXO0zldPKsih9asKPWDo.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":17111,"title":"Shutter","description":"When Jane and Tun run over a girl in a car accident, they speed away immediately from the crime scene. However, Tun, a photographer, soon discovers strange shadows in his photos, which unsettles them.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Horror","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2004-09-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cX48taTcXP2oGXPvka8QFa4f4Qb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7Tq7SrB14r3WpjJQOldbDHQk89J.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cX48taTcXP2oGXPvka8QFa4f4Qb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7Tq7SrB14r3WpjJQOldbDHQk89J.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4543,"title":"Monty Python''s The Meaning of Life","description":"Life''s questions are ''answered'' in a series of outrageous vignettes, beginning with a staid London insurance company which transforms before our eyes into a pirate ship. Then there''s the National Health doctors who try to claim a healthy liver from a still-living donor. The world''s most voracious glutton brings the art of vomiting to new heights before his spectacular demise.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1983-03-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eIcJq4QDmToJeu4g6fS4iLPKY8n.jpg","p