 murdered and his mother now marrying the murderer... his uncle. Meanwhile, war is brewing.","duration":"4:02:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1996-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9kkzRKwGKTVWNFBMruCT3RKUrzx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ilurgUOp6SCl4cuhfjctj1qxlfZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9kkzRKwGKTVWNFBMruCT3RKUrzx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ilurgUOp6SCl4cuhfjctj1qxlfZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":704,"title":"A Hard Day''s Night","description":"Capturing John Lennon, Paul McCartney, George Harrison and Ringo Starr in their electrifying element, ''A Hard Day''s Night'' is a wildly irreverent journey through this pastiche of a day in the life of The Beatles during 1964. The band have to use all their guile and wit to avoid the pursuing fans and press to reach their scheduled television performance, in spite of Paul''s troublemaking grandfather and Ringo''s arrest.","duration":"1:28:00","genre":["Comedy","Music"],"release_date":"1964-07-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9hWiNbvLR3nPDanTdEWOc4EeBGp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6Ulsccp2VkaVU5qbya3bxm9JG4x.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9hWiNbvLR3nPDanTdEWOc4EeBGp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6Ulsccp2VkaVU5qbya3bxm9JG4x.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":177,"title":"The Fisher King","description":"Two troubled men face their terrible destinies and events of their past as they join together on a mission to find the Holy Grail and thus to save themselves.","duration":"2:18:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1991-09-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3NyCi98Y2lqLawrV41kNCcyo6Ab.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hwIYw22HmAUMobV4zsX69MgfVUz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3NyCi