unters a strange Native American man who prepares him for his journey into the spiritual world.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Drama","Fantasy","Western"],"release_date":"1995-12-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a7DtgKB187dUm9n81IlvNzVXsK1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jX3wGBVoYoAY3IixBpwYk1fjT4z.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//a7DtgKB187dUm9n81IlvNzVXsK1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jX3wGBVoYoAY3IixBpwYk1fjT4z.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1101412,"title":"Fall 2: Deadpoint","description":"On a perilous climb across Thailand''s Mount Kwan, two climbers become trapped thousands of feet above the ground, where vertigo-inducing heights, sheer exposure, and impossible odds turn every moment into a fight for survival.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Thriller"],"release_date":"2026-09-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yBDxqDB29kpH9VojTytjGWBgmdJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fgSm5ylwiXbIHn8UbUXDjk9RRu4.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yBDxqDB29kpH9VojTytjGWBgmdJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fgSm5ylwiXbIHn8UbUXDjk9RRu4.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":486947,"title":"The Guilty","description":"Police officer Asger Holm, demoted to desk work as an alarm dispatcher, answers a call from a panicked woman who claims to have been kidnapped. Confined to the police station and with the phone as his only tool, Asger races against time to get help and find her.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"2018-02-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wXZ2JmuQq58E9A4OcP9e8yeKFGR.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/42QPG6p7oLcLd4LQOPeSTLhqfMx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wXZ2JmuQq58E9A4OcP9e8yeKFGR.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmd