b.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5dwlH8Krm2bsuc2Pubw2cBb03g5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tCrB8pcjadZjsDk7rleGJaIv78k.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5dwlH8Krm2bsuc2Pubw2cBb03g5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tCrB8pcjadZjsDk7rleGJaIv78k.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10501,"title":"The Road to El Dorado","description":"Stowing away after a failed con, a pair of swindlers end up on El Dorado, the fabled \"city of gold\", where they quickly get in over their heads when they are mistaken as gods by the inhabitants.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Family","Adventure","Animation","Comedy","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2000-03-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ciM5RFsBoWEj0tbwJy42Hr76iRd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tQuqhUBACMcGqCvliHxpJreBfXC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ciM5RFsBoWEj0tbwJy42Hr76iRd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tQuqhUBACMcGqCvliHxpJreBfXC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1397364,"title":"La Grazia","description":"As his tenure as President of Italy nears its end, Mariano De Santis faces wrenching decisions-both political and deeply personal. Amid these moral quandaries, he must confront his own conscience and seek guidance from those closest to him, including his confidante and daughter, Dorotea.","duration":"2:13:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2025-12-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/baIjN7xPyw2In1CuHACTgzcsF20.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lnPGzi7BNc17WtxXso16CjNjT5K.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//baIjN7xPyw2In1CuHACTgzcsF20.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lnPGzi7BNc17WtxXso16CjNjT5K.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1223601,"title":"Sisu: Road to Revenge","description":"Returning to the house where his family was brutally murdered during the war, \"the man who refuses to die\" dismantles it, loads it on a truck, and is determined to rebuild it somewhere safe in their honor. When the commander who killed his family comes back hellbent on finishing the job, a relentless, eye-popping cross-country chase ensues.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Action","War","Thriller"],"release_date":"2025-10-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/10MiMMNzWeE53cHhSlfroPiO8vi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/roCMOuMQ55Z2TxVx1vZZTevlo0n.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//10MiMMNzWeE53cHhSlfroPiO8vi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//roCMOuMQ55Z2TxVx1vZZTevlo0n.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":118412,"title":"Berserk: The Golden Age Arc II - The Battle for Doldrey","description":"The Band of the Hawk and their enigmatic leader Griffith continue winning battle after battle as their prestige throughout the kingdom of Midland grows. But their latest task is one that has seen failure from everyone who has attempted it: the subjugation of the impenetrable fortress of Doldrey.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2012-06-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/A34inrFSAIQNatFGc8qP5kfwDmV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/emotEtDYn6qA5O5C52yb5bS4TrN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//A34inrFSAIQNatFGc8qP5kfwDmV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//emotEtDYn6qA5O5C52yb5bS4TrN.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":27094,"title":"Lenny","description":"The story of acerbic 1960s comic Lenny Bruce, whose groundbreaking, no-holds-barred style and social commentary was often deemed by the establishment as too obscene for the public.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1974-11-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6zqFDzIKPKyGX1jwYAiJTGvYyXz.jpg","poster_path":"htt