ge, where he will make friends and enemies as he follows the quiet footsteps of a mysterious presence eager for revenge.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Fantasy","Drama","Horror","Thriller"],"release_date":"2001-04-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iUFylO8khUHGiSJanUZQfzZYyXI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iP1z1aJzPnkP8FHg77TS7ukqoEZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iUFylO8khUHGiSJanUZQfzZYyXI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iP1z1aJzPnkP8FHg77TS7ukqoEZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":408220,"title":"Justice League Dark","description":"When innocent civilians begin committing unthinkable crimes across Metropolis, Gotham City and beyond, Batman must call upon mystical counterparts to eradicate this demonic threat to the planet; enter Justice League Dark. This team of Dark Arts specialists must unravel the mystery of Earth''s supernatural plague and contend with the rising, powerful villainous forces behind the siege—before it''s too late for all of mankind.","duration":"1:16:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Science Fiction","Horror"],"release_date":"2017-01-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2idkeA6HJ9F7IxeP6zbU4xBU35y.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gWcTaDFXDrOAPfVzfBFz0Aya5BE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2idkeA6HJ9F7IxeP6zbU4xBU35y.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gWcTaDFXDrOAPfVzfBFz0Aya5BE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":60308,"title":"Moneyball","description":"The story of Oakland Athletics general manager Billy Beane''s successful attempt to put together a baseball team on a budget, by employing computer-generated analysis to draft his players.","duration":"2:14:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2011-09-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kYlBNDkB5qFdpTDpnlQdH0CdK3T.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4yIQq1e6iOcaZ5rLDG3lZBP3j7a.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kYlBNDkB5qFdpTDpnlQdH0CdK3T.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4yIQq1e6iOcaZ5rLDG3lZBP3j7a.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":25793,"title":"Precious: Based on the Novel ''Push'' by Sapphire","description":"In Harlem in 1987, Claireece \"Precious\" Jones is a 16-year-old African American girl born into a life no one would want. She''s pregnant for the second time by her absent father, and at home she must wait hand and foot on her mother, an angry woman who abuses her emotionally and physically. School is chaotic and Precious has reached the ninth grade with good marks and a secret – she can''t read.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2009-11-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/81ME78JndOYu7IluTi1rxh0cLY2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/d4ltLIDbvZskSwbzXqi0Hfv5ma4.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//81ME78JndOYu7IluTi1rxh0cLY2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//d4ltLIDbvZskSwbzXqi0Hfv5ma4.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10794,"title":"The Party","description":"Hrundi V. Bakshi, an accident-prone actor from India, is accidentally put on the guest list for an upcoming party at the home of a Hollywood film producer. Unfortunately, from the moment he arrives, one thing after another goes wrong with compounding effect.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1968-04-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jqw9t9nshz9mV79C66PV2giHVw6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nWZ9rrbMoHHgsvYNdng2EhbjeLf.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jqw9t9nshz9mV79C66PV2giHVw6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nWZ9rrbMoHHgsvYNdng2EhbjeLf.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10112,"title":"The Aristocats","description":"When Madame Adelaide Bonfamille leaves her fortune to Duchess and her children—Bonfamille’s beloved family of cats—the butler plots to steal the money and kidnaps the legatees, leaving them out on a country road. All seems lost until the wily Thomas O’Malley Cat and his jazz-playing alley cats come to the aristocats’ rescue.","duration":"1:18:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Family","Adventure"],"release_date":"1970-12-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rnMwOM8gMqo6Gf6XXMpaJEayUwk.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aOWs5XMJEABN6SKCTJBCoeD1kCA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rnMwOM8gMqo6Gf6XXMpaJEayUwk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aOWs5XMJEABN6SKCTJBCoeD1kCA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":928720,"title":"Return to Dust","description":"Humble, unassuming Ma and timid Cao have been cast off by their families and forced into an arranged marriage. They have to combine their strength and build a home to survive. In the face of much adversity, an unexpected bond begins to blossom, as both Ma and Cao, uniting with Earth''s cycles, create a haven for themselves in which they can thrive.","duration":"2:13:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2022-07-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e1Z4TfgRYdwen5Hzj5kVUZQEOeL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wUf7BWSN16KOdO70P3UOy5FRWRg.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e1Z4TfgRYdwen5Hzj5kVUZQEOeL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wUf7BWSN16KOdO70P3UOy5FRWRg.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":423333,"title":"Mass","description":"Two couples meet for a painful and raw conversation in the aftermath of a violent tragedy.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2021-10-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cv6Nn8Yt9mgFoUSievEdW9JK82A.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/c3M