 charge into a warped, unfeeling heartbreaker.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1946-12-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5SdVucbeGF5xAHT496uPRPZVJD6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ynaFuVvW2jaG06pMV67dOhzMYfJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5SdVucbeGF5xAHT496uPRPZVJD6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ynaFuVvW2jaG06pMV67dOhzMYfJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10150,"title":"The Last Unicorn","description":"A unicorn learns from a riddle-speaking butterfly that she is supposedly the last of her kind, all the others having been herded away by the monstrous Red Bull. The unicorn sets out to discover the truth behind the butterfly''s words. She is eventually joined on her quest by Schmendrick, a second-rate magician, and Molly Grue, a middle-aged woman who dreamed all her life of seeing a unicorn. Their journey leads them far from home, all the way to the castle of King Haggard.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Fantasy","Animation","Family","Adventure"],"release_date":"1982-11-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fwxOQkzYtRVKs3kzcyukdbsyIuh.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/MRHFtXTjxC74MGCzHACcuqvHiw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fwxOQkzYtRVKs3kzcyukdbsyIuh.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//MRHFtXTjxC74MGCzHACcuqvHiw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":429174,"title":"Loveless","description":"Zhenya and Boris are going through a vicious divorce marked by resentment, frustration and recriminations. Already embarking on new lives, each with a new partner, they are impatient to start again, to turn the page – even if it means threatening to abandon their 12-year-old son Alyosha. Until, after witnessing one of their fights, Alyosha disappears.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2017-06-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fnWEr4voDR1kp0sXZ1WufM7j2Qp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oBUsLGZoGuLKMuHj19mjG9iCDoq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fnWEr4voDR1kp0sXZ1WufM7j2Qp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oBUsLGZoGuLKMuHj19mjG9iCDoq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":23566,"title":"Barbie and the Three Musketeers","description":"Corinne is a young country girl who heads to Paris to pursue her big dream – to become a female musketeer! Never could she imagine she would meet three other girls who secretly share the same dream! Using their special talents, the girls work together as a team to foil a plot and save the prince. It''s all for one and one for all!","duration":"1:21:00","genre":["Animation","Family"],"release_date":"2009-09-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7azfW8hJFlayltIW2Mc1jC78smZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zR0ts7zL2P1kQIQXYlnS4KCqqmu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7azfW8hJFlayltIW2Mc1jC78smZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zR0ts7zL2P1kQIQXYlnS4KCqqmu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13479,"title":"A Charlie Brown Thanksgiving","description":"Turkey, cranberries, pumpkin pie... and the Peanuts gang to share them with. This is going to be the greatest Thanksgiving ever! The fun begins when Peppermint Patty invites herself and her pals to Charlie Brown''s house for a REALLY big turkey party. Good grief! All our hero can cook is cold cereal and maybe toast. Is Charlie Brown doomed? Not when Linus, Snoopy and Woodstock chip in to save the (Thanksgiving) Day. With such good friends, Charlie Brown - and all of us - have so many reasons to be thankful.","duration":"0:25:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Family","TV Movie"],"release_date":"1973-11-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xCTW6uzOWasbTivZIeQc2AsEIWr.jpg","poster_path":"https://ima