rom an alternate universe appears to recruit the Justice League to help save his Earth from the Crime Syndicate, an evil version of the League. What ensues is the ultimate battle of good versus evil in a war that threatens both planets and, through a devious plan launched by Batman''s counterpart Owlman, puts the balance of all existence in peril.","duration":"1:15:00","genre":["Animation","Science Fiction","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2010-02-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/okRY6YHbakM9cQz08EfcaLfzDoX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tN2lodc5g7Fkkus6I6Ch2tNTgb5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//okRY6YHbakM9cQz08EfcaLfzDoX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tN2lodc5g7Fkkus6I6Ch2tNTgb5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15487,"title":"The Greatest Game Ever Played","description":"A biopic of 20-year-old Francis Ouimet who defeated his golfing idol and 1900 US Open Champion, Harry Vardon.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2005-09-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nCzfXkipK6LCg9JAPkrYw2QA0GO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kh4vd6wKa6j9xVFzxhQrsT0p2YN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nCzfXkipK6LCg9JAPkrYw2QA0GO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kh4vd6wKa6j9xVFzxhQrsT0p2YN.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14621,"title":"Lean On Me","description":"When principal Joe Clark takes over decaying Eastside High School, he''s faced with students wearing gang colors and graffiti-covered walls. Determined to do anything he must to turn the school around, he expels suspected drug dealers, padlocks doors and demands effort and results from students, staff and parents. Autocratic to a fault, this real-life educator put it all on the line.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1989-03-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_