, esthetics and eroticism of these girl-women. It is not easy to say what the subject is, there are so many: the discovery of sexuality, discrimination, chance, drugs, maternity, traditions, betrayals, power, love. A mural of a complex reality from the point of view of twenty-something women in the skin of 14 to 15 year old girls.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2011-03-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/b7qyTKrkFDAVyAzBgVpqjvAHneH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jrJrgwFjAyzkZLiaU5dA8o1hcUA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//b7qyTKrkFDAVyAzBgVpqjvAHneH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jrJrgwFjAyzkZLiaU5dA8o1hcUA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10911,"title":"The Guns of Navarone","description":"A team of allied saboteurs are assigned an impossible mission: infiltrate an impregnable Nazi-held island and destroy the two enormous long-range field guns that prevent the rescue of 2,000 trapped British soldiers.","duration":"2:40:00","genre":["Adventure","Drama","War"],"release_date":"1961-04-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hgFyxEtHCMDJQc2TdXSl3FGIs2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/j6VSFnm20GlkUi8yb7hM5Qfc1fA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hgFyxEtHCMDJQc2TdXSl3FGIs2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//j6VSFnm20GlkUi8yb7hM5Qfc1fA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9473,"title":"South Park: Bigger, Longer & Uncut","description":"The third graders of South Park sneak into an R-rated film by ultra-vulgar Canadian television personalities Terrance and Phillip, and emerge with expanded vocabularies that leave their parents and teachers scandalized. When outraged Americans try to censor the film, the controversy spirals into a call to wage war on Canada and Terrance and Phillip end up on death row, with the kids their only hope of 