d, must flee a relentless policeman named Javert. The pursuit consumes both men''s lives, and soon Valjean finds himself in the midst of the student revolutions in France.","duration":"2:38:00","genre":["History","Drama"],"release_date":"2012-12-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bsG8LkZx1ijrcf3fP6AvBlGTxkX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6CuzBs2Lb8At7qQr64mLXg2RYRb.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bsG8LkZx1ijrcf3fP6AvBlGTxkX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6CuzBs2Lb8At7qQr64mLXg2RYRb.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":34672,"title":"Chestnut: Hero of Central Park","description":"Ray and Sal, two orphaned sisters, adopt and hide a Great Dane puppy from their two adopted parents living in a luxury downtown New York apartment that expressely forbids dogs.","duration":"1:26:00","genre":["Family","Comedy"],"release_date":"2004-10-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qJiadhrwmYM3hJEJlI6t6KuaQeq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/quDRdSE0gZ1Q1lpOkZVq4ek2kaQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qJiadhrwmYM3hJEJlI6t6KuaQeq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//quDRdSE0gZ1Q1lpOkZVq4ek2kaQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13597,"title":"Labyrinth","description":"Frustrated with babysitting on yet another weekend night, Sarah, a teenager with an active imagination, summons the Goblins to take her baby stepbrother away. When little Toby actually disappears, Sarah must follow him into a fantastical world to rescue him from the Goblin King. Guarding his castle is the labyrinth itself, a twisted maze of deception, populated with outrageous characters and unknown dangers.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Adventure","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1986-06-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mGkleIuPO2flRyvP8yBcUykSQsp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pejayhTVBEL4w8YKSfrhOjjWVlH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mGkleIuPO2flRyvP8yBcUykSQsp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pejayhTVBEL4w8YKSfrhOjjWVlH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11190,"title":"The Return","description":"Two young brothers in contemporary Russia are reunited with a father they know only from an old photograph after his sudden return from a long absence. With their mother’s reluctant consent, they set out on a remote trip that quickly becomes an uneasy test of authority, trust, and masculinity. As the journey moves deeper into the wilderness, the fragile bonds between father and sons are pushed to their limits.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Drama","Mystery"],"release_date":"2003-06-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8ULBp6mMRhpR6qnEqEWFbMdmdNq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7V8iHBs34cPYw7ohpLqliF9x8Gv.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8ULBp6mMRhpR6qnEqEWFbMdmdNq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7V8iHBs34cPYw7ohpLqliF9x8Gv.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":802,"title":"Lolita","description":"Humbert Humbert is a middle-aged British novelist who is both appalled by and attracted to the vulgarity of American culture. When he comes to stay at the boarding house run by Charlotte Haze, he soon becomes obsessed with Lolita, the woman''s teenaged daughter.","duration":"2:34:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"1962-06-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/40JNQ4FOekM1LDgUC5mDcM8bZyl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8Puqbeh0D95DpXFWep1rmH78btu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//40JNQ4FOekM1LDgUC5mDcM8bZyl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8Puqbeh0D95DpXFWep1rmH78btu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":255,"title":"Stolen Kisses","description":"The third in a series of films featuring François Truffaut''s alter-ego, Antoine Doinel, the story resumes with Antoine being discharged from military service. His sweetheart Christine''s father lands Antoine a job as a security guard, which he promptly loses. Stumbling into a position assisting a private detective, Antoine falls for his employers'' seductive wife, Fabienne, and finds that he must choose between the older woman and Christine.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1968-09-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/42pH01hfjrpuKvplFjkLQYOlbmO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5qHh1Vp2TOOX5IaTVt4wyT8OTnR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//42pH01hfjrpuKvplFjkLQYOlbmO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5qHh1Vp2TOOX5IaTVt4wyT8OTnR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":93289,"title":"Now Where Did the Seventh Company Get to?","description":"1940: During the chaotic running fights of the French army the 7th company disappears - nobody knows they''ve been taken captive. Only their scouting patrol, three witty but lazy guys, can escape and now wanders around behind the German lines. They''d like to just stay out the fights, but a Lieutenant urges them to use a captured truck to break through to their troops.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Comedy","War"],"release_date":"1973-05-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sf3LLFDjkZIABUnHi2tIY02az5r.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/clSsWDMsUJ49ptNkhJ0yLWyPXlU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sf3LLFDjkZIABUnHi2tIY02az5r.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//clSsWDMsUJ49ptNkhJ0yLWyPXlU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":59037,"title":"Toxic Love","description":"The alienating and repetitive life of a group of heroin junkies in 1980s Rome.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"1983-09-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/866aJcimh30DVYRo3IMTqaKK3JR.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hQwo0Nwek1kH9QE4ZOO0TN7XAgU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//866aJcimh30DVYRo3IMTqaKK3JR.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hQwo0Nwek1kH9QE4ZOO0TN7XAgU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":43832,"title":"Only Angels Have Wings","description":"A traveling performer arrives at a remote South American port town where the head of an air freight service must risk his pilots'' lives to earn a major contract.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Romance","Adventure","Drama"],"release_date":"1939-05-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wq7KVxUAYH06cHuReBcV0Sx2kFv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lqcwiWancAkjtAQPHr9V3SfJjBM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wq7KVxUAYH06cHuReBcV0Sx2kFv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lqcwiWancAkjtAQPHr9V3SfJjBM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":36102,"title":"The Swindle","description":"Aging small-time conman Augusto works with two younger men: Roberto, who desires to become the Italian Johnny Ray, and Carlo, nicknamed Picasso. Through a series of mishaps and personal entanglements, things go badly for Augusto.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"1955-10-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tzb3epsqaSJMiBwKtK4GtW25ryq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kpo4sZyeOX3dIY0l8uZ2f214mK8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tzb3epsqaSJMiBwKtK4GtW25ryq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kpo4sZyeOX3dIY0l8uZ2f214mK8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":26513,"title":"Punishment Park","description":"In this fictional documentary, U.S. prisons are at capacity, and President Nixon declares a state of emergency. All new prisoners, most of whom are connected to the antiwar movement, are now given the choice of jail time or spending three days in Punishment Park, where they will be hunted for sport by federal authorities. The prisoners invariably choose the latter option, but learn that, between the desert heat and the brutal police officers, their chances of survival are slim.","duration":"1:28:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1971-10-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oqKfIArX3RcHdHot8tDE0NHFxH5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fPGnMnp80ycqUHdgP1T3nzCyYKe.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oqKfIArX3RcHdHot8tDE0NHFxH5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fPGnMnp80ycqUHdgP1T3nzCyYKe.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14698,"title":"Suddenly, Last Summer","description":"The only son of wealthy widow Violet Venable dies while on vacation with his cousin Catherine. What the girl saw was so horrible that she went insane; now Mrs. Venable wants Catherine lobotomized to cover up the truth.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama","Mystery"],"release_date":"1959-12-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pMIIOovLyyCr8W5JFOqsSO8gK1r.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/igma0zn9J5srRvOMDRnxyUDQXJL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pMIIOovLyyCr8W5JFOqsSO8gK1r.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//igma0zn9J5srRvOMDRnxyUDQXJL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":926393,"title":"The Equalizer 3","description":"Robert McCall finds himself at home in Southern Italy but he discovers his friends are under the control of local crime bosses. As events turn deadly, McCall knows what he has to do: become his friends'' protector by taking on the mafia.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2023-08-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gystuaqp5AkVqqu3Nf0564zeOv4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w