ge","description":"Two former Olympians, one a figure skater and the other a hockey player, pin their hopes of one last shot at Olympic glory on one another. That is, of course, if they can keep from killing each other in the process...","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1992-03-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pNGrPhlOt76pkC5VAPR76mQrgin.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sx4qf2XoW0xaLITQLpajsYc4mcj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pNGrPhlOt76pkC5VAPR76mQrgin.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sx4qf2XoW0xaLITQLpajsYc4mcj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":635389,"title":"Jiang Ziya","description":"Atop the ruins of war, top commander Jiang Ziya is given the task to banish the Nine-tailed Fox Demon who threatens all mortals'' very existence. When he discovers the Nine-tailed Fox''s life linked to the soul of an innocent girl, he is faced with a challenging decision: follow the will of heaven or find his own path to righteousness.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Fantasy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2020-10-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6Urx7y2CQQvxIlzk5R0BpOKI2NR.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eDq4dGgNHxPbT3Y5S6mfymsQ0rQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6Urx7y2CQQvxIlzk5R0BpOKI2NR.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eDq4dGgNHxPbT3Y5S6mfymsQ0rQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":259761,"title":"Lights Out","description":"A woman prepares for bed, but realizes that something may be lurking in the shadows.","duration":"0:03:00","genre":["Horror"],"release_date":"2014-05-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cVntX63U4vSeG1LOO5JDkY0i1Rc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1VzEIaYWO9HFIp6lgjfbLRJRKSF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cVntX63U4vSeG1LOO5JDkY0i1Rc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1VzEIaYWO9HFIp6lgjfbLRJRKSF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":258893,"title":"Scooby-Doo! WrestleMania Mystery","description":"The mystery begins when Shaggy and Scooby win tickets to \"WrestleMania\" and convince the crew to go with them to WWE City. But this city harbors a spooky secret - a ghastly Ghost Bear holds the town in his terrifying grip! To protect the coveted WWE Championship Title, the gang gets help from WWE Superstars like John Cena, Triple H, Sin Cara, Brodus Clay, AJ Lee, The Miz and Kane. Watch Scooby and the gang grapple with solving this case before it''s too late.","duration":"1:24:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Family","Mystery"],"release_date":"2014-03-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jlHQyiqUtADbhj9DwJZbvT37mbv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vgnxicD1qvhTrh4db9F7hJLoOaa.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jlHQyiqUtADbhj9DwJZbvT37mbv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vgnxicD1qvhTrh4db9F7hJLoOaa.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12900,"title":"Conspiracy","description":"At the Wannsee Conference on January 20, 1942, senior Nazi officials meet to determine the manner in which the so-called \"Final Solution to the Jewish Question\" can be best implemented.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["History","Drama","War","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2001-05-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iESnRGuIiXKeNo3pKMRaZStXyH6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xKocKpTHaKcTuNRLu0rLbZWbLnH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iESnRGuIiXKeNo3pKMRaZStXyH6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xKocKpTHaKcTuNRLu0rLbZWbLnH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10009,"title":"Brother Bear","description":"When an impulsive boy named Kenai is magically transformed into a bear, he must literally walk in another''s footsteps until he learns some valuable life lessons. His courageous and often zany journey introduces him to a forest full of wildlife, including the lovable bear cub Koda, hilarious moose Rutt and Tuke, woolly mammoths and rambunctious rams.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Adventure","Animation","Family"],"release_date":"2003-10-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sZhY0BAsN1bMAPLIqMRqG1fqb3A.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/otptPbEY0vBostmo95xwiiumMJm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sZhY0BAsN1bMAPLIqMRqG1fqb3A.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//otptPbEY0vBostmo95xwiiumMJm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9325,"title":"The Jungle Book","description":"The boy Mowgli makes his way to the man-village with Bagheera, the wise panther. Along the way he meets jazzy King Louie, the hypnotic snake Kaa and the lovable, happy-go-lucky bear Baloo, who teaches Mowgli \"The Bare Necessities\" of life and the true meaning of friendship.","duration":"1:18:00","genre":["Family","Animation","Adventure"],"release_date":"1967-10-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3sbmRuIpYEH5dMvec4z4JxKQHoj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yN1kuupnPTLUprgfvC5WapgrxG4.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3sbmRuIpYEH5dMvec4z4JxKQHoj.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yN1kuupnPTLUprgfvC5WapgrxG4.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":6404,"title":"Nosferatu the Vampyre","description":"A real estate agent leaves behind his beautiful wife to go to Transylvania to visit the mysterious Count Dracula and formalize the purchase of a property in Wismar.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Drama","Horror"],"release_date":"1979-01-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uHudMff1vp2GDXqHD8QOA78QpNW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jHKzGYwf7P34vz8MhJBTN6cnaYD.jpg","sm