"1:23:00","genre":["Horror"],"release_date":"1974-10-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wvBx1Q1FcQE1BPLfBbgA3y9aaS1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mpgkRPH1GNkMCgdPk2OMyHzAks7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wvBx1Q1FcQE1BPLfBbgA3y9aaS1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mpgkRPH1GNkMCgdPk2OMyHzAks7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":26900,"title":"The Bandit","description":"The film tells the story of a group of bandits captured in the Cudi Mountains 35 years ago. All of them have died, either from illness or vendettas; only Baran (Şener Şen) survives. After serving his 35-year sentence, Baran is released from Viranşehir Prison and learns that his birthplace is now submerged under the waters of a dam. Ceren Ana (Zübeyde Erden) tells him about the past. Baran is imprisoned because of the betrayal of his old friend Berfo (Kamran Usluer). Berfo stole the bandits gold, bought his childhood love Keje (Sermin Hürmeriç) from her father, and fled to Istanbul. While Baran is searching for Keje, he encounters a young man named Cumali (Uğur Yücel). These two men find solace in each other to avoid being swept away by the storms of the big city. And in this world where violence, betrayal, passion, boundless love and hatred intertwine, they try to survive.","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1996-11-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oojHJ1BRCeHBkdIEshjP85gDDfY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/44KTRoayojxpzti2okBZGKmjEGM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oojHJ1BRCeHBkdIEshjP85gDDfY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//44KTRoayojxpzti2okBZGKmjEGM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11948,"title":"Merry Christmas, Mr. Lawrence","description":"Island of Java, 1942, during World War II. British Major Jack Celliers arrives at a Japanese prison camp, run by the strict Captain Yonoi. Colonel John Lawrence, who has a profound knowledge of Japanese culture, and Sergeant Hara, brutal and simpleton, will witness the struggle of wills between two men from very different backgrounds who are tragically destined to clash.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Drama","History","War"],"release_date":"1983-05-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6NaWU3u3OwHMcEyNOLrXhFYr7Th.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sKeZzN7sXPLRe5rRlOuoXsh1qPA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6NaWU3u3OwHMcEyNOLrXhFYr7Th.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sKeZzN7sXPLRe5rRlOuoXsh1qPA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10559,"title":"Frequency","description":"When a rare phenomenon gives police officer John Sullivan the chance to speak to his father, 30 years in the past, he takes the opportunity to prevent his dad''s tragic death.  After his actions inadvertently give rise to a series of brutal murders he and his father must find a way to fix the consequences of altering time.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2000-04-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pBS51YVR78U2E6s2YXdIh8hPGSn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bnuWuzgJSl2V7bEDM6dPQv9PQQx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pBS51YVR78U2E6s2YXdIh8hPGSn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bnuWuzgJSl2V7bEDM6dPQv9PQQx.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2860,"title":"Claire''s Knee","description":"On the eve of his wedding, on holiday on the Lake Annecy shore, career diplomat Jérôme visits an old acquaintance, perhaps a former girlfriend. Through her, he meets an intense teenager, Laura, and then lusts after her sister, Claire. Whilst Laura attempts to flirt with him, Jérôme''s fantasy becomes focused on wanting to caress Claire''s knee.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Drama","Ro