 then assassinate an official  who works for the Japanese puppet government in Shanghai. Her mission becomes clouded when she finds herself falling in love with the man she is assigned to kill.","duration":"2:38:00","genre":["Action","Drama","Romance","Thriller"],"release_date":"2007-09-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lU1fQews2gye23PocVE48CsTmOQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6c1tqfJEBuIyhQC19SLlLQAUAvJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lU1fQews2gye23PocVE48CsTmOQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6c1tqfJEBuIyhQC19SLlLQAUAvJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1010819,"title":"The Little Guy","description":"Groot discovers a miniature civilization that believes the seemingly enormous tree toddler is the hero they’ve been waiting for.","duration":"0:06:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Comedy","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2022-08-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tTrZap8lEJsdpnab5yIR3d9bedg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lPzcizL8PdS2U1q0rfhlVn00b9l.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tTrZap8lEJsdpnab5yIR3d9bedg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lPzcizL8PdS2U1q0rfhlVn00b9l.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":610120,"title":"Anima","description":"In a short musical film directed by Paul Thomas Anderson, Thom Yorke of Radiohead stars in a mind-bending visual piece. Best played loud.","duration":"0:15:00","genre":["Music"],"release_date":"2019-06-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lF9W3LAlYYfv7R2V2b1k0ZnA3a.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xCBOjFAzsz8d2kABIPfwIAOeJ5t.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lF9W3LAlYYfv7R2V2b1k0ZnA3a.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xCBOjFAzsz8d2kABIPfwIAOeJ5t.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":545609,"title":"Extraction","description":"A ha