tion":"When the bumbling Lieutenant Frank Drebin investigates events following the shooting of his partner, he stumbles upon an attempt to assassinate Queen Elizabeth II.","duration":"1:26:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"1988-12-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qpjuVCGZvNsbDa4UyxrbAa4Dno3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zT0mhZqZQJE1gSY5Eg9qcGP4NYo.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qpjuVCGZvNsbDa4UyxrbAa4Dno3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zT0mhZqZQJE1gSY5Eg9qcGP4NYo.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":21519,"title":"Project A","description":"In late 19th century Hong Kong, the British may rule the land, but the pirates rule the waters. Coast Guard officer Dragon Ma is determined that his beloved Coast Guard will not be made a fool of.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Comedy"],"release_date":"1983-12-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bBuhStsvG48xAfatOxtHxSL2w0L.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AvTu2bmJbVZGXPxdx6VllGXCtLG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bBuhStsvG48xAfatOxtHxSL2w0L.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AvTu2bmJbVZGXPxdx6VllGXCtLG.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":18183,"title":"Like Water for Chocolate","description":"Tita is passionately in love with Pedro, but her controlling mother forbids her from marrying him. When Pedro marries her sister, Tita throws herself into her cooking and discovers she can transfer her emotions through the food she prepares, infecting all who eat it with her intense heartbreak.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1992-04-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fi7gBF2nfIGWF9MuOhuEr6rkgBQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/itwUdMqLmPfhtGJ44hiDxkqZhiq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/