he Harvard elite.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2007-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/waOYBThLihaTKUFOAzjvhPjBmrS.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nuF3DDlZzNb2qq0tEsYU0zpXf8K.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//waOYBThLihaTKUFOAzjvhPjBmrS.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nuF3DDlZzNb2qq0tEsYU0zpXf8K.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8393,"title":"The Gods Must Be Crazy","description":"A Coca-Cola bottle dropped from an airplane raises havoc among a normally peaceful tribe of African bushmen who believe it to be a utensil of the gods.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Action","Comedy"],"release_date":"1980-09-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3gzI0UrLqIR9D40qshwduhGZCp3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wntGWN2mpeS3QaUm1PTKAcTM9K7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3gzI0UrLqIR9D40qshwduhGZCp3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wntGWN2mpeS3QaUm1PTKAcTM9K7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9797,"title":"Ivan the Terrible, Part I","description":"Set during the early part of his reign, Ivan faces betrayal from the aristocracy and even his closest friends as he seeks to unite the Russian people.  Sergei Eisenstein''s final film, this is the first part of a three-part biopic of Tsar Ivan IV of  Russia, which was never completed due to the producer''s dissatisfaction with Eisenstein''s attempts to use forbidden experimental filming techniques and excessive cost overruns.  The second part was completed but not released for a decade after Eisenstein''s death and a change of heart in the USSR government toward his work; the third part was only in its earliest stage of filming when shooting was stopped altogether.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"1944-11-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ohn9zA2dUbVuo4ajx32Em97qvMr.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rzFWfdq6CXLCnlfXTTZs9W9dMR2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ohn9zA2dUbVuo4ajx32Em97qvMr.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rzFWfdq6CXLCnlfXTTZs9W9dMR2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":285,"title":"Pirates of the Caribbean: At World''s End","description":"After losing Captain Jack Sparrow to the locker of Davy Jones, Will Turner, Elizabeth Swann, and Captain Barbossa journey to the ends of the earth to rescue him. And as the East India Trading Company tightens its grip on the seas under Lord Cutler Beckett—now in control of Davy Jones—the fate of piracy hangs by a thread. Now, they must unite the pirate lords for one final stand. But as loyalties are tested and alliances shift, each must ultimately choose where they stand in the battle for freedom on the high seas.","duration":"2:49:00","genre":["Adventure","Fantasy","Action"],"release_date":"2007-05-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1jHxkVXMI5s3vRiyiZooUy1shB5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jGWpG4YhpQwVmjyHEGkxEkeRf0S.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1jHxkVXMI5s3vRiyiZooUy1shB5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jGWpG4YhpQwVmjyHEGkxEkeRf0S.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":969492,"title":"Land of Bad","description":"When a Delta Force special ops mission goes terribly wrong, Air Force drone pilot Reaper has 48 hours to remedy what has devolved into a wild rescue operation. With no weapons and no communication other than the drone above, the ground mission suddenly becomes a full-scale battle when the team is discovered by the enemy.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Action","War","Thriller"],"release_date":"2024-02-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iKqItVltY6r0eJeIRdIZV8IrBpz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/h3jYanWMEJq6JJsCopy1h7cT2Hs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iKqItVltY6r0eJeIRdIZV8IrBpz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//h3jYanWMEJq6JJsCopy1h7cT2Hs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":567566,"title":"The Rifleman","description":"The love story of sixteen-year-old Arturs is interrupted by the First World War. After losing his mother and his home, he finds some consolation in joining the army, because this is the first time national battalions are allowed in the Russian Empire. But war is nothing like Arturs imagined – no glory, no fairness. It is brutal and painful. Arturs is now completely alone as war takes the lives of his father and brother. Also, no progress is made in the promised quick resolution of the war and timely return home. Within the notion that only he alone cares about returning home and that his homeland is just a playground for other nations, Arturs finds strength for the final battle and eventually returns home to start everything from scratch, just like his newly born country.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["War","Drama","History"],"release_date":"2019-11-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zhr06iXdSAXbGMrodUTCA4o9FCO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cYMVgoTsFbn0HbDwUSxhWCD63mp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zhr06iXdSAXbGMrodUTCA4o9FCO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cYMVgoTsFbn0HbDwUSxhWCD63mp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":399579,"title":"Alita: Battle Angel","description":"When Alita awakens with no memory of who she is in a future world she does not recognize, she is taken in by Ido, a compassionate doctor who realizes that somewhere in this abandoned cyborg shell is the heart and soul of a young woman with an extraordinary past.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Action","Science Fiction","Adventure"],"release_date":"2019-01-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jXDselREPq8TOVGM4dzBBUM7xVk.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xRWht48C2V8XNfzvPehyClOvDni.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jXDselREPq8TOVGM4dzBBUM7xVk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xRWht48C2V8XNfzvPehyClOvDni.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":318121,"title":"The Fundamentals of Caring","description":"Having suffered a tragedy, Ben becomes a caregiver to earn money. His first client, Trevor, is a hilarious 18-year-old with muscular dystrophy. One paralyzed emotionally, one paralyzed physically, Ben and Trevor hit the road on a trip into the western states. The folks they collect along the way will help them test their skills for surviving outside their calculated existence. Together, they come to understand the importance of hope and the necessity of true friendship.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2016-06-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9kAKDdnHvhS93eMTqsXwiVaBtw7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zZ0eda1GyHILNSoq9KF5u0hcq6O.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9kAKDdnHvhS93eMTqsXwiVaBtw7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zZ0eda1GyHILNSoq9KF5u0hcq6O.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":99861,"title":"Avengers: Age of Ultron","description":"When Tony Stark tries to jumpstart a dormant peacekeeping program, things go awry and Earth’s Mightiest Heroes are put to the ultimate test as the fate of the planet hangs in the balance. As the villainous Ultron emerges, it is up to The Avengers to stop him from enacting his terrible plans, and soon uneasy alliances and unexpected action pave the way for an epic and unique global adventure.","duration":"2:21:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2015-04-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kIBK5SKwgqIIuRKhhWrJn3XkbPq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4ssDuvEDkSArWEdyBl2X5