e French Army, over a perceived insult. For over a decade, they engage in a series of duels amidst larger conflicts, including the failed French invasion of Russia in 1812, and shifts in the political and social systems of Europe.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Drama","War"],"release_date":"1977-08-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xyVURBvbRIzsGJlD0h8vybkXjLs.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nqjMYlUXnmmO8Jqucow4nj9alE5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xyVURBvbRIzsGJlD0h8vybkXjLs.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nqjMYlUXnmmO8Jqucow4nj9alE5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11839,"title":"The Court Jester","description":"A hapless carnival performer masquerades as the court jester as part of a plot against a usurper who has overthrown the rightful king of England.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Music","Adventure","Comedy"],"release_date":"1955-12-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dxtPARExUBZniJ5bBVoejPIdoeh.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pPCOAipDP0sm8SLChpTMBPdCiqB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dxtPARExUBZniJ5bBVoejPIdoeh.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pPCOAipDP0sm8SLChpTMBPdCiqB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11177,"title":"Mask","description":"A significantly deformed but highly intelligent teenage boy and his biker gang mother attempt to live as normal a life as possible under the circumstances.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1985-03-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xhaIbAXa6HOpYFn387a63Ser2wy.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yO54XMNbbLukU4YCuPWPxhzn70z.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xhaIbAXa6HOpYFn387a63Ser2wy.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yO54XMNbbLukU4YCuPWPxhzn70z.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":6145,"title":"Fracture","description":"A husband is on trial for the attempted murder of his wife, in what is seemingly an open/shut case for the ambitious district attorney trying to put him away. However, there are surprises for both around every corner, and, as a suspenseful game of cat-and-mouse is played out, each must manipulate and outwit the other.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Thriller"],"release_date":"2007-04-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mujUrk2diGe5vRCb3kdpHZeobRs.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qNen8x5gaikjIg9CFihgxYcJwQe.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mujUrk2diGe5vRCb3kdpHZeobRs.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qNen8x5gaikjIg9CFihgxYcJwQe.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":571468,"title":"Freaks Out","description":"Four super-powered circus freaks find themselves trapped in war-torn Rome after their foster father is captured by the Nazis.","duration":"2:21:00","genre":["Adventure","Fantasy","Drama"],"release_date":"2021-10-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rTVUx5xLnMyeRPYRcZd8XPzSekJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6y0qa5rkSMuTmOPyQZ8u0g1VeEF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rTVUx5xLnMyeRPYRcZd8XPzSekJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6y0qa5rkSMuTmOPyQZ8u0g1VeEF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":392982,"title":"Marshall","description":"Thurgood Marshall, the first African-American Supreme Court Justice, battles through one of his career-defining cases.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2017-10-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8nh70OvIsJKpfZdTMZoMJMb8aVE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2KfdXsXTCbMie0wB1mSmIX60C2F.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8nh70OvIsJKpfZdTMZoMJMb8aVE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2KfdXsXTCbMi