ies to a foreign superpower.  But time is not on their side - the greatest catastrophe to ever befall the world is about to evolve right before their very eyes.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Action","Science Fiction","Horror"],"release_date":"2016-07-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tb0uo01w2kDHiQwTszsLlSusAm4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jPNShaWZMpVF0iQ7j1dvTuZLD20.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tb0uo01w2kDHiQwTszsLlSusAm4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jPNShaWZMpVF0iQ7j1dvTuZLD20.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":280795,"title":"Haider","description":"A young man returns to Kashmir after his father''s disappearance to confront his uncle - the man he suspects to have a role in his father''s fate.","duration":"2:30:00","genre":["Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2014-10-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bbd3XvJfY5MppOoYKl447HKjKXp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lOCotkHPODWdsRDMoLbSdLdVT3L.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bbd3XvJfY5MppOoYKl447HKjKXp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lOCotkHPODWdsRDMoLbSdLdVT3L.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":64956,"title":"Inception: The Cobol Job","description":"Cobb, Arthur and Nash are enlisted by Cobol Engineering.","duration":"0:15:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Thriller","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2010-12-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/p8K8Z4yjaslJx5mTsIC5L6LJxQB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sNxqwtyHMNQwKWoFYDqcYTui5Ok.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//p8K8Z4yjaslJx5mTsIC5L6LJxQB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sNxqwtyHMNQwKWoFYDqcYTui5Ok.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":23619,"title":"We Can Do That","description":"The film follows Nello, the recently hired director of a newly developed work cooperative of former mental patients. After the closure of state psychiatric hospitals and asylums in Italy under the Basaglia Law many former patients were left with few resources and little hope of reintegrating into society. With the intention of actually improving the lives of his pupils, rather than just sedating them, Nello encourages them to expand their individual abilities and explore the wider world around them although, regardless of intention, there is sometimes a price to pushing boundaries too quickly.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2008-10-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hgiuAQDZeCZS4LWf0ODyqSBUU8a.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vRgjbl788t9w2DnhFCX8NSy73gM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hgiuAQDZeCZS4LWf0ODyqSBUU8a.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vRgjbl788t9w2DnhFCX8NSy73gM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":21733,"title":"Dragons Forever","description":"A hot-shot lawyer is hired by a Hong Kong chemical plant to dispose of opposition to their polluting ways. But when he falls for a beautiful woman out to stop the plant, he is torn in a conflict of interest and asks his trusty friends Samo and Biao to help out at least until they discover the true purpose of the plant.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Action","Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"1988-02-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5KwIMLRVOfwVmYId7IEkhF5vssp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lt94C482UqyVlq1UdK5nvXukaw7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5KwIMLRVOfwVmYId7IEkhF5vssp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lt94C482UqyVlq1UdK5nvXukaw7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12162,"title":"The Hurt Locker","description":"During the Iraq War, a Sergeant recently assigned to an army bomb squad is put at odds with his squad mates due to his maverick way of handling his work.","duration":"2:11:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","War"],"release_date":"2008-10-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/off0xgvtfHY82l3MC4mDpCk1APY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/io2dfBJhasvGbgkCX9cCGVOiA99.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//off0xgvtfHY82l3MC4mDpCk1APY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//io2dfBJhasvGbgkCX9cCGVOiA99.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11450,"title":"Quiz Show","description":"Herbert Stempel''s transformation into an unexpected television personality unfolds as he secures victory on the cherished American game show, ''Twenty-One.'' However, when the show introduces the highly skilled contestant Charles Van Doren to replace Stempel, it compels Stempel to let out his frustrations and call out the show as rigged. Lawyer Richard Goodwin steps in and attempts to uncover the orchestrated deception behind the scenes.","duration":"2:13:00","genre":["History","Drama"],"release_date":"1994-08-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/R5yzaNz6IE2107lcmnzBSerCBP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yoGJo1h3Hl2exXPVcG9UXWDENtX.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//R5yzaNz6IE2107lcmnzBSerCBP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yoGJo1h3Hl2exXPVcG9UXWDENtX.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2640,"title":"Heathers","description":"A girl who halfheartedly tries to be part of the \"in crowd\" of her school meets a rebel who teaches her a more devious way to play social politics: by killing the popular kids.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"1989-03-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5pLaYZGbweHYULiNiRehPxYuUnn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rtzcrwgsuESV2adSDhIuLyQoZmp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5pLaYZGbweHYULiNiRehPxYuUnn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rtzcrwgsuESV2adSDhIuLyQoZmp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1942,"title":"Bunny Lake Is Missing","description":"A woman reports that her young daughter is missing, but there seems to be no evidence that she ever existed.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"1965-10-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u6cyzNiF95GaZFRmNYRDQJoU0Av.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zsZ2PAMMyBhkn5OSC8Qnror2KCA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u6cyzNiF95GaZFRmNYRDQJoU0Av.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zsZ2PAMMyBhkn5OSC8Qnror2KCA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1538,"title":"Collateral","description":"Cab driver Max picks up a man who offers him $600 to drive him around. But the promise of easy money sours when Max realizes his fare is an assassin.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Drama","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2004-08-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qVzmXKKOTtd3szkiCheCNrfa394.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nV5316WUsVij8sVXLCF1g7TFitg.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qVzmXKKOTtd3szkiCheCNrfa394.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nV5316WUsVij8sVXLCF1g7TFitg.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":837,"title":"Videodrome","description":"As the president of a trashy TV channel, Max Renn is desperate for new programming to attract viewers. When he happens upon \"Videodrome,\" a TV show dedicated to gratuitous torture and punishment, Max sees a potential hit and broadcasts the show on his channel. However, after his girlfriend auditions for the show and never returns, Max investigates the truth behind Videodrome and discovers that the graphic violence may not be as fake as he thought.","duration":"1:28:00","genre":["Horror","Science Fiction","Mystery"],"release_date":"1983-02-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w6