ic.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Fantasy","Romance","Thriller"],"release_date":"1990-07-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6nLdSON3ErniBZTXWG7WRqs5jGz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/w9RaPHov8oM5cnzeE27isnFMsvS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6nLdSON3ErniBZTXWG7WRqs5jGz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//w9RaPHov8oM5cnzeE27isnFMsvS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":823452,"title":"The Boys in the Boat","description":"The triumphant underdog story of the University of Washington men''s rowing team, who stunned the world by competing at the 1936 Berlin Olympics.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2023-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gub9e0qRZWmmzTV77A6T95HELIF.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ncJMztHprw3gLRAnDjNnnT23CIt.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gub9e0qRZWmmzTV77A6T95HELIF.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ncJMztHprw3gLRAnDjNnnT23CIt.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":652962,"title":"Half Brothers","description":"Mexican aviation exec Renato is shocked to learn that he has an American half-brother he never knew about: free-spirited Asher. They are forced on a road trip together, tracing the path their father took from Mexico to the U.S.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2020-12-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/s2rvxRvXfcFQxdY4mNUN3S9V9xn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/Apl0WFx61trVOoxvc8Erd5cbP8X.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//s2rvxRvXfcFQxdY4mNUN3S9V9xn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//Apl0WFx61trVOoxvc8Erd5cbP8X.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":483980,"title":"Z-O-M-B-I-E-S","description":"Two star-crossed freshmen – a zombie, Zed and a cheerleader, Addison – each outsiders in their unique ways, befriend each other and work together to show their high school and the Seabrook community what they can achieve when they embrace their differences.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Fantasy","Comedy","Romance","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2018-02-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ArccbTKFk8fMp5JnHuxoW8xU0iJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6S9O5U7Ietqh6zTtZhGbhbA3Pze.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ArccbTKFk8fMp5JnHuxoW8xU0iJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6S9O5U7Ietqh6zTtZhGbhbA3Pze.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":51497,"title":"Fast Five","description":"Former cop Brian O''Conner partners with ex-con Dom Toretto on the opposite side of the law. Since Brian and Mia Toretto broke Dom out of custody, they''ve blown across many borders to elude authorities. Now backed into a corner in Rio de Janeiro, they must pull one last job in order to gain their freedom.","duration":"2:11:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2011-04-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tQN9JEQ4N4aqej7O6AkQtt0dLpt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gEfQjjQwY7fh5bI4GlG0RrBu7Pz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tQN9JEQ4N4aqej7O6AkQtt0dLpt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gEfQjjQwY7fh5bI4GlG0RrBu7Pz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8816,"title":"My Life as a Dog","description":"A boy, obsessed with comparing himself with those less fortunate, experiences a different life at the home of his aunt and uncle in 1959 Sweden.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"1985-12-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zKqzUT0ZAljEYPLceye6ZT4H9By.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eVg9IsX2HtR1BNYH0UAhF4JPHi7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zKqzUT0ZAljEYPLceye6ZT4H9By.jpg