p-star villains, Branch and Poppy embark on a harrowing and emotional journey to reunite the other brothers and rescue Floyd from a fate even worse than pop-culture obscurity.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Music","Fantasy","Comedy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2023-10-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mDW6z7I6de6JbUgPOkAEZwKbg7G.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3ySgD2xwasTHOK6R9bNZiEwKgYo.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mDW6z7I6de6JbUgPOkAEZwKbg7G.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3ySgD2xwasTHOK6R9bNZiEwKgYo.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":498248,"title":"Mia and the White Lion","description":"A young girl from London moves to Africa with her parents where she befriends a lion cub.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Adventure","Family","Drama"],"release_date":"2018-08-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bGgcTfGf8jggZZotx3uKpRF2zbv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zXfwBeYe0RnqsJ0dnBoFTB4SSrG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bGgcTfGf8jggZZotx3uKpRF2zbv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zXfwBeYe0RnqsJ0dnBoFTB4SSrG.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":284689,"title":"Testament of Youth","description":"Testament of Youth is a powerful story of love, war and remembrance, based on the First World War memoir by Vera Brittain, which has become the classic testimony of that war from a woman’s point of view. A searing journey from youthful hopes and dreams to the edge of despair and back again, it’s a film about young love, the futility of war and how to make sense of the darkest times.","duration":"2:09:00","genre":["History","Drama","War"],"release_date":"2015-01-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jD0mmfqPRpvJUaPdpLl1vMj38CA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a6kFsaDCulCLfYHmKLDKTYaddM4.jpg","sm