ock draws inspiration from people he knows, and from events that happened to him, sometimes causing these people to become alienated from him as a result.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1997-12-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/f8Q3Sug5Sa42psw2b3Gdd1aT8t.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/i7Z5DdznqANJUjqWISEFu9bw6J7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//f8Q3Sug5Sa42psw2b3Gdd1aT8t.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//i7Z5DdznqANJUjqWISEFu9bw6J7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":779,"title":"Vampyr","description":"Allan Gray, a young man fascinated by the supernatural, goes to a small village where he feels a sinister force descending upon him. There, Allan meets an old man who asks him to protect his two daughters, for one of them has been bitten by a vampire.","duration":"1:14:00","genre":["Horror","Fantasy","Mystery"],"release_date":"1932-05-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rg3hBiQbDet8uNQkgfbpk7306p8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yt3JS5JSoZseSohYkhs6FLU9B0O.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rg3hBiQbDet8uNQkgfbpk7306p8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yt3JS5JSoZseSohYkhs6FLU9B0O.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":580600,"title":"Astro Kid","description":"Terra Willy: Unexplored Planet — Upon the destruction of their ship, Willy is separated from his parents. He lands on a wild and unexplored planet and with the help of Buck, a survival robot, he will have to hold until the arrival of a rescue mission.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Adventure","Family"],"release_date":"2019-04-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ivKorzMwX7ZEWtJozRn6Q3VgZgO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vwqEIL5SrsZFVvileNe9LuHbJy7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w