:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2007-04-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dd4KuEWZNoLp733pPmrWFTvhCp0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rDv38jqf3t0n4F9wGkQXBLx7wN9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dd4KuEWZNoLp733pPmrWFTvhCp0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rDv38jqf3t0n4F9wGkQXBLx7wN9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2748,"title":"Journey to Italy","description":"Married for eight years with no children, Brits Katherine and Alex Joyce are driving to Italy, their ultimate destination just outside of Naples to sell the villa they have just inherited from his uncle, the villa where they will be staying during their time there. On the drive, they come to the realization that this trip marks the first time that they have truly been alone together, and as such don''t really know one another in the true sense.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1954-09-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5SDqKj8AfUazPqXvOCDL1nmE8Zb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/d470qCzer5cTLRdeN0iTCQCJiOc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5SDqKj8AfUazPqXvOCDL1nmE8Zb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//d470qCzer5cTLRdeN0iTCQCJiOc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":863873,"title":"Caddo Lake","description":"When an 8-year-old girl mysteriously vanishes on Caddo Lake, a series of past deaths and disappearances begin to link together, forever altering a broken family’s history.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Mystery","Science Fiction","Thriller"],"release_date":"2024-11-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jcpUCn3oFKitAnbwosoPqaMFccj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/r1h1YltM7bwzlWE330izIgQSwkj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jcpUCn3oFKitAnbwosoPqaMFccj.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//r1h1YltM7bwzlWE330izIgQSwkj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":710356,"title":"2 Hearts","description":"When illness strikes two people who are polar opposites, life and death bring them together in surprising ways.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2020-10-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sSalNFInZxGi0bmmIKJoDz5jI6n.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a7bW3uKOMPBnmHs8gnlpfhTD8YQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sSalNFInZxGi0bmmIKJoDz5jI6n.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//a7bW3uKOMPBnmHs8gnlpfhTD8YQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":664698,"title":"Contra","description":"With his uncouth manner, Professor Pohl doesn’t enjoy the best reputation at the university where he works. To make matters worse, he makes a racist remark when student Naima arrives late for his lecture. Unfortunately for him, a video of his verbal outburst spreads like wildfire on the Internet, and the university’s president, Lambrecht, is called to deal with the incident. But Pohl is not dismissed. Instead, he is put to the task of helping Naima prepare for an important debating competition. The lecturer and the student could not be more different, yet they are thrown together to work as a team.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2020-10-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4D0LwwHmhgd3R3nmln13wEEjKHL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/m2p8j2qVJNV26GyoEF4GJOv0xQg.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4D0LwwHmhgd3R3nmln13wEEjKHL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//m2p8j2qVJNV26GyoEF4GJOv0xQg.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11868,"title":"Dracula","description":"After Jonathan Harker attacks Dracula at his castle, the vampire travels to a nearby city, where he preys on the family of Harker''s fiancée. The only one who may be able to protect them is Dr. van Helsing, Harker''s friend and fellow-student of vampires, who is determined to destroy Dracula, whatever the cost.","duration":"1:22:00","genre":["Horror"],"release_date":"1958-04-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ijbBzlKSKwWNRpebLUGfmXhBrvg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9UHOATvzXQWbElSGygOY1ar3vpp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ijbBzlKSKwWNRpebLUGfmXhBrvg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9UHOATvzXQWbElSGygOY1ar3vpp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9603,"title":"Clueless","description":"Shallow, rich and socially successful Cher is at the top of her Beverly Hills high school''s pecking scale. Seeing herself as a matchmaker, Cher first coaxes two teachers into dating each other. Emboldened by her success, she decides to give hopelessly klutzy new student Tai a makeover. When Tai becomes more popular than she is, Cher realizes that her disapproving ex-stepbrother was right about how misguided she was -- and falls for him.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"1995-07-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/65d0MccsiRSPTVicregKQL8owoo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8AwVTcgpTnmeOs4TdTWqcFDXEsA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//65d0MccsiRSPTVicregKQL8owoo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8AwVTcgpTnmeOs4TdTWqcFDXEsA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2014,"title":"The Edge of Heaven","description":"The lives of six German-Turkish immigrants are drawn together by circumstance: An old man and a prostitute forging a partnership, a young scholar reconciling his past, two young women falling in love, and a mother putting the shattered pieces of her life back together.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2007-09-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/s3kGgVwM946SWj3iXShDbeJALiT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kqhVVpXFtOotSlK0npVaBHXUqxV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//s3kGgVwM946SWj3iXShDbeJALiT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kqhVVpXFtOotSlK0npVaBHXUqxV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":407448,"title":"Detroit","description":"A police raid in Detroit in 1967 results in one of the largest citizens'' uprisings in the history of the United States.","duration":"2:23:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","History"],"release_date":"2017-07-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3pl3WgBFp7YLIow01fro1gj2UfA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/r0ldqSFASpqSM5xTrpcZGO6Ef2G.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3pl3WgBFp7YLIow01fro1gj2UfA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//r0ldqSFASpqSM5xTrpcZGO6Ef2G.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":271674,"title":"Suite Française","description":"France, 1940. In the first days of occupation, beautiful Lucile Angellier is trapped in a stifled existence with her controlling mother-in-law as they both await news of her husband: a prisoner of war. Parisian refugees start to pour into their small town, soon followed by a regiment of German soldiers who take up residence in the villagers'' own homes. Lucile initially tries to ignore Bruno von Falk, the handsome and refined German officer staying with them. But soon, a powerful love draws them together and leads them into the tragedy of war.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","War"],"release_date":"2015-03-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/j82SfPOqas5rvHbAHAPq7OgaSir.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mPgijY9f79FfD7K8MmzsynXpq0R.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//j82SfPOqas5rvHbAHAPq7OgaSir.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mPgijY9f79FfD7K8MmzsynXpq0R.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":45958,"title":"Biutiful","description":"This is a story of a man in free fall. On the road to redemption, darkness lights his way. Connected with the afterlife, Uxbal is a tragic hero and father of two who''s sensing the danger of death. He struggles with a tainted reality and a fate that works against him in order to forgive, for love, and forever.","duration":"2:28:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2010-10-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/s1r2aBDzkvlFkNnAgxWFTCQjKPe.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4BLshBMp8INRDhvfuKwxMlHDIIt.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//s1r2aBDzkvlFkNnAgxWFTCQjKPe.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4BLshBMp8INRDhvfuKwxMlHDIIt.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":19597,"title":"The Hedgehog","description":"Paloma is a serious and highly articulate but deeply bored 11-year-old who has decided to kill herself on her 12th birthday. Fascinated by art and philosophy, she questions and documents her life and immediate circle, drawing trenchant and often hilarious observations on the world around her. But as her appointment with death approaches, Paloma finally meets some kindred spirits in her building''s grumpy janitor and an enigmatic, elegant neighbor, both of whom inspire Paloma to question her rather pessimistic outlook on life.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2009-07-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/brOMTLeCIz0LBt4jxMp1658aT45.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dGV6PP3m871ur8pUFWR3NUysTi2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//brOMTLeCIz0LBt4jxMp1658aT45.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dGV6PP3m871ur8pUFWR3NUysTi2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8129,"title":"My Name Is Joe","description":"Two thirtysomethings, unemployed former alcoholic Joe and community health worker Sarah, start a romantic relationship in one of the 