have to babysit a little Neanderthal baby.","duration":"0:05:00","genre":["Animation","Family"],"release_date":"2015-11-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/taCWtbPrBNooPqavM9dktdPYtIj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gduXRlGrywqLry0sdDrf37Tyibh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//taCWtbPrBNooPqavM9dktdPYtIj.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gduXRlGrywqLry0sdDrf37Tyibh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":229407,"title":"Puppy","description":"A Minion, longing for a puppy, humorously tries to catch a dog, a squirrel, and even a ladybug, but none of his attempts succeed. Just as his hopes fade, a tiny UFO swoops down and abducts the ladybug. The Minion watches in fascination as the UFO, making adorable beeping noises, forms an unexpected bond with him, becoming his new \"puppy.\" They share fun adventures, with the UFO using its space powers to entertain, playing music and enlarging snacks like cheese puffs and bananas.  One evening, the UFO puppy shows the Minion its home in the stars and expresses a longing to return. The Minion, determined to help, sends an email with their picture to the UFO''s home planet, triggering a rescue party. Before leaving, the UFO uses its grow-ray to enlarge the ladybug into a puppy-sized companion. The Minion, surrounded by friends, joyfully accepts the new “puppy,” ready for more adventures together.","duration":"0:05:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Comedy","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2013-12-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vK48h2fZarnDjXdsnHZFyL5lveI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bapLpnoV3PUbgcZNDwg6Hxe75HI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vK48h2fZarnDjXdsnHZFyL5lveI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bapLpnoV3PUbgcZNDwg6Hxe75HI.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":38805,"title":"Lilies of the Field","description":"An unemployed construction worker heading out west stops at a remote farm in the desert to get water when his car overheats. The farm is being worked by a group of East European Catholic nuns, headed by the strict mother superior, who believes the man has been sent by God to build a much needed church in the desert.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1963-06-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yyoZuEAMcT7QhpChN4s1JyUorcT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gYoVx2m8NP2hTWnEpwNeROIWrQ4.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yyoZuEAMcT7QhpChN4s1JyUorcT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gYoVx2m8NP2hTWnEpwNeROIWrQ4.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":17962,"title":"After Life","description":"On a cold Monday morning, a group of counselors clock in at an old-fashioned social services office. Their task is to interview the recently deceased, record their personal details, then, over the course of the week, assist them in choosing a single memory to keep for eternity.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Fantasy","Drama"],"release_date":"1999-04-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pXOsdvH4xuprxGmZMiCJsRAowi7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bs2M1hqAQl5LeAOPPRV4drwouZS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pXOsdvH4xuprxGmZMiCJsRAowi7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bs2M1hqAQl5LeAOPPRV4drwouZS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11524,"title":"Thief","description":"Frank is an expert professional safecracker, specialized in high-profile diamond heists. He plans to use his ill-gotten income to retire from crime and build a nice life for himself complete with a home, wife and kids. To accelerate the process, he signs on with a top gangster for a big score.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"1981-03-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w6