/p/w342//zGNLkZYzFrBvROL2g6UNJsfnA8h.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7mQyn9zDgrHfPtj37BLT1DK3mId.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":40001,"title":"Mrs. Winterbourne","description":"Connie Doyle is eighteen, pregnant and alone. She accidentally ends up on a train where she meets Hugh Winterbourne and his wife pregnant Patricia. The train wrecks and she wakes up in the hospital to find out that it''s been assumed that she''s Patricia. Hugh''s mother takes her in and she falls in love with Hugh''s brother Bill. Just when she thinks everything is going her way, her ex-boyfriend shows up.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"1996-04-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2peKSpj2WqR5QxHqS1xzrwkRfNd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/egeehOmWVnXj6ohtpqUOB7Eqxe5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2peKSpj2WqR5QxHqS1xzrwkRfNd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//egeehOmWVnXj6ohtpqUOB7Eqxe5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":36940,"title":"The First Beautiful Thing","description":"The film tells the story of the Michelucci family, from the nineteen-seventies to the present day: the central character is the stunningly beautiful Anna, the lively, frivolous and sometimes embarrassing mother of Bruno and Valeria. Everything begins in the Summer of 1971, at the annual Summer beauty pageant held at Livorno’s most popular bathing establishment. Anna is unexpectedly crowned “Most Beautiful Mother”, unwittingly stirring the violent jealousy of her husband. From then on, chaos strikes the family and for Anna, Bruno and his sister Valeria, it is the start of an adventure that will only end thirty years later.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2010-01-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1HiZLxlZdLNviwXdBGe6L77fIWm.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7h4BbIGigxaECJFQWEaQ9ih3INp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1HiZLxlZdLNviwXdBGe6L77fIWm.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7h4BbIGigxaECJFQWEaQ9ih3INp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":28966,"title":"Wings","description":"Two young men, one rich, one middle class, both in love with the same woman, become US Air Corps fighter pilots and, eventually, heroic flying aces during World War I. Devoted best friends, their mutual love of the girl eventually threatens their bond. Meanwhile, a hometown girl who''s the lovestruck lifelong next door neighbor of one of them pines away.","duration":"2:24:00","genre":["Drama","Action","War","Romance"],"release_date":"1927-08-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u90ajspDd9911ISbx74rtofQZfO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kEl6KCBgdmT1Nex3ka0EIWAOmtm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u90ajspDd9911ISbx74rtofQZfO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kEl6KCBgdmT1Nex3ka0EIWAOmtm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9821,"title":"The Mighty","description":"Kevin, an intelligent guy helps out Maxwell to improve his reading skills. In return, Kevin wants Maxwell to take him out places since he is not authorized to go out. Being the social outcasts of the town, Kevin and Maxwell come to realize that they are similar to each other and accept that they are \"freaks\" and nothing will stop them.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"1998-06-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wq41s88t8TUNDWWhpZQ65P4OhP8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eHcuTZwmY4VAJm7kfbZn7qDAjYs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wq41s88t8TUNDWWhpZQ65P4OhP8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eHcuTZwmY4VAJm7kfbZn7qDAjYs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8329,"title":"[REC]","description":"A television reporter and cameraman follow emergency workers into a dark apartment building and are quickly locked inside with something terrifying.","duration":"1:18:00","genre":["Horror","Mystery"],"release_date":"2007-11-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xfrguTH6maYiGsC8FXiQ9N3lZXw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hgyJR4sgMsee6xMFM3xYiG6cDCh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xfrguTH6maYiGsC8FXiQ9N3lZXw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hgyJR4sgMsee6xMFM3xYiG6cDCh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":850,"title":"A Christmas Story","description":"The comic mishaps and adventures of a young boy named Ralph, trying to convince his parents, teachers, and Santa that a Red Ryder B.B. gun really is the perfect Christmas gift for the 1940s.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"1983-11-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/feCcRTZNGUop3LnWBLTToYhd03S.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/34nSHYqmb7222tiqiuKqKJmZiQa.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//feCcRTZNGUop3LnWBLTToYhd03S.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//34nSHYqmb7222tiqiuKqKJmZiQa.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":268,"title":"Batman","description":"Having witnessed his parents'' brutal murder as a child, millionaire philanthropist Bruce Wayne fights crime in Gotham City disguised as Batman, a costumed hero who strikes fear into the hearts of villains. But when a deformed madman known as ''The Joker'' seizes control of Gotham''s criminal underworld, Batman must face his most ruthless nemesis ever while protecting both his identity and his love interest, reporter Vicki Vale.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Fantasy","Action","Crime"],"release_date":"1989-06-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rhc7OF7tC9HPu0X8DBKQJzaGRbu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cij4dd21v2Rk2YtUQbV5kW69WB2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rhc7OF7tC9HPu0X8DBKQJzaGRbu.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cij4dd21v2Rk2YtUQbV5kW69WB2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":528210,"title":"The Chinese Widow","description":"It’s 1941 and the Japanese attack on Pearl Harbor has destroyed America’s morale. The US President Franklin D. Roosevelt then decides to risk it all by bombing Tokyo and raise more hope for his citizens. After completing its mission, a unit of the US Air Force is forced to make an emergency landing in China. Its commander Jack Turner (Emilie Hirsch) barely survives but gets rescued by Ying (Crystal Liu), a local widow who will stop at nothing to hide him from the Japanese occupant.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","History","War"],"release_date":"2017-11-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/430DV9AgQ4mV8WjahXDvMKEfOHJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ztcaeAzK3VkllaWB0VEQdcSD7BO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//430DV9AgQ4mV8WjahXDvMKEfOHJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ztcaeAzK3VkllaWB0VEQdcSD7BO.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":121875,"title":"In the House","description":"A sixteen-year-old boy insinuates himself into the house of a fellow student from his literature class and writes about it in essays for his French teacher. Faced with this gifted and unusual pupil, the teacher rediscovers his enthusiasm for his work, but the boy’s intrusion will unleash a series of uncontrollable events.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2012-09-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rSlu3MWZzOVBy6e6UEw9mPLMzUO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6NCBSCCcyef9aNcABsVGZwuehSC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rSlu3MWZzOVBy6e6UEw9mPLMzUO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6NCBSCCcyef9aNcABsVGZw