r for the Planet of the Apes","description":"Caesar and his apes are forced into a deadly conflict with an army of humans led by a ruthless Colonel. After the apes suffer unimaginable losses, Caesar wrestles with his darker instincts and begins his own mythic quest to avenge his kind. As the journey finally brings them face to face, Caesar and the Colonel are pitted against each other in an epic battle that will determine the fate of both their species and the future of the planet.","duration":"2:20:00","genre":["Drama","Science Fiction","War"],"release_date":"2017-07-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ulMscezy9YX0bhknvJbZoUgQxO5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3vYhLLxrTtZLysXtIWktmd57Snv.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ulMscezy9YX0bhknvJbZoUgQxO5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3vYhLLxrTtZLysXtIWktmd57Snv.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11051,"title":"The Last Temptation of Christ","description":"Jesus, a humble Judean carpenter beginning to see that he is the son of God, is drawn into revolutionary action against the Roman occupiers by Judas -- despite his protestations that love, not violence, is the path to salvation. The burden of being the savior of mankind torments Jesus throughout his life, leading him to doubt.","duration":"2:44:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1988-05-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rBqdcQeM1h05YjF9rFtPWnNaDO2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7L4qwrC1mipZXJfU5oRgQWChLv1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rBqdcQeM1h05YjF9rFtPWnNaDO2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7L4qwrC1mipZXJfU5oRgQWChLv1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11020,"title":"Picnic at Hanging Rock","description":"In the early 1900s, Miranda attends a girls boarding school in Australia. One Valentine''s Day, the school''s typically strict headmistress treats the girls to a picnic field trip to an unusual but scenic volcanic formation called Hanging Rock. Despite rules against it, Miranda and several other girls venture off. It''s not until the end of the day that the faculty realizes the girls and one of the teachers have disappeared mysteriously.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Drama","Mystery"],"release_date":"1975-09-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/41Mlaj6wfjlF4wQaVH0tjfDXvMi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7BAXwmFN4pZDNb9N6kzmAAwdssi.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//41Mlaj6wfjlF4wQaVH0tjfDXvMi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7BAXwmFN4pZDNb9N6kzmAAwdssi.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10842,"title":"Strange Circus","description":"The erotic novelist Taeko is writing a morbid story of a family destroyed by incest, murder and abuse. Her assistant, Yuji, sets on a mission to uncover the reality of this story, but the reality might be too much to bear.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Mystery","Horror","Drama"],"release_date":"2005-12-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2CPsXJw4qZ00dp6PM0AleCoczk8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8uEvy8cVVomN82atiLp5i7JIuI4.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2CPsXJw4qZ00dp6PM0AleCoczk8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8uEvy8cVVomN82atiLp5i7JIuI4.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":948713,"title":"The Last Kingdom: Seven Kings Must Die","description":"In the wake of King Edward''s death, Uhtred of Bebbanburg and his comrades adventure across a fractured kingdom in the hopes of uniting England at last.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","War"],"release_date":"2023-04-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kEhCztSTP4ixu7R0AIWg8vvcvbb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qcNDxDzd5OW9wE3c8nWxCBQoBrM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kEhCztSTP4ixu7R0AIWg8vvcvbb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qcNDxDzd5OW9wE3c8nWxCBQoBrM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":637693,"title":"Spirit Untamed","description":"Lucky Prescott''s life is changed forever when she moves from her home in the city to a small frontier town and befriends a wild mustang named Spirit.","duration":"1:28:00","genre":["Adventure","Animation","Family","Western"],"release_date":"2021-05-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jtFy2m7CvOVTYoNTY9arN8DVHFi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fLE2mvuvhvzmSICOsqR9uE50Ave.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jtFy2m7CvOVTYoNTY9arN8DVHFi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fLE2mvuvhvzmSICOsqR9uE50Ave.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":264337,"title":"Spare Parts","description":"With the help of their high school''s newest teacher, four Hispanic students form a robotics club. Although they have no experience, the youths set their sights on a national robotics contest. With $800 and parts scavenged from old cars, they build a robot and compete against reigning champion MIT. Along the way, the students learn not only how to build a robot but something far more important: how to forge bonds that will last a lifetime.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2015-01-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4VXmlLKDCHEpNwMsGewezYlamKD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/r2bMAt51027Pm3sjvfDuRXs9IHW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4VXmlLKDCHEpNwMsGewezYlamKD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//r2bMAt51027Pm3sjvfDuRXs9IHW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":137698,"title":"The Dance of Reality","description":"''Having broken away from my illusory self, I was desperately seeking a path and a meaning to life.'' This phrase perfectly sums up Alejandro Jodorowsky’s biographical project: reconstituting the incredible adventure of his life. He was born in 1929 Tocopilla, a coastal town on edge of the Chilean desert, where he discovered the fundamentals of reality, as he underwent an unhappy and alienated childhood as part of an uprooted family.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Drama","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2013-06-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vcZg3tjspOOIKlDQGfXZtxOqrBt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2qbsG9t943DciYTHITISzXQltqt.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vcZg3tjspOOIKlDQGfXZtxOqrBt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2qbsG9t943DciYTHITISzXQltqt.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":72570,"title":"The Vow","description":"Happy young married couple Paige and Leo are, well, happy. Then a car accident puts Paige into a life-threatening coma. Upon awakening she has lost the previous five years of memories, including those of her beloved Leo, her wedding, a confusing relationship with her parents, or the ending of her relationship with her ex-fiance. Despite these complications, Leo endeavors to win her heart again and rebuild their marriage.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2012-02-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a8IFeO1BMn4QEfLsf41Ml7LodyC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/y5GUXzTvt7kSQbdQrSvbYNoa8HB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//a8IFeO1BMn4QEfLsf41Ml7LodyC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//y5GUXzTvt7kSQbdQrSvbYNoa8HB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":25205,"title":"The Concert","description":"A former world-famous conductor of the Bolshoï orchestra, known as \"The Maëstro\", Andreï Filipov had seen his career publicly broken by Leonid Brezhnev for hiring Jewish musicians and now works cleaning the concert hall where he once directed. One day, he intercepts an official invitation from the prestigious Théâtre du Châtelet. Through a series of mad antics, he reunites his old orchestra, now composed of old alcoholic musicians, and flies to perform in Paris and complete the Tchaikovsky concerto interrupted 30 years earlier. For the concerto, he engages a young violin soloist with whom he has an unexpected connection.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2009-11-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/Ng3bVep7dL8qQiWhWQlSo2OvpZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nMIDVIq7p2mcvolG93FH4Ku3aYJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//Ng3bVep7dL8qQiWhWQlSo2OvpZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nMIDVIq7p2mcvolG93FH4Ku3aYJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":19673,"title":"Sexmission","description":"Two scientists are chosen as guinea pigs for a time experiment: they are placed in hibernation and should be brought back to life after three years. In the meantime, however, World War III breaks out and life has been wiped off the surface of Earth. When they wake up, it turns out that not only 50 years have passed but also that they are the only living specimens of the male sex in a new, underground society composed exclusively of women.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Adventure","Comedy"],"release_date":"1984-05-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/36nTaD0feaC8fXry2eG9qOCJJfc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8zh3AuXBxGbgtebL5DpaDxJgMeW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//36nTaD0feaC8fXry2eG9qOCJJfc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8zh3AuXBxGbgtebL5DpaDxJgMeW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11770,"title":"Shaolin Soccer","description":"A young Shaolin follower reunites with his discouraged brothers to form a soccer team using their martial art skills to their advantage.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Action","Comedy"],"release_date":"2001-07-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lMRX4cLx4hxYth3iQ96c0E1RHGB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/z6ZQqwoxWy9muIxwUP4K2zWw7BU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lMRX4cLx4hxYth3iQ96c0E1RHGB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//z6ZQqwoxWy9muIxwUP4K2zWw7BU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":403,"title":"Driving Miss Daisy","description":"The story of an old Jewish widow named Daisy Werthan and her relationship with her black chauffeur, Hoke. From an initial mere work relationship grew in 25 years a strong friendship between the two very different characters, in a time when those types of relationships were shunned.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1989-12-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4XC0HwRNOvub6xksENsOl68zHOn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iaCzvcY42HihFxQBTZCTKMpsI0P.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4XC0HwRNOvub6xksENsOl68zHOn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iaCzvcY42HihFxQBTZCTKMpsI0P.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1158915,"title":"Dìdi (弟弟)","description":"In 2008, during the last month of summer before high school begins, an impressionable 13-year-old Taiwanese American boy learns what his family can''t teach him: how to skate, how to flirt, and how to love your mom.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2024-07-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jD1oLRnLSKiLhutjiZ6OzgCgBsr.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3UCTNaZgxW6BbeHMMTe6uL07MpV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jD1oLRnLSKiLhutjiZ6OzgCgBsr.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3UCTNaZgxW6BbeHMMTe6uL07MpV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":614930,"title":"Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Mutant Mayhem","description":"After years of being sheltered from the human world, the 