ent complex looks the same and the key coincide completely - just typical Soviet-type ''economy'' architecture. Imagine the surprise of Nadya when she enters her apartment and finds a man without trousers in her bed. What''s more - Nadya''s fiancé also finds him there...","duration":"3:12:00","genre":["TV Movie","Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"1976-01-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1kShjfoNZe0wTF16jvPaX8OOel1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zlkG0yVVamCyBnLLbD2zOaHMJEz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1kShjfoNZe0wTF16jvPaX8OOel1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zlkG0yVVamCyBnLLbD2zOaHMJEz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":18947,"title":"The Boat That Rocked","description":"When a group of rebellious deejays decides to defy the ban on government-censored music, they take to the seas to broadcast music and mayhem to millions of adoring fans.","duration":"2:15:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2009-04-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vZS0CQBaxj1CPFWTICXLXMJbb3o.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/l7CBRLAXUnHi0kp2krhLtlJvtWI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vZS0CQBaxj1CPFWTICXLXMJbb3o.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//l7CBRLAXUnHi0kp2krhLtlJvtWI.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":986,"title":"Chimes at Midnight","description":"Henry IV usurps the English throne, sets in motion the factious War of the Roses and now faces a rebellion led by Northumberland scion Hotspur. Henry''s heir, Prince Hal, is a ne''er-do-well carouser who drinks and causes mischief with his low-class friends, especially his rotund father figure, John Falstaff. To redeem his title, Hal may have to choose between allegiance to his real father and loyalty to his friend.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","History","War"],"release_date":"1965-12-22","backdrop_path":"https