stinct differences create big clashes between these various tribes. When a mysterious threat puts all of the Trolls across the land in danger, Poppy, Branch, and their band of friends must embark on an epic quest to create harmony among the feuding Trolls to unite them against certain doom.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Family","Animation","Comedy","Fantasy","Adventure","Music"],"release_date":"2020-03-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qsxhnirlp7y4Ae9bd11oYJSX59j.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7W0G3YECgDAfnuiHG91r8WqgIOe.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qsxhnirlp7y4Ae9bd11oYJSX59j.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7W0G3YECgDAfnuiHG91r8WqgIOe.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":70160,"title":"The Hunger Games","description":"In a dystopian society where the Capitol forces each district to send two young tributes to fight to the death in a televised spectacle, a girl volunteers to take her sister’s place, setting the stage for a struggle of survival and defiance.","duration":"2:22:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Adventure","Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2012-03-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eVYChqJavS1DCXFeJE2lzVUMLKp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/apa5G43Hha7kH7wJG0gkkHT7FA9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eVYChqJavS1DCXFeJE2lzVUMLKp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//apa5G43Hha7kH7wJG0gkkHT7FA9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":53486,"title":"The Family Friend","description":"Geremia, an aging tailor/money lender, is a repulsive, mean, stingy man who lives alone in his shabby house with his scornful, bedridden mother. He has a morbid, obsessive relationship with money and he uses it to insinuate himself into other people''s affairs, pretending to be the \"family friend\". One day he is asked by a man to lend him money for the wedding of Rosalba, his daughter. Geremia falls in love at first sight with the bewitching creature and and soon indulges in a \"beauty and the beast\" relationship...","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2006-10-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/h7vIVkj5sQfFnPdw8WgnV4P84vP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4GErGIgZuhRbwMH9fYSQcZTeShT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//h7vIVkj5sQfFnPdw8WgnV4P84vP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4GErGIgZuhRbwMH9fYSQcZTeShT.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":35838,"title":"Tristana","description":"As a young woman, Tristana is orphaned and taken under the guardianship of Don Lope, a respected member of the community, who takes advantage of his innocent charge. When Tristana falls in love with artist Horacio, she must learn to be more assertive in order to achieve independence from her nefarious guardian, or her blossoming relationship with Horacio is doomed.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1970-03-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rAJEXUzsWRuM5zcmiWs2b10AZTC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zs695dsih9HRlj0YF4rujHTRya5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rAJEXUzsWRuM5zcmiWs2b10AZTC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zs695dsih9HRlj0YF4rujHTRya5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":25680,"title":"The Friends of Eddie Coyle","description":"An aging hood is about to go back to prison. Hoping to escape his fate, he supplies information on stolen guns to the feds, while simultaneously supplying arms to his bank robbing chums.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1973-06-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mRRFX4LHJTEEnIfYI7dMCRvAdD3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tyV8Bgf2huCIbGUxTdGgnzdIRKZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image