ion","Adventure","Mystery"],"release_date":"2009-12-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/85g84VtSf9tu1A9JqqruXEHspb7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/momkKuWburNTqKBF6ez7rvhYVhE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//85g84VtSf9tu1A9JqqruXEHspb7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//momkKuWburNTqKBF6ez7rvhYVhE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":6479,"title":"I Am Legend","description":"Robert Neville is a scientist who was unable to stop the spread of the terrible virus that was incurable and man-made. Immune, Neville is now the last human survivor in what is left of New York City and perhaps the world. For three years, Neville has faithfully sent out daily radio messages, desperate to find any other survivors who might be out there. But he is not alone.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Drama","Science Fiction","Thriller"],"release_date":"2007-12-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ePgD1cwmklyrFBjl6z96IuixuSY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iPDkaSdKk2jRLTM65UOEoKtsIZ8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ePgD1cwmklyrFBjl6z96IuixuSY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iPDkaSdKk2jRLTM65UOEoKtsIZ8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":998022,"title":"The Teachers'' Lounge","description":"When one of her students is suspected of theft, teacher Carla Nowak decides to get to the bottom of the matter. Caught between her ideals and the school system, the consequences of her actions threaten to break her.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2023-05-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7RxhC2ntrglVl1nkKjAgNoO0XP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kWXA6PfQ0PpZpoCXoeBFRciRrUw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7RxhC2ntrglVl1nkKjAgNoO0XP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kWXA