4-01-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rjXK74vrvmFMN0vuFw3TViZ18Ha.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ZSrU2mvlzM5Jr30XtKCU1fziIj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rjXK74vrvmFMN0vuFw3TViZ18Ha.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ZSrU2mvlzM5Jr30XtKCU1fziIj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":55931,"title":"The Animatrix","description":"Straight from the creators of the groundbreaking Matrix trilogy, this collection of short animated films from the world''s leading anime directors fuses computer graphics and Japanese anime to provide the background of the Matrix universe and the conflict between man and machines. The shorts include Final Flight of the Osiris, The Second Renaissance, Kid''s Story, Program, World Record, Beyond, A Detective Story and Matriculated.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Animation","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2003-05-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7a4WHNllmX5ZGR0MfYJDPhV69eM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eDjIG2hAeMU5cxLrd6oiQqdqoZt.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7a4WHNllmX5ZGR0MfYJDPhV69eM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eDjIG2hAeMU5cxLrd6oiQqdqoZt.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":25716,"title":"Crows Zero II","description":"Genji and his victorious G.P.S. alliance find themselves facing down a new challenge by the students of Hosen Academy, feared by everyone as ''The Army of Killers.'' The two schools, in fact, have a history of bad blood between them. And the simmering embers of hatred are about to flare up again, burning away any last remnants of the truce they had so rigorously observed until now.","duration":"2:13:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Crime","Comedy","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2009-04-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/q2wxcc9xsqLptpVTIsCyYGYWomm.jpg","poster_path":"https://im