olen money is hidden but has forgotten its location, sending them on a journey to recover the loot and confront who they are.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2025-10-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zo1SfeASCrbHFaXJN9y1RW7uU2m.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cgvGExc0kfHRUffTKBSQHPKchrq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zo1SfeASCrbHFaXJN9y1RW7uU2m.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cgvGExc0kfHRUffTKBSQHPKchrq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1062807,"title":"SPY x FAMILY CODE: White","description":"While under the guise of taking his family on a weekend winter getaway, Loid''s attempt to make progress on his current mission Operation Strix proves difficult when Anya mistakenly gets involved and triggers events that threaten world peace.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Adventure","Action"],"release_date":"2023-12-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tKihJpAof64rjw0A8uvKohUVjra.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xlIQf4y9eB14iYzNN142tROIWON.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tKihJpAof64rjw0A8uvKohUVjra.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xlIQf4y9eB14iYzNN142tROIWON.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":129112,"title":"Wadjda","description":"An enterprising Saudi girl signs on for her school''s Quran recitation competition as a way to raise the remaining funds she needs in order to buy the green bicycle that has captured her interest.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2012-12-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e7CAgALwH47WEKVqTUfNZO5nPiO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/w4iCIZ1kWSOCt0yELjfUMNAToUF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e7CAgALwH47WEKVqTUfNZO5nPiO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//w4iCIZ1kWSOCt0yELjfUMNAToUF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":42006,"title":"Red Sorghum","description":"An old leper who owned a remote sorghum winery dies. Jiu''er, the wife bought by the leper, and her lover, identified only as \"my Grandpa\" by the narrator, take over the winery and set up an idealized quasi-matriarchal community headed by Jiu''er. When the Japanese invaders subject the area to their rule and cut down the sorghum to make way for a road, the community rises up and resists as the sorghum grows anew.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","History"],"release_date":"1988-10-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4bjVA2NrkrdNPPpKUt7eR2P3xlf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2CP2eazEBKJ3njm4HM63pMfs5tW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4bjVA2NrkrdNPPpKUt7eR2P3xlf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2CP2eazEBKJ3njm4HM63pMfs5tW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":38198,"title":"Itinerary of a Spoiled Child","description":"A foundling, raised in the circus, Sam Lion becomes a businessman after a trapeze accident. However, when he reaches fifty and becomes tired of his responsibilities and of his son Jean-Philippe, he decides to disappear at sea. However, he runs into Albert Duvivier, one of his former employees. He comes to realise that he has ignored the important things in his life.","duration":"2:15:00","genre":["Drama","Adventure"],"release_date":"1988-11-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tTz1kdkgxRTH7K5VwCBPOrVbSjx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9yZaH3bmvrN5EQktVZouaRTGKgQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tTz1kdkgxRTH7K5VwCBPOrVbSjx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9yZaH3bmvrN5EQktVZouaRTGKgQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10772,"title":"Django","description":"A coffin-dragging gunslinger and a prostitute become embroiled in a bitter feud between a Klan 