s://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gJb9HRAs1V4bA0VKsWpT6mhv2RT.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":19120,"title":"Juliet of the Spirits","description":"Middle-aged Giulietta grows suspicious of her husband, Giorgio, when his behavior grows increasingly questionable. One night when Giorgio initiates a seance amongst his friends, Giulietta gets in touch with spirits and learns more about herself and her painful past. Slightly skeptical, but intrigued, she visits a mystic who gives her more information -- and nudges her toward the realization that her husband is indeed a philanderer.","duration":"2:28:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1965-10-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9VeXz4mj4QaOfTNSLy0owJHkWEo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/NbN10moPWQiiIKDJsC7A3j4Mcy.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9VeXz4mj4QaOfTNSLy0owJHkWEo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//NbN10moPWQiiIKDJsC7A3j4Mcy.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":18030,"title":"Kiss Me Deadly","description":"One evening, Hammer gives a ride to Christina, an attractive hitchhiker on a lonely country road, who has escaped from the nearby lunatic asylum. Thugs waylay them and force his car to crash. When Hammer returns to semi-consciousness, he hears Christina being tortured until she dies. Hammer, both for vengeance and in hopes that \"something big\" is behind it all, decides to pursue the case.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Mystery","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"1955-04-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/znL0K0hPJndT7IAddNWBfAEYSRC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/z7me91nrpWLHY1mZOB2v20cK0zY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//znL0K0hPJndT7IAddNWBfAEYSRC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//z7me91nrpWLHY1mZOB2v20cK0zY.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8996,"title":"Europa Europa","description":"A Jewish boy separated 