vasion of Sicily","description":"Tonio, the son the bears King, is kidnapped by hunters in the Sicilian mountains. Due to the harshness of a winter that threatens famine, the Bear King decides to invade the land of men (in the hope of finding his son). Thanks to his powerful army and the help of a wizard, while he will succeed at both quests, he will soon find out that bears are not meant to live among men.","duration":"1:22:00","genre":["Animation","Adventure","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2019-10-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8NE6VgSJ2Dx0fQm1UxY9KVt9fLm.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tmSLN2bNCQ8fEex3rEw7GobJP3Z.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8NE6VgSJ2Dx0fQm1UxY9KVt9fLm.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tmSLN2bNCQ8fEex3rEw7GobJP3Z.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":321528,"title":"Batman vs. Robin","description":"Damian Wayne is having a hard time coping with his father''s \"no killing\" rule. Meanwhile, Gotham is going through hell with threats such as the insane Dollmaker, and the secretive Court of Owls.","duration":"1:20:00","genre":["Crime","Action","Adventure","Animation"],"release_date":"2015-04-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/g2XhZJhFiHcczWcXEEldItG53gd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aGp9XDXmVM5lCKHWtgBC15S7XLr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//g2XhZJhFiHcczWcXEEldItG53gd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aGp9XDXmVM5lCKHWtgBC15S7XLr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":35428,"title":"What Men Talk About","description":"Four old friends - Kamil, Lesha, Sasha and Slava - all well-to-do professionals in their late 30s embarking on a two days road trip from Moscow to Odessa. They wish to escape the metropolis and the everyday routine of work, family and girlfriends to relax in a nightclub run by Slava''s friend and to see the popular band B-2 show.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2010-03-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/i2VYdkt2qyIuxpZbhY1cWVkQAFi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kprgQJtu9I5ZWaDHeTTufDIGgaa.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//i2VYdkt2qyIuxpZbhY1cWVkQAFi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kprgQJtu9I5ZWaDHeTTufDIGgaa.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11850,"title":"Invasion of the Body Snatchers","description":"The residents of San Francisco are becoming drone-like shadows of their former selves, and as the phenomenon spreads, two Department of Health workers uncover the horrifying truth.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Horror"],"release_date":"1978-12-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lyHnFsWafILUlizalpCSikJT7Ui.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/skS02wdeH2C0nrbCQP3qKwJdZtZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lyHnFsWafILUlizalpCSikJT7Ui.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//skS02wdeH2C0nrbCQP3qKwJdZtZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2015,"title":"Secret Sunshine","description":"Shin-ae moves to her recently late husband’s hometown. Despite her efforts to settle in this unfamiliar and too-normal place, she finds that she can’t fit in. After a sudden tragedy, Shin-ae turns to Christianity to relieve her pain, but when even this is not permitted, she wages a war against God.","duration":"2:23:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2007-05-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bJd4hoeLCQIqqZnyQ9W1Bh5dIY7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vee1jyUrqUEmi5ZStWI1JJzLQJH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bJd4hoeLCQIqqZnyQ9W1Bh5dIY7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vee1jyUrqUEmi5ZStWI1JJzLQJH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1850,"title":"Man on the Moon","description":"The story of the life and career of eccentric avant-garde comedian, Andy Kaufman.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","History"],"release_date":"1999-12-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/c6jFpztvihsXraV51up2nxXfm5t.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/msOZS07xRIFnapwp3fprGbKEAfT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//c6jFpztvihsXraV51up2nxXfm5t.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//msOZS07xRIFnapwp3fprGbKEAfT.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1029575,"title":"The Family Plan","description":"Dan Morgan is many things: a devoted husband, a loving father, a celebrated car salesman. He''s also a former assassin. And when his past catches up to his present, he''s forced to take his unsuspecting family on a road trip unlike any other.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Action","Comedy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2023-12-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/arNhhBd88bP3Bjoe4HT8MFE1JQA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jLLtx3nTRSLGPAKl4RoIv1FbEBr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//arNhhBd88bP3Bjoe4HT8MFE1JQA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jLLtx3nTRSLGPAKl4RoIv1FbEBr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":496328,"title":"Sanju","description":"Sanju explores some of the most crucial chapters from movie star Sanjay Dutt’s dramatic and controversial real life. It gives a lowdown on his tryst with drugs and his trials and tribulations in the Arms Acts case and the 1993 Mumbai blasts.","duration":"2:41:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2018-06-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3gCW9kwMs8OPLzJEPQikgv980m6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/q1wkN4VQuBTj1AeyTLLz2w6awMA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3gCW9kwMs8OPLzJEPQikgv980m6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//q1wkN4VQuBTj1AeyTLLz2w6awMA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15152,"title":"OSS 117: Cairo, Nest of Spies","description":"Set in 1955, French secret agent Hubert Bonisseur de La Bath/OSS 117 is sent to Cairo to investigate the disappearance of his best friend and fellow spy Jack Jefferson, only to stumble into a web of international intrigue.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Crime","Action","Adventure","Comedy"],"release_date":"2006-04-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mrRzR4Xbt64heUQF5YBMMfdMEXu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dDVHVZVEbTV4JsB8ZjdXNmMK7rA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mrRzR4Xbt64heUQF5YBMMfdMEXu.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dDVHVZVEbTV4JsB8ZjdXNmMK7rA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14163,"title":"Chak De! India","description":"A team of rag-tag girls with their own agenda form Team India competing for international fame in field hockey. Their coach, the ex-men''s Indian National team captain, returns from a life of shame after being unjustly accused of match fixing in his last match. Can he give the girls the motivation required to win, while dealing with the shadows of his own past?","duration":"2:28:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2007-08-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dRl7PCVhBgosXuivxRg4fCz5G7D.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mmFMgEsTRCAGAtwffGpuo3mJsxN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dRl7PCVhBgosXuivxRg4fCz5G7D.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mmFMgEsTRCAGAtwffGpuo3mJsxN.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13446,"title":"Withnail & I","description":"Two out-of-work actors -- the anxious, luckless Marwood and his acerbic, alcoholic friend, Withnail -- spend their days drifting between their squalid flat, the unemployment office and the pub. When they take a holiday \"by mistake\" at the country house of Withnail''s flamboyantly gay uncle, Monty, they encounter the unpleasant side of the English countryside: tedium, terrifying locals and torrential rain.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1987-06-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bOgKCymrdPHPHozhRBNr9XhVD87.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/i18cIp8A10A2JgByrfA9oIC9299.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bOgKCymrdPHPHozhRBNr9XhVD87.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//i18cIp8A10A2JgByrfA9oIC9299.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9261,"title":"The Wedding Banquet","description":"A Taiwanese-American man is happily settled in New York with his American boyfriend. He plans a marriage of convenience to a Chinese woman in order to keep his parents off his back and to get the woman a green card. Chaos follows when his parents arrive in New York for the wedding.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1993-03-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AiADW9ru9v1DLbFo4Ac76CtlXjK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/arWCA8lg0rbdlwHUMvI46LNDhnL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AiADW9ru9v1DLbFo4Ac76CtlXjK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//arWCA8lg0rbdlwHUMvI46LNDhnL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2055,"title":"Open Range","description":"A former gunslinger is forced to take up arms again when he and his cattle crew are threatened by a corrupt lawman.","duration":"2:19:00","genre":["Western"],"release_date":"2003-08-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e65E7jH5bKMSgHJnWLw4ex02Dyu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1mrNc88NrUEGtMtat4FD7sfpFrW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e65E7jH5bKMSgHJnWLw4ex02Dyu.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1mrNc88NrUEGtMtat4FD7sfpFrW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1064835,"title":"The Seven Deadly Sins: Grudge of Edinburgh Part 2","description":"Reunited with Lancelot for the first time since their tragic accident, Tristan must learn to conquer his inner demons in order to save his mother''s life.","duration":"0:55:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2023-08-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6NbqvhC6oPuvXN5jta9WbaQJD2E.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/516MFML05KWiPfiQNAsVCGMySc7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6NbqvhC6oPuvXN5jta9WbaQJD2E.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//516MFML05KWiPfiQNAsVCGMySc7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":298582,"title":"Full Out","description":"Based on the true life story of California gymnast Ariana Berlin. As she zoned in on her Olympic goals, 14 year old Ariana Berlin''s life took a sharp turn when she was involved in a debilitating car accident. Gaining her confidence and movement back through learning hip hop dance, she unexpectedly found herself called back to the gymnastics world thanks to world renowned UCLA Coach Valorie Kondos Field. With Val''s help, Ariana was eventually able to secure a spot on the UCLA gymnastics team and win an NCAA championship, a lifelong goal that she had always dreamed of. This is a wonderfully inspiring story of persistence, confidence, and the heart and courage to make a somewhat impossible comeback in life.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["History","Drama","Family"],"release_date":"2015-09-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/t6LhhNQUXXq8w0EvHBcnuBZHV7s.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e9c2JOwJlWUfIZRaxIWE2BZt5GV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//t6LhhNQUXXq8w0EvHBcnuBZHV7s.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e9c2JOwJlWUfIZRaxIWE2BZt5GV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":20128,"title":"Life Is a Miracle","description":"Set during the Bosnian war in the early 1990s, Luka is a mild-mannered railway clerk whose life is turned upside down, not just by the outbreak of the war, but when his wife runs off with a local musician. Then Luka''s son is conscripted and eventually captured in the fighting. To recover his son, Luka is commanded to guard a pretty young Muslim nurse who will be used in a hostage swapping operation.","duration":"2:35:00","genre":["Romance","Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2004-05-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oYdNnmgFybqL4z76B0tnG2XNYsY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wyPG79yFyq0zj4qWXD2CkCj0nTJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oYdNnmgFybqL4z76B0tnG2XNYsY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wyPG79yFyq0zj4qWXD2CkCj0nTJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":16769,"title":"Coal Miner''s Daughter","description":"Biography of Loretta Lynn, a country and western singer that came from poverty to fame.","duration":"2:05:00","genre":["Music","Drama","History"],"release_date":"1980-03-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/Aa4UDJWVckGXwPZxY5qpRifQFYp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bzHFDAdUad4QcHPi2UOqvaQKNWA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//Aa4UDJWVckGXwPZxY5qpRifQFYp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bzHFDAdUad4QcHPi2UOqvaQKNWA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15196,"title":"Clue","description":"Clue finds six colorful dinner guests gathered at the mansion of their host, Mr. Boddy -- who turns up dead after his secret is exposed: He was blackmailing all of them. With the killer among them, the guests and Boddy''s chatty butler must suss out the culprit before the body count rises.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime","Mystery"],"release_date":"1985-12-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rsclb1vtH6IkxmVBuCC37biEBT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aRxbYOYHS8T73nzR8hsLousoplR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rsclb1vtH6IkxmVBuCC37biEBT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aRxbYOYHS8T73nzR8hsLousoplR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8424,"title":"Love Me If You Dare","description":"As adults, best friends Julien and Sophie continue the odd game they started as children -- a fearless competition to outdo one another with daring and outrageous stunts. While they often act out to relieve one another''s pain, their game might be a way to avoid the fact that they are truly meant for one another.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2003-09-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bwbTBi7QmHDGuI7A51B16IoCqpN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vvjC5LSMANKvGGDHjIWj1YomPdN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bwbTBi7QmHDGuI7A51B16IoCqpN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vvjC5LSMANKvGGDHjIWj1YomPdN.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2355,"title":"Reign Over Me","description":"A man who lost his family in the September 11 attack on New York City runs into his old college roommate. Rekindling the friendship is the one thing that appears able to help the man recover from his grief.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2007-03-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/inPupECvfe7cHuAwaEVBkDJjXZO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/b5EtDvwj2gdG1qMBLijamlLfJLB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//inPupECvfe7cHuAwaEVBkDJjXZO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//b5EtDvwj2gdG1qMBLijamlLfJLB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2024,"title":"The Patriot","description":"After proving himself on the field of battle in the French and Indian War, Benjamin Martin wants nothing more to do with such things, preferring the simple life of a farmer. But when his son Gabriel enlists in the army to defend their new nation, America, against the British, Benjamin reluctantly returns to his old life to protect his son.","duration":"2:45:00","genre":["Drama","History","War"],"release_date":"2000-06-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8J10PcjUuJlk3BG3BMHlUOiIUpM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fWZd815QxUCUcrWQZwUkAp9ljG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8J10PcjUuJlk3BG3BMHlUOiIUpM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fWZd815QxUCUcrWQZwUkAp9ljG.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1725,"title":"West Side Story","description":"In Manhattan’s Upper West Side, rival gangs of Polish-Americans and newly arrived Puerto Ricans clash for control of the neighborhood, even as two young members from opposite sides fall dangerously in love.","duration":"2:33:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1961-12-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/swYJtp5GISfsCMZ46y2WNBBwJsq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nzCMu6D5q60i2bVrIQ0DxlRSgCZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//swYJtp5GISfsCMZ46y2WNBBwJsq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nzCMu6D5q60i2bVrIQ0DxlRSgCZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":950028,"title":"The Invite","description":"Joe and Angela''s marriage is on thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic upstairs neighbors for a dinner party, the night spirals into unexpected places. Have they reignited the spark or lit the match that burns it all down?","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2026-06-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lEwqBGNR65KZv6Ej5ufcmhZu2y2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/b7Dr8Chzse8VagexAporUu2RtLx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lEwqBGNR65KZv6Ej5ufcmhZu2y2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//b7Dr8Chzse8VagexAporUu2RtLx.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":520318,"title":"Fatima","description":"In 1917, outside the parish of Fátima, Portugal, a 10-year-old girl and her two younger cousins witness multiple visitations of the Virgin Mary, who tells them that only prayer and suffering will bring an end to World War I.  As secularist government officials and Church leaders try to force the children to recant their story, word of the sighting spreads across the country, inspiring religious pilgrims to flock to the site in hopes of witnessing a miracle..","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2020-08-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jrsB8tChsAFTQilhsS8fxNTuear.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lfA46pZbk4kxIaQvHyBPq0KH84Q.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jrsB8tChsAFTQilhsS8fxNTuear.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lfA46pZbk4kxIaQvHyBPq0KH84Q.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":475094,"title":"The Captain","description":"Germany, 1945. Soldier Willi Herold, a deserter of the German army, stumbles into a uniform of a Nazi captain abandoned during the last and desperate weeks of the Third Reich. Newly emboldened by the allure of a suit that he has stolen only to stay warm, Willi discovers that many Germans will follow the leader, whoever he is.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["War","Drama","History"],"release_date":"2018-02-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1HscyOaJKZNxZI2CQHRiYGcV6vb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jdUSP7svZ3DOgCnB0upT1yiueUY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1HscyOaJKZNxZI2CQHRiYGcV6vb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jdUSP7svZ3DOgCnB0upT1yiueUY.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":374671,"title":"After the Storm","description":"Ryota is an unpopular writer although he won a literary award 15 years ago. Now, Ryota works as a private detective. He is divorced from his ex-wife Kyoko and he has an 11-year-old son Shingo. His mother Yoshiko lives alone at her apartment. One day, Ryota, his ex-wife Kyoko, and son Shingo gather at Yoshiko''s apartment. A typhoon passes and the family must stay there all night long.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2016-05-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6v9G4Sc5ciRUoJ2wkutX3JBQj9K.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uwpBfqI1xPkSWD5PYlwypoBIkpz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6v9G4Sc5ciRUoJ2wkutX3JBQj9K.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uwpBfqI1xPkSWD5PYlwypoBIkpz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":109410,"title":"42","description":"In 1947, Jackie Robinson becomes the first Black man to play in Major League Baseball facing unabashed racism from the public, the press and other players.","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2013-04-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eyjWwMOgkq4nh0wMtyW8XPJ749H.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iZ7jVGQWj3eBUdqwAPUlKk0BaS2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eyjWwMOgkq4nh0wMtyW8XPJ749H.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iZ7jVGQWj3eBUdqwAPUlKk0BaS2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":25518,"title":"La Belle Verte","description":"As part of an intergalactic coalition, a well-meaning space alien volunteers to bring a message of self-actualization and harmony with nature to the one planet rejected by all her peers as incorrigible: Earth.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1996-09-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a1ng6McskX9Qg8SJNE98zywG4ki.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8KE4MGBu9BNr2dawI17n1We64nF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//a1ng6McskX9Qg8SJNE98zywG4ki.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8KE4MG