plete, such as understanding what led Makoto to commit suicide in the first place and learning how to enjoy his second chance at life.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Animation","Drama","Family"],"release_date":"2010-08-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/prs7S1Gp6UL2ByRaZdbmEGNwLOP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aSM1ki4WSEgvPYMZ9K28aylImFF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//prs7S1Gp6UL2ByRaZdbmEGNwLOP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aSM1ki4WSEgvPYMZ9K28aylImFF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":59421,"title":"Bedevilled","description":"A disillusioned Seoul woman visits a remote island to reconnect with a childhood friend, only to find her trapped in an oppressive cycle of physical, mental, and sexual abuse. As tensions escalate, the situation spirals into a harrowing tale of survival and retribution.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Thriller","Crime","Drama","Horror"],"release_date":"2010-08-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5cnEvJ7W0lfR8auMXoSLxZOnEX1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uqvG28xhk34ExPZYu2wRGmKB34h.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5cnEvJ7W0lfR8auMXoSLxZOnEX1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uqvG28xhk34ExPZYu2wRGmKB34h.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":42297,"title":"Burlesque","description":"Ali leaves behind a troubled life and follows her dreams to Los Angeles, where she lands a job as a cocktail waitress at the Burlesque Lounge, a once-majestic theater that houses an inspired musical revue. Vowing to perform there, she makes the leap from bar to stage, helping restore the club''s former glory.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2010-11-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/t5S0EaBud0lT4lbn4HvIFZ4EBU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3U9zBIibERQZqYKM3N1a4MYgB