tion":"Skeptical young detective Ichabod Crane gets transferred to the hamlet of Sleepy Hollow, New York, where he is tasked with investigating the decapitations of three people – murders the townsfolk attribute to a legendary specter, The Headless Horseman.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Fantasy","Thriller","Mystery","Horror"],"release_date":"1999-11-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/m8t7K3LcAY7bpyQ7iQ5kGsrcjnh.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1GuK965FLJxqUw9fd1pmvjbFAlv.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//m8t7K3LcAY7bpyQ7iQ5kGsrcjnh.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1GuK965FLJxqUw9fd1pmvjbFAlv.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":436,"title":"Maria Full of Grace","description":"A pregnant Colombian teenager becomes a drug mule to make some desperately needed money for her family.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2004-04-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/q6xEN0Lx214QUXXXlQfLaoJS7EB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/30CImATfvHWLXy6a3KmHXnYXB6c.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//q6xEN0Lx214QUXXXlQfLaoJS7EB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//30CImATfvHWLXy6a3KmHXnYXB6c.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1002155,"title":"Monsieur Aznavour","description":"From his poor childhood to his rise to fame, from his triumphs to his failures, from Paris to New York, discover the exceptional journey of an artist. Intimate, intense, fragile and indestructible, devoted to his art until the very end, here is one of the most immortal singers of all time: MONSIEUR AZNAVOUR.","duration":"2:14:00","genre":["History","Music","Drama"],"release_date":"2024-10-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jLvNVWqyfvaMaYrOwtuVmNaGGXQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/23FkaTaAosaTcTgyuJdTf7TvcJu.jpg","small_b