ing an election to become chairman of the Wo Lin Shing triad, a gang leader lashes out and tries to seize the dragon-head baton, the official symbol of a chairman''s authority.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2005-10-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uVnHskokSRJ8cRItMA0L9NQ9dXa.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/js9w4pQNJq9si5AlwdvojBfC9Ml.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uVnHskokSRJ8cRItMA0L9NQ9dXa.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//js9w4pQNJq9si5AlwdvojBfC9Ml.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":16136,"title":"Juice","description":"Four Harlem friends -- Bishop, Q, Steel and Raheem -- dabble in petty crime, but they decide to go big by knocking off a convenience store. Bishop, the magnetic leader of the group, has the gun. But Q has different aspirations. He wants to be a DJ and happens to have a gig the night of the robbery. Unfortunately for him, Bishop isn''t willing to take no for answer in a game where everything''s for keeps.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1992-01-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/54xcERdFHlRny2FJ9NC4koForkR.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hfXFPMhNjLnCugBHMN0nrtKW7Ra.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//54xcERdFHlRny2FJ9NC4koForkR.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hfXFPMhNjLnCugBHMN0nrtKW7Ra.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1878,"title":"Fear and Loathing in Las Vegas","description":"Raoul Duke and his attorney Dr. Gonzo drive a red convertible across the Mojave desert to Las Vegas with a suitcase full of drugs to cover a motorcycle race. As their consumption of drugs increases at an alarming rate, the stoned duo trash their hotel room and fear legal repercussions. Duke begins to drive back to L.A., but after an odd run-in with a cop, he returns to Sin City and continues his wild drug binge.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Adventure","Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"1998-05-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qJaR9AZx2Qq2oJ3krnSO0Z5ne5I.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tisNLcMkxryU2zxhi0PiyDFqhm0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qJaR9AZx2Qq2oJ3krnSO0Z5ne5I.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tisNLcMkxryU2zxhi0PiyDFqhm0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":795811,"title":"Wheel of Fortune and Fantasy","description":"An unexpected love triangle, a seduction trap, and a random encounter are the three episodes, told in three movements to depict three female characters and trace the trajectories between their choices and regrets.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2021-04-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mTOUk5M0LXIATbJDZkeH4xzA2hV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/z3xqVWOsetW6pSEgx1uiqXfzRet.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mTOUk5M0LXIATbJDZkeH4xzA2hV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//z3xqVWOsetW6pSEgx1uiqXfzRet.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":355338,"title":"Riley''s First Date?","description":"Riley, now 12, who is hanging out with her parents at home when potential trouble comes knocking. Mom''s and Dad''s Emotions find themselves forced to deal with Riley going on her first \"date.\"","duration":"0:05:00","genre":["Animation","Family"],"release_date":"2015-11-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/q2haCPQUzeMlRlX0wKJgddMbE0o.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cGLwfmLqg39822RFQMUDat0UJev.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//q2haCPQUzeMlRlX0wKJgddMbE0o.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cGLwfmLqg39822RFQMUDat0UJev.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":348657,"title":"Woman at War","description":"Halla declares a one-woman-war on the local aluminium industry. She is prepared to risk everything to protect the pristine Icelandic Highlands she loves… Until an orphan unexpectedly enters her life.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Comedy"],"release_date":"2018-05-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7XolBNeZsAm4Gehx09Y4cPdvd5q.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9IwRoLxbYF1Vu1KxHt0aLbyeS5u.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7XolBNeZsAm4Gehx09Y4cPdvd5q.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9IwRoLxbYF1Vu1KxHt0aLbyeS5u.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":17905,"title":"Branded to Kill","description":"After botching his latest assignment, a third-ranked Japanese hit man becomes the target of another assassin.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Thriller","Crime","Action"],"release_date":"1967-06-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eBX1etPQLrvOeJb9YQodwQzVKUf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/asiSCq1SFrCV4gy7PJzw8c3m0yL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eBX1etPQLrvOeJb9YQodwQzVKUf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//asiSCq1SFrCV4gy7PJzw8c3m0yL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13807,"title":"Exiled","description":"A friendship is formed between an ex-gangster, and two groups of hitmen - those who want to protect him and those who were sent to kill him.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2006-10-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/znDXTRP0RL3G3Get8gyWvRqqgHi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kIvGTEAtmhe46Zf55TCr6K8Pfxw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//znDXTRP0RL3G3Get8gyWvRqqgHi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kIvGTEAtmhe46Zf55TCr6K8Pfxw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12092,"title":"Alice in Wonderland","description":"On a golden afternoon, wildly curious young Alice tumbles into the burrow and enters the merry, madcap world of Wonderland full of whimsical escapades.","duration":"1:15:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Fantasy","Adventure"],"release_date":"1951-08-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tyj0QztA0PkYo6XauifWjkx7UVi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/20cvfwfaFqNbe9Fc3VEHJuPRxmn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tyj0QztA0PkYo6XauifWjkx7UVi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//20cvfwfaFqNbe9Fc3VEHJuPRxmn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11165,"title":"Tora! Tora! Tora!","description":"In the summer of 1941, the United States and Japan seem on the brink of war after constant embargos and failed diplomacy come to no end. \"Tora! Tora! Tora!\", named after the code words used by the lead Japanese pilot to indicate they had surprised the Americans, covers the days leading up to the attack on Pearl Harbor, which plunged America into the Second World War.","duration":"2:24:00","genre":["War","History","Drama"],"release_date":"1970-01-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/z2mntgw06VvPybd1YlNBi5prg7N.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/c311sN931DixuZRer0JGYCwpx9N.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//z2mntgw06VvPybd1YlNBi5prg7N.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//c311sN931DixuZRer0JGYCwpx9N.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10452,"title":"Queen Margot","description":"Paris, Kingdom of France, August 18, 1572. To avoid the outbreak of a religious war, the Catholic princess Marguerite de Valois, sister of the feeble King Charles IX, marries the Huguenot King Henry III of Navarre.","duration":"2:18:00","genre":["Drama","History","Romance"],"release_date":"1994-05-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/h0lGYUOxXKCM1W7cgvHN1UW1TC4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8uGkhBLiJMIkwoh