nd offers to take one of them to Mexico City for a chance at sports stardom.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2008-12-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bmjo4w9MoLag2BjayBIHCAl0w0e.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rZRKMeyVkgxriKAjItTIf1gAcTD.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bmjo4w9MoLag2BjayBIHCAl0w0e.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rZRKMeyVkgxriKAjItTIf1gAcTD.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1418,"title":"Take My Eyes","description":"One winter night, Pilar runs away from home. With her, she takes only a few belongings and her son, Juan. Antonio soon sets out to look for her. He says Pilar is his sunshine, and what''s more, \"She gave him her eyes\"...","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2003-10-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7i0WHzf7GxUhfnrj1vOQRrKwrqK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2U9z48ULc5eQSlkERAaLjTZ276m.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7i0WHzf7GxUhfnrj1vOQRrKwrqK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2U9z48ULc5eQSlkERAaLjTZ276m.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":788,"title":"Mrs. Doubtfire","description":"Loving but irresponsible dad Daniel Hillard, estranged from his exasperated spouse, is crushed by a court order allowing only weekly visits with his kids. When Daniel learns his ex needs a housekeeper, he gets the job -- disguised as a British nanny. Soon he becomes not only his children''s best pal but the kind of parent he should have been from the start.","duration":"2:05:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Family"],"release_date":"1993-11-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/f9X91dUckoRzOZlw4XBUOfkN9FC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/shHrSmXS5140o6sQzgzXxn3KqSm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//f9X91dUcko