rnfield Hall, she meets the dark, cold, and abrupt master of the house, Edward Rochester. Jane and her employer grow close in friendship and she soon finds herself falling in love with him. Happiness seems to have found Jane at last, but could Rochester''s terrible secret be about to destroy it forever?","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2011-03-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/am9WwUTZuUDuinVcyST4OxJ8vFs.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3Cn7D0wEaxnvm8kTta1osNu3QJv.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//am9WwUTZuUDuinVcyST4OxJ8vFs.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3Cn7D0wEaxnvm8kTta1osNu3QJv.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10860,"title":"Steel Magnolias","description":"A young beautician, newly arrived in a small Louisiana town, finds work at the local salon, where a small group of women share a close bond of friendship and welcome her into the fold.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"1989-11-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nvrQW1NmhkQ7B4FjNik7uqMOldP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7ExUSN9s9gX9bhVM17zDLEizano.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nvrQW1NmhkQ7B4FjNik7uqMOldP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7ExUSN9s9gX9bhVM17zDLEizano.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10830,"title":"Matilda","description":"Matilda Wormwood is an brilliant and intelligent little girl. Unfortunately, her parents, Harry and Zinnia, fail to see that fact. As time passes, she finally starts school and has a kind teacher, loyal friends, and a terrifying, sadistic headmistress. As she becomes fed up with the constant cruelty, she discovers she has a special gift that she just might be able to use to outwit the unruly adults around her.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Comedy","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1996-08-02","backdrop_p