r that was to become a worldwide hit in little more than a decade. The story of the meteoric rise and catastrophic demise of the world''s first smartphone.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","History"],"release_date":"2023-02-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cUHxmWfkp6se0Rt10Kr86bMCYDE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nQSvHZDuMlrZdm7ooMo8gb4CXhW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cUHxmWfkp6se0Rt10Kr86bMCYDE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nQSvHZDuMlrZdm7ooMo8gb4CXhW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":277217,"title":"Descendants","description":"A present-day idyllic kingdom where the benevolent teenage son of King Adam and Queen Belle offers a chance of redemption for the troublemaking offspring of Disney''s classic villains: Cruella De Vil (Carlos), Maleficent (Mal), the Evil Queen (Evie) and Jafar (Jay).","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Family","Adventure","Fantasy","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2015-07-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/20ncMtoy9Cxy6OQxgXZemHoFymz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/65DkgHPSLVjgr6IYkpY9Aqqqid5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//20ncMtoy9Cxy6OQxgXZemHoFymz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//65DkgHPSLVjgr6IYkpY9Aqqqid5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":67572,"title":"The Band Concert","description":"Mickey is trying to lead a concert of The William Tell Overture, but he''s continually disrupted by ice cream vendor Donald, who uses a seemingly endless supply of flutes to play Turkey in the Straw instead. After Donald gives up, a bee comes along and causes his own havoc. The band then reaches the Storm sequence, and the weather also starts to pick up; a tornado comes along, but they keep playing.","duration":"0:09:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Music"],"release_date":"1935-02-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600