"tmdb_id":5996,"title":"We''re No Angels","description":"Three convicts escape from prison on Devil''s Island just before Christmas and arrive at a nearby French colonial town. They go to the store of the Ducotels, the only store that gives supplies on credit. They initially intend to take advantage of them but have a change of heart after they find the family is in financial troubles.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"1955-07-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jAvAhgVnCo45vc6IQPsp803Oaks.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/UsrZkcoj95K8ZVf7FMnTiZ5P4C.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jAvAhgVnCo45vc6IQPsp803Oaks.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//UsrZkcoj95K8ZVf7FMnTiZ5P4C.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4708,"title":"Is Paris Burning?","description":"Near the end of World War II, General Dietrich von Choltitz receives orders to burn down Paris if it becomes clear the Allies are going to invade, or if he''s unable to maintain control of the city. After much contemplation, Choltitz ignores orders, enraging the Germans and giving hope to various resistance factions that the city will be liberated. Choltitz, alongside Swedish diplomat Raoul Nordling, helps a leader organise his forces.","duration":"2:53:00","genre":["War","Drama","History"],"release_date":"1966-10-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/y8b8mobmUMem8woXGuQQT9uGFxn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hdlXGmBbfZuF46yVbsZnT2TRAnn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//y8b8mobmUMem8woXGuQQT9uGFxn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hdlXGmBbfZuF46yVbsZnT2TRAnn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":657644,"title":"Minnal Murali","description":"A tailor gains special powers after being struck by lightning but must take down an unexpected foe if he is to become the superhero his hometown in Kerala needs.","duration":"2:38:00","genre":["Action","Comedy","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2021-12-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hAv1GwwatyWV1RFXOfaASxgUVm4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/efetKFDyptrRpoHBb103Tg3Auw5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hAv1GwwatyWV1RFXOfaASxgUVm4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//efetKFDyptrRpoHBb103Tg3Auw5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":21452,"title":"Case Closed: The Fourteenth Target","description":"Ran’s secret past revealed! Ten years ago, something happened between her mom and dad. Now, plagued by nightmares, Ran is starting to remember… Meanwhile, a murderous card dealer breaks out of jail to seek revenge. His target: Ran’s father. Can Conan stop him in time and save his girlfriend’s family?","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Animation","Crime","Mystery","Adventure"],"release_date":"1998-04-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6Bev1r0VbGp8Riv9QiSgt832OoW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2W1FwcYpHarzO5GKBYucoGnDffA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6Bev1r0VbGp8Riv9QiSgt832OoW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2W1FwcYpHarzO5GKBYucoGnDffA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11330,"title":"Pusher 3","description":"Milo is aging, he is planning his daughter''s 25th birthday, and his shipment of heroin turns out to be 10,000 pills of ecstasy. When Milo tries to sell the pills anyway, all Hell breaks loose and his only chance is to ask for help from his ex-henchman and old friend Radovan.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2005-08-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mRqM7jaTPCdzRELR5sjOMgiDDwo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kLBQtXaKv9LDh7ie4yIvgrv5TmD.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mRqM7jaTPCdzRELR5sjOMgiDDwo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kLBQtXaKv9LDh7ie4yIvgrv5TmD.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10948,"title":"The Fox and the Hound","description":"When a feisty little fox named Tod is adopted into a farm family, he quickly becomes friends with a fun and adorable hound puppy named Copper. Life is full of hilarious adventures until Copper is expected to take on his role as a hunting dog -- and the object of his search is his best friend!","duration":"1:22:00","genre":["Adventure","Animation","Drama","Family"],"release_date":"1981-07-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lNmIAX1IuPIEPMHhLBEm4wmhYX0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bbPEYD1z1DN13UJMr9sjhMh8DJx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lNmIAX1IuPIEPMHhLBEm4wmhYX0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bbPEYD1z1DN13UJMr9sjhMh8DJx.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":96714,"title":"Diaz - Don''t Clean Up This Blood","description":"On July 19–21, 2001, over 200,000 people took to the streets of Genoa to protest against the ongoing G8 summit. Anti-globalization activists clashed with the police, with 23-year-old protester Carlo Giuliani shot dead after confronting a police vehicle. In the aftermath, the police organized a night raid on the Diaz high school, where around a hundred people between unarmed protesters—mostly students—and independent reporters who documented the police brutality during the protests had took shelter. What happened next was called by Amnesty International \"the most serious breach of civil liberties in a democratic Western country since World War II.\"","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2012-04-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6VKQ2ynCyPcrVIkP5S3cP3kcC7M.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vcGFlMHToPdYLn3ZMUwHsA8FQr0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6VKQ2ynCyPcrVIkP5S3cP3kcC7M.jp