e","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1963-06-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xdefSJpYARFdW4jPhPsuvUlmt2M.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xHVxIgqD5CxlOI5GHxvVSt5Zh5Y.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xdefSJpYARFdW4jPhPsuvUlmt2M.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xHVxIgqD5CxlOI5GHxvVSt5Zh5Y.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1014590,"title":"Upgraded","description":"Ana is an ambitious intern dreaming of a career in the art world while trying to impress her demanding boss Claire. When she''s upgraded to first class on a work trip, she meets handsome Will, and Ana pretends to be her boss– a white lie that sets off a glamorous chain of events, romance and opportunity, until her fib threatens to surface.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"2024-02-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/77Fqz6PFCSnWySDOmEL6ZPcaYIl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uhOXS17gRpTwA85WsZLlYFK3rz0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//77Fqz6PFCSnWySDOmEL6ZPcaYIl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uhOXS17gRpTwA85WsZLlYFK3rz0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":407655,"title":"A Cinderella Story: If the Shoe Fits","description":"A contemporary musical version of the classic Cinderella story in which the servant step daughter hope to compete in a musical competition for a famous pop star.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Comedy","Family","Fantasy","Music"],"release_date":"2016-08-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/adM7v1IbTXRKuE4AlQ5VyM5GQpt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qtxOA6Sb8lK1PfRiwduxYVuzaEv.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//adM7v1IbTXRKuE4AlQ5VyM5GQpt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qtxOA6Sb8lK1PfRiwduxYVuzaEv.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15451,"title":"Revanche",