":"1:56:00","genre":["Drama","Horror"],"release_date":"2007-12-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/obYVvi6eD4rjFeC7g4uoZQPIh7F.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gAW4J1bkRjZKmFsJsIiOBASeoAp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//obYVvi6eD4rjFeC7g4uoZQPIh7F.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gAW4J1bkRjZKmFsJsIiOBASeoAp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1160018,"title":"KILL","description":"When an army commando finds out his true love is engaged against her will, he boards a New Dehli-bound train in a daring quest to derail the arranged marriage. But when a gang of knife-wielding thieves begin to terrorize innocent passengers on his train, the commando takes them on, one by one.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2024-07-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u060S4drIWntmLeMDGe7mD0V6Jh.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/m2zXTuNPkywdYLyWlVyJZW2QOJH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u060S4drIWntmLeMDGe7mD0V6Jh.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//m2zXTuNPkywdYLyWlVyJZW2QOJH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":912908,"title":"Strays","description":"When Reggie is abandoned on the mean city streets by his lowlife owner, Doug, Reggie is certain that his beloved owner would never leave him on purpose. But once Reggie falls in with Bug, a fast-talking, foul-mouthed stray who loves his freedom and believes that owners are for suckers, Reggie finally realizes he was in a toxic relationship and begins to see Doug for the heartless sleazeball that he is.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Comedy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2023-08-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1HzL603WOer58xtnrRYdSIL5K04.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/n1hqbSCtyBAxaXEl1Dj3ipXJAJG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmd