 a theatre house. However, Eden is self-centered and loves only herself. She is frequently accompanied by her snooty cat, Chuzzlewit. She does not believe in Christmas and orders all her employees to work on Christmas.","duration":"1:16:00","genre":["Animation","Family"],"release_date":"2008-11-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vYjZEw6g76pDXSoXTwtypr42Iyz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fX9g1AE1JIqjX3LPPKVjcmHs6fd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vYjZEw6g76pDXSoXTwtypr42Iyz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fX9g1AE1JIqjX3LPPKVjcmHs6fd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":3543,"title":"Bagdad Cafe","description":"A German woman named Jasmin stumbles upon a dilapidated motel/diner in the middle of nowhere. Her unusual appearance and demeanor are at first suspicious to Brenda, the exasperated owner who has difficulty making ends meet. But when an unlikely magic sparks between the two women, this lonely desert outpost is transformed into a thriving and popular oasis.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1987-11-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xNZwsgmAt3aqjKZYWQmUzEij6XD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zeEa3jVkLE8C0KjOiiKqMbhHgaL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xNZwsgmAt3aqjKZYWQmUzEij6XD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zeEa3jVkLE8C0KjOiiKqMbhHgaL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":577922,"title":"Tenet","description":"Armed with only one word - Tenet - and fighting for the survival of the entire world, the Protagonist journeys through a twilight world of international espionage on a mission that will unfold in something beyond real time.","duration":"2:30:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2020-08-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mQOUyqDybTqxl73hO5LujCZsM1o.jpg","poster_pat