genre":["Action","Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"2000-11-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oW8tmQwXbg45AwqLqKCRhbgV89P.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/20ApKJUi1XYri37RAH3SDIp2Ykh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oW8tmQwXbg45AwqLqKCRhbgV89P.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//20ApKJUi1XYri37RAH3SDIp2Ykh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4518,"title":"Elizabeth","description":"The story of the ascension to the throne and the early reign of Queen Elizabeth the First, the endless attempts by her council to marry her off, the Catholic hatred of her and her romance with Lord Robert Dudley.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"1998-09-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/LTjGvAf92YLudl5zqJP9tHLuSo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qEk48VLOdibXFVIEzE9ETZUBcCs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//LTjGvAf92YLudl5zqJP9tHLuSo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qEk48VLOdibXFVIEzE9ETZUBcCs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":567646,"title":"Extreme Job","description":"A drug squad attempts to take down a criminal organization and they must go undercover to do so, so they begin working at a chicken restaurant, that becomes famous for its delicious chicken. Due to the unexpected popularity, the detectives find themselves in a situation they never expected.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Action","Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"2019-01-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3MUwpoEnsSNinnzVQ6mynvXBw7T.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/52oLgq2gEiZyDjpJ7tgkGruoQI0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3MUwpoEnsSNinnzVQ6mynvXBw7T.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//52oLgq2gEiZyDjpJ7tgkGruoQI0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":502425,"title":"Escape from Pretoria","description":"South Africa, 1978. Tim Jenkin and Stephen Lee, two white political activists from the African National Congress imprisoned by the apartheid regime, put a plan in motion to escape from the infamous Pretoria Prison.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Drama","History","Thriller"],"release_date":"2020-03-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vwbmp3vvX4U0VjinaQktYOBt5kW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8GGS0jkFFCnmdStvZED6NL6V7gd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vwbmp3vvX4U0VjinaQktYOBt5kW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8GGS0jkFFCnmdStvZED6NL6V7gd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":100898,"title":"North Sea Texas","description":"A teen boy living in a small town on the Belgian coast finds his ordinary life take an unexpected turn when a handsome traveler blows through town.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2011-03-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/61QRbP2qVRXLXK2NZBtNhHqeo2J.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jLmcMgjW8sM9vVqXopZa97RICWb.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//61QRbP2qVRXLXK2NZBtNhHqeo2J.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jLmcMgjW8sM9vVqXopZa97RICWb.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12144,"title":"The Land Before Time","description":"An orphaned brontosaurus named Littlefoot sets off in search of the legendary Great Valley. A land of lush vegetation where the dinosaurs can thrive and live in peace. Along the way he meets four other young dinosaurs, each one a different species, and they encounter several obstacles as they learn to work together in order to survive.","duration":"1:09:00","genre":["Family","Animation","Adventure","Drama"],"release_date":"1988-11-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sXfQGa7juaTpZ5IF17Xa6hI53nx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7phV1ETZnQrLsEeuk4hNeceEl25.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sXfQGa7juaTpZ5IF17Xa6hI53nx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7phV1ETZnQrLsEeuk4hNeceEl25.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":647,"title":"Final Fantasy VII: Advent Children","description":"Two years have passed since the final battle with Sephiroth. Though Midgar, city of mako, city of prosperity, has been reduced to ruins, its people slowly but steadily walk the road to reconstruction. However, a mysterious illness called Geostigma torments them. With no cure in sight, it brings death to the afflicted, one after another, robbing the people of their fledgling hope.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2005-07-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lsXnU0zkJSianGyxnK3Jhx4vObM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pTIXM2yu8McSlcQVs1VjVSNC45x.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lsXnU0zkJSianGyxnK3Jhx4vObM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pTIXM2yu8McSlcQVs1VjVSNC45x.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":227,"title":"The Outsiders","description":"In 1960s Tulsa, class divisions ignite a violent rivalry between the working-class Greasers and the privileged Socs. When a deadly encounter forces two Greasers, Ponyboy and Johnny, to flee, their struggle for survival and redemption exposes the fragile innocence and enduring bonds of youth on the wrong side of town.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"1983-03-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hpzbQDjl2yzf6MwrYOrbDJCmojc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/l9os0HcXY8BOkvUWAx4rvby3j6L.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hpzbQDjl2yzf6MwrYOrbDJCmojc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//l9os0HcXY8BOkvUWAx4rvby3j6L.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":651881,"title":"Bye Bye Morons","description":"When 43-year-old hairdresser Suze Trappet finds out that she''s seriously ill, she decides to go looking for a child she was forced to abandon when she was only 15. On her madcap bureaucratic quest she crosses paths with JB, a 50-year-old man in the middle of a burnout, and Mr. Blin, a blind archivist prone to overenthusiasm. The unlikely trio set off on a hilarious and poignant helterskelter journey across the city in search of Suze''s long-lost child.","duration":"1:27:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2020-10-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sBtBtQ7DigbXx4o1rqp80Pzr1qa.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iEzAKYpwdfFprRV39B7GxJoz9LV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sBtBtQ7DigbXx4o1rqp80Pzr1qa.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iEzAKYpwdfFprRV39B7GxJoz9LV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":129533,"title":"Barbie: The Princess & the Popstar","description":"Tori is a blonde princess who is bored of living her royal life, and has dreams of becoming a popstar. Keira, on the other hand, is a brunette popstar who dreams of being a princess. When the two meet, they magically trade places, but after realising it is best to be themselves.","duration":"1:26:00","genre":["Family","Animation"],"release_date":"2012-09-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kCQKdkfNc7Smox53QRalBO3Doe0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hab6ZMC3eXj9pQHlSxNUjonphCR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kCQKdkfNc7Smox53QRalBO3Doe0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hab6ZMC3eXj9pQHlSxNUjonphCR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":79553,"title":"The Front Line","description":"In 1951 ceasefire is declared, but two remaining armies fought their final battle on the front line Towards the end of the Korean War, a South Korean battalion is fiercely battling over a hill on the front line border against the North in order to capture a strategic point that would determine the new border between two nations. The ownership of this small patch of land would swap multiple times each day. Kang is dispatched to the front line in order to investigate the tacit case that’s been happening there.","duration":"2:13:00","genre":["Drama","Action","War"],"release_date":"2011-07-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pDgX3i0xd3bzLCmh6ejapPNMQx4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cRw9czK3hOnNenW1iVVpGM3kbn7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pDgX3i0xd3bzLCmh6ejapPNMQx4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cRw9czK3hOnNenW1iVVpGM3kbn7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":26730,"title":"Bugs Bunny''s 3rd Movie: 1001 Rabbit Tales","description":"If Bugs Bunny were to direct his signature inquiry--\"What''s up, doc?\"--toward the modern-day Warner Bros. creative team, he wouldn''t be far off. For 1001 Rabbit Tales, they''ve doctored up a batch of classic cartoons featuring the carrot muncher and his bumbling comrades and bundled them, near seamlessly, into a feature-length film. Here''s the premise: Bugs and Daffy, both book salesmen, are competing to sell the most copies of a kids'' book. Instead of burrowing a beeline to his sales territory (he should have made a left at Albuquerque), Bugs ends up in the castle of Yosemite Sam, here a harem-leading honcho. Sam''s pain-in-the-spurs son, Prince Abalaba, needs somebody to read him stories; Bugs, who''d sooner take the job than suffer the alternative, that involving being boiled in oil, signs on.","duration":"1:14:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Family","Adventure","Music"],"release_date":"1982-11-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5pDoHPXtrCBy7Ol0TyWkITKO7b8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wDXqtMTh88qCY0afA6JSXTxYHn3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5pDoHPXtrCBy7Ol0TyWkITKO7b8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wDXqtMTh88qCY0afA6JSXTxYHn3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10618,"title":"Once Upon a Time in China II","description":"Wong Fei-Hung faces the White Lotus Society, a fanatical cult seeking to drive the Europeans out of China through violence, even attacking Chinese who follow Western ways. Wong must also defend revolutionary Dr. Sun Yat Sen from the military.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Action","Comedy"],"release_date":"1992-04-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zrSmI2wP2WIkWrgfP7IDSY1F9fW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jvrQXnpgSpKXQ3fkz5p6RV8jZJa.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zrSmI2wP2WIkWrgfP7IDSY1F9fW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jvrQXnpgSpKXQ3fkz5p6RV8jZJa.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9316,"title":"Ong-Bak","description":"When the head of a statue sacred to a village is stolen, a young martial artist goes to the big city and finds himself taking on the underworld to retrieve it.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2003-01-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/A7WpMBH6N1T0pPIEXsq9w4tu0oB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oagqAwp48dMPoCT94yDJUDOCVPi.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//A7WpMBH6N1T0pPIEXsq9w4tu0oB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oagqAwp48dMPoCT94yDJUDOCVPi.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":979,"title":"Irreversible","description":"A woman’s lover and her ex-boyfriend take justice into their own hands after she becomes the victim of a rapist. Because some acts can’t be undone. Because man is an animal. Because the desire for vengeance is a natural impulse. Because most crimes remain unpunished.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2002-05-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xV1EfNSEg6id6juJPr1vM6p9x5X.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rxeDxo8FvZpLu6iplNpxdtAVnfu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xV1EfNSEg6id6juJPr1vM6p9x5X.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rxeDxo8FvZpLu6iplNpxdtAVnfu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":138,"title":"Dracula","description":"A British estate agent travels to Transylvania to meet with the mysterious Count Dracula, who is interested in leasing a London castle. After Dracula enslaves and drives the agent to insanity, the pair return to London together, where Dracula, a secret bloodsucker, begins preying on socialites.","duration":"1:14:00","genre":["Horror"],"release_date":"1931-02-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cemjdP7HrUyJAry85vRT19Hidbi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ueVSPt7vAba0XScHWTDWS5tNxYX.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cemjdP7HrUyJAry85vRT19Hidbi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ueVSPt7vAba0XScHWTDWS5tNxYX.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":59,"title":"A History of Violence","description":"An average family is thrust into the spotlight after the father commits a seemingly self-defense murder at his diner.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2005-09-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iZHJsUYxhjI6kbooHoQRWXv6F8E.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ptJKY9WGDUUL064ge3jW78zBX0t.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iZHJsUYxhjI6kbooHoQRWXv6F8E.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ptJKY9WGDUUL064ge3jW78zBX0t.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":591274,"title":"Fear Street: 1978","description":"In 1978, two rival groups at Camp Nightwing must band together to solve a terrifying mystery when horrors from their towns'' history come alive.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Horror","Mystery","Drama"],"relea