tween love and her duty as Guardian of the Heart of the Forest when she falls for a human, a talented young musician named Lukas.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Animation","Adventure","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2023-03-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lyHmhoRj3zXSdeCYbs2oOXLCF4K.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eeJjd9JU2Mdj9d7nWRFLWlrcExi.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lyHmhoRj3zXSdeCYbs2oOXLCF4K.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eeJjd9JU2Mdj9d7nWRFLWlrcExi.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":285733,"title":"Barbie and the Secret Door","description":"A shy princess discovers a secret door in her kingdom and enters a magical world full of magical creatures. She meets a mermaid and a fairy who tell her about a spoiled ruler threatening them.","duration":"1:21:00","genre":["Animation","Family"],"release_date":"2014-08-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/d8YV61996Zq00UqSVBV9K8KJgN4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/i4BIMP1KZmERVwt4BFXKeBBIDvJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//d8YV61996Zq00UqSVBV9K8KJgN4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//i4BIMP1KZmERVwt4BFXKeBBIDvJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":72113,"title":"Carnage","description":"Two pairs of parents hold a cordial meeting after their sons are involved in a fight, though as their time together progresses, increasingly childish behavior throws the discussion into chaos.","duration":"1:20:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2011-09-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mntBeW6TRgm7GkYJwRDy3oJnKtn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3Imx53XV3T02ADlMxYazYXVNysZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mntBeW6TRgm7GkYJwRDy3oJnKtn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3Imx53XV3T02ADlMxYazYXVNysZ.jpg"},{"