1:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2020-03-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2DwSRqFuqZoGqbJVkuAFsulYVQA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iaoIzpakgSm0IQEz3edfAttr4YC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2DwSRqFuqZoGqbJVkuAFsulYVQA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iaoIzpakgSm0IQEz3edfAttr4YC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":512895,"title":"Lady and the Tramp","description":"The love story between a pampered Cocker Spaniel named Lady and a streetwise mongrel named Tramp. Lady finds herself out on the street after her owners have a baby and is saved from a pack by Tramp, who tries to show her to live her life footloose and collar-free.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Family","Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"2019-11-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nHNNKoqQOIWODk5mMyW8CvDisem.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8wBEye516IKul9sW7JKGcFXVGfV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nHNNKoqQOIWODk5mMyW8CvDisem.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8wBEye516IKul9sW7JKGcFXVGfV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":52333,"title":"Astral City: A Spiritual Journey","description":"The selfish Dr. André Luiz dies and awakes in the limbo called \"Umbral\". After a painful period in the gruesome swamp, he is rescued and brought in a white light to \"Nosso Lar\" (meaning \"Our Home\"). He finds a place of harmony, where people live in peace awaiting","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2010-09-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cmRirdFMcrwMqH1h51rwYCp7waH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rBOvHjIdNokh7GqTEZykm2Mo9Ce.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cmRirdFMcrwMqH1h51rwYCp7waH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rBOvHjIdNokh7GqTEZykm2Mo9Ce.jpg"},{"tmdb_id"