g/t/p/w342//v2X1BtkxaV8pzLbmM8a5gTdpg7B.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":82693,"title":"Silver Linings Playbook","description":"After losing his job and wife, and spending time in an institution, a former teacher winds up living with his parents. He wants to rebuild his life and reconcile with his wife, but his father would be happy if he shared his obsession with the Philadelphia Eagles. Things get complicated when he meets Tiffany Maxwell who offers to help him reconnect with his wife if he will do something very important for her in exchange.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2012-11-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/12GpsUm9nVVKFlcjDTflKLClFVA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fhHB1uvfFKKFbj6bTKE8xdtsjKi.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//12GpsUm9nVVKFlcjDTflKLClFVA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fhHB1uvfFKKFbj6bTKE8xdtsjKi.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":44321,"title":"Our Lady of the Assassins","description":"World-weary author Fernando has returned to his native Colombia to live out his days in peace. But Fernando''s once-quiet hometown has become a hotbed of violence, drugs, and corruption. On the brink of despair, Fernando meets Alexis, a beautiful but hardened street kid who lives by the rule of the gun. Together, they forge an unlikely relationship.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2000-09-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cT3grVcsGHCfZGATDl7ifXkaoiG.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/q5jT6BBCIWIysr712UIZY7BOGje.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cT3grVcsGHCfZGATDl7ifXkaoiG.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//q5jT6BBCIWIysr712UIZY7BOGje.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":41343,"title":"The God of Cookery","description":"The most renowned and feared chef in the world loses his title of God of Cookery because of his pompous attitude. Humbled, he sets out to reclaim his title.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1996-12-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zqDAbBZkAgQEKvBLih1GFitDWC8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9BbEsmLl1kVPcsojW5W8kMm5Ws5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zqDAbBZkAgQEKvBLih1GFitDWC8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9BbEsmLl1kVPcsojW5W8kMm5Ws5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13400,"title":"Santa Claus Is Comin'' to Town","description":"A postman, S.D. Kluger, decides to answer some of the most common questions about Santa Claus, and tells us about a baby named Kris who is raised by a family of elf toymakers named Kringle. When Kris grows up, he wants to deliver toys to the children of Sombertown. But its Mayor is too mean to let that happen. And to make things worse, the Winter Warlock lives between the Kringles and Sombertown.","duration":"0:51:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Fantasy","TV Movie"],"release_date":"1970-12-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4byysN0CjC1vabe8bSGzPZWGU8Y.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8BYZEKB0BQkbniS1WRzPaU38cmp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4byysN0CjC1vabe8bSGzPZWGU8Y.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8BYZEKB0BQkbniS1WRzPaU38cmp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":916,"title":"Bullitt","description":"Senator Walter Chalmers is aiming to take down mob boss Pete Ross with the help of testimony from the criminal''s hothead brother Johnny, who is in protective custody in San Francisco under the watch of police lieutenant Frank Bullitt. When a pair of mob hitmen enter the scene, Bullitt follows their trail through a maze of complications and double-crosses. This thriller includes one of the most famous car chases ever filmed.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"1968-10-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/glvwKs7zwGh6G3hoCYJexwEfPfT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2ffzF1WmeXtH420fSUoCrecFvDA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//glvwKs7zwGh6G3hoCYJexwEfPfT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2ffzF1WmeXtH420fSUoCrecFvDA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":27430,"title":"Touchez Pas au Grisbi","description":"Gentleman gangster Max and his partner, Riton, pull off their last, most successful heist and find themselves comfortable enough to retire in the style they enjoy. However, Max confides the details of the theft to his younger mistress, Josey -- who has secretly taken up with ambitious young rival gangster Angelo. Angelo then has Riton kidnapped and demands the stash of gold as ransom, which threatens Max''s dreams of the perfect retirement.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"1954-03-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lz8Tbe00QsXrLJ412zY8gezVclx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/svG2UuJ3SPrCp8O0RGPaKbECilq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lz8Tbe00QsXrLJ412zY8gezVclx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//svG2UuJ3SPrCp8O0RGPaKbECilq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9441,"title":"Stepmom","description":"Jackie is a divorced mother of two. Isabel is the career minded girlfriend of Jackie’s ex-husband Luke, forced into the role of unwelcome stepmother to their children. But when Jackie discovers she is ill, both women realise they must put aside their differences to find a common ground and celebrate life to the fullest, while they have the chance.","duration":"2:05:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"1998-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iteE4cNHQm8PWmWDuKcCCnMLhS3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h90