e control of Seo Bok to serve their own agendas.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Action","Thriller","Mystery"],"release_date":"2021-04-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yC4DRg5aGgNpkHpUDpLtBqzownS.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dHOuFBQ4Vtr7aCDebC0dvpR27ww.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yC4DRg5aGgNpkHpUDpLtBqzownS.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dHOuFBQ4Vtr7aCDebC0dvpR27ww.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":527435,"title":"The Christmas Chronicles","description":"Siblings Kate and Teddy try to prove Santa Claus is real, but when they accidentally cause his sleigh to crash, they have to save Christmas.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Comedy","Adventure","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2018-11-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zQVsXIPXU040BnFtBmzoOfYGcDu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5Il2EMSF2KecrUKZPuen6BZmaCP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zQVsXIPXU040BnFtBmzoOfYGcDu.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5Il2EMSF2KecrUKZPuen6BZmaCP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":484862,"title":"Scooby-Doo! & Batman: The Brave and the Bold","description":"Scooby-Doo and the Mystery Inc. gang meet up with Batman and other friends to defeat evil villains and save the day.","duration":"1:16:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Action","Family","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2018-01-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bhzfjgG6EBL7UZp2ElyBx3L4DVA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uImdPC9V5L4uSWA6HV6Q6nxc8Ib.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bhzfjgG6EBL7UZp2ElyBx3L4DVA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uImdPC9V5L4uSWA6HV6Q6nxc8Ib.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":130925,"title":"Partysaurus Rex","description":"When Rex finds himself left behind in the bathroom, 