eries of events that send them and their family hurtling towards a shattering climax.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2007-09-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ocAiyzGWhfr3PtNXxYih5s19c1h.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/h4QXi4Ysuc3zICiK9jHxjCAK9Oh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ocAiyzGWhfr3PtNXxYih5s19c1h.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//h4QXi4Ysuc3zICiK9jHxjCAK9Oh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":157832,"title":"Calvary","description":"After being threatened during a confession, a good-natured priest must battle the dark forces closing in around him.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2014-04-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3JwLoQ98yofeGq8bu3Pjox5oI5s.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jzgiam18I0gR20LB8BAE5u4dIdm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3JwLoQ98yofeGq8bu3Pjox5oI5s.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jzgiam18I0gR20LB8BAE5u4dIdm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":38700,"title":"Bad Boys for Life","description":"Marcus and Mike are forced to confront new threats, career changes, and midlife crises as they join the newly created elite team AMMO of the Miami police department to take down the ruthless Armando Armas, the vicious leader of a Miami drug cartel.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Thriller","Action","Crime"],"release_date":"2020-01-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eAIHqfS3kXm7kZl4j7ZBfdegyEz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/y95lQLnuNKdPAzw9F9Ab8kJ80c3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eAIHqfS3kXm7kZl4j7ZBfdegyEz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//y95lQLnuNKdPAzw9F9Ab8kJ80c3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":36955,"title":"True Lies","description":"A fearless, globe-trotting, terrorist-battling secret agent has his life turned upside down when he discovers his wife might be having an affair with a used car salesman while terrorists smuggle nuclear war heads into the United States.","duration":"2:21:00","genre":["Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"1994-07-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jRZ3joUcg8YDCQYl4Tog5xhY6wk.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pqdvCBDThAOjlA0XBzbNm7GvwpU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jRZ3joUcg8YDCQYl4Tog5xhY6wk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pqdvCBDThAOjlA0XBzbNm7GvwpU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":25300,"title":"I''m Not Scared","description":"In a tiny community enclosed by wheat fields, the adults shelter indoors, while six children venture out on their bikes across the scorched, deserted countryside. Exploring a dilapidated and uninhabited farmhouse, nine-year-old Michele discovers a secret so momentous, so terrible, that he dares not tell anyone about it...","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Mystery","Drama","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2003-02-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gpjHHQcHKBefkgRkroGQHbS8CnG.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vTf4qR0OSuV4qBT8As4QoWxSJSq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gpjHHQcHKBefkgRkroGQHbS8CnG.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vTf4qR0OSuV4qBT8As4QoWxSJSq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4552,"title":"A Tale of Two Sisters","description":"Two sisters return home after a stay in a mental institution, only to face disturbing events and a strained relationship with their stepmother. As eerie occurrences unfold, dark family secrets begin to surface, blurring the line between reality and nightmare.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Drama","Horror","Mystery"],"release_date":"2003-06-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/syKbZiHVdXw0NcH6NdXWEKZaECv.jpg","post