ription":"A serial killer reappears 15 years after his murder spree with a book detailing his crimes. The resentful cop who failed to catch him before is assigned to protect him. The families of the victims plan revenge. And as the media circus spirals out of control, a masked man called \"J\" appears claiming to be the real killer.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2012-11-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zfC6I4v7OQw5crVsl3DMA0BLgbj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kT7Pmqgd0545MrN3MhwuCh4C8WK.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zfC6I4v7OQw5crVsl3DMA0BLgbj.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kT7Pmqgd0545MrN3MhwuCh4C8WK.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4173,"title":"Stromboli","description":"After the end of WWII, a young Lithuanian woman and a young Italian man from Stromboli impulsively marry, but married life on the island is more demanding than she can accept.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1950-02-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/58wyozfcoM7mFiA0soOJfHEA27N.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tsyyzGSspKsawHocchfokskwbeM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//58wyozfcoM7mFiA0soOJfHEA27N.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tsyyzGSspKsawHocchfokskwbeM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":506,"title":"Marnie","description":"Marnie is a beautiful but emotionally withdrawn thief, stealing from employers before disappearing under new identities. When her new boss, Mark Rutland, discovers her secret, his fascination turns to obsession, and he blackmails her into marriage, convinced he can cure her. But as he probes deeper into Marnie’s fractured mind, long-buried fears and compulsions begin to surface.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Thriller","Mystery","Romance"],"release_date":"1964-07-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.