 in Arkansas tries to clean it up of corruption after initially posing as an inmate.","duration":"2:11:00","genre":["Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"1980-06-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1mrub90uU3Q36Nvnwz2fzZdItwl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fjf3elnOC32m1BdNyxiL8CzNc6t.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1mrub90uU3Q36Nvnwz2fzZdItwl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fjf3elnOC32m1BdNyxiL8CzNc6t.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1495,"title":"Kingdom of Heaven","description":"After his wife dies, a blacksmith named Balian is thrust into royalty, political intrigue and bloody holy wars during the Crusades.","duration":"2:24:00","genre":["Drama","Action","Adventure","History","War"],"release_date":"2005-05-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kP8rK9dGS1pr0HrnmXfIi2heWjo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2NaFdWy9hkM35vZB1hkqsnTcms8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kP8rK9dGS1pr0HrnmXfIi2heWjo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2NaFdWy9hkM35vZB1hkqsnTcms8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":926,"title":"Galaxy Quest","description":"For four years, the courageous crew of the NSEA Protector —  Commander Peter Quincy Taggart, Lieutenant Tawny Madison, and Doctor Lazarus — set off on a thrilling and often dangerous mission in space... until their series was cancelled! Now, twenty years later, aliens under attack have mistaken the Galaxy Quest television transmissions for \"historical documents\" and beam up the crew of has-been actors to save the universe. With no script, no director, and no clue, the actors must turn in the performances of their lives.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Comedy","Science Fiction","Adventure"],"release_date":"1999-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yzQ0mkz1OUJKtUK1NWp53jiGcaJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fZXSwgZknp81vmciTb86rw0MejV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yzQ0mkz1OUJKtUK1NWp53jiGcaJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fZXSwgZknp81vmciTb86rw0MejV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":103758,"title":"Reality","description":"A dark comedy centering on the lives of a Neapolitan based family whose father, a fish merchant, is so infatuated with the reality TV show \"Grande Fratello\" (the Italian version of \"Big Brother\") he starts living his life as if he were on it.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2012-05-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3GldDOFWTq0TcmmN6OOjG2O8qQx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bl2Hy8yyHXmTSDLz3NMxIe9wgIo.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3GldDOFWTq0TcmmN6OOjG2O8qQx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bl2Hy8yyHXmTSDLz3NMxIe9wgIo.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":48034,"title":"Little White Lies","description":"Despite a traumatic event, a group of friends decide to go ahead with their annual beach vacation. Their relationships, convictions, sense of guilt and friendship are sorely tested. They are finally forced to own up to the little white lies they''ve been telling each other.","duration":"2:34:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2010-10-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aDKuDfEAYa2VENKd155D4ZoAl7c.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/djypJtQfUxeEMh6kc0aRzIoN9UR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aDKuDfEAYa2VENKd155D4ZoAl7c.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//djypJtQfUxeEMh6kc0aRzIoN9UR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10141,"title":"Dirty Rotten Scoundrels","description":"Con artist Lawrence Jamieson is a longtime resident of a luxurious coastal resort, where he enjoys the lavish fruits of his deceptions -- that is, until a competitor, Freddy Benson, shows up. When the new guy''s lowbrow tactics impinge on his own sophisticated work and believing him to be the infamous conman ''The Jackal'', Lawrence resolves to get rid of him. Confident of his own duplicitous talents, he challenges Freddy to a winner-takes-all competition: whoever swindles their latest mark, American heiress Janet Colgate, out of $50,000 first can stay, while the other must leave town.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"1988-12-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cDDH3WzL2qqpGB45NNolZhRJRBA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3176xH21fSetstKpEtAD1giHbyT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cDDH3WzL2qqpGB45NNolZhRJRBA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3176xH21fSetstKpEtAD1giHbyT.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":809140,"title":"Father Stu","description":"The true-life story of boxer-turned-priest. When an injury ends his amateur boxing career, Stuart Long moves to Los Angeles to find money and fame. While scraping by as a supermarket clerk, he meets Carmen, a Sunday school teacher who seems immune to his bad-boy charm. Determined to win her over, the longtime agnostic starts going to church to impress her. However, a motorcycle accident leaves him wondering if he can use his second chance to help others, leading to the surprising realization that he''s meant to be a Catholic priest.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2022-04-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rmhMB6KBxdSYatfiFoas60uF6Fc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pLAeWgqXbTeJ2gQtNvRmdIncYsk.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rmhMB6KBxdSYatfiFoas60uF6Fc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pLAeWgqXbTeJ2gQtNvRmdIncYsk.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":371638,"title":"The Disaster Artist","description":"An aspiring actor in Hollywood meets an enigmatic stranger by the name of Tommy Wiseau, the meeting leads the actor down a path nobody could have predicted; creating the worst movie ever made.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2017-03-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1hdorswm5HPxb81xq84H9gqveUq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2HuLGiyH0TPYxnCvYHAxc8K738o.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1hdorswm5HPxb81xq84H9gqveUq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2HuLGiyH0TPYxnCvYHAxc8K738o.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":68722,"title":"The Master","description":"Freddie, a volatile, heavy-drinking veteran who suffers from post-traumatic stress disorder, finds some semblance of a family when he stumbles onto the ship of Lancaster Dodd, the charismatic leader of a new \"religion\" he forms after World War II.","duration":"2:17:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2012-09-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6vvt0ghvrrzEB8Z1BLvmHOWUdxw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jjVGdNt4fYb3T2hjISGZ2qnCuaV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6vvt0ghvrrzEB8Z1BLvmHOWUdxw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jjVGdNt4fYb3T2hjISGZ2qnCuaV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":20770,"title":"But I''m a Cheerleader","description":"Megan is an all-American girl. A cheerleader. She has a boyfriend. But Megan doesn''t like kissing her boyfriend very much. And she''s pretty touchy with her cheerleader friends. Her conservative parents worry that she must be a lesbian and send her off to \"sexual redirection\" school, where she must, with other lesbians and gays learn how to be straight.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2000-07-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/f4ZgIaMpOWd6rewhCfoIIMqWquh.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8huD