0,"title":"Anomalisa","description":"An inspirational speaker becomes reinvigorated after meeting a lively woman who shakes up his mundane existence.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Animation","Drama","Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"2015-12-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xNykrL50OsygNTtFuHCw9U0D3eu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4DJ1zNr4Y6q7zQ27goEYla46VdO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xNykrL50OsygNTtFuHCw9U0D3eu.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4DJ1zNr4Y6q7zQ27goEYla46VdO.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":99343,"title":"Next Floor","description":"During an opulent and luxurious banquet, complete with hordes of servers and valets, eleven pampered guests participate in what appears to be a ritualistic gastronomic carnage. In this absurd and grotesque universe, an unexpected sequence of events destabilizes the endless symphony of abundance.","duration":"0:12:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2008-05-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ebdXwGc3y5lcbnUs9lJMlkycmsu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1HBizk472Kb0SY8NM8XTbig2xpm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ebdXwGc3y5lcbnUs9lJMlkycmsu.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1HBizk472Kb0SY8NM8XTbig2xpm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":17264,"title":"The Black Stallion","description":"While traveling with his father, young Alec becomes fascinated by a mysterious Arabian stallion that is brought on board and stabled in the ship he is sailing on. When it tragically sinks both he and the horse survive only to be stranded on a deserted island. He befriends it, so when finally rescued both return to his home where they soon meet Henry Dailey, a once successful trainer. Together they begin training the horse to race against the fastest ones in the world.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Family","Adventure"],"release_da