oster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rhv06T3gTFOShIVkQ0UipZFIyDw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//t1LMwZqFXjoa7KM4QWGZxmUYD4J.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rhv06T3gTFOShIVkQ0UipZFIyDw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13580,"title":"The Spy Who Came In from the Cold","description":"British agent Alec Leamas refuses to come in from the Cold War during the 1960s, choosing to face another mission, which may prove to be his final one.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1965-12-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/llwusQFdHmHCWS7jySP2r6bbAIm.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lN3PWv6cW22mqXDcgGZgK1Aa2gh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//llwusQFdHmHCWS7jySP2r6bbAIm.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lN3PWv6cW22mqXDcgGZgK1Aa2gh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1584,"title":"The School of Rock","description":"Fired from his band and hard up for cash, guitarist and vocalist Dewey Finn finagles his way into a job as a fifth-grade substitute teacher at a private school, where he secretly begins teaching his straight-A students the finer points of rock ''n'' roll and the power of sticking it to the man. But as the school’s stern principal closes in and the Battle of the Bands looms, Dewey must risk everything to prove that rock ''n'' roll can change lives.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Comedy","Family","Music"],"release_date":"2003-10-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/k5MTAtE9CCi5TWA84qaFMYv3ajB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zXLXaepIBvFVLU25DH3wv4IPSbe.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//k5MTAtE9CCi5TWA84qaFMYv3ajB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zXLXaepIBvFVLU25DH3wv4IPSbe.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":585077,"title":"Children of the Sea","description":"Ruka is a young girl whose parents are separated and whose father works in an aquarium. When two boys, Umi and Sora, who were raised in the sea by dugongs, are brought to the aquarium, Ruka feels drawn to them and begins to realize that she has the same sort of supernatural connection to the ocean that they do. Umi and Sora''s special power seems to be connected to strange events that have been occurring more and more frequently, such as the appearance of sea creatures far from their home territory and the disappearance of aquarium animals around the world. However, the exact nature of the boys'' power and of the abnormal events is unknown, and Ruka gets drawn into investigating the mystery that surrounds her new friends.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Animation","Fantasy","Adventure","Mystery"],"release_date":"2019-06-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wDbcEcTIfTp7yDBj0zVnqpQ24N7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9Fch8X5C5yW2srPVBiq6LNRvwd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wDbcEcTIfTp7yDBj0zVnqpQ24N7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9Fch8X5C5yW2srPVBiq6LNRvwd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":420818,"title":"The Lion King","description":"Simba idolizes his father, King Mufasa, and takes to heart his own royal destiny. But not everyone in the kingdom celebrates the new cub''s arrival. Scar, Mufasa''s brother—and former heir to the throne—has plans of his own. The battle for Pride Rock is ravaged with betrayal, tragedy and drama, ultimately resulting in Simba''s exile. With help from a curious pair of newfound friends, Simba will have to figure out how to grow up and take back what is rightfully his.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Adventure","Drama","Family","Animation"],"release_date":"2019-07-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1TUg5pO1VZ4B0Q1amk3OlXvlpXV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dzBtMocZuJbjLOXvrl4zGYigDzh.jpg","small_bac