pg"},{"tmdb_id":19490,"title":"The Bishop''s Wife","description":"An Episcopal Bishop, Henry Brougham, has been working for months on the plans for an elaborate new cathedral which he hopes will be paid for primarily by a wealthy, stubborn widow. He is losing sight of his family and of why he became a churchman in the first place. Enter Dudley, an angel sent to help him. Dudley does help everyone he meets, but not necessarily in the way they would have preferred. With the exception of Henry, everyone loves him, but Henry begins to believe that Dudley is there to replace him, both at work and in his family''s affections, as Christmas approaches.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Comedy","Fantasy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1947-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fVEynIdJC8gRpslMfGXyZXrz5ar.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2sMpffmvoJlW7WBcvyHTPR9DEsj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fVEynIdJC8gRpslMfGXyZXrz5ar.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2sMpffmvoJlW7WBcvyHTPR9DEsj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11951,"title":"Vanishing Point","description":"Kowalski works for a car delivery service, and takes delivery of a 1970 Dodge Challenger to drive from Colorado to San Francisco. Shortly after pickup, he takes a bet to get the car there in less than 15 hours.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1971-01-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sYn05iS9AxV9rsjqBSHrI4azji1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1ThnpFx2G2HPhecvODGFEQxfOpO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sYn05iS9AxV9rsjqBSHrI4azji1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1ThnpFx2G2HPhecvODGFEQxfOpO.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":279229,"title":"Sapphire Blue","description":"Gwen has just discovered, that she''s the final member of the secret time-traveling Circle of Twelve. Now she has to juggle with constant trips to the past, her relationships with Gideon and figuring out dark secrets surrounding the Circle.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Fantasy","Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2014-08-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/y95HIJdesNQQaujZkGZczX7ejp2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kxRqokSkj6HWuwVCbnddPFg73CM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//y95HIJdesNQQaujZkGZczX7ejp2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kxRqokSkj6HWuwVCbnddPFg73CM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":42246,"title":"Tom and Jerry: The Fast and the Furry","description":"After being evicted from their old house by Tom''s owner for causing major damage, cat and mouse Tom and Jerry enter a race entitled the \"Fabulous Super Race\" to win a mansion.","duration":"1:15:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Family","Action"],"release_date":"2005-09-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bXILbW1i0WRShd6s4LfLKdJM6zm.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4pQhh5bU1KcUeXqPOteWsCkNZPK.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bXILbW1i0WRShd6s4LfLKdJM6zm.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4pQhh5bU1KcUeXqPOteWsCkNZPK.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":17358,"title":"My Name Ain''t Johnny","description":"The true story of João Guilherme Estrella (\"Johnny\"), a young middle-class bon vivant who became a big-time cocaine dealer in Rio de Janeiro in the early 1990s.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2008-01-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uAX6NW8kFFrGmc0nJTWL7ajymQf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mKDKutX0bCvg401k68U9Nt7EG0y.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uAX6NW8kFFrGmc0nJTWL7ajymQf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mKDKutX0bCvg401k68U9Nt7EG0y.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11447,"title":"The Son''s Room","description":"A psychoanalyst and his family go through profound emotional trauma when their son dies in a scuba diving accident.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2001-03-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fA7ptJVPbph8cZLVc1yaZIsTULk.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e9s1Hvw9TcVZspbkq2V8Bmvhky1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fA7ptJVPbph8cZLVc1yaZIsTULk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e9s1Hvw9TcVZspbkq2V8Bmvhky1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":6077,"title":"13 Tzameti","description":"Sebastian, a young man, has decided to follow instructions intended for someone else, without knowing where they will take him. Something else he does not know is that Gerard Dorez, a cop on a knife-edge, is tailing him. When he reaches his destination, Sebastian falls into a degenerate, clandestine world of mental chaos behind closed doors in which men gamble on the lives of others men.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2006-02-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mmZvBvbAMPrDEJoP9YXUrRabQQz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kSpFeY6ibND9ygqSFcOzEKK0Cl.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mmZvBvbAMPrDEJoP9YXUrRabQQz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kSpFeY6ibND9ygqSFcOzEKK0Cl.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2109,"title":"Rush Hour","description":"When Hong Kong Inspector Lee is summoned to Los Angeles to investigate a kidnapping, the FBI doesn''t want any outside help and assigns cocky LAPD Detective James Carter to distract Lee from the case. Not content to watch the action from the sidelines, Lee and Carter form an unlikely partnership and investigate the case themselves.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Action","Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"1998-09-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9FrpAtF87VKblKkDEiIZzYgO40K.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nwPhAsfnb7f46bZkWLG7IRP5HXr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9FrpAtF87VKblKkDEiIZzYgO40K.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nwPhAsfnb7f46bZkWLG7IRP5HXr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":664300,"title":"Shiva Baby","description":"College student Danielle must cover her tracks when she unexpectedly runs into her sugar daddy at a shiva - with her parents, ex-girlfriend and family friends also in attendance.","duration":"1:18:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2021-03-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/feQvRl67oc4AOWN4LhAwkrMWdX4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4sdqVsT6SHqtbCYZS7bhVoEftlL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//feQvRl67oc4AOWN4LhAwkrMWdX4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4sdqVsT6SHqtbCYZS7bhVoEftlL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11222,"title":"The American Friend","description":"Tom Ripley, an American who deals in forged art, is slighted at an auction in Hamburg by picture framer Jonathan Zimmerman. When Ripley is asked by gangster Raoul Minot to kill a rival, he suggests Zimmerman, and the two, exploiting Zimmerman''s terminal illness, coerce him into being a hitman.","duration":"2:05:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"1977-06-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/h59F8NcFSlucTK7fUcndD9TB9jg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pBi7QjQJbyEKK7Y5B1vHaEaO3BS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//h59F8NcFSlucTK7fUcndD9TB9jg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pBi7QjQJbyEKK7Y5B1vHaEaO3BS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9281,"title":"Witness","description":"While protecting an Amish boy—the sole witness to a brutal murder—and his mother, a detective is forced to seek refuge within their community when his own life comes under threat.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1985-02-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aDn3wL0ObbA5TCn5ZLri9xI2kUZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kOymD1rChAMykmDVEzJpIh4OYS7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aDn3wL0ObbA5TCn5ZLri9xI2kUZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kOymD1rChAMykmDVEzJpIh4OYS7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":3059,"title":"Intolerance: Love''s Struggle Throughout the Ages","description":"The story of a poor young woman, separated by prejudice from her husband and baby, is interwoven with tales of intolerance from throughout history.","duration":"3:17:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"1916-09-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5s5Vau1tCvoQaaTTTGk4Qux8CcH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lJCabs4TMOsKfnl0BmA5Hf16Ezb.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5s5Vau1tCvoQaaTTTGk4Qux8CcH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lJCabs4TMOsKfnl0BmA5Hf16Ezb.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1900,"title":"Traffic","description":"An exploration of the United States of America''s war on drugs from multiple perspectives. For the new head of the Office of National Drug Control Policy, the war becomes personal when he discovers his well-educated daughter is abusing cocaine within their comfortable suburban home. In Mexico, a flawed, but noble policeman agrees to testify against a powerful general in league with a cartel, and in San Diego, a drug kingpin''s sheltered trophy wife must learn her husband''s ruthless business after he is arrested, endangering her luxurious lifestyle.","duration":"2:27:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"2000-12-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nkMgY1XFLWr91najzfvwie8LyYF.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jbccmnqE4oAPI67bApgt2JiRPz8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nkMgY1XFLWr91najzfvwie8LyYF.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jbccmnqE4oAPI67bApgt2JiRPz8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1208476,"title":"Ricky Gervais: Armageddon","description":"Ricky Gervais dishes out controversial takes on political correctness and oversensitivity in a taboo-busting comedy special about the end of humanity.","duration":"1:03:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2023-12-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tEFYrXJXMBSNQNuHKJcobHQ3IRM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/i4fbnHXE7qW6AT41xv9XLekvJeZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tEFYrXJXMBSNQNuHKJcobHQ3IRM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//i4fbnHXE7qW6AT41xv9XLekvJeZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":964960,"title":"The Taste of Things","description":"Set in 1889 France, Dodin Bouffant is a chef living with his personal cook and lover Eugénie. They share a long history of gastronomy and love but Eugénie refuses to marry Dodin, so the food lover decides to do something he has never done before: cook for her.","duration":"2:15:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2023-11-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yDA4vgY6Thi8jflN94kHa05mqjj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pYwK6rg0pmxDxzdtECABUsf49Eu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yDA4vgY6Thi8jflN94kHa05mqjj.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pYwK6rg0pmxDxzdtECABUsf49Eu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":912480,"title":"Red Rooms","description":"The high-profile case of serial killer Ludovic Chevalier has just gone to trial, and Kelly-Anne is obsessed. When reality blurs with her morbid fantasies, she goes down a dark path to seek the final piece of the case’s puzzle.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2023-08-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/83g3gkDw6oc2mxkyB8DSoXQZJHl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uBJvbf0g9rcsYElcwZCMYU0Vrj8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//83g3gkDw6oc2mxkyB8DSoXQZJHl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uBJvbf0g9rcsYElcwZCMYU0Vrj8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":50618,"title":"Fortress of War","description":"The film covers the heroic defence of the Brest Fortress, which was attacked during the first strike of German invaders on June 22 1941. The story describes the events of the first days of the defence, including the three main resistance zones, headed by the regiment commander, Pyotr Mikhailovich Gavrilov, the commissar Efim Moiseevich Fomin and the head of the 9th frontier outpost, Andrey Mitrofanovich Kizhevatov. Many years later veteran Alexander Akimov again recalls the memories of the time, when he, then a 15 year old Sasha Akimov was deeply in love with the beautiful Anya and suddenly found himself in the middle of the bloody events of war.","duration":"2:18:00","genre":["War","Drama","History","Action"],"release_date":"2010-11-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fszKktAJqDnWsp2iOhpa4gk2cfm.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iHXo74DonjdP8AoY2iChSEm9HjG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fszKktAJqDnWsp2iOhpa4gk2cfm.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iHXo74DonjdP8AoY2iChSEm9HjG.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":49444,"title":"Kung Fu Panda 2","description":"Po is finally living the dream as the Dragon Warrior—until a shadow from his past comes roaring back. When the ruthless peacock Lord Shen unleashes a devastating new weapon used to wipe out kung fu masters across the land, Po and the Furious Five race across China to put an end to his plans. But if Po is to have any hope of stopping him, he must first confront the truth of his origins—and find inner peace before his past tears him apart.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Comedy","Action"],"release_date":"2011-05-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iBUIS2duNa9aDfLgRr8thsUPRs0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mtqqD00vB4PGRt20gWtGqFhrkd0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iBUIS2duNa9aDfLgRr8thsUPRs0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mtqqD00vB4PGRt20gWtGqFhrkd0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":20993,"title":"Brother 2","description":"Arriving in Moscow, Chechen War veteran Danila meets Konstantin, an old friend who tells him that his twin brother has been forced into signing a crooked contract with a US ice hockey team. Soon after this meeting, Danila discovers Konstantin dead and he sets out to avenge his death; a journey that leads him to Chicago and a whole new experience.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2000-05-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a8bPE7ufmXsfj2BLOrB8KuNMxN5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/r5pffTC8XZsrGUYSU8e23dGmGNK.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//a8bPE7ufmXsfj2BLOrB8KuNMxN5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//r5pffTC8XZsrGUYSU8e23dGmGNK.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":16520,"title":"The King and I","description":"Widowed Welsh mother Anna Leonowens becomes a governess and English tutor to the wives and many children of the stubborn King Mongkut of Siam. Anna and the King have a clash of personalities as she works to teach the royal family about the English language, customs and etiquette, and rushes to prepare a party for a group of European diplomats who must change their opinions about the King.","duration":"2:13:00","genre":["Romance","History","Drama"],"release_date":"1956-06-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gjFI54BO9