on":"1:57:00","genre":["Western","Adventure","Action"],"release_date":"1966-11-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jJKjniDrS1FaWiSgOBxjjTe6ME.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sH4Clw7QrtH23xl9o4sOpHNkRIz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jJKjniDrS1FaWiSgOBxjjTe6ME.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sH4Clw7QrtH23xl9o4sOpHNkRIz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14748,"title":"Boy A","description":"Freed after a lengthy term in a juvenile detention center, convicted child killer Jack Burridge finds work as a deliveryman and begins dating co-worker Michelle. While out on the road one day, Jack notices a distressed child, and, after reuniting the girl with her family, becomes a local celebrity. But when a local newspaper unearths his past, Jack must cope with the anger of citizens who fear for the safety of their children.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2008-07-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bBT7Sc6n26n69a2EWYcAYiHeWIn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wrQQUjeiHFPvTfaaB3vtNLLZ8kv.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bBT7Sc6n26n69a2EWYcAYiHeWIn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wrQQUjeiHFPvTfaaB3vtNLLZ8kv.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10831,"title":"The Draughtsman''s Contract","description":"R. Neville, a brash young draftsman, is hired to make a dozen landscape illustrations at the estate of Mr Herbert and his wife Virginia. Aside from monetary compensation, the arrangement includes a sexual liaison offered to Neville by Virginia while her estranged husband is away. But when the murdered body of Mr Herbert is discovered at the estate, mysterious clues found in Neville''s drawings point to the identity of the killer.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["History","Mystery","Comedy"],"release_date":"1982-11-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4cExyNONv6JNlOuBH1qcUvIyd8O.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ljeTWR2kowGXijMc8LMuy72ULM3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4cExyNONv6JNlOuBH1qcUvIyd8O.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ljeTWR2kowGXijMc8LMuy72ULM3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4043,"title":"Law of Desire","description":"Pablo, a successful film director, disappointed in his relationship with his young lover, Juan, concentrates in a new project, a monologue starring his transgender sister, Tina. Antonio, an uptight young man, falls possessively in love with the director and in his passion would stop at nothing to obtain the object of his desire.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Thriller","Comedy"],"release_date":"1987-02-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kx3KdTmefo87oQEEhGqm6dLlAg0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tAKaUaYGPCUStvlOaLwsJldrOJQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kx3KdTmefo87oQEEhGqm6dLlAg0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tAKaUaYGPCUStvlOaLwsJldrOJQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1715,"title":"The Cider House Rules","description":"Homer is an orphan who was never adopted, becoming the favorite of orphanage director Dr. Larch. Dr. Larch imparts his full medical knowledge on Homer, who becomes a skilled, albeit unlicensed, physician. But Homer yearns for a self-chosen life outside the orphanage. What will Homer learn about life and love in the cider house? What of the destiny that Dr. Larch has planned for him?","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1999-12-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dlZzE2HyO9USfTyZvzsLK5ge2hL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qAECAgqjSFRVZzEEGbFAZqZNiDh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dlZzE2HyO9USfTyZvzsLK5ge2hL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qAECAgqjSFRVZzEEGbFAZqZNiDh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1280941,"title":"The Boy with Pink Pants","description":"On 20 November 2012, 15-year-old Andrea Spezzacatena took his life, becoming the first reported case in Italy of bullying and cyberbullying leading to a minor''s suicide. The triggering incident was his choice to wear a pair of red trousers, a gift from his mother, which turned pink due to a washing mishap.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2024-10-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/olCv7BXqGBAMUZnYDUfgiu8rixN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2UI9pOCyvn7ibrFHleOo0PceAyD.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//olCv7BXqGBAMUZnYDUfgiu8rixN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2UI9pOCyvn7ibrFHleOo0PceAyD.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14299,"title":"Cadillac Records","description":"The story of sex, violence, race and rock and roll in 1950s Chicago, and the exciting but turbulent lives of some of America''s musical legends, including Muddy Waters, Leonard Chess, Little Walter, Howlin'' Wolf, Etta James and Chuck Berry.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Drama","History","Music"],"release_date":"2008-12-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ubgl0v0crnOGYPGkR2hhIwv7Chm.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u2GtllItFwaXMLj4uCeKYt9wf4l.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ubgl0v0crnOGYPGkR2hhIwv7Chm.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u2GtllItFwaXMLj4uCeKYt9wf4l.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11446,"title":"Welcome to the Dollhouse","description":"An unattractive 7th grader struggles to cope with suburban life as the middle child with inattentive parents and bullies at school.","duration":"1:28:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1996-03-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cmD7smdQnflmpthFDjSArI2jKZF.jp