 Not Ashamed","description":"Based on the journal entries of Rachel Joy Scott, the first student killed in the Columbine High School shooting in 1999.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"2016-10-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rsdFvneLY76JGXQ1rYovyeUtqyc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/P4bxuNq5XT0Wc3MYpoLP52e0P6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rsdFvneLY76JGXQ1rYovyeUtqyc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//P4bxuNq5XT0Wc3MYpoLP52e0P6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":371738,"title":"Looking: The Movie","description":"Patrick returns to San Francisco for the first time in almost a year to celebrate a momentous event with his old friends. In the process, he must face the unresolved relationships he left behind and make difficult choices about what’s important to him.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2016-07-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9v7tJP1CROJAz4vBacfnigm5SjQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tQdda275rJqNi6Ifrf3ntWBsXDj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9v7tJP1CROJAz4vBacfnigm5SjQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tQdda275rJqNi6Ifrf3ntWBsXDj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":36245,"title":"Diary of a Chambermaid","description":"Celestine has a new job as a chambermaid for the quirky M. Monteil, his wife and her father. When the father dies, Celestine decides to quit her job and leave, but when a young girl is raped and murdered, Celestine believes that the Monteils'' groundskeeper, Joseph, is guilty, and stays on in order to prove it. She uses her sexuality and the promise of marriage to get Joseph to confess -- but things do not go as planned.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"1964-03-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vpPdmaG