tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8C4rnA6r7myYdJBgeZLgCvy5RPS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15573,"title":"The Cowboys","description":"When his cattlemen abandon him for the gold fields, rancher Wil Andersen is forced to take on a collection of young boys as his cowboys in order to get his herd to market in time to avoid financial disaster. The boys learn to do a man''s job under Andersen''s tutelage, however, neither he nor the boys know that a gang of cattle thieves is stalking them.","duration":"2:14:00","genre":["Western","Adventure","Drama","Action"],"release_date":"1972-01-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pzWkw7Acgn7OyAwMHTlrB6PGnNa.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/srdRiGV9tYFzWd2C4IjPJNtLrmr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pzWkw7Acgn7OyAwMHTlrB6PGnNa.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//srdRiGV9tYFzWd2C4IjPJNtLrmr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":763165,"title":"The Burial","description":"When a handshake deal goes sour, funeral home owner Jeremiah O''Keefe enlists charismatic, smooth-talking attorney Willie E. Gary to save his family business. Tempers flare and laughter ensues as the unlikely pair bond while exposing corporate corruption and racial injustice.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2023-10-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aOI3o06xhCgLmA6Bcpm4KRDeMXF.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9ssNSfNKpzZwhbFsnW3wa82m2sG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aOI3o06xhCgLmA6Bcpm4KRDeMXF.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9ssNSfNKpzZwhbFsnW3wa82m2sG.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":321741,"title":"Concussion","description":"A dramatic thriller based on the incredible true David vs. Goliath story of American immigrant Dr. Bennet Omalu, the brilliant forensic neuropathologist who made the first discovery of CTE, a football-related brain trauma, in a pro player and fought for the truth to be known. Omalu''s emotional quest puts him at dangerous odds with one of the most powerful institutions in the world.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2015-11-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fEaZwgkX2k91LJZ5APkaK0aDwg1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uuRFr7Jhsq7bITDyyvxZrQMAr9e.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fEaZwgkX2k91LJZ5APkaK0aDwg1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uuRFr7Jhsq7bITDyyvxZrQMAr9e.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":63310,"title":"Bullhead","description":"A young  cattle farmer is approached by an unscrupulous veterinarian to make a shady deal with a notorious beef trader.","duration":"2:09:00","genre":["Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2011-02-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/q0arvx5ai3x3vMJICHiCfAfQJzh.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/j9XzaLtFAJIozDH4MQwxaR2aDvJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//q0arvx5ai3x3vMJICHiCfAfQJzh.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//j9XzaLtFAJIozDH4MQwxaR2aDvJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":59474,"title":"Cazuza: Time Doesn''t Stop","description":"Inspired by the moving book “Só as Mães São Felizes”, by Lucinha Araújo, Cazuza''s mother, the film covers a little more than 10 years of the singer’s crazy and brief life – from the beginning of his career in the Circo Voador venue, in 1981, to the huge success and the apotheosis of his shows with the Barão Vermelho band, his solo career, his relations with his parents, friends, lovers and passions, and the courage he had to face his final years, with HIV, until his death, in 1990.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Drama","Music","History"],"release_date":"2004-06-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pN7c5advjqyVkB9r9BYaRVCsbsu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5D3vuj