ch happened more than three thousand years ago.","duration":"2:28:00","genre":["Action","Fantasy","War"],"release_date":"2023-07-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ef9dYKxDe2isgNhoJsGrt9yjXPz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6VOV2wU3WEyN0H1QtrbAS6whXPc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ef9dYKxDe2isgNhoJsGrt9yjXPz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6VOV2wU3WEyN0H1QtrbAS6whXPc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":438740,"title":"Salyut-7","description":"USSR, June 1985. After contact with the Salyut 7 space station is lost, cosmonauts Vladimir Dzhanibekov and Viktor Savinykh dock with the empty, frozen craft, and bring her back to life. Based on actual events.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Action","Drama","Adventure"],"release_date":"2017-09-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ixSWXuavLZsAedVDM2ntEV8LJ2J.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/s2ktgF2ze4aVt9bXBUvxFJllqyd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ixSWXuavLZsAedVDM2ntEV8LJ2J.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//s2ktgF2ze4aVt9bXBUvxFJllqyd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":860,"title":"WarGames","description":"High school student David Lightman has a talent for hacking. But while trying to hack into a computer system to play unreleased video games, he unwittingly taps into the Department of Defense''s war computer and initiates a confrontation of global proportions. Together with his friend and a wizardly computer genius, David must race against time to outwit his opponent and prevent a nuclear Armageddon.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Drama","Science Fiction","Thriller"],"release_date":"1983-06-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qtamfYGFfDLfGRcucx1zNwohRts.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zZ1rN4LoPxKNfAp67Xl300WxVeD.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qtamfYGFfDLfGRcucx1zNwohRts.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zZ1rN4LoPxKNfAp67Xl300WxVeD.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":401,"title":"Garden State","description":"Andrew returns to his hometown for his mother’s funeral, a journey that reconnects him with old friends. The trip coincides with his decision to stop taking his powerful antidepressants. A chance meeting with Sam—a girl also struggling with various maladies—opens up the possibility of rekindling emotional connections, confronting his psychologist father, and perhaps beginning a new life.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2004-07-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2mu6XkJE0B6nK5jeOvXOyWPVmhw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/h3iqYiGS6F3y7GxaS4AT8nFxZ2i.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2mu6XkJE0B6nK5jeOvXOyWPVmhw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//h3iqYiGS6F3y7GxaS4AT8nFxZ2i.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":519141,"title":"Matthias & Maxime","description":"Two childhood best friends are asked to share a kiss for the purposes of a student short film. Soon, a lingering doubt sets in, confronting both men with their preferences, threatening the brotherhood of their social circle, and, eventually, changing their lives.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2019-10-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/27xckIk5qdMina9WEtnMjp3oJHX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/j3DI3UjYBRqIbO1keUU1Bzn5qG6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//27xckIk5qdMina9WEtnMjp3oJHX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//j3DI3UjYBRqIbO1keUU1Bzn5qG6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":449749,"title":"The Leisure Seeker","description":"A runaway couple go on an unforgettable journey from Boston to Key West, recapturing their passion for life and their love for each other on a road trip that provides revelation and surprise right up to the very end.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Adventure"],"release_date":"2018-01-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lZc28Tk0m92CIzzi60qJwieLYMx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1IOnJzgbgVj85vDEIf1fPmCQ7KP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lZc28Tk0m92CIzzi60qJwieLYMx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1IOnJzgbgVj85vDEIf1fPmCQ7KP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":361380,"title":"Barbie & Her Sisters in the Great Puppy Adventure","description":"Barbie and her sisters, Skipper, Stacie and Chelsea, and their adorable new puppy friends find unexpected mystery and adventure when they return to their hometown of Willows. While going through mementos in Grandma''s attic, the sisters discover an old map, believed to lead to a long-lost treasure buried somewhere in the town. With their puppy pals in tow, the four girls go on an exciting treasure hunt, along the way discovering that the greatest treasure of all is the love and laughter they share as sisters!","duration":"1:16:00","genre":["Family","Animation","Adventure"],"release_date":"2015-10-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9cUKJtYLOZqCuZJq8Dc0SY341qR.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3ybjPWweUjPXXqIXFERgPnOQ5O3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9cUKJtYLOZqCuZJq8Dc0SY341qR.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3ybjPWweUjPXXqIXFERgPnOQ5O3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":270400,"title":"Breathe","description":"Charlie, a 17-year-old girl tortured by doubt, is thrilled when she becomes friends with Sarah, but when Sarah tires of Charlie and looks for a new friend, their relationship takes an ominous turn.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2014-11-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xxkuySNoMail