a","Romance"],"release_date":"1979-10-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hEVAABU2c86MU42jlnGRM9FcCq5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xejUFnoAVxzvU95o2jlzG2USmY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hEVAABU2c86MU42jlnGRM9FcCq5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xejUFnoAVxzvU95o2jlzG2USmY.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9393,"title":"Before the Fall","description":"In 1942, Friedrich Weimer''s boxing skills get him an appointment to a National Political Academy (NaPolA) – high schools that produce Nazi elite. Over his father''s objections, Friedrich enrolls. During his year in seventh column, Friedrich encounters hazing, cruelty, death, and the Nazi code. His friendship with Albrecht, the ascetic son of the area''s governor, is central to this education.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2004-07-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7Or5uj52hqOnHWDna13OagcX9aP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dhTTscZkiQefuq6OeYp9rnvhCBW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7Or5uj52hqOnHWDna13OagcX9aP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dhTTscZkiQefuq6OeYp9rnvhCBW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":814340,"title":"Cha Cha Real Smooth","description":"Fresh out of college and stuck at his New Jersey home without a clear path forward, 22-year-old Andrew begins working as a party starter for bar/bat mitzvahs—where he strikes up a unique friendship with a young mom and her teenage daughter.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2022-06-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1LMGpNSUekWg3XCPweN33knQPW9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iUvoVhvwTlP8DofoqeIu7QAGLAe.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1LMGpNSUekWg3XCPweN33knQPW9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image