ainst the clock, they must find the perpetrators of the attacks as quickly as possible before they can strike again, travelling across Europe and beyond in one of the biggest manhunts in history.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2022-10-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ks3WTeuEaenmMiizxXba65Rxpu1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/A5wae5M81jLTuv3WbCJfORxapRA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ks3WTeuEaenmMiizxXba65Rxpu1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//A5wae5M81jLTuv3WbCJfORxapRA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":400090,"title":"The Nightingale","description":"In 1825, Clare, a 21-year-old Irish convict, chases a British soldier through the rugged Tasmanian wilderness, bent on revenge for a terrible act of violence he committed against her family. She enlists the services of an Aboriginal tracker who is also marked by trauma from his own violence-filled past.","duration":"2:16:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Western"],"release_date":"2018-09-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kPKwqHl2rYsi9rFWJWA6afKdmlT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wEzqFiatOJSbGBu6pb8z5sQuZt1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kPKwqHl2rYsi9rFWJWA6afKdmlT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wEzqFiatOJSbGBu6pb8z5sQuZt1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":353728,"title":"Closet Monster","description":"A creative and driven teenager is desperate to escape his hometown and the haunting memories of his turbulent childhood.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Drama","Fantasy","Mystery"],"release_date":"2016-07-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sgVPO6fgi6FzD3IbpkHvqjfa5hq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mJYAloVKf20Ko5OE9F9VSfAvmXY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sgVPO6fgi6FzD3Ibp