iend, Samantha, dies in an accident shortly after they had a fight (and nearly broke up), Ian Wyndham, a grief-stricken British businessman living in London gets a chance to relive the day all over again, in the hope of changing the events that led up to her getting killed.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2004-01-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rcJynPuUuSBuzOmahUTasliurzr.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/m55qCh44VzrDhWSINr1MdB7RtAb.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rcJynPuUuSBuzOmahUTasliurzr.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//m55qCh44VzrDhWSINr1MdB7RtAb.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11815,"title":"The Fly","description":"Industrialist François Delambre is called late at night by his sister-in-law, Helene, who tells him that she has just killed her husband. Reluctant at first, she eventually explains to the police that he invented a matter transportation apparatus and, while experimenting on himself, a fly entered the chamber.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Horror","Drama"],"release_date":"1958-07-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wpz62HFxCGaMX6jImELAspwqjT1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kXdBcDh2EbgSIf4Oo1dxKapZM2f.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wpz62HFxCGaMX6jImELAspwqjT1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kXdBcDh2EbgSIf4Oo1dxKapZM2f.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10653,"title":"The Seven Year Itch","description":"When his family goes away for summer vacation, a hitherto faithful publishing executive with an overactive imagination is tempted by an attractive new neighbor.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"1955-06-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/o1rW0pM3nxyY6YKl0bQVXbEqKHt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_an