into the ring to try and recapture his past success.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1979-07-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/op0a9xUPuGskQKwuXr3omz3K158.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8GyHL4TftI4SKVA8Jj9JpthhIu6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//op0a9xUPuGskQKwuXr3omz3K158.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8GyHL4TftI4SKVA8Jj9JpthhIu6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":27452,"title":"The Spiral Staircase","description":"On a stormy night, the mute servant to an ailing matriarch is stalked by a serial killer.","duration":"1:23:00","genre":["Horror","Mystery","Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"1946-01-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tbt3dq9AMrojwq5SGeAcL97buC8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4k0k9f59g901GWzw0gfFT7f5in.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tbt3dq9AMrojwq5SGeAcL97buC8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4k0k9f59g901GWzw0gfFT7f5in.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":25103,"title":"Night of the Demon","description":"American professor John Holden arrives in London for a conference on parapsychology only to discover that the colleague he was supposed to meet was killed in a freak accident the day before. It turns out that the deceased had been investigating a cult lead by Dr. Julian Karswell. Though a skeptic, Holden is suspicious of the devil-worshiping Karswell. Following a trail of mysterious manuscripts, Holden enters a world that makes him question his faith in science.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Fantasy","Horror","Mystery"],"release_date":"1957-11-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bUFWLSQsSYdyy4eohp4iBBnOV1s.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uy3wfu0fXi72R5AypMmV22wS1UN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bUFWLSQsSYdyy4eohp4iBBnOV1s.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uy3wfu0fXi72R5AypMmV22wS1UN.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":19186,"title":"The Parent Trap","description":"Two identical twin sisters, separated at birth by their parents'' divorce, are reunited years later at a summer camp, where they scheme to bring their parents back together. The girls, one of whom has been living with their mother and the other with their father, switch places after camp and go to work on their plan, the first objective being to scare off a gold-digger pursuing their father.","duration":"2:09:00","genre":["Comedy","Family","Romance"],"release_date":"1961-05-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wl7imDwEkYt1HnlsdEcUDXuxnRw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jaZFWy6ZAvQoMW2mo9xP5gx4URo.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wl7imDwEkYt1HnlsdEcUDXuxnRw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jaZFWy6ZAvQoMW2mo9xP5gx4URo.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9036,"title":"Eight Below","description":"In the Antarctic, after an expedition with Dr. Davis McClaren, the sled dog trainer Jerry Shepherd has to leave the polar base with his colleagues due to the proximity of a heavy snow storm. He ties his dogs to be rescued after, but the mission is called-off and the dogs are left alone at their own fortune. For six months, Jerry tries to find a sponsor for a rescue mission.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Adventure","Drama","Family"],"release_date":"2006-02-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1GAEBLa8EmA9d8l0s8gHB2zxWLq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/39hR806Me4wI42LCFcK2LBiCRGW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1GAEBLa8EmA9d8l0s8gHB2zxWLq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//39hR806Me4wI42LCFcK2LBiCRGW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1314481,"title":"The Devil Wears Prada 2","description":"Andy Sachs returns to Runway as Miranda Priestly navigates a new media landscape and Runway''s position within. The duo reconnect with former assistant Emily Charlton, now the head of a luxury brand that possesses funding which could ensure Runway''s survival.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2026-04-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dRoFlUbH1l51ACmx5oPCI3jfvZq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xTI42pmsP5EDnvsNJPEDubwWBQO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dRoFlUbH1l51ACmx5oPCI3jfvZq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xTI42pmsP5EDnvsNJPEDubwWBQO.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":30890,"title":"Radio Days","description":"The Narrator tells us how the radio influenced his childhood in the days before TV. In the New York City of the late 1930s to the New Year''s Eve 1944, this coming-of-age tale mixes the narrator''s experiences with contemporary anecdotes and urban legends of the radio stars.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1987-01-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rn3E4Kd7EUOGOF95Hsd0aOhQqZg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ljZ3yyYznAiq1vF6nHITdJn6qXB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rn3E4Kd7EUOGOF95Hsd0aOhQqZg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ljZ3yyYznAiq1vF6nHITdJn6qXB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2064,"title":"While You Were Sleeping","description":"A transit worker pulls commuter Peter off railway tracks after he''s mugged, but—while he''s in a coma—his family mistakenly thinks she''s Peter''s fiancée, and she doesn''t correct them. Things get more complicated when she falls for his brother, who''s not quite sure that she''s who she claims to be.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"1995-04-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/r4ZkyhfwcpnHNGdn2QULEBTClZG.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qNGO3ETcNwlWqK2kNRpbJSJRlos.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//r4ZkyhfwcpnHNGdn2QULEBTClZG.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qNGO3ETcNwlWqK2kNRpbJSJRlos.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1122932,"title":"See You on Venus","description":"Mia and Kyle, two misfit American teens, travel to Spain in search of Mia''s birth mother. As the pair road trip through the picturesque cities of Andalusia and fall in love, they discover that the most important question isn''t who gave you life, but what you decide to do with it.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2023-07-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pBYVFbEurxPfp3Z0d9HJK4UAzSw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mEE73FsCLs800A9aUEbDs4qrQQg.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pBYVFbEurxPfp3Z0d9HJK4UAzSw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mEE73FsCLs800A9aUEbDs4qrQQg.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":649928,"title":"Robin Robin","description":"A bird raised by mice begins to question where she belongs and sets off on a daring journey of self-discovery.","duration":"0:30:00","genre":["Animation","Adventure","Family"],"release_date":"2021-10-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8MRDdTrh0O6iG60d4UoepxVI0lj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bKIdlJbd17rrIm4oZzhXTbmqpon.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8MRDdTrh0O6iG60d4UoepxVI0lj.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bKIdlJbd17rrIm4oZzhXTbmqpon.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":636565,"title":"Rose Island","description":"In 1968, engineer Giorgio Rosa established the independent state called \"The Isle of Roses\" off the coast of Rimini, built on a platform outside the territorial waters, with Esperanto as the official language. The Italian authorities did not take it well because the micronation was seen as an expedient to not pay taxes on the revenues obtained thanks to the arrival of numerous tourists and curious people.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Comedy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2020-12-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tAbDYp1b7zK2oOhJKcza63dUtOl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fbmYUDOo6tNq3A1VWhhxE6pjNEB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tAbDYp1b7zK2oOhJKcza63dUtOl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fbmYUDOo6tNq3A1VWhhxE6pjNEB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":366924,"title":"Batman: Bad Blood","description":"When Batman goes missing, it takes the entire Bat \"family\" - including Batwoman and Batwing - to keep the peace in Gotham and unravel the mystery behind the Dark Knight''s disappearance.","duration":"1:14:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Action","Animation","Adventure","Crime"],"release_date":"2016-01-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nwfpBjtMNFwrGjW2o9HBhMEYCpM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ktjbGsGm5GKlHDvvwQajXvDW2BN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nwfpBjtMNFwrGjW2o9HBhMEYCpM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ktjbGsGm5GKlHDvvwQajXvDW2BN.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":365222,"title":"Ip Man 3","description":"When a band of brutal gangsters led by a crooked property developer make a play to take over the city, Master Ip is forced to take a stand.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Action","Drama","History"],"release_date":"2015-12-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/19Shb0Xn0PeLXA4CkT2TIIvxaR6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8PvinaGEqzf1rrfFAxiXujJnCtI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//19Shb0Xn0PeLXA4CkT2TIIvxaR6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8PvinaGEqzf1rrfFAxiXujJnCtI.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":73562,"title":"Declaration of War","description":"Roméo and Juliette are two young actors. They fall in love at first sight, move in together and make a baby. A love story and the founding of a home like millions of others. Except that their little boy, Adam, behaves abnormally. The young parents try hard to persuade themselves that everything is okay but, with the passing of time, they cannot delude themselves anymore: their son has a problem. From now on, war is declared. A war against illness. A war against Death. A war against despair.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2011-08-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mnWAectkyVej1nKwnmhpqp1KWbT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gVqIROaHxwwsxCSTEaEMqWyINmX.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mnWAectkyVej1nKwnmhpqp1KWbT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gVqIROaHxwwsxCSTEaEMqWyINmX.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":62177,"title":"Brave","description":"In the mystical Scottish Highlands, Merida is the princess of a kingdom ruled by King Fergus and Queen Elinor. An unruly daughter and an accomplished archer, Merida one day defies a sacred custom of the land and inadvertently brings turmoil to the kingdom. In an attempt to set things right, Merida seeks out an eccentric old Wise Woman and is granted an ill-fated wish.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Adventure","Animation","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2012-06-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qx9ts2hBYJrkIQxhryitxnLlm2u.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1XAuDtMWpL0sYSFK0R6EZate2Ux.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qx9ts2hBYJrkIQxhryitxnLlm2u.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1XAuDtMWpL0sYSFK0R6EZate2Ux.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":36877,"title":"The Blood of a Poet","description":"In a poet’s room, an armless statue abruptly comes to life. It invites the poet to step through a mirror and to discover another world. Strange places and characters present themselves to him. The poet tears himself away from these twisted fascinations and returns, with some difficulty, to his room.","duration":"0:55:00","genre":["Fantasy"],"release_date":"1932-01-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kRQVehqORmZPeK3kt7ktmeKPhqt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/paHmfMrtQVT2cUTeteni3iDgRym.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kRQVehqORmZPeK3kt7ktmeKPhqt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//paHmfMrtQVT2cUTeteni3iDgRym.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8981,"title":"Dear Frankie","description":"Nine-year-old Frankie and his single mum Lizzie have been on the move ever since Frankie can remember, most recently arriving in a seaside Scottish town. Wanting to protect her deaf son from the truth that they''ve run away from his father, Lizzie has invented a story that he is away at sea on the HMS Accra. Every few weeks, Lizzie writes Frankie a make-believe letter from his father, telling of his adventures in exotic lands. As Frankie tracks the ship''s progress around the globe, he discovers that it is due to dock in his hometown. With the real HMS Accra arriving in only a fortnight, Lizzie must choose between telling Frankie the truth or finding the perfect stranger to play Frankie''s father for just one day...","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Drama","Family"],"release_date":"2004-05-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1eFyO5JIDTZxrQuVZ3NfHl0M0xU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5YRDvaBWBbhTKBYYc7BoOWdW01N.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1eFyO5JIDTZxrQuVZ3NfHl0M0xU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5YRDvaBWBbhTKBYYc7BoOWdW01N.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2044,"title":"The Lake House","description":"When architect Alex Wyler moves into an unusual glass house on stilts over a lake, he discovers a note from the previous tenant in the mailbox--but no one''s lived in the house for years. He replies and soon discovers that he''s corresponding with a doctor named Kate Forster. Their correspondence, only through the ''magical'' mailbox, turns romantic and their paths cross in unexpected ways, but when they try to truly connect, danger looms. They must try to unravel the mystery behind their extraordinary romance before it''s too late.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Romance","Drama","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2006-06-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cvenzPOcYthevmYvy0WX4pZ2RNp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tHpc1118dYWLnHZleGhwZxRbpae.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cvenzPOcYthevmYvy0WX4pZ2RNp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tHpc1118dYWLnHZleGhwZxRbpae.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":468,"title":"My Own Private Idaho","description":"In this loose adaptation of Shakespeare''s \"Henry IV,\" Mike Waters is a hustler afflicted with narcolepsy. Scott Favor is the rebellious son of a mayor. Together, the two travel from Portland, Oregon to Idaho and finally to the coast of Italy in a quest to find Mike''s estranged mother. Along the way they turn tricks for money and drugs, eventually attracting the attention of a wealthy benefactor and sexual deviant.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1991-02-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/stSaFz5CtMXwIj3r4MDjqxqWRot.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/p9TF90Pb5yg2MNb2UztzyXktMm4.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//stSaFz5CtMXwIj3r4MDjqxqWRot.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//p9TF90Pb5yg2MNb2UztzyXktMm4.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":118,"title":"Charlie and the Chocolate Factory","description":"A young boy wins a tour through the most magnificent chocolate factory in the world, led by the world''s most unusual candy maker.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Adventure","Comedy","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2005-07-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/atoIgfAk2Ig2HFJLD0VUnjiPWEz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iKP6wg3c6COUe8gYutoGG7qcPnO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//atoIgfAk2Ig2HFJLD0VUnjiPWEz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iKP6wg3c6COUe8gYutoGG7qcPnO.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1007826,"title":"The Underdoggs","description":"Jaycen ''Two Js'' Jennings is a washed-up former pro football star who has hit rock bottom. When sentenced to community service coaching the Underdoggs, an unruly pee-wee football team in his hometown, he sees it mostly as an opportunity to rebuild his public image. But in the process, he may just turn his life around and rediscover his love of the game.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2024-01-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dT1bXXEd7cfuVsB7CMvOKYiRZWl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/haFB89tlAcex3WHuy3trtp1yhwt.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dT1bXXEd7cfuVsB7CMvOKYiRZWl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//haFB89tlAcex3WHuy3trtp1yhwt.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":993729,"title":"South Park the Streaming Wars Part 2","description":"A drought has brought the town of South Park to the brink of disaster.","duration":"0:52:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2022-07-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lILJHBKPllHrssoXQqHfchsyb8v.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rsfc5EVzWPtGcBiNKMXxDo2xvsQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lILJHBKPllHrssoXQqHfchsyb8v.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rsfc5EVzWPtGcBiNKMXxDo2xvsQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":846433,"title":"The Enforcer","description":"A noir thriller set in Miami, the film follows an enforcer who discovers his femme fatale boss has branched out into cyber sex trafficking, putting a young runaway he’s befriended at risk. He sacrifices everything to save the young girl from the deadly organization he’s spent his life building.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2022-09-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/Aqldsq65Nj1KAkQD2MzkZsAk5N5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/72V1r1G8S87ELagVxjqAUdChMCt.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//Aqldsq65Nj1KAkQD2MzkZsAk5N5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//72V1r1G8S87ELagVxjqAUdChMCt.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":574475,"title":"Final Destination Bloodlines","description":"Plagued by a violent recurring nightmare, college student Stefanie heads home to track down the one person who might be able to break the cycle and save her family from the grisly demise that inevitably awaits them all.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Horror","Mystery"],"release_date":"2025-05-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uIpJPDNFoeX0TVml9smPrs9KUVx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6WxhEvFsauuACfv8HyoVX6mZKFj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uIpJPDNFoeX0TVml9smPrs9KUVx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6WxhEvFsauuACfv8HyoVX6mZKFj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":62204,"title":"Quest for Fire","description":"In the prehistoric world, a Cro-Magnon tribe depends on an ever-burning source of fire, which eventually extinguishes. Lacking the knowledge to start a new fire, the tribe sends three warriors on a quest for more. With the tribe''s future at stake, the warriors make their way across a treacherous landscape full of hostile tribes and monstrous beasts. On their journey, they encounter Ika, a woman who has the knowledge they seek.","durati