homas Johnson dies in an auto accident and reincarnates as a dog. Remembering some of his previous being, he returns to his wife and son to protect them from the man who caused his accident. But, as time goes by, his memories return, and Thomas realizes he wasn''t such a good husband and father.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Drama","Adventure","Family"],"release_date":"1995-06-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lwnM9P0rtXdNdV2uZ9r84ALQTyt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9cdyiQQK4JwghWVWWB6hEqx4okB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lwnM9P0rtXdNdV2uZ9r84ALQTyt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9cdyiQQK4JwghWVWWB6hEqx4okB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11652,"title":"Invincible","description":"Inspired by the true story of Vince Papale, a man with nothing to lose who ignored the staggering odds and made his dream come true. When the coach of Papale''s beloved hometown football team hosted an unprecedented open tryout, the public consensus was that it was a waste of time – no one good enough to play professional football was going to be found this way.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2006-08-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yvsHnHmfb1fkHaz0VQlqP0wXeZw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oEaUMn5POAiMLnU6hKOBKoZbDpo.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yvsHnHmfb1fkHaz0VQlqP0wXeZw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oEaUMn5POAiMLnU6hKOBKoZbDpo.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4886,"title":"And Then There Were None","description":"Ten strangers are summoned to a remote island and while they are waiting for the mysterious host to appear, a recording levels serious accusations at each of the guests. Soon they start being murdered, one by one. As the survivors try to keep their wits, they reach a disturbing conclusion: one of them must be the killer.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Mystery"],"release_date":"1945-10-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/anyaK6Ab3g2FQyXpTI36rAWRQsw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/maV1jQZ58NZIjwRbdtmRcaW3fZo.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//anyaK6Ab3g2FQyXpTI36rAWRQsw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//maV1jQZ58NZIjwRbdtmRcaW3fZo.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2164,"title":"Stargate","description":"An interstellar teleportation device, found in Egypt, leads to a planet with humans resembling ancient Egyptians who worship the god Ra.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1994-10-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/s2bqHApZlliCuwgyHod0qucrYqZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4T6Po0XnZlevmhfPh3ZfEs5butR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//s2bqHApZlliCuwgyHod0qucrYqZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4T6Po0XnZlevmhfPh3ZfEs5butR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":522241,"title":"The Courier","description":"Cold War spy Greville Wynne and his Russian source try to put an end to the Cuban Missile Crisis.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Thriller","History","Drama"],"release_date":"2020-01-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sFEDBymGs32vSZ5rkfGWYpQpaEf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zFIjKtZrzhmc7HecdFXXjsLR2Ig.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sFEDBymGs32vSZ5rkfGWYpQpaEf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zFIjKtZrzhmc7HecdFXXjsLR2Ig.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":480530,"title":"Creed II","description":"Between personal obligations and training for his next big fight against an opponent with ties to his family''s past, Adonis Creed is up against the challenge of his life.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Drama","Action"],"releas