.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zH2zbxYfYplU0m1k6wUXRCIsgMK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cZgTA5ZOKOIRGyYClJMu02VUNcE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zH2zbxYfYplU0m1k6wUXRCIsgMK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cZgTA5ZOKOIRGyYClJMu02VUNcE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":508935,"title":"The Eight Hundred","description":"In 1937, eight hundred Chinese soldiers fight under siege from a warehouse in the middle of the Shanghai battlefield, completely surrounded by the Japanese army.","duration":"2:27:00","genre":["War","History","Drama","Action"],"release_date":"2020-08-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/x2WhpsSikzftIScNKkcSgwlGwHk.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/skGBLKakvPhyXaTPwZzx2zyOKz5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//x2WhpsSikzftIScNKkcSgwlGwHk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//skGBLKakvPhyXaTPwZzx2zyOKz5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":460465,"title":"Mortal Kombat","description":"Washed-up MMA fighter Cole Young, unaware of his heritage, and hunted by Emperor Shang Tsung''s best warrior, Sub-Zero, seeks out and trains with Earth''s greatest champions as he prepares to stand against the enemies of Outworld in a high stakes battle for the universe.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Action","Fantasy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2021-04-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6ELCZlTA5lGUops70hKdB83WJxH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nkayOAUBUu4mMvyNf9iHSUiPjF1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6ELCZlTA5lGUops70hKdB83WJxH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nkayOAUBUu4mMvyNf9iHSUiPjF1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":79113,"title":"A Princess for Christmas","description":"After her sister and brother-in-law''s tragic deaths, an American woman who is the guardian for her young niece and nephew is invit