''s death with the aid of photographs, notes and tattoos all over his body.","duration":"3:06:00","genre":["Action","Romance","Thriller"],"release_date":"2008-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rwywuA4irKO1zoMLBhJJaiUHv3U.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cPLzHxPFRjzNvoyncdtDGBAxjp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rwywuA4irKO1zoMLBhJJaiUHv3U.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cPLzHxPFRjzNvoyncdtDGBAxjp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2623,"title":"An Officer and a Gentleman","description":"Zack Mayo is an aloof, taciturn man who aspires to be a navy pilot. Once he arrives at training camp for his 13-week officer''s course, Mayo runs afoul of abrasive, no-nonsense drill Sergeant Emil Foley. Mayo is an excellent cadet, but a little cold around the heart, so Foley rides him mercilessly, sensing that the young man would be prime officer material if he weren''t so self-involved. Zack''s affair with a working girl is likewise compromised by his unwillingness to give of himself.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1982-07-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/w1lWBgc1FWtS2EM0vksA6bZtRYw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/69adZbLeRk5TNQ3e0008dMnde9p.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//w1lWBgc1FWtS2EM0vksA6bZtRYw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//69adZbLeRk5TNQ3e0008dMnde9p.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":588921,"title":"Ainbo: Spirit of the Amazon","description":"An epic journey of a young hero and her Spirit Guides, ''Dillo'' a cute and humorous armadillo and \"Vaca\" a goofy oversized tapir, who embark on a quest to save their home in the spectacular Amazon Rainforest.","duration":"1:24:00","genre":["Adventure","Animation","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2021-02-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/v4NDRjYO3HYj8nt