les during college, the founding of their companies, and the ingenious actions they took to build up the global corporate empires of Apple Computer Inc. and Microsoft Corporation.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Drama","TV Movie"],"release_date":"1999-06-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vKgsqmYHdNjtyhQIUjXW88IPeI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rdAMdi7iFN7EP0zuaPp3mESBOH8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vKgsqmYHdNjtyhQIUjXW88IPeI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rdAMdi7iFN7EP0zuaPp3mESBOH8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1088,"title":"Whale Rider","description":"A contemporary story of love, rejection, and triumph as a young Māori girl fights to fulfill a destiny her grandfather refuses to recognize.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Drama","Family"],"release_date":"2003-01-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dLJ6qwEXg2AglBSClRV5iVYZI1b.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cVBZQZq091KtwBm2qObOv0JTFcH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dLJ6qwEXg2AglBSClRV5iVYZI1b.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cVBZQZq091KtwBm2qObOv0JTFcH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":777270,"title":"Belfast","description":"Buddy is a young boy on the cusp of adolescence, whose life is filled with familial love, childhood hijinks, and a blossoming romance. Yet, with his beloved hometown caught up in increasing turmoil, his family faces a momentous choice: hope the conflict will pass or leave everything they know behind for a new life.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2021-11-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/l1Z9PLy8AXiqlZmFEgiGWeSFdSX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3mInLZyPOVLsZRsBwNHi3UJXXnm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//l1Z9PLy8AXiqlZmFEgiGWeSFdSX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3mInLZyPOVLsZRsBwNHi3UJXXnm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":412202,"title":"Handsome Devil","description":"A music-mad 16-year-old outcast at a rugby-mad boarding school forms an unlikely friendship with his dashing new roommate.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2017-02-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hDrwkV8lRrgjQWm3xMBU8VSh7Nn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xlHOWQFgcGV4KcZKLzYBZ21gjGT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hDrwkV8lRrgjQWm3xMBU8VSh7Nn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xlHOWQFgcGV4KcZKLzYBZ21gjGT.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":325113,"title":"A Girl Like Her","description":"Sophomore year has been a nightmare for Jessica Burns. Relentlessly harassed by her former friend Avery Keller, Jessica doesn''t know what she did to deserve the abuse from one of South Brookdale High''s most popular and beautiful students. But when a shocking event changes both of their lives, a documentary film crew, a hidden digital camera, and the attention of a reeling community begin to reveal the powerful truth about A Girl Like Her.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2015-03-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qj3gh66gqjOj3YeFYdRdhrfgckQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1jLewqKtMcoGaWHbxdRwUl9ND1B.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qj3gh66gqjOj3YeFYdRdhrfgckQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1jLewqKtMcoGaWHbxdRwUl9ND1B.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":250734,"title":"Far from the Madding Crowd","description":"In Victorian England, the independent and headstrong Bathsheba Everdene attracts three very different suitors: Gabriel Oak, a hardworking young sheep farmer; Frank Troy, a handsome and reckless Sergeant; and William Boldwood, a prosperous and mature bachelor.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":[