:"Fort Apache","description":"Owen Thursday sees his new posting to the desolate Fort Apache as a chance to claim the military honour which he believes is rightfully his. Arrogant, obsessed with military form and ultimately self-destructive, he attempts to destroy the Apache chief Cochise after luring him across the border from Mexico, against the advice of his subordinates.","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["Western"],"release_date":"1948-05-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lJyDK0shCLOVa7OZQrcYkM9MKmq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5PqKsWVlyIFuMeV1UkK6Q9Q8y9k.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lJyDK0shCLOVa7OZQrcYkM9MKmq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5PqKsWVlyIFuMeV1UkK6Q9Q8y9k.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11975,"title":"The Rainmaker","description":"Fresh out of law school and desperate for work, idealistic rookie Rudy Baylor takes on a powerful insurance company accused of denying a dying boy’s claim. Teaming up with a scrappy, unlicensed paralegal, he finds himself in a David-versus-Goliath courtroom battle that tests his ethics, courage, and belief in justice.","duration":"2:15:00","genre":["Drama","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"1997-11-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/v0IeACcCsKLKqT4eCJsZ60nySQL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/twLGHXPjQtS8UyVGp5GXmhJiTM7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//v0IeACcCsKLKqT4eCJsZ60nySQL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//twLGHXPjQtS8UyVGp5GXmhJiTM7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":581389,"title":"Space Sweepers","description":"When the crew of a space junk collector ship called The Victory discovers a humanoid robot named Dorothy that''s known to be a weapon of mass destruction, they get involved in a risky business deal which puts their lives at stake.","duration":"2:16:00","genre":["Drama","Fantasy","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2021-02-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/drulhSX7P5TQlEMQZ3JoXKSDEfz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bmemsraCG1kIthY74NjDnnLRT2Q.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//drulhSX7P5TQlEMQZ3JoXKSDEfz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bmemsraCG1kIthY74NjDnnLRT2Q.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":512263,"title":"Honey Boy","description":"The story of a child star attempting to mend his relationship with his law-breaking, alcohol-abusing father over the course of a decade, loosely based on Shia LaBeouf’s life.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2019-11-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5n2jz145P1CRdPfA296MmEZF1sQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3BZ2rBn31kWER45ZMj7OTe9keMm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5n2jz145P1CRdPfA296MmEZF1sQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3BZ2rBn31kWER45ZMj7OTe9keMm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":196750,"title":"Ghost in the Shell: Arise - Border 1: Ghost Pain","description":"The story is set in 2027, one year after the end of the fourth non-nuclear war. New Port City is still reeling from the war''s aftermath when it suffers a bombing caused by a self-propelled mine. Then, a military member implicated in arms-dealing bribes is gunned down.  During the investigation, Public Security Section''s Daisuke Aramaki encounters Motoko Kusanagi, the cyborg, wizard-level hacker assigned to the military''s 501st Secret Unit. Batou, a man with the \"eye that does not sleep,\" suspects that Kusanagi is the one behind the bombing. The Niihama Prefectural Police detective Togusa is pursuing his own dual cases of the shooting death and a prostitute''s murder. Motoko herself is being watched by the 501st Secret Unit''s head Kurutsu and cyborg agents.","duration":"0:58:00","genre":["Action","Animation","Crime","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2013-06-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/j2ExXeaolTgJzWPgX1n3jfy3KBH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/p0kHK9nJoLzpqa6tqOzPgPkdxYN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//j2ExXeaolTgJzWPgX1n3jfy3KBH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//p0kHK9nJoLzpqa6tqOzPgPkdxYN.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":56899,"title":"Santa Maradona","description":"An aimless college graduate jumping from one job interview to another — killing time in between with his wisecracking and deadbeat room-mate — falls in love with an actress.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2001-10-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ojcnSztiM3N2Bv1Jy0OVK7t5JfO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fYuwnWK4TN1EVB8RiGbNps5cyBr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ojcnSztiM3N2Bv1Jy0OVK7t5JfO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fYuwnWK4TN1EVB8RiGbNps5cyBr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":34067,"title":"Pokémon: Lucario and the Mystery of Mew","description":"In the legendary past, before Poké Balls were invented, an aura-guiding hero Pokémon named Lucario sensed two groups of armies about to clash, and a threat of a massive war in front of Oldoran Castle in Kanto that would leave no survivors. He transferred this message to his master, the legendary hero Arlon, while he was being attacked by a violent group of Hellgar. During the battle, his sense of sight was lost and he was rendered unable to see. He used the detection of his Aura, and so with the offensive Wave Bomb, he eliminated them. Though by the threat, the queen of Rota, Lady Rin was resolute to die with her civilians, and so Arlon made a choice.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Family","Adventure","Animation","Fantasy","Action","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2005-07-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7qzuPx3ukGxCyLR9j0Ahg3fFI7r.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mh5RLos1JKaswUF12jbSUQt0arm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7qzuPx3ukGxCyLR9j0Ahg3fFI7r.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mh5RLos1JKaswUF12jbSUQt0arm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9909,"title":"Dangerous Minds","description":"Former Marine Louanne Johnson lands a gig teaching in a pilot program for bright but underachieving teens at a notorious inner-city high school. After having a terrible first day, she decides she must throw decorum to the wind. When Johnson returns to the classroom, she does so armed with a no-nonsense attitude informed by her military training and a fearless determination to better the lives of her students -- no matter what the cost.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1995-08-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yK5vziICSiW6uHLltNqkZ1TXhNx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yWHWC8fJRp2kLgiFrEa8o3krOH9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yK5vziICSiW6uHLltNqkZ1TXhNx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yWHWC8fJRp2kLgiFrEa8o3krOH9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":923667,"title":"Twilight of the Warriors: Walled In","description":"In 1980s Hong Kong, troubled youth Chan Lok-kwun, a mainland refugee, struggles to survive in the Kowloon Walled City by joining underground fights. Betrayed by crime boss Mr. Big while trying to buy a fake ID, he steals drugs from him and seeks refuge in the Walled City, where he encounters Cyclone, a compassionate yet authoritative crime lord.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2024-05-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vnOc8bBkUyynscYKK4VAP1ti7jn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/h0tunBO4tMjvKVVG7fXqHgwOr5C.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vnOc8bBkUyynscYKK4VAP1ti7jn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//h0tunBO4tMjvKVVG7fXqHgwOr5C.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":393519,"title":"Raw","description":"Stringent vegetarian Justine encounters a decadent, merciless, and dangerously seductive world during her first week at veterinary school. Desperate to fit in, she strays from her principles and eats raw meat for the first time. She soon experiences terrible and unexpected consequences as her true self begins to emerge.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Horror","Drama"],"release_date":"2017-03-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/46GikxYW84dRh71sWVY0eRQiHLX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kc8jT1MAiKM0iwdjAwC5lQrTNry.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//46GikxYW84dRh71sWVY0eRQiHLX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kc8jT1MAiKM0iwdjAwC5lQrTNry.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":40085,"title":"The Long, Hot Summer","description":"Accused barn burner and conman Ben Quick arrives in a small Mississippi town and quickly ingratiates himself with its richest family, the Varners.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1958-05-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lnXz5krhKNLFSQcKqjYv3V4tn6i.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nWQddN7kfkVqSimb4SQc35gNUnP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lnXz5krhKNLFSQcKqjYv3V4tn6i.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nWQddN7kfkVqSimb4SQc35gNUnP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14886,"title":"The Last Detail","description":"Two Navy men are ordered to bring a young offender to prison, but decide to show him one last good time along the way.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"1973-12-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kyDesXA3VEx74ua1ZGAoYmzvjCc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zQoNkO99qfaBjh5aoA0pKau1prp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kyDesXA3VEx74ua1ZGAoYmzvjCc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zQoNkO99qfaBjh5aoA0pKau1prp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":670292,"title":"The Creator","description":"Amid a future war between the human race and the forces of artificial intelligence, a hardened ex-special forces agent grieving the disappearance of his wife, is recruited to hunt down and kill the Creator, the elusive architect of advanced AI who has developed a mysterious weapon with the power to end the war—and mankind itself.","duration":"2:14:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Action","Adventure"],"release_date":"2023-09-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kjQBrc00fB2RjHZB3PGR4w9ibpz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3dSivDtOuyxLDxPH4v2tcNG1fP7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kjQBrc00fB2RjHZB3PGR4w9ibpz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3dSivDtOuyxLDxPH4v2tcNG1fP7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":524348,"title":"The Report","description":"The story of Daniel Jones, lead investigator for the US Senate’s sweeping study into the CIA''s Detention and Interrogation Program, which was found to be brutal, immoral and ineffective. With the truth at stake, Jones battled tirelessly to make public what many in power sought to keep hidden.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2019-09-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fnTrZiCRXCk3I6mnYvJwiMZf6pF.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sG5NI6TMNR9ftOdTIXmG0hrBYSY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fnTrZiCRXCk3I6mnYvJwiMZf6pF.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sG5NI6TMNR9ftOdTIXmG0hrBYSY.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":432068,"title":"C''est la vie!","description":"Max is a battle-weary veteran of the wedding-planning racket. His latest — and last — gig is a hell of a fête, involving stuffy period costumes for the caterers, a vain, hyper- sensitive singer who thinks he''s a Gallic James Brown, and a morose, micromanaging groom determined to make Max''s night as miserable as possible. But what makes the affair too bitter to endure is that Max''s colleague and ostensible girlfriend, Joisette, seems to have written him off, coolly going about her professional duties while openly flirting with a much younger server. It''s going to be a very long night… especially once the groom''s aerial serenade gets underway.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2017-10-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/10ECHyeW7vZMjCLSRLak9K5fVdB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e9hIxAKPdXo9Fgwca6vT4USOXK6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//10ECHyeW7vZMjCLSRLak9K5fVdB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e9hIxAKPdXo9Fgwca6vT4USOXK6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":418680,"title":"Goodbye Christopher Robin","description":"The behind the scenes story of the life of A.A. Milne and the creation of the Winnie the Pooh stories inspired by his son Christopher Robin.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Family","History","Drama"],"release_date":"2017-09-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tUVVEGe16K5hfN7jH5MhJYjbCt2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a6IK3hMlUHzXZZVLBTh0WZ5KoAb.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tUVVEGe16K5hfN7jH5MhJYjbCt2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//a6IK3hMlUHzXZZVLBTh0WZ5KoAb.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":341744,"title":"Truman","description":"Tomás, who lives in Canada, travels to Madrid, Spain, to visit his old friend Julián. Both of them, accompanied by Truman, Julián''s faithful dog, will share many surprising and emotional little moments, triggered by the hard situation Julián is going through, for just a few days.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2015-09-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iUAFLqAj7p1v8zkOReyd7tjSLDg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/p4MFl06ePJGKMIF7zFCJhex95Vi.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iUAFLqAj7p1v8zkOReyd7tjSLDg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//p4MFl06ePJGKMIF7zFCJhex95Vi.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":285213,"title":"The Pirates","description":"At the cusp of the founding of Joseon Dynasty, an envoy from China is delivering Emperor’s Ming’s Royal Seal. But nature in the form of a giant whale intervenes and swallows the royal seal.  When a generous reward is offered to whomever can retrieve the royal seal from the belly of the whale, the race is on. A group of mountain bandits led by Jang Sa Jung and a group of pirates led by Yeo Wol  go after the lost treasure, but who will get to to it first?","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2014-08-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8UfYtyCeWGbhfyyq0u0xYwEYaZb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4qU1SW1b2Txf3Ge9rGlddDthSgx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8UfYtyCeWGbhfyyq0u0xYwEYaZb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4qU1SW1b2Txf3Ge9rGlddDthSgx.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":36657,"title":"X-Men","description":"Two mutants, Rogue and Wolverine, come to a private academy for their kind whose resident superhero team, the X-Men, must oppose a terrorist organization with similar powers.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Adventure","Action","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2000-07-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3QUVzbcNyfGe3ocWkYAT8emK8Co.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bRDAc4GogyS9ci3ow7UnInOcriN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3QUVzbcNyf