ave his younger brother from the gallows, Charlie must hunt down and kill his older brother, who is wanted for rape and murder. Venturing into one of the Outback''s most inhospitable regions, Charlie faces a terrible moral dilemma that can end only in violence.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Western","Drama"],"release_date":"2005-10-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5ndWXHSKcdN6uYSPOLlxnSMuAEE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bbSHSJuO5XjrIKMh6QXXLTg3Yzr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5ndWXHSKcdN6uYSPOLlxnSMuAEE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bbSHSJuO5XjrIKMh6QXXLTg3Yzr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11826,"title":"Sexy Beast","description":"Ex-safecracker Gal Dove has served his time behind bars and is blissfully retired to a Spanish villa paradise with a wife he adores. The idyll is shattered by the arrival of his nemesis Don Logan, intent on persuading Gal to return to London for one last big job.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"2001-01-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yYUGy4MDM6jbJoamlfo3HT6Guhy.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xTfCZTzhgHNAR1pf5D49WH4buI5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yYUGy4MDM6jbJoamlfo3HT6Guhy.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xTfCZTzhgHNAR1pf5D49WH4buI5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10655,"title":"Gettysburg","description":"In the summer of 1863, General Robert E. Lee leads the Confederate Army of Northern Virginia into Gettysburg, Pennsylvania with the goal of marching through to Washington, D.C. The Union Army of the Potomac, under the command of General George G. Meade, forms a defensive position to confront the rebel forces in what will prove to be the decisive battle of the American Civil War.","duration":"4:14:00","genre":["Drama","History","War"],"release_date":"1993-10-08","ba