rtin, a fatherless teen who insinuates himself into the doctor''s life in gradually unsettling ways.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Mystery"],"release_date":"2017-10-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kJwQXgAk440l2vZOspUJee6inim.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e4DGlsc9g0h5AyoyvvAuIRnofN7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kJwQXgAk440l2vZOspUJee6inim.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e4DGlsc9g0h5AyoyvvAuIRnofN7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":44727,"title":"One Piece: Dead End Adventure","description":"Desperate for cash, the Straw Hat Pirates enter a secret race between pirate crews known as the Dead End Competition. There, they must battle against powerful people, including the bounty hunter who wants to kill Gasparde and a climatic battle with Marine-turned-pirate Captain Gasparde.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Adventure"],"release_date":"2003-03-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/41e5H3UhT7D8VYBh4rdGy5fB0lv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tEJBIHzaW1IoOVHtgblXy76kj4G.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//41e5H3UhT7D8VYBh4rdGy5fB0lv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tEJBIHzaW1IoOVHtgblXy76kj4G.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":36950,"title":"You Don''t Know Jack","description":"Controversy and legal problems follow Dr. Jack Kevorkian as he advocates assisted suicide.","duration":"2:14:00","genre":["Drama","TV Movie","History"],"release_date":"2010-06-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9BMEUvc5TxYJF5xmygls2hnhnMP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xl4x8aILt9v91TUOKXHIVDZwkXy.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9BMEUvc5TxYJF5xmygls2hnhnMP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xl4x8aILt9v91TUOKXHIVDZwkXy.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":16