28,"title":"Triangle of Sadness","description":"A celebrity model couple are invited on a luxury cruise for the uber-rich, helmed by an unhinged, alcoholic captain. What first appears Instagrammable ends catastrophically, leaving the survivors stranded on a desert island in a struggle of hierarchy.","duration":"2:27:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2022-09-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vNPY4oCSUp7CxbHkKJNRx1fmCl0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/k9eLozCgCed5FGTSdHu0bBElAV8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vNPY4oCSUp7CxbHkKJNRx1fmCl0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//k9eLozCgCed5FGTSdHu0bBElAV8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":457799,"title":"Extremely Wicked, Shockingly Evil and Vile","description":"A chronicle of the crimes of Ted Bundy, from the perspective of his longtime girlfriend, Elizabeth Kloepfer, who refused to believe the truth about him for years.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"2019-05-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uRoA67sM5vvCI4cplxhl67BTPly.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a7dVwEBU3vupg3hZQMeyL6ksz0F.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uRoA67sM5vvCI4cplxhl67BTPly.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//a7dVwEBU3vupg3hZQMeyL6ksz0F.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":440642,"title":"The Spacewalker","description":"March 1965. In the heat of the Cold War, the USA and the USSR are competing for supremacy in space. What both superpowers aim for in this race, is to be the first to have a man walk in outer space. To accomplish that, no price is too high and no risk is too great. Now it’s up to the unlikely duo of a seasoned war veteran and a hot-headed test-pilot to fulfill this mission. Two men in a tiny spaceship, without proper testing, facing the complete unknown. They were supposed to do what no man has done before—and no man imagined what would happen next.","duration":"2:20:00","genre":["Adventure","Drama","History","Thriller"],"release_date":"2017-04-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/t4YhlPbrloOjukZLKol9dhfDyxS.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hDNVRmrprxI9NQ0zc2Uu03p65Fw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//t4YhlPbrloOjukZLKol9dhfDyxS.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hDNVRmrprxI9NQ0zc2Uu03p65Fw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":283564,"title":"SlugTerra: Return of the Elementals","description":"A new member has joined Eli and the Shane Gang! Junjie, once the protector of the Eastern Caverns, is a master of the slugslinging art of Slug Fu! But even with the power of five slingers, the Shane Gang find themselves in over their heads as they race across The 99 Caverns in search of the Legendary Elemental Slugs. The five Elementals are ancient slugs of great power, and the forbearers of all slugs found in SlugTerra today. In the wrong hands, they could bring Slugterra to the brink of destruction. So when an evil alliance starts hunting down the Elementals, Eli and his friends — old and new — take off in pursuit of the greatest threat their world has ever faced!","duration":"1:03:00","genre":["Family","Animation","Adventure"],"release_date":"2014-08-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6jnSkRFKkcyKyQJGO5eVfFeXFGF.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ApN2lteDsoIU5dDHJXeqVD13vpd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6jnSkRFKkcyKyQJGO5eVfFeXFGF.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ApN2lteDsoIU5dDHJXeqVD13vpd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":253239,"title":"Diplomacy","description":"On the night of August 24, 1944, the fate of Paris rests with General von Choltitz, who plans to destroy the city on Hitler''s orders. As the general prepares to detonate explosives throughout the capital, Swedish c