e, Superman''s death has also signaled to the universe that Earth is vulnerable. Can these new Supermen and the rest of the heroes prove them wrong?","duration":"1:27:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Animation","Action","Fantasy","Drama","Adventure"],"release_date":"2019-01-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cdCMUHWyXBOsbLL4dOEPdCEtwM4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e9TzqscNRUaG8HqEP3K1jUvi8pC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cdCMUHWyXBOsbLL4dOEPdCEtwM4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e9TzqscNRUaG8HqEP3K1jUvi8pC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":233063,"title":"Suck Me Shakespeer","description":"Ex-con Zeki Müller goes undercover as a teacher at a below average Gymnasium to find money he''d stashed prior to incarceration.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2013-11-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/p8LlfRewGJkf67UhVM0s70IfNBt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hV88MiailtnGVF6rbp6Ug6UBKYS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//p8LlfRewGJkf67UhVM0s70IfNBt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hV88MiailtnGVF6rbp6Ug6UBKYS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":24589,"title":"Dug''s Special Mission","description":"Dug is sent on foolish missions by Alpha, Beta, and Gamma so they can hunt for the Bird of Paradise Falls by themselves. Dug may find that where he belongs is not where he''s been looking.","duration":"0:05:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"2009-11-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qDm20Q4ifjK9BlBQshDtL5byAHZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/o0ydUDS80j9YTQ3JbUmD3CRPitd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qDm20Q4ifjK9BlBQshDtL5byAHZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//o0ydUDS80j9YTQ3JbUmD3CRPitd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13928,