yle after the arrival of a mysterious woman claiming to be his long-lost mother.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2012-09-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iOmGHgU3qhCMTBcf73m528risb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cI9SXHxBsEF0cgUTZKDDaPC0ozT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iOmGHgU3qhCMTBcf73m528risb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cI9SXHxBsEF0cgUTZKDDaPC0ozT.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9696,"title":"Ichi the Killer","description":"As sadomasochistic yakuza enforcer Kakihara searches for his missing boss he comes across Ichi, a repressed and psychotic killer who may be able to inflict levels of pain that Kakihara has only dreamed of.","duration":"2:09:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Horror"],"release_date":"2001-12-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/j3P5wkyiigZW8aeogoZoiNIZySL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/k8j4YLZlda98dqp9ErymKzjYowG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//j3P5wkyiigZW8aeogoZoiNIZySL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//k8j4YLZlda98dqp9ErymKzjYowG.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2758,"title":"Addams Family Values","description":"Siblings Wednesday and Pugsley Addams will stop at nothing to get rid of Pubert, the new baby boy adored by parents Gomez and Morticia. Things go from bad to worse when the new \"black widow\" nanny, Debbie Jellinsky, launches her plan to add Fester to her collection of dead husbands.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Comedy","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1993-11-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sZhTfYouKM1iV3rVbgIVEQFQogA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sdxT2VjVSx9DRicwnuECUdBHeE7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sZhTfYouKM1iV3rVbgIVEQFQogA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//s