ption":"Blank-faced bug killer Bill Lee and his dead-eyed wife, Joan, like to get high on Bill''s pest poisons while lounging with Beat poet pals. After meeting the devilish Dr. Benway, Bill gets a drug made from a centipede. Upon indulging, he accidentally kills Joan, takes orders from his typewriter-turned-cockroach, ends up in a constantly mutating Mediterranean city and learns that his hip friends have published his work -- which he doesn''t remember writing.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"1991-12-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mBteXONDhdVyXRNxj54eMNGNqyT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u01kh5jKUWjhom76mguRqUgdvja.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mBteXONDhdVyXRNxj54eMNGNqyT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u01kh5jKUWjhom76mguRqUgdvja.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1084199,"title":"Companion","description":"During a weekend getaway at a secluded lakeside estate, a group of friends finds themselves entangled in a web of secrets, deception, and advanced technology. As tensions rise and loyalties are tested, they uncover unsettling truths about themselves and the world around them.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Horror","Science Fiction","Thriller"],"release_date":"2025-01-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sc1abgWNXc29wSBaerrjGBih06l.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oCoTgC3UyWGfyQ9thE10ulWR7bn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sc1abgWNXc29wSBaerrjGBih06l.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oCoTgC3UyWGfyQ9thE10ulWR7bn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":486898,"title":"Long Day''s Journey Into Night","description":"Luo Hongwu returns to Kaili, the hometown from which he fled many years ago. He begins the search for the woman he loved and whom he has never been able to forget.","duration":"2:18:00","genre":["Drama","Mystery"],"release_date":"2018-12-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zJDaoc3HIHIgIOiY60NxqZUdXcp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8wUxYW7v2sahnFwipwzjRo8Z3sP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zJDaoc3HIHIgIOiY60NxqZUdXcp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8wUxYW7v2sahnFwipwzjRo8Z3sP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":328387,"title":"Nerve","description":"Industrious high school senior Vee Delmonico has had it with living life on the sidelines. When pressured by friends to join the popular online game Nerve, Vee decides to sign up for just one dare in what seems like harmless fun. But as she finds herself caught up in the thrill of the adrenaline-fueled competition partnered with a mysterious stranger, the game begins to take a sinister turn with increasingly dangerous acts, leading her into a high stakes finale that will determine her entire future.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Mystery","Adventure","Crime"],"release_date":"2016-06-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fg04CQyJzuDJ82jm2meY37n9XyE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qmSpHC0CSNyNll9WhlwWYuwoQ28.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fg04CQyJzuDJ82jm2meY37n9XyE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qmSpHC0CSNyNll9WhlwWYuwoQ28.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":97630,"title":"Zero Dark Thirty","description":"A chronicle of the decade-long hunt for al-Qaeda terrorist leader Osama bin Laden after the September 2001 attacks, and his death at the hands of the Navy S.E.A.L. Team 6 in May, 2011.","duration":"2:37:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"2012-12-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/evPzxMacNWsjkUKQO4NXKe5Rl6a.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wNSdSSxowM3WIqmPJNg3RagYbwP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//evPzxMacNWsjkUKQO4NXKe5Rl6a.jp