le. As the struggle against European imperialism sweeps Indochina, Jean-Baptiste and Camille have to choose sides and Éliane faces the emotionally difficult challenge of raising the child of her daughter and ex-lover.","duration":"2:39:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1992-04-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sk5YqvIl4jd7xgw7lcoUMYOLjKt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sAemRfr6mOSwtQ76e4yUQVImo8B.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sk5YqvIl4jd7xgw7lcoUMYOLjKt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sAemRfr6mOSwtQ76e4yUQVImo8B.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":799583,"title":"The Ministry of Ungentlemanly Warfare","description":"During World War II, the British Army assigns a group of competent soldiers to carry out a mission against the Nazi forces behind enemy lines... A true story about a secret British WWII organization — the Special Operations Executive. Founded by Winston Churchill, their irregular warfare against the Germans helped to change the course of the war, and gave birth to modern black operations.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Action","Comedy","War"],"release_date":"2024-04-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hm21I7yc6oYBogTloET3eXsVPlq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8aF0iAKH9MJMYAZdi0Slg77RYa2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hm21I7yc6oYBogTloET3eXsVPlq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8aF0iAKH9MJMYAZdi0Slg77RYa2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":661914,"title":"One Night in Miami...","description":"In the aftermath of Cassius Clay''s defeat of Sonny Liston in 1964, the boxer meets with Malcolm X, Sam Cooke and Jim Brown to change the course of history in the segregated South.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2020-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yUyuDacqA0IhWqEbPQPXBsEIbPX.jpg","po