pmentally disabled boy''s life changes after he encounters an extraterrestrial being.","duration":"2:45:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Action","Adventure"],"release_date":"2003-08-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ytQ9bT5TuDbSIXgmOC1wy49dkpM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2iJVauDYcYxRRGciTmAOSjiATf9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ytQ9bT5TuDbSIXgmOC1wy49dkpM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2iJVauDYcYxRRGciTmAOSjiATf9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15766,"title":"Ghidorah, the Three-Headed Monster","description":"After a meteorite unleashes a three-headed beast upon Tokyo, Mothra tries to unite with Godzilla and Rodan to battle the extraterrestrial threat.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Action","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1964-12-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aQHjAx6PisDlolT4bM4bHqLP1uJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qkI5nhvxx3233gQmoQvv0W3MB7A.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aQHjAx6PisDlolT4bM4bHqLP1uJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qkI5nhvxx3233gQmoQvv0W3MB7A.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13633,"title":"Bad Boys","description":"Mick O''Brien is a young Chicago street thug torn between a life of petty crime and the love of his girlfriend. But when the heist of a local drug dealer goes tragically wrong Mick is sentenced to a brutal juvenile prison where violence is a rite of passage and respect is measured in vengeance.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1983-03-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yIpaahwOBk4uVUBNcHkoZdcXPCK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5nHZ3wflOifKJMUcTCw0isKhmCv.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yIpaahwOBk4uVUBNcHkoZdcXPCK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5nHZ3wflOifKJMUcTCw0isKhmCv.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9392,"title":"The Descent","description":"After a personal tragedy, Sarah joins her friends on a caving expedition in the Appalachian Mountains. But when a rockfall traps them deep underground, their adventure turns into a nightmare. As they search for a way out, the group discovers they are not alone—lurking in the darkness are savage, cave-dwelling creatures. With rising tension and dwindling trust, the women must fight to survive against both the predators and each other.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Adventure","Horror"],"release_date":"2005-07-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9T5D5RGuCsC6CeqYZJTv4rT4RPy.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mxFPI4KYBk5ri9cPteIS8jiDFgj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9T5D5RGuCsC6CeqYZJTv4rT4RPy.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mxFPI4KYBk5ri9cPteIS8jiDFgj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1107215,"title":"Once Upon My Mother","description":"In 1963, Esther gives birth to Roland, the youngest of a large family. Roland is born with a club foot that prevents him from standing. Against everyone''s advice, she promises her son that he will walk like the others and that he will have a fabulous life. From then on, Esther will do everything in her power to keep this promise. Through decades of trials and miracles of life, this film is the story of a true, funny and moving story, that of an incredible destiny and the greatest love there is: that of a mother for her child.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2025-03-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qMYb0pTEnsYsYPVD1uJIpOMumYB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9MZjFDA3ILz3n23Iqj1ozYfi8yt.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qMYb0pTEnsYsYPVD1uJIpOMumYB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9MZjFDA3ILz3n2