ttps://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hehaK1jIuTOvRPGPccVivZcZ2Cb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mPYBjVkeHakkPGY7WaKyyNU4RWm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5698,"title":"The Great Train Robbery","description":"After the train station clerk is assaulted and left bound and gagged, then the departing train and its passengers robbed, a posse goes in hot pursuit of the fleeing bandits.","duration":"0:12:00","genre":["Western","Crime","Action","Adventure"],"release_date":"1903-12-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/99uGRUGS2qxNvPARiM8dkuTrUnW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vEYr1sJR1dOFGXwXawpBN6hDRGF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//99uGRUGS2qxNvPARiM8dkuTrUnW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vEYr1sJR1dOFGXwXawpBN6hDRGF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2594,"title":"Monsieur Batignole","description":"In 1942, in an occupied Paris, the apolitical grocer Edmond Batignole lives with his wife and daughter in a small apartment in the building of his grocery. When his future son-in-law and collaborator of the German Pierre-Jean Lamour calls the Nazis to arrest the Jewish Bernstein family, they move to the confiscated apartment. Some days later, the young Simon Bernstein escapes from the Germans and comes to his former home. When Batignole finds him, he feels sorry for the boy and lodges him, hiding Simon from Pierre-Jean and also from his wife. Later, two cousins of Simon meet him in the cellar of the grocery. When Pierre-Jean finds the children, Batignole decides to travel with the children to Switzerland.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2002-03-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/86UfYMcI2pOotv52YL9zeMuO7gw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2Cse4C8YXXOoXmxeymyGIg45TvD.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//86UfYMcI2pOotv52YL9zeMuO7gw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2Cse4C8YXXOoXmxeymyGIg45TvD.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":579583,"title":"The King of Staten Island","description":"Scott has been a case of arrested development ever since his firefighter father died when he was seven. He''s now reached his mid-20s having achieved little, chasing a dream of becoming a tattoo artist that seems far out of reach. As his ambitious younger sister heads off to college, Scott is still living with his exhausted ER nurse mother and spends his days smoking weed, hanging with the guys — Oscar, Igor and Richie — and secretly hooking up with his childhood friend Kelsey. But when his mother starts dating a loudmouth firefighter named Ray, it sets off a chain of events that will force Scott to grapple with his grief and take his first tentative steps toward moving forward in life.","duration":"2:17:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2020-07-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5rwcd24GGltKiqdPT4G2dmchLr9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zQFjMmE3K9AX5QrBL1SXIxYQ9jz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5rwcd24GGltKiqdPT4G2dmchLr9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zQFjMmE3K9AX5QrBL1SXIxYQ9jz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":332283,"title":"Mary Shelley","description":"The love affair between poet Percy Shelley and Mary Wollstonecraft Godwin resulted in the creation of an immortal novel, “Frankenstein; or, The Modern Prometheus.”","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2017-08-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iGm4RpRv5zEsdUPGZRems4KYFgg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gKHJTsrfxJtfFNPQJn2hDNEMtFf.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iGm4RpRv5zEsdUPGZRems4KYFgg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gKHJTsrfxJtfFNPQJn2hDNEMtFf.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":160588,"title":"Blue Jasmine","descrip