journey, he finds himself continually sparring and occasionally cooperating with Ryan, a gunfighter on his own quest for vengeance, who knows more than he says about Bill''s tragedy.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Western"],"release_date":"1967-08-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9FbiHF7JcBNxeNrOgHa1kRlioZU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qjvb8IYBaqizU1GG1qmGtMJpkBK.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9FbiHF7JcBNxeNrOgHa1kRlioZU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qjvb8IYBaqizU1GG1qmGtMJpkBK.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":41428,"title":"Tetsuo: The Iron Man","description":"A \"metal fetishist\", driven mad by the maggots wriggling in the wound he''s made to embed metal into his flesh, runs out into the night and is accidentally run down by a Japanese businessman and his girlfriend. The pair dispose of the corpse in hopes of quietly moving on with their lives. However, the businessman soon finds that he is now plagued by a vicious curse that transforms his flesh into iron.","duration":"1:07:00","genre":["Horror","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1989-07-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xt75NSIlfzwPwuBsuarB3i1mBxj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lARc59hUAKW3ziWddftUnZ99R8c.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xt75NSIlfzwPwuBsuarB3i1mBxj.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lARc59hUAKW3ziWddftUnZ99R8c.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":37950,"title":"Charlie St. Cloud","description":"Accomplished sailor Charlie St. Cloud has the adoration of his mother Claire and his little brother Sam, as well as a college scholarship that will lead him far from his sleepy Pacific Northwest hometown. But his bright future is cut short when tragedy strikes and takes his dreams with it. After high school classmate Tess returns home unexpectedly, Charlie grows torn between honoring a promise