op_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gJeF1Pn9nsSsexqaQpS0G840nI2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//obcQJkZB2OsRxd5GWIcQ5Qjv4YW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9386,"title":"In the Line of Fire","description":"Veteran Secret Service agent Frank Horrigan is a man haunted by his failure to save President Kennedy while serving protection detail in Dallas. Thirty years later, a man calling himself \"Booth\" threatens the life of the current President, forcing Horrigan to come back to protection detail to confront the ghosts from his past.","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["Action","Drama","Thriller","Crime","Mystery"],"release_date":"1993-07-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zYM9IbF08gB1Ip3Qee19HPvNY8T.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3NvOFpmyECI3DNExYMtFIRcGMsu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zYM9IbF08gB1Ip3Qee19HPvNY8T.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3NvOFpmyECI3DNExYMtFIRcGMsu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":6968,"title":"The Baader Meinhof Complex","description":"When German police viciously quell a protest against the shah of Iran, popular journalist Ulrike Meinhof rebels against her dishonest marriage, walks away from her children and joins radical anarchist Andreas Baader. Together with Baader''s girlfriend, Gudrun Ensslin, they form the violent Red Faction Army, and together perpetrate a slew of terrorist attacks as a way of disrupting the fabric of what they see as an increasingly fascist state.","duration":"2:29:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Drama","History","Thriller"],"release_date":"2008-09-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6vspNQNWrtoXQMqjsBhouCVsozG.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/36Y0UT6bXnkHBGmmVFWGEnEh8nI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6vspNQNWrtoXQMqjsBhouCVsozG.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//36Y0UT6bXnkHBGmmVF