 threat emerging from the shadows of the past who''s fueled by blood revenge, and who is determined to shatter this family and destroy everything—and everyone—that Dom loves, forever.","duration":"2:22:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2023-05-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4XM8DUTQb3lhLemJC51Jx4a2EuA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fiVW06jE7z9YnO4trhaMEdclSiC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4XM8DUTQb3lhLemJC51Jx4a2EuA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fiVW06jE7z9YnO4trhaMEdclSiC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":385128,"title":"F9","description":"Dominic Toretto and his crew battle the most skilled assassin and high-performance driver they''ve ever encountered: his forsaken brother.","duration":"2:23:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Crime"],"release_date":"2021-05-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xXHZeb1yhJvnSHPzZDqee0zfMb6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/deEmLILTPejEb6OGsXRJ5MCvyDW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xXHZeb1yhJvnSHPzZDqee0zfMb6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//deEmLILTPejEb6OGsXRJ5MCvyDW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":53487,"title":"This Must Be the Place","description":"A bored, retired rock star living in Ireland sets out to find his dead father''s tormentor, an ex-Nazi war criminal who is a refugee in the U.S.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2011-08-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hq4MeMZeWWOvsLyOp9kCG687Ds3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7WSD4SAMGVP6BHSOzDGL9Acunxd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hq4MeMZeWWOvsLyOp9kCG687Ds3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7WSD4SAMGVP6BHSOzDGL9Acunxd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13320,"title":"Funny Face","description":"A shy Greenwich Village book clerk is discovered by a fashion photographer and whisked off to Paris where she becomes a reluctant model.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Music","Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"1957-02-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9VJh0YPms8QM8GYDvt5wtmRsCU5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tzTjalpIz6NyFrWPPlOBFoBjb7z.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9VJh0YPms8QM8GYDvt5wtmRsCU5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tzTjalpIz6NyFrWPPlOBFoBjb7z.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11227,"title":"Angel-A","description":"A beautiful and mysterious woman helps an inept scam artist get his game together... but is their meeting purely coincidence?","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2005-12-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/z3xpnup2yshwV88pj3VmxQPO5F1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ojUGHGfroGRwW7jO0727txepQbC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//z3xpnup2yshwV88pj3VmxQPO5F1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ojUGHGfroGRwW7jO0727txepQbC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10779,"title":"The Frighteners","description":"Once an architect, Frank Bannister now passes himself off as an exorcist of evil spirits. To bolster his facade, he claims his \"special\" gift is the result of a car accident that killed his wife. But what he does not count on is more people dying in the small town where he lives. As he tries to piece together the supernatural mystery of these killings, he falls in love with the wife of one of the victims and deals with a crazy FBI agent.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Horror","Comedy"],"release_date":"1996-07-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/krR08gys45BTnY3qXIfBJVDKrvK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zcJbCMwFLJdn5OLjhYwMVaSB32R.jpg","small_backdrop_path"