.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7UGmn8TyWPPzkjhLUW58cOUHjPS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11703,"title":"Kiss of the Spider Woman","description":"The story of two radically different men thrown together in a Latin American prison cell. One is Valentin, a journalist being tortured for his political beliefs. The other is Molina, a gay window-dresser who fills their lonely nights by spinning romantic fantasies drawn from memories of old movies.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1985-07-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sQSKR3iDCtayRTN2Nr9LiRYy6TT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lbrn4gOjYKrLrINn3uUJRlV2NZO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sQSKR3iDCtayRTN2Nr9LiRYy6TT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lbrn4gOjYKrLrINn3uUJRlV2NZO.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11576,"title":"It''s a Mad, Mad, Mad, Mad World","description":"A group of strangers come across a man dying after a car crash who proceeds to tell them about the $350,000 he buried in California. What follows is the madcap adventures of those strangers as each attempts to claim the prize for himself.","duration":"3:12:00","genre":["Adventure","Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"1963-11-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wSiBXaJ2PtlxUGH2waIxQZjFPhg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/j4mWzOisSHFkaqIkq34l2mm8a5K.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wSiBXaJ2PtlxUGH2waIxQZjFPhg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//j4mWzOisSHFkaqIkq34l2mm8a5K.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1272,"title":"Sunshine","description":"Fifty years into the future, the sun is dying, and Earth is threatened by arctic temperatures. A team of astronauts is sent to revive the Sun — but the mission fails. Seven years later, a new team is sent to finish the mission as mankind’s last hope.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Thriller"],"release_date":"2007-04-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5AIAnucJKZ3sHpm7r1ykFVIoUHK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oKGGeJ8qvm0UmClz43VJ31fzPP7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5AIAnucJKZ3sHpm7r1ykFVIoUHK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oKGGeJ8qvm0UmClz43VJ31fzPP7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":763215,"title":"Damsel","description":"A young woman''s marriage to a charming prince turns into a fierce fight for survival when she''s offered up as a sacrifice to a fire-breathing dragon.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Fantasy","Action","Adventure"],"release_date":"2024-03-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/deLWkOLZmBNkm8p16igfapQyqeq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AgHbB9DCE9aE57zkHjSmseszh6e.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//deLWkOLZmBNkm8p16igfapQyqeq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AgHbB9DCE9aE57zkHjSmseszh6e.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":385103,"title":"Scoob!","description":"In Scooby-Doo’s greatest adventure yet, see the never-before told story of how lifelong friends Scooby and Shaggy first met and how they joined forces with young detectives Fred, Velma, and Daphne to form the famous Mystery Inc. Now, with hundreds of cases solved, Scooby and the gang face their biggest, toughest mystery ever: an evil plot to unleash the ghost dog Cerberus upon the world. As they race to stop this global “dogpocalypse,” the gang discovers that Scooby has a secret legacy and an epic destiny greater than anyone ever imagined.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Family","Mystery"],"release_date":"2020-07-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sJjuXNHNT7PfzcgkqM3oSIkVOXB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jHo2M1OiH9Re33jYtUQdfzPeUkx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sJjuXNHNT7PfzcgkqM3oSIkVOXB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jHo2M1OiH9Re33jYtUQdfzPeUkx.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":76492,"title":"Hotel Transylvania","description":"Welcome to Hotel Transylvania, Dracula''s lavish five-stake resort, where monsters and their families can live it up and no humans are allowed. One special weekend, Dracula has invited all his best friends to celebrate his beloved daughter Mavis''s 118th birthday. For Dracula catering to all of these legendary monsters is no problem but the party really starts when one ordinary guy stumbles into the hotel and changes everything!","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2012-09-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5rARlA8beRAVXPYzSaF2NoS8Ry5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eJGvzGrsfe2sqTUPv5IwLWXjVuR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5rARlA8beRAVXPYzSaF2NoS8Ry5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eJGvzGrsfe2sqTUPv5IwLWXjVuR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":46705,"title":"Blue Valentine","description":"Dean and Cindy live a quiet life in a modest neighborhood. They appear to have the world at their feet at the outset of the relationship. However, his lack of ambition and her retreat into self-absorption cause potentially irreversible cracks in their marriage.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2010-12-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fAqpfILTPsaKpAzoAvkXf5glgSo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dc8BdKnDY5Iy28KzUGtHIXuqqFK.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fAqpfILTPsaKpAzoAvkXf5glgSo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dc8BdKnDY5Iy28KzUGtHIXuqqFK.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14410,"title":"Notorious","description":"\"Notorious\" is the story of Christopher Wallace. Through raw talent and sheer determination, Wallace transforms himself from Brooklyn street hustler (once selling crack to pregnant women) to one of the greatest rappers of all time: The Notorious B.I.G. Follow his meteoric rise to fame and his refusal to succumb to expectations - redefining our notion of \"The American Dream.\"","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Music","Drama","History"],"release_date":"2009-01-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xlIxMddSdqyxfY02CilOK4VKWR8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/62NsZPgueSiE8y7dqtU3FSLFwYw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xlIxMddSdqyxfY02CilOK4VKWR8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//62NsZPgueSiE8y7dqtU3FSLFwYw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9007,"title":"Just Like Heaven","description":"Shortly after David Abbott moves into his new San Francisco digs, he has an unwelcome visitor on his hands: winsome Elizabeth Masterson, who asserts that the apartment is hers -- and promptly vanishes. When she starts appearing and disappearing at will, David thinks she''s a ghost, while Elizabeth is convinced she''s alive.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2005-09-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/k63j5qexRlpD3wxzETKfuZRVWiT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2cLbyVNhEEaUJGg7rfbLtX6454I.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//k63j5qexRlpD3wxzETKfuZRVWiT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2cLbyVNhEEaUJGg7rfbLtX6454I.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2459,"title":"Pardon Mon Affaire","description":"On an otherwise normal day, Étienne, a happily married man and a good father, sees something that stops him dead in his tracks: a gorgeous woman in a billowing red dress. Long after she has left his vision, her memory continues to haunt his mind. He falls instantly in love with her and tries everything to get to know her better. Helping Étienne snare his elusive lady in red are his three bumbling buddies, which all have secret affairs and/or cheat on their wives.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"1976-09-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2CQBJsfAQ9Y99rl5vwTLTuCQLj8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kYNgxIPOJUlJiN984H4NHf46y66.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2CQBJsfAQ9Y99rl5vwTLTuCQLj8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kYNgxIPOJUlJiN984H4NHf46y66.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":392,"title":"Chocolat","description":"In the winter of 1959, a single mother and her young daughter arrive in a rural French town, where they open an unusual chocolate shop that disrupts the moral fiber of the strictly Catholic townsfolk and mayor.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2000-12-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ci7lHSttckIgO6TlaT4X1zy8CDi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lnwPvyj8UR7MetG2pQ92453IIoR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ci7lHSttckIgO6TlaT4X1zy8CDi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lnwPvyj8UR7MetG2pQ92453IIoR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":894205,"title":"Werewolf by Night","description":"On a dark and somber night, a secret cabal of monster hunters emerge from the shadows and gather at the foreboding Bloodstone Temple following the death of their leader. In a strange and macabre memorial to the leader’s life, the attendees are thrust into a mysterious and deadly competition for a powerful relic—a hunt that will ultimately bring them face to face with a dangerous monster.","duration":"0:55:00","genre":["Action","Fantasy","Horror"],"release_date":"2022-09-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/l1ORpdYr8uFZ9MNYKoq1p6fIc4M.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mvIvNKRIJPPS7WSFa