of Justice League: War, Ocean Master and Black Manta have declared a war against the surface in retaliation of the aftermath of Apokoliptian-tyrant Darkseid''s planetary invasion. Queen Atlanna seeks out her other son, Ocean Master’s half-brother Arthur Curry, a half-human with aquatic powers with no knowledge of his Atlantean heritage, to restore balance.  Living with powers he doesn’t understand and seeing the danger around him, Curry takes steps to embrace his destiny, joining the Justice League, and with his new teammates he battles to save Earth from total destruction.","duration":"1:12:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Action","Animation","Adventure"],"release_date":"2015-01-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ltlPFTMRsohmi2QbbSZUkAVg7Nc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iaYZA8teYeIxmR8wRrEED5wwR0u.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ltlPFTMRsohmi2QbbSZUkAVg7Nc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iaYZA8teYeIxmR8wRrEED5wwR0u.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":296917,"title":"PSYCHO-PASS: The Movie","description":"In a futuristic Japan, the Sibyl System is charged with keeping the peace. When the state of SEAUn brings the Sibyl System in to test its effectiveness, it becomes a haven of peace and safety—for a time. Eventually, terrorists from SEAUn begin appearing in Japan, somehow slipping through the System''s security and attacking from within. Desperate for answers, Inspector Akane Tsunemori is sent overseas to bring the terrorists to justice. But when her investigation forces her into a standoff with an old ally, will she be able to pull the trigger?","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Animation","Science Fiction","Action"],"release_date":"2015-01-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xxXFQbB55KvRzlhnUES93tIT9z0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rf3aOQwmCs1xTgp2vem5ZQeh4NU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://imag