ile deciding how to proceed.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1995-12-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jOncZUo1ce3cOgBWPvnmpilzFUu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nPrUw2hLIt9uWrGwfKjr0AbGWgd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jOncZUo1ce3cOgBWPvnmpilzFUu.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nPrUw2hLIt9uWrGwfKjr0AbGWgd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8195,"title":"Ronin","description":"A briefcase with undisclosed contents – sought by Irish terrorists and the Russian mob – makes its way into criminals'' hands. An Irish liaison assembles a squad of mercenaries, or ''ronin'', and gives them the thorny task of recovering the case.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"1998-09-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/frqahc6v8wt0p2Zo3XKBu2dg73z.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AirrhRJjHwytOV0pdLu7YZ4DEyr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//frqahc6v8wt0p2Zo3XKBu2dg73z.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AirrhRJjHwytOV0pdLu7YZ4DEyr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2750,"title":"24 Hour Party People","description":"Manchester, 1976. Tony Wilson is an ambitious but frustrated local TV news reporter looking for a way to make his mark. After witnessing a life-changing concert by a band known as the Sex Pistols, he persuades his station to televise one of their performances, and soon Manchester''s punk groups are clamoring for him to manage them. Riding the wave of a musical revolution, Wilson and his friends create the legendary Factory Records label and The Hacienda club.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Music"],"release_date":"2002-02-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ucRD8UUr5tllltg3ZTWoXOyPXyJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8f50NQ1wz6hdxfCISC