anity Fair article - suddenly stopped his career in its tracks.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2003-11-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u4OUSKeFwuP1z42dL58Mi0LYwIg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bIFJ49tk79hiFr9Z6bF6QapTg66.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u4OUSKeFwuP1z42dL58Mi0LYwIg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bIFJ49tk79hiFr9Z6bF6QapTg66.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12244,"title":"9","description":"When 9 first comes to life, he finds himself in a post-apocalyptic world. All humans are gone, and it is only by chance that he discovers a small community of others like him taking refuge from fearsome machines that roam the earth intent on their extinction. Despite being the neophyte of the group, 9 convinces the others that hiding will do them no good.","duration":"1:19:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Animation","Science Fiction","Thriller"],"release_date":"2009-08-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bxgbXWG7dBgNpaFw4BLwzNS7qLk.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3uqXGOH4BQ2CLJWkDJZ0PzbUzOn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bxgbXWG7dBgNpaFw4BLwzNS7qLk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3uqXGOH4BQ2CLJWkDJZ0PzbUzOn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12153,"title":"White Chicks","description":"Two FBI agent brothers, Marcus and Kevin Copeland, accidentally foil a drug bust. To avoid being fired they accept a mission escorting a pair of socialites to the Hamptons--but when the girls are disfigured in a car accident, they refuse to go. Left without options, Marcus and Kevin decide to pose as the sisters, transforming themselves from black men into rich white women.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"2004-06-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/di47xqYMCYpjqwnqNlO17X5qXMX.