ime","Thriller"],"release_date":"1971-02-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/q7WBYbZ1DiirFGx1Ex11N7jKMyT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3AytAYzJuPmS4Wo8X3jcsaN4oM3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//q7WBYbZ1DiirFGx1Ex11N7jKMyT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3AytAYzJuPmS4Wo8X3jcsaN4oM3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":832964,"title":"Lee","description":"The true story of photographer Elizabeth \"Lee\" Miller, a fashion model who became an acclaimed war correspondent for Vogue magazine during World War II.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["History","Drama","War"],"release_date":"2024-09-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9SvSJJSgufM76vn9ddB0YMF6lzs.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zdNWyuim8gpJHe1LtKaDrs43dWz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9SvSJJSgufM76vn9ddB0YMF6lzs.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zdNWyuim8gpJHe1LtKaDrs43dWz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":37495,"title":"Four Lions","description":"Four Lions tells the story of a group of British jihadists who push their abstract dreams of glory to the breaking point. As the wheels fly off, and their competing ideologies clash, what emerges is an emotionally engaging (and entirely plausible) farce.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2010-05-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bVmDpF2VzVivzH8GVFXfVJeRPd7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/x4JzaRPXBs9wiHCe3e3ymXWuwfd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bVmDpF2VzVivzH8GVFXfVJeRPd7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//x4JzaRPXBs9wiHCe3e3ymXWuwfd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":36679,"title":"Godzilla vs. King Ghidorah","description":"The Futurians, time-travelers from the 23rd century, arrive in Japan to warn them of the nation''s destruction under Godzilla. They offer to help erase Godzilla from history by preventing his creation. With Godzilla seemingly gone, a new monster emerges as the Futurians'' true intentions are revealed.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1991-12-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8W2rvs3y7x4KGwjN8dO6HmVPU82.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lhJAwiVMflnMWnZGEdVDHWBwIZq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8W2rvs3y7x4KGwjN8dO6HmVPU82.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lhJAwiVMflnMWnZGEdVDHWBwIZq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12149,"title":"Frailty","description":"A mysterious man arrives at the offices of an FBI agent and recounts his childhood: how his religious fanatic father received visions telling him to kill people who were in fact \"demons.\"","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2002-04-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vORzDiWl5mxm6nuXQu9h5bhi6rb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jGuobXsIJOV3FmM4gRlK4QQMIos.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vORzDiWl5mxm6nuXQu9h5bhi6rb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jGuobXsIJOV3FmM4gRlK4QQMIos.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1056380,"title":"The Coffee Table","description":"Jesus and María are a couple going through a difficult time in their relationship. Nevertheless, they have just become parents. To shape their new life, they decide to buy a new coffee table. A decision that will change their existence.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Horror","Thriller","Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2023-11-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7mij6m3a2rmaj7SvQf1dPyu7mqZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/r8S7cc676EfgfUDVQKPrqRlbRFz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7m