itle":"A Christmas Carol","description":"Miser Ebenezer Scrooge is awakened on Christmas Eve by spirits who reveal to him his own miserable existence, what opportunities he wasted in his youth, his current cruelties, and the dire fate that awaits him if he does not change his ways. Scrooge is faced with his own story of growing bitterness and meanness, and must decide what his own future will hold: death or redemption.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Drama","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1999-12-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/g5CMQPz5cqUHro9pNLBRW7cT8cY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oi1NcVDXlFEsdpLp37BJmFbVlg9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//g5CMQPz5cqUHro9pNLBRW7cT8cY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oi1NcVDXlFEsdpLp37BJmFbVlg9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14556,"title":"Anything for Her","description":"Lisa and Julien are married and lead a happy uneventful life with their son Oscar. But their life radically changes one morning, when the police comes to arrest Lisa on murder charges. She''s sentenced to 20 years of prison. Convinced of his wife''s innocence, Julien decides to act. How far will he be willing to go for her?","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2008-12-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fezKVCfPieamGuVcTjBDz8cqgb3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jYqFLb9d2dfJjIix7PCKoDqdbw6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fezKVCfPieamGuVcTjBDz8cqgb3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jYqFLb9d2dfJjIix7PCKoDqdbw6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11329,"title":"Runaway Jury","description":"After a workplace shooting in New Orleans, a trial against the gun manufacturer pits lawyer Wendell Rohr against shady jury consultant Rankin Fitch, who uses illegal means to stack the jury with people sympathetic to the defense. But when juror Nicholas Easter and his girlfriend Marlee reveal their ability to sway the jury into delivering any verdict they want, a high-stakes cat-and-mouse game begins.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2003-10-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zIckqbwhqxiMQKcpfdPuOCXfp5c.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hpBot7sqaskTdZS264c7hOhGiQ0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zIckqbwhqxiMQKcpfdPuOCXfp5c.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hpBot7sqaskTdZS264c7hOhGiQ0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10707,"title":"The Squid and the Whale","description":"Based on the true childhood experiences of Noah Baumbach and his brother, The Squid and the Whale tells the touching story of two young boys dealing with their parents'' divorce in Brooklyn in the 1980s.","duration":"1:21:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2005-10-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3ZjxENlw4HXioGGwhqaJrvdEXKo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9NbXn1NMdfGM491V3EFjZADR9SX.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3ZjxENlw4HXioGGwhqaJrvdEXKo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9NbXn1NMdfGM491V3EFjZADR9SX.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2163,"title":"Breakdown","description":"On their cross-country drive, a married couple, Jeff and Amy Taylor, experience car trouble after their SUV breaks down. Stranded in the New Mexico desert, the two catch a break when a passing truck driver offers Amy a ride to a nearby café to call for help. Meanwhile, Jeff is able to fix the car and make his way to the café, but Amy isn''t there. He tracks down the trucker ― who tells the police he''s never seen Jeff or his wife before. Jeff then begins a desperate, frenzied search for Amy.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Crime","Mystery","Thriller","Action"],"release_date":"1997-05-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e86x1nXqfXRlqATuy60MmzFUFQr.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/m3VB59ppr1RlpxNUYRUfZTgjgU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e86x1nXqfXRlqATuy60MmzFUFQr.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//m3VB59ppr1RlpxNUYRUfZTgjgU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":813477,"title":"Shin Kamen Rider","description":"A man forced to bear power and stripped of humanity. A woman skeptical of happiness. Takeshi Hongo, an Augmentation made by SHOCKER, and Ruriko Midorikawa, a rebel of the organization, escape while fighting off assassins. What’s justice? What’s evil? Will this violence end? Despite his power, Hongo tries to remain human. Along with freedom, Ruriko has regained a heart. What paths will they choose?","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Action","Drama","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2023-03-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ccFavvHGfhA5yI32K0bzDjlyKSN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9dTO2RygcDT0cQkawABw4QkDegN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ccFavvHGfhA5yI32K0bzDjlyKSN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9dTO2RygcDT0cQkawABw4QkDegN.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":412117,"title":"The Secret Life of Pets 2","description":"Max the terrier must cope with some major life changes when his owner gets married and has a baby. When the family takes a trip to the countryside, nervous Max has numerous run-ins with canine-intolerant cows, hostile foxes and a scary turkey. Luckily for Max, he soon catches a break when he meets Rooster, a gruff farm dog who tries to cure the lovable pooch of his neuroses.","duration":"1:26:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Family","Adventure"],"release_date":"2019-05-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zDIievPXqjfjLogXFqnnopU0OkK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/s9xg4V5EDKiphgIksVJ9gewBM11.jpg","small_b