inous damsel in distress.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Comedy","Horror"],"release_date":"1967-11-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pmO4NERkXjJiCfpEuLT1raZS5fA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nqk9oTXRaukSyhFAwBGGgEnLl43.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pmO4NERkXjJiCfpEuLT1raZS5fA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nqk9oTXRaukSyhFAwBGGgEnLl43.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2259,"title":"The House of the Spirits","description":"A rancher, his clairvoyant wife and their family face turbulent years in South America.","duration":"2:20:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"1993-10-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/im6mZxeUMq71cBqqQmzLGDVdIXd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pS5xqILNBxcjRqLZROIkO4wszrU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//im6mZxeUMq71cBqqQmzLGDVdIXd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pS5xqILNBxcjRqLZROIkO4wszrU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":972614,"title":"Knox Goes Away","description":"A contract killer, after being diagnosed with a fast-moving form of dementia, is presented with the opportunity to redeem himself by saving the life of his estranged adult son. But to do so, he must race against the police closing in on him as well as the ticking clock of his own rapidly deteriorating mind.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2024-03-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2NPhBHfzhEmXl8csQ2dKmoxfj5e.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/w39qKYjltCix18BwtoZ1e45usdb.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2NPhBHfzhEmXl8csQ2dKmoxfj5e.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//w39qKYjltCix18BwtoZ1e45usdb.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":508791,"title":"The Sun Is Also a Star","description":"Two young New Yorkers begin to fall in love over the course of a single day, as a series of potentially life-altering meetings loom over their heads - hers concerning her family’s deportation to Jamaica, and his concerning an education at Dartmouth.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2019-05-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3CFuFIwtSSQU4Fyd5NnmHnNZq9w.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dGl7ZnnL3WoiCKQAQdgkEF0EAbj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3CFuFIwtSSQU4Fyd5NnmHnNZq9w.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dGl7ZnnL3WoiCKQAQdgkEF0EAbj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":402900,"title":"Ocean''s Eight","description":"Debbie Ocean, a criminal mastermind, gathers a crew of female thieves to pull off the heist of the century at New York''s annual Met Gala.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Crime","Comedy","Action"],"release_date":"2018-06-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/scQf03Fm3jeyv4FH04qvi4fp4wh.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/MvYpKlpFukTivnlBhizGbkAe3v.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//scQf03Fm3jeyv4FH04qvi4fp4wh.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//MvYpKlpFukTivnlBhizGbkAe3v.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":59143,"title":"Mikey and Nicky","description":"Nick is desperate, holed up in a cheap hotel, suffering from an ulcer and convinced that a local mob boss wants him killed. Terrified, he calls Mikey, his friend since childhood and a fellow gangster. So begins a long night…","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"1976-12-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pzST8cae4CTsfj0nPP63YOdPLiO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fnHC1OJ1EbdOX97nmXVYrXFgiQT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pzST8cae4CTsfj0nPP63YOdPLiO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/