Bfs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12530,"title":"Avanti!","description":"A successful businessman travels to Italy to arrange for the return of his tycoon father''s body, only to learn that dear old dad died with his longtime mistress.","duration":"2:18:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"1972-12-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/61jP8dg2Ui0GFjJm3HqayUmjQUt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dxhQzsBIjWMRu7rqprX4I2WzyEo.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//61jP8dg2Ui0GFjJm3HqayUmjQUt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dxhQzsBIjWMRu7rqprX4I2WzyEo.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":738215,"title":"Barbie: Princess Adventure","description":"With new friends in a new kingdom, Barbie learns what it means to be herself when she trades places with a royal lookalike in this musical adventure.","duration":"1:12:00","genre":["Animation","Music","Family","Drama"],"release_date":"2020-09-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cmZVWuXM1hpP2GKFABCUkoscKu4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/c4hSVM1eQEs6OXCcxV1CcsphaOi.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cmZVWuXM1hpP2GKFABCUkoscKu4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//c4hSVM1eQEs6OXCcxV1CcsphaOi.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":520758,"title":"Chicken Run: Dawn of the Nugget","description":"A band of fearless chickens flock together to save poultry-kind from an unsettling new threat: a nearby farm that''s cooking up something suspicious.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Family","Animation","Adventure","Comedy"],"release_date":"2023-12-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/utChUdMhCEWKjHTc8DO5aK8dUVS.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eImY0cjbH0bll8EXSqxqEZIZcmY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//utChUdMhCEWKjHTc8DO5aK8dUVS.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eImY0cjbH0bll8EXSqxqEZIZcmY.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":458723,"title":"Us","description":"Husband and wife Gabe and Adelaide Wilson take their kids to their beach house expecting to unplug and unwind with friends. But as night descends, their serenity turns to tension and chaos when some shocking visitors arrive uninvited.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Horror","Mystery"],"release_date":"2019-03-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sC0b8iPUHfZdD8kseLiHw3N8gkp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ux2dU1jQ2ACIMShzB3yP93Udpzc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sC0b8iPUHfZdD8kseLiHw3N8gkp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ux2dU1jQ2ACIMShzB3yP93Udpzc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":394161,"title":"The Outsider","description":"A drama about the less known aspects of the trading activity inside one of the biggest banks in the world - Société Générale. The movie tracks the rise and fall of anonymous trader turned superstar turned escape goat - Jérôme Kerviel - just as the 2008 financial crisis was unfolding","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"2016-06-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wScPmDqaZtGrZ5cL2SmQyTvi5AH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/q12hpgdfCoZKHLWJeslJyqz9QJL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wScPmDqaZtGrZ5cL2SmQyTvi5AH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//q12hpgdfCoZKHLWJeslJyqz9QJL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":17578,"title":"The Adventures of Tintin","description":"Intrepid young reporter, Tintin, and his loyal dog, Snowy, are thrust into a world of high adventure when they discover a ship carrying an explosive secret. As Tintin is drawn into a centuries-old mystery, Ivan Ivanovitch Sakharine suspects him of stealing a priceless treasure. Tintin and Snowy, with the help of salty, cantankerous Captain Haddock and bumbling detectives, Thompson and Thomson, travel half the world, one step ahead of their enemies, as Tintin endeavors to find the Unicorn, a sunken ship that may hold a vast fortune, but also an ancient curse.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Adventure","Animation","Mystery"],"release_date":"2011-10-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6mqgl2szMLRYj4lhlXOjju5Tpeo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fQZ3sLR1Fi63NMsNRbjm9q5qODJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6mqgl2szMLRYj4lhlXOjju5Tpeo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fQZ3sLR1Fi63NMsNRbjm9q5qODJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8390,"title":"Definitely, Maybe","description":"When Will decides to tell his daughter the story of how he met her mother, he discovers that a second look at the past might also give him a second chance at the future.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2008-02-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/myH9ZNzJqJJVldyZJIeGDoqPFfO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7eS5RurcMyi8eVUDenaCjPGAzJ2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//myH9ZNzJqJJVldyZJIeGDoqPFfO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7eS5RurcMyi8eVUDenaCjPGAzJ2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":820722,"title":"The Good Boss","description":"Julio Blanco is the proprietor of Básculas Blanco, a Spanish company producing industrial scales in a provincial Spanish town, which awaits the imminent visit from a committee that will decide if they merit a local Business Excellence award: everything has to be perfect when the time comes. Working against the clock, Blanco pulls out all the stops to address and resolve issues with his employees, crossing every imaginable line in the process.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2021-10-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zrwx2GY2mObQl1PvORZttrefwAL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/x1OgeRKB8AoOYKt3DzxJelLLpLA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zrwx2GY2mObQl1PvORZttrefwAL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//x1OgeRKB8AoOYKt3DzxJelLLpLA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":359410,"title":"Road House","description":"Ex-UFC fighter Dalton takes a job as a bouncer at a Florida Keys roadhouse, only to discover that this paradise is not all it seems.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"2024-03-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/clFFCapyGpE7KD4Jsu5pUbFBZF4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fDEdtS4P0gJsxHDIt8dG8TR5dx1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//clFFCapyGpE7KD4Jsu5pUbFBZF4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fDEdtS4P0gJsxHDIt8dG8TR5dx1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11033,"title":"Dressed to Kill","description":"After witnessing a mysterious woman brutally slay a homemaker, prostitute Liz Blake finds herself trapped in a dangerous situation. While the police thinks she is the murderer, the real killer is intent on silencing her only witness.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Thriller","Mystery","Horror"],"release_date":"1980-07-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8UZfEjAlFq1iUiAkHMkJViq4ZO0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oy1m5dd44foNrxV8U9l6Walx82V.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8UZfEjAlFq1iUiAkHMkJViq4ZO0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oy1m5dd44foNrxV8U9l6Walx82V.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2289,"title":"Cold Mountain","description":"In this classic story of love and devotion set against the backdrop of the American Civil War, a wounded Confederate soldier named W.P. Inman deserts his unit and travels across the South, aiming to return to his young wife, Ada, who he left behind to tend their farm. As Inman makes his perilous journey home, Ada struggles to keep their home intact with the assistance of Ruby, a mysterious drifter sent to help her by a kindly neighbor.","duration":"2:34:00","genre":["War","History","Adventure","Romance"],"release_date":"2003-12-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xjJz025MAPrSeNj18LPjcyu4xFM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/j0AJeeR5CQPDFh0otyWyCWREHO8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xjJz025MAPrSeNj18LPjcyu4xFM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//j0AJeeR5CQPDFh0otyWyCWREHO8.jpg"}]'::jsonb
