","Drama","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2021-09-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4hAhZ66n5iasGtSYHTFg6oGdJk0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dqvkxOLmnHgDOqZlT7GgMWEQViR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4hAhZ66n5iasGtSYHTFg6oGdJk0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dqvkxOLmnHgDOqZlT7GgMWEQViR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":602,"title":"Independence Day","description":"Strange phenomena surface around the globe. The skies ignite. Terror races through the world''s major cities. As these extraordinary events unfold, it becomes increasingly clear that a force of incredible magnitude has arrived. Its mission: total annihilation over the Fourth of July weekend. The last hope to stop the destruction is an unlikely group of people united by fate and unimaginable circumstances.","duration":"2:25:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1996-07-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kFI1oF6KVnLEbUT7yLIbKXeyvu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/p0BPQGSPoSa8Ml0DAf2mB2kCU0R.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kFI1oF6KVnLEbUT7yLIbKXeyvu.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//p0BPQGSPoSa8Ml0DAf2mB2kCU0R.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":975773,"title":"Wicked Little Letters","description":"When the denizens of Littlehampton – including conservative Edith – begin receiving letters full of hilarious profanities, rowdy Irish migrant Rose is charged with the crime. Suspecting something amiss, the town''s women band together to investigate.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Mystery"],"release_date":"2024-02-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sp99ZzKz6Zv7nX95XDJmhNA4LVI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/scAU7YudKNVeZlOfgSEWntAUSJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sp99Zz