ves to be as hard as looking for a needle in the haystack. So Bitti seeks the help of the local printing press-owner, Chirag Dubey on her journey of love.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2017-08-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mthx2fkTwfphd93nsuwJ7Efx09K.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gviYC7rpJ4HWbbEFs0ZW5u965Tq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mthx2fkTwfphd93nsuwJ7Efx09K.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gviYC7rpJ4HWbbEFs0ZW5u965Tq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15797,"title":"Only the Strong","description":"Former Green Beret Louis Stevens returns to his hometown of Miami after completing military service in Brazil, only to learn that his old high school has become a haven for gangs and drug dealers. After Stevens uses his capoeira skills to kick several drug dealers off of the school property, Kerrigan, one of Stevens'' old teachers, sees the impact that Stevens has on the students. Kerrigan gives him the task of teaching Capoeira to a handful of the worst at-risk students at the school.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Action","Drama"],"release_date":"1993-08-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/k7wQcxa6KN5EmAdxj1tWgy7odBg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pPWV5rBhCgzlzhwkpdRG7a7UZqt.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//k7wQcxa6KN5EmAdxj1tWgy7odBg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pPWV5rBhCgzlzhwkpdRG7a7UZqt.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":251577,"title":"The Treatment","description":"Inspector Nick Cafmeyer seems to have it all - looks, brains and a successful career.  But a dark cloud hangs over his life: since the age of nine, he has been haunted by the unsolved disappearance of his younger brother, Bjorn. Plettinckx, a known sex offender, was questioned but quickly released. Plettinckx lives close by and takes fiendish pleasure in harassing Nick. Then, when a disturbing case comes to light involving a missing nine-year-old, Nick heads a massive search which turns into a relentless manhunt.","duration":"2:11:00","genre":["Crime","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2014-01-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9iemEC0cGDNyRepa3leXJNkUwkX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nzVhjAjEaugzs0CSmEO50W5mTcc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9iemEC0cGDNyRepa3leXJNkUwkX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nzVhjAjEaugzs0CSmEO50W5mTcc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":39465,"title":"Godzilla vs. Mothra","description":"Mothra''s dark counterpart, Battra, emerges to eliminate humanity on behalf of the Earth. Two tiny fairies called the Cosmos offer their help by calling Mothra to battle the creature. Unfortunately a meteorite has awoken a hibernating Godzilla as a three way battle for the Earth begins.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1992-12-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nS0HmXoWdVMcTM4OUzgGmgOj9J8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oqhO8Vg8DOTnuen1rmL4BdS2su2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nS0HmXoWdVMcTM4OUzgGmgOj9J8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oqhO8Vg8DOTnuen1rmL4BdS2su2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12101,"title":"Soylent Green","description":"In the year 2022, overcrowding, pollution,  and resource depletion have reduced society’s leaders to finding food for the teeming masses. The answer is Soylent Green.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Crime","Mystery"],"release_date":"1973-04-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/m8NHyJklrrg4DxvgSQRLdZQQZNZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5nbkShkOEXUoKVhaX0XG41wyBkq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p