keeper in a mysterious New York City high-rise, unaware that she is entering a community that has seen a number of disappearances over the years and may be under the grip of a Satanic cult.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Action","Comedy","Horror","Thriller"],"release_date":"2026-03-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7IwBgIwoHtkQ0lYGbBbqKintSWx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6oI4oQKTWMVUlr8Ivqydp28Ruu6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7IwBgIwoHtkQ0lYGbBbqKintSWx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6oI4oQKTWMVUlr8Ivqydp28Ruu6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":664031,"title":"Out of My League","description":"Marta may be an orphan, and she may be affected by a lethal illness, yet she is the most positive person one can meet. She wants a boy to fall for her. Not any boy - the most handsome of them all. One day, she may have found her match.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"2020-10-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cL8nGFsbFkvaHh33PesJPKgs2HJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/csu16eLYUDvyX64UdqHtwBwAd21.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cL8nGFsbFkvaHh33PesJPKgs2HJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//csu16eLYUDvyX64UdqHtwBwAd21.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":591538,"title":"The Tragedy of Macbeth","description":"Macbeth, the Thane of Glamis, receives a prophecy from a trio of witches that one day he will become King of Scotland. Consumed by ambition and spurred to action by his wife, Macbeth murders his king and takes the throne for himself.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2021-12-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lMjY6kMBOHhloz2Ul16fLJn8xuw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tDNJEhcLbX3jIk3BMCur9pCdaVD.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lMjY6kMBOHhloz2Ul16fLJn8xuw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tDNJEhcLbX3jIk3BMCur9pCdaVD.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":44730,"title":"One Piece: Giant Mecha Soldier of Karakuri Castle","description":"The Straw Hats visits an island, known as Mecha Island, where a fisherman sings an old folk song about a Golden Crown. Searching for that mysterious treasure, they find a hidden entrance into the island. The island''s leader, Ratchet, impressed with the find and in search of the Golden Crown himself, invites the crew to join him in his search and the crew along with Ratchet and his henchmen enter the cave. As it turns out, the islands true form, is that of a giant turtle. Ratchet, who had known this all along, uses his mechanical castle to take control of the turtle, in order to use it, to take over the world. Now the Straw Hats have to stop not only Ratchet, but also the helpless turtle, from crashing into a nearby island.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Animation","Adventure","Action","Comedy","Science Fiction","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2006-03-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4NyJEGke7B5bZcRaImkTFc5FcZE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4Pu26TQNiyl8kjNe1sI3NMG2OQG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4NyJEGke7B5bZcRaImkTFc5FcZE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4Pu26TQNiyl8kjNe1sI3NMG2OQG.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":21588,"title":"Cemetery Man","description":"Francesco Dellamorte  is the groundskeeper at a cemetery where the dead just won’t stay dead—and it’s up to him to deal with those who come back to life with a hunger for human flesh. But Dellamorte’s job soon becomes much more complicated when he falls for an enigmatic young woman whose husband has recently died.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Comedy","Horror"],"release_date":"1994-03-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fHPTQ18tuwtJ3JvrCeZMZs4X58Q.jpg",