na Lisa Smile","description":"Katherine Watson is a recent UCLA graduate hired to teach art history at the prestigious all-female Wellesley College, in 1953. Determined to confront the outdated mores of society and the institution that embraces them, Katherine inspires her traditional students, including Betty and Joan, to challenge the lives they are expected to lead.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Drama","History","Romance"],"release_date":"2003-12-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/trfjdJI51Krnig9UmxJQkz15ICo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bg0VKsXnLjIZ0cHmZHZLs9gzrvm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//trfjdJI51Krnig9UmxJQkz15ICo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bg0VKsXnLjIZ0cHmZHZLs9gzrvm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4836,"title":"Layer Cake","description":"When a seemingly straight-forward drug deal goes awry, XXXX has to break his die-hard rules and turn up the heat, not only to outwit the old regime and come out on top, but to save his own skin...","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2004-09-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fcAVJkXnvqxOrk7skr06CbWfgpQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rDOxXteqxALBaSa3V3zTjGJuyWB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fcAVJkXnvqxOrk7skr06CbWfgpQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rDOxXteqxALBaSa3V3zTjGJuyWB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":3033,"title":"Gods and Monsters","description":"It''s 1957, and James Whale''s heyday as the director of \"Frankenstein,\" \"Bride of Frankenstein\" and \"The Invisible Man\" is long behind him. Retired and a semi-recluse, he lives his days accompanied only by images from his past. When his dour housekeeper, Hannah, hires a handsome young gardener, the flamboyant director and simple yard man develop an unlikely friendship, which will change them forever.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1998-09-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/v1HOjtXoGwQz26fT4elHeNT0JnW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/awvJH3NtXoStsjAtXKr99hfuVaG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//v1HOjtXoGwQz26fT4elHeNT0JnW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//awvJH3NtXoStsjAtXKr99hfuVaG.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2023,"title":"Hidalgo","description":"Set in 1890, this is the story of a Pony Express courier who travels to Arabia to compete with his horse, Hidalgo, in a dangerous race for a massive contest prize, in an adventure that sends the pair around the world...","duration":"2:16:00","genre":["Western","Adventure"],"release_date":"2004-02-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sAiTihJ8bjEqg8nYUIlTQUnVXuj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iGzENlBPYJEFWZnye4t3nqWSSp1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sAiTihJ8bjEqg8nYUIlTQUnVXuj.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iGzENlBPYJEFWZnye4t3nqWSSp1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":468224,"title":"Tolkien","description":"England, early 20th century. The future writer and philologist John Ronald Reuel Tolkien (1892-1973) and three of his schoolmates create a strong bond between them as they share the same passion for literature and art, a true fellowship that strengthens as they grow up, but the outbreak of World War I threatens to shatter it.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["War","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2019-05-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4HXiEsWUEMzJNFwjJv6oUaocqJU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/A7eYO3t7oZQdfJj5KlJBI7GhT9H.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4HXiEsWUEMzJNFwjJv6oUaocqJU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//A7eYO3t7oZQdfJj5KlJBI7GhT9H.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":73686,