er racial heritage is not what he thought it was.","duration":"1:27:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1960-10-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vBywNMAiQTNn3PxlOWslgYcwcpN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zR1gHOGVruoROCdHS7Tc5TSZqED.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vBywNMAiQTNn3PxlOWslgYcwcpN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zR1gHOGVruoROCdHS7Tc5TSZqED.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13931,"title":"Mike''s New Car","description":"Mike discovers that being the top-ranking laugh collector at Monsters, Inc. has its benefits – in particular, earning enough money to buy a six-wheel-drive car that''s loaded with gadgets. That new-car smell doesn''t last long enough, however, as Sulley jump-starts an ill-fated road test that teaches Mike the true meaning of buyer''s remorse.","duration":"0:03:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"2002-05-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1gwPQcnfkMCnAlWauI934i7E3Pr.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mOnNx05XOPFeQhOqpbPI0lwEf4N.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1gwPQcnfkMCnAlWauI934i7E3Pr.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mOnNx05XOPFeQhOqpbPI0lwEf4N.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10423,"title":"Dragon: The Bruce Lee Story","description":"This film is a glimpse into the life, love and the unconquerable spirit of the legendary Bruce Lee. From a childhood of rigorous martial arts training, Lee realizes his dream of opening his own kung-fu school in America. Before long, he is discovered by a Hollywood producer and begins a meteoric rise to fame and an all too short reign as one the most charismatic action heroes in cinema history.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Drama","History","Action"],"release_date":"1993-05-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xbDyMo2ZRHc6FIZP4U9VrFt8NLT.jpg","pos