ther: She dates the broke boxer to provoke her parents and get them to fund a long-desired chef training in New York. He tries to rip off the rich daughter to finance his first professional boxing match. Their plans soon develop into emotional chaos that challenges everything the two believe to know about money, career and love.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"2020-02-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2EOy2YSJbzKvlzKpEEKULVYZGlN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zaqStzYifawjqXnkxVGUvdi4KJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2EOy2YSJbzKvlzKpEEKULVYZGlN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zaqStzYifawjqXnkxVGUvdi4KJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":407890,"title":"Lean on Pete","description":"Charley Thompson, a teenager living with his single father, gets a summer job working for horse trainer Del Montgomery. Bonding with an aging racehorse named Lean on Pete, Charley is horrified to learn he is bound for slaughter, and so he steals the horse, and the duo embark on an odyssey across the new American frontier.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Drama","Adventure","Western"],"release_date":"2018-04-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a26Gj4TqFKEdku1XLIWLFpzUgv4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7SuPHSo9Uw8GACkP2oPst512Qhl.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//a26Gj4TqFKEdku1XLIWLFpzUgv4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7SuPHSo9Uw8GACkP2oPst512Qhl.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":402431,"title":"Wicked","description":"In the land of Oz, ostracized and misunderstood green-skinned Elphaba is forced to share a room with the popular aristocrat Glinda at Shiz University, and the two''s unlikely friendship is tested as they begin to fulfill their respective destinies as Glinda the Good and the Wicked Witch of the West.","duration":"2:42:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2024-10-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/w22GVYotTIVC1dUd58mRhwPqiS.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xDGbZ0JJ3mYaGKy4Nzd9Kph6M9L.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//w22GVYotTIVC1dUd58mRhwPqiS.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xDGbZ0JJ3mYaGKy4Nzd9Kph6M9L.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":296524,"title":"Deepwater Horizon","description":"A story set on the offshore drilling rig Deepwater Horizon, which exploded during April 2010 and created the worst oil spill in U.S. history.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Drama","Action"],"release_date":"2016-09-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fRT76SSQzAuZljogpsWyKphUxYX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jgBIYCZACe3iaS9TL2XzVGkO5p5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fRT76SSQzAuZljogpsWyKphUxYX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jgBIYCZACe3iaS9TL2XzVGkO5p5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":62837,"title":"Dolphin Tale","description":"A sea of animal rescuers — and a lonely boy in need of a friend – nurse an injured dolphin back to health after it loses its tail in a trap.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Drama","Family"],"release_date":"2011-09-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/y0GUZoM63hT4HTKyUbQbsaP8yIT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/af2SRFllNW26WFG84AfTv3xLT5t.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//y0GUZoM63hT4HTKyUbQbsaP8yIT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//af2SRFllNW26WFG84AfTv3xLT5t.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":57737,"title":"Barbie: A Fairy Secret","description":"Barbie realises that fairies secretly surround everybody. She, along with the help of her friends, Taylor and Carrie, sets out to rescue Ken. He is taken to the secret fairy city, Gloss Angeles.","duration":"1:12:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2011-03-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4yN3l7ZQgGDZOewvoiWKcLt7EVb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wn2aoYKOonwMNKkzfgO5y4ji8pB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4yN3l7ZQgGDZOewvoiWKcLt7EVb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wn2aoYKOonwMNKkzfgO5y4ji8pB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":54559,"title":"Orientation Day","description":"The Minions embark on their first day of work, eager to prove themselves in their new roles. After watching a hilariously outdated ''Initiation Video,'' three rookie Minions take on bomb-carrying duty. Predictably, their enthusiasm quickly spirals into chaos as they bungle the simplest of tasks. Packed with slapstick comedy and the Minions'' trademark antics, this short highlights their lovable ineptitude in the workplace.","duration":"0:04:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Comedy"],"release_date":"2010-12-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rWXhj6vAVstbZdNRrgF8tAXrx1y.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/b5qrtwVT3p3iQvqCWHbxmk4RvBS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rWXhj6vAVstbZdNRrgF8tAXrx1y.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//b5qrtwVT3p3iQvqCWHbxmk4RvBS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":48246,"title":"Alvin and the Chipmunks Meet the Wolfman","description":"As Alvin struggles with nightmares involving werewolves, the school play of Jekyll & Hyde is in jeopardy when the lead, Alvin, is suspended. In an attempt to boost his confidence, the principal suggests Theodore, who''s suddenly going through some canine changes.","duration":"1:17:00","genre":["Family","Fantasy","Comedy","Animation","Music"],"release_date":"2000-08-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rrD9B4gbXGC29RBDLGj1mxXcNni.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xvAGKjbAl2F71hterQ6BpPzQM