die, who’s moved to New York and is now expecting a baby, Agnes still lives in the New England house they once shared as graduate students, now working as a professor at her alma mater. A ‘bad thing’ happened to Agnes a few years ago and, since then, despite her best efforts, life hasn’t gotten back on track.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2025-06-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nVHEjkA8vuEGJLfNUOmVW5md6yn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/n8wZEQen5hDNRGzm4fY4sxWe5xe.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nVHEjkA8vuEGJLfNUOmVW5md6yn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//n8wZEQen5hDNRGzm4fY4sxWe5xe.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":758323,"title":"The Pope''s Exorcist","description":"Father Gabriele Amorth, Chief Exorcist of the Vatican, investigates a young boy''s terrifying possession and ends up uncovering a centuries-old conspiracy the Vatican has desperately tried to keep hidden.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Horror","Thriller"],"release_date":"2023-04-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3oqmk6mNWPatBKcjOOJLp5WW9zN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jFC4LS5qTAT3PinzdEzINfu1CV9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3oqmk6mNWPatBKcjOOJLp5WW9zN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jFC4LS5qTAT3PinzdEzINfu1CV9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":252822,"title":"In Order of Disappearance","description":"Upstanding community leader Nils has just won an award for \"Citizen of the Year\" when he learns the news that his son has died of a heroin overdose. Suspecting foul play, Nils begins to investigate, and soon finds himself at the center of an escalating underworld gang war between Serbian drug dealers and a sociopathic criminal mastermind known only as “The Count.”","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Thriller","Action","Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"2014-0