 as their hold on the middle class slips away. Bruno concocts a grimly audacious plan to identify and kill his fellow job applicants so that he is the only qualified person left.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2005-03-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8aMGsqLtJ9wfGkFRvGJSm4kUDGU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/v6upsNV9GWkSn0ODM8hFpvbQNJn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8aMGsqLtJ9wfGkFRvGJSm4kUDGU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//v6upsNV9GWkSn0ODM8hFpvbQNJn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":22947,"title":"Up in the Air","description":"Corporate downsizing expert Ryan Bingham spends his life in planes, airports, and hotels, but just as he’s about to reach a milestone of ten million frequent flyer miles, he meets a woman who causes him to rethink his transient life.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2009-12-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yTweHAwEokqAgZg1Io8e0zCJQvt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/useGH8nfwlaHK44IWEZdUYJOE2N.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yTweHAwEokqAgZg1Io8e0zCJQvt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//useGH8nfwlaHK44IWEZdUYJOE2N.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":18727,"title":"Heaven Can Wait","description":"Spoiled playboy Henry van Cleve dies and arrives at the entrance to Hell, a final destination he is sure he deserves after living a life of profligacy. The devil, however, isn''t so sure Henry meets Hell''s standards. Convinced he is where he belongs, Henry recounts his life''s deeds, both good and bad, including an act of indiscretion during his 25-year marriage to his wife, Martha, with the hope that \"His Excellency\" will arrive at the proper judgment.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance","Fantasy","Drama"],"release_date":"1943-08-05","backdr