 collide while both learn to appreciate new friends and experiences.","duration":"1:24:00","genre":["Animation","Music","Family"],"release_date":"2015-08-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4nOShZSE5V5MWZgZs4NjDcDHiSo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aCKWWQpEijagMEfIOz0vW0aTDmv.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4nOShZSE5V5MWZgZs4NjDcDHiSo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aCKWWQpEijagMEfIOz0vW0aTDmv.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":38291,"title":"Educating Rita","description":"Rita, a witty 26-year-old hairdresser, wants to ''discover'' herself, so she joins the Open University where she meets the disillusioned professor of literature, Dr. Frank Bryant. His marriage has failed, his new girlfriend is having an affair with his best friend and he can''t get through the day without downing a bottle or two of whisky. What Frank needs is a challenge... and along comes Rita.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"1983-06-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4WaqsTQUhGzRRuuY7FXPVM1lLda.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xwxgiRzw2zxzWNIYp98faJ0rUy5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4WaqsTQUhGzRRuuY7FXPVM1lLda.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xwxgiRzw2zxzWNIYp98faJ0rUy5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14746,"title":"Streets of Fire","description":"Raven Shaddock and his gang of merciless biker friends kidnap rock singer Ellen Aim. Ellen''s former lover, soldier-for-hire Tom Cody, happens to be passing through town on a visit. In an attempt to save his star act, Ellen''s manager hires Tom to rescue her. Along with a former soldier, they battle through dangerous cityscapes, determined to get Ellen back.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Action"],"release_date":"1984-06-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7rE6SyTySkcpnHSuBMkOOTiv