face/ceRN51oeadmccAvqvDxpnnNRcLU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7nFfW8RM50PANBIdfI9Ut3FdoSB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ceRN51oeadmccAvqvDxpnnNRcLU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":102001,"title":"Like Someone in Love","description":"An old man and a young woman meet in Tokyo. She knows nothing about him, he thinks he knows her. He welcomes her into his home, she offers him her body. But the web that is woven between them in the space of twenty four hours bears no relation to the circumstances of their encounter.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2012-09-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9CIG8zW5iyxjSjNDF7hK74rsky8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/j1gotCDkKFmMdcSagxBUGalVbtt.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9CIG8zW5iyxjSjNDF7hK74rsky8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//j1gotCDkKFmMdcSagxBUGalVbtt.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":84329,"title":"Robot & Frank","description":"Curmudgeonly old Frank lives by himself. His routine involves daily visits to his local library, where he has a twinkle in his eye for the librarian. His grown children are concerned about their father’s well-being and buy him a caretaker robot. Initially resistant to the idea, Frank soon appreciates the benefits of robotic support – like nutritious meals and a clean house – and eventually begins to treat his robot like a true companion. With his robot’s assistance, Frank’s passion for his old, unlawful profession is reignited, for better or worse.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"2012-08-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mV2UZZHYiWPKH0AwtMSil1T7DUH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/602vUwe1GPmaRvcrT3OQWqH1Nm1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mV2UZZHYiWPKH0AwtMSil1T7DUH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//602vUwe1GPmaRvcrT3OQWqH1Nm1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":79108,"title":"Starbuck","description":"David Wozniak is a perpetual adolescent who discovers that, as a sperm donor, he has fathered 533 children. He is advised that more than 100 of his offspring are trying to force the fertility clinic to reveal the true identity of \"Starbuck,\" the pseudonym he used when donating his sperm. To make matters worse, his girlfriend Valérie is pregnant with his child, but doesn''t feel that he is mature enough to be a father.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2011-07-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oWaSlhlfx9woNAYP9XeqarG6JYH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/t7ZyIR941krELzP7POiFUu0yhFq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oWaSlhlfx9woNAYP9XeqarG6JYH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//t7ZyIR941krELzP7POiFUu0yhFq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13524,"title":"Battle of the Bulge","description":"In the winter of 1944, the Allied Armies stand ready to invade Germany at the coming of a New Year. To prevent it, Hitler orders an all-out offensive to re-take French territory and capture the major port city of Antwerp.","duration":"2:49:00","genre":["Drama","History","War"],"release_date":"1965-12-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oy6iVutVLwR4nj4iykeie0vsbXe.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vNEw6H6St25991C0a8r6AQKTdqi.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oy6iVutVLwR4nj4iykeie0vsbXe.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vNEw6H6St25991C0a8r6AQKTdqi.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13285,"title":"Barbie Fairytopia: Mermaidia","description":"In this animated follow-up to Fairytopia, Elina enlists the help of a mermaid, Nori, to save her friend Nalu, a merman prince who has been captured by the wicked Laverna.","duration":"1:16:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2006-03-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/c2wkRgqYlWdT3yejyO8kdwgepSd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uBCvRThFwjvwNQeS3Vy7xMPc0Rh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//c2wkRgqYlWdT3yejyO8kdwgepSd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uBCvRThFwjvwNQeS3Vy7xMPc0Rh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1294698,"title":"Case 137","description":"When Internal Affairs officer Stéphanie investigates a young man severely injured during a chaotic Paris demonstration and finds no police misconduct, the routine case hits close to home upon her discovering the victim is from her native town.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2025-11-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kjKxmpuPIvXjDP4reWCkMaeK2Es.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4QL4LcsYX8mdNktst0CnyHQDRLg.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kjKxmpuPIvXjDP4reWCkMaeK2Es.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4QL4LcsYX8mdNktst0CnyHQDRLg.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1242011,"title":"Together","description":"Years into their relationship, Tim and Millie find themselves at a crossroads as they move to the country, abandoning all that is familiar in their lives except each other. With tensions already flaring, a nightmarish encounter with a mysterious, unnatural force threatens to corrupt their lives, their love, and their flesh.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Horror","Romance"],"release_date":"2025-07-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/39Niij05MXfibXBsHiUU0Ml0POX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/80slKYVM5teFH3kz6ouWrZXveqj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//39Niij05MXfibXBsHiUU0Ml0POX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//80slKYVM5teFH3kz6ouWrZXveqj.jpg"},{"tmd