 to the test when an unexpected turn sends their wedding week off the rails.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2026-04-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1oKLEA9JOhvaBwLpqjROisvWMy7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rnIOUhzwJDfgQakx8EjoNyItKgs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1oKLEA9JOhvaBwLpqjROisvWMy7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rnIOUhzwJDfgQakx8EjoNyItKgs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1318447,"title":"Apex","description":"A grieving woman pushing her limits on a solo adventure in the Australian wild is ensnared in a twisted game with a cunning killer who thinks she''s prey.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2026-04-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9nzfyiYbmTUXWC4B2kwjl4NAlqO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eTp7gSPkSF3Aw79mNx1NkBP1PZT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9nzfyiYbmTUXWC4B2kwjl4NAlqO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eTp7gSPkSF3Aw79mNx1NkBP1PZT.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1106739,"title":"Juror #2","description":"While serving as a juror in a high profile murder trial, family man Justin Kemp finds himself struggling with a serious moral dilemma…one he could use to sway the jury verdict and potentially convict—or free—the accused killer.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2024-10-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wHXyGLjYPm4bHNKFQPCfYWiTeSH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ugQkpGajKFQ8eyOEhGheR0HfWQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wHXyGLjYPm4bHNKFQPCfYWiTeSH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ugQkpGajKFQ8eyOEhGheR0HfWQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":725201,"title":"The Gray Man","description":"When a shadowy CIA agent uncovers damning agency secrets, he''s hunted across the globe by a sociopathic rogue operative who''s put a bounty on his head.","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2022-07-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2u1YBNBlSwvBReyvI7i5z5ykQXP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8cXbitsS6dWQ5gfMTZdorpAAzEH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2u1YBNBlSwvBReyvI7i5z5ykQXP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8cXbitsS6dWQ5gfMTZdorpAAzEH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":531876,"title":"The Outpost","description":"A small unit of U.S. soldiers, alone at the remote Combat Outpost Keating, located deep in the valley of three mountains in Afghanistan, battles to defend against an overwhelming force of Taliban fighters in a coordinated attack. The Battle of Kamdesh, as it was known, was the bloodiest American engagement of the Afghan War in 2009 and Bravo Troop 3-61 CAV became one of the most decorated units of the 19-year conflict.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["War","Drama","History","Action"],"release_date":"2020-06-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/n1RohH2VoK1CdVI2fXvcP19dSlm.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/saN1UywIQMQNXYx2ag9j2tPwaVl.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//n1RohH2VoK1CdVI2fXvcP19dSlm.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//saN1UywIQMQNXYx2ag9j2tPwaVl.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":511809,"title":"West Side Story","description":"Two youngsters from rival New York City gangs fall in love, but tensions between their respective friends build toward tragedy.","duration":"2:36:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Crime"],"release_date":"2021-12-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/exnFsbb9c3fDutTsgtJSWcDmZm0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yfz3IUoYYSY32tkb97HlUBGFsnh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//exnFsbb9c3fDutTsgtJSWcDmZm0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yfz3IUoYYSY32tkb97HlUBGFsnh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":453350,"title":"Bloody Milk","description":"Pierre, in his thirties, is a breeder of dairy cattle. His life revolves around his farm, his veterinarian sister and his parents whose livestock he took over. As the first cases of a zoonotic outbreak are reported in France, Pierre discovers that one of his animals is infected. He cannot cope with the perspective of losing the whole herd. They are everything he has and he will do whatever it takes to save them.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2017-08-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/t8CJeAEcg4Ke5DR4ypYTokKUpXM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lf6qe9pRD26awaV4v4ObYgz2GAx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//t8CJeAEcg4Ke5DR4ypYTokKUpXM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lf6qe9pRD26awaV4v4ObYgz2GAx.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":319995,"title":"The Club","description":"In a secluded house in a small seaside town live four unrelated men and the woman who tends to the house and their needs. All former priests, they have been sent to this quiet exile to purge the sins of their pasts, the separation from their communities the worst form of punishment by the Church. They keep to a strict daily schedule devoid of all temptation and spontaneity, each moment a deliberate effort to atone for their wrongdoings.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Drama","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2015-05-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xfLMCz9I9HMFMUwKwPYKipv33in.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cSLJxkNyKLnfNtyR16bzlHKBQW7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xfLMCz9I9HMFMUwKwPYKipv33in.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cSLJxkNyKLnfNtyR16bzlHKBQW7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":131634,"title":"The Hunger Games: Mockingjay - Part 2","description":"As the war between the Capitol and the districts reaches its peak, Katniss Everdeen embarks on a perilous mission to liberate Panem and confront President Snow. Joined by a team of trusted allies, she navigates deadly traps, shifting loyalties, and the heavy cost of rebellion, determined to bring freedom to her people and end the Hunger Games once and for all.","duration":"2:17:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2015-11-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qVgLMRVNB5bHU0inmRa0ueShacN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lImKHDfExAulp16grYm8zD5eONE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qVgLMRVNB5bHU0inmRa0ueShacN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lImKHDfExAulp16grYm8zD5eONE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":83542,"title":"Cloud Atlas","description":"A set of six nested stories spanning time between the 19th century and a distant post-apocalyptic future. Cloud Atlas explores how the actions and consequences of individual lives impact one another throughout the past, the present and the future. Action, mystery and romance weave through the story as one soul is shaped from a killer into a hero and a single act of kindness ripples across centuries to inspire a revolution in the distant future.  Based on the award winning novel by David Mitchell. Directed by Tom Tykwer and the Wachowskis.","duration":"2:52:00","genre":["Drama","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2012-10-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sFDntG0Z0Wjrsz26TVptfs5OSLT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8naVv2Xu3rWI5JKHz0vCujx6GaJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sFDntG0Z0Wjrsz26TVptfs5OSLT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8naVv2Xu3rWI5JKHz0vCujx6GaJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15163,"title":"Amazing Grace","description":"The true story of William Wilberforce and his courageous quest to end the British slave trade. Along the way, Wilberforce meets intense opposition, but his minister urges him to see the cause through.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2007-02-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9vFMRabZKwF4BTlrIqn7ltaUUMJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zr48JEuwxcYM03NcdJU6qWMHPtq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9vFMRabZKwF4BTlrIqn7ltaUUMJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zr48JEuwxcYM03NcdJU6qWMHPtq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":7551,"title":"Déjà Vu","description":"Called in to recover evidence in the aftermath of a horrific explosion on a New Orleans ferry, Federal agent Doug Carlin gets pulled away from the scene and taken to a top-secret government lab that uses a time-shifting surveillance device to help prevent crime.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2006-11-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mhi2fRCbEXtN43FNiq45WQg0DFe.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eTX6hklzFOiEVqVukNCEedZKhix.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mhi2fRCbEXtN43FNiq45WQg0DFe.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eTX6hklzFOiEVqVukNCEedZKhix.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":441829,"title":"Team Thor: Part 2","description":"A continuation of the documentary spoof of what Thor and his roommate Darryl were up to during the events of \"Captain America: Civil War\". While Cap and Iron Man duke it out, Thor tries to pay Darryl his rent in Asgardian coins.","duration":"0:05:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Comedy","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2017-02-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cz8m8AS8MOD1x4RAjYgYMHf13xB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2jmP71A5Un0jDNqBesDPQSN8hjJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cz8m8AS8MOD1x4RAjYgYMHf13xB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2jmP71A5Un0jDNqBesDPQSN8hjJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":426865,"title":"UFO","description":"A college student, who sees a UFO, uses his exceptional math skills to investigate the sighting with his friends while the FBI follows closely behind.","duration":"1:28:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Thriller","Mystery"],"release_date":"2018-09-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/s5Dz4TsaW5jyLw5GS73jgqgwHsZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jdy1GTdaAXqhsCVOpIXokifYdCh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//s5Dz4TsaW5jyLw5GS73jgqgwHsZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jdy1GTdaAXqhsCVOpIXokifYdCh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":380111,"title":"Flight Crew","description":"A story about bravery, self-sacrifice and human dignity put on trial by the merciless power of nature. A young pilot is fired from military air force after disobeying an absurd order. He gets a job as a co-pilot with a civil airline. Being brutally honest and direct, he is not on best terms with his new colleagues. During a flight to Asia his crew receives a distress message from a volcanic island and makes a decision to attempt a rescue mission. Will it be a success? Will they survive the disaster? They have a single chance to find that out: by being a team and sticking up for one another.","duration":"2:18:00","genre":["Action"],"release_date":"2016-04-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/MrnSQzIwftHPAXJa9DrkebfnXu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nL1WhzLiD2nZ7ixQcp5K0z4eEB7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//MrnSQzIwftHPAXJa9DrkebfnXu.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nL1WhzLiD2nZ7ixQcp5K0z4eEB7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":16184,"title":"The Happiness of the Katakuris","description":"The Katakuri family has just opened their guest house in the mountains. Unfortunately their first guest commits suicide and in order to avoid trouble they decide to bury him in the backyard. Things get way more complicated when their second guest, a famous sumo wrestler, dies while having sex with his underage girlfriend and the grave behind the house starts to fill up more and more.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Horror"],"release_date":"2002-02-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8kFu3NmbwMmi8iRXWy09awhMFLC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8iIei17w5DVEz4P9OjxIM10f7Jh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8kFu3NmbwMmi8iRXWy09awhMFLC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8iIei17w5DVEz4P9OjxIM10f7Jh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14711,"title":"Afro Samurai: Resurrection","description":"Afro Samurai avenged his father and found a life of peace. But the legendary master is forced back into the game by a beautiful and deadly woman from his past. The sparks of violence dropped along Afro’s bloody path now burn out of control – and nowhere are the flames of hatred more intense than in the eyes of Sio.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Science Fiction","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2009-04-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4rNjTccVltQHKKJd6INzqHtfV5x.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6snrLj3Ydmbu5L9giAYtiSNwE0U.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4rNjTccVltQHKKJd6INzqHtfV5x.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6snrLj3Ydmbu5L9giAYtiSNwE0U.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13098,"title":"Paid in Full","description":"Ace is an impressionable young man working for a dry cleaning business. His friend, drug dealer Mitch, goes to prison. In an unrelated incident, he finds some cocaine in a pants pocket. Soon, Ace finds himself dealing cocaine for Lulu. Via lucky breaks and solid interpersonal skills, Ace moves to the top of the Harlem drug world. Of course, unfaithful employees and/or rivals conspire to bring about Ace''s fall.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2002-10-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/56AyVhgvQmrOBAF9ZeyOdls4PPa.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oiG5BObjENJjEacFdWw1KfK3TFx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//56AyVhgvQmrOBAF9ZeyOdls4PPa.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oiG5BObjENJjEacFdWw1KfK3TFx.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":7305,"title":"Alive","description":"The amazing true story of a Uruguayan rugby team''s plane that crashed in the middle of the Andes mountains, and their immense will to survive and pull through alive, forced to do anything and everything they could to stay alive on meager rations and through the freezing cold.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Adventure","Drama","History"],"release_date":"1993-01-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qHXdyDBgetOyetVkWGzHYGp7L72.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uQACcCZqd7WCTRin9xRIW5gr1bd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qHXdyDBgetOyetVkWGzHYGp7L72.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uQACcCZqd7WCTRin9xRIW5gr1bd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":390043,"title":"The Hitman''s Bodyguard","description":"The world’s top bodyguard gets a new client, a hitman who must testify at the International Court of Justice. They must put their differences aside and work together to make it to the trial on time.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Action","Comedy","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2017-08-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7KsqfXDECZMryX1Rv4RKsT7SIjQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5CGjlz2vyBhW5xHW4eNOZIdgzYq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7KsqfXDECZMryX1Rv4RKsT7SIjQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5CGjlz2vyBhW5xHW4eNOZIdgzYq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":519465,"title":"Queen of Hearts","description":"Anne, a brilliant and dedicated advocacy lawyer specialising in society’s most vulnerable, children and young adults, lives what appears to be the picture-perfect life with her doctor-husband, Peter, and their twin daughters. When her estranged teenage stepson, Gustav, moves in with them, Anne’s escalating desire leads her down a dangerous rabbit hole which, once exposed, unleashes a sequence of events destined to destroy her world.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2019-03-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e5lxpaVyazQX723A3svR17WxckP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dfFVDIgovEfQZn53VRKLV2JQnRJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e5lxpaVyazQX723A3svR17WxckP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dfFVDIgovEfQZn53VRKLV2JQnRJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":397538,"title":"Borg vs McEnroe","description":"The Swedish Björn Borg and the American John McEnroe, the best tennis players in the world, maintain a legendary duel during the 1980 Wimbledon tournament.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2017-09-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/led6mPvEAMsF5fpJUqiUy07ZPty.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vIQqjcrSnyCqLpqwScnvFY1bpkL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//led6mPvEAMsF5fpJUqiUy07ZPty.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vIQqjcrSnyCqLpqwScnvFY1bpkL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":22660,"title":"Old Yeller","description":"Young Travis Coates is left to take care of the family ranch with his mother and younger brother while his father goes off on a cattle drive in the 1860s. When a yellow mongrel comes for an uninvited stay with the family, Travis reluctantly adopts the dog.","duration":"1:24:00","genre":["Adventure","Drama","Family","Western"],"release_date":"1957-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bFj82z1rOIEmsin3jbdGzkeBDpv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/Xe7AB0ffhGPSdBZ4qJ9AKJfllL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bFj82z1rOIEmsin3jbdGzkeBDpv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//Xe7AB0ffhGPSdBZ4qJ9AKJfllL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13416,"title":"Friday Night Lights","description":"A small, turbulent town in Texas obsesses over their high school football team to an unhealthy degree. When the star tailback, Boobie Miles, is seriously injured during the first game of the season, all hope is lost, and the town''s dormant social problems begin to flare up. It is left to the inspiring abilities of new coach Gary Gaines to instill in the other team members -- and, by proxy, the town itself -- a sense of self-respect and honor.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2004-10-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dxXhdYuQyuMPX0lCEo6LhCv69Xq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8HIqpOgqShRc3TAleabnYispDl1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dxXhdYuQyuMPX0lCEo6LhCv69Xq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8HIqpOgqShRc3TAleabnYispDl1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10560,"title":"Center Stage","description":"A group of 12 teenagers from various backgrounds enroll at the American Ballet Academy in New York to make it as ballet dancers and each one deals with the problems and stress of training and getting ahead in the world of dance.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Drama","Music"],"release_date":"2000-05-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/f3cTz9cEPgrWWECMAGIYO9gRSLs.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/95Et0t08Nv6S8FD593HpXyvcRt8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//f3cTz9cEPgrWWECMAGIYO9gRSLs.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//95Et0t08Nv6S8FD593HpXyvcRt8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9476,"title":"A Knight''s Tale","description":"William Thatcher, a knight''s peasant apprentice, gets a chance at glory when the knight dies suddenly mid-tournament. Posing as a knight himself, William won''t stop until he''s crowned tournament champion—assuming matters of the heart don''t get in the way.","duration":"2:13:00","genre":["Adventure","Drama","Romance","Action"],"release_date":"2001-05-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gkT737kgnmI6jZyXbUBJRwVbGkW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/srb1XnrlDZHcdpjBKqUu4qAzxKU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gkT737kgnmI6jZyXbUBJRwVbGkW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//srb1XnrlDZHcdpjBKqUu4qAzxKU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":7291,"title":"36th Precinct","description":"In Paris, two cops are competing for the vacant job of chief of police, in the middle of the search for a gang of violent thieves. The movie is directed by Olivier Marchal, a former police officer who spent 12 years with the French police before creating this story, taken in part from real events of the 1980s.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2004-11-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tRZV0cmQUfKx0SL0L1z0Es7ZtK8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/exD0FsvhkZqetOVOYrfGqwnc7nX.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tRZV0cmQUfKx0SL0L1z0Es7ZtK8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//exD0FsvhkZqetOVOYrfGqwnc7nX.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":599281,"title":"Fear of Rain","description":"A teenage girl living with schizophrenia begins to suspect her neighbor has kidnapped a child. Her parents try desperately to help her live a normal life, without exposing their own tragic secrets, and the only person who believes her is Caleb – a boy she isn’t even sure exists.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Thriller","Horror","Drama"],"release_date":"2021-02-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dJR6dZJHXcXOBbNkVzsjuquWFU4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5hmaACPJfI2M0v38DeltW3dSggT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dJR6dZJHXcXOBbNkVzsjuquWFU4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5hmaACPJfI2M0v38DeltW3dSggT.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":447404,"title":"Pokémon Detective Pikachu","description":"In a world where people collect pocket-size monsters (Pokémon) to do battle, a boy comes across an intelligent monster who seeks to be a detective.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2019-05-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yXybBEC45p84D0Ky7GmQQYrclVr.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uhWvnFgg3BNlcUz0Re1HfQqIcCD.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yXybBEC45p84D0Ky7GmQQYrclVr.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uhWvnFgg3BNlcUz0Re1HfQqIcCD.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":393457,"title":"Fences","description":"In 1950s Pittsburgh, a frustrated African-American father struggles with the constraints of poverty, racism, and his own inner demons as he tries to raise a family.","duration":"2:19:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2016-12-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/j2kgVOyp4dxlqohU5QJTrDHfbRD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8NvnB8aeWQvBEz2ruN4g313j991.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//j2kgVOyp4dxlqohU5QJTrDHfbRD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8NvnB8aeWQvBEz2ruN4g313j991.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":363088,"title":"Ant-Man and the Wasp","description":"Just when his time under house arrest is about to end, Scott Lang once again puts his freedom at risk to help Hope van Dyne and Dr. Hank Pym dive into the quantum realm and try to accomplish, against time and any chance of success, a very dangerous rescue mission.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2018-07-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iYdgEUE2W2aJkgqfSjf1x3gFfuV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cFQEO687n1K6umXbInzocxcnAQz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iYdgEUE2W2aJkgqfSjf1x3gFfuV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cFQEO687n1K6umXbInzocxcnAQz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":294963,"title":"Bone Tomahawk","description":"During a shootout in a saloon, Sheriff Hunt injures a suspicious stranger. The doctor''s assistant, wife of the local foreman, tends to him in prison. That night, the town is attacked and they both disappear—only the arrow of a cannibal tribe is found. Hunt and a few of his men go in search of the prisoner and the foreman''s wife.","duration":"2:13:00","genre":["Drama","Horror","Western"],"release_date":"2015-10-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/orXMq2jZy8wFmePv7zXS2Kor7Ug.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4MmTHpn2Y8emqvBgvOjufImUmKZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//orXMq2jZy8wFmePv7zXS2Kor7Ug.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4MmTHpn2Y8emqvBgvOjufImUmKZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8072,"title":"Alphaville","description":"Lemmy Caution is on a mission to eliminate Professor Von Braun, the creator of a malevolent computer that rules the city of Alphaville. Befriended by the scientist’s daughter Natasha, Lemmy must unravel the mysteries of the strictly logical Alpha 60 and teach Natasha the meaning of the word “love.”","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Drama","Science Fiction","Mystery"],"release