iece her life back together in unexpected ways.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"2003-09-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dy516GsG7lvszB47FiotNjLARDY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3vQUQwdtfPt1Sl2GZrIECWWA0dk.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dy516GsG7lvszB47FiotNjLARDY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3vQUQwdtfPt1Sl2GZrIECWWA0dk.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":707103,"title":"Emily","description":"The imagined life of one of the world’s most famous authors, Emily Brontë, as she finds her voice and writes the literary classic Wuthering Heights. Explore the relationships that inspired her – her raw, passionate sisterhood with Charlotte and Anne; her first aching, forbidden love for Weightman and her care for her maverick brother whom she idolises.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["History","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2022-10-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7DrLrDf3vVVjgOGRUf37knUu7Rx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tgVBMIiJczfBWINRRd9yxE8ESln.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7DrLrDf3vVVjgOGRUf37knUu7Rx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tgVBMIiJczfBWINRRd9yxE8ESln.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":542417,"title":"Skin","description":"A destitute young man, raised by racist skinheads and notorious among white supremacists, turns his back on hatred and violence to transform his life, with the help of a black activist and the woman he loves.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Drama","Crime","Romance"],"release_date":"2019-07-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/etyZEgWCf46AzKKDMQcLoiYKwec.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7ryH8Noh6VKE4L42yhpR5jqIGsF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//etyZEgWCf46AzKKDMQcLoiYKwec.jpg","small_poster_path":"http