b.org/t/p/w342//zLzS2aOqKsS0QvEaY6SfBw4VBqh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9602,"title":"Coming to America","description":"An African prince decides it’s time for him to find a princess... and his mission leads him and his most loyal friend to Queens, New York. In disguise as an impoverished immigrant, the pampered prince quickly finds himself a new job, new friends, new digs, new enemies and lots of trouble.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"1988-06-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vsCIw7ARCKQVPT2K2hkkFVl7yo5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/djRAvxyvvN2yqlJKDbT3uy4vOBw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vsCIw7ARCKQVPT2K2hkkFVl7yo5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//djRAvxyvvN2yqlJKDbT3uy4vOBw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":68924,"title":"The Ice Storm","description":"In the weekend after thanksgiving 1973 the Hood family is skidding out of control. Then an ice storm hits, the worst in a century.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1997-09-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yu57dADKL9PfxHZqVfpcNEccWNv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3a6uLta7K8Dzojps4RoJAPHD0km.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yu57dADKL9PfxHZqVfpcNEccWNv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3a6uLta7K8Dzojps4RoJAPHD0km.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":64688,"title":"21 Jump Street","description":"When cops Schmidt and Jenko join the secret Jump Street unit, they use their youthful appearances to go undercover as high school students. They trade in their guns and badges for backpacks, and set out to shut down a dangerous drug ring. But, as time goes on, Schmidt and Jenko discover that high school is nothing like it was just a few years earlier -- and, what''s more, they must again confront the teenage terror and anxiety they thought they had left behind.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Action","Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"2012-03-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rXrpYOveFl76ivMmyb2612T7Q8w.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8v3Sqv9UcIUC4ebmpKWROqPBINZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rXrpYOveFl76ivMmyb2612T7Q8w.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8v3Sqv9UcIUC4ebmpKWROqPBINZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10019,"title":"Mannequin","description":"Jonathan Switcher, an unemployed artist, finds a job as an assistant window dresser for a department store. When Jonathan happens upon a beautiful mannequin he previously designed, she springs to life and introduces herself as Emmy, an Egyptian under an ancient spell. Despite interference from the store''s devious manager, Jonathan and his mannequin fall in love while creating eye-catching window displays to keep the struggling store in business.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1987-02-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rbYlmgMV96GcvTe700peiTH5JcS.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oHMA8euTiZdDFXDi5zaIQQXwl0K.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rbYlmgMV96GcvTe700peiTH5JcS.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oHMA8euTiZdDFXDi5zaIQQXwl0K.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":849869,"title":"Kill Boksoon","description":"At work, she''s a renowned assassin. At home, she''s a single mom to a teenage daughter. Killing? That''s easy. It''s parenting that''s the hard part.","duration":"2:17:00","genre":["Action","Drama","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2023-02-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mGwzJbtX6zU0SdtxeHn1sNNK8JW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/taYgn3RRpCGlTGdaGQvnSIOzXFy.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mGwzJbtX6zU0SdtxeHn1sNNK8JW.jpg","small_poster_pa