.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lJRGgbi4Slsz171vcJ0Ctgiea6v.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iMCkGHVrYRdqKROPRPmVaJVSlg3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lJRGgbi4Slsz171vcJ0Ctgiea6v.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iMCkGHVrYRdqKROPRPmVaJVSlg3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10217,"title":"The Sweet Hereafter","description":"A small mountain community in Canada is devastated when a school bus accident leaves more than a dozen of its children dead. A big-city lawyer arrives to help the survivors'' and victims'' families prepare a class-action suit, but his efforts only seem to push the townspeople further apart. At the same time, one teenage survivor of the accident has to reckon with the loss of innocence brought about by a different kind of damage.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1997-09-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7zRAZFZ4xVMyoLEvCb4Au41uvny.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gJy7LMq4b5qO5fsSUSoBgm24BHf.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7zRAZFZ4xVMyoLEvCb4Au41uvny.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gJy7LMq4b5qO5fsSUSoBgm24BHf.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":919,"title":"Blood: The Last Vampire","description":"In Japan, the vampire-hunter Saya, who is a powerful original, is sent by her liaison with the government, David, posed as a teenage student to the Yokota High School on the eve of Halloween to hunt down vampires. Saya asks David to give a new katana to her. Soon she saves the school nurse Makiho Amano from two vampires disguised of classmates and Makiho witnesses her fight against the powerful demon.","duration":"0:48:00","genre":["Animation","Fantasy","Horror","Action"],"release_date":"2000-11-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/17s9ojb8j8QnBGCfqDUJraXLlFi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uRwR5lc