 be Robert, whom Charles suspects is having an affair with his wife and would not mind seeing him dead.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Drama"],"release_date":"1997-09-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yU3nJxP2vNy8OQdDsfV09elG4k9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zplJqfuUyqzW0D4jX3W1afl0d7b.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yU3nJxP2vNy8OQdDsfV09elG4k9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zplJqfuUyqzW0D4jX3W1afl0d7b.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":6418,"title":"Hotel Chevalier","description":"In a Paris hotel room, Jack Whitman lies on a bed. His phone rings; it''s a woman on her way to see him, a surprise. She arrives and the complications of their relationship emerge in bits and pieces. Will they make love? Is their relationship over? (A prequel to The Darjeeling Limited, 2007.)","duration":"0:13:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2007-10-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kvlXOT8snP7qplRpkOSAZahH5UB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fiWLuGIUAcJtu2hs7KlcZ0O2Ix3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kvlXOT8snP7qplRpkOSAZahH5UB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fiWLuGIUAcJtu2hs7KlcZ0O2Ix3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":426613,"title":"The Miseducation of Cameron Post","description":"Pennsylvania, 1993. After getting caught with another girl, teenager Cameron Post is sent to a conversion therapy center run by the strict Dr. Lydia Marsh and her brother, Reverend Rick, whose treatment consists in repenting for feeling “same sex attraction.” Cameron befriends fellow sinners Jane and Adam, thus creating a new family to deal with the surrounding intolerance.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2018-07-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lqmNJ2dEqC5afCmYeLUiC6bYDUI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xFLJDW3na8AADFzQJT6bM1VU5zs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lqmNJ2dEqC5afCmYeLUiC6bYDUI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xFLJDW3na8AADFzQJT6bM1VU5zs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":32568,"title":"The Man in the White Suit","description":"The unassuming, nebbishy inventor Sidney Stratton creates a miraculous fabric that will never be dirty or worn out. Clearly he can make a fortune selling clothes made of the material, but may cause a crisis in the process. After all, once someone buys one of his suits they won''t ever have to fix them or buy another one, and the clothing industry will collapse overnight. Nevertheless, Sidney is determined to put his invention on the market, forcing the clothing factory bigwigs to resort to more desperate measures...","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Comedy","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1951-08-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eSxcby3f435Dq5yE3kPdLLj0oi7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/laTLoNZB7Ar3ZDoQmspBDVa5mbC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eSxcby3f435Dq5yE3kPdLLj0oi7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//laTLoNZB7Ar3ZDoQmspBDVa5mbC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15136,"title":"So Close","description":"A conflict of interest between two high-kicking assassin sisters is complicated as they''re pursued by the criminals who hired them and an equally high-kicking female cop.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2002-05-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/DKiebEytdEyrh9E66XQ9kWovcn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zdw5bISsOT9JLS4mB9OPxH91Sg5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//DKiebEytdEyrh9E66XQ9kWovcn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zdw5bISsOT9JLS4mB9OPxH91Sg5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":7973,"title":"Caramel","description":"In a beauty salon in Beirut the lives of five women cross paths. The beauty salon is a colorful and sensual microcosm where they share and entrust their hopes, fears and expectations.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2007-08-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xg3HpC1I0eDEREqF3RyDY21kzUh.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3YAAZuO0Rz33CrIO66NqxMS6R4y.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xg3HpC1I0eDEREqF3RyDY21kzUh.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3YAAZuO0Rz33CrIO66NqxMS6R4y.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":582906,"title":"The Dazzled","description":"Camille, is the eldest of a large family. One day, her parents enter a religious community which gradually, regimentation becomes sectarian and Camille will have to fight to assert her freedom and save her brothers and sisters.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2019-11-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/t5OD0TovGlQQN5Rqknh2FnEZwIv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hn106rcEHkO5IuWylzB9ccT4bLz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//t5OD0TovGlQQN5Rqknh2FnEZwIv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hn106rcEHkO5IuWylzB9ccT4bLz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":485189,"title":"Sorry Angel","description":"At once an intimate chronicle of a romance and a sprawling portrait of life in early 1990s France following the intertwining journeys of Jacques, a worldly Parisian writer, and Arthur, a curious, carefree and much-younger university student who is just beginning to live. Brought together by chance, the two men find themselves navigating a casual fling that gradually deepens into a tender, transformative bond.","duration":"2:13:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2018-05-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5DDaEzznWzLUvYcHxkyRv