":"Delinquent Tyler Gage receives the opportunity of a lifetime after vandalizing a performing arts school, gaining him the chance to earn a scholarship and dance with up-and-coming dancer Nora.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Music","Drama","Romance","Crime"],"release_date":"2006-08-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/k3AGi4UD8Ql2dKosXh6FrBSKm0s.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fmw52kXk2kN8AQil7tgOD41gt4Q.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//k3AGi4UD8Ql2dKosXh6FrBSKm0s.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fmw52kXk2kN8AQil7tgOD41gt4Q.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":419743,"title":"Disobedience","description":"New York photographer Ronit flies to London after learning about the death of her estranged father. Ronit is returning to the same Orthodox Jewish community that shunned her decades earlier for her childhood attraction to Esti, a female friend. Their fortuitous and happy reunion soon reignites their burning passion as the two women explore the boundaries of faith and sexuality.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2018-04-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uTT0yYYgD5S4cDpNOJxuvCITAeC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kPJTR7IUkzqjIu1SGnpQmGo9Iip.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uTT0yYYgD5S4cDpNOJxuvCITAeC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kPJTR7IUkzqjIu1SGnpQmGo9Iip.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":44494,"title":"Zero for Conduct","description":"In a repressive boarding school with rigid rules of behavior, four boys decide to rebel against the director on a celebration day.","duration":"0:48:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1933-04-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9pB6CO85B6vwwgZtBKkvyISd3Lq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oQcGB9BGj9LPTWcEdij47McotKY.jpg","smal