ll over again…and again, and again. That''s because the delightful Lucy has no short-term memory, so Henry must woo her day after day until he finally sweeps her off her feet.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2004-02-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/v8lPo8UWKyP2tIXD8N64HfNP4Pw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lzUI2Cg7OMfcUNv3f7MywYNBjs6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//v8lPo8UWKyP2tIXD8N64HfNP4Pw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lzUI2Cg7OMfcUNv3f7MywYNBjs6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":892153,"title":"Tom and Jerry Cowboy Up!","description":"This time, the rivals team up to help a cowgirl and her brother save their homestead from a greedy land-grabber, and they’re going to need some help! Jerry’s three precocious nephews are all ready for action, and Tom is rounding up a posse of prairie dogs. But can a ragtag band of varmints defeat a deceitful desperado determined to deceive a damsel in distress? No matter what happens with Tom and Jerry in the saddle, it’ll be a rootin’ tootin’ good time!","duration":"1:15:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Family","Western"],"release_date":"2022-01-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/q1NXVYTqSStNQsnKrCvtU6NPzEk.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/muIaHotSaSUQr0KZCIJOYQEe7y2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//q1NXVYTqSStNQsnKrCvtU6NPzEk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//muIaHotSaSUQr0KZCIJOYQEe7y2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":521494,"title":"Transformers: Titans Return","description":"After the Combiner Wars ended, Cybertron started to be rebuilt. However, an undead Starscream has been reincarnated as Trypticon, wreaking havoc around him. To combat this menace, Windblade gathers up a ragtag team of Transformers, including Optimus Prime and Megatron, to resurrect an ancient ally. And while some may be forever changed by the events, others may not emerge with their sparks intact.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Animation","Action"],"release_date":"2017-11-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/y71J24BNl00V1CMJeFJEljKMk5i.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nP4nfW0E1cl1dAy6j8iKHsJRyQ2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//y71J24BNl00V1CMJeFJEljKMk5i.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nP4nfW0E1cl1dAy6j8iKHsJRyQ2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":513310,"title":"Boss Level","description":"A former special forces agent is trapped in a time loop and relives his death over and over again. To escape the terrible situation, he must track down those responsible and stop them.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Action","Science Fiction","Thriller"],"release_date":"2021-02-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1Yc5hIRh3skhsEKLbCHE7v1FBOa.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nt8on8Ge0Lsw0oF6EbmGiDV69Hf.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1Yc5hIRh3skhsEKLbCHE7v1FBOa.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nt8on8Ge0Lsw0oF6EbmGiDV69Hf.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":278927,"title":"The Jungle Book","description":"After a threat from the tiger Shere Khan, Mowgli, a man-cub fostered by wolves, is forced to flee the jungle, and he embarks on a journey of self-discovery with the help of the panther, Bagheera, and the free-spirited bear, Baloo.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Adventure","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2016-04-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8oYykF1Qhrb8fC2qZqD71EzRywg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2Epx7F9X7DrFptn4seqn4mzBVks.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8oYykF1Qhrb8fC2qZqD71EzRywg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2Epx7F9X7DrFptn4seqn4mzBVks.