 for the world and Godzilla are revealed.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1999-12-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nv60CvL3fjosoJytnBcdJcF5l0L.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7BrjFxV0j5VzZRfVYeYbFXMUweB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nv60CvL3fjosoJytnBcdJcF5l0L.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7BrjFxV0j5VzZRfVYeYbFXMUweB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9263,"title":"Now and Then","description":"Waxing nostalgic about the bittersweet passage from childhood to puberty, four childhood girlfriends — Teeny, Chrissy, Samantha and Roberta — recall the magical summer of 1970. During their walk down memory lane, they reconcile experiences with boys, secrets, bullies and more.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1995-10-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ic529Vlnxmp2ArVSYr5vBLoNFEK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/q31Ks8oAmM4Nq2CcGjyYYpdBAmh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ic529Vlnxmp2ArVSYr5vBLoNFEK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//q31Ks8oAmM4Nq2CcGjyYYpdBAmh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4193,"title":"Evil Under the Sun","description":"An opulent beach resort provides a scenic background to this amusing whodunit as Poirot attempts to uncover the nefarious evildoer behind the strangling of a notorious stage star.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Thriller","Crime","Mystery","Drama"],"release_date":"1982-03-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kv20JYfmzLyYi1vV0ocryyju3zl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rQNMZoVVURf9YyYiBTsrOTEKALH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kv20JYfmzLyYi1vV0ocryyju3zl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rQNMZoVVURf9YyYiBTsrOTEKALH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":972118,"title":"The Goldman Case","description":"A second trial begins in November 1975 against French left-wing revolutionary Pierre Goldman, accused of several armed robberies and the death of two chemists.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Drama","Crime","History"],"release_date":"2023-06-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6cpzcoVpAifoZPyJ02Kfs0wnA5S.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fYbjXgBQUPgj1mtcmH0GafbJlXV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6cpzcoVpAifoZPyJ02Kfs0wnA5S.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fYbjXgBQUPgj1mtcmH0GafbJlXV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":121873,"title":"Hannah Arendt","description":"A portrait of the genius that shook the world with her discovery of “the banality of evil.” After she attends the Nazi Adolf Eichmann’s trial in Jerusalem, Arendt dares to write about the Holocaust in terms no one has ever heard before. Her work instantly provokes a furious scandal, and Arendt stands strong as she is attacked by friends and foes alike. But as the German-Jewish émigré also struggles to suppress her own painful associations with the past, the film exposes her beguiling blend of arrogance and vulnerability — revealing a soul defined and derailed by exile.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2012-09-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/li3pr2ZQjmrYuX4YWAPKvU8JaWc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kB4hUbhIYmx7Xdpo1DGn15pstO3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//li3pr2ZQjmrYuX4YWAPKvU8JaWc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kB4hUbhIYmx7Xdpo1DGn15pstO3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":70667,"title":"Kon-Tiki","description":"The true story about legendary explorer Thor Heyerdahl and his epic crossing of the Pacific on a balsa wood raft in 1947, in an effort to prove it was possible for South Americans to settle in Polynesia in pre-