["Action","Comedy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2010-02-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kn0DkkCG459NTwUMzP6qbDWBNcu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uCSQnopQPIw58RKTfzoRYxq9It5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kn0DkkCG459NTwUMzP6qbDWBNcu.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uCSQnopQPIw58RKTfzoRYxq9It5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":27845,"title":"Trees Lounge","description":"Tommy has lost his job, his love and his life. He lives in a small apartment above the Trees Lounge, a bar which he frequents along with a few other regulars without lives. He gets a job driving an ice cream truck and ends up getting involved with the seventeen-year-old niece of his ex-girlfriend. This gets him into serious trouble with her father.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"1996-05-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4aXe78YsL7TWtoVZXO5DTnn9AAR.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/swOo6PSYDVgwSce9faxPBS9V4ss.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4aXe78YsL7TWtoVZXO5DTnn9AAR.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//swOo6PSYDVgwSce9faxPBS9V4ss.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":807986,"title":"The Hummingbird","description":"Everyone in Marco''s life seems constantly restless, from his brilliant but unhappily married parents to his own wife Marina, or even Luisa, the real love of his life, a girl he met during a fateful summer in the ''70s and always stayed in touch with. Tragedy and fate seem to haunt him, yet he somehow manages never to get ensnared in the chaos—like his namesake, “the hummingbird”, he focuses all his energy at standing still.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2022-10-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rJOrsUssTsm6CU4Tq0VMsfP7xyA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1lgbElaJ0o