t which just leaves the harbor. He manipulates the ship''s compass so that Charlie is not aware that he is sailing to the treasure island. But when they step on the island, they discover that it is not as abandoned as they believed: there are some natives - and a Japanese soldier still defending the treasure","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Comedy"],"release_date":"1981-12-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2bCcm0ENZYvInREBoEYGFxg96Kb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8fl6sXVv5fWMpDxFDab54qc71tv.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2bCcm0ENZYvInREBoEYGFxg96Kb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8fl6sXVv5fWMpDxFDab54qc71tv.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1921,"title":"Sweet November","description":"Nelson is a man devoted to his advertising career in San Francisco. One day, while taking a driving test at the DMV, he meets Sara. She is very different from the other women in his life. Nelson causes her to miss out on taking the test and later that day she tracks him down. One thing leads to another and Nelson ends up living with her through a November that will change his life forever.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2001-02-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6KfQTuw4X3LQN11sDA18eYy9HJY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3biEHZSBSYqSkawU2sQyNbLcjgE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6KfQTuw4X3LQN11sDA18eYy9HJY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3biEHZSBSYqSkawU2sQyNbLcjgE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":522098,"title":"Babyteeth","description":"A terminally ill teen upsets her parents when she falls in love with a small-time drug dealer.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2020-06-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/n4NKnzaLwGhBMNjYQTLhPVpE8je.jpg","poster_