900_face/gG5ZlQNnJs2NsO9JdeCf1jgNzn7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cNeDPyJdeV4Gzs3TcVthM8AJYHW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gG5ZlQNnJs2NsO9JdeCf1jgNzn7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cNeDPyJdeV4Gzs3TcVthM8AJYHW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14012,"title":"Flicka","description":"Katy McLaughlin desires to work on her family''s mountainside horse ranch, although her father insists she finish boarding school. Katy finds a mustang in the hills near her ranch. The headstrong 16 year old then sets her mind to tame a mustang and prove to her father she can run the ranch. But when tragedy happens, it will take all the love and strength the family can muster to restore hope.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Family","Drama"],"release_date":"2006-10-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8cpaUuYwSG24rOJZKyKOSdlcgY4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nhJlXSmiHnlVxea5J5l3wfuATwY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8cpaUuYwSG24rOJZKyKOSdlcgY4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nhJlXSmiHnlVxea5J5l3wfuATwY.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10586,"title":"The Ghost and the Darkness","description":"Sir Robert Beaumont is behind schedule on a railroad in Africa. Enlisting noted engineer John Henry Patterson to right the ship, Beaumont expects results. Everything seems great until the crew discovers the mutilated corpse of the project''s foreman, seemingly killed by a lion. After several more attacks, Patterson calls in famed hunter Charles Remington, who has finally met his match in the bloodthirsty lions.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Adventure","Thriller","History"],"release_date":"1996-10-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kM2RkLCt3ElQ2NfHgw1CzZXRGfZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3KEPs6RKlin9pT9fqjtW7MSLC8H.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://