ease_date":"2003-05-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oKGaTHGcveMKUalGLmEIt5CUgNj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3pnMViIDP6whWXnTBq7ibQipSyS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oKGaTHGcveMKUalGLmEIt5CUgNj.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3pnMViIDP6whWXnTBq7ibQipSyS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":556694,"title":"Three Thousand Years of Longing","description":"A solitary scholar discovers an ancient bottle while on a trip to Istanbul and unleashes a djinn who offers her three wishes. Filled with reluctance, she is unable to come up with one, so the djinn tries to inspire her with his stories.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Drama","Fantasy","Romance"],"release_date":"2022-08-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/90IcDDC47Rck4D2fyZbpZ1rbFZW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nS7DNl4A7XnDncZX70UJ8ALAihF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//90IcDDC47Rck4D2fyZbpZ1rbFZW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nS7DNl4A7XnDncZX70UJ8ALAihF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":454652,"title":"Colette","description":"After marrying a successful Parisian writer known commonly as Willy, Sidonie-Gabrielle Colette is transplanted from her childhood home in rural France to the intellectual and artistic splendor of Paris. Soon after, Willy convinces Colette to ghostwrite for him. She pens a semi-autobiographical novel about a witty and brazen country girl named Claudine, sparking a bestseller and a cultural sensation. After its success, Colette and Willy become the talk of Paris and their adventures inspire additional Claudine novels.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2018-09-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mNiVBMDBaQU2A5XA1KnvmkL6rPI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5fvcs8x7k16wGdet16qkx1cKBPM.jpg","