s a temporary hideout.","duration":"2:28:00","genre":["Drama","History","Thriller"],"release_date":"2019-10-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/r73j0zjtTOsOCStHLby23NNDJyI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rgS3e3sTUHeVgKzKmFhIJcl9tVA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//r73j0zjtTOsOCStHLby23NNDJyI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rgS3e3sTUHeVgKzKmFhIJcl9tVA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":45284,"title":"Outrage","description":"When a tough yakuza gangster is betrayed by his bosses, it means all out war. Bodies pile up as he takes out everyone in his way to the top in a brutal quest for revenge.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"2010-06-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tNr8lv3OeLD0OCJPUuazBN3DnTT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/s6VVl5WKuGIDlSAm8hgvTsrzODK.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tNr8lv3OeLD0OCJPUuazBN3DnTT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//s6VVl5WKuGIDlSAm8hgvTsrzODK.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":44092,"title":"Reign of Assassins","description":"Set in ancient China, Zeng Jing is a skilled assassin who finds herself in possession of a mystical Buddhist monk''s remains. She begins a quest to return the remains to its rightful resting place, and thus places herself in mortal danger because a team of assassins is in a deadly pursuit to possess the remains which holds an ancient power-wielding secret.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Action","Adventure"],"release_date":"2010-09-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dJXQ840kmEGefoJ0EQGlpZfsoic.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jIQAm7YlBoZqllu4gbnagRlO9NY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dJXQ840kmEGefoJ0EQGlpZfsoic.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jIQ