s – all stand at the intersection of modern warfare – a murky world of fluid morality where all is not as it seems. A unique and dramatic look at the Canadian Army in Afghanistan.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["War","Drama","Thriller","Action"],"release_date":"2015-10-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1CDUzgUuTTCV5LzoyRdmbcayQJi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zdn34Jx3rRkhDGsD0qcB0cA1HzB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1CDUzgUuTTCV5LzoyRdmbcayQJi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zdn34Jx3rRkhDGsD0qcB0cA1HzB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":76535,"title":"Marvel One-Shot: A Funny Thing Happened on the Way to Thor''s Hammer","description":"Agent Coulson stops at a convenience store and deals with a coincidental robbery during his visit.","duration":"0:04:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Fantasy","Adventure","Action","Comedy"],"release_date":"2011-10-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yuIsNfHZTn3nkSsatzM0298wA67.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/njrOqsmFH4pxBrhcoslqLfw2OGk.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yuIsNfHZTn3nkSsatzM0298wA67.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//njrOqsmFH4pxBrhcoslqLfw2OGk.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":25970,"title":"I Married a Witch","description":"A 17th-century witch returns to wreak havoc in the life of a descendant of the Puritan witch hunter who burned her, but runs afoul of her father when she discovers that her mischief might have found her true love.","duration":"1:17:00","genre":["Romance","Fantasy","Comedy"],"release_date":"1942-10-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xrb2llOfcqX5dL5JLca4ZiTdwyu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pOtHcQfo0wCesRfeDPacrS2bD3W.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xrb2llOfcqX5dL5JLca4ZiTdwyu.jpg","small_poster_path":"h