ity officer races to outsmart a mysterious traveler forcing him to let a dangerous item slip onto a Christmas Eve flight.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Thriller","Action"],"release_date":"2024-12-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rhc8Mtuo3Kh8CndnlmTNMF8o9pU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sjMN7DRi4sGiledsmllEw5HJjPy.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rhc8Mtuo3Kh8CndnlmTNMF8o9pU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sjMN7DRi4sGiledsmllEw5HJjPy.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":541134,"title":"The Good Nurse","description":"Suspicious that her colleague is responsible for a series of mysterious patient deaths, a nurse risks her own life to uncover the truth.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Drama","Crime","Mystery"],"release_date":"2022-10-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/x2U0R60Z7hmJxZixzsGZfjFJbve.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rSq6cq0LCcbro10jbEaPTEb3WmW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//x2U0R60Z7hmJxZixzsGZfjFJbve.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rSq6cq0LCcbro10jbEaPTEb3WmW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":493483,"title":"In the Aisles","description":"Christian, a reclusive young man from Leipzig, gets a job working the night shift at a big-box store. He''s trained to stocks goods and operate a forklift by Bruno, a wistful former truck driver, who introduces Christian to a colorful group of overnight workers, including Marion, with whom Christian develops a troubled infatuation.","duration":"2:05:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2018-05-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8S22MtzZMUm3NhqQ8S1jJxgxRL3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7qmeZlLSBkQ34AtfeoaF7usnfRr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8S22MtzZMUm3NhqQ8S1jJxgxRL3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t