/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/x1BL62HL6N8sqGcmn4YRtuGVsh1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ewsYTI6KKQw3IDPFmVVbHq89kxv.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//x1BL62HL6N8sqGcmn4YRtuGVsh1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ewsYTI6KKQw3IDPFmVVbHq89kxv.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":50839,"title":"Margin Call","description":"Set in the high-stakes world of the financial industry, involving the key players at an investment firm during one perilous 24-hour period in the early stages of the 2008 financial crisis. An entry-level analyst unlocks information that could prove to be the downfall of the firm.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"2011-09-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fIriCG54pJZoMGvoHHLCPn5y7Cx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xNXYXJ3XNC9o5wxDF2ImZ9b2es.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fIriCG54pJZoMGvoHHLCPn5y7Cx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xNXYXJ3XNC9o5wxDF2ImZ9b2es.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":33542,"title":"Rumble in the Bronx","description":"Keong comes from Hong Kong to visit New York for his uncle''s wedding. His uncle runs a market in the Bronx and Keong offers to help out while Uncle is on his honeymoon. During his stay in the Bronx, Keong befriends a neighbor kid and beats up some neighborhood thugs who cause problems at the market. One of those petty thugs in the local gang stumbles into a criminal situation way over his head.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Crime","Action","Comedy","Thriller"],"release_date":"1995-01-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/upETXObL782G3OyjBcOw83oizHT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1nAfchiXHQB3iyhK8fCJJEnNs5A.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//upETXObL782G3OyjBcOw83oizHT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1nAfchiXHQB3iyhK8fCJJEnNs5A.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":25251,"title":"Borsalino","description":"In 1930s Marseilles two small-time crooks decide to join forces when they meet while brawling over a woman. Starting with fixed horse races and boxing matches, they soon find themselves doing jobs for the local gangster bosses. When they decide to go into the business for themselves, their easy-going approach to crime starts to change.","duration":"2:05:00","genre":["Crime","Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1970-05-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gygNkDF0mTdVaaRO8nTeXvJwjFA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yYmYPRswLysH9D1Qvy7diumFXG2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gygNkDF0mTdVaaRO8nTeXvJwjFA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yYmYPRswLysH9D1Qvy7diumFXG2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":18995,"title":"D.O.A.","description":"Frank Bigelow is about to die, and he knows it. The accountant has been poisoned and has only 24 hours before the lethal concoction kills him. Determined to find out who his murderer is, Frank, with the help of his assistant and girlfriend, Paula, begins to trace back over his last steps. As he frantically tries to unravel the mystery behind his own impending demise, his sleuthing leads him to a group of crooked businessmen and another murder.","duration":"1:23:00","genre":["Mystery","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"1949-12-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rsl2YCe2bSeni2qGdaMoDBS7sLo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/m7wZXWOt9XQKJT8r9pbAFo7jB46.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rsl2YCe2bSeni2qGdaMoDBS7sLo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//m7wZXWOt9XQKJT8r9pbAFo7jB46.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14367,"title":"Adventures in Babysitting","description":"When plans with her boyfriend fall through, high school senior Chris Parker ends up babysitting the Anderson kids, Brad and Sara. What should be a quiet night in, however, turns into a series of ridiculous exploits, starting when they leave the house to pick up Chris'' friend Brenda. Soon, Brad''s buddy Daryl is involved, and the group must contend with car thieves, blues musicians and much more.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1987-07-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bddWCMRxVW7e1VJCz3pEZug5oJx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8QiAj0Xw2UMeZMIIfZKeNoIsszs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bddWCMRxVW7e1VJCz3pEZug5oJx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8QiAj0Xw2UMeZMIIfZKeNoIsszs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8009,"title":"Highlander","description":"He fought his first battle on the Scottish Highlands in 1536. He will fight his greatest battle on the streets of New York City in 1986. His name is Connor MacLeod. He is immortal.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Adventure","Action","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1986-03-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2EfbAWLq8s2f1LxTAIuLGYpKETV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8Z8dptJEypuLoOQro1WugD855YE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2EfbAWLq8s2f1LxTAIuLGYpKETV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8Z8dptJEypuLoOQro1WugD855YE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4837,"title":"La Collectionneuse","description":"Bombastic, womanising art dealer Adrien and his painter friend Daniel go on holiday at a 17th-century villa on the Riviera. But their idyll is disturbed by the presence of the bohemian Haydée, accused of being a ''collector'' of men.","duration":"1:26:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1967-03-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lEamKAOMyENqc97bEuwLFMvie8x.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rMVluFrpfeCtcCUtDkjklbBirry.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lEamKAOMyENqc97bEuwLFMvie8x.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rMVluFrpfeCtcCUtDkjklbBirry.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":860508,"title":"The Whisper Man","description":"When his young son vanishes, a widower enlists help from his estranged father, a retired detective who put away the serial killer now linked to the case.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2026-08-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uauoVKKCkNA9iWjgJCL8TdSfLf5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ndRs5lADYm0PeVjuOxaMcInY0o2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uauoVKKCkNA9iWjgJCL8TdSfLf5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ndRs5lADYm0PeVjuOxaMcInY0o2.jpg"}]'::jsonb
