https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//epZEeCqidRtSBCerlsKW4ZeuMeD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//w1TKSc5ml15JjlnYtsvM4fAEG8Z.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":291984,"title":"The Death & Life of John F. Donovan","description":"A decade after the death of an American TV star, a young actor reminisces about the written correspondence he once shared with the former, as well as the impact those letters had on both their lives.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2019-03-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gY6kVEUqOkVu6B6FARpgHwjoKW1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2bhI7Ivk7VmvUaJaDTxJUgOXp1E.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gY6kVEUqOkVu6B6FARpgHwjoKW1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2bhI7Ivk7VmvUaJaDTxJUgOXp1E.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":192136,"title":"Mandela: Long Walk to Freedom","description":"A chronicle of Nelson Mandela''s life journey from his childhood in a rural village through to his inauguration as the first democratically elected president of South Africa.","duration":"2:21:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2013-11-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wNk223rTAxXlwdBeyVs0WdMPyX2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nzjwDSwLbalv7bCXnFbkAuIxXLx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wNk223rTAxXlwdBeyVs0WdMPyX2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nzjwDSwLbalv7bCXnFbkAuIxXLx.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":44249,"title":"The Legend Is Born: Ip Man","description":"The remarkable true story of the early life of Ip Man, the formidable kung fu genius who would become Bruce Lee''s mentor; beginning at the start of his journey from his initial training through to the ultimate battle to become supreme master of the art of Wing Chun.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Drama","Action","History"],"release_date":"2010-06-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4jCHr55RGHQlXzcDYwJ70b0mYj9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ekJxJ037GWBrqIR8FX7Kh7daaR9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4jCHr55RGHQlXzcDYwJ70b0mYj9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ekJxJ037GWBrqIR8FX7Kh7daaR9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":36647,"title":"Blade","description":"The Daywalker known as \"Blade\" - a half-vampire, half-mortal man - becomes the protector of humanity against an underground army of vampires.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Horror","Action"],"release_date":"1998-08-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7NKfxJrQn053UJeLftlx4m4NTzo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oWT70TvbsmQaqyphCZpsnQR7R32.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7NKfxJrQn053UJeLftlx4m4NTzo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oWT70TvbsmQaqyphCZpsnQR7R32.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":27899,"title":"Little Caesar","description":"A small-time hood shoots his way to the top, but how long can he stay there?","duration":"1:18:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"1931-01-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fG5sKoSaTiySmGaqFjNcGXo4Gtt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1K3Q1tAHHA5Sdtja2pPALBQevA7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fG5sKoSaTiySmGaqFjNcGXo4Gtt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1K3Q1tAHHA5Sdtja2pPALBQevA7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":17845,"title":"Loft","description":"Five close friends, all of them married, share a loft to meet their mistresses. One day they find the body of a young woman in the loft. Since there are only five keys to the loft, the five men begin to suspect each other of murder.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Drama","Mystery","Romance"],"release_date":"2008-10-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eUM3rcy8tQjOJKqyp1VXxqJWCn3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gbFwIV5cxwMD3qUPiU91kfALTjN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eUM3rcy8tQjOJKqyp1VXxqJWCn3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gbFwIV5cxwMD3qUPiU91kfALTjN.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":16270,"title":"Career Opportunities","description":"After falling asleep in a Target dressing room, an unhappy heiress wakes up locked inside the store overnight with a local slacker and notorious liar, leading the two unlikely companions to bond over their shared desire to escape their lives.","duration":"1:23:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"1991-03-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/y9UU2JNjoFPI7ZvCuiWzpN9GJHZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xi0fBIBDZQqJ8U0hUvwhpxFd4jM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//y9UU2JNjoFPI7ZvCuiWzpN9GJHZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xi0fBIBDZQqJ8U0hUvwhpxFd4jM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15088,"title":"The Cutting Edge: Chasing the Dream","description":"A world class ice skater eager to take the top prize in the biggest competition around finds his dreams going up in flames after his partner suffers a debilitating injury in this romantic sports drama starring Matt Lanter, Francia Rosa, and Christy Carlson Romano. Zack (Lanter) was headed for the gold when his partner suffered an injury that made competing impossible, but could a feisty female hockey player prove the key to keeping his illustrious career on track? Alexandra is an amateur Latina hockey player who has never skated professionally and doesn''t much care for Zack, though a little determination goes a long way in helping Zack convince her to join him on the ice. Now, as this unlikely pair begins the arduous training process that could make them both bona-fide superstars, the girl with the icy attitude finds her handsome partner''s warmth and charm bringing about a most unexpected thaw.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Romance","Drama","Action","Adventure"],"release_date":"2008-03-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4KJN0JtDN81mzJyb6EDgTrfYPA1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pwhDGNlBplpLxnZsI1x3SbnZb5q.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4KJN0JtDN81mzJyb6EDgTrfYPA1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pwhDGNlBplpLxnZsI1x3SbnZb5q.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10083,"title":"No Way Out","description":"Navy Lt. Tom Farrell meets a young woman, Susan Atwell, and they share a passionate fling. Farrell then finds out that his superior, Defense Secretary David Brice, is also romantically involved with Atwell. When the young woman turns up dead, Farrell is put in charge of the murder investigation. He begins to uncover shocking clues about the case, but when details of his encounter with Susan surface, he becomes a suspect as well.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"1987-08-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9F6zZuETJWUtkcSEnOc0JLqBHAK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/93CzsBvRhg035yvQosRtSsTL19v.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9F6zZuETJWUtkcSEnOc0JLqBHAK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//93CzsBvRhg035yvQosRtSsTL19v.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":727745,"title":"The Kissing Booth 3","description":"It''s the summer before Elle heads to college, and she has a secret decision to make. Elle has been accepted into Harvard, where boyfriend Noah is matriculating, and also Berkeley, where her BFF Lee is headed and has to decide if she should stay or not.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"2021-08-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oOZM1C3wZtsZtdidVgEazeas7U4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/c7xcqnMDV