cle that includes Antonio and Angelica, married with children; Nerval and her policeman husband.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2007-02-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xLjv2ah3MeLrkm6EoViJR9ZGznj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qpzR06PrVDaJGBaSngEMUhVhhw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xLjv2ah3MeLrkm6EoViJR9ZGznj.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qpzR06PrVDaJGBaSngEMUhVhhw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15143,"title":"Some Kind of Wonderful","description":"Keith Nelson, an artsy high school outcast, tries to land a date with popular girl Amanda Jones with some help from his tomboy best friend, Watts. However, Watts realizes she likes Keith as more than just a friend and tries to convince him to stop pursuing Amanda. Matters are further complicated when Keith''s invitation draws the ire of Amanda''s rich yet snobby ex-boyfriend, Hardy Jenns, who makes plans to get even.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"1987-02-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/k5LISwQzFyNiw0o1G0azI3YmFnO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6z6ZUrwbAJl9Nq43OY77O7iY80x.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//k5LISwQzFyNiw0o1G0azI3YmFnO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6z6ZUrwbAJl9Nq43OY77O7iY80x.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":799497,"title":"Get the Goat","description":"Bruceuilis, a policeman from the countryside, is assigned to rescue Celestina, a goat considered heritage of his small city, and travels to São Paulo. There, he meets police clerk Trindade, who decides to venture out into the field, even though it is not his specialty.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Action","Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"2021-03-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tEFzrCUpYem5Rbt75zx8fGzAbLd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.t