uration":"1:46:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2021-11-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ouQPvA86SW1DXFTsc2qaRqz4tAg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kSXPsrausCYVsDnQaJfhzqR9fV7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ouQPvA86SW1DXFTsc2qaRqz4tAg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kSXPsrausCYVsDnQaJfhzqR9fV7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":717980,"title":"Sharper","description":"A small, wealthy family in New York City gets progressively torn apart by secrets, lies, and the theft that orchestrates all of it.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2023-02-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cG5QZHyIRJXqo53YA41gbNMlpIM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tq8x5F17q95T1j0up5rpzXFAylN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cG5QZHyIRJXqo53YA41gbNMlpIM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tq8x5F17q95T1j0up5rpzXFAylN.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":642208,"title":"Supernova","description":"Sam and Tusker, partners of 20 years, are traveling across England in their old RV visiting friends, family and places from their past. Since Tusker was diagnosed with early-onset dementia two years ago, their time together is the most important thing they have.  As the trip progresses, however, their ideas for the future clash, secrets come out, and their love for each other is tested as never before. Ultimately, they must confront the question of what it means to love one another in the face of Tusker’s illness.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2020-11-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/BjLgTDAcZc94KomcQAxMVye0yI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/c21Vwt4shqVxCQziFz0Hf91wSow.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//BjLgTDAcZc94KomcQAxMVye0yI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//c21Vwt4shqVxCQziFz0Hf91wSow.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":445571,"title":"Game Night","description":"Max and Annie''s weekly game night gets kicked up a notch when Max''s brother Brooks arranges a murder mystery party -- complete with fake thugs and federal agents. So when Brooks gets kidnapped, it''s all supposed to be part of the game. As the competitors set out to solve the case, they start to learn that neither the game nor Brooks are what they seem to be. The friends soon find themselves in over their heads as each twist leads to another unexpected turn over the course of one chaotic night.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Mystery","Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"2018-02-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aKPCZwkSZy2ASLo0QKeYmcoplfA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/85R8LMyn9f2Lev2YPBF8Nughrkv.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aKPCZwkSZy2ASLo0QKeYmcoplfA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//85R8LMyn9f2Lev2YPBF8Nughrkv.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":33583,"title":"The Decameron","description":"A young Sicilian is swindled twice, but ends up rich; a man poses as a deaf-mute in a convent of curious nuns; a woman must hide her lover when her husband comes home early; a scoundrel fools a priest on his deathbed; three brothers take revenge on their sister''s lover; a young girl sleeps on the roof to meet her boyfriend at night; a group of painters wait for inspiration; a crafty priest attempts to seduce his friend''s wife; and two friends make a pact to find out what happens after death.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["History","Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"1971-08-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9CbH2EktREWAur7XLBeFNFNr5BQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iL5mmuIL6fqFSWJeHE417WWrocz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9CbH2EktREWAur7