e flee to Switzerland. Sabina begins an affair, Tom continues womanizing, and Tereza, disgusted, returns to Czechoslovakia. Realizing his mistake, Tomas decides to chase after her.","duration":"2:51:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1988-02-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wru4lC7aK4BYJzxAOoDI0vlfXL7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/g1kPEwATsCI8DnGx6ViAhUVKQSI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wru4lC7aK4BYJzxAOoDI0vlfXL7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//g1kPEwATsCI8DnGx6ViAhUVKQSI.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10297,"title":"How to Marry a Millionaire","description":"Three women set out to find eligible millionaires to marry, but find true love in the process.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"1953-11-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pkOgOztKdFadcarmNZwrOcNHrdq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dFwefYyEOOZaWVn15xGY6CbYYJ2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pkOgOztKdFadcarmNZwrOcNHrdq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dFwefYyEOOZaWVn15xGY6CbYYJ2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":578814,"title":"Tomorrow''s a New Day","description":"When theatre actor Giuliano receives an unexpected visit from his childhood friend Tommasso, the encounter is bittersweet. This reunion is their ﬁrst meeting in many years, triggered by Giuliano’s failing health and his decision to forgo treatment. Instead he is focussed on putting his affairs in order: distributing possessions, reconciling past disputes, and, most importantly, ﬁnding a home for his beloved canine, Pato. Over four days, the two men walk the streets of Rome, visiting bookshops, restaurants, veterinarians and friends, examining their lives and speculating on what the future holds.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2019-02-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6AP9uBm8jVIEmYMSEYLOfX2YeX9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zh2mFtZ6HJoZYcdyjfs17GHm8Qw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6AP9uBm8jVIEmYMSEYLOfX2YeX9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zh2mFtZ6HJoZYcdyjfs17GHm8Qw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":551271,"title":"Medieval","description":"The story of fifteenth century Czech icon and warlord, Jan Zizka, who defeated armies of the Teutonic Order and the Holy Roman Empire.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Action","Drama","History"],"release_date":"2022-09-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/maxRhndtC4BJABvqRPvYNu69CHA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eeUNWsdoiOijOZAMaWFDA5Pb1n8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//maxRhndtC4BJABvqRPvYNu69CHA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eeUNWsdoiOijOZAMaWFDA5Pb1n8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":527729,"title":"Asterix: The Secret of the Magic Potion","description":"Following a fall during mistletoe picking, Druid Getafix decides that it is time to secure the future of the village. Accompanied by Asterix and Obelix, he undertakes to travel the Gallic world in search of a talented young druid to transmit the Secret of the Magic Potion.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Family","Animation","Comedy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2018-05-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9cPMIuB2tv4IP0LbeNhrK5OyDy5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5OvHpzWXBzOvgZwOoUsqNSouSwy.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9cPMIuB2tv4IP0LbeNhrK5OyDy5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5OvHpzWXBzOvgZwOoUsqNSouSwy.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":450322,"title":"The Man Who Invented Christmas","description":"In 1843, despite the fact that Dickens is a successful writer, the failure of his latest book puts his career at a crossroads, until the moment when, struggling with inspiration and confronting reality with his childhood memories, a new character is born in the depths of his troubled mind; an old, lonely, embittered man, so vivid, so human, that a whole world grows around him, a story so inspiring that changed the meaning of Christmas forever.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Drama","History","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"2017-10-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hm8Gux0946IfeJ1PZwztOo6lVHH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qRkzRue5rTzB6PESXBJCKqROOXC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hm8Gux0946IfeJ1PZwztOo6lVHH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qRkzRue5rTzB6PESXBJCKqROOXC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":22478,"title":"Another Woman","description":"Marion is a woman who has learned to shield herself from her emotions. She rents an apartment to work undisturbed on her new book, but by some acoustic anomaly she can hear all that is said in the next apartment in which a psychiatrist holds his office. When she hears a young woman tell that she finds it harder and harder to bear her life, Marion starts to reflect on her own life. After a series of events she comes to understand how her unemotional attitude towards the people around her affected them and herself.","duration":"1:24:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1988-10-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2cH8vxci9QjUP9oT2OLW2OHn6U6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ds4CcnlACh0r1r3VGa7y85dz72R.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2cH8vxci9QjUP9oT2OLW2OHn6U6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ds4CcnlACh0r1r3VGa7y85dz72R.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13813,"title":"Defiance","description":"Based on a true story, during World War II, four Jewish brothers escape their Nazi-occupied homeland of West Belarus in Poland and join the