nesiac Gally begins to forge a life for herself in a world where every day is a struggle for survival.","duration":"0:54:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1993-06-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bEkcFT2mI78oZMl6WDpqVy8iSZ5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/urvznwew7HrjrIEbK2RLaEkaezs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bEkcFT2mI78oZMl6WDpqVy8iSZ5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//urvznwew7HrjrIEbK2RLaEkaezs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11696,"title":"The Exchange Student","description":"Monsieur Bosquier, the owner of a private school, is far from pleased when his eldest son, Philippe, fails his end of year exams. He decides to send his wayward offspring to England to improve his English. In exchange, Philippe’s host, a wealthy whisky distiller, Mac Farrel, will send his daughter, Shirley, to live with the Bosquiers in France. However, Philippe has already decided to spend the summer holidays on a yacht with his friends, so he sends a fellow student, Michonnet, to England in his place. The deception is soon discovered but things go from bad to worse when Philippe and Shirley fall in love and fly to Scotland to get married...","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1967-12-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5508isiWLDMbFerBqjUN0dAoBrT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/73lKodrSbIqVfoeApFgLUf2SeWR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5508isiWLDMbFerBqjUN0dAoBrT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//73lKodrSbIqVfoeApFgLUf2SeWR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8366,"title":"Manitou''s Shoe","description":"Abahachi, Chief of the Apache Indians, and his blood brother Ranger maintain peace and justice in the Wild West. One day, Abahachi needs to take up a credit from the Shoshone Indians to finance his tribe''s new saloon. Unfortunately Santa Maria, who sold the saloon, betrays Abahachi, takes the money and leaves. Soon, the Shoshones are on the warpath to get their money back, and Abahachi is forced to organize it quickly.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Western","Comedy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2001-07-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cvxv0u07o3NWsiQX4LngJLejWJ7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5vliuDzm4Mxzsu25VefoLZZMQ7w.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cvxv0u07o3NWsiQX4LngJLejWJ7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5vliuDzm4Mxzsu25VefoLZZMQ7w.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4546,"title":"The Count of Monte-Cristo","description":"Young sailor Edmond Dantès is wrongfully imprisoned, escapes, finds treasure, and reinvents himself as the wealthy Count of Monte Cristo to exact revenge on those who betrayed him.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Adventure","Drama","TV Movie"],"release_date":"1975-10-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8VjQ8hOjrrOtTJjCfdDg8eyFDUk.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jbXO1lV54yWLGyzpOxQjzBxMfLR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8VjQ8hOjrrOtTJjCfdDg8eyFDUk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jbXO1lV54yWLGyzpOxQjzBxMfLR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":929590,"title":"Civil War","description":"In the near future, a group of war journalists attempt to survive while reporting the truth as the United States stands on the brink of civil war.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["War","Action","Drama"],"release_date":"2024-04-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/t2SXZ7KLriaLyf5QT8Iar6fSOGp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sh7Rg8Er3tFcN9BpKIPOMvALgZd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//t2SXZ7KLriaLyf5QT8Iar6fSOGp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sh7Rg8Er3tFcN9BpKIPO