ption":"A tight-knit group of New York City street dancers, including Luke and Natalie, team up with NYU freshman Moose, and find themselves pitted against the world''s best hip-hop dancers in a high-stakes showdown that will change their lives forever.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2010-08-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iHUp2Ojhi6qhx4wIYtRR6ux7YbG.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rPcqa5TZ7S63RNmCuY45ZizFBen.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iHUp2Ojhi6qhx4wIYtRR6ux7YbG.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rPcqa5TZ7S63RNmCuY45ZizFBen.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1991,"title":"Death Proof","description":"Austin''s hottest DJ, Jungle Julia, sets out into the night to unwind with her two friends Shanna and Arlene. Covertly tracking their moves is Stuntman Mike, a scarred rebel leering from behind the wheel of his muscle car, revving just feet away.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2007-05-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qbVCChwbGWDAgsCXKZxyjBrRiWx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vtu6H4NWnQVqEp3aanUq3hNeeot.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qbVCChwbGWDAgsCXKZxyjBrRiWx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vtu6H4NWnQVqEp3aanUq3hNeeot.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1119173,"title":"A Beautiful Life","description":"When a young fisherman with a hidden talent gets discovered by a music producer, he must decide if he''s ready to open himself up to stardom — and love.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Drama","Music","Romance"],"release_date":"2023-06-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6BI1XjPNT5VYEJ4vXkdyuiKLMYt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/x6PvT4HAkK7phdj54Zao8rY5oBT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6BI1XjPN