 Among them is the cocksure A.J. who Harry thinks isn''t good enough for his daughter, until the mission proves otherwise.","duration":"2:31:00","genre":["Action","Science Fiction","Adventure"],"release_date":"1998-07-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1cO6OQJxz7YhTZ4V1OlkYfebeJa.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eTM3qtGhDU8cvjpoa6KEt5E2auU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1cO6OQJxz7YhTZ4V1OlkYfebeJa.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eTM3qtGhDU8cvjpoa6KEt5E2auU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":926606,"title":"The Home","description":"A troubled man starts working at a retirement home and realizes its residents and caretakers harbor sinister secrets. As he investigates the building and its forbidden fourth floor, he starts to uncover connections to his own past and upbringing as a foster child.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Horror","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2025-07-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/Lu57GTE24Ja5O61jieY2aIBk8d.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qyGY1k5GqAORsVhfZA3gFKirZWD.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//Lu57GTE24Ja5O61jieY2aIBk8d.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qyGY1k5GqAORsVhfZA3gFKirZWD.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":596161,"title":"Let Him Go","description":"Following the loss of their son, a retired sheriff and his wife leave their Montana ranch to rescue their young grandson from the clutches of a dangerous family living off the grid in the Dakotas.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Thriller","Crime","Western"],"release_date":"2020-11-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ZLD4pjmMLt9I3t1a7SFJBekIh1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/EsLZoT8oHhQlGd1QpdbnvnwTzO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ZLD4pjmMLt9I3t1a7SFJBekIh1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//EsLZoT8oHhQlGd1QpdbnvnwTzO.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":574436,"title":"Piranhas","description":"A gang of teenage boys stalk the streets of Naples armed with hand guns and AK-47s to do their mob bosses'' bidding – until they decide to be the bosses themselves.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"2019-02-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tT3ZdqNFkZEep8GfVaeoVDPmHBg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7fcIdggCiqoz3vddPhb9TkHlEYC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tT3ZdqNFkZEep8GfVaeoVDPmHBg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7fcIdggCiqoz3vddPhb9TkHlEYC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":470333,"title":"Hearts Beat Loud","description":"In the hip Brooklyn neighborhood of Red Hook, single dad and record store owner Frank is preparing to send his hard-working daughter Sam off to college while being forced to close his vintage shop. Hoping to stay connected through their shared musical passions, Frank urges Sam to turn their weekly jam sessions into a father-daughter live act. After their first song becomes an internet breakout, the two embark on a journey of love, growing up and musical discovery.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Music","Drama","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"2018-06-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6XznuR5s363S8ZqrqEFO0qXl7V5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/h1wKptD8iXJbtAUSz9OlXS3q4Co.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6XznuR5s363S8ZqrqEFO0qXl7V5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//h1wKptD8iXJbtAUSz9OlXS3q4Co.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":402298,"title":"Denial","description":"Acclaimed writer and historian Deborah E. Lipstadt must battle for historical truth to prove the Holocaust actually occurred when David Irving, a renowned denier, sues her for libel.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2016-09-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rnNj2g7BhPIjxs0WR5VS2f0im7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cJLbcWqV6sKwPpX5uT4xaklTgQz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rnNj2g7BhPIjxs0WR5VS2f0im7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cJLbcWqV6sKwPpX5uT4xaklTgQz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":22094,"title":"Hard Times","description":"In the depression, Chaney, a strong silent streetfighter, joins with Speed, a promoter of no-holds-barred street boxing bouts. They go to New Orleans where Speed borrows money to set up fights for Chaney, but Speed gambles away any winnings.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1975-08-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cjA8bxjXcw3I63DlO3qa6uFwrH4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yWIh8cMGd9XubkdhJB2TJ7buGy3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cjA8bxjXcw3I63DlO3qa6uFwrH4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yWIh8cMGd9XubkdhJB2TJ7buGy3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11497,"title":"All Dogs Go to Heaven","description":"When a casino-owning dog named Charlie is murdered by his rival Carface, he finds himself in Heaven. Wanting to get back at his killer, he cons his way back to the living with the warning that doing so damns him to Hell. Once back, he teams with his old partner, Itchy, to prep his retaliation. He stumbles upon an orphan girl who can talk to the animals, thus allowing him to get the inside info on the races to ensure his wins to finance his plans. However, all the while, he is still haunted by nightmares of what''s waiting for him on the other side unless he can prove that he is worthy of Heaven again.","duration":"1:24:00","genre":["Drama","Animation","Family","Comedy","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1989-11-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/haJ6SsjxfhSRG61LMy4QJWxCNAb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nmWh1NglDinfkHD9zCNqGWyhl7Q.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//haJ6SsjxfhSRG61LMy4QJWxCNAb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nmWh1NglDinfkHD9zCNqGWyhl7Q.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9737,"title":"Bad Boys","description":"Marcus Burnett is a henpecked family man. Mike Lowrey is a footloose and fancy free ladies'' man. Both Miami policemen, they have 72 hours to reclaim a consignment of drugs stolen from under their station''s nose. To complicate matters, in order to get the assistance of the sole witness to a murder, they have to pretend to be each other.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Crime","Comedy"],"release_date":"1995-04-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wOLTJxfv98miIQcn0oNXq9fIgXM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/x1ygBecKHfXX4M2kRhmFKWfWbJc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wOLTJxfv98miIQcn0oNXq9fIgXM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//x1ygBecKHfXX4M2kRhmFKWfWbJc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5994,"title":"The Family Man","description":"Jack''s lavish, fast-paced lifestyle changes one Christmas night when he stumbles into a grocery store holdup and disarms the gunman. The next morning he wakes up in bed lying next to Kate, his college sweetheart he left in order to pursue his career, and to the horrifying discovery that his former life no longer exists. As he stumbles through this alternate suburban universe, Jack finds himself at a crossroad where he must choose between his high-power career and the woman he loves.","duration":"2:05:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2000-12-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gnosJeDIDQXy9uDewXphEpDWNYT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9wToOVsKuf0XeKhlauzCa3D8Gui.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gnosJeDIDQXy9uDewXphEpDWNYT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9wToOVsKuf0XeKhlauzCa3D8Gui.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":65057,"title":"The Descendants","description":"With his wife Elizabeth on life support after a boating accident, Hawaiian land baron Matt King takes his daughters on a trip from Oahu to Kauai to confront a young real estate broker, who was having an affair with Elizabeth before her misfortune.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2011-09-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/afC5IhoNZb8MqDHuiWOAcLjqi6b.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8cDq5UlOPYeKm39okALCEOsZPxk.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//afC5IhoNZb8MqDHuiWOAcLjqi6b.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8cDq5UlOPYeKm39okALCEOsZPxk.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":26171,"title":"Everybody''s Fine","description":"Eight months after the death of his wife, Frank Goode looks forward to a reunion with his four adult children. When all of them cancel their visits at the last minute, Frank, against the advice of his doctor, sets out on a road trip to reconnect with his offspring. As he visits each one in turn, Frank finds that his children''s lives are not quite as picture-perfect as they''ve made them out to be.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2009-12-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bJo0O0swYl7Dc51PR6AGWBXBdiY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qnC4ypkpviWgp4aHsXvWym38v56.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bJo0O0swYl7Dc51PR6AGWBXBdiY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qnC4ypkpviWgp4aHsXvWym38v56.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14019,"title":"Ex Drummer","description":"Three musicians form a band. But they''re not just any musicians: each has a disability that makes them particularly unsuitable for their instrument. The guitarist is deaf, the singer is tone deaf, and the bassist has a stiff arm. They lack a drummer, and to respect the group''s uniqueness, they turn to a famous writer who has never played the drums. He accepts, but begins a manipulation that will wreak further havoc on the already largely dysfunctional band.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2007-01-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mIYSIgQjTU0Y7e1yZ08E588A8av.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7VxXp2h9UtJP6XbeuQGqqbQzoE1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mIYSIgQjTU0Y7e1yZ08E588A8av.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7VxXp2h9UtJP6XbeuQGqqbQzoE1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14011,"title":"Justice League: The New Frontier","description":"The human race is threatened by a powerful creature, and only the combined power of Superman, Batman, Wonder Woman, Green Lantern, Martian Manhunter and The Flash can stop it. But can they overcome their differences to thwart this enemy using the combined strength of their newly formed Justice League?","duration":"1:15:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Animation","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2008-02-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aKQqtcdgFOQ1WsDi0g2FCtxMTnr.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bj25ueeYNkz4e5t8oMMaAOWmwOc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aKQqtcdgFOQ1WsDi0g2FCtxMTnr.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bj25ueeYNkz4e5t8oMMaAOWmwOc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13776,"title":"Diner","description":"Set in 1959, Diner shows how five young men resist their adulthood and seek refuge in their beloved Diner. The mundane, childish, and titillating details of their lives are shared. But the golden moments pass, and the men shoulder their responsibilities, leaving the Diner behind.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release