ters brothers, two notorious assassins, to capture him on his way to California.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Western","Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2018-09-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2cI0rmMgoZOqP78iQDZwQASkKT3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wTgomqYRTXT3BXQScnIo8uHDyWC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2cI0rmMgoZOqP78iQDZwQASkKT3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wTgomqYRTXT3BXQScnIo8uHDyWC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":350499,"title":"Pokémon the Movie: Hoopa and the Clash of Ages","description":"Ash, Pikachu, and their friends come to a desert city by the sea. Here they meet the Mythical Pokémon Hoopa, which has the ability to summon things—including people and Pokémon—through its magic rings. After a scary incident, they learn of a story about a brave hero who stopped the rampage of a terrifying Pokémon long ago. Now, the threat that has been bottled up for years is in danger of breaking loose again.","duration":"1:13:00","genre":["Family","Adventure","Animation","Action","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2015-07-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/crFk9m8DK9lNqlOa7AGTvYsO6Qn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6kXRevMC1XSywmxqqRHuBcZlROT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//crFk9m8DK9lNqlOa7AGTvYsO6Qn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6kXRevMC1XSywmxqqRHuBcZlROT.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":326359,"title":"Frozen Fever","description":"On Anna''s birthday, Elsa and Kristoff are determined to give her the best celebration ever, but Elsa''s icy powers may put more than just the party at risk.","duration":"0:08:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Comedy","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2015-03-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tQNop6scGYjapYo8j4wCSoVls0i.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mPrDJ7puYzP