dy"],"release_date":"2025-08-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/41043LV7mfluH8iXEUPVseCDAv5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cvda8s5J8YaHjTyEyXQpvD6f3iV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//41043LV7mfluH8iXEUPVseCDAv5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cvda8s5J8YaHjTyEyXQpvD6f3iV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":897192,"title":"Diary of a Wimpy Kid: Rodrick Rules","description":"As a new school year begins, Greg is subject to relentless teasing from his brother Rodrick. Will Greg manage to get along with him? Or will a secret ruin everything?","duration":"1:14:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"2022-12-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xEUz44bmr8EOPFQrVZ5ebxgN8Eq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iW6ixzkrvdrcxk0umiLZMtlSl9L.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xEUz44bmr8EOPFQrVZ5ebxgN8Eq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iW6ixzkrvdrcxk0umiLZMtlSl9L.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":400020,"title":"The Young Karl Marx","description":"26 year-old Karl Marx embarks with his wife, Jenny, on the road to exile. In 1844 in Paris, he meets Friedrich Engels, an industrialist’s son, who has been investigating the sordid birth of the British working class. Engels, the dandy, provides the last piece of the puzzle to the young Karl Marx’s new vision of the world. Together, between censorship and the police’s repression, riots and political upheavals, they will lead the labor movement during its development into a modern era.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["History","Drama"],"release_date":"2017-03-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uJSuJ4eocpofYc6LjEJ7G3vgbfS.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4VwBXiCzXKJyHfRdVBb843m23dx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uJSuJ4eocpofYc6LjEJ7G3vgbfS.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4VwBXiCzXKJyHfRdVBb843m23dx.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":253412,"title":"Everest","description":"Inspired by the incredible events surrounding a treacherous attempt to reach the summit of the world''s highest mountain, \"Everest\" documents the awe-inspiring journey of two different expeditions challenged beyond their limits by one of the fiercest snowstorms ever encountered by mankind. Their mettle tested by the harshest of elements found on the planet, the climbers will face nearly impossible obstacles as a lifelong obsession becomes a breathtaking struggle for survival.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Adventure","Drama","History"],"release_date":"2015-09-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/P7d3lyBaYbAXVor6iB2avLvc4K.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2jKOu2bjpLP6NXJcm7Ep14bDGtA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//P7d3lyBaYbAXVor6iB2avLvc4K.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2jKOu2bjpLP6NXJcm7Ep14bDGtA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":49207,"title":"R","description":"Imprisoned for violent assault, Rune is placed in the hardcore ward, where his survival depends on quickly learning the prison''s parallel world of rules, honor, and obligations.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2010-04-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gd4JXEnL3SAff3qth6Qx3ZNh3NO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jxMgFBcEkBPhoikocUBqXS3i6TP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gd4JXEnL3SAff3qth6Qx3ZNh3NO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jxMgFBcEkBPhoikocUBqXS3i6TP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":38939,"title":"Tales from the Crypt","description":"When a tourist group become lost within ancient catacombs, they meet the sinister Crypt Keeper, who tells them each their fate. The enigmatic figure''s macabre stories involve a wife dabbling in murder, a retired sanitation worker targeted by his suspicious neighbors, and an adulterer who may face a fitting demise if the yarns come true.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Horror"],"release_date":"1972-03-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/QE9ILRngt3v67xkvNUPbjADPe2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vA3wsl2lfurU6UFVs0Hg0cZJDah.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//QE9ILRngt3v67xkvNUPbjADPe2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vA3wsl2lfurU6UFVs0Hg0cZJDah.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11148,"title":"XXY","description":"Alex, an intersexed 15-year-old, is living as a girl, but she and her family begin to wonder whether she''s emotionally a boy when another teenager''s sexual advances bring the issue to a head. As Alex faces a final decision regarding her gender, she meets both hostility and compassion.","duration":"1:26:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2007-06-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/w1USmlLq33AkiAEIry7k0Hy5GsE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4sgoignnXhqjxepHBi2inLFLhSz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//w1USmlLq33AkiAEIry7k0Hy5GsE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4sgoignnXhqjxepHBi2inLFLhSz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":338952,"title":"Fantastic Beasts: The Crimes of Grindelwald","description":"Gellert Grindelwald has escaped imprisonment and has begun gathering followers to his cause—elevating wizards above all non-magical beings. The only one capable of putting a stop to him is the wizard he once called his closest friend, Albus Dumbledore. However, Dumbledore will need to seek help from the wizard who had thwarted Grindelwald once before, his former student Newt Scamander, who agrees to help, unaware of the dangers that lie ahead. Lines are drawn as love and loyalty are tested, even among the truest friends and family, in an increasingly divided wizarding world.","duration":"2:14:00","genre":["Fantasy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2018-11-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/i3rRY0EKYhSpyOLRAQ7iB05zhAp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fMMrl8fD9gRCFJvsx0SuFwkEOop.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//i3rRY0EKYhSpyOLRAQ7iB05zhAp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fMMrl8fD9gRCFJvsx0SuFwkEOop.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":207686,"title":"The House at the End of Time","description":"The story of Dulce, a mother who has encounters with apparitions inside her old house. She must decipher a mystery that could trigger a prophecy: the death of her family.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Horror","Drama","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2013-06-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ZIwr7usYLrVodguqdosMiXzJc5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/88keS5TaMqlbuqCZIgwwusmv4tu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ZIwr7usYLrVodguqdosMiXzJc5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//88keS5TaMqlbuqCZIgwwusmv4tu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":154400,"title":"The Drop","description":"Bob Saginowski finds himself at the center of a robbery gone awry and entwined in an investigation that digs deep into the neighborhood''s past where friends, families, and foes all work together to make a living - no matter the cost.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"2014-09-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kydclLUnhGMuoCxl6VRfSSwdRRO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/olQInYvVCW2wycMSU1ogo9Jshml.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kydclLUnhGMuoCxl6VRfSSwdRRO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//olQInYvVCW2wycMSU1ogo9Jshml.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13554,"title":"Eight Men Out","description":"Buck Weaver and Hap Felsch are young idealistic players on the Chicago White Sox, a pennant-winning team owned by Charles Comiskey -  a penny-pinching, hands-on manager who underpays his players and treats them with disdain. And when gamblers and hustlers discover that Comiskey''s demoralized players are ripe for a money-making scheme, one by one the team members agree to throw the World Series. But when the White Sox are defeated, a couple of sports writers smell a fix and a national scandal explodes, ripping the cover off America''s favorite pastime.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"1988-09-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6v594uUI5VOBjdlxiV0d6EOjvW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9nh0w2C9h9KfJb0OsVg65O65b5s.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6v594uUI5VOBjdlxiV0d6EOjvW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9nh0w2C9h9KfJb0OsVg65O65b5s.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11004,"title":"Wonder Boys","description":"Grady is a 50-ish English professor who hasn''t had a thing published in years—not since he wrote his award winning ''Great American Novel'' 7 years ago. This weekend proves even worse than he could imagine as he finds himself reeling from one misadventure to another in the company of a new wonder boy author.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2000-02-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/f6axPiSzkPa2ErTtTxBUGfCLFPd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5yvQe06HPNII2eZCJWTeMwqLWvR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//f6axPiSzkPa2ErTtTxBUGfCLFPd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5yvQe06HPNII2eZCJWTeMwqLWvR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":758679,"title":"Mothers'' Instinct","description":"Housewives Alice and Celine are best friends and neighbours who seem to have it all. However, when a tragic accident shatters the harmony of their lives, guilt, suspicion and paranoia begin to unravel their sisterly bond.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"2024-01-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2ak94bJfXxHR5vBxwrpkycwOKv3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6EtPToJlGpjyuIxkIoztnBXYFgJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2ak94bJfXxHR5vBxwrpkycwOKv3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6EtPToJlGpjyuIxkIoztnBXYFgJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":526050,"title":"Little","description":"Jordan Sanders, a take-no-prisoners tech mogul, wakes up one morning in the body of her 13-year-old self right before a do-or-die presentation. Her beleaguered assistant April is the only one in on the secret that her daily tormentor is now trapped in an awkward tween body, just as everything is on the line.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Comedy","Fantasy","Romance"],"release_date":"2019-04-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zbPVujc7qIEqpqkG70t2NpNvHOa.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4MDB6jJl3U7xK1Gw64zIqt9pQA4.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zbPVujc7qIEqpqkG70t2NpNvHOa.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4MDB6jJl3U7xK1Gw64zIqt9pQA4.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":521777,"title":"Good Boys","description":"A group of young boys on the cusp of becoming teenagers embark on an epic quest to fix their broken drone before their parents get home.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2019-08-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lZbpGWA1P8k7P6MJXdMDDDS01z9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tximyCXMEnWIIyOy9STkOduUprG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lZbpGWA1P8k7P6MJXdMDDDS01z9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tximyCXMEnWIIyOy9STkOduUprG.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":425703,"title":"How to Grow Up Despite Your Parents","description":"More and more parents take competitive behavior towards the teachers of their children: deny votes and programs, vaneggiano of likes, dislikes, and conspiracies. So, instead of helping in the training of their children, they become insurmountable obstacles to their growth. Presumptuously they think: \"We know better than anyone else our children and we know what they are worth and how and what you have to teach.\"","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Music","Family","Drama"],"release_date":"2016-11-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2agCGhg915ZhmY2P24Ozw0CucfW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sZXTB2E1LGhBNXahaDee9IUqfXj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2agCGhg915ZhmY2P24Ozw0CucfW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sZXTB2E1LGhBNXahaDee9IUqfXj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":167221,"title":"Long Live Freedom","description":"Elections are approaching and things don''t look too good for the opposition. Their leader can''t stand the pressure and disappears. To avoid a scandal, the upper echelons of the party concoct a risky plan: to replace him with his identical twin, a philosopher with BPD, whose eclectic ideas and direct approach unexpectedly make the party surge in the polls.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2013-02-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5v2zW1RiHU4uPO2Mlfq6kYQCzhc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e6UFJbhBG0sStPle9RoWC07s0K0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5v2zW1RiHU4uPO2Mlfq6kYQCzhc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e6UFJbhBG0sStPle9RoWC07s0K0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":49367,"title":"Two Sons of Francisco","description":"The story of Francisco, a very simple and poor man whose dream was to see his children become country music stars, and who made all the efforts to make it happen.","duration":"2:1