.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AcKVlWaNVVVFQwro3nLXqPljcYA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yRutvYkM3OP8N9oqqfjSK1VC7fs.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AcKVlWaNVVVFQwro3nLXqPljcYA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":349067,"title":"Tigers Are Not Afraid","description":"When her mother suddenly disappears with no one to care for her, young Estrella ends up on the street and joins a gang of children, triggering a dangerous and tragic chain of events.","duration":"1:23:00","genre":["Fantasy","Horror"],"release_date":"2017-11-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4JXF6GkzFcKA7MvSJyfv407WwC0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fSDOwpgG8WFB3rt4Fj7iJ0EQnNq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4JXF6GkzFcKA7MvSJyfv407WwC0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fSDOwpgG8WFB3rt4Fj7iJ0EQnNq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":265189,"title":"Force Majeure","description":"While holidaying in the French Alps, a Swedish family deals with acts of cowardliness as an avalanche breaks out.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2014-08-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oZp8CLwvRXgBAYGhn8P0pKOD4Ho.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/41agNfzepz2DTdgTBX1fX0QclHp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oZp8CLwvRXgBAYGhn8P0pKOD4Ho.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//41agNfzepz2DTdgTBX1fX0QclHp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":187017,"title":"22 Jump Street","description":"After making their way through high school (twice), big changes are in store for officers Schmidt and Jenko when they go deep undercover at a local college. But when Jenko meets a kindred spirit on the football team, and Schmidt infiltrates the bohemian art major scene, they begin to question their partnership. Now they don''t have to just crack the case - they have to figure out if they can have a mature relationship. If these two overgrown adolescents can grow from freshmen into real men, college might be the best thing that ever happened to them.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Crime","Comedy","Action"],"release_date":"2014-06-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kdyYOwpKvvD2fSbwfnMM2YPAzfq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/850chzYHYbT3IISl6Q7dbBuFP2B.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kdyYOwpKvvD2fSbwfnMM2YPAzfq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//850chzYHYbT3IISl6Q7dbBuFP2B.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":27277,"title":"The War Wagon","description":"An ex-con seeks revenge on the man who put him in prison by planning a robbery of the latter''s stagecoach, which is transporting gold. He enlists the help of a partner, who could be working for his nemesis.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Western","Action","Crime"],"release_date":"1967-05-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/doc1yGmr2QvFFLniF6KpHNwhsKr.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wGSv9mfHocleVwH4Q8d38SkwQP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//doc1yGmr2QvFFLniF6KpHNwhsKr.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wGSv9mfHocleVwH4Q8d38SkwQP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":21946,"title":"Counter Investigation","description":"A cop investigates whether the man convicted of murdering his daughter is really guilty.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Thriller"],"release_date":"2007-03-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/geLvA85NzaIWcpkp3JoKLSkiT3o.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/huswFtH8wSaezEtGEs4AmgvhVw8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//geLvA85NzaIWcpkp3JoKLSkiT3o.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//huswFtH8wSaezEtGEs4AmgvhVw8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9411,"title":"Fallen","description":"H