eturn of Chen Zhen","description":"The Japanese forces occupy Shanghai and slowly start spreading terror in the city. Chen Zhen, who was presumed dead, returns to fight against the Japanese and put an end to their tyrannical rule.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Drama","Action","History","Thriller"],"release_date":"2010-09-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/r8VWydH7HYYt8VLiAFq9lQ2FgSp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qT6KI2jNiskkB4VuNz4uN0ng4Ro.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//r8VWydH7HYYt8VLiAFq9lQ2FgSp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qT6KI2jNiskkB4VuNz4uN0ng4Ro.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":27850,"title":"Halloweentown","description":"On her 13th birthday, Marnie learns she''s a witch, discovers a secret portal, and is transported to Halloweentown — a magical place where ghosts and ghouls, witches and werewolves live apart from the human world. But she soon finds herself battling wicked warlocks, evil curses, and endless surprises.","duration":"1:24:00","genre":["Family","Fantasy","Comedy","TV Movie"],"release_date":"1998-11-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qcAJcXtYCaXYKQKBylqnWscTa6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6iOPwHAeIqKTuKImCLOqHHEOYal.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qcAJcXtYCaXYKQKBylqnWscTa6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6iOPwHAeIqKTuKImCLOqHHEOYal.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":6435,"title":"Practical Magic","description":"Sally and Gillian Owens, born into a magical family, have mostly avoided witchcraft themselves. But when Gillian''s vicious boyfriend, Jimmy Angelov, dies unexpectedly, the Owens sisters give themselves a crash course in hard magic. With policeman Gary Hallet growing suspicious, the girls struggle to resurrect Angelov -- and unwittingly inject his corpse with an evil spirit that threatens to end their family line.","dura