2WrGrCG9o.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":29912,"title":"The Robe","description":"Drunk and disillusioned Roman, Marcellus Gallio, wins Jesus'' robe in a dice game after the crucifixion. Marcellus has never been a man of faith like his slave, Demetrius, but when Demetrius escapes with the robe, Marcellus experiences disturbing visions and feels guilty for his actions. Convinced that destroying the robe will cure him, Marcellus sets out to find Demetrius — and discovers his Christian faith along the way.","duration":"2:15:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"1953-09-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nWCcl7iY718qikjbYfERstvcBrn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qFYZNGzftIM8dqGMJBToGraAFJp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nWCcl7iY718qikjbYfERstvcBrn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qFYZNGzftIM8dqGMJBToGraAFJp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":25941,"title":"Harry Brown","description":"An elderly ex-serviceman and widower looks to avenge his best friend''s murder by doling out his own form of justice.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Thriller","Crime","Drama","Action"],"release_date":"2009-11-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7pZtTbxn8d6Blgcf4EUysdEu3bO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lk9qVzvPHuL2vX9ixNut9n0KfYD.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7pZtTbxn8d6Blgcf4EUysdEu3bO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lk9qVzvPHuL2vX9ixNut9n0KfYD.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11208,"title":"Wicker Park","description":"Matthew, a young advertising executive in Chicago, puts his life and a business trip to China on hold when he thinks he sees Lisa, the love of his life who left him without a word two years earlier, walking out of a restaurant one day.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Drama","Mystery","Romance","Thriller"],"release_date":"2004-09-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.o