 artist Son Goku. However, unlike his predecessor he''s not a brave fighter. He''s constantly picked on by school bullies, his grandmother Pan sees this and she''s worried, but even though Goku Jr. is not a strong and powerful Saiyan, he has a kind heart, and Pan loves him. When Pan gets sick Goku Jr. realizes he must do something if he doesn''t want to lose Pan. Then he will remember about the legends of the Dragon Balls. It was told they granted a wish to the bearer, Goku Jr. needs a magical wish more than ever.","duration":"0:45:00","genre":["Adventure","Action","Animation","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1997-03-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lesSOGpRuJwebgtL4vNkoRFnbil.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/reNPMjkPg9f6wgf6kHSSkKjBarL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lesSOGpRuJwebgtL4vNkoRFnbil.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//reNPMjkPg9f6wgf6kHSSkKjBarL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9270,"title":"Brick","description":"A teenage loner pushes his way into the underworld of a high school crime ring to investigate the disappearance of his ex-girlfriend.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Drama","Mystery","Crime"],"release_date":"2006-03-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sDr2KjWpEbJ8M1F88rEmhoczLkX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5WVk8JpNIxepn4fpZzQeCumkOL5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sDr2KjWpEbJ8M1F88rEmhoczLkX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5WVk8JpNIxepn4fpZzQeCumkOL5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8835,"title":"Legally Blonde","description":"Fashionable sorority queen Elle Woods has it all, but, she wants nothing more than to be Mrs. Warner Huntington III. But he dumps her before heading to Harvard Law School. Elle rallies all of her resources and gets into Harvard, determined to win him back. While there, she figures out that there is more to hers