rking on the one track that will set the world on fire. Opportunity comes knocking when he meets James Reed, a charismatic DJ who takes the 23-year-old under his wing. Soon, his seemingly clear path to success gets complicated when he starts falling for his mentor''s girlfriend, jeopardizing his new friendship and the future he seems destined to fulfill.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Drama","Music","Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"2015-08-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bTme7w566uEyoJLR8gA1fwKsECY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7RzpN4aLjM5FUc7Q3WsvNn2MuaR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bTme7w566uEyoJLR8gA1fwKsECY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7RzpN4aLjM5FUc7Q3WsvNn2MuaR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":37768,"title":"Talcum Powder","description":"Sergio Benvenuti is a shy seller of contracts for a Roman company of music, but because of his character he cannot find even a customer, so he asks for help from a fellow named Nadia.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1982-01-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mdyeJRmLW3IPCo0e1oEmR8WBklm.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2IMlCia3G1EoI2fetNZkCVEkAzq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mdyeJRmLW3IPCo0e1oEmR8WBklm.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2IMlCia3G1EoI2fetNZkCVEkAzq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":34193,"title":"Magic","description":"A ventriloquist is at the mercy of his vicious dummy while he tries to renew a romance with his high school sweetheart.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Drama","Horror"],"release_date":"1978-11-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/o0qTNliLQK7t31UVSNQBvxj8dpN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nkDUIHyr7MlDRgbHv98YbH0jvYr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//o0qTNliLQK7t31