ce of power in four couples’ relationships is upset when the women start using the advice in Steve Harvey’s book, Act Like A Lady, Think Like A Man, to get more of what they want from their men. When the men realize that the women have gotten a hold of their relationship “playbook,” they decide that the best defense is a good offense and come up with a plan to use this information to their advantage.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2012-04-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/c8kjrMDDKrlpikQTgvNGLBZh5V8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kfIrKVPDzXJDBzPnFEuoatlaZPW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//c8kjrMDDKrlpikQTgvNGLBZh5V8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kfIrKVPDzXJDBzPnFEuoatlaZPW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":991494,"title":"The SpongeBob Movie: Search for SquarePants","description":"Desperate to be a big guy, SpongeBob sets out to prove his bravery to Mr. Krabs by following The Flying Dutchman – a mysterious swashbuckling ghost pirate – on a seafaring adventure that takes him to the deepest depths of the deep sea, where no Sponge has gone before.","duration":"1:28:00","genre":["Adventure","Family","Animation","Comedy","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2025-12-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pMxO1beNNFYMDM7RcDyKW5Wheuz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xJnOMMsFASxNiFnG7v3TNIQ3ife.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pMxO1beNNFYMDM7RcDyKW5Wheuz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xJnOMMsFASxNiFnG7v3TNIQ3ife.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":352161,"title":"The Clan","description":"In Argentina, between 1982 and 1985, the Puccios, a well-established family of San Isidro, an upper-class suburb of Buenos Aires, kidnap several people and hold them as hostages for a ransom.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Drama","History","Crime"],"release_date