g at a cabin in Niagara Falls. The couple befriend Polly and Ray Cutler, who are honeymooning in the area. Polly begins to suspect that something is amiss between Rose and George, and her suspicions grow when she sees Rose in the arms of another man. While Ray initially thinks Polly is overreacting, things between George and Rose soon take a shockingly dark turn.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"1953-01-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ctUWlPJ0jLYkwyXjvofdQjtRdgu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wb9OBAiO3aUpY4UBkE07KscXSkA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ctUWlPJ0jLYkwyXjvofdQjtRdgu.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wb9OBAiO3aUpY4UBkE07KscXSkA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15247,"title":"The Ipcress File","description":"Sly and dry intelligence agent Harry Palmer is tasked with investigating British Intelligence security, and is soon enmeshed in a world of double-dealing, kidnap and murder when he finds a traitor operating at the heart of the secret service.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Thriller"],"release_date":"1965-03-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/y7qyru5dzEGk6QUO8ZobgfVbF2b.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iCNRK7NVhBvNpiyMRmCpTBFNoLO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//y7qyru5dzEGk6QUO8ZobgfVbF2b.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iCNRK7NVhBvNpiyMRmCpTBFNoLO.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14635,"title":"The Rookie","description":"Jim Morris never made it out of the minor leagues before a shoulder injury ended his pitching career twelve years ago. Now a married-with-children high-school chemistry teacher and baseball coach in Texas, Jim''s team makes a deal with him: if they win the district championship, Jim will try out with a major-league organization. The bet proves incentive enough for the team, and they go from worst to first, making it to state for the first time in the history of the school. Jim, forced to live up to his end of the deal, is nearly laughed off the try-out field--until he gets onto the mound, where he confounds the scouts (and himself) by clocking successive 98 mph fastballs, good enough for a minor-league contract with the Tampa Bay Devil Rays. Jim''s still got a lot of pitches to throw before he makes it to The Show, but with his big-league dreams revived, there''s no telling where he could go.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Drama","Family"],"release_date":"2002-03-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gf5ahmfnGuM02RJyoETKQXTLft0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gNmLsseIs6thkBKne91iQZDGyBT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gf5ahmfnGuM02RJyoETKQXTLft0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gNmLsseIs6thkBKne91iQZDGyBT.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11235,"title":"Local Hero","description":"An American oil company sends a man to Scotland to buy up an entire village where they want to build a refinery. But things don''t go as expected.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1983-02-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tfiFC0pw1ccJFBkYkhP9uWeQ1S1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jqxD0H9a1rg5bXftsm6gsNOjt4n.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tfiFC0pw1ccJFBkYkhP9uWeQ1S1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jqxD0H9a1rg5bXftsm6gsNOjt4n.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":7010,"title":"The Wild Geese","description":"A British multinational company seeks to overthrow a vicious dictator in central Africa. It hires a band of (largely aged) mercenaries in London and sends them in to save the virtuous but imprisoned opposition leader who is also critically ill and due for execution. Just when the team has performed a perfect rescue, the multinational does a deal with the vicious dictator leaving the mercenary band to escape under their own steam and exact revenge.","duration":"2:14:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Thriller","War"],"release_date":"1978-06-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/egamWHfqdyHwHHHTFp6hyjG0hT9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sISC4RURtA5l8QXcnVgK3dP0VHn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//egamWHfqdyHwHHHTFp6hyjG0hT9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sISC4RURtA5l8QXcnVgK3dP0VHn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2652,"title":"Hard Candy","description":"Hayley’s a smart, charming teenage girl. Jeff’s a handsome, smooth fashion photographer. An Internet chat, a coffee shop meet-up, an impromptu fashion shoot back at Jeff’s place. Jeff thinks it’s his lucky night. He’s in for a surprise.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2006-04-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9uYq1A9mx4wvQ8J6OF8BXUntciQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uHTmlcivbPeclEdmtuQg3zOQWPS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9uYq1A9mx4wvQ8J6OF8BXUntciQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uHTmlcivbPeclEdmtuQg3zOQWPS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1405338,"title":"Demon City","description":"Framed for his family''s murder and left for dead, an ex-hitman will stop at nothing to exact revenge on the masked \"demons\" who have taken over his city.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Fantasy","Thriller"],"release_date":"2025-02-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hD2SN5bbqxk0kcRmsATJkXObgnZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fQ9hzto0cUuxjfzqNAiAnNJo8O7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hD2SN5bbqxk0kcRmsATJkXObgnZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fQ9hzto0cUuxjfzqNAiAnNJo8O7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":76332