n life-form arrives on a comet from the Dark Gaseous Nebula and proceeds to consume pollution. Spewing mists of sulfuric acid and corrosive sludge, neither humanity nor Godzilla may be able to defeat this toxic menace.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Action","Horror"],"release_date":"1971-07-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xuVoIUhiV41rnUG8I9obCAW8iJi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mWVRlVwWK3sUCGd9lzMMWUa7CBu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xuVoIUhiV41rnUG8I9obCAW8iJi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mWVRlVwWK3sUCGd9lzMMWUa7CBu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12504,"title":"The Outsider","description":"Philippe Jordan is a policeman prone to advancing the cause of justice by any means necessary. On his agenda is a powerful drug cartel working out of Paris and Marseilles, with a drug lord who is essentially inaccessible -- but not immortal.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"1983-10-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pSjh05C0JIA583CKToVSY4pMz4z.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/li1IrkJldDlHNm8DtcA79b251fS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pSjh05C0JIA583CKToVSY4pMz4z.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//li1IrkJldDlHNm8DtcA79b251fS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":318917,"title":"Look Who''s Back","description":"When Adolf Hitler reawakens at the site of his former bunker in present-day Berlin, he is mistaken for a comedian and quickly becomes a media phenomenon.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2015-10-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4j4OGz6msCN9HsxcVWtHUIHGUqe.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1CxZWytSiCzZiZA5k0AiLUFtQNA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4j4OGz6msCN9HsxcVWtHUIHGUqe.jpg","sma