hen a gruesome murder in Manhattan leaves detectives baffled, they call on Rhyme to help solve the mystery. Amelia Donaghy, a rookie cop whose quick thinking preserved a gruesome murder scene, is enlisted by Rhyme to be his on-the-scene forensics expert. With Amelia reluctantly acting as Rhyme''s able-bodied go-between, the pair piece together cryptic clues the killer leaves behind at the scene of the crime, hoping to catch the grisly serial killer.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller","Drama","Mystery"],"release_date":"1999-11-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hMclNPye6G3ouN5QdusrlTK0SaE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7atMCqRaDpAOnGsteTRm17zmvN3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hMclNPye6G3ouN5QdusrlTK0SaE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7atMCqRaDpAOnGsteTRm17zmvN3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":7012,"title":"The Day After","description":"In the mid-1980s, the U.S. is poised on the brink of nuclear war. This shadow looms over the residents of a small town in Kansas as they continue their daily lives. Dr. Russell Oakes maintains his busy schedule at the hospital, Denise Dahlberg prepares for her upcoming wedding, and Stephen Klein is deep in his graduate studies. When the unthinkable happens and the bombs come down, the town''s residents are thrust into the horrors of nuclear winter.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Drama","TV Movie"],"release_date":"1983-12-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AfBGTLp9JtsWNUJC6rP1U1XCPCE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/brieV17D6R6HcubOqehLNYuxnvs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AfBGTLp9JtsWNUJC6rP1U1XCPCE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//brieV17D6R6HcubOqehLNYuxnvs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2179,"title":"Tenacious D in The Pick of Destiny","description":"In Venice Beach, naive Midwesterne