nastics academy run by a legendary, hard-nosed coach. Once there, Haley''s rebellious attitude wins her both friends and enemies.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2006-04-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/81DlYvzoxYjPzFAxs6ruTRZzFRL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uMcylxIC7nBpBd8Uf6Apr4MJ1pf.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//81DlYvzoxYjPzFAxs6ruTRZzFRL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uMcylxIC7nBpBd8Uf6Apr4MJ1pf.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1001865,"title":"Scrooge: A Christmas Carol","description":"On a cold Christmas Eve, selfish miser Ebenezer Scrooge has one night left to face his past — and change the future — before time runs out.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2022-11-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wMNY6tU9WOUeAMRfqbCYwceOl9u.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oyGb5JpEYMEqDDjfJKLEvPTVSjK.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wMNY6tU9WOUeAMRfqbCYwceOl9u.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oyGb5JpEYMEqDDjfJKLEvPTVSjK.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":253331,"title":"Black or White","description":"A grieving widower is drawn into a custody battle over his granddaughter, whom he helped raise her entire life.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2015-01-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/759wfisWoD7eJZmi1wi6Y0cW3jw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hOxxudUwgh5KGC7LtxDCkkwn1YP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//759wfisWoD7eJZmi1wi6Y0cW3jw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hOxxudUwgh5KGC7LtxDCkkwn1YP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":228161,"title":"Home","description":"When Earth is taken over by the overly-confident Boov, an alien race in search of a new place to call home, all humans are promptly relocated, while all Boov get busy reorganizing the planet. But when one resourceful girl, Tip, manages to avoid capture, she finds herself the accidental accomplice of a banished Boov named Oh. The two fugitives realize there’s a lot more at stake than intergalactic relations as they embark on the road trip of a lifetime.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Fantasy","Comedy","Animation","Science Fiction","Family"],"release_date":"2015-03-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gnkBzJVH2zicIopP2fHf4kRElne.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/usFenYnk6mr8C62dB1MoAfSWMGR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gnkBzJVH2zicIopP2fHf4kRElne.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//usFenYnk6mr8C62dB1MoAfSWMGR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":86004,"title":"Talaash","description":"A cop, investigating the mysterious death of a filmstar, meets a sex-worker, while he faces some personal problems psychologically. The mystery connects these people in a way, that ultimately changes their lives.","duration":"2:29:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2012-11-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aJIojufZhl5JG42rJ0H3LsMxId6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oCxyN7HmJ7zWp8jtJeMRHABnutF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aJIojufZhl5JG42rJ0H3LsMxId6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oCxyN7HmJ7zWp8jtJeMRHABnutF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":47943,"title":"With a Friend Like Harry...","description":"While fixing up their summer cottage, Michel and his family run into a man who claims to have gone to high school with Michel.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Drama","Mystery"],"release_date":"2000-08-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mgNMFGVUezUAgOPJ57N2toQ7d6z.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tQ6Ut3kPOpo3l