.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8Ua4voSMwqzlL8DzYi6dOOe1Dxw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//t2voKheYY22L3IM18oavWN164Da.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8Ua4voSMwqzlL8DzYi6dOOe1Dxw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1946,"title":"eXistenZ","description":"A game designer on the run from assassins must play her latest virtual reality creation with a marketing trainee to determine if the game has been damaged.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1999-04-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vgPBS3To8IuQ1sY1l9G97dqcsq2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kETKF0JhdTPn1knci8CAdYL0d79.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vgPBS3To8IuQ1sY1l9G97dqcsq2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kETKF0JhdTPn1knci8CAdYL0d79.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":496,"title":"Borat: Cultural Learnings of America for Make Benefit Glorious Nation of Kazakhstan","description":"Kazakh journalist Borat Sagdiyev travels to America to make a documentary. As he zigzags across the nation, Borat meets real people in real situations with hysterical consequences. His backwards behavior generates strong reactions around him exposing prejudices and hypocrisies in American culture.","duration":"1:24:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2006-11-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mEagEZkyUp18shDqX05w4zxTnEM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7g9kBHMN2KTr5KUf8aen187Mdn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mEagEZkyUp18shDqX05w4zxTnEM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7g9kBHMN2KTr5KUf8aen187Mdn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":974931,"title":"Totally Killer","description":"When the infamous \"Sweet Sixteen Killer\" returns 35 years after his first murder spree to claim another victim, 17-year-old Jamie accidentally travels back in time to 19