ood Vengeance 3D follows Xiaoyu Ling, seasoned martial artist and high school student, tasked by the G Corporation to infiltrate an international school in Kyoto to gather information on the mysterious student Shin Kamiya. Before she can make any progress in the investigation, Shin is kidnapped by an unknown assailant. Digging deeper into Shin’s background in an attempt to rescue him, Xiaoyu learns about the frightening underbelly of the Mishima Zaibatsu. Jin Kazama, Kazuya Mishima… and the late Heihachi Mishima’s conspiracy that’s stained with blood.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Action","Animation","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2011-07-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xWoQPSqJxB8P6Non8kyMSvtna9Y.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nYfa9yK6LlbE9K4U7Ved815RgMM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xWoQPSqJxB8P6Non8kyMSvtna9Y.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nYfa9yK6LlbE9K4U7Ved815RgMM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4307,"title":"The Flower of My Secret","description":"Middle-aged romance author Leo writes under a pseudonym, since she despises her own work. At home, her husband, who works overseas, is distant both physically and emotionally. As she reevaluates her life and writing, Leo is led to an unexpected relationship with Ángel, a sensitive newspaper editor.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1995-09-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kbY2KsmwyFiRYtO0f9Xwd3cV9tZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/t4ctWrXgjE1U8l0BKmebEfcLT5Z.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kbY2KsmwyFiRYtO0f9Xwd3cV9tZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//t4ctWrXgjE1U8l0BKmebEfcLT5Z.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9647,"title":"Scrooged","description":"Frank Cross is a wildly successful television executive whose cold ambition and curmudgeonly nature has driven away the love of his life. But after firing a staff member on Christmas Eve, Frank is visited by a series of ghosts who give him a chance to re-evaluate his actions and right the wrongs of his past.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Fantasy","Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1988-11-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6Cld2xtKYfWnWK3w3gfJRRA82vd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uO0znfB2ZzTXA1IS7jkrjNbpkYK.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6Cld2xtKYfWnWK3w3gfJRRA82vd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uO0znfB2ZzTXA1IS7jkrjNbpkYK.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8905,"title":"Three Monkeys","description":"A family battles against the odds to stay together when small lies grow into an extravagant cover-up. In order to avoid hardship and responsibilities that would otherwise be impossible to endure, the family chooses to ignore the truth, not to see, hear or talk about it. But does playing “Three Monkeys” invalidate the truth of its existence?","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2008-05-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tD7zvUWcx6Uw54GiE0xzpGK15pT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tyIKP8SSTkw9xEXAG9lj5jEnIfW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tD7zvUWcx6Uw54GiE0xzpGK15pT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tyIKP8SSTkw9xEXAG9lj5jEnIfW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1701,"title":"Con Air","description":"Newly-paroled former US Army ranger Cameron Poe is headed back to his wife, but must fly home aboard a prison transport flight dubbed \"Jailbird\" taking the “worst of the worst” prisoners, a group described as “pure predators”, to a new super-prison. Poe faces impossible odds when the transport plane is skyjacked mid-flight by the most vicious criminals in the country led by the mastermind — genius serial killer Cyrus \"The Virus\" Grissom, and backed by black militant Diamond Dog and psychopath Billy Bedlam.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"1997-06-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vsmlShNNHrYlERZaqMOsZ3YctoO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kOKjgrEzGOP92rVQ6srA9jtp60l.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vsmlShNNHrYlERZaqMOsZ3YctoO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kOKjgrEzGOP92rVQ6srA9jtp60l.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":484638,"title":"15 Minutes of War","description":"February 1976. Somalian rebels hijack a school bus carrying 21 French children and their teacher in Djibouti City. When the terrorists drive it to a no-man’s-land on the border between Somalia and French territory, the French Government sends out a newly formed elite squad to rescue the hostages. Within a few hours, the highly trained team arrives to the crisis area, where the Somalian National Army has taken position behind the barbed wire on the border. The French unit is left with very few options to rescue the hostages. As the volatile situation unravels, the French men quickly come up with a daring plan: carry out a simultaneous 5 men sniper attack to get the children and the teacher out safely. A true story.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["War","Action","Drama","History"],"release_date":"2019-01-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u4PhTSMSvlE7dE45I7ktXlje2Ea.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mHXzqCiAmgVhhJscGJIQH94vac0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u4PhTSMSvlE7dE45I7ktXlje2Ea.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mHXzqCiAmgVhhJscGJIQH94vac0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":426249,"title":"Lords of Chaos","description":"A teenager''s quest to launch Norwegian Black Metal in Oslo in the 1990s results in a very violent outcome.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Music"],"release_date":"20