enager Casey Welson is abducted in the back of a man''s car and calls 911, Jordan is the one called upon to use all of her experience, insights and quick thinking to help Casey escape, and not just to save her, but to make sure the man is brought to justice.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2013-03-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9jih8et3fkd0Zdo4NHf3cnPj05Z.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mG334OlDVJpD8gMfTCM2Mpp0gQH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9jih8et3fkd0Zdo4NHf3cnPj05Z.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mG334OlDVJpD8gMfTCM2Mpp0gQH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":47292,"title":"Pokémon: Giratina and the Sky Warrior","description":"When Giratina is discovered to be able to create parallel dimensions, it''s up to Ash and his friends to stop a mysterious stranger from using its powers for evil.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Family","Adventure","Animation","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2008-07-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/b5NH2rjQFATYfkd1XYbGQWeyevx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e3T08IL68EVcrUPiJLVN9KSGlXs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//b5NH2rjQFATYfkd1XYbGQWeyevx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e3T08IL68EVcrUPiJLVN9KSGlXs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":30163,"title":"The Fugitives","description":"Coming out from jail, Lucas has decided to change his life and behave like a good citizen. But when he is taken hostage in a bank by a hare-brained robber, no cops can believe he is not part of the action.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1986-12-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cbz3HdoFVFmd49CVpWG2OzuT4dT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dmrVlsTFOW6RRUpEANVpiOytHFK.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cbz3HdoFVFmd49CVpWG2OzuT4dT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dmrVlsTFOW6RRUpEANVpiOytHFK.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15394,"title":"Owning Mahowny","description":"Dan Mahowny was a rising star at the Canadian Imperial Bank of Commerce. At twenty-four he was assistant manager of a major branch in the heart of Toronto''s financial district. To his colleagues he was a workaholic. To his customers, he was astute, decisive and helpful. To his friends, he was a quiet, but humorous man who enjoyed watching sports on television. To his girlfriend, he was shy but engaging. None of them knew the other side of Dan Mahowny--the side that executed the largest single-handed bank fraud in Canadian history, grossing over $10 million in eighteen months to feed his gambling obsession.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2003-05-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/EZzC6VIaZDHLmtLv80kcQFWDa4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xQYKqpN6fD7Dc7Vu8xnShHPKDwe.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//EZzC6VIaZDHLmtLv80kcQFWDa4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xQYKqpN6fD7Dc7Vu8xnShHPKDwe.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13339,"title":"Three O''Clock High","description":"Nerdy high schooler Jerry Mitchell is assigned to write an article for the school paper about the infamous new delinquent transfer student, Buddy Revell. When Jerry accidentally invades Buddy''s personal space and touches him, Buddy challenges Jerry to an afterschool fight in the parking lot, which Jerry tries to avoid at all costs.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1987-10-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hrD8UN3J7XMC2b9ponFzGDk0kYG.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wwnIIgCTAb1JZD5txcQAAaesW7W.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hrD8UN3J7XMC2b9ponFzGDk0kYG.jpg","small_poster_