y did kill the Master Sergeant.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Mystery","Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"1984-09-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/95Dwih7xB72mlT9cwrQ8aOlZSDo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vSLrddsvH8bJzryOS5BD9qtTtFa.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//95Dwih7xB72mlT9cwrQ8aOlZSDo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vSLrddsvH8bJzryOS5BD9qtTtFa.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10427,"title":"Red Rock West","description":"When a promised job for Texan Michael fails to materialize in Wyoming, Mike is mistaken by Wayne to be the hitman he hired to kill his unfaithful wife, Suzanne. Mike takes full advantage of the situation, collects the money, and runs. During his getaway, things go wrong, and soon get worse when he runs into the real hitman, Lyle.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"1993-05-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/awzAeboEEQxTd0FH60Hn9JbVZIA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ewofUEqU3Gpr7WSgSz3TEVPIfBg.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//awzAeboEEQxTd0FH60Hn9JbVZIA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ewofUEqU3Gpr7WSgSz3TEVPIfBg.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":744276,"title":"After Ever Happy","description":"As a shocking truth about a couple''s families emerges, the two lovers discover they are not so different from each other. Tessa is no longer the sweet, simple, good girl she was when she met Hardin — any more than he is the cruel, moody boy she fell so hard for.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2022-08-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rwgmDkIEv8VjAsWx25ottJrFvpO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/moogpu8rNkEjTgFyLXwhPghft5w.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rwgmDkIEv8VjAsWx25ottJrFvpO.jpg",