e love for each other keeps them in the fight.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2022-01-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tUYotMWdNGXtH22cs7p3a7c19PS.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5sw1EvOeXMGRZGWr18R4EiZs036.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tUYotMWdNGXtH22cs7p3a7c19PS.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5sw1EvOeXMGRZGWr18R4EiZs036.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":538207,"title":"We Die Young","description":"Lucas, a 14-year-old boy inducted into the gang life in Washington D.C., is determined that his 10-year-old brother won''t follow the same path. When an Afghanistan war veteran comes into the neighborhood, an opportunity arises.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Drama","Action","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2019-05-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mYU1NFj8U99yX4sXEGcvEGQ7RQG.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1rvsmRHfjIalt2LBDrEkyKFOQgo.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mYU1NFj8U99yX4sXEGcvEGQ7RQG.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1rvsmRHfjIalt2LBDrEkyKFOQgo.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":452558,"title":"Paradox","description":"When a Hong Kong police negotiator is informed about the sudden disappearance of his 16-year-old daughter in Thailand,  he travels there to search for her whereabouts.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2017-08-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nNy9b1jS0sswrbfcSJ4PYrAEPOY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/c8cLJXp0DzUtpRUyszFZMPAwUTA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nNy9b1jS0sswrbfcSJ4PYrAEPOY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//c8cLJXp0DzUtpRUyszFZMPAwUTA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":424781,"title":"Sorry to Bother You","description":"In an 