 FBI rival as well as the media.","duration":"2:11:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2001-02-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3Nb9AQaq3elLNCUBxG8VprmqfhZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/v5wAZwRqpGWmyAaaJ8BBHYuNXnj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3Nb9AQaq3elLNCUBxG8VprmqfhZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//v5wAZwRqpGWmyAaaJ8BBHYuNXnj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9443,"title":"Chariots of Fire","description":"In the class-obsessed and religiously divided UK of the early 1920s, two determined young runners train for the 1924 Paris Olympics. Eric Liddell, a devout Christian born to Scottish missionaries in China, sees running as part of his worship of God''s glory and refuses to train or compete on the Sabbath. Harold Abrahams overcomes anti-Semitism and class bias, but neglects his beloved sweetheart in his single-minded quest.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"1981-05-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nEeq7iQDbsj4qRt9E11PvQOWKvQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qnRaum8k0HqGRml2i7OawFqUtEb.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nEeq7iQDbsj4qRt9E11PvQOWKvQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qnRaum8k0HqGRml2i7OawFqUtEb.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8871,"title":"How the Grinch Stole Christmas","description":"The Grinch decides to rob Whoville of Christmas - but a dash of kindness from little Cindy Lou Who and her family may be enough to melt his heart...","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Family","Comedy","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2000-11-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sy0vo1cmpKqwPRiMUiJ45jyLsX7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1WZbbPApEivA421gCOluuzMMKCk.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sy0vo1cmpKqwPRiMUiJ45jyLsX7.j