h":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5PnypKiSj2efSPqThNjTXz8jwOg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9pCoqX24a6rE981fY1O3PmhiwrB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5PnypKiSj2efSPqThNjTXz8jwOg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9pCoqX24a6rE981fY1O3PmhiwrB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":396373,"title":"Woman Walks Ahead","description":"Based on a true story, this riveting western follows a headstrong New York widow as she journeys west to meet Sioux chief Sitting Bull, facing off with an army officer intent on war with Native Americans.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Drama","History","Western"],"release_date":"2018-06-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eFpSaFzmP916Vf0QdEJSE9M0uOO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qI5NcQHR0nsykPqlG2qnfFyMgW6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eFpSaFzmP916Vf0QdEJSE9M0uOO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qI5NcQHR0nsykPqlG2qnfFyMgW6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":267463,"title":"The 10 Year Plan","description":"Myles and Brody are best friends with two very different ways of finding love. Displeased with their current love lives, they make a pact to be together if neither finds love in ten year’s time. Now two months shy of their deadline, both friends set off to do whatever it takes to avoid ending up as each other’s last resort.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"2014-09-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zmITCoQrARbYoNh3vm3tOpO1cKY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/x2oJPcyydaL997oaDQhcCt4xGgD.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zmITCoQrARbYoNh3vm3tOpO1cKY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//x2oJPcyydaL997oaDQhcCt4xGgD.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":256917,"title":"The Water Diviner","description":"In 1919, Australian farmer Joshua Connor travels to Turkey to discover the fate of his three sons, reported missing in action. Holding on to hope, Joshua must travel across the war-torn landscape to find the truth and his own peace.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["War","Drama"],"release_date":"2014-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ixJQ8u7lnCO1j7ldHAOzv3UF5Hz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kIlVtC22BDNiiAiCvSZoOS7FhY9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ixJQ8u7lnCO1j7ldHAOzv3UF5Hz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kIlVtC22BDNiiAiCvSZoOS7FhY9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":56415,"title":"A Gang Story","description":"After growing up in a poor gypsy camp, Edmond Vidal, aka Momon, has retained a sense of family, unfailing loyalty and pride in his origins. Most of all, he has remained friends with Serge Suttel, with whom he first discovered prison life - for stealing cherries. The two of them inevitably got involved in organized crime. The team they formed, the Ganf Des Lyonnais, made them the most notorious armed robbers of the early 1970s. Their irresistible rise ended in 1974 with a spectacular arrest. Today, as he nears 60, Momon would like to forget that part of his life. He has found peace by retiring from the \"business\". He tends to his wife Janou, who suffered so in the past, and to his children and grandchildren, all of whom have great respect for this man of simple and universal values, so clear-headed and full of kindness. But then Serge Suttel, who has disowned nothing of his past, comes back into the picture.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2011-11-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pzmWjjE7jZVMiTipQSdHykaV2bZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nN3osmlYWNZZtg8vtXrt8c5t8ET.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pzmWjjE7jZVMiTipQSdHykaV2bZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nN3osmlYWNZZtg8vtXrt8c5t8ET.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":36897,"title":"Pokémon: Mewtwo Returns","description":"The Team Rocket leader, Giovanni, has found Mewtwo in a remote area of the Johto region. As Giovanni tries to re-capture Mewtwo, Ash and his friends are kidnapped by Domino, a new Team Rocket member, while trying to rescue Pikachu from Jessie and James. The Clone Pokemon are also captured and are then used as bait for Mewtwo. The situation then becomes a battle between the wills of Mewtwo and Giovanni; and Mewtwo also tries to discover if it and the clones have a purpose in life, even though they are products of science.","duration":"1:03:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2001-08-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pJszL2mPl084IDSzLDPH8NqIq0r.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zIYljUBF2rXzB0yYZVEPY1l8zHp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pJszL2mPl084IDSzLDPH8NqIq0r.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zIYljUBF2rXzB0yYZVEPY1l8zHp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":19025,"title":"Bhool Bhulaiyaa","description":"NRI Siddharth Chaturvedi and his wife Avni return to Siddharth''s family''s ancestral Varanasi palace while disregarding warnings of a curse and paranormal phenomena. Soon enough, inexplicable events begin occuring, which forces Siddharth to consult the eccentric psychiatrist Aditya Shrivastav to help solve the mystery.","duration":"2:38:00","genre":["Comedy","Horror","Thriller"],"release_date":"2007-10-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yflnRLYid6ySzTaPzoZeZ7cpwkZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/r5p19XzY9g3j3whIXHGL1NKRTJf.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yflnRLYid6ySzTaPzoZeZ7cpwkZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//r5p19XzY9g3j3whIXHGL1NKRTJf.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11022,"title":"Narc","description":"Narcotics Sergeant Nick Tellis, on leave after a trauma, is called back to investigate the murder of fellow undercover operative Michael Calvess, joined by the victim''s unpredictable and brutal ex-partner, Henry Oak. Working together in the back alleys of Detroit, Tellis and Oak delve into a dark investigation that leads them to uncover shocking secrets and question the corruption and morality within the department, encountering unorthodox methods and a brutal truth about Calvess''s death.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Crime","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2002-01-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lu1eTRsyZztMmfR5Q30k2jFPMri.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uGHFyVdMQKvIXlsLAoXa5nOUGF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lu1eTRsyZztMmfR5Q30k2jFPMri.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uGHFyVdMQKvIXlsLAoXa5nOUGF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":3784,"title":"Frankie and Johnny","description":"When Johnny is released from prison following a forgery charge, he quickly lands a job as a short-order cook at a New York diner. Following a brief fling with waitress Cora, he develops an attraction for Cora''s friend and fellow waitress Frankie. While Frankie resists Johnny''s charms initially, she eventually relents when her best friend, Tim, persuades her to give Johnny a chance.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"1991-10-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mXn2VhwaRKAKahulvqLdM5i3t7D.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zSOh7hriX4mQNVxhCz1yVY4aykn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mXn2VhwaRKAKahulvqLdM5i3t7D.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zSOh7hriX4mQNVxhCz1yVY4aykn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1172675,"title":"The Swan","description":"Two large, ignorant bullies ruthlessly pursue a small, brilliant boy in this young adult Roald Dahl short story.","duration":"0:17:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2023-09-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oIUDSK3CCqkpe6lct8YPuUupFes.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fRbx6DPdQBJrhZWyshjJABtAIyu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oIUDSK3CCqkpe6lct8YPuUupFes.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fRbx6DPdQBJrhZWyshjJABtAIyu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":788977,"title":"Cairo Conspiracy","description":"A fisherman''s son is offered the ultimate privilege to study at the Al-Azhar University in Cairo, the epicenter of power of Sunni Islam. Shortly after his arrival, the university’s highest ranking religious leader, the Grand Imam, dies and the young student becomes a pawn in a ruthless power struggle between Egypt''s religious and political elite.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Thriller"],"release_date":"2022-10-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5pUJhaYpDdmOiyMvCh3G1R6G1wi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zDRAA4UJWgQnSFxhJuefnwO74v5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5pUJhaYpDdmOiyMvCh3G1R6G1wi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zDRAA4UJWgQnSFxhJuefnwO74v5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":576071,"title":"Unplanned","description":"As one of the youngest Planned Parenthood clinic directors in the nation, Abby Johnson was involved in upwards of 22,000 abortions and counseled countless women on their reproductive choices. Her passion surrounding a woman''s right to choose led her to become a spokesperson for Planned Parenthood, fighting to enact legislation for the cause she so deeply believed in. Until the day she saw something that changed everything.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2019-03-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qus9J3gLXDc1U2czHKtKvxhJtrJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tvCtAz8z5tF49a7q9RRHvxiTjzv.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qus9J3gLXDc1U2czHKtKvxhJtrJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tvCtAz8z5tF49a7q9RRHvxiTjzv.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":61667,"title":"We Have a Pope","description":"The newly elected Pope suffers a panic attack just as he is about to greet the faithful who have gathered to see him. His advisors, unable to convince him he is the right man for the job, call on a renowned therapist who also happens to be an atheist. But the Pope''s fear of his newfound responsibility is one he must face alone. Winner Best Film at the Italian Golden Globes.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2011-04-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sMKgMj6pe0Ry7oNaPrXCUeXEIYx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8C8AncIi7XKq7Sg0SlN58RXpuqd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sMKgMj6pe0Ry7oNaPrXCUeXEIYx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8C8AncIi7XKq7Sg0SlN58RXpuqd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":51052,"title":"Arthur Christmas","description":"For hundreds of years, the Claus family has delegated the title \"Santa\" to a chosen few of its members, which can be passed down upon retirement. Each Christmas, Santa and his vast army of highly trained elves produce gifts and distribute them around the world in a one-night high-tech operation. However, when one of 600 million children to receive a gift from Santa on Christmas Eve is missed, it is deemed ‘acceptable’ to all but one—Arthur Claus, the current Santa’s misfit son deemed ineligible for the title, who executes an unauthorised rookie mission to get the last present halfway around the globe before dawn on Christmas morning.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Drama","Animation","Family","Comedy"],"release_date":"2011-11-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hwtYE4Gs0IsBnrJ0nTZItOXlz19.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/brELZkSbkLrcCXJ0xt5hQUMXhut.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hwtYE4Gs0IsBnrJ0nTZItOXlz19.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//brELZkSbkLrcCXJ0xt5hQUMXhut.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":44251,"title":"Dragon Ball Z: Broly - Second Coming","description":"A Saiyan Space pod crash-lands on Earth out of which a wounded Saiyan crawls: Broly, the Legendary Super Saiyan. The wounded Broly shouts out in frustration and turns into normal form. The place soon freezes, trapping him in it and he falls into a coma.","duration":"0:48:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1994-03-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2WTjYoswcKZTQrokeUOhY3Xb3mZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/Apnw8FWoPOIsu14d5dvaNZzFSJE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2WTjYoswcKZTQrokeUOhY3Xb3mZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//Apnw8FWoPOIsu14d5dvaNZzFSJE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8456,"title":"Never Back Down","description":"Jake, full of anger after his father''s death, is just starting to find a place for himself at his new Orlando high school - until Ryan, head of an underground MMA fight club, picks Jake out as a prime opponent. After being trounced by Ryan in front of the entire school, Jake begins training under the firm, moral guidance of a MMA master, where he learns how to fight... and how to avoid a fight. But it becomes obvious that a rematch will be inevitable if Jake wants to stop Ryan and his bullying, once and for all.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Drama","Action"],"release_date":"2008-03-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/friU3sWmplu7NbBEQBUFHyulsyY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8oRUTyP1QAtGDMvRpKZyuyFPG0U.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//friU3sWmplu7NbBEQBUFHyulsyY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8oRUTyP1QAtGDMvRpKZyuyFPG0U.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":454,"title":"Romeo + Juliet","description":"In this contemporary take on William Shakespeare''s classic tragedy, the Montagues and Capulets have moved their ongoing feud to the sweltering suburb of Verona Beach, where Romeo and Juliet fall in love and secretly wed. Though the film is visually modern, the bard''s dialogue remains.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1996-11-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hoQBa4EK6KFS31sPBND9zMjARfb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dJCDUkXhfRdc4q8e4VCKEBbqzBT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hoQBa4EK6KFS31sPBND9zMjARfb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dJCDUkXhfRdc4q8e4VCKEBbqzBT.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":286519,"title":"Boychoir","description":"A troubled and angry 11-year-old orphan from a small Texas town, ends up at a Boy Choir school after the death of his single mother. Completely out of his element, he finds himself in a battle of wills with a demanding Choir Master who recognises a unique talent in this young boy as he pushes him to discover his creative heart and soul in music.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Music","Drama"],"release_date":"2015-03-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yDI3qXoKMGUGGz0E2zrkHw4PRt4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jh2xStYNXhSK5JYFUApMEqgn0yT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yDI3qXoKMGUGGz0E2zrkHw4PRt4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jh2xStYNXhSK5JYFUApMEqgn0yT.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":17101,"title":"Bleach the Movie: The DiamondDust Rebellion","description":"When an artifact known as the \"King''s Seal\" is stolen during transport from Soul Society, Hitsugaya Toushirou is assigned to retrieve it. Toushirou goes missing after a battle with the thieves, leading Seireitei to suspect him of treachery. They order his immediate capture and execution. Unwilling to believe him capable of such a crime, Ichigo, Rangiku, Rukia, and Renji set out to find Toushirou.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Action","Animation","Thriller"],"release_date":"2007-12-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vmuvk8DSUyk6IUyrvgyxZAAITmP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1PV8OKvHSYvgmdVnU2wcuzQGthP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vmuvk8DSUyk6IUyrvgyxZAAITmP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1PV8OKvHSYvgmdVnU2wcuzQGthP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10096,"title":"13 Going on 30","description":"After total humiliation at her thirteenth birthday party, Jenna Rink wants to just hide until she''s thirty. Thanks to some magic wishing dust, Jenna''s prayer has been answered. With a knockout body, a fabulous wardrobe, an athlete boyfriend, a dream job, and superstar friends, this can''t be a better life. But soon Jenna realizes that adult life isn’t as easy as she hoped for.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Comedy","Fantasy","Romance"],"release_date":"2004-04-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ld7UTOGzZSxIMbuYsb6eQ6QdN4h.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iNZdSIfhSCMtRILDNyhLn8UKeSG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ld7UTOGzZSxIMbuYsb6eQ6QdN4h.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iNZdSIfhSCMtRILDNyhLn8UKeSG.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5920,"title":"Le Mans","description":"Filmed during the annual 24-hour endurance race at Le Mans, Michael Delaney is a Porsche driver haunted by the memory of an accident at the previous year''s race in which a competing driver was killed. Delaney also finds himself increasingly infatuated with the man''s widow.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Action","Drama"],"release_date":"1971-06-23","backdrop_path"