onicle of a Handful of Truths","description":"A renowned Mexican journalist and documentary filmmaker living in Los Angeles, after being named the recipient of a prestigious international award, is compelled to return to his native country, unaware that this simple trip will push him to an existential limit.","duration":"2:39:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2022-10-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8xCL0U7CaDltwYI9327BU401IMp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3e6RA0CzFDC0pz5TqiRlbHcsc2n.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8xCL0U7CaDltwYI9327BU401IMp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3e6RA0CzFDC0pz5TqiRlbHcsc2n.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":643882,"title":"The Princess Switch: Switched Again","description":"When Duchess Margaret unexpectedly inherits the throne & hits a rough patch with Kevin, it’s up to Stacy to save the day before a new lookalike — party girl Fiona — foils their plans.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Family","Romance","Comedy","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2020-11-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zCHe8ckyufHVUZaoHu2DiF8evET.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4vOmeimnVCdojwvc4icyeYUCydJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zCHe8ckyufHVUZaoHu2DiF8evET.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4vOmeimnVCdojwvc4icyeYUCydJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":502422,"title":"Thunder Road","description":"A police officer faces a personal meltdown following a divorce and the death of his mother.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2018-09-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/g9uDiHKpk2LvzG3RlmtYZ3ybYZS.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ynljTdiGVUCJJ6THSZi22SBoQAR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//g9uDiHKpk2LvzG3RlmtYZ3ybYZS.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ynljTdiGVUCJJ6THSZi22SBoQAR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":417670,"title":"Loro 1","description":"\"Loro\", in two parts, is a period movie that chronicles, as a fiction story, events likely happened in Italy (or even made up) between 2006 and 2010.  \"Loro\" wants to suggest in portraits and glimps, through a composite constellation of characters, a moment in history, now definitively ended, which can be described in a very summary picture of the events as amoral, decadent but extraordinarily alive.  Additionally, \"Loro\" wishes to tell the story of some Italians, fresh and ancient people at the same time: souls from a modern imaginary Purgatory who, moved by heterogeneous intents like ambition, admiration, affection, curiosity, personal interests, establish to try and orbit around the walking Paradise that is the man named Silvio Berlusconi.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2018-04-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1KFHukSqkSRxsm2XStCAfNEksvK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jGuYfMTTz3oWLGF5zjE9Bhk5Yxy.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1KFHukSqkSRxsm2XStCAfNEksvK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jGuYfMTTz3oWLGF5zjE9Bhk5Yxy.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":956,"title":"Mission: Impossible III","description":"Retired from active duty, and training recruits for the Impossible Mission Force, agent Ethan Hunt faces the toughest foe of his career: Owen Davian, an international broker of arms and information, who''s as cunning as he is ruthless. Davian emerges to threaten Hunt and all that he holds dear – including the woman Hunt loves.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Adventure","Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2006-04-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bYKeB9uUcPmvikjouEEQ86uvPw9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vKGYCpmQyV9uHybWDzXuII8Los5.jpg","small