d Rose","description":"A young Scottish singer, Rose-Lynn Harlan, dreams of making it as a country artist in Nashville after being released from prison.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Music","Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2019-04-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/k18DGK5laMQJ8i79YnR509IzuKN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/79THplH9WM7y3gRPYM4dcC0IRPw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//k18DGK5laMQJ8i79YnR509IzuKN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//79THplH9WM7y3gRPYM4dcC0IRPw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":447034,"title":"Vita & Virginia","description":"Socialite Vita Sackville-West and literary icon Virginia Woolf run in different circles in 1920s London. Despite the odds, the two forge an unconventional affair, set against the backdrop of their own strikingly contemporary marriages.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2019-05-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aNzaviyNOvorkzP0G9eOJEIAlsW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kNsMRldqZgsinyFjwNn1UzC0iln.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aNzaviyNOvorkzP0G9eOJEIAlsW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kNsMRldqZgsinyFjwNn1UzC0iln.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":79379,"title":"Book of Dragons","description":"So you want to be a dragon trainer do you? Prepare yourself for adventure, excitement and training as Hiccup, Astrid, Toothless and Gobber tell the legend behind the Book of Dragons and reveal insider training secrets about new, never-before-seen dragons.","duration":"0:18:00","genre":["Fantasy","Animation","Action","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"2011-11-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6UbuK8pO1CwGYulMT5jhBaIt7sf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jDInObzAHYGsde02gTxL8B56HGT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.