re it, sets Peter off on a journey to complete three seemingly impossible tasks that will change the face of his town forever.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Animation","Adventure","Family","Fantasy","Comedy"],"release_date":"2023-03-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gNOyIDGW8YY6AYbz6nMvrVSHSXs.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cAoAgzOCxSytYBqqCQulhXNR3LB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gNOyIDGW8YY6AYbz6nMvrVSHSXs.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cAoAgzOCxSytYBqqCQulhXNR3LB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":654895,"title":"Run to You","description":"Gianni is a serial seducer but his life is destined to change when he meets Chiara, a beautiful woman who has had an accident and is paraplegic.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2022-03-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ljYHyD0ZOQqIKDjRyxHYzlmvY2t.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vWgcIHKARoGFtbEPP9Ut7y2fmoP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ljYHyD0ZOQqIKDjRyxHYzlmvY2t.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vWgcIHKARoGFtbEPP9Ut7y2fmoP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":568091,"title":"Fractured","description":"Driving cross-country, Ray and his wife and daughter stop at a highway rest area where his daughter falls and breaks her arm. After a frantic rush to the hospital and a clash with the check-in nurse, Ray is finally able to get her to a doctor. While the wife and daughter go downstairs for an MRI, Ray, exhausted, passes out in a chair in the lobby. Upon waking up, they have no record or knowledge of Ray''s family ever being checked in.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"2019-09-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6y4748yU4dnrI7jF2loGscmiVXQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/paZNRffT3kUckuRFKbeDB