enre":["Mystery","Adventure","Thriller"],"release_date":"1985-12-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/depMebS7tRuR8ebxghxdkIlnX3s.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aOxVYvQoAfNSns4hW5Ah55GBzgq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//depMebS7tRuR8ebxghxdkIlnX3s.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aOxVYvQoAfNSns4hW5Ah55GBzgq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":619930,"title":"Narvik","description":"April, 1940. The eyes of the world are on Narvik, a small town in northern Norway, a source of the iron ore needed for Hitler''s war machine. Through two months of fierce winter warfare, the German leader is dealt with his first defeat.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["War","Drama","History","Action"],"release_date":"2022-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ogFIG0fNXEYRQKrpnoRJcXQNX9n.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iTqTgxTNs1AIaSmxh0zD3RMaFNn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ogFIG0fNXEYRQKrpnoRJcXQNX9n.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iTqTgxTNs1AIaSmxh0zD3RMaFNn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":589612,"title":"A Call to Spy","description":"The story of Vera Atkins, a crafty spy recruiter, and two of the first women she selects for Churchill''s \"secret army\": Virginia Hall, a daring American undaunted by a disability and Noor Inayat Khan, a pacifist. These civilian women form an unlikely sisterhood while entangled in dangerous missions to turn the tide of the war.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["History","Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2020-10-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/udc1W1WEqVrZl4iyddFzYBut54W.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cK5D0ss2LLSZtOZKvgOVTcCdXIE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//udc1W1WEqVrZl4iyddFzYBut54W.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cK5D0ss2LLSZtOZKvgOVTcCdXIE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":390734,"title":"Kingsglaive: Final Fantasy XV","description":"The magical kingdom of Lucis is home to the world’s last remaining Crystal, and the menacing empire of Niflheim is determined to steal it. King Regis of Lucis commands an elite force of soldiers called the Kingsglaive. Wielding their king’s magic, they fight to protect Lucis. As the overwhelming military might of the empire bears down, King Regis is faced with an impossible ultimatum – to marry his son, Prince Noctis to Princess Lunafreya of Tenebrae, captive of Niflheim, and surrender his lands to Niflheim rule.  Although the king concedes, it becomes clear that the empire will stop at nothing to achieve their devious goals, with only the Kingsglaive standing between them and world domination.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Animation","Science Fiction","Action"],"release_date":"2016-07-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eTfik9sRZTcaWIMJGVhmUqrbL0Q.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xGMgspge6uYoypRiasAmlluDlXH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eTfik9sRZTcaWIMJGVhmUqrbL0Q.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xGMgspge6uYoypRiasAmlluDlXH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":35119,"title":"Evil Angels","description":"Based on the true story of Lindy Chamberlain who, during a family camping trip to Ayers Rock in central Australia, claimed she witnessed a dingo take her baby daughter, Azaria, from their tent. Azaria''s body was never found and, after investigations and two public inquests, she is charged with murder.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1988-11-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lDULCevM5oreITICKy1t75wAuqB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/auyoK8OZh1sZldjJfy9RGzS6crV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lDULCevM5oreITICKy1t75wAuqB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https: