 Smith.","duration":"2:09:00","genre":["Adventure","Action","Thriller","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2003-11-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/533xAMhhVyjTy8hwMUFEt5TuDfR.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qEWiBXJGXK28jGBAm8oFKKTB0WD.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//533xAMhhVyjTy8hwMUFEt5TuDfR.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qEWiBXJGXK28jGBAm8oFKKTB0WD.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":569547,"title":"Black Mirror: Bandersnatch","description":"In 1984, a young programmer begins to question reality as he adapts a dark fantasy novel into a video game. A mind-bending tale with multiple endings.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Thriller","Science Fiction","Mystery"],"release_date":"2018-12-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1qSo3zT9XAQYcbZaLBn46mTeTHZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fR0VZ0VE598zl1lrYf7IfBqEwQ2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1qSo3zT9XAQYcbZaLBn46mTeTHZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fR0VZ0VE598zl1lrYf7IfBqEwQ2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":472734,"title":"Dumplin''","description":"To prove a point about measuring up and fitting in, Texas teen Willowdean “Dumplin’” Dickson enters a local pageant run by her ex-beauty queen mom.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2018-12-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9c9X3HHlBKuPpvOcFIxlldS7TGh.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xJAB1HrFUuOf2VkWPaZ4N2DACCo.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9c9X3HHlBKuPpvOcFIxlldS7TGh.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xJAB1HrFUuOf2VkWPaZ4N2DACCo.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":26606,"title":"Performance.","description":"In underworld terms, Chas Devlin is a ''performer,'' a gangster with a talent for violence and intimidation. Turner is a reclusive rock superstar. When Chas and Turner meet, their worlds collide—and the impact is both exotic and explosive.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"1970-08-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u6twkjIhNbNynmWWHrCZ5BZpfNI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yKuqk84TtTpj0nYZS5m680JmprG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u6twkjIhNbNynmWWHrCZ5BZpfNI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yKuqk84TtTpj0nYZS5m680JmprG.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15021,"title":"The Baby''s Room","description":"Juan and Sonia arrive at a large old house, an ideal place to raise their newborn son. When, one night before going to bed, they check the operation of the monitoring device installed in the baby''s room, they discover that someone is sitting next to the crib.","duration":"1:20:00","genre":["Drama","Horror","Thriller","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2006-11-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nm5nC0vKRHSZZoQuhdmVuEML5kO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/t5BtCJyju9ltoVUV0VmwKUt5N0S.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nm5nC0vKRHSZZoQuhdmVuEML5kO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//t5BtCJyju9ltoVUV0VmwKUt5N0S.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10999,"title":"Commando","description":"John Matrix, the former leader of a special commando strike force that always got the toughest jobs done, is forced back into action when his young daughter is kidnapped. To find her, Matrix has to fight his way through an array of punks, killers, one of his former commandos, and a fully equipped private army. With the help of a feisty stewardess and an old friend, Matrix has only a few hours to overcome his greatest challenge: finding his daughter before she''s killed.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Thriller"],"release_date":"1985-10-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t