r and transfer from an urban East Los Angeles public high school to an exclusive prep school in Malibu, where she struggles to fit in with her affluent new peers. After snooty cheerleading captain Avery blocks Lina from varsity, Lina recruits her best friends from her old school to help her whip the pathetic junior varsity cheerleading squad -- the Sea Lions -- into fighting shape.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2009-07-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4Qj1qSBGjHKMEtKNfMM5Wqrpj9F.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/o3zsel0aCcBWgOCytyFa9FxuPTk.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4Qj1qSBGjHKMEtKNfMM5Wqrpj9F.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//o3zsel0aCcBWgOCytyFa9FxuPTk.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10510,"title":"Miracle on 34th Street","description":"Six-year-old Susan Walker has doubts about childhood''s most enduring miracle—Santa Claus. Her mother told her the secret about Santa a long time ago, but, after meeting a special department store Santa who''s convinced he''s the real thing, Susan is given the most precious gift of all—something to believe in.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Fantasy","Drama","Family"],"release_date":"1994-11-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oU0lGpUukjNOgZeuIqueNM3QiBE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iUTPKkljdEjPlcPPYgbUz7APnHu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oU0lGpUukjNOgZeuIqueNM3QiBE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iUTPKkljdEjPlcPPYgbUz7APnHu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1609,"title":"There''s Only One Jimmy Grimble","description":"Jimmy Grimble is a shy Manchester school boy. At school he is constantly being bullied by the other kids, and at home he has to face his mother''s new boyfriend. However, through football, and some special boots, he manages to gain the confidence to succeed and leads his school football team towards the final of the local schools cup.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2000-08-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mp45oLvaMWxhggGdHg6cueWY7Pz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9v4RxdSMUkhkH9cceSVU4jH4BfV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mp45oLvaMWxhggGdHg6cueWY7Pz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9v4RxdSMUkhkH9cceSVU4jH4BfV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":949838,"title":"72 HOURS","description":"To save his career, a 40-year-old ad exec joins a crew of twentysomethings for a wild Miami bachelor party after they mistakenly add him to a group chat.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"2026-07-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hL5EIk48251OXlbIbRJq3yaBHk8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9Bu1PW2R1XayqRqnl0aDOgMcrdS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hL5EIk48251OXlbIbRJq3yaBHk8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9Bu1PW2R1XayqRqnl0aDOgMcrdS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":468202,"title":"The Girl in the Fog","description":"A gripping and chilling thriller that brings us to a hazy mountain village where an enigmatic detective is investigating the sudden disappearance of fifteen-year-old girl.","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["Mystery","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2017-10-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tB9L7FmEeWiWWjCUjKW1Zu7IfQD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fuJApAPgHrur08y6icGB5k5Umzo.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tB9L7FmEeWiWWjCUjKW1Zu7IfQD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fuJApAPgHrur08y6icGB5k5Umzo.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":272693,"title":"The DUFF","description":"Bianca''s universe turns upside down when she learns that her high school refers to her as a ‘DUFF'' (Designated Ugly Fat Friend). Hoping to erase that label, she enlists the help of a charming jock and her favorite teacher. Together they''ll face the school''s mean girl and remind everyone that we are all someone''s DUFF… and that''s totally fine.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"2015-02-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/trL84LbzW4s0uhOtHkTWLFJhpYO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/A6ScveWmIPL9vSYyULD8ObqyHDQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//trL84LbzW4s0uhOtHkTWLFJhpYO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//A6ScveWmIPL9vSYyULD8ObqyHDQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":110146,"title":"The Sapphires","description":"It''s 1968, and four young, talented Australian Aboriginal girls learn about love, friendship, and war when they entertain the US troops in Vietnam as singing group The Sapphires.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2012-08-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/42WCOoNzJy4iytEQDBiZgzQmThy.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3249QNApOMITMcIrnt16ckxd8Z8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//42WCOoNzJy4iytEQDBiZgzQmThy.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3249QNApOMITMcIrnt16ckxd8Z8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":91739,"title":"Much Ado About Nothing","description":"A modern retelling of Shakespeare''s classic comedy about two pairs of lovers with different takes on romance and a way with words.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2013-05-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yFAewxspQeCYeY8rp9YdvBmMRwn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kDUEegV4P8odhUTjHE2e2kWMZo3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yFAewxspQeCYeY8rp9YdvBmMRwn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kDUEegV4P8odhUTjHE2e2kWMZo3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":57243,"title":"The Women on the 6th Floor","description":"Paris, in the early 1960s. Jean-Louis Joubert is a serious but uptight stockbroker, married to Suzanne, a starchy class-conscious woman and father of two arrogant teenage boys, currently in a boarding school. The affluent man lives a steady yet boring life. At least until, due to fortuitous circumstances, Maria, the charming new maid at the service of Jean-Louis'' family, makes him discover the servants'' quarter on the sixth floor of the luxury building he owns and lives in. There live a crowd of lively Spanish maids who will help Jean-Louis to open to a new civilization and a new approach of life. In their company - and more precisely in the company of beautiful Maria - Jean-Louis will gradually become another man, a better man.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2011-02-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4yXwLVlpzVWMkVZuYxhLXC2luo6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/88875SqNHpwslXXa5WtDA3VnOvn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4yXwLVlpzVWMkVZuYxhLXC2luo6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//88875SqNHpwslXXa5WtDA3VnOvn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9558,"title":"King of New York","description":"A former drug lord returns from prison determined to wipe out all his competition and distribute the profits of his operations to New York''s poor and lower classes in this stylish and ultra violent modern twist on Robin Hood.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"1990-07-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4SqkcTDow3cgXUsN2DC2RETbhAZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1MyH4MJAJZJbb6wDVeOc2bTECtK.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4SqkcTDow3cgXUsN2DC2RETbhAZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1MyH4MJAJZJbb6wDVeOc2bTECtK.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1195506,"title":"Novocaine","description":"When the girl of his dreams is kidnapped, everyman Nate turns his inability to feel pain into an unexpected strength in his fight to get her back.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Action","Comedy","Thriller"],"release_date":"2025-03-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lyBH2mFFU6qrHwD5QKotL2JnEb6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xmMHGz9dVRaMY6rRAlEX4W0Wdhm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lyBH2mFFU6qrHwD5QKotL2JnEb6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xmMHGz9dVRaMY6rRAlEX4W0Wdhm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":634528,"title":"The Marksman","description":"Jim Hanson’s quiet life is suddenly disturbed by two people crossing the US/Mexico border – a woman and her young son – desperate to flee a Mexican cartel. After a shootout leaves the mother dead, Jim becomes the boy’s reluctant defender. He embraces his role as Miguel’s protector and will stop at nothing to get him to safety, as they go on the run from the relentless assassins.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Action","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2021-01-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5Zv5KmgZzdIvXz2KC3n0MyecSNL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6vcDalR50RWa309vBH1NLmG2rjQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5Zv5KmgZzdIvXz2KC3n0MyecSNL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6vcDalR50RWa309vBH1NLmG2rjQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":54441,"title":"Angel of Evil","description":"Set in Italy in the 1970s, VALLANZASCA is the true story of the Italian underworld’s most infamous outlaw. A criminal by age 9, Renato Vallanzasca grew up to become the country’s most notorious mobster before the age of 27. Vallanzasca and his gang wrested control of the Milan underworld with a string of high profile robberies, kidnappings and murders. In the process, he captivated the public and earned the nick