ller","Action"],"release_date":"2021-07-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/s15olg5LwRqTjgDd5KIfVXhcoqs.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/v7aOJKI5vxCHotHvN8O7SR6SpP6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//s15olg5LwRqTjgDd5KIfVXhcoqs.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//v7aOJKI5vxCHotHvN8O7SR6SpP6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":592867,"title":"Dragon Quest: Your Story","description":"Luca follows in his father''s footsteps to rescue his mother from evil Ladja. Finding the heavenly hero who wields the Zenithian sword is his only hope.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Animation","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy","Action","Family"],"release_date":"2019-08-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vKhp5yhdtPkKsBOYXMjb5Yi05e7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5R70ehKGh5V0ZYOdikxwSfoLGMt.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vKhp5yhdtPkKsBOYXMjb5Yi05e7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5R70ehKGh5V0ZYOdikxwSfoLGMt.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":436270,"title":"Black Adam","description":"Nearly 5,000 years after he was bestowed with the almighty powers of the Egyptian gods—and imprisoned just as quickly—Black Adam is freed from his earthly tomb, ready to unleash his unique form of justice on the modern world.","duration":"2:05:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2022-10-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bQXAqRx2Fgc46uCVWgoPz5L5Dtr.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rCtreCr4xiYEWDQTebybolIh6Xe.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bQXAqRx2Fgc46uCVWgoPz5L5Dtr.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rCtreCr4xiYEWDQTebybolIh6Xe.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":381262,"title":"In Her Name","description":"In 1982, André Bamberski learns about the death of his 14 year-old daughter, Kalinka, while she was on vacation with her mother and stepfather in Germany. Convinced that Kalinka’s death was not an accident, Bamberski begins to investigate. A botched autopsy report raises his suspicions and leads him to accuse Kalinka’s stepfather, Dr Dieter Krombach, as the murderer.\r Unable to indict Krombach in Germany, Bamberski attempts to take the trial to France, where he will dedicate his life to Kalinka’s justice and the imprisonment of Krombach.","duration":"1:27:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"2016-03-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rSWv4coph16vM5yOaOFXE1Y6qgY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lVYfYQBBvs6yb7pChIBJ6R4vsrK.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rSWv4coph16vM5yOaOFXE1Y6qgY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lVYfYQBBvs6yb7pChIBJ6R4vsrK.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":180894,"title":"Ninja: Shadow of a Tear","description":"Fight everyone and trust no one: it''s the code of survival practiced by martial-arts master Casey Bowman after his life of domestic bliss is shattered by a savage act of violence. Vowing revenge, the fearless American stealthily tracks the killer from Osaka to Bangkok to Rangoon with the help of a wise and crafty sensei. His only clues: a series of victims whose necks bear the distinctive mark of strangulation by barbed wire. Fighting to avenge as well as to survive, Casey must sharpen his razor-like responses and take his battle skills to the next level, even using deep meditation to fake his own death. His target: the sinister drug lord Goro, who is flooding the streets with deadly meth cooked at his remote jungle factory. To prepare for his ultimate confrontation, Casey must finally become an invisible warrior worthy of the name Ninja. But just when his prey is cornered, an unexpected twist shows Casey that his battle is only beginning: he truly can trust no one.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2013-12-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7Q67AjYx1EUC5lopy51wxgES6ap.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/f4i1wzuyFXv6NHREAy4fPPGSH7E.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7Q67AjYx1EUC5lopy51wxgES6ap.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//f4i1wzuyFXv6NHREAy4fPPGSH7E.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14384,"title":"Soldier Blue","description":"After a cavalry group is massacred by the Cheyenne, only two survivors remain: Honus, a naive private devoted to his duty, and Cresta, a young woman who had lived with the Cheyenne two years and whose sympathies lie more with them than with the US government. Together, they must try to reach the cavalry''s main base camp. As they travel onward, Honus is torn between his growing affection for Cresta.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Western","Drama"],"release_date":"1970-08-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ff2zbJ1PljlCWY5npok4TctInsW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2fRfVQpdrjAhvxwytG0scOqdQOJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ff2zbJ1PljlCWY5npok4TctInsW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2fRfVQpdrjAhvxwytG0scOqdQOJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10591,"title":"The Girl Next Door","description":"Exceptionally ambitious high schooler Matthew has aspirations for a career in politics when he falls in love with his gorgeous 19-year-old neighbor, Danielle. But Matthew''s bright future is jeopardized when he finds Danielle was once a porn star. As Danielle''s past catches up with her, Matthew''s love for her forces him to re-evaluate his goals.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2004-04-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qvcOovScPoRalRxDy50rYSYFree.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5mVyFHSY2rSsNgD4NfEwV82HigU.jpg","sma