.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Thriller","Action","Drama"],"release_date":"2007-08-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qzmCz3tK2v5BFLQYgbQVGmTI3YD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AgtEL99178EEEKfd44mvvoPRZt1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qzmCz3tK2v5BFLQYgbQVGmTI3YD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AgtEL99178EEEKfd44mvvoPRZt1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":619730,"title":"Don''t Worry Darling","description":"Alice and Jack are lucky to be living in the idealized community of Victory, the experimental company town housing the men who work for the top-secret Victory Project and their families. But when cracks in their idyllic life begin to appear, exposing flashes of something much more sinister lurking beneath the attractive façade, Alice can’t help questioning exactly what they’re doing in Victory, and why.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Mystery","Horror","Thriller"],"release_date":"2022-09-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tfCNMP37jRX3TOetuce7FLkxNKa.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wjAJWfuE5OQm5zerlOAbTxdHFMV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tfCNMP37jRX3TOetuce7FLkxNKa.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wjAJWfuE5OQm5zerlOAbTxdHFMV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":559713,"title":"Fisherman''s Friends","description":"Ten fishermen from Cornwall are signed by Universal Records and achieve a top ten hit with their debut album of Sea Shanties. Based on the true-life story of Cornish folk band, Fisherman''s Friends.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Music"],"release_date":"2019-03-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xxjFyF0onOaH1MvTrOsuA47v74R.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4faFbkPf8aH5nrY4YcNvn40PXLL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xxj