jpg"},{"tmdb_id":21385,"title":"Mickey, Donald, Goofy: The Three Musketeers","description":"In Disney''s take on the Alexander Dumas tale, Mickey Mouse, Donald Duck and Goofy want nothing more than to perform brave deeds on behalf of their queen (Minnie Mouse), but they''re stymied by the head Musketeer, Pete. Pete secretly wants to get rid of the queen, so he appoints Mickey and his bumbling friends as guardians to Minnie, thinking such a maneuver will ensure his scheme''s success.","duration":"1:08:00","genre":["Adventure","Animation","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"2004-08-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uLMSOtPaZDggYXdClvxnHaO094h.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/23bvOwfOS9fw347Yc68yPpkmd8i.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uLMSOtPaZDggYXdClvxnHaO094h.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//23bvOwfOS9fw347Yc68yPpkmd8i.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":18647,"title":"One-Eyed Jacks","description":"Running from the law after a bank robbery in Mexico, Dad Longworth finds an opportunity to take the stolen gold and leave his partner Rio to be captured. Years later, Rio escapes from the prison where he has been since, and hunts down Dad for revenge. Dad is now a respectable sheriff in California, and has been living in fear of Rio''s return.","duration":"2:21:00","genre":["Western","Drama"],"release_date":"1961-03-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/c34lzH24bX4SJJIZCRbIbYShM1K.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xal47bRKVIxErB7h2CScY3GBnoT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//c34lzH24bX4SJJIZCRbIbYShM1K.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xal47bRKVIxErB7h2CScY3GBnoT.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13851,"title":"Batman: Gotham Knight","description":"Six interlocking stories reveal Bruce Wayne''s earliest adventures as Batman and the steps he took to become the grim avenger of Gotham City.","duration":"1:16:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Animation","Drama","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2008-07-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sGVOhdD4nlzJX5PV8xArhLSJZC9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3i1o0sHBP0VUpuSVmkdCRKYoDBC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sGVOhdD4nlzJX5PV8xArhLSJZC9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3i1o0sHBP0VUpuSVmkdCRKYoDBC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":858,"title":"Sleepless in Seattle","description":"After the death of his mother, a young boy calls a radio station in an attempt to set his father up on a date. Across the country, an engaged woman becomes convinced that they belong together, despite their never having met. Will their paths collide despite the odds?","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1993-06-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/k83YesKu0mSpMVu7YYf1QyeZpFn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jAXfku1u1uaLGh4cUmK0ESf1pPu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//k83YesKu0mSpMVu7YYf1QyeZpFn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jAXfku1u1uaLGh4cUmK0ESf1pPu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":798286,"title":"Beau Is Afraid","description":"Following the sudden death of his mother, a mild-mannered but anxiety-ridden man confronts his darkest fears as he embarks on an epic odyssey back home.","duration":"2:59:00","genre":["Comedy","Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2023-04-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/atvEgnjjXN5QvFDThXVz4nyU9yi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wgVkkjigF31r1nZV80uV0xNIoun.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//atvEgnjjXN5QvFDThXVz4nyU9yi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wgVkkjigF31r1nZV80uV0xNIoun.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":619778,"title":"Malignant","description":"Madison is paralyzed by shocking visions of grisly murders, and her torment worsens as she discovers that these waking dreams are in fact terrifying realities with a mysterious tie to her past.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Horror","Mystery"],"release_date":"2021-09-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xnyGhzrfqENfFoiNZ9z4oy63Z9F.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dGv2BWjzwAz6LB8a8JeRIZL8hSz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xnyGhzrfqENfFoiNZ9z4oy63Z9F.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dGv2BWjzwAz6LB8a8JeRIZL8hSz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":496967,"title":"Atlantics","description":"Arranged to marry a rich man, young Ada is crushed when her true love goes missing at sea during a migration attempt — until a miracle reunites them.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2019-10-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kWkAWQQrlI5Rq2CtC5aYac9dx9V.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zRnZM6HqglFK31MYyrTSQVlj1dQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kWkAWQQrlI5Rq2CtC5aYac9dx9V.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zRnZM6HqglFK31MYyrTSQVlj1dQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":212716,"title":"What If","description":"Medical-school dropout Wallace has been repeatedly burned by bad relationships. So while everyone around him, including his roommate Allan, seems to be finding the perfect partner, Wallace decides to put his love life on hold. It is then that he meets Chantry, an animator who lives with her longtime boyfriend Ben. Wallace and Chantry form an instant connection, striking up a close friendship. Still, there is no denying the chemistry between them, leading the pair to wonder, what if the love of your life is actually your best friend?","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2013-09-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iIcJ72VzqAIw5NT6bOYqfHB2ukM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/67x9NJyjK4u02NpISnChDMKzCUr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iIcJ72VzqAIw5NT6bOYqfHB2ukM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//67x9NJyjK4u02NpISnChDMKzCUr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":60307,"title":"Diary of a Wimpy Kid: Rodrick Rules","description":"Wimpy Greg Heffley, now in seventh grade, thinks he has it all together. He has mastered middle school and gotten rid of the Cheese Touch. However, Greg''s older brother, Rodrick, is itching to cut him down to size. He gets the perfect opportunity when their mother tries to force the boys to bond. Rodrick may be Greg''s chief tormentor, but he feels his constant pranks are just what his little brother needs to prepare him for life''s hard knocks.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Family","Comedy"],"release_date":"2011-03-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9BwGL0nsjCdvhe6V9q42NG11Pyq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/w77ZoDmHNf6lnk8NWsXqWYOQqnp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9BwGL0nsjCdvhe6V9q42NG11Pyq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//w77ZoDmHNf6lnk8NWsXqWYOQqnp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":16297,"title":"With Honors","description":"Convinced he''ll graduate with honors because of his thesis paper, a stuffy Harvard student finds his paper being held hostage by a homeless man, who might be the guy to school the young man in life.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1994-04-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/m0m0ikotUirpFBRuqjfXA738CMc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eWJ2Y7CRvlv1KVfAJGRcH95i1pY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//m0m0ikotUirpFBRuqjfXA738CMc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eWJ2Y7CRvlv1KVfAJGRcH95i1pY.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10935,"title":"Heaven''s Gate","description":"Harvard graduate James Averill serves as the sheriff of prosperous Jackson County, Wyoming, standing at the center of a conflict between impoverished immigrants and affluent cattle farmers. Politically connected ranchers enlist mercenary Nathan Champion—who is also vying for the affections of local madam Ella Watson—to combat the immigrant uprising. As tensions escalate, both Averill and Champion start to question their decisions.","duration":"3:37:00","genre":["Drama","Western","History"],"release_date":"1980-11-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/v0DsJiF7LAeJtqFObQfq3eU6rag.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kW4Vk31nhtKPKGuYMaVATq3wcHC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//v0DsJiF7LAeJtqFObQfq3eU6rag.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kW4Vk31nhtKPKGuYMaVATq3wcHC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10855,"title":"Naked Weapon","description":"A mysterious woman, known as Madame M, kidnaps forty pre-teen girls and transports them to a remote island to train them as the most deadly assassins. CIA operative Jack Chen follows the case for 6 years with no leads, but when a series of assassinations begin to occur, Jack suspects that Madame M is back in business.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Action","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2002-11-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9SIFiToG6kRkoS5OKUhuPYp2mnI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bEkFMDlIosqroIO8yBBIKZWoGRh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9SIFiToG6kRkoS5OKUhuPYp2mnI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bEkFMDlIosqroIO8yBBIKZWoGRh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1811,"title":"Nowhere","description":"In Los Angeles, a colorful assortment of bohemians try to make sense of their intersecting lives. The moody Dark Smith, his bisexual girlfriend, her lesbian lover and their shy gay friend plan on attending the wildest party of the year. But they''ll only make it if they can survive the drug trips, suicides, trysts, mutilations and alien abductions that occur as one surreal day unfolds.","duration":"1:23:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1997-05-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sx1Lyt6f1NL9uVJiizanUfVNfIx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/c1TZKfzvATep5x5DthqWjjWtU2l.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sx1Lyt6f1NL9uVJiizanUfVNfIx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//c1TZKfzvATep5x5DthqWjjWtU2l.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1078600,"title":"Marked Men: Rule + Shaw","description":"Shaw Landon has loved Rule Archer from the moment she laid eyes on him. Rule, a fiery-tempered rebel tattoo artist, doesn’t have time for a good girl pre-med student like Shaw — even if she’s the only one who can see the person he truly is. She lives by other people’s rules; he makes his own. But a short skirt, too many birthday cocktails, and spilled secrets lead to a night neither can forget. Now, Shaw and Rule must figure out how a girl like her and a guy like him are supposed to be together without destroying their love…or each other.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2025-01-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9qYD7pAOEdYBoQblv5VAMMSVAC8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gZQU8BtCH2IbMZq6QETiU4HXQSR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9qYD7pAOEdYBoQblv5VAMMSVAC8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gZQU8BtCH2IbMZq6QETiU4HXQSR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":646207,"title":"The Ice Road","description":"After a remote diamond mine collapses in far northern Canada, an ice road driver must lead an impossible rescue mission over a frozen ocean to save the trapped miners.","duration":"1:48:00","genre"