his life outside the disco is not easy and things change when he gets attracted to Stephanie.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1977-12-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iihMna17sTxP3zwlWBsKZbvDiGZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ylA7E5Md21aqgzxbwa2dFxX8LKV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iihMna17sTxP3zwlWBsKZbvDiGZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ylA7E5Md21aqgzxbwa2dFxX8LKV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10846,"title":"The Tiger and the Snow","description":"Love and injury in time of war. Attilio de Giovanni teaches poetry in Italy. He has a romantic soul, and women love him. But he is in love with Vittoria, and the love is unrequited. Every night he dreams of marrying her, in his boxer shorts and t-shirt, as Tom Waits sings. Vittoria travels to Iraq with her friend, Fuad, a poet; they are there with the second Gulf War breaks out. Vittoria is injured. Attilio must get to her side, and then, as war rages around him, he must find her the medical care she needs. In war, does love conquer all?","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2005-10-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eoYqlqSKE381giHHxVafHa5eUDi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/18ZaN20XRwG2dOJYuo8tvWdDMCR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eoYqlqSKE381giHHxVafHa5eUDi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//18ZaN20XRwG2dOJYuo8tvWdDMCR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4483,"title":"The Return of Martin Guerre","description":"Village of Artigat, southern France, summer 1542, during the reign of Francis I. Martin Guerre and Bertrande de Rols marry. A few years later, accused of having committed a robbery, Martin suddenly disappears. When, almost a decade later, a man arrives in Artigat claiming to be Martin, the Guerre family recognizes him as such; but doubts