y","description":"January 1978. After their success in England, the punk rock band Sex Pistols venture out on their tour of the southern United States. Temperamental bassist Sid Vicious is forced by his band mates to travel without his troubled girlfriend, Nancy Spungen, who will meet him in New York. When the band breaks up and Sid begins his solo career in a hostile city, the turbulent couple definitely falls into the depths of drug addiction.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1986-09-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pLdutWHlPIHf7ldH31akiVLUHQQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wHzCbMCfipDJ38GW5IyBTWDflMz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pLdutWHlPIHf7ldH31akiVLUHQQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wHzCbMCfipDJ38GW5IyBTWDflMz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9060,"title":"Dumplings","description":"Aunt Mei''s famous homemade dumplings provide amazing age-defying qualities popular with middle-aged women. But her latest customer, a fading actress, is determined to find out what the secret ingredient is.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Horror"],"release_date":"2004-08-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aSLDG8l73T5SlabvZtYgv7m6OG9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7btkd83yTWMyeAFei3ZlXiaiqu6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aSLDG8l73T5SlabvZtYgv7m6OG9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7btkd83yTWMyeAFei3ZlXiaiqu6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8453,"title":"Fanaa","description":"Zooni Ali Beg is a blind Kashmiri girl who travels without her parents for the first time with a dance troupe to Delhi to perform in a ceremony for independence day. On her journey, she meets Rehan Khan, a casanova and tour guide who flirts with her. Although her friends warn Zooni about him, she cannot resist falling in love with him and he takes her on a private tour of New Delhi. But there is more to Rehan than meets the eye and Zooni will have to make a heartbreaking decision.","duration":"2:48:00","genre":["Action","Drama","Romance","Thriller"],"release_date":"2006-05-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/r0gZkk6h3eXGv8l7dCy1HrzQwmd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4A17fF6K6WAvv4Ces0CgpMZRee4.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//r0gZkk6h3eXGv8l7dCy1HrzQwmd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4A17fF6K6WAvv4Ces0CgpMZRee4.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":634,"title":"Bridget Jones''s Diary","description":"Bridget Jones is an average woman struggling against expectations. As a New Year''s resolution, Bridget decides to take control of her life, starting by keeping a diary in which she will always tell the complete truth. Her charming boss takes an interest in her, and she cannot stop running into a rather disagreeable acquaintance whom Bridget cannot help finding quietly attractive.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2001-04-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9rSpxsMhG1FnFtUDdvSAXdtLtb3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/olMTi7uCaec9Yr3Ar07D2SIja1G.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9rSpxsMhG1FnFtUDdvSAXdtLtb3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//olMTi7uCaec9Yr3Ar07D2SIja1G.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":538225,"title":"Deadwood: The Movie","description":"Follow the 10-year reunion of the Deadwood camp to celebrate South Dakota''s statehood. Former rivalries are reignited, alliances are tested and old wounds are reopened, as all are left to navigate the inevitable changes that modernity and time have wrought.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Western","Drama","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2019-05-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kIXJRoqUdqU9AowvS7PqBqMK8N8.jpg","pos