 So, McGinty dusts off his secret dossier of ex-players who never got a chance (or screwed up the one they were given) and knits together a bad-dream team of guys who just may give the Sentinels their title shot.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2000-08-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wH4M4wvSR2kQqomE3N9dTStJre8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6qerI41HqkdRlio1sG0d5HLZcFN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wH4M4wvSR2kQqomE3N9dTStJre8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6qerI41HqkdRlio1sG0d5HLZcFN.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9058,"title":"Only You","description":"Two childhood paranormal incidents have convinced schoolteacher Faith Corvatch that her true love is a guy named ''Damon Bradley'', but she has yet to meet him. Preparing to marry podiatrist Dwayne in ten days, Faith receives a phone call from Dwayne''s old classmate Damon Bradley, who is on his way to Venice. She impulsively decides to fly to Italy with the hope of finally encountering the man of her dreams. Accompanying her on the trip is her sister-in-law and best friend Kate, who has just left her husband, Faith''s brother Larry.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"1994-03-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8uAwA3xnpMyP6etx3JIjFouA4Cl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7mLLANXgUg3bibTiUitDlB0NZcU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8uAwA3xnpMyP6etx3JIjFouA4Cl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7mLLANXgUg3bibTiUitDlB0NZcU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2675,"title":"Signs","description":"A family living on a farm finds mysterious crop circles in their fields which suggests something more frightening to come.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Thriller","Science Fiction","Horror"],"release_date":"2002-08-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w60