ain ride to the North Pole, he embarks on a journey of self-discovery that shows him that the wonder of life never fades for those who believe.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Adventure","Animation","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2004-11-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jtOvTVlkF8TlaOq94oNXRc9u2yp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eOoCzH0MqeGr2taUZO4SwG416PF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jtOvTVlkF8TlaOq94oNXRc9u2yp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eOoCzH0MqeGr2taUZO4SwG416PF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":310,"title":"Bruce Almighty","description":"Bruce Nolan toils as a \"human interest\" television reporter in Buffalo, NY, but despite his high ratings and the love of his beautiful girlfriend, Bruce remains unfulfilled. At the end of the worst day in his life, he angrily ridicules God — and the Almighty responds, endowing Bruce with all of His divine powers.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Fantasy","Comedy"],"release_date":"2003-05-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/m0eJc9CwCy5nowYQdNEaxkHHmj4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wqkWrOFtYnZSvIMu8Lsmz7WIvKC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//m0eJc9CwCy5nowYQdNEaxkHHmj4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wqkWrOFtYnZSvIMu8Lsmz7WIvKC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1297763,"title":"Batman Ninja vs. Yakuza League","description":"The Batman family has returned to the present to discover that Japan has disappeared, and a giant island - Hinomoto - is now in the sky over Gotham City.  At the top sit the Yakuza, a group of superpowered individuals who reign without honor or humanity and look suspiciously like the Justice League. Now, it’s up to Batman and his allies to save Gotham!","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2025-03-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org