ace.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Drama","Mystery","Romance"],"release_date":"2018-03-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tFtqdDndzsQyymIR4fGbC77HVXJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e8SJJEliAK9g0EG5agPsbxWoWoI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tFtqdDndzsQyymIR4fGbC77HVXJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e8SJJEliAK9g0EG5agPsbxWoWoI.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":276844,"title":"The Little Death","description":"A comedy film that looks into the loosely connected lives of people with strange sexual fantasies.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2014-06-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/khvSmyqkTndJ39GH36phq0p8ncI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wH15YYgBT9ZX37nFkSQ0OM8qjCE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//khvSmyqkTndJ39GH36phq0p8ncI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wH15YYgBT9ZX37nFkSQ0OM8qjCE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":198185,"title":"Million Dollar Arm","description":"In a last-ditch effort to save his career, sports agent JB Bernstein dreams up a wild game plan to find Major League Baseball’s next great pitcher from a pool of cricket players in India. He soon discovers two young men who can throw a fastball but know nothing about the game of baseball. Or America. It’s an incredible and touching journey that will change them all — especially JB, who learns valuable lessons about teamwork, commitment and family.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2014-05-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7I5uDeJfST5EgU3yQHpO3ExyBQk.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6OgA9x6jvwBIj8e7x8LANTbVvR2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7I5uDeJfST5EgU3yQHpO3ExyBQk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6OgA9x6jvwBI