rg/t/p/w342//tbP1vcLKUXRJkuffFe3bfOaRRKQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":74513,"title":"Special Forces","description":"Afghanistan. War correspondent Elsa Casanova is taken hostage by the Taliban. Faced with her imminent execution, a Special Forces unit is dispatched to free her. In some of the world’s most breathtaking yet hostile landscapes, a relentless pursuit begins between her kidnappers who have no intention of letting their prey escape them and a group of soldiers who risk their lives in pursuit of their single aim – to bring her home alive. This strong, independent woman and these men of duty are thrown together and forced to confront situations of great danger that inextricably bind them – emotionally, violently and intimately.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Action","Drama","War"],"release_date":"2011-11-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cImYSNm0piuUfjlBCozNPEEvTK2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xpe9F3214mNrk8tnIqZvHSmIV1I.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cImYSNm0piuUfjlBCozNPEEvTK2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xpe9F3214mNrk8tnIqZvHSmIV1I.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":43645,"title":"The Little Devil","description":"Father Maurice, a priest living in a residential college for priests in Rome, is called out one day to \"exorcise\" the devil from someone. The devil turns out to be in the form of a fun-loving man called Giuditta. What Father Maurice doesn''t know is that this type of devil will turn his life around.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Comedy","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1988-07-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cpoCmsmKGsqxwSRPWFKegZbmoQz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ck1dLdsmjwYljlnwQRNj4XhBa55.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cpoCmsmKGsqxwSRPWFKegZbmoQz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ck1dLdsmjwYljlnwQRNj4XhBa55.jpg"},{"tmdb_id