m5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11592,"title":"Serial Mom","description":"Beverly is the perfect happy homemaker, along with her doting husband and two children, but this nuclear family just might explode when her fascination with serial killers collides with her ever-so-proper code of ethics.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"1994-04-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yaHSrHQ82mCeJRvXX4H08cLsXYz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3Qlycp68b6TQkC1fMMahpf04Oq8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yaHSrHQ82mCeJRvXX4H08cLsXYz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3Qlycp68b6TQkC1fMMahpf04Oq8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":776328,"title":"Marilyn''s Eyes","description":"Clara and Diego, under the guidance of the psychiatrist of a day rehabilitation center for disturbed people who attend, decide to transform the treatment center into a restaurant, involving all their other companions.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2021-10-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zOVxbbt8BrrjWBJ0eO21S2adUvo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u4jiAnEDzDVhpVdBk9jtRrLzc9S.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zOVxbbt8BrrjWBJ0eO21S2adUvo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u4jiAnEDzDVhpVdBk9jtRrLzc9S.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":758336,"title":"Love Again","description":"Mira Ray, dealing with the loss of her fiancé, John, sends a series of romantic texts to his old cell phone number… not realizing the number was reassigned to Rob Burns'' new work phone. Rob, a journalist, is captivated by the honesty in the beautifully confessional texts. When he’s assigned to write a profile of megastar Céline Dion, he enlists her help in figuring out how to meet Mira in person and win her heart.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Romance","Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2023-05-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jv9WTuEk7kW8JxgpjQ872CyiifP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/koswMk0y7jGcyofV1sBccnNtY0B.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jv9WTuEk7kW8JxgpjQ872CyiifP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//koswMk0y7jGcyofV1sBccnNtY0B.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":452773,"title":"Tad, the Lost Explorer, and the Secret of King Midas","description":"Tad dreams of becoming an archaeologist traveling the world, uncovering hidden secrets and lost treasure, but his job working construction keeps him daydreaming instead of exploring. The chance of a lifetime comes when he is invited to attend archaeologist Sara Lavrof''s presentation of her latest discovery - the papyrus that proves the existence of the Necklace of Midas, the legendary King who turned everything he touched into solid gold.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Animation","Adventure","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"2017-03-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4Pv4JRqT7LT1F290JbbjQsaB6LD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7WtFoWtGp45PLNmajM8iGtjAA7B.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4Pv4JRqT7LT1F290JbbjQsaB6LD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7WtFoWtGp45PLNmajM8iGtjAA7B.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":334522,"title":"Alone in Berlin","description":"Berlin in June of 1940. While Nazi propaganda celebrates the regime’s victory over France, a kitchen-cum-living room in Prenzlauer Berg is filled with grief. Anna and Otto Quangel’s son has been killed at the front. This working class couple had long believed in the ‘Führer’ and followed him willingly, but now they realise that his promises are nothing but lies and deceit. They begin writing postcards as a form of resistance and in a bid to raise awareness: Stop the war machine! Kill Hitler! Putting their lives at risk, they distribute these cards in the entrances of tenement buildings and in stairwells. But the SS and the Gestapo are soon onto them, and even their neighbours pose a threat.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["War","Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"2016-02-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qx9r2keMWhYZgnncVR9DiNvfFnI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8BuRgEY3dMw8usxelybUS1K3NMd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qx9r2keMWhYZgnncVR9DiNvfFnI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8BuRgEY3dMw8usxelybUS1K3NMd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":200505,"title":"Draft Day","description":"At the NFL Draft, general manager Sonny Weaver has the opportunity to rebuild his team when he trades for the number one pick. He must decide what he''s willing to sacrifice on a life-changing day for a few hundred young men with NFL dreams.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2014-04-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6OmYtlqri24uwgPx1UQERaZIMmn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bnl2ocjS1io4UCPhjoFuPKmJ9bf.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6OmYtlqri24uwgPx1UQERaZIMmn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bnl2ocjS1io4UCPhjoFuPKmJ9bf.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":25189,"title":"The Mirror Has Two Faces","description":"Rose Morgan, who still lives with her mother, is a professor of Romantic Literature who desperately longs for passion in her life. Gregory Larkin, a mathematics professor, has been burned by passionate relationships and longs for a sexless union based on friendship and respect.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1996-11-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/29f4MK68pkBwDzWWTmarrmzdrcn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ekk8MKMp3tlJjcMuhOgKsMCRrvR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//29f4