 knowing that everything in life is a gamble and that gamblers are born to lose. Inevitably, he gets sucked into the world of the casino which takes its toll on his relationships and the novel he is writing.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1998-06-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/maKFO957CHUHZ9K34Hqtg1oMojH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bLLa74hdq9qsJpcVqLSwm3fKzJn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//maKFO957CHUHZ9K34Hqtg1oMojH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bLLa74hdq9qsJpcVqLSwm3fKzJn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10627,"title":"Taps","description":"Military cadets take extreme measures to ensure the future of their academy when its existence is threatened by local condo developers.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1981-12-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vpkhxXlhBdykd0cicgIZzSvpaRc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/m6w9QiuYQSBle3jygH9oV5JC8sP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vpkhxXlhBdykd0cicgIZzSvpaRc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//m6w9QiuYQSBle3jygH9oV5JC8sP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9588,"title":"Quigley Down Under","description":"American Matt Quigley answers Australian land baron Elliott Marston''s ad for a sharpshooter to kill the dingoes on his property. But when Quigley finds out that Marston''s real target is the aborigines, Quigley hits the road. Now, even American expatriate Crazy Cora can''t keep Quigley safe in his cat-and-mouse game with the homicidal Marston.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Western","Adventure"],"release_date":"1990-10-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/acceAT7dXF46O6ksnowcVAbnkY3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/93HWOYFsjLsCJC8RawGLv1ANZwS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//acceAT7dXF46O6ksnowcVAbnkY3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//93HWOYFsjLsCJC8RawGLv1ANZwS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":540709,"title":"Ema","description":"Ema is a magnetic and impulsive dancer in a reggaeton troupe. Her toxic marriage to choreographer Gastón is beyond repair, following a decision to give up on their adopted child Polo. She sets out on a mission to get him back, not caring who she’ll need to fight, seduce or destroy to make it happen.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2019-09-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ks7PNbmkcxBoSLxF4bBbqiEofHP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9p78EwUeo7NkFFCIBzU8jwxC867.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ks7PNbmkcxBoSLxF4bBbqiEofHP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9p78EwUeo7NkFFCIBzU8jwxC867.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":505948,"title":"I Am Mother","description":"A teenage girl is raised underground by a robot \"Mother\", designed to repopulate the earth following an extinction event. But their unique bond is threatened when an inexplicable stranger arrives with alarming news.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Thriller"],"release_date":"2019-06-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iJjdemZDyHGa2BJgfoyv5m1sCiw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ayPSqlpYIbeq1RiDekx6W9WUqrL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iJjdemZDyHGa2BJgfoyv5m1sCiw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ayPSqlpYIbeq1RiDekx6W9WUqrL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":91745,"title":"Romeo & Juliet","description":"In Verona, bad blood between the Montague and Capulet families leads to much bitterness. Despite the hostility, Romeo Montague manages an invitation to a masked ball at the estate of the Capulets and meets Juliet, their daughter. The two are instantly smitten but dismayed to learn that their families are enemies. Romeo and Juliet figure out a way to pursue their romance, but Romeo is banished for his part in the slaying of Juliet''s cousin, Tybalt.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2013-09-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/k8fNdW9NwNPlAdwYDMlufGwQzna.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9FZ3wTjY9rUvIoobJFv8ozoTwTT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//k8fNdW9NwNPlAdwYDMlufGwQzna.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9FZ3wTjY9rUvIoobJFv8ozoTwTT.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":28973,"title":"A King in New York","description":"A recently-deposed \"Estrovian\" monarch seeks shelter in New York City, where he becomes an accidental television celebrity. Later, he''s wrongly accused of being a Communist and gets caught up in subsequent HUAC hearings.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1957-09-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wO62WckgbBMpu3efEIY9oQsSLb0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e6KtBoiXa5D3LLZtiMCkiqIDnZv.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wO62WckgbBMpu3efEIY9oQsSLb0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e6KtBoiXa5D3LLZtiMCkiqIDnZv.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":649394,"title":"Worth","description":"Kenneth Feinberg, a powerful D.C. lawyer appointed Special Master of the 9/11 Fund, fights off the cynicism, bureaucracy, and politics associated with administering government funds and, in doing so, discovers what life is worth.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["History","Drama"],"release_date":"2021-07-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AbDiTqEu8hVA6a9BaD1mciHRkLk.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xMFKTgRRCxfZGmFQVxBsQYAQufo.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AbDiTqEu8hVA6a9BaD1mciHRkLk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xMFKTgRRCxfZGmFQVxBsQYAQufo.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11130,"title":"The Princess Diaries 2: Royal Engagement","description":"Mia Thermopolis is now a college graduate and on her way to Genovia to take up her duties as princess. Accompanied by her friend Lilly, Mia continues her ''princess lessons'', like riding horses side-saddle and archery. But her already complicated life is turned upside down once again when she learns that she is to take the crown as queen earlier than expected, all while she meets a mysteriously charming young man.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Family","Romance"],"release_date":"2004-08-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pmOXaAK8hteMlCiMZyyDJENHCZI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/upJOyrxxSIxlSZC7KEqJfB1vlGl.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pmOXaAK8hteMlCiMZyyDJENHCZI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//upJOyrxxSIxlSZC7KEqJfB1vlGl.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9789,"title":"My Brother Is an Only Child","description":"Accio and Manrico are siblings from a working-class family in 1960s Italy: older Manrico is handsome, charismatic, and loved by all, while younger Accio is sulky, hot-headed, and treats life as a battleground — much to his parents'' chagrin. After the former is drawn into left-wing politics, Accio joins the fascists out of spite, but his flimsy beliefs are put to test when he falls for Manrico''s like-minded girlfriend.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","History"],"release_date":"2007-03-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wYA0JQkcveqKpc3dC0TOTpKdanG.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rSOjjhIY9OidNPqgJcguGfHeTg.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wYA0JQkcveqKpc3dC0TOTpKdanG.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rSOjjhIY9OidNPqgJcguGfHeTg.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1696,"title":"The Devil''s Rejects","description":"The murderous, backwoods Firefly family take to the road to escape the vengeful Sheriff Wydell, who is not afraid of being as ruthless as his target.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Drama","Horror","Crime"],"release_date":"2005-07-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ya7pQHMp57aJAbNu6e5HaJLqvQ9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/drZz4AuI7trq6BxlH9Xa4v4O0Pb.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ya7pQHMp57aJAbNu6e5HaJLqvQ9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//drZz4AuI7trq6BxlH9Xa4v4O0Pb.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1624,"title":"Liar Liar","description":"Forced by his son''s birthday wish, fast-talking attorney and habitual liar Fletcher Reede must tell the truth for the next 24 hours.","duration":"1:26:00","genre":["Comedy","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1997-03-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nuDMG0uTaiWFVD6XfHPruum5JOL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/p1habYSdC7oD3WygQ5lynU5G5rV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nuDMG0uTaiWFVD6XfHPruum5JOL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//p1habYSdC7oD3WygQ5lynU5G5rV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":676705,"title":"Pil''s Adventures","description":"Pil, a little vagabond girl, lives on the streets of the medieval city of Roc-en-Brume, along with her three tame weasels. She survives of food stolen from the castle of the sinister Regent Tristain. One day, to escape his guards, Pil disguises herself as a princess. Thus she embarks upon a mad, delirious adventure, together with Crobar, a big clumsy guard who thinks she''s a noble, and Rigolin, a young crackpot jester. Pil is going to have to save Roland, rightful heir to the throne under the curse of a spell. This adventure will turn the entire kingdom upside down, and teach Pil that nobility can be found in all of us.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Animation","Adventure","Fantasy","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"2021-08-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tq3klWQevRK0Or0cGhsw0h3FDWQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/s460WnGrUOm2v18k39ZfjJF21MU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tq3klWQevRK0Or0cGhsw0h3FDWQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//s460WnGrUOm2v18k39ZfjJF21MU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":426063,"title":"Nosferatu","description":"A gothic tale of obsession between a haunted young woman and the terrifying vampire infatuated with her, causing untold horror in its wake.","duration":"2:13:00","genre":["Horror","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2024-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gprjiZWY43vxSKngMha1wfb5TGG.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/d0B8xDdqBZlzlPEzES8lu5LlNQn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gprjiZWY43vxSKngMha1wfb5TGG.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//d0B8xDdqBZlzlPEzES8lu5LlNQn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":107846,"title":"Escape Plan","description":"Ray Breslin is the world''s foremost authority on structural security. After analyzing every high security prison and learning a vast array of survival skills so he can design escape-proof prisons, his skills are put to the test. He''s framed and incarcerated in a master prison he designed himself. He needs to escape and find the person who put him behind bars.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2013-10-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ix9WYBqQ2xSZCgyeQ1vVdrbaFa4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qOZPLflxDqKogu9v9hYw3lolxGs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ix9WYBqQ2xSZCgyeQ1vVdrbaFa4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qOZPLflxDqKogu9v9hYw3lolxGs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":45610,"title":"Machine Gun Preacher","description":"The true s