n the Sky","description":"After clearing brush for the government, a group of men return to town claiming their friend was abducted. Despite no apparent motive or evidence of foul play, no-one believes their story and his disappearance is treated as murder.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Mystery","Thriller","Drama","Horror"],"release_date":"1993-03-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rG8rGUrK3Ur6N2DuTVvjrtpV44l.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rTFrjAp1YV49DSTUGCyKSkaEHC8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rG8rGUrK3Ur6N2DuTVvjrtpV44l.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rTFrjAp1YV49DSTUGCyKSkaEHC8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9538,"title":"Scanners","description":"A scientist trains a man with an advanced telepathic ability called ''scanning'' to stop a dangerous Scanner with extraordinary psychic powers from waging war against non-Scanners.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Horror"],"release_date":"1981-01-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1qxQvGJXlkFRqfGallca9DXmynS.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/VTqLdveNXxGsIAZL5I4RliTTt7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1qxQvGJXlkFRqfGallca9DXmynS.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//VTqLdveNXxGsIAZL5I4RliTTt7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8967,"title":"The Tree of Life","description":"The impressionistic story of a Texas family in the 1950s. The film follows the life journey of the eldest son, Jack, through the innocence of childhood to his disillusioned adult years as he tries to reconcile a complicated relationship with his father. Jack finds himself a lost soul in the modern world, seeking answers to the origins and meaning of life while questioning the existence of faith.","duration":"2:19:00","genre":["Drama","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2011-05-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t