 Jean, is looking for the entry code to Georges'' apartment. These characters'' lives interconnect with a Romanian immigrant and a deaf teacher.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2000-11-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bTUBuFR25xvTiFel7q6pq0ejacY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kJJx2FNmiaep8WT21uMPY9qPzxL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bTUBuFR25xvTiFel7q6pq0ejacY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kJJx2FNmiaep8WT21uMPY9qPzxL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11163,"title":"Satyricon","description":"After his young lover, Gitone, leaves him for another man, Encolpio decides to kill himself, but a sudden earthquake destroys his home before he has a chance to do so. Now wandering around Rome in the time of Nero, Encolpio encounters one bizarre and surreal scene after another.","duration":"2:09:00","genre":["Drama","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1969-09-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kPdvXDdXIbuKKAt9gEy13FNYgbm.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/83urUMl04GtwuuGIFpezqzi7n6m.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kPdvXDdXIbuKKAt9gEy13FNYgbm.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//83urUMl04GtwuuGIFpezqzi7n6m.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10692,"title":"Henry: Portrait of a Serial Killer","description":"Arriving in Chicago, Henry moves in with ex-con acquaintance Otis and starts schooling him in the ways of the serial killer.","duration":"1:23:00","genre":["Crime","Horror","Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"1986-09-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nLr8MU3e4YVwdSMpzhtiKRsO79b.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/diVMzTarVLgjc3jyODyhZMadfwD.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nLr8MU3e4YVwdSMpzhtiKRsO79b.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//diVMzTarVLgj