red to her character and needs, whose artificial intelligence is designed to be the perfect life partner for her. Enter Tom, a machine in human form in a class of its own, created solely to make her happy.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2021-07-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5AlTT97P209obOB9zRoyYDrzLkZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/v13p6KlgD7Y1Tas6X8GLJzv5zRe.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5AlTT97P209obOB9zRoyYDrzLkZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//v13p6KlgD7Y1Tas6X8GLJzv5zRe.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":47166,"title":"Ferdinand the Bull","description":"This Oscar-winning short tells of a bull who preferred to sit under trees and smell flowers to clashing horns with his fellow animals. As luck would have it, an untimely bee reveals Ferdinand''s ferocious side via pained howls and wild stomping. This lands him in the bull-fighting arena amidst characters based on Walt''s animators with a matador reportedly modeled after Walt himself.","duration":"0:08:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"1938-11-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/znaH5tNazEMv4DTc07vC5rFi7m7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u9VJv0kT6X0m2oVJQ6RWftM5sSy.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//znaH5tNazEMv4DTc07vC5rFi7m7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u9VJv0kT6X0m2oVJQ6RWftM5sSy.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":35412,"title":"On the Beach","description":"In 1964, atomic war wipes out humanity in the northern hemisphere; one American submarine finds temporary safe haven in Australia, where life-as-usual covers growing despair. In denial about the loss of his wife and children in the holocaust, American Captain Towers meets careworn but gorgeous Moira Davidson, who begins to fall for him. The sub returns after reconnaissance a month (or less) before the end; will Towers and Moira find comfort with each other?","duration":"2:14:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1959-12-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kiRjFt3UYI8j75h7JVlvz0jM1NM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lTDuj5zalrI0fpQel7UfPHTexTK.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kiRjFt3UYI8j75h7JVlvz0jM1NM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lTDuj5zalrI0fpQel7UfPHTexTK.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":24803,"title":"Julie & Julia","description":"Julia Child and Julie Powell – both of whom wrote memoirs – find their lives intertwined. Though separated by time and space, both women are at loose ends... until they discover that with the right combination of passion, fearlessness and butter, anything is possible.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2009-08-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1tWpsnSelznXfkdssCWQGgavRZM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1QZNWOOwfRi86ZApGvr2TtJZPBK.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1tWpsnSelznXfkdssCWQGgavRZM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1QZNWOOwfRi86ZApGvr2TtJZPBK.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":22171,"title":"Ms .45","description":"After being attacked and raped twice in one day, a timid, mute seamstress becomes a violent agent of revenge for wronged women.","duration":"1:21:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller","Action"],"release_date":"1981-04-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vXrZ7pyHHQGBSyfXC791b62Ouxv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9ulPP8hcBjIrWRqeXsZVjL0uX3E.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vXrZ7pyHHQGBSyfXC791b62Ouxv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9ulPP8hcBjIrWRqeXsZVjL0uX3E.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15300,"title":"Newsies","descrip