ore important who you love and not who''s in charge.","duration":"1:05:00","genre":["Adventure","Animation","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"2004-03-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eg6db3KpXpUBfFaWQNa7S6Ob3MC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yAgVcU1BdPqvnyYnOkb1QtVNd5V.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eg6db3KpXpUBfFaWQNa7S6Ob3MC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yAgVcU1BdPqvnyYnOkb1QtVNd5V.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12184,"title":"The Other Boleyn Girl","description":"A sumptuous and sensual tale of intrigue, romance and betrayal set against the backdrop of a defining moment in European history: two beautiful sisters, Anne and Mary Boleyn, driven by their family''s blind ambition, compete for the love of the handsome and passionate King Henry VIII.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","History"],"release_date":"2008-02-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jovVe4UGpmQEAE6ZEmV5xa6Kk1f.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/q2lgC8mmAltWTkbqPM8n5EYF4XL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jovVe4UGpmQEAE6ZEmV5xa6Kk1f.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//q2lgC8mmAltWTkbqPM8n5EYF4XL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12112,"title":"He Loves Me… He Loves Me Not","description":"A talented art student named Angélique is passionately in love with Dr. Loïc Le Garrec, a handsome married man whom she believes will leave his wife. When he eventually decides to stay in his marriage, it causes Angélique to spiral. However, as the story shifts from Angélique''s perspective to Loïc''s, the surprising truth about their relationship is revealed.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Thriller"],"release_date":"2002-03-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xwPS4U5DoAohQJ8orDsEEg22zot.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h90