lash. But before long, all that tension sparks fireworks of another sort, and the love-averse tough guy is torn between duty and romance.","duration":"2:09:00","genre":["Action","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1992-11-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bJyb7Bk9PLUslPggangniTBLzHO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ihWF0uY1xnKqw9YK7ZHNLUZOhcO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bJyb7Bk9PLUslPggangniTBLzHO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ihWF0uY1xnKqw9YK7ZHNLUZOhcO.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":820697,"title":"The Five Devils","description":"8-year-old Vicky has a mysterious gift: she can recreate any scent she comes across, even that of her beloved mother Joanne. When her estranged aunt Julia suddenly returns to town, the invocation of her fragrance plunges the young girl back in time to unravel a past replete with family secrets.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Drama","Fantasy","Romance"],"release_date":"2022-08-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iEqs3MI7YmjMPJPMbrdFLYzgp5t.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eGk3tFSCdF48eEEFsEgV0UwCHqh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iEqs3MI7YmjMPJPMbrdFLYzgp5t.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eGk3tFSCdF48eEEFsEgV0UwCHqh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":614292,"title":"Bad Tales","description":"In a small suburb on the outskirts of Rome, the cheerful heat of summer camouflages a stifling atmosphere of alienation. From a distance, the families seem normal, but it’s an illusion: in the houses, courtyards and gardens, silence shrouds the subtle sadism of the fathers, the passivity of the mothers and the guilty indifference of adults. But it’s the desperation and repressed rage of the children that will explode and cut through this grotesque façade, with devastating consequences for the entire community.","duration":"1:38:00","genre"