il rises and the existence of the magic world is put to danger, Ivan has to team up with his old friends and his new rivals. They will set out on a long journey beyond the known world to find a way to defeat the enemies and to return peace to Belogorie.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Fantasy","Adventure","Comedy"],"release_date":"2020-12-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dIibeeq4QMay5bTJ2vjr72IFFRo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5VJSIAhSn4qUsg5nOj4MhQhF5wQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dIibeeq4QMay5bTJ2vjr72IFFRo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5VJSIAhSn4qUsg5nOj4MhQhF5wQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":20760,"title":"Lilo & Stitch 2: Stitch Has a Glitch","description":"Now, we find the rowdy extraterrestrial getting used to life with his new ʻohana. However, a malfunction in the ultimate creation of Dr. Jumba soon emerges, which reinstates his destructive programming and threatens to both ruin his friendship with Lilo and to short him out for good!","duration":"1:08:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Comedy","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2005-08-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5blbwmFZekM3ffqxDoveupJck5C.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/p2R4mhZcikWEBlqv80VfJ7M9xql.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5blbwmFZekM3ffqxDoveupJck5C.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//p2R4mhZcikWEBlqv80VfJ7M9xql.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":16992,"title":"The Boxer","description":"Nineteen-year-old Danny Flynn is imprisoned for his involvement with the I.R.A. in Belfast. He leaves behind his family and his sixteen-year-old girlfriend, Maggie Hamill. Fourteen years later, Danny is released from prison and returns to his old working class neighborhood to resume his life as a boxer.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1997-12-31","backdrop_path