oing she innocently unleashes the horrors of the undead once again on the populace, including those at her school for ladies. Luckily for some, Dr. Van Helsing is already on his way.","duration":"1:22:00","genre":["Horror"],"release_date":"1960-06-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9hdHLj5aJ0kQpPnCC2lFHsu9K7K.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yJYJmxZZIAkrn0BaMcYnvEB8wVk.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9hdHLj5aJ0kQpPnCC2lFHsu9K7K.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yJYJmxZZIAkrn0BaMcYnvEB8wVk.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":18990,"title":"The Mummy","description":"One by one the archaeologists who discover the 4,000-year-old tomb of Princess Ananka are brutally murdered. Kharis, high priest in Egypt 40 centuries ago, has been brought to life by the power of the ancient gods and his sole purpose is to destroy those responsible for the desecration of the sacred tomb. But Isobel, wife of one of the explorers, resembles the beautiful princess, forcing the speechless and tormented monster to defy commands and abduct Isobel to an unknown fate.","duration":"1:28:00","genre":["Horror"],"release_date":"1959-08-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vnRmAak09fX10KGG82blVhBZDHl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/w3XEtgi8W9tuPQnLVFCPVxtweyC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vnRmAak09fX10KGG82blVhBZDHl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//w3XEtgi8W9tuPQnLVFCPVxtweyC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":18905,"title":"Caveman","description":"Disgraced and cast out of his tribe for lusting after Lana, the mate of the tribe''s head muscle man, Atouk stumbles along gathering other misfits and learning a bit about the world outside of his cave. Eventually he and friends Lar and Tala learn the secrets of fire, cooked meat, and how to defend themselves from the brutal, yet very stupid dinosaurs.","dur