 human consciousness. Using sensory deprivation and hallucinogenic mixtures from Native American shamans, he explores these altered states of cognizance and finds that memory, time, and reality itself are states of mind.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Horror","Science Fiction","Thriller"],"release_date":"1980-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4iJQItnH2qmV7fZVDGvdE4XyxcO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fsoaPN5SWYgZ4B7GG9nRNj33so.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4iJQItnH2qmV7fZVDGvdE4XyxcO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fsoaPN5SWYgZ4B7GG9nRNj33so.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10912,"title":"All Quiet on the Western Front","description":"At the start of World War I, Paul Baumer is a young German patriot, eager to fight. Indoctrinated with propaganda at school, he and his friends eagerly sign up for the army soon after graduation. But when the horrors of war soon become too much to bear, and as his friends die or become gravely wounded, Paul questions the sanity of fighting over a few hundreds yards of war-torn countryside.","duration":"2:30:00","genre":["War","Drama","TV Movie"],"release_date":"1979-11-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/Awo2WTB3p5NDGniBHZ8lRuKczR0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lQdUlvbX6DfJruknXbyOmZK7RoS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//Awo2WTB3p5NDGniBHZ8lRuKczR0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lQdUlvbX6DfJruknXbyOmZK7RoS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10269,"title":"Yentl","description":"In a time when girls were forbidden to study religious scriptures, a Jewish girl masquerades as a boy to enter religious training and unexpectedly finds love along the way.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Music","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1983-11-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oMRr5B0OkOJ8vjwR2w5Xw7YNp9W.