or them to test their mettle at a competition hosted by Emperor Chiaotzu. Not everyone''s playing by the rules, however, as a member of the ruler''s household schemes to use the Dragonballs to extort money and power from the royal.","duration":"0:48:00","genre":["Action","Animation"],"release_date":"1988-07-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mhwqI7dKEjVwhTbILHM3tZyarTD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4uPs9rjKkGWOmc5QO4VV08YdLpV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mhwqI7dKEjVwhTbILHM3tZyarTD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4uPs9rjKkGWOmc5QO4VV08YdLpV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":25389,"title":"Matinee","description":"A showman introduces a small coastal town to a unique movie experience and capitalizes on the Cuban Missile crisis hysteria with a kitschy horror extravaganza combining film effects, stage props and actors in rubber suits in this salute to the B-movie.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1993-01-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nfTkAIHLQ0XGVAxJefC8zX5yYrr.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2S6FEhl4dpr5E0mj3sth0XxJQAu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nfTkAIHLQ0XGVAxJefC8zX5yYrr.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2S6FEhl4dpr5E0mj3sth0XxJQAu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":22307,"title":"Sisters","description":"Inquisitive journalist Grace Collier is horrified when she witnesses her neighbor, fashion model Danielle Breton, violently murder a man. Panicking, she calls the police. But when the detective arrives at the scene and finds nothing amiss, Grace is forced to take matters into her own hands. Her first move is to recruit private investigator Joseph Larch, who helps her to uncover a secret about Danielle''s past that has them both seeing double.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Thriller","Horror"],"release_date":"1973-03-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/V4iqE9Ptgx7FJ8pLK0IWI9Zg46.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hqxzpgJse54AcX1Mt1c6raXS290.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//V4iqE9Ptgx7FJ8pLK0IWI9Zg46.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hqxzpgJse54AcX1Mt1c6raXS290.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11371,"title":"The Score","description":"An aging thief hopes to retire and live off his ill-gotten wealth when a young kid convinces him into doing one last heist.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Thriller","Mystery","Drama"],"release_date":"2001-07-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tCBcuOw60wjzLvg9oJdZKlBn1nG.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fsb4m9XW59mei8GKznvI3lLzcfp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tCBcuOw60wjzLvg9oJdZKlBn1nG.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fsb4m9XW59mei8GKznvI3lLzcfp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10399,"title":"Mansfield Park","description":"Fanny Price is sent to live with her wealthy relatives, the Bertrams, where she is treated poorly by most except her cousin Edmund. Her life is complicated by the arrival of the worldly Mary and Henry Crawford.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"1999-11-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/w3jB1liVZioKssQ9V18mEZaTG9V.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4l6KP9BSU1QgSgj9cjpeS3Bfhsr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//w3jB1liVZioKssQ9V18mEZaTG9V.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4l6KP9BSU1QgSgj9cjpeS3Bfhsr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":245,"title":"About a Boy","description":"Will Freeman is a good-looking, smooth-talking bachelor whose primary goal in life is avoiding any kind of responsibility. But when he invents an imaginary son in order to meet attractive single moms, Will gets a hilarious lesson about life from a bright, but hopelessly geeky 12-year-old named Marcus. Now, as Will struggles to teach Marcus the art of being cool, Marcus teaches Will that you''re never too old to grow up.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2002-04-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xxiPjhXigJ4zPiqqrA77FK10ULo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qoZ1bD0q9EFqcNiEYbEigsRcNCt.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xxiPjhXigJ4zPiqqrA77FK10ULo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qoZ1bD0q9EFqcNiEYbEigsRcNCt.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":959092,"title":"Mayhem!","description":"Sam is a professional boxer about to get released from prison. While on parole, his past catches up with him and he has no choice but to flee. Five years later, he has rebuilt a simple life on an exotic island in Thailand with his wife and her daughter, but when he gets blackmailed by a dangerous local godfather, he must embark on a dangerous drug smuggling mission which results in a tragedy. Now he has only one purpose: to seek merciless vengeance.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2023-06-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dSbHiA9m62FhQxiSZoJmhzKlmZD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u9035lysUz3ccloQt0SeIp1Mu8a.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dSbHiA9m62FhQxiSZoJmhzKlmZD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u9035lysUz3ccloQt0SeIp1Mu8a.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":75612,"title":"Oblivion","description":"Jack Harper is one of the last few drone repairmen stationed on Earth. Part of a massive operation to extract vital resources after decades of war with a terrifying threat known as the Scavs, Jack’s mission is nearly complete. His existence is brought crashing down when he rescues a beautiful  stranger from a downed spacecraft. Her arrival triggers a chain of events that  forces him to question everything he knows and puts the fate of humanity in his hands.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Action","Science Fiction","Adventure","Mystery"],"release_date":"2013-04-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2kVt8oj1cSz4GAP0Hi8SESOiH0T.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bYLM3GpNUZnoFElPXp1zlhDPdtv.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2kVt8oj1cSz4GAP0Hi8SESOiH0T.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bYLM3GpNUZnoFElPXp1zlhDPdtv.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":48138,"title":"Unknown","description":"A man awakens from a coma, only to discover that someone has taken on his identity and that no one, (not even his wife), believes him. With the help of a young woman, he sets out to prove who he is.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Action","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2011-02-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/f2d419xzKDbtVpToJorTxlKMvgQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aXBQD515okXQZmYA89ntXMvSJSd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//f2d419xzKDbtVpToJorTxlKMvgQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aXBQD515okXQZmYA89ntXMvSJSd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":17985,"title":"Bleeder","description":"Two stories for the price of one: a video store clerk tries to get acquainted with a waitress; a man beats his pregnant wife, unaware that her brother is a violent racist.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"1999-08-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/usFLaJeqJgIBA65msnNgCXiVjUx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lNF10v7Db2zq53kBcwKGlVcd8Er.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//usFLaJeqJgIBA65msnNgCXiVjUx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lNF10v7Db2zq53kBcwKGlVcd8Er.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9726,"title":"A Good Year","description":"Failed London banker Max Skinner inherits his uncle''s vineyard in Provence, where he spent many childhood holidays. Upon his arrival, he meets a woman from California who tells Max she is his long-lost cousin and that the property is hers.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2006-09-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dV5AKLfihrUTfAqh7dj9MG3OUWl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/10ErazhJxfL68rWg2KLfwiRuIou.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dV5AKLfihrUTfAqh7dj9MG3OUWl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//10ErazhJxfL68rWg2KLfwiRuIou.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":3021,"title":"1408","description":"A man who specializes in debunking paranormal occurrences checks into the fabled room 1408 at the Dolphin Hotel. Soon after settling in, he confronts genuine terror.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Horror","Mystery"],"release_date":"2007-06-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a4ZupLMg23auAw8e1j1K39PCO6z.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yE9MCW7ZNxSw5SC1TMqm51pMBIV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//a4ZupLMg23auAw8e1j1K39PCO6z.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yE9MCW7ZNxSw5SC1TMqm51pMBIV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1216191,"title":"Oddity","description":"After the brutal murder of her twin sister, Darcy goes after those responsible by using haunted items as her tools for revenge.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Horror","Mystery"],"release_date":"2024-07-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6GhU4BJnqLSaAuz0yQBq3RfdzsF.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3Z9c1tbUhP0QruRjczPHnbx3U2D.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6GhU4BJnqLSaAuz0yQBq3RfdzsF.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3Z9c1tbUhP0QruRjczPHnbx3U2D.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":83686,"title":"The Words","description":"The Words follows young writer Rory Jansen who finally achieves long sought after literary success after publishing the next great American novel. There''s only one catch - he didn''t write it. As the past comes back to haunt him and his literary star continues to rise, Jansen is forced to confront the steep price that must be paid for stealing another man''s work, and for placing ambition and success above life''s most fundamental three words.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2012-09-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/b0GGZbLB7P9r4klx1wUcz77WzE6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aJtPLZS7tlpiQl6pEr8H42K565x.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//b0GGZbLB7P9r4klx1wUcz77WzE6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aJtPLZS7tlpiQl6pEr8H42K565x.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":78698,"title":"Big Miracle","description":"A small-town news reporter and a Greenpeace volunteer enlist the help of rival superpowers to save three majestic gray whales trapped under the ice of the Arctic Circle.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Adventure","Drama","Romance","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2012-02-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9iMCwIdz2ZXAuKurdPiVrJy05Kb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hqdrgC5oHK06DDaAlulReUC7Nog.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9iMCwIdz2ZXAuKurdPiVrJy05Kb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hqdrgC5oHK06DDaAlulReUC7Nog.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":24742,"title":"Secret Admirer","description":"An anonymous love letter left in Michael Ryan''s locker on the last day of school wreaks havoc on his life and the lives of everyone who comes in contact with it.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"1985-06-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/otElW2B6kTSObMEzaFGkZdPRRbE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4kJQ1R7zD1ckFPFfmyxI7kwPSiM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//otElW2B6kTSObMEzaFGkZdPRRbE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4kJQ1R7zD1ckFPFfmyxI7kwPSiM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11283,"title":"Nanny McPhee","description":"Widower Cedric Brown hires Nanny McPhee to care for his seven rambunctious children, who have chased away all previous nannies. Taunted by Simon and his siblings, Nanny McPhee uses mystical powers to instill discipline. And when the children''s great-aunt and benefactor, Lady Adelaide Stitch, threatens to separate the kids, the family pulls together under the guidance of Nanny McPhee.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Fantasy","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"2005-10-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ijmKdhQQ86L18ZUywjHjM7h7YgO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8tommndfI0W62teXwSmXdmVZ7gz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ijmKdhQQ86L18ZUywjHjM7h7YgO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8tommndfI0W62teXwSmXdmVZ7gz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10201,"title":"Yes Man","description":"Carl Allen, a guy whose life is going nowhere, signs up for a self-help program based on one simple covenant: say yes to everything…and anything.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2008-12-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/l9kUuYVqiZV1r6d4nKUKcQvtLR3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8Vk2nQF1kY34x53YnWd5zDaTht.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//l9kUuYVqiZV1r6d4nKUKcQvtLR3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8Vk2nQF1kY34x53YnWd5zDaTht.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2462,"title":"Hibernatus","description":"Hubert de Tartas'' life becomes a complete muddle when his wife''s grandfather is unearthed after having spent 65 years in frozen hibernation in the polar circle. After being de-frosted, the Hibernating Man believes it is still the beginning of the century. Nothing is spared to keep that illusion alive. At the end of his rope, Hubert blurts out the truth and takes the man from Edwardian times on a crazy spree through an ultramodern Twentieth Century.","duration":"1:22:00","genre":["Comedy","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1969-09-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yoIwxm5PlsHfK6DfqdRdZN7A6t9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dQTG9gwSgaGD9T8vukNFPMOcBh0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yoIwxm5PlsHfK6DfqdRdZN7A6t9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dQTG9gwSgaGD9T8vukNFPMOcBh0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":787,"title":"Mr. & Mrs. Smith","description":"A husband and wife struggle to keep their marriage alive until they realize they are both secretly working as assassins. Now, their respective assignments require them to kill each other.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Action","Comedy","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2005-06-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tgDSUwWMgypgmcBhRs9u30RLPNC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kjD700RtyhveN3ZbOnSvUSne0Qj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tgDSUwWMgypgmcBhRs9u30RLPNC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kjD700RtyhveN3ZbOnSvUSne0Qj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":787781,"title":"Quiz Lady","description":"A brilliant but tightly wound, gameshow-obsessed young woman, Anne, and her estranged, train-wreck of a sister, Jenny, must work together to help cover their mother''s gambling debts. When Anne''s beloved dog is kidnapped, they set out on a wild, cross-country trek to get the cash the only way they know how: by turning Anne into a bona-fide gameshow champion.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2023