mbling estate to claim his bride, Roderick goes to ruthless—even deadly—lengths to keep them apart.","duration":"1:19:00","genre":["Horror","Drama"],"release_date":"1960-07-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bNFtjsp9v95DL9iL20Gue4gMddZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jEzZOrGSWpl0jKOIXoY3OnEabLQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bNFtjsp9v95DL9iL20Gue4gMddZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jEzZOrGSWpl0jKOIXoY3OnEabLQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13190,"title":"Dead Space: Downfall","description":"On a deep space mining mission to a remote planet, an ancient religious relic - thought to be proof of the existence of God - is unearthed and brought aboard. When the unholy artifact unleashes a long-dormant alien race, its glimpse of Heaven transforms the ship into a living Hell. A prequel to the events of the 2008 video game Dead Space.","duration":"1:14:00","genre":["Animation","Horror","Science Fiction","Thriller"],"release_date":"2008-10-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aFnF8gvNedNWHoCNTjZWphebecd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/w8KNXRQF9UzplokFlDrNMt0FkW7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aFnF8gvNedNWHoCNTjZWphebecd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//w8KNXRQF9UzplokFlDrNMt0FkW7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1635,"title":"The Island","description":"In 2019, Lincoln Six-Echo is a resident of a seemingly \"Utopian\" but contained facility. Like all of the inhabitants of this carefully-controlled environment, Lincoln hopes to be chosen to go to The Island — reportedly the last uncontaminated location on the planet. But Lincoln soon discovers that everything about his existence is a lie.","duration":"2:16:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2005-07-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zZZ1FDl5FPClZ9OnMrl