ip by fixing every mistake he made—while dragging his best friend along in the process.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2018-11-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/il036klfxddKrHHZPpxvWc0L5Kr.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oSDctngY0Oiq6l2LcJDk8k6smvg.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//il036klfxddKrHHZPpxvWc0L5Kr.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oSDctngY0Oiq6l2LcJDk8k6smvg.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":421447,"title":"The Climb","description":"A true story of Samy, native of La Courneuve, who is out of love for Nadia, decides to climb Mount Everest.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance","Adventure"],"release_date":"2017-01-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a4bLN32DOZkKiJCky97lfNNX9k5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tlNg2wOSuZOjgrbcLtbetOppUM5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//a4bLN32DOZkKiJCky97lfNNX9k5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tlNg2wOSuZOjgrbcLtbetOppUM5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":353070,"title":"Going in Style","description":"Desperate to pay the bills and come through for their loved ones, three lifelong pals risk it all by embarking on a daring bid to knock off the very bank that absconded with their money.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Crime","Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2017-04-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uARnuPezr7eZkOsHj2ujFQz6EKE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4nfWsdsJfO5srRZgxiWC9xHub0W.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uARnuPezr7eZkOsHj2ujFQz6EKE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4nfWsdsJfO5srRZgxiWC9xHub0W.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":337676,"title":"Mektoub, My Love: Canto Uno","description":"Amin, an aspiring screenwriter living in Paris, returns home for the summer, in Sète, South of France. It is a time of reconnecting with his family and his childhood friends. Together with his cousin Tony and his best friend Ophélie, he spends his time between the Tunisian restaurant run by his parents, the local bars and the beaches frequented by girls on holiday.","duration":"2:54:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2018-03-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jyvbxKsmIIYTQsjOCjnRYWyUEsa.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jJLL0E243c8CBTlryvYh69rQQV9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jyvbxKsmIIYTQsjOCjnRYWyUEsa.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jJLL0E243c8CBTlryvYh69rQQV9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":41659,"title":"My Life","description":"It seems that Bob Jones has everything a man could want, namely a fulfilling job and a beautiful, pregnant wife, Gail. But Bob''s life is turned upside-down when he is diagnosed with cancer and given four months to live -- not even enough time to see his first child''s birth. To cleanse himself of demons in his remaining days, Bob makes a video diary, hoping to pass along some wisdom to his future child. Along the way, he discovers a lot about himself.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1993-11-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5ccAivPcFEJazxwZZnr5QOGNcz6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eF8wNMMqY3kukUTTAVXLLx94UhB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5ccAivPcFEJazxwZZnr5QOGNcz6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eF8wNMMqY3kukUTTAVXLLx94UhB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11443,"title":"Dead Presidents","description":"On the streets they call cash dead presidents. And that''s just what a Vietnam veteran is after when he returns home from the war only to find himself drawn into a life of crime. With the aid of his fellow vets he plans the ultimate heist -- a daring robbery of an armored car filled with unmarked U.S. currency!","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Action"],"release_date":"1995-09-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/c8H6Xi9im1tT6HP9PA9HpFE3sOy.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eGfsSXizR11tTHVo0kuOOFPAxZt.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//c8H6Xi9im1tT6HP9PA9HpFE3sOy.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eGfsSXizR11tTHVo0kuOOFPAxZt.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10341,"title":"Until the End of the World","description":"In 1999, a woman''s life is forever changed after she survives a car crash with two bank robbers, who enlist her help to take the money to a drop in Paris. On the way, she runs into another fugitive from the law — an American doctor on the run from the CIA. They want to confiscate his father''s invention – a device which allows anyone to record their dreams and visions.","duration":"2:38:00","genre":["Drama","Science Fiction","Adventure"],"release_date":"1991-09-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wF08MKJWgBIJqmTQXSWwXbQe0OU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sDpYWgYkBlrVnpySXQNsxVvDAAG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wF08MKJWgBIJqmTQXSWwXbQe0OU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sDpYWgYkBlrVnpySXQNsxVvDAAG.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":25,"title":"Jarhead","description":"Jarhead is a film about a US Marine Anthony Swofford’s experience in the Gulf War. After putting up with an arduous boot camp, Swofford and his unit are sent to the Persian Gulf where they are eager to fight, but are forced to stay back from the action. Swofford struggles with the possibility of his girlfriend cheating on him, and as his mental state deteriorates, his desire to kill increases.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Drama","War"],"release_date":"2005-11-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bQ8fRUaitJvi54O2lUT6Ta7FVHK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6vdj47RAWOUZBkeQmqToeZ7eaio.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bQ8fRUaitJvi54O2lUT6Ta7FVHK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6vdj47RAWOUZBkeQmqToeZ7eaio.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":662546,"title":"Godmothered","description":"A young and unskilled fairy godmother that ventures out on her own to prove her worth by tracking down a young girl whose request for help was ignored. What she discovers is that the girl has now become a grown woman in need of something very different than a \"prince charming.\"","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Family","Fantasy","Comedy"],"release_date":"2020-12-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9hT855BbX7yypRbxb8yPrQQ5CcC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/80tDCErk6ymHS7YfvqJcbnnTtqa.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9hT855BbX7yypRbxb8yPrQQ5CcC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//80tDCErk6ymHS7YfvqJcbnnTtqa.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":37292,"title":"Broken Arrow","description":"Indian scout Tom Jeffords is sent out to stem the war between the American settlers and Apaches in the late 1870s Arizona. He learns that the Indians kill only to protect themselves, or out of retaliation for white atrocities.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Western","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1950-07-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yEP3KF4YBOn4CMO5kc5aQWuqLmi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/n061xgOTAvJ2l06latNDF4s13FV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yEP3KF4YBOn4CMO5kc5aQWuqLmi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//n061xgOTAvJ2l06latNDF4s13FV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13763,"title":"Purple Rain","description":"A victim of his own anger, the Kid is a Minneapolis musician on the rise with his band, the Revolution, escaping a tumultuous home life through music. While trying to avoid making the same mistakes as his truculent father, the Kid navigates the club scene and a rocky relationship with a captivating singer, Apollonia. But another musician, Morris, looks to steal the Kid''s spotlight -- and his girl.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Drama","Music","Romance"],"release_date":"1984-07-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/s3WFrpZV1QIo8Aao2TaAI5ERUTO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vkQmzaSuDj8QyXmwNhCceCAmwUe.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//s3WFrpZV1QIo8Aao2TaAI5ERUTO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vkQmzaSuDj8QyXmwNhCceCAmwUe.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9044,"title":"Tristan & Isolde","description":"An affair between the second in line to Britain''s throne and the princess of the feuding Irish spells doom for the young lovers.","duration":"2:05:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2006-04-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cmmOLD0UOrw8rJ2WBb3rvEUhkE1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/r7TpY5hJ4jQGH7c8yzJgBnTwPH6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cmmOLD0UOrw8rJ2WBb3rvEUhkE1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//r7TpY5hJ4jQGH7c8yzJgBnTwPH6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":471853,"title":"Transit","description":"In an attempt to flee Nazi-occupied France, Georg assumes the identity of a dead author but soon finds himself stuck in Marseilles, where he falls in love with Maria, a young woman searching for her missing husband.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2018-04-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qBR2L2hpQ8lgslpRiT4gU8IqFnv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3YLOCnokMMSIOCvA0kCnkhpTD79.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qBR2L2hpQ8lgslpRiT4g