ne, producing an adorable and wholly unauthorized baby girl...","duration":"1:27:00","genre":["Adventure","Animation","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"2016-09-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3dhuShnYmB0UOQrn8v8gT9DBf0T.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pwGolX8JmGJhhcUjO5SJt38Uk0m.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3dhuShnYmB0UOQrn8v8gT9DBf0T.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pwGolX8JmGJhhcUjO5SJt38Uk0m.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":278236,"title":"X+Y","description":"Struggling to connect with those around him, a teenage math prodigy trains for the International Mathematical Olympiad, where a budding romance with a fellow contestant breaks through his emotional walls and teaches him that love cannot be calculated.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2015-03-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jHlodFQ7WcmVWYi6HAAc2Ox9rPZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jYkfSWb9rlTTzvLclCuJwm48kbl.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jHlodFQ7WcmVWYi6HAAc2Ox9rPZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jYkfSWb9rlTTzvLclCuJwm48kbl.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15655,"title":"The Tigger Movie","description":"Winnie the Pooh, Piglet, Owl, Kanga, Roo, and Rabbit are preparing a suitable winter home for Eeyore, the perennially dejected donkey, but Tigger''s continual bouncing interrupts their efforts. Rabbit suggests that Tigger go find others of his kind to bounce with, but Tigger thinks \"the most wonderful thing about tiggers is\" he''s \"the only one!\" Just in case though, the joyously jouncy feline sets out to see if he can find relatives.","duration":"1:17:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Comedy"],"release_date":"2000-02-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/60JMvMGuLHSlVjoUpi86UiB5Lmq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9OdZKUdGfaBAUwRLbtWpFWKbILO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//60JMvMGuLHSlVjoUpi86UiB5Lmq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9OdZKUdGfaBAUwRLbtWpFWKbILO.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13614,"title":"Katyn","description":"On September 1st, 1939, Nazi Germany invades Poland, unleashing World War II. On September 17th, the Soviet Red Army crosses the border. The Polish army, unable to fight on two fronts, is defeated. Thousands of Polish men, both military and government officials, are captured by the invaders. Their fate will only be known several years later.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Drama","History","War"],"release_date":"2007-09-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/Pbr2ImzoDbE8CdGyencQpdEOdw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/g9yyF5zC2pel0gG6vxlVpkDgZgC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//Pbr2ImzoDbE8CdGyencQpdEOdw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//g9yyF5zC2pel0gG6vxlVpkDgZgC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8065,"title":"21","description":"Ben Campbell is a young, highly intelligent student at M.I.T. who strives to succeed. Wanting a scholarship to transfer to Harvard School of Medicine to become a doctor, Ben learns that he cannot afford the $300,000 tuition as he comes from a poor, working-class background. But one evening, Ben is introduced by his unorthodox math professor to a small but secretive club of five students, Jill, Choi, Kianna, and Fisher, who are being trained by Professor Rosa to count cards at blackjack.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"2008-03-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u6OCGwhSWhfQX1LZ4NTq0bfcWxs.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/efG8Po57alqSlhqHU1lXJ3duG6t.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u6OCGwhSWhfQX1LZ4NTq0bfcWxs.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//efG8Po57alqSlhqHU1lXJ3duG6t.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1992,"title":"Planet Terror","description":"Two doctors find their graveyard shift inundated with townspeople ravaged by sores. Among the wounded is Cherry Darling, a dancer whose leg was ripped from her body. As the invalids quickly become enraged aggressors, Cherry and her ex-boyfriend El Wray lead a team of accidental warriors into the night.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Horror","Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2007-04-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iZBUOcku0xv9MMfiEMXiDqErPXl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/30ANoUgvqQZ9tgCnM6OyJZUveaf.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iZBUOcku0xv9MMfiEMXiDqErPXl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//30ANoUgvqQZ9tgCnM6OyJZUveaf.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":799882,"title":"The Bluff","description":"When her tranquil life on a remote island is shattered by the return of her vengeful former captain, a skilled ex-pirate must confront her bloody past and unleash her deadly talents to save her family from a ruthless siege.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Drama","Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2026-02-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rbFqLPKj6D2JyRh5mOfA7jqX0Qk.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dl1cA7wdwePc9QU2Rc24EPqlcyJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rbFqLPKj6D2JyRh5mOfA7jqX0Qk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dl1cA7wdwePc9QU2Rc24EPqlcyJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":724209,"title":"Heart of Stone","description":"An intelligence operative for a shadowy global peacekeeping agency races to stop a hacker from stealing its most valuable — and dangerous — weapon.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2023-08-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/m1k24MwmoqAdKMPJDaBLwdB5Tps.jpg","poster_path":"htt