omance","Drama"],"release_date":"2012-09-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2gR4hjE2atX7rwVm3pxtHKlTSx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mLFXD0GrJhrRlvNpWbmecEiRADy.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2gR4hjE2atX7rwVm3pxtHKlTSx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mLFXD0GrJhrRlvNpWbmecEiRADy.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":96724,"title":"Anna Karenina","description":"In Imperial Russia, Anna, wife of the officer Karenin, goes to Moscow to visit her brother. On the way, she meets charming cavalry officer Vronsky, to whom she''s immediately attracted. But in St. Petersburg’s high society, a relationship like this could destroy a woman’s reputation.","duration":"2:09:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","History"],"release_date":"2012-09-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wpl3g17Ucjh30hUBv4Ng57ERWA6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/b9mvt1kKqDuveD1AJuGSkBEuagU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wpl3g17Ucjh30hUBv4Ng57ERWA6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//b9mvt1kKqDuveD1AJuGSkBEuagU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":81250,"title":"Geek Charming","description":"Film geek Josh is looking for the subject of his new documentary when a chance meeting puts the perfect star in his sights—Dylan, his school''s most popular junior. But Dylan''s hopes of using the film to become Blossom Queen don''t quite match with Josh''s goal to make a hard-hitting exposé about popularity. Will Josh shoot the film as planned, or show Dylan as the truly interesting person she is?","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance","Family","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2011-11-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5btPLADkUW3gxzIs25VdqRAOMtB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xweQBQSYQyHKiUxN1nCDQbLvJE0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5btPLADkUW3gxzIs25VdqRAOMtB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xweQBQSYQyHKiUxN1nCDQbLvJE0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":49763,"title":"Bad Moon","description":"During an expedition in Nepal, a photo-journalist becomes infected by a werewolf. Returning to the U.S., he holes up in an isolated location in the woods, but when he invites his sister and nephew for a visit, their dog, Thor, knows something is amiss.","duration":"1:20:00","genre":["Horror","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1996-11-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5Qr1sU7l1BU7qVnu8iTu3iND89U.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1RobAQaPIYV2PBmkb4XISbsQZPe.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5Qr1sU7l1BU7qVnu8iTu3iND89U.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1RobAQaPIYV2PBmkb4XISbsQZPe.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15592,"title":"Beaches","description":"A privileged rich debutante and a cynical struggling entertainer share a turbulent, but strong childhood friendship over the years.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Music"],"release_date":"1988-12-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sO2pl7lp81dgEY1oUbIWk6w3d1j.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vol5TCGHDbi8r0yo0TrIGFiGxJ7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sO2pl7lp81dgEY1oUbIWk6w3d1j.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vol5TCGHDbi8r0yo0TrIGFiGxJ7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13971,"title":"Wild Child","description":"Sixteen-year-old Poppy has everything her unlimited credit cards can buy, and a spoiled attitude to match. After a final thoughtless prank, her exasperated father ships her off to boarding school in England. There, Poppy meets her match in a stern headmistress and a class full of girls who will not tolerate her selfishness.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"2008-08-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zjobTF54Z1P1hpa3w2RePqL42is.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xwbFEPubG4wroLDZdmTWRGNnnWf.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zjobTF54Z1P1hpa3w2RePqL42is.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xwbFEPubG4wroLDZdmTWRGNnnWf.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12573,"title":"A Serious Man","description":"It is 1967, and Larry Gopnik, a physics professor at a quiet Midwestern university, has just been informed by his wife Judith that she is leaving him. He scrambles to find a semblance of meaning as he loses control of nearly every aspect of his life.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2009-10-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6j3YrwkG4TZo8oNR4U4SDpql4pP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5gGxDS8WmrebPlMHexVS8EVehiP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6j3YrwkG4TZo8oNR4U4SDpql4pP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5gGxDS8WmrebPlMHexVS8EVehiP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10731,"title":"The Client","description":"A street-wise kid, Mark Sway, sees the suicide of Jerome Clifford, a prominent Louisiana lawyer, whose current client is Barry ''The Blade'' Muldano, a Mafia hit-man. Before Jerome shoots himself, he tells Mark where the body of a Senator is buried. Clifford shoots himself and Mark is found at the scene, and both the FBI and the Mafia quickly realize that Mark probably knows more than he says.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Crime","Mystery"],"release_date":"1994-07-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ncU6X4hosU9srxqC0hGxajZvAyD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oLdkJ4ZjxPtFSUChdjDQvHM9l75.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ncU6X4hosU9srxqC0hGxajZvAyD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oLdkJ4ZjxPtFSUChdjDQvHM