pon: a shadow, a look-alike who can fool both his enemies and the King himself. Now he must use this weapon in an intricate plan that will lead his people to victory in a war that the King does not want.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Action","War"],"release_date":"2018-09-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1A0h3Bek2eyxHNRikyZdXDGXxdS.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/h0iIEYdJ65xXiKjwtdUXy0bG07x.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1A0h3Bek2eyxHNRikyZdXDGXxdS.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//h0iIEYdJ65xXiKjwtdUXy0bG07x.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":360605,"title":"Invisible Sister","description":"Teenager Cleo''s school science project goes quite awry, causing her popular older sister Molly to go invisible.","duration":"1:18:00","genre":["Fantasy","Adventure","Comedy","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2015-12-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xy4kRFTxMbPeWBKcQkijJ8i1DFx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/seWQvVIzb5xBjHW0Y1h4jvokxZN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xy4kRFTxMbPeWBKcQkijJ8i1DFx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//seWQvVIzb5xBjHW0Y1h4jvokxZN.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":121879,"title":"A Late Quartet","description":"When the beloved cellist of a world-renowned string quartet is diagnosed with a life threatening illness, the group''s future suddenly hangs in the balance as suppressed emotions, competing egos and uncontrollable passions threaten to derail years of friendship and collaboration. As they are about to play their 25th anniversary concert — quite possibly their last — only their intimate bond and the power of music can preserve their legacy.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Music","Drama"],"release_date":"2012-11-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rVmBmaXyvjDiumChLQNLW08nhDD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t