ysterious, hairy creature soon spread. People lock themselves up at night, but there''s one boy who''s still outside…","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Horror"],"release_date":"1985-10-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dRKPz3iZiuYpgdfbBQ3Af6Wo63R.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/52CvWYuJyWcMTPvsfcmsxaVHi7f.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dRKPz3iZiuYpgdfbBQ3Af6Wo63R.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//52CvWYuJyWcMTPvsfcmsxaVHi7f.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13804,"title":"Fast & Furious","description":"When a crime brings them back to L.A., fugitive ex-con Dom Toretto reignites his feud with agent Brian O''Conner. But as they are forced to confront a shared enemy, Dom and Brian must give in to an uncertain new trust if they hope to outmaneuver him. And the two men will find the best way to get revenge: push the limits of what''s possible behind the wheel.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2009-04-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/25HepicRtrzZ3MVCqhfoxGDbHjw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lUtVoRukW7WNtUySwd8hWlByBds.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//25HepicRtrzZ3MVCqhfoxGDbHjw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lUtVoRukW7WNtUySwd8hWlByBds.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13676,"title":"The Little Mermaid: Ariel''s Beginning","description":"Follow Ariel''s adventures before she gave up her fins for true love. When Ariel wasn''t singing with her sisters, she spent time with her mother, Queen Athena. Ariel is devastated when Athena is killed by pirates, and after King Triton outlaws all singing. Along with pals Flounder and Sebastian, Ariel sets off in hopes of changing her father''s decision to ban music from the kingdom.","duration":"1:17:00","genre":["Family","Animation"],"release_date":"2008-08-25","backdrop_path":"https:/