omedy","Fantasy","Music","Romance"],"release_date":"2019-06-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/t5Kp02Jzixl0KfpwthHp9ZUex9t.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9fYka5CQt9nrb6LOtKicysUf9NA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//t5Kp02Jzixl0KfpwthHp9ZUex9t.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9fYka5CQt9nrb6LOtKicysUf9NA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":373571,"title":"Godzilla: King of the Monsters","description":"Follows the heroic efforts of the crypto-zoological agency Monarch as its members face off against a battery of god-sized monsters, including the mighty Godzilla, who collides with Mothra, Rodan, and his ultimate nemesis, the three-headed King Ghidorah. When these ancient super-species, thought to be mere myths, rise again, they all vie for supremacy, leaving humanity''s very existence hanging in the balance.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Action"],"release_date":"2019-05-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uovH5k4BAEPqXqxgwVrTtqH169g.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mzOHg7Q5q9yUmY0b9Esu8Qe6Nnm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uovH5k4BAEPqXqxgwVrTtqH169g.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mzOHg7Q5q9yUmY0b9Esu8Qe6Nnm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":29074,"title":"Tales of Terror","description":"Three stories adapted from the work of Edgar Allen Poe:  1) A man and his daughter are reunited, but the blame for the death of his wife hangs over them, unresolved.  2) A derelict challenges the local wine-tasting champion to a competition, but finds the man''s attention to his wife worthy of more dramatic action.  3) A man dying and in great pain agrees to be hypnotized at the moment of death, with unexpected consequences.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Horror","Comedy","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"1962-07-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lcnDx86U3Slwzo5gEYuskIIvwsF.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/itHjXJLzxeUsPsruQV3r79egxaO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lcnDx86U3Slwzo5gEYuskIIvwsF.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//itHjXJLzxeUsPsruQV3r79egxaO.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8872,"title":"Wayne''s World","description":"The adventures of two amiably aimless metal-head friends, Wayne and Garth. From Wayne''s basement, the pair broadcast a talk-show called \"Wayne''s World\" on local public access television. The show comes to the attention of a sleazy network executive who wants to produce a big-budget version of \"Wayne''s World\"—and he also wants Wayne''s girlfriend, a rock singer named Cassandra. Wayne and Garth have to battle the executive not only to save their show, but also Cassandra.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Comedy","Music"],"release_date":"1992-02-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lAvf5zzyOgTZmpRBRJFa7IVVqCK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fHwZnFNWR7PaS9t5EBwTvGPeoYQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lAvf5zzyOgTZmpRBRJFa7IVVqCK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fHwZnFNWR7PaS9t5EBwTvGPeoYQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1020006,"title":"Priscilla","description":"When teenage Priscilla Beaulieu meets Elvis Presley at a party, the man who is already a meteoric rock-and-roll superstar becomes someone entirely unexpected in private moments: a thrilling crush, an ally in loneliness, a vulnerable best friend.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2023-10-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zz219ZRGo0vVIzvKttjx5nXOc2N.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uDCeELWWpsNq7ErM61Yuq70WAE9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zz219ZRGo0vVIzvKttjx5nXOc2N.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uDCeELWWpsNq7ErM61Yuq70WAE9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":543343,"title":"Guava Island","description":"Deni Maroon, a musician and dock worker is determined to pull off a music festival against the interests of the local factory owner.","duration":"0:56:00","genre":["Comedy","Thriller","Music"],"release_date":"2019-04-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iyiLSQlJ6vbqEHdabO8wDF4aS1W.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oQ5OnvNNGUYOPh3iTjmqx6GPsdc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iyiLSQlJ6vbqEHdabO8wDF4aS1W.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oQ5OnvNNGUYOPh3iTjmqx6GPsdc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":232679,"title":"When the Game Stands Tall","description":"A young coach turns a losing high school football program around to go undefeated for 12 consecutive seasons.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2014-08-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/h2WyyRB2jKpketuZ0znyANyJGjc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ffVhh4sBLpJCu875v6hwLJN5VNR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//h2WyyRB2jKpketuZ0znyANyJGjc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ffVhh4sBLpJCu875v6hwLJN5VNR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13691,"title":"Piglet''s Big Movie","description":"When the gang from the Hundred Acre Wood begin a honey harvest, young Piglet is excluded and told that he is too small to help. Feeling inferior, Piglet disappears and his pals Eeyore, Rabbit, Tigger, Roo and Winnie the Pooh must use Piglet''s scrapbook as a map to find him. In the process they discover that this very small animal has been a big hero in a lot of ways.","duration":"1:19:00","genre":["Animation","Family"],"release_date":"2003-03-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yrIL6TukQ3m2KLf9oFoLMF7kDnz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cytspPjtacOInHroA6h2dIekDrp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yrIL6TukQ3m2KLf9oFoLMF7kDnz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cytspPjtacOInHroA6h2dIekDrp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11441,"title":"Madly in Love","description":"Cristina is a rich, spoiled princess visiting Rome with her royal parents. The mission of their visit is to marry her off to a super-wealthy corporate type and thereby start to turn around the losses their small kingdom is experiencing in its casino business. These less-than-noble intentions get derailed when Barnaba, a zany bus driver enters their lives and falls madly in love with the gorgeous Cristina. He is nuts enough to succeed in this romantic chase after royalty, as love seems to fuel his determination to rid Cristina of her elitism and to make her see his own irrepressible attractions.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1981-12-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2b0m5uZY7ZFheQwg7qPuWks1Lz0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9Mo9IKxv7XOMJrdVpWY0iZqPMhe.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2b0m5uZY7ZFheQwg7qPuWks1Lz0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9Mo9IKxv7XOMJrdVpWY0iZqPMhe.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9869,"title":"Patriot Games","description":"When CIA Analyst Jack Ryan interferes with an IRA assassination, a renegade faction targets Jack and his family as revenge.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Drama","Action","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"1992-06-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/26Ftg4S0uORiachoSFR59biJC9c.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9IT7gnszrRthduYxCLqaIkM55Un.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//26Ftg4S0uORiachoSFR59biJC9c.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9IT7gnszrRthduYxCLqaIkM55Un.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9291,"title":"The Longest Yard","description":"Disgraced pro football quarterback Paul Crewe lands in a Texas federal penitentiary, where manipulative Warden Hazen recruits him to advise the institution''s football team of prison guards. Crewe suggests a tune-up game which lands him quarterbacking a crew of inmates in a game against the guards. Aided by incarcerated ex-NFL coach and player Nate Scarborough, Crewe and his team must overcome not only the bloodthirstiness of the opposition, but also the corrupt warden trying to fix the game against them.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"2005-05-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/63V4wbVah1gnjckPJnSU0ZmOGAW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nbKcVBcxF96ARW2oKHqDYAcLdu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//63V4wbVah1gnjckPJnSU0ZmOGAW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nbKcVBcxF96ARW2oKHqDYAcLdu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1389,"title":"Out of Sight","description":"Meet Jack Foley, a smooth criminal who bends the law and is determined to make one last heist. Karen Sisco is a federal marshal who chooses all the right moves … and all the wrong guys. Now they''re willing to risk it all to find out if there''s more between them than just the law.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"1998-06-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rOvXN8m3l4qNKCdNscLUjxK6I9I.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/v49q7AMR3pB4M762woWB1NYMCLF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rOvXN8m3l4qNKCdNscLUjxK6I9I.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//v49q7AMR3pB4M762woWB1NYMCLF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":792293,"title":"Dumb Money","description":"Vlogger Keith Gill sinks his life savings into GameStop stock and posts about it. When social media starts blowing up, so do his life and the lives of everyone following him. As a stock tip becomes a movement, everyone gets rich—until the billionaires fight back, and both sides find their worlds turned upside down.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["History","Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2023-09-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dTOQaHP4PjDXU2JwDF6UYqGqRT0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e9u7luSxFKOZgPTB9XHFnPArGdP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dTOQaHP4PjDXU2JwDF6UYqGqRT0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e9u7luSxFKOZgPTB9XHFnPArGdP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":433252,"title":"Our Souls at Night","description":"Addie Moore and Louis Waters, a widow and widower, have lived next to each other for years. The pair have almost no relationship, but that all changes when Addie tries to make a connection with her neighbour.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2017-09-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2ec2qzc9izRpDDCgNNU3CNZ8wX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e5qqikqIXqBzug3G6RCE8LFydKd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2ec2qzc9izRpDDCgNNU3CNZ8wX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e5qqikqIXqBzug3G6RCE8LFydKd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":254375,"title":"Hector and the Search for Happiness","description":"Hector is a quirky psychiatrist who has become increasingly tired of his humdrum life. As he tells his girlfriend, Clara, he feels like a fraud: he hasn’t really tasted life, and yet he’s offering advice to patients who are just not getting any happier. So Hector decides to break out of his deluded and routine driven life. Armed with buckets of courage and child-like curiosity, he embarks on a global quest in hopes of uncovering the elusive secret formula for true happiness. And so begins a larger than life adventure with riotously funny results.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Adventure","Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2014-08-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vujKrqkydYxLuFvdGjA5bDicupV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lymRg46xAt6s9ApWa9MBcgnzXAS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vujKrqkydYxLuFvdGjA5bDicupV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lymRg46xAt6s9ApWa9MBcgnzXAS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":185567,"title":"Zulu","description":"As a child, Ali Neuman narrowly escaped being murdered by Inkhata, a militant political party at war with Nelson Mandela''s African National Congress. Only he and his mother survived the carnage of those years. But as with many survivors, the psychological scars remain.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2013-12-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/883smeniIZTmucEQAMGctTMwCOt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/h5OZD7pVkIKR5jf4lGFzQQrLmLc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//883smeniIZTmucEQAMGctTMwCOt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//h5OZD7pVkIKR5jf4lGFzQQrLmLc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":75780,"title":"Jack Reacher","description":"One morning in an ordinary town, five people are shot dead in a seemingly random attack. All evidence points to a single suspect: an ex-military sniper who is quickly brought into custody. The interrogation yields one written note: ''Get Jack Reacher!''. Reacher, an enigmatic ex-Army investigator, believes the authorities have the right man but agrees to help the sniper''s defense attorney. However, the more Reacher delves into the case, the less clear-cut it appears. So begins an extraordinary chase for the truth, pitting Jack Reacher against an unexpected enemy, with a skill for violence and a secret to keep.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller","Action"],"release_date":"2012-12-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iwvP8XVpYVmJ3xfF9xdBi5uAOWl.jpg