ters their lives, Lucero finds herself pulled into a risky and consuming relationship. As secrecy, desire, and jealousy tighten their grip, the boundaries within the family begin to collapse, placing mother and daughter in a dangerous emotional triangle that threatens to shatter everything Lucero has built.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Mystery","Drama"],"release_date":"2026-05-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oBter8Y5p2ZFUwWgQ1T9pulGFTJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3bEqHqeaQlFykaLQ7N4gDkIvL5w.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oBter8Y5p2ZFUwWgQ1T9pulGFTJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3bEqHqeaQlFykaLQ7N4gDkIvL5w.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":41003,"title":"White Palace","description":"Max Baron is a Jewish advertising executive in his 20s who''s still getting over the death of his wife. Nora Baker is a 40-something diner waitress who enjoys the wilder side of life. Mismatched or not, their attraction is instant and smoldering. With time, however, their class and age differences become an obstacle in their relationship, especially since Max can''t keep Nora a secret from his Jewish friends and upper-crust associates forever.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1990-10-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yme0UvacQuWaZK9QiywD6lvx0Oz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nUxEeMzDNIrxlUXTmg3ApKj4EhU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yme0UvacQuWaZK9QiywD6lvx0Oz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nUxEeMzDNIrxlUXTmg3ApKj4EhU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":27431,"title":"The Cat o'' Nine Tails","description":"A newsman works with a blind puzzle-solver to uncover a deadly conspiracy linked to a genetic research facility.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Horror","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"1971-02-12","backdrop_path":"https://image