f the duke''s last heir.","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["Adventure","Action","Drama"],"release_date":"1997-12-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vQdHQip4YTxiOldOf2bhvNCMUJu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3tNL0uM1SNSfN2d1mKSBB5Ih6FH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vQdHQip4YTxiOldOf2bhvNCMUJu.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3tNL0uM1SNSfN2d1mKSBB5Ih6FH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2470,"title":"Belle Époque","description":"In 1931, a young soldier deserts from the army and falls into a country farm, where he is welcomed by the owner due to his political ideas. Manolo has four daughters, Fernando likes all of them and they like him, so he has to decide which one to love.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1992-12-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1HOO7m6NeK3wFw22xGBLdwvim51.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2pb7i9pI6wMH5dlyjbVTXdfSKun.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1HOO7m6NeK3wFw22xGBLdwvim51.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2pb7i9pI6wMH5dlyjbVTXdfSKun.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":672741,"title":"Till Death","description":"After a romantic evening at their secluded lake house, a woman wakes up handcuffed to her dead husband. Trapped and isolated in the dead of winter, she must fight off hired killers to escape her late spouse''s twisted plan.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Horror","Thriller"],"release_date":"2021-07-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rInMNJipAil3iIcBltPiGRkNAG7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bvwMvrX2XqZVOz35YuYbFx3Iggr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rInMNJipAil3iIcBltPiGRkNAG7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bvwMvrX2XqZVOz35YuYbFx3Iggr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":24008,"title":"Monkey Business","description":"Research chemist Barnaby Fulton works on a fountain of youth pill for a chemical company. One of the labs chimps gets loose in the laboratory and mixes chemicals, but then pours the mix into the water cooler. When trying one of his own samples, washed down with water from the cooler, Fulton begins to act just like a twenty-year-old and believes his potion is working. Soon his wife and boss are also behaving like children.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Comedy","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1952-09-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1sS6ilJQOv6QUbQ6cgZ0E7mh5qB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cVYh7b1fLy9zzpZLX2aVNF5U12C.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1sS6ilJQOv6QUbQ6cgZ0E7mh5qB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cVYh7b1fLy9zzpZLX2aVNF5U12C.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11522,"title":"Pretty in Pink","description":"Andie is an outcast, hanging out either with her older boss, who owns the record store where she works, or her quirky high school classmate Duckie, who has a crush on her. When one of the rich and popular kids at school, Blane, asks Andie out, it seems too good to be true. As Andie starts falling for Blane, she begins to realize that dating someone from a different social sphere is not easy.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"1986-02-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bZneRu42OnfMJzQJ0Mn39kCI5v3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jeFJyzJBufJexpOuywuPp8q2tCJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bZneRu42OnfMJzQJ0Mn39kCI5v3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jeFJyzJBufJexpOuywuPp8q2tCJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10543,"title":"Fear","description":"Nicole Walker always dreamed of being swept away by someone special — someone strong, sexy and sensitive who would care for her more than anything else 