 ugly dose of reality, a bizarre and thrilling confrontation ensues.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2002-08-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uwbp1RJkFR5vhaMJPujoB7Qkkgc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fuSIN3Nq6dmaA8LZSkASpQueFO1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uwbp1RJkFR5vhaMJPujoB7Qkkgc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fuSIN3Nq6dmaA8LZSkASpQueFO1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":574376,"title":"Eye for an Eye","description":"Mario, an exemplary man, lives in a village on the Galician coast. In the old people’s home, where he works as a nurse, everyone appreciates him. When the best known narco in the area, Antonio Padín, recently released from prison, enters the residence, Mario tries to make Antonio feel at home.  Now, Padín''s two sons, Kike and Toño, are in charge of the family business. The failure of an operation will put Kike in jail and cause them to owe a large debt to a Colombian supplier. Toño will turn to the nurse to try to convince his father to assume the debt. But Mario has his own plans.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2019-08-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bd6NQDFpUoqNWWJ8eBBip3SR2kP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3WEJAWFusNeZIJDNYxeIPytuZ1g.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bd6NQDFpUoqNWWJ8eBBip3SR2kP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3WEJAWFusNeZIJDNYxeIPytuZ1g.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":491283,"title":"Judy","description":"Thirty years after starring in ''The Wizard of Oz'', beloved actress and singer Judy Garland arrives in London to perform sold-out shows at the Talk of the Town nightclub. While there, she reminisces with friends and fans and begins a whirlwind romance with musician Mickey Deans, her soon-to-be fifth husband.","duration":"1:58:00","g