ther, Walter, swoop in to help the gang put on a telethon show and raise the $10 million they need to save the day.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Comedy","Family","Adventure"],"release_date":"2011-11-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/60PR4UC3D20dycVAoWadUzFio5R.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/h5N6x5gS45wAALt5fsWVn0oCYQR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//60PR4UC3D20dycVAoWadUzFio5R.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//h5N6x5gS45wAALt5fsWVn0oCYQR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":31608,"title":"Three Fugitives","description":"On his first day after being released from jail for 14 armed bank robberies, Lucas finds himself caught up in someone else''s robbery. Perry has decided to hold up the local bank to raise money so that he can keep his daughter, Meg, and get her the treatment she needs. Dugan, a detective, assumes Lucas helped plan the robbery, and hence Lucas, Perry and Meg become three fugitives.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"1989-01-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fRJKTmRji1LewYJvzCkYp3GCD7o.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qUNgtb0LEkRcHGanKHO0B3JWsw9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fRJKTmRji1LewYJvzCkYp3GCD7o.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qUNgtb0LEkRcHGanKHO0B3JWsw9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":27814,"title":"Brain Damage","description":"Brian comes under the addictive spell of a parasite with the ability to induce euphoric hallucinations in its hosts.","duration":"1:26:00","genre":["Horror","Comedy","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1988-04-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2u0bhTWIBTbgtfDmJqrsQqydojh.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nNJbQXlut92RIpcnPyoICzdJvJs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2u0bhTWIBTbgtfDmJqrsQqydojh