provide for their families. Fourteen year old Michiel can''t wait to join the Dutch resistance, to the dismay of his father, who, as mayor, works to prevent escalations in the village.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Drama","History","War"],"release_date":"2008-11-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dotY8NsIZvhpCj9MZhK8LUADWdr.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xwPAQjLoIqqAAGRZ5ke5j7OpKSH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dotY8NsIZvhpCj9MZhK8LUADWdr.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xwPAQjLoIqqAAGRZ5ke5j7OpKSH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12766,"title":"Vera Cruz","description":"After the American Civil War, mercenaries travel to Mexico to fight in their revolution for money. The former soldier and gentleman Benjamin Trane meets the gunman and killer Joe Erin and his men, and together they are hired by the Emperor Maximillian and the Marquis Henri de Labordere to escort the Countess Marie Duvarre to the harbor of Vera Cruz.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Western"],"release_date":"1954-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oftyzHLMpnpOHe5gV5Vvf0tu7o6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7sDTIHW0nG8CqzskwBJtmUnBwcK.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oftyzHLMpnpOHe5gV5Vvf0tu7o6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7sDTIHW0nG8CqzskwBJtmUnBwcK.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4912,"title":"Confessions of a Dangerous Mind","description":"Television made him famous, but his biggest hits happened off screen. Television producer by day, CIA assassin by night, Chuck Barris was recruited by the CIA at the height of his TV career and trained to become a covert operative. Or so Barris said.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime","Drama","Romance","Thriller","History"],"release_date":"2002-12-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uS03jRk64ZFFtpKNAhLp