n seeking out the legendary Trident of Poseidon, but to find it, he must forge an uneasy alliance with a brilliant and beautiful astronomer and a headstrong young man in the British navy.","duration":"2:09:00","genre":["Adventure","Action","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2017-05-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7C921eWK06n12c1miRXnYoEu5Yv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6lAPOAFYFWIO3SQRemEY2wInQMC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7C921eWK06n12c1miRXnYoEu5Yv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6lAPOAFYFWIO3SQRemEY2wInQMC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":72277,"title":"The Last Wave","description":"A Sydney lawyer defends five Aboriginal people in a ritualised taboo murder and in the process learns disturbing truths about himself and premonitions.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Drama","Mystery","Horror"],"release_date":"1977-12-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sPJmwvy9z5IpjdEXoYG6zxd7LO7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7UwdJ0EMXirUuNFaohfK023Nuyr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sPJmwvy9z5IpjdEXoYG6zxd7LO7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7UwdJ0EMXirUuNFaohfK023Nuyr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11302,"title":"Bananas","description":"When a bumbling New Yorker is dumped by his activist girlfriend, he travels to a tiny Latin American nation and becomes involved in its latest rebellion.","duration":"1:22:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1971-04-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bnJrWEST2YVuWfZiYP4owjXpjwq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gK11RUXspxqty0Wq6KoV8J0crKO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bnJrWEST2YVuWfZiYP4owjXpjwq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gK11RUXspxqty0Wq6KoV8J0crKO.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10863,"title":"Eye of the Needle","descri