unter an extreme haunted house that promises to feed on their darkest fears. The night turns deadly as they come to the horrifying realisation that some nightmares are real.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Horror","Thriller"],"release_date":"2019-09-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dmXsktpfHgTNeLFeo5nVItiXuBr.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/haQSrjFlq30I60UVN1VsB6uRwKM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dmXsktpfHgTNeLFeo5nVItiXuBr.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//haQSrjFlq30I60UVN1VsB6uRwKM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":426808,"title":"A Cinderella Christmas","description":"Angie works hard to run her uncle’s events business while her cousin Candace takes the credit. When Angie takes a night off to have fun at the Christmasquerade Ball, the mask and gown allow her to let loose, and she quickly catches the eye of Nicholas, a wealthy local bachelor. But then Angie has to go before revealing her identity, leaving Nicholas searching for his mystery woman in this modern take on the classic fairy tale.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2016-12-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/93CoNRSqCfKQLFG8UJJKtJoaqjY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yD4SvhjDKi7ppsceMbxXKgMBtUi.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//93CoNRSqCfKQLFG8UJJKtJoaqjY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yD4SvhjDKi7ppsceMbxXKgMBtUi.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":276843,"title":"What We Did on Our Holiday","description":"Doug and Abi and their three children travel to the Scottish Highlands for Doug''s father Gordie''s birthday party. It''s soon clear that when it comes to keeping a secret under wraps from the rest of the family, their children are their biggest liability...","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2014-09-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5oM00doqcMnRaJT4CaOfczEO7Qb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/79erD2M6Tj9He4GSXiW0TjlQHkg.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5oM00doqcMnRaJT4CaOfczEO7Qb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//79erD2M6Tj9He4GSXiW0TjlQHkg.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":209361,"title":"One Chance","description":"This film follows the remarkable and inspirational true story of Paul Potts, a shy, bullied shop assistant by day and an amateur opera singer by night.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Music"],"release_date":"2013-09-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/o8QeIgs4CVNjFDZuAzXE1OIEuZ4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/v7J3MW82NXvothqsN7gBizljnVj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//o8QeIgs4CVNjFDZuAzXE1OIEuZ4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//v7J3MW82NXvothqsN7gBizljnVj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":174733,"title":"Metro","description":"Terror strikes the underground train system in Moscow in the form of a flood from a collapsed tunnel. The film follows a diverse group of Moscow citizens who find themselves trapped in the city’s underground rail network, their train derailed and virtually crushed after an aging tunnel collapses. Amongst this band of survivors is softly spoken surgeon Andrey (Sergei Puskepalis), whose wife is having an affair with the conceited businessman Vlad (Anatoly Beliy). Fate brings these two men together on the same doomed train, but there is little time to resolve their differences, as the tunnel begins to quickly fill with water, forcing them to work together with the others and find a way back to the surface.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2013-02-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/q2B3bjLYcxGG11ThDr8gyzCIGAv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/b66