lem: they must find and drink the antidote within 48 hours, or forever remain as fish.","duration":"1:20:00","genre":["Adventure","Animation","Comedy","Family","Drama"],"release_date":"2000-10-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yQ0eSp9Cfpixnp1EvFpFWQzKhB5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/s9yFQD19xJqXEnAnUAZFUan25DJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yQ0eSp9Cfpixnp1EvFpFWQzKhB5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//s9yFQD19xJqXEnAnUAZFUan25DJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11959,"title":"UHF","description":"The eccentric new manager of a UHF television channel tries to save the station from financial ruin with an odd array of programming.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1989-07-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dAz8vPSI2daM4ZVrHSKnpNLUvDM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wxx5YQLKVH1WMSRXQAUnC76r4iY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dAz8vPSI2daM4ZVrHSKnpNLUvDM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wxx5YQLKVH1WMSRXQAUnC76r4iY.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2016,"title":"Days of Glory","description":"1943. They have never stepped foot on French soil but because France was at war, Said, Abdelkader, Messaoud and Yassir enlist in the French Army, along with 130,000 other “indigenous” soldiers, to liberate the “fatherland” from the Nazi enemy. Heroes that history has forgotten...","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["Drama","History","War"],"release_date":"2006-09-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eKYnSOV7UBj0zCSCmnD1GFVFMTs.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/49Bq01x0hGe6wQeswmkI4CTnmoi.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eKYnSOV7UBj0zCSCmnD1GFVFMTs.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//49Bq01x0hGe6wQeswmkI4CTnmoi.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":66,"title":"Absolute Power","description":"A master thief coincidentally is robbing a house where a murder—in which the President of the United States is involved—occurs in front of his eyes. He is forced to run, while holding evidence that could convict the President.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Action"],"release_date":"1997-02-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cLftTzGw40BlLw8IggKSWDjKOQo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jiwy7YaPHLN8s1SuXWGgQLKKNKE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cLftTzGw40BlLw8IggKSWDjKOQo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jiwy7YaPHLN8s1SuXWGgQLKKNKE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1202033,"title":"Enola Holmes 3","description":"Adventure follows detective Enola Holmes to Malta, where her plans to tie the knot unravel when Sherlock''s disappearance plunges her into a perilous case.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Adventure","Crime","Mystery"],"release_date":"2026-06-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jLuGZc84MvPYCQomQg9DI72mstt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7kRYHH9H9PjBFwz1FprbHB2AAjI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jLuGZc84MvPYCQomQg9DI72mstt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7kRYHH9H9PjBFwz1FprbHB2AAjI.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":424277,"title":"Annette","description":"In present-day Los Angeles, controversial stand-up comedian Henry McHenry and internationally renowned opera singer Ann Defrasnoux form the façade of a happy couple in the spotlight. Ann gives birth to a baby girl named Annette, who possesses an exceptional gift that will change all of their lives forever.","duration":"2:20:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2021-07-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cDVWsqsnGwIUqOSzAuDS0PIhNdW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4FTnypxpGltJdIARrfFsP31pGTp.jpg","