 bleed into the mainstream, Guerin decides to take on and expose those responsible. Beginning at the bottom with addicts, Guerin then gets in touch with John Traynor, a paranoid informant. Not without some prodding, Traynor leads her to John Gilligan, the ruthless head of the operation, who does not take kindly to Guerin''s nosing.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Drama","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2003-07-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pku59jhFJGLqrFIP0m1ITyqfQcB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1aJYz1YjcZggKsTJhCcYJ3adtcm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pku59jhFJGLqrFIP0m1ITyqfQcB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1aJYz1YjcZggKsTJhCcYJ3adtcm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4437,"title":"2010","description":"While planet Earth poises on the brink of nuclear self-destruction, a team of Russian and American scientists aboard the Leonov hurtles to a rendezvous with the still-orbiting Discovery spacecraft and its sole known survivor, the homicidal computer HAL.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Thriller","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1984-12-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8zvo2J1rKbzcfxaX9lHRgHgOEf0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mEWKXuCMv7mFMxXVSTI3v8UOQuq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8zvo2J1rKbzcfxaX9lHRgHgOEf0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mEWKXuCMv7mFMxXVSTI3v8UOQuq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":998846,"title":"Back to Black","description":"The extraordinary story of Amy Winehouse’s early rise to fame from her early days in Camden through the making of her groundbreaking album, Back to Black that catapulted Winehouse to global fame. Told through Amy’s eyes and inspired by her deeply personal lyrics, the film explores and embraces the many layers of the iconic artist and the tumultuous love story at the center of one of the most legendary albums of all time.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Music","History","Drama"],"release_date":"2024-04-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a1m4DAmySexNaaGnjEVA2MKNUCo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xHQEeUT3Ac4fTY72UeNrI75xLtE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//a1m4DAmySexNaaGnjEVA2MKNUCo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xHQEeUT3Ac4fTY72UeNrI75xLtE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":16418,"title":"Barbie Presents: Thumbelina","description":"Meet a tiny girl named Thumbelina who lives in harmony with nature in the magical world of the Twillerbees that''s hidden among the wildflowers. At the whim of a spoiled young girl named Makena, Thumbelina and her two friends have their patch of wildflowers uprooted and are transported to a lavish apartment in the city.","duration":"1:15:00","genre":["Animation","Family"],"release_date":"2009-02-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/y8w1IaNDP0jMcZ0AfSruXlEVllY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ytKd2jWnzWLCiccutqqMNzcP5RE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//y8w1IaNDP0jMcZ0AfSruXlEVllY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ytKd2jWnzWLCiccutqqMNzcP5RE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":628866,"title":"The Return","description":"After the death of his father, a brilliant college student returns to his family home where he learns that the horrors from his childhood aren''t as dead and gone as he once thought.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Horror","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2020-09-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3fIELwQezqPoIrfgzCf19r9TymE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rK2gW2kOIC5hG3JjVB81vU9v8gC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3fIELwQezqPoIrfgzCf19r9TymE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rK2gW2kOIC5hG3JjVB81vU9v