red millionaire is chosen. His wife and accountant—the murderers—are confused by this development, as he buys the L.A. Rams in order to once again quarterback them into the Superbowl.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Fantasy","Comedy","Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"1978-06-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yucBYHGAMaTu2HsxM2k9JWRxSlj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/h1yOiO9cow6gwmGxSAWvPdY4lhJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yucBYHGAMaTu2HsxM2k9JWRxSlj.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//h1yOiO9cow6gwmGxSAWvPdY4lhJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10176,"title":"The Quiet Earth","description":"After a top-secret experiment misfires, a scientist may be the only man left alive in the world.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Drama","Science Fiction","Thriller"],"release_date":"1985-09-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/acNTpCRoAHueT1VoJzEQPYXdXy5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6uvRcSy1DCh0zONGMRO4bEj44hq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//acNTpCRoAHueT1VoJzEQPYXdXy5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6uvRcSy1DCh0zONGMRO4bEj44hq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10010,"title":"Brother Bear 2","description":"Kenai finds his childhood human friend Nita and the two embark on a journey to burn the amulet he gave to her before he was a bear, much to Koda''s dismay.","duration":"1:13:00","genre":["Adventure","Animation","Family"],"release_date":"2006-07-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dMqbyB5GQvDujXiKdKPhWT0VTRw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yaA8q2zHHUgFWdJNxXyAdU71SzM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dMqbyB5GQvDujXiKdKPhWT0VTRw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yaA8q2zHHUgFWdJNxXyAdU71SzM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2105,"title":"American Pie","description":"At a high-school party, four friends find that losing their collective virginity isn''t as easy as they had thought. But they still believe that they need to do so before college. To motivate themselves, they enter a pact to all \"score\" by their senior prom.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"1999-07-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cvH1gNIMRITdLzoWv1HNAbRyH3n.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5P68by2Thn8wHAziyWGEw2O7hco.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cvH1gNIMRITdLzoWv1HNAbRyH3n.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5P68by2Thn8wHAziyWGEw2O7hco.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1941,"title":"Exodus","description":"Ari Ben Canaan, a passionate member of the Jewish paramilitary group Haganah, attempts to transport 600 Jewish refugees on a dangerous voyage from Cyprus to Palestine on a ship named the Exodus. He faces obstruction from British forces, who will not grant the ship passage to its destination.","duration":"3:28:00","genre":["Drama","War"],"release_date":"1960-12-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9Knw79HXoPpHIqa9TscDlwbuRJV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1JXFJRztd43gCf4TAodNUwkfZoi.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9Knw79HXoPpHIqa9TscDlwbuRJV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1JXFJRztd43gCf4TAodNUwkfZoi.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1120911,"title":"Saturday Night","description":"At 11:30pm on October 11, 1975, a ferocious troupe of young comedians and writers changed television forever. This is the story of what happened behind the scenes in the 90 minutes leading up to the first broadcast of Saturday Night Live.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2024-09-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9ewYb0LIBJNds8ZMoobKYUd647g.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600