":"1:37:00","genre":["Horror","Drama"],"release_date":"1983-04-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qw9p7gBroQt99fjG0cwtLHohQR9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lFTDtRtK8J55A1LTpwigV7QGQg7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qw9p7gBroQt99fjG0cwtLHohQR9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lFTDtRtK8J55A1LTpwigV7QGQg7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8961,"title":"Bad Boys II","description":"Detectives Marcus Burnett and Mike Lowrey of the Miami Narcotics Task Force are tasked with stopping the flow of the drug Ecstasy into Miami. They track the drugs to the whacked-out Cuban drug lord Johnny Tapia, who is also involved in a bloody war with Russian and Haitian mobsters. If that isn''t bad enough, there''s tension between the two detectives when Marcus discovers that playboy Mike is secretly romancing Marcus’ sister, Syd.","duration":"2:26:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Comedy"],"release_date":"2003-07-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gxSVZCUlDd8upT1G2wdrUdz2hxG.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yCvB5fG5aEPqa1St7ihY6KEAsHD.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gxSVZCUlDd8upT1G2wdrUdz2hxG.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yCvB5fG5aEPqa1St7ihY6KEAsHD.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":7457,"title":"Alpha Dog","description":"Johnny Truelove likes to see himself as tough. He''s the son of an underworld figure and a drug dealer. Johnny also likes to get tough when things don''t go his way. When Jake Mazursky fails to pay up for Johnny, things get worse for the Mazursky family, as Johnny and his ''gang'' kidnap Jake''s 15 year old brother and hold him hostage.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2006-01-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oxEvnbNAr1BFWX8XQ6KBU35uWN8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_an