nstrument of death.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller","Action"],"release_date":"2024-04-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1LOT0yesrW1l98qYzMbzx6vCRbi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/25JskXmchcYwj3jHRmcPm738MpB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1LOT0yesrW1l98qYzMbzx6vCRbi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//25JskXmchcYwj3jHRmcPm738MpB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":262391,"title":"Serial (Bad) Weddings","description":"A catholic French couple sees their life upside down when their four daughters get married to men of different religion and origins.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2014-04-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xSTedn34WWuOk5V60UK3ZXWwkXz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bkAiSLxLJJEZXZZqgNna5BWcBIy.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xSTedn34WWuOk5V60UK3ZXWwkXz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bkAiSLxLJJEZXZZqgNna5BWcBIy.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":103686,"title":"Paradise: Love","description":"On the beaches of Kenya they’re known as \"Sugar Mamas\" —European women who seek out African boys selling love to earn a living. Teresa, a 50-year-old Austrian and mother of a daughter entering puberty, travels to this vacation paradise, moving from beach to beach.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2012-04-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9jmlny93dxtXn4KnjGlj8sUsL20.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nah6G8dNvjL6L8k3wumcR3DH3KC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9jmlny93dxtXn4KnjGlj8sUsL20.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nah6G8dNvjL6L8k3wumcR3DH3KC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1729,"title":"The Forbidden Kingdom","description":"An American teenager who is obsessed with Hong Kong cinema and kung-fu classics makes an extraordinary discovery in a Chinatown pawnshop: the legendary stick weapon of the Chinese sage and warrior, the Monkey King. With the lost relic in hand, the teenager unexpectedly finds himself travelling back to ancient China to join a crew of warriors from martial arts lore on a dangerous quest to free the imprisoned Monkey King.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2008-04-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9a59H9qoAzMcj1NWurMgvg9iLaT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/z8chF1Z7hyuSVqLYTgElkQZh2VB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9a59H9qoAzMcj1NWurMgvg9iLaT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//z8chF1Z7hyuSVqLYTgElkQZh2VB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":339964,"title":"Valerian and the City of a Thousand Planets","description":"In the 28th century, Valerian and Laureline are special operatives charged with keeping order throughout the human territories. On assignment from the Minister of Defense, the two undertake a mission to Alpha, an ever-expanding metropolis where species from across the universe have converged over centuries to share knowledge, intelligence, and cultures. At the center of Alpha is a mysterious dark force which threatens the peaceful existence of the City of a Thousand Planets, and Valerian and Laureline must race to identify the menace and safeguard not just Alpha, but the future of the universe.","duration":"2:17:00","genre":["Adventure","Science Fiction","Action"],"release_date":"2017-07-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5rYnygKCkmqWuMv1O5yAnzGF8gV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vlc95gl3PtrjxSEuM8RhTtSm2xU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5rYnygKCkmqWuMv1O5yAnzGF8gV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vlc95gl3PtrjxSEuM8RhTtSm2xU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":293982,"title":"Warsaw 44","description":"City of Warsaw, Poland, August 1st, 1944. Citizens have experienced inhuman acts of terror and violence during five long years of Nazi occupation. As the Soviet Army relentlessly approaches, the youngest and bravest among them rise up as one and face tyranny fighting street by street, but the price to pay will be high and hard the way to freedom…","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Drama","History","War"],"release_date":"2014-09-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/r3nuY1fTkjqKxaUYjJi4OThoXJx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/k9WOOkVur2Gwo93wuiKzJDm2mUK.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//r3nuY1fTkjqKxaUYjJi4OThoXJx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//k9WOOkVur2Gwo93wuiKzJDm2mUK.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":275060,"title":"The Disappearance of Eleanor Rigby: Her","description":"Told from the woman''s perspective, the story of a couple trying to reclaim the life and love they once knew and pick up the pieces of a past that may be too far gone.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2014-10-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zWjcyGONx6RayBlOmDMOkXIrsuT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ynQT7JLYoLwV8P2ropoQEpTH7gG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zWjcyGONx6RayBlOmDMOkXIrsuT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ynQT7JLYoLwV8P2ropoQEpTH7gG.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":39468,"title":"Godzilla vs. Megaguirus","description":"In an alternate timeline the original Godzilla is never defeated and repeatedly reemerges to feed on Japan''s energy sources. A new inter-dimensional weapon called the Dimension Tide is created with the intent of eliminating Godzilla. However, the new weapon might also serve as a gateway to something far more sinister.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Action","Science Fiction","Thriller","Horror"],"release_date":"2000-12-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fsvWFzFJOoDGCadO3FstRRuY4Yu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jWOLrfoVmYCogt0FUsQuXSThi1s.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fsvWFzFJOoDGCadO3FstRRuY4Yu.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jWOLrfoVmYCogt0FUsQuXSThi1s.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12509,"title":"Pollock","description":"In August of 1949, Life Magazine ran a banner headline that begged the question: \"Jackson Pollock: Is he the greatest living painter in the United States?\" The film is a look back into the life of an extraordinary man, a man who has fittingly been called \"an artist dedicated to concealment, a celebrity who nobody knew.\" As he struggled with self-doubt, engaging in a lonely tug-of-war between needing to express himself and wanting to shut the world out, Pollock began a downward spiral.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2000-09-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/diLUnClHswIfhpJSjpblvSjWL9U.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/azsBSw2zw2uNHiCjTnbe9TJVEDB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//diLUnClHswIfhpJSjpblvSjWL9U.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//azsBSw2zw2uNHiCjTnbe9TJVEDB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11566,"title":"Dave","description":"A sweet-natured Temp Agency operator and amateur Presidential look-alike is recruited by the Secret Service to become a temporary stand-in for the President of the United States.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1993-05-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lpBqjU3OyG9DnIy5BHt0zNw8n0q.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/n7wQlcexeER5bW7DvV8sji2vRRH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lpBqjU3OyG9DnIy5BHt0zNw8n0q.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//n7wQ