/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8ZtH1V4rhrtP53ezlEWrCaMALXF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xWq3T9P4NU2pTdZ3hXFygsNnAq4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8ZtH1V4rhrtP53ezlEWrCaMALXF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5126,"title":"Martian Child","description":"A recently-widowed science fiction writer considers whether to adopt a hyper-imaginative 6-year-old abandoned and socially-rejected boy who says he''s really from Mars.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2007-11-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hAvQYr8vpK9OlJHwn4ft0ETKzRD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/amRUHHflkZsbcvRnfJN9ZKxv8R3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hAvQYr8vpK9OlJHwn4ft0ETKzRD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//amRUHHflkZsbcvRnfJN9ZKxv8R3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":839321,"title":"Return","description":"Polish animator Anna Błaszczyk’s humorous short—a collage of drawing, cut-out, and computer animation—was inspired by Stanisław Lem’s 1961 novel Return from the Stars, a time-paradox tale of an astronaut who returns to Earth after many years away.","duration":"0:08:00","genre":["Animation","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2008-01-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_facenull","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_facenull","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/null","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/null"},{"tmdb_id":62835,"title":"Colombiana","description":"After witnessing her parents’ murder as a child in Bogota, Cataleya Restrepo grows up to be a stone-cold assassin. She works for her uncle as a hitman by day, but her personal time is spent engaging in vigilante murders that she hopes will lead her to her ultimate target: the mobster responsible for her parents'' death.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Crime","Drama"],"release_dat