utt-Head wake to discover their TV has been stolen. Their search for a new one takes them on a clueless adventure across America, during which they manage to accidentally become America''s most wanted.","duration":"1:21:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Adventure","Crime","Music"],"release_date":"1996-12-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/l8HMzSzHkLx8wKEMKwIUTZjLxF4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vqdgQiRCSzgpFXLlbxbybfkleBM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//l8HMzSzHkLx8wKEMKwIUTZjLxF4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vqdgQiRCSzgpFXLlbxbybfkleBM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":542830,"title":"Little White Lies 2","description":"The sequel to Little White Lies (\"Les petits mouchoirs\"), set 7 years later. The group of friends, which had separated, reunites for the surprise birthday party organized for Max.","duration":"2:14:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Family","Romance"],"release_date":"2019-05-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uPSiOPaMtOG14ChOx9kU5U8G2JA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xS1863lQOAS3EkkEWkFENMI6bdY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uPSiOPaMtOG14ChOx9kU5U8G2JA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xS1863lQOAS3EkkEWkFENMI6bdY.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":429662,"title":"Viceroy''s House","description":"In 1947, Lord Mountbatten assumes the post of last Viceroy, charged with handing India back to its people, living upstairs at the house which was the home of British rulers, whilst 500 Hindu, Muslim and Sikh servants lived downstairs.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2017-03-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hKIjpVMDou26uEBW93gDdMzPPMw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qBLpcLCewPUJYp6Veemsp1MEEzF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w