he kingdom while his twin brother, Philippe, remains imprisoned, the Musketeers reunite to abduct Louis and replace him with Philippe.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Adventure","Action","Drama"],"release_date":"1998-03-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uhhtglfXNaTavkKtjer38qHLfVi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zHE9yRURvA7DyhYtQxkGTfE1Ywi.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uhhtglfXNaTavkKtjer38qHLfVi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zHE9yRURvA7DyhYtQxkGTfE1Ywi.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9093,"title":"The Four Feathers","description":"A young British officer resigns his post when he learns of his regiment''s plan to ship out to the Sudan for the conflict with the Mahdi. His friends and fiancée send him four white feathers as symbols of what they view as his cowardice. To redeem his honor, he disguises himself as an Arab and secretly saves their lives.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Drama","Romance","War"],"release_date":"2002-09-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2IojDzEWedVbre8KZhZPMoP5az4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bfmpeRr9LTXzBC2dpC89FE5uavK.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2IojDzEWedVbre8KZhZPMoP5az4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bfmpeRr9LTXzBC2dpC89FE5uavK.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5890,"title":"Azumi 2: Death or Love","description":"Young assassins Azumi and Nagara continue their mission to prevent a civil war. In their hunt for Masayuki Sanada, who is protected by both an army and a dangerous clan, they meet Ginkaku, a person who shows a remarking resemblance with former friend Nachi.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Action"],"release_date":"2005-03-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3P0rmJsVImfYWng2mGCtFRZJTiG.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zEdtkkcAbR1StLAvbAh6vpGquiu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3P0rmJsVImfYWng2mGCtFRZJTiG.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zEdtkkcAbR1StLAvbAh6vpGquiu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1552,"title":"Parenthood","description":"The story of the Buckman family and friends, attempting to bring up their children. They suffer/enjoy all the events that occur: estranged relatives, the ''black sheep'' of the family, the eccentrics, the skeletons in the closet, and the rebellious teenagers.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1989-07-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zdWdI9k8UroWuMjALiftO6WTXu1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/29Y6yg0gSurkFYTh54yxDzLBmrT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zdWdI9k8UroWuMjALiftO6WTXu1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//29Y6yg0gSurkFYTh54yxDzLBmrT.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":790142,"title":"The Royal Treatment","description":"Isabella runs her own salon and isn’t afraid to speak her mind, while Prince Thomas runs his own country and is about to marry for duty rather than love. When Izzy and her fellow stylists get the opportunity of a lifetime to do the hair for the royal wedding, she and Prince Thomas learn that taking control of their own destiny requires following their hearts.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"2022-01-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/on1p1AdcfxmlyHhVXoycWt75D8H.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mYAv0YUoXJzLxIdEirOken8Quwf.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//on1p1AdcfxmlyHhVXoycWt75D8H.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mYAv0YUoXJzLxIdEirOken8Quwf.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":315664,"title":"Florence Foster Jenkins","description":"The story of Florence Foster Jenkins, a New York heiress, who dreamed of becoming an opera singer, despite having a terrible singing voice.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2016-05-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/x5zHw4qTZ1aP4Lrcv49coRluvxr.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1HAdtUchzWEo0LMFHrgD2UBIBS3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//x5zHw4qTZ1aP4Lrcv49coRluvxr.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1HAdtUchzWEo0LMFHrgD2UBIBS3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":87492,"title":"Foxcatcher","description":"The greatest Olympic Wrestling Champion brother team joins Team Foxcatcher led by multimillionaire sponsor John E. du Pont as they train for the 1988 games in Seoul - a union that leads to unlikely circumstances.","duration":"2:14:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2014-11-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tT8vexYdyHG0nHyXQkhzt8tbFkt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/w6Sl079QtUcQ9dVQ2RP6aN9NBXx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tT8vexYdyHG0nHyXQkhzt8tbFkt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//w6Sl079QtUcQ9dVQ2RP6aN9NBXx.jpg"}]'::jsonb
