 on a diet of peas. This serves to drive him close to madness, and the discovery that Marie is involved in an affair with the local drum major exacerbates the situation. Pushed too far, Woyzeck resorts to violence.","duration":"1:22:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1979-05-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7J9mhvkKH6kvjshBNNcEJungJvG.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lxJThwhfqvyIRD6VszknCNCSokK.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7J9mhvkKH6kvjshBNNcEJungJvG.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lxJThwhfqvyIRD6VszknCNCSokK.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8270,"title":"The Lookout","description":"Chris is a once promising high school athlete whose life is turned upside down following a tragic accident. As he tries to maintain a normal life, he takes a job as a janitor at a bank, where he ultimately finds himself caught up in a planned heist.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2007-03-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4iEg0LWTx9aTWOWMhpBu3UffXih.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wTYyXCoIBy2TDxetoGS4Sc0VBP1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4iEg0LWTx9aTWOWMhpBu3UffXih.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wTYyXCoIBy2TDxetoGS4Sc0VBP1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":588,"title":"Silent Hill","description":"Rose, a desperate mother, takes her adopted daughter, Sharon, to the town of Silent Hill in an attempt to cure her of her ailment. After a violent car crash, Sharon disappears, and Rose embarks on a horrific journey to get her back and begins to uncover the truth behind the apocalyptic disaster that burned the town 30 years earlier.","duration":"2:05:00","genre":["Horror","Mystery"],"release_date":"2006-04-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/48TM0HjZSRjIr4QMuDTsMWcz7gX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tm