solated from other peers. Their new friendship helps them to resist, until the mechanical attraction and fear the judgment of others do not grasp them unprepared.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"2016-03-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/DPHrczA2TWU0poerCiAIRh9F7d.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eQw1JGdeMzaAADZVZPbFm6OKowR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//DPHrczA2TWU0poerCiAIRh9F7d.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eQw1JGdeMzaAADZVZPbFm6OKowR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":338958,"title":"Disenchanted","description":"Disillusioned with life in the city, feeling out of place in suburbia, and frustrated that her happily ever after hasn’t been so easy to find, Giselle turns to the magic of Andalasia for help. Accidentally transforming the entire town into a real-life fairy tale and placing her family’s future happiness in jeopardy, she must race against time to reverse the spell and determine what happily ever after truly means to her and her family.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Comedy","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2022-11-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mchDEPh1fkID8nq8IONAGQeiPJg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uyNLq2Dc3s4IOdcYTU8ZtM2lTjb.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mchDEPh1fkID8nq8IONAGQeiPJg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uyNLq2Dc3s4IOdcYTU8ZtM2lTjb.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":236737,"title":"Spanish Affair","description":"Rafael, a Seville citizen who has never left the Spanish region of Andalucia, decides to leave his homeland to follow Amaia, a Basque girl unlike other women he has known.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2014-03-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xpthYlJMUr3bC1wP3mrIRTyVPVI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/