heat death on the same day, prompting them to reunite and confront the reasons their lives went so wrong. As the twins'' reunion reinvigorates them, they realize the key to fixing their lives may just lie in repairing their relationship.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2014-06-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8jF8Ky170Ib3877Ehm59VjL6Rgy.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lDygTdg1KlrVJVzqsFL515uGzSe.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8jF8Ky170Ib3877Ehm59VjL6Rgy.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lDygTdg1KlrVJVzqsFL515uGzSe.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":26690,"title":"The Boston Strangler","description":"Boston is being terrorized by a series of seemingly random murders of women. Based on the true story, the film follows the investigators path through several leads before introducing the Strangler as a character. It is seen almost exclusively from the point of view of the investigators who have very few clues to build a case upon.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Drama","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"1968-10-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eOezHJhtwK0sFaOKmTI2IvC8cNn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hIVMUQf80zT4PyTMmXA1LXUzmBF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eOezHJhtwK0sFaOKmTI2IvC8cNn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hIVMUQf80zT4PyTMmXA1LXUzmBF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12155,"title":"Alice in Wonderland","description":"Alice, now 19 years old, returns to the whimsical world she first entered as a child and embarks on a journey to discover her true destiny.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Family","Fantasy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2010-03-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ocOWbTzHcJVTw9Tz173KPeskDOP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/o0kre9wRCZz3jjSjaru7QU0UtFz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ocOWbTzHcJVTw9Tz173KPeskDOP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//o0kre9wRCZz3jjSjaru7QU0UtFz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9442,"title":"Dead Men Don''t Wear Plaid","description":"Juliet Forrest is convinced that the reported death of her father in a mountain car crash was no accident. Her father was a prominent cheese scientist working on a secret recipe. To prove it was murder, she enlists the services of private eye Rigby Reardon. He finds a slip of paper containing a list of people who are ''The Friends and Enemies of Carlotta''.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Comedy","Mystery","Crime"],"release_date":"1982-05-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hhxrMW0WY30ulaCGMu5mVezktHQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cwYwZBEE73PakUWzbICzxYKlXAz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hhxrMW0WY30ulaCGMu5mVezktHQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cwYwZBEE73PakUWzbICzxYKlXAz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":3635,"title":"Girl with a Pearl Earring","description":"This film, adapted from a work of fiction by author Tracy Chevalier, tells a story about the events surrounding the creation of the painting \"Girl With A Pearl Earring\" by 17th century Dutch master Johannes Vermeer. A young peasant maid working in the house of painter Johannes Vermeer becomes his talented assistant and the model for one of his most famous works.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2003-12-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tuiupUeJrNQkmO6LADHOSjbGJ6E.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/41DkOi1MvTgTQXt5BevVSzo94kk.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tuiupUeJrNQkmO6LADHOSjbGJ6E.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//41DkOi1MvTgTQXt5BevVSzo94kk.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":663712,"title":"Terrifier 2","description":"A year after the Miles County massacre, Art the Clown is resurrected by a sinister entity. Art returns home, where he must hunt down and destroy teenage Sienna and her younger brother Jonathan on Halloween. As the body count rises, the siblings fight to stay alive while uncovering the true nature of Art''s evil intent.","duration":"2:18:00","genre":["Horror"],"release_date":"2022-10-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4QJtcL4D3abqdX6Snrk8ciRkroa.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qEAlwXbYk6IHA4ztoS2XFFaa7Xo.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4QJtcL4D3abqdX6Snrk8ciRkroa.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qEAlwXbYk6IHA4ztoS2XFFaa7Xo.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":572468,"title":"Impetigore","description":"A woman inherits a house in her ancestral village, but she''s unaware that members of the community have been trying to locate and kill her to remove the curse that has plagued them for years.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Horror","Mystery"],"release_date":"2019-10-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4JOCooFc5M8w4EoSn3o8hZcKdyO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dku2KnAPALsi69MnvTV7cXrylWm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4JOCooFc5M8w4EoSn3o8hZcKdyO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dku2KnAPALsi69MnvTV7cXrylWm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":347026,"title":"A United Kingdom","description":"The inspiring true story of Seretse Khama, the King of Bechuanaland (modern Botswana), and Ruth Williams, the London office worker he married in 1948 in the face of fierce opposition from their families and the British and South African governments. Seretse and Ruth defied family, Apartheid and empire - their love triumphed over every obstacle flung in their path and in so doing they transformed their nation and inspired the world.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"rele