ace/bfYGNAK6JRVExXON7CmHiOT2NJc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fRxz9cKaCOF5noUBvoA6cebOdUE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bfYGNAK6JRVExXON7CmHiOT2NJc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fRxz9cKaCOF5noUBvoA6cebOdUE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":382595,"title":"Dalida","description":"Based on the true story of acclaimed music icon \"Dalida\" born in Cairo, who gained celebrity in the 50s, singing in French, Spanish, Arabic, Hebrew, German, Italian, playing in awarded Youssef Chahine''s picture \"Le Sixième Jour\", and who later committed suicide in 1987 in Paris, after selling more than 130 million records worldwide.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Music","Drama"],"release_date":"2017-01-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6WqaHRr7Kuv46vfP9s100mjGkMa.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fZx4PGZBXePgMmo0HyBcHPbidZU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6WqaHRr7Kuv46vfP9s100mjGkMa.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fZx4PGZBXePgMmo0HyBcHPbidZU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":50544,"title":"Friends with Benefits","description":"Dylan is done with relationships. Jamie decides to stop buying into the Hollywood clichés of true love. When the two become friends they decide to try something new and take advantage of their mutual attraction - but without any emotional attachment.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"2011-07-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/p5HKeRbNRTZL2tvFhmXF8oVL1y6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nKhhDFCdzxeJ3GUunQ570LDpUkz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//p5HKeRbNRTZL2tvFhmXF8oVL1y6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nKhhDFCdzxeJ3GUunQ570LDpUkz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10183,"title":"Frozen River","description":"A financially strapped mother joins a Mohawk woman to smuggle illegal immigrants into the United States.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"2008-03-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gOhtvGwrVkEM5hCFdyyWKJEOBk8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6wsrP3rtxJlbS8EGwldLIkCXtWs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gOhtvGwrVkEM5hCFdyyWKJEOBk8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6wsrP3rtxJlbS8EGwldLIkCXtWs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1299655,"title":"Blue Moon","description":"On the evening of March 31, 1943, legendary lyricist Lorenz Hart confronts his shattered self-confidence in Sardi’s bar as his former collaborator, Richard Rodgers, celebrates the opening night of his ground-breaking hit musical, “Oklahoma!”","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["History","Drama"],"release_date":"2025-10-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/28PLbMHktbX8TnuEWSiTrRbI4p8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dVU7SNc6dgStTVdtbPLQncWxsyZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//28PLbMHktbX8TnuEWSiTrRbI4p8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dVU7SNc6dgStTVdtbPLQncWxsyZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1267905,"title":"The Roses","description":"Life seems easy for picture-perfect couple Ivy and Theo: successful careers, a loving marriage, great kids. But beneath the façade of their supposed ideal life, a storm is brewing – as Theo''s career nosedives while Ivy''s own ambitions take off, a tinderbox of fierce competition and hidden resentment ignites.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2025-08-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3CPQc1pgYu0iWr1UNk2nwy2ylDE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/99O8HLHklXGzvF2TqiRqr7WddzT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3CPQc1pgYu0iWr1UNk2nwy2ylDE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//99O8HLHklXGzvF2TqiRqr7WddzT.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":529862,"title":"Brittany Runs a Marathon","description":"Hilarious and outgoing, Brittany Forgler, is everybody’s best friend ― except her own. Her partying, underemployment and toxic relationships are catching up with her. She receives a startling wake-up call when a visit to the doctor reveals how unhealthy she is. Motivated to lose weight, but too broke for a gym and too proud to ask for help, Brit is at a loss, until her neighbor pushes her to run one sweaty block. Soon, she sets an almost unthinkable goal: the New York City Marathon.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2019-08-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zVBsGrA8MIx7DNeo33Ll86dKzZU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aSWePCEtLpNdD7ykW6OuZqvVhyn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zVBsGrA8MIx7DNeo33Ll86dKzZU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aSWePCEtLpNdD7ykW6OuZqvVhyn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":138222,"title":"Best Man Down","description":"A newlywed couple cancels their honeymoon and returns to the snowy Midwest to make the funeral arrangements for their best man, who died unexpectedly after their ceremony.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2012-10-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uNP27yOuXSEtiKxcobj3wcfSHd2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iJOjvFV0a5znaeMVD8v7Xp51g4c.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uNP27yOuXSEtiKxcobj3wcfSHd2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iJOjvFV0a5znaeMVD8v7Xp51g4c.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12489,"title":"Gridlock''d","description":"After a friend overdoses, Spoon and Stretch decide to kick their drug habits and attempt to enroll in a government detox program. Their efforts are hampered by seemingly endless red tape, as they are shuffled from one office to another while being chased by drug dealers and the police.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"1997-01-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jFT7mu2A1rM64JeFg2126zaIwO0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jlOL8fLsG0tGBtkj9qzHgqcHPVV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jFT7mu2A1rM64JeFg2126zaIwO0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jlOL8fLsG0tGBtkj9qzHgqcHPVV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2454,"title":"The Chronicles of Narnia: Prince Caspian","description":"One year after their incredible adventures in the Lion, the Witch and the Wardrobe, Peter, Edmund, Lucy and Susan Pevensie return to Narnia to aid a young prince whose life has been threatened by the evil King Miraz. Now, with the help of a colorful cast of new characters, including Trufflehunter the badger and Nikabrik the dwarf, the Pevensie clan embarks on an incredible quest to ensure that Narnia is returned to its rightful heir.","duration":"2:30:00","genre":["Adventure","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2008-05-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9pBv1BOSloAUgAkF0meJWdnbV4Q.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qxz3WIyjZiSKUhaTIEJ3c1GcC9z.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9pBv1BOSloAUgAkF0meJWdnbV4Q.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qxz3WIyjZiSKUhaTIEJ3c1GcC9z.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":544,"title":"There''s Something About Mary","description":"For Ted, prom night went about as bad as it’s possible for any night to go. Thirteen years later, he finally gets another chance with his old prom date, only to run up against other suitors including the sleazy detective he hired to find her.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"1998-07-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/egJQ3nIon5fT8wyXcKRHzvmtZpD.jpg","p