ey succumb to.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2014-03-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/YBSeCMORtdET4PV1gIJdfPAcHi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8yDZUKQQLZQEPw1wRXS2ZNEsHqG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//YBSeCMORtdET4PV1gIJdfPAcHi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8yDZUKQQLZQEPw1wRXS2ZNEsHqG.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":216580,"title":"Savaged","description":"After thugs brutalize a deaf-mute woman, the spirit of an Apache warrior takes over her lifeless body and sets out on a bloodthirsty quest for revenge.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Action","Drama","Horror","Thriller"],"release_date":"2014-08-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/b6DSXmqDufJj30TDUkw6WngZffd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bsPV6pXVDTAGbl4Tg4xWkm3Kkl.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//b6DSXmqDufJj30TDUkw6WngZffd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bsPV6pXVDTAGbl4Tg4xWkm3Kkl.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":20156,"title":"Exotica","description":"In the upscale Toronto strip club Exotica, dancer Christina is visited nightly by the obsessive Francis, a depressed tax auditor. Her ex-boyfriend, the club''s MC, Eric, still jealously pines for her even as he introduces her onstage, but Eric is having his own relationship problems with the club''s female owner. Thomas, a mysterious pet-shop owner, is about to become unexpectedly involved in their lives.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1994-09-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sdgWn2YmR2h0HWFUGXmvbCerQCR.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pWcJdcIHjL3P6NaEJKeV6ONfAMV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sdgWn2YmR2h0HWFUGXmvbCerQCR.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pWcJdcIHjL3P6NaEJKeV6ONfAMV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10398,"title":"Double Jeopardy","description":"Libby Parsons, wrongly convicted of her husband Nick''s murder, thinks he is still alive. She survives the long years in prison with two burning desires sustaining her -- finding her son and solving the mystery that destroyed her once-happy life. Standing between her and her quest, however, is her parole officer, Travis Lehman. Libby poses a challenge to the cynical officer, one that forces him to face up to his own failings while pitting him against his superior and law enforcement colleagues, as she plunges into a desperate fight for justice, survival, and revenge.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Thriller","Crime","Mystery"],"release_date":"1999-09-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fk4NXhazfRKtQaVEV9IPeM7OIVH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dPd9QvEeMQpgHO6iLB1LqALTZl.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fk4NXhazfRKtQaVEV9IPeM7OIVH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dPd9QvEeMQpgHO6iLB1LqALTZl.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10260,"title":"My New Partner","description":"A streetwise Paris policeman who takes kickbacks from the minor criminals on his beat to allow them to continue is assigned an idealistic new partner fresh from police academy. He sets out to corrupt him...","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1984-09-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vdokXTdAIx3jrYYG7moT0vop4ZO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kvILcin1mGcEyu0rrME8MlmD9b3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vdokXTdAIx3jrYYG7moT0vop4ZO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kvILcin1mGcEyu0rrME8MlmD9b3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10044,"title":"My Lucky Stars","description":"Two Hong Kong cops are sent to Tokyo to catch an ex-cop who stole a large amount of money in diamonds. After one is captured by the Ninja-gang protecting the rogue cop, the other one gets his old Orphanage gang, dubbed the \"Five Lucky Stars,\" to help him. They don''t like this much, but they do it.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Action","Comedy"],"release_date":"1985-02-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nqku4NcsbNsqkzMhvNOFosVDo6a.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dZzHBIcJsld2XMvwR75OZGf4NM2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nqku4NcsbNsqkzMhvNOFosVDo6a.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dZzHBIcJsld2XMvwR75OZGf4NM2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4169,"title":"Breach","description":"Eric O''Neill, a low-level surveillance expert with the FBI, believes he is accomplishing his dream of becoming a full-fledged agent, with his unexpected promotion and assignment to clerk for Robert Hanssen, a renowned senior agent with 25 years in the FBI. However, he soon learns the reason for his promotion is to gain Hanssen''s trust and find proof that he is a traitor to the country. Determined to draw the suspected double-agent out of deep cover, O''Neill finds himself in a lethal game of spy vs. spy, where nothing is as it seems.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Crime","History"],"release_date":"2007-02-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8WneCViPYXAcnJcJ2VZuAPPHQ5p.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/m2iVkJPxDrrink7NiE412nFBMQj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8WneCViPYXAcnJcJ2VZuAPPHQ5p.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//m2iVkJPxDrrink7NiE412nFBMQj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":893086,"title":"The Good Neighbor","description":"A nightmarish evening unfolds for neighbors David and Robert when they accidentally hit a woman on her bike and flee the scene. While David is increasingly plagued by feelings of guilt, Robert shows no remorse and becomes overbearing and possessive.","duration":"1:37:00","genre"