os","description":"On a faraway mountaintop, eight kids with guns watch over a hostage and a conscripted milk cow.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Crime","War"],"release_date":"2019-08-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iqd7U0nrQw9zKUKyG05dtWpBVJT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sMcvyEqzwWyaUhuUaJtiZuc7Ku5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iqd7U0nrQw9zKUKyG05dtWpBVJT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sMcvyEqzwWyaUhuUaJtiZuc7Ku5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":320367,"title":"Return","description":"A tale of terror. Cathy Reed has been institutionalized most of her life because of Schizophrenia, as a child her parents thought she was possessed by demons and had her exercised by priests. Medical science saw different. Now decades later Cathy is freed, relocated to her own flat and given a chance to be independent. Once alone things are not what they all seem and when her nightmares turn real she questions her state of mind before she is left to face her demons.","duration":"0:45:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2015-01-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_facenull","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a3fhJx8oVTC1Mh9QraF1z2K1Wr1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/null","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//a3fhJx8oVTC1Mh9QraF1z2K1Wr1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":192577,"title":"Space Pirate Captain Harlock","description":"Space Pirate Captain Harlock and his fearless crew face off against the space invaders who seek to conquer the planet Earth.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Animation","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2013-09-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4xzUhKxWHxPjJ6h1faVMTUBDquQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mlHoTQLYsuzJJArO2fHS5rqnLqe.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/