{"tmdb_id":12113,"title":"Body of Lies","description":"The CIA’s hunt is on for the mastermind of a wave of terrorist attacks. Roger Ferris is the agency’s man on the ground, moving from place to place, scrambling to stay ahead of ever-shifting events. An eye in the sky – a satellite link – watches Ferris.  At the other end of that real-time link is the CIA’s Ed Hoffman, strategizing events from thousands of miles away. And as Ferris nears the target, he discovers trust can be just as dangerous as it is necessary for survival.","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["Action","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2008-10-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6ghc2ySuEnTW8h3YgZZufk2SOTv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sLjVDPPfNQfAma9XyOqHPClQb2V.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6ghc2ySuEnTW8h3YgZZufk2SOTv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sLjVDPPfNQfAma9XyOqHPClQb2V.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10133,"title":"Cypher","description":"An unsuspecting, disenchanted man finds himself working as a spy in the dangerous, high-stakes world of corporate espionage. Quickly getting way over-his-head, he teams up with a mysterious femme fatale.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Thriller","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2002-10-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dAUPKVE0K7XPC02IepwrMduvYYa.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7wYwmDuCbdKF7sAcLj7eqrNaiam.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dAUPKVE0K7XPC02IepwrMduvYYa.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7wYwmDuCbdKF7sAcLj7eqrNaiam.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":7450,"title":"Titan A.E.","description":"A young man finds out that he holds the key to restoring hope and ensuring survival for the human race, while an alien species called the Drej are bent on mankind''s destruction.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Animation","Science Fiction","Adventure","Family","Action"],"release_date":"2000-06-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/t0VWB5Kc5o38w5YYgzReArrGiZ8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/el2iHk3LTJWfEnwrvcRkvWY501G.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//t0VWB5Kc5o38w5YYgzReArrGiZ8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//el2iHk3LTJWfEnwrvcRkvWY501G.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":434775,"title":"The Third Murder","description":"A lawyer tasked with defending a robbery-and-murder suspect begins developing doubts about what truly happened.","duration":"2:05:00","genre":["Drama","Mystery","Crime"],"release_date":"2017-09-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kHejbCUiGHVVqIj2RmweEnVb6LJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xENc6UYviC3JfFqKA6kReHfT2Zt.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kHejbCUiGHVVqIj2RmweEnVb6LJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xENc6UYviC3JfFqKA6kReHfT2Zt.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":401200,"title":"Kursk","description":"Barents Sea, August 12th, 2000. During a Russian naval exercise, and after suffering a serious accident, the K-141 Kursk submarine sinks with 118 crew members on board. While the few sailors who are still alive barely manage to survive, their families push for accurate information and a British officer struggles to obtain from the Russian government a permit to attempt a rescue before it is late. But general incompetence are against all their efforts.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Drama","History","Thriller","Action"],"release_date":"2018-11-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tpn4FbxL6oeZh8YtanV1a0k7dLB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1Y09MkMJ8CESSPW4fcbDm9s5cAS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tpn4FbxL6oeZh8YtanV1a0k7dLB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1Y09MkMJ8CESSPW4fcbDm9s5cAS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":245916,"title":"Kill the Messenger","description":"A reporter becomes the target of a vicious smear campaign that drives him to the point of suicide after he exposes the CIA''s role in arming Contra rebels in Nicaragua and importing cocaine into California. Based on the true story of journalist Gary Webb.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Mystery","Thriller","History"],"release_date":"2014-10-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hYVAvYJXE4taTIh2y6F5mGJWfPm.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8gaNZiKZHvKCqMDByY00dUIV0YC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hYVAvYJXE4taTIh2y6F5mGJWfPm.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8gaNZiKZHvKCqMDByY00dUIV0YC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":190880,"title":"Me, Myself and Mum","description":"How to become a man when your mother and your closed circle have decided otherwise? This is the challenge Guillaume took up. The film recounts Guillaume''s tragicomic battle from the young age of eight, as he adopts the role of a girl then of a homosexual... until, aged 30, he meets the woman who, after his mother, will become the other woman in his life. Beyond this story of a heterosexual coming-out, the film tells the tale of an actor who never stopped loving women, maybe even a little too much.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2013-11-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/skYxo3bOe9JoNLbgfXKREZl5Z3B.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7FunclNlH3HjMXrSWMFUHWGy4Pp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//skYxo3bOe9JoNLbgfXKREZl5Z3B.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7FunclNlH3HjMXrSWMFUHWGy4Pp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":47955,"title":"White Dog","description":"Samuel Fuller’s throat-grabbing exposé on American racism was misunderstood and withheld from release when it was made in the early eighties.Today, the notorious film is lauded for its daring metaphor and gripping pulp filmmaking. Kristy McNichol stars as a young actress who adopts a lost German shepherd, only to discover through a series of horrifying incidents that the dog has been trained to attack black people, and Paul Winfield plays the animal trainer who tries to cure him. A snarling, uncompromising vision, White Dog is a tragic portrait of the evil done by that most corruptible of all animals; the human being.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Drama","Horror","Thriller"],"release_date":"1982-07-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yYddTCIoWvpVl9hbyqEQV3OsX61.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2oU700G9pDwFt7px5GxOqDHFPfR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yYddTCIoWvpVl9hbyqEQV3OsX61.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2oU700G9pDwFt7px5GxOqDHFPfR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":39100,"title":"Dragon Ball Z: The World''s Strongest","description":"The evil Dr. Kochin uses the dragon balls to resurrect his mentor, Dr. Wheelo, in an effort to take over the world. Dr. Wheelo, his body having been destroyed by the avalanche that killed him fifty years before, desires the body of the strongest fighter in the world as his new vessel. Believing Roshi to be the world''s strongest warrior, Dr. Kochin abducts Bulma and forces Roshi to surrender himself to save her. When Goku hears of their abduction, he goes to their rescue.","duration":"1:00:00","genre":["Action","Animation","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1990-03-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pLuoFuzygOdWBRJhLQWSbKeoZ0s.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5elbm3iLgGQ6nA5vqUmi9vIojbF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pLuoFuzygOdWBRJhLQWSbKeoZ0s.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5elbm3iLgGQ6nA5vqUmi9vIojbF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11635,"title":"Old School","description":"Three friends attempt to recapture their glory days by opening up a fraternity near their alma mater.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2003-02-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2tZVYiosztNM1DAYUF59VPsNp9L.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nYtuwNHpEoIbTgS3aFPSEwZNN6l.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2tZVYiosztNM1DAYUF59VPsNp9L.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nYtuwNHpEoIbTgS3aFPSEwZNN6l.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8834,"title":"Conspiracy Theory","description":"A man obsessed with conspiracy theories becomes a target after one of his theories turns out to be true. Unfortunately, in order to save himself, he has to figure out which theory it is.","duration":"2:15:00","genre":["Action","Drama","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"1997-08-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/70tmPOoCJCciWaM1vDvXAi4w3Bc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sTyTKZVikQU6g50HE8HR1tBSRxj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//70tmPOoCJCciWaM1vDvXAi4w3Bc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sTyTKZVikQU6g50HE8HR1tBSRxj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":881164,"title":"Boston Strangler","description":"Reporters Loretta McLaughlin and Jean Cole bravely pursue the story of the Boston Strangler at great personal risk, putting their own lives on the line in their quest to uncover the truth.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Crime","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2023-03-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/254iY5CzFzjnjkP0lUkLpOLvXar.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oZJfw78ZyPmgNJ0YJ8070nKEF4Y.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//254iY5CzFzjnjkP0lUkLpOLvXar.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oZJfw78ZyPmgNJ0YJ8070nKEF4Y.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":547012,"title":"Buffaloed","description":"Set in the underworld of debt-collecting, homegrown hustler Peg Dahl will do anything to escape Buffalo, NY.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2020-02-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vLI1uQuvk3lUnTWER0bJ9RSRnKM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7ecianrsS9xYzqoAtVIW8tMcbIX.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vLI1uQuvk3lUnTWER0bJ9RSRnKM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7ecianrsS9xYzqoAtVIW8tMcbIX.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":529485,"title":"The Way Back","description":"A former basketball all-star, who has lost his wife and family foundation in a struggle with addiction, attempts to regain his soul and salvation by becoming the coach of a disparate ethnically mixed high school basketball team at his alma mater.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2020-03-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iTLGqoHkiSqUts9nPIdYLPtOz8C.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ylPnfaphW3FrLBUVwAREVtiL9My.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iTLGqoHkiSqUts9nPIdYLPtOz8C.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ylPnfaphW3FrLBUVwAREVtiL9My.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":262789,"title":"Ti ricordi di me?","description":"Sharing the same psychologist, kleptomaniac Roberto, who writes stories a bit too realistic and scary for kids, and a narcoleptic Beatrice, who documents everything in her life, begin to think that love could be the cure for their problems. But nothing comes easy to either of them, and, just like in one of Roberto''s stories, the happy ending really needs to be sought after. Will they find their own?","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"2014-04-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a1UHS1zpGvAcWCw7IzZF6Ffi1Ox.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_an