ription":"An undercover DEA agent and his partner embark on a game of cat and mouse with an audacious, and surprising group of thieves – their own rebellious teenagers, who have begun robbing from a dangerous cartel, using their parents'' tactics and top-secret intel to do it.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2025-11-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oIJjO1CvEdTMFNkWfHaV0RB584G.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6tpAPeuuqbVnYWWPoOLEDLSBU7a.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oIJjO1CvEdTMFNkWfHaV0RB584G.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6tpAPeuuqbVnYWWPoOLEDLSBU7a.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":25059,"title":"Homeward Bound II: Lost in San Francisco","description":"When the pets accidentally get separated from their vacationing owners, Chance, Shadow, and Sassy navigate the mean streets of San Francisco, trying to find their home across the Golden Gate Bridge. But the road is blocked by a series of hazards, both man and beast.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Adventure","Comedy","Drama","Family"],"release_date":"1996-03-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sMukEdOweNU9UveS1FPTnzVpB9p.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kfYawa9SF9MQ3ae0TXAfhDLFGv7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sMukEdOweNU9UveS1FPTnzVpB9p.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kfYawa9SF9MQ3ae0TXAfhDLFGv7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10449,"title":"When a Man Loves a Woman","description":"An airline pilot and his wife are forced to face the consequences of her alcoholism when her addictions threaten her life and their daughter''s safety. While the woman enters detox, her husband must face the truth of his enabling behavior.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1994-04-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eS4k