nd teams up with Tron, a security measure created to bring balance to the digital environment.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Action","Adventure"],"release_date":"1982-07-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vUmeBHiGp5r2ydd8aEvbNLamTVD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jigY9B6TKz4qlfikZcd18qtzTK4.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vUmeBHiGp5r2ydd8aEvbNLamTVD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jigY9B6TKz4qlfikZcd18qtzTK4.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":535167,"title":"The Wandering Earth","description":"When the Sun begins to expand in such a way that it will inevitably engulf and destroy the Earth in a hundred years, united mankind finds a way to avoid extinction by propelling the planet out of the Solar System using gigantic engines, moving it to a new home located four light years away, an epic journey that will last thousands of years.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Action","Drama"],"release_date":"2019-02-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wIrqeoJHYtZmneqIufPtcOHMjOg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/z3MXFdFjrYmoxOEFgE1wuphwo2a.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wIrqeoJHYtZmneqIufPtcOHMjOg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//z3MXFdFjrYmoxOEFgE1wuphwo2a.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":514684,"title":"Why Don''t You Just Die!","description":"Andrey, a detective and the world''s most horrible father, brings together a terrible group of people in his apartment: his resentful actress daughter, an angry thug, and a cheated cop. Each one of them has a reason to want revenge..","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Comedy","Thriller","Horror"],"release_date":"2018-08-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ehaZKFWlNV1UudA4DBnFAG6eozT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/warC8GJApWssmU9vXXZDY7O