xVaxxIGaFjy3NVxK29gvucR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":668640,"title":"Official Competition","description":"When a billionaire entrepreneur impulsively decides to create an iconic movie, he demands the best. Renowned filmmaker Lola Cuevas is recruited to mastermind this ambitious endeavour. Completing the all-star team are two actors with massive talent but even bigger egos: Hollywood heartthrob Félix Rivero and radical theatre actor Iván Torres. Both are legends, but not exactly best friends. Through a series of increasingly eccentric trials set by Lola, Félix and Iván must confront not only each other but also their own legacies. Who will be left when the cameras finally start rolling?","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2021-09-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cuyXEls6uOMDqflx2MSzZOuQSn2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xvsiRSy1kIwlySogzOxkCFrJWYx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cuyXEls6uOMDqflx2MSzZOuQSn2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xvsiRSy1kIwlySogzOxkCFrJWYx.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":243526,"title":"Faults","description":"Claire is under the grip of a mysterious new cult called Faults. Desperate to be reunited with their daughter, Claire''s parents recruit one of the world''s foremost experts on mind control, Ansel Roth.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2014-03-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/s6qH2TwlRWzSfKhFeDAJFzNI54A.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/syUVk09hC701h3C1pjaB69LXwJi.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//s6qH2TwlRWzSfKhFeDAJFzNI54A.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//syUVk09hC701h3C1pjaB69LXwJi.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11455,"title":"Up in Smoke","description":"An unemployed pot-smoking slacker and amateur drummer, Anthony Stoner ditches his strict parents and hits the road, eventually meeting kindred spirit Pedro de Pacas. While the drug-ingesting duo is soon arrested for possession of marijuana, Anthony and Pedro get released on a technicality, allowing them to continue their many misadventures and ultimately compete in a rock band contest, where they perform the raucous tune \"Earache My Eye.\"","duration":"1:26:00","genre":["Adventure","Comedy"],"release_date":"1978-09-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eEG0Wq8TFg11HFuaKnetw0dQNUy.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bZclIeyzmybXLe3hTbFOIqlyPE0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eEG0Wq8TFg11HFuaKnetw0dQNUy.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bZclIeyzmybXLe3hTbFOIqlyPE0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10691,"title":"Crazy/Beautiful","description":"At Pacific Palisades High, a poor Latino falls hard for a troubled girl from the affluent neighborhood.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2001-06-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zbFG63ineDZdEHHyv7WwASRpOAM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1kxn6w6lvKkrhmVxfVqI0cfBmLa.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zbFG63ineDZdEHHyv7WwASRpOAM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1kxn6w6lvKkrhmVxfVqI0cfBmLa.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10184,"title":"He''s Just Not That Into You","description":"Remember that really cute girl/guy who said they''d call – and didn''t? Maybe they lost your number. Maybe they''re in the hospital. Maybe they''re awed by your looks, brains or success. Or maybe... They''re just not that into you.","duration":"2:09:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2009-02-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jZkkch6yrP1tVVfEU2uqwej9rBM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jip2ap24Y6JxEgzVRyNqyYssnyR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"