g/t/p/w342//zGFHR3JoW783Dl2YuWYcQWbTrGD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//g6bzaEu7wpNu5PPczMqzOBw05TQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":251768,"title":"JLA Adventures: Trapped in Time","description":"Get ready for a battle of the ages when the Justice League faces off against its archenemies, the Legion of Doom, in an all-new movie from DC Comics. A mysterious being known as the Time Trapper arises, and a sinister plan led by Lex Luthor sends the Legion of Doom back in time to eliminate Superman, Wonder Woman and Batman before they become super heroes. For Aquaman, Flash and Cyborg, along with teen super heroes Karate Kid and Dawnstar, the stakes have never been higher, the rescue mission never deadlier. So join the fight for the future as the Justice League confronts its ultimate challenge… the threat of having never existed!","duration":"0:52:00","genre":["Family","Animation","Action","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2014-01-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mWzgMPlQcFZ6lZ449673LS2aCHX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qchNuTbnleCtlIB8wyV03f36VuF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mWzgMPlQcFZ6lZ449673LS2aCHX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qchNuTbnleCtlIB8wyV03f36VuF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":238636,"title":"The Purge: Anarchy","description":"One night per year, the government sanctions a 12-hour period in which citizens can commit any crime they wish -- including murder -- without fear of punishment or imprisonment. Leo, a sergeant who lost his son, plans a vigilante mission of revenge during the mayhem. However, instead of a death-dealing avenger, he becomes the unexpected protector of four innocent strangers who desperately need his help if they are to survive the night.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Horror","Thriller"],"release_date":"2014-07-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/blfZnm6StMPnTY35kaooPBCsSVp.jpg",