ster Ip Man, who will eventually train Bruce Lee, finds his peaceful life interrupted by vengeance.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Action","Drama","History"],"release_date":"2013-01-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hhT61DEebn8IicJbImFXw29GvRl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ydBVVIscL6TsX5hYztA5YpBCwJ3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hhT61DEebn8IicJbImFXw29GvRl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ydBVVIscL6TsX5hYztA5YpBCwJ3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":19344,"title":"Loving Annabelle","description":"Annabelle is the wise-beyond-her-years newcomer to an exclusive Catholic girls school. Having been expelled from her first two schools she''s bound to stir some trouble. Sparks fly though when sexual chemistry appears between her and the Head of her dorm and English teacher, Simone Bradley. Annabelle pursues her relentlessly and until the end the older woman manages to avoid the law.","duration":"1:17:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2007-05-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nnrNau1w3kIsPYMllbfsVQNUJVu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a6p1Oexil6Z2XO5d1QVHR3F2OoM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nnrNau1w3kIsPYMllbfsVQNUJVu.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//a6p1Oexil6Z2XO5d1QVHR3F2OoM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11422,"title":"Midway","description":"This war drama depicts the U.S. and Japanese forces in the naval Battle of Midway, which became a turning point for Americans during World War II.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Action","Drama","History","War"],"release_date":"1976-06-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2QCwYIcWkRcGMNSqHFrbdppZgX6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vCzGV28YFmWubUn1jh8ytagYocR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2QCwYIcWkRcGMNSqHFrb