g son Dom are trapped in a digital space by a rogue A.I., LeBron must get them home safe by leading Bugs, Lola Bunny and the whole gang of notoriously undisciplined Looney Tunes to victory over the A.I.''s digitized champions on the court. It''s Tunes versus Goons in the highest-stakes challenge of his life.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Family","Comedy","Adventure","Science Fiction","Animation"],"release_date":"2021-07-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8s4h9friP6Ci3adRGahHARVd76E.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5bFK5d3mVTAvBCXi5NPWH0tYjKl.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8s4h9friP6Ci3adRGahHARVd76E.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5bFK5d3mVTAvBCXi5NPWH0tYjKl.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":306650,"title":"Kajaki","description":"British soldiers guarding the Kajaki Dam set out to rescue a three-man team after one of them loses a leg to a landmine.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Thriller","War","Adventure","Drama"],"release_date":"2014-11-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8jBDEjOdYFXE6D2o2sekLhe7Oo0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/csL2D3ZbcxSoqoWyhYz4lDjdmk2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8jBDEjOdYFXE6D2o2sekLhe7Oo0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//csL2D3ZbcxSoqoWyhYz4lDjdmk2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":177699,"title":"Alan Partridge: Alpha Papa","description":"When famous DJ Alan Partridge’s radio station is taken over by a new media conglomerate, it sets in motion a chain of events which see Alan having to work with the police to defuse a potentially violent siege.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2013-07-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/de5FcDrVhkhNQHkn6O5q6jaatKP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kwIXwAUQKzyJC5Co1eEBCH52WDY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https: