st","description":"Young Nigel Slater has big culinary aspirations, even though all his mother knows how to make is toast. When his mother dies, relations grow strained between Nigel and his father, especially when he remarries a woman who wins his heart with a lemon meringue pie. Nigel enters culinary school, starts working in a pub, and finds himself competing with his stepmother - both in the kitchen and for his father''s attention.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","History","Family"],"release_date":"2010-12-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bCdDu23bLVzUTCykxDKEhhpj5c9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2TSqAghgHeXA7nHXNDp0wuovj3X.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bCdDu23bLVzUTCykxDKEhhpj5c9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2TSqAghgHeXA7nHXNDp0wuovj3X.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11532,"title":"The Emerald Forest","description":"For ten years, engineer Bill Markham has searched tirelessly for his son Tommy who disappeared from the edge of the Brazilian rainforest. Miraculously, he finds the boy living among the reclusive Amazon tribe who adopted him. And that''s when Bill''s adventure truly begins. For his son is now a grown tribesman who moves skillfully through this beautiful-but-dangerous terrain, fearful only of those who would exploit it. And as Bill attempts to \"rescue\" him from the savagery of the untamed jungle, Tommy challenges Bill''s idea of true civilization and his notions about who needs rescuing.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Drama"],"release_date":"1985-06-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8JH97RT7J2zMRDx3ia7wwywkIwV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fdRlqPnPFaPyQqS3KiBLJwWQPBe.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8JH97RT7J2zMRDx3ia7wwywkIwV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fdRlqPnPFaPyQqS3KiBLJwWQPBe.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8649,"title":"Bringing Out the Dead","description":"Once called \"Father Frank\" for his efforts to rescue lives, Frank Pierce sees the ghosts of those he failed to save around every turn. He has tried everything he can to get fired, calling in sick, delaying taking calls where he might have to face one more victim he couldn''t help, yet cannot quit the job on his own.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1999-10-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6UgzxKBBIdfTLrDQdDdFf1gpBBa.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gE2Q8mL0m0EA6HakRyc92uzSPJn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6UgzxKBBIdfTLrDQdDdFf1gpBBa.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gE2Q8mL0m0EA6HakRyc92uzSPJn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5121,"title":"The Sugarland Express","description":"Married small-time crooks Lou-Jean and Clovis Poplin lose their baby to the state of Texas and resolve to do whatever it takes to get him back. Lou-Jean gets Clovis out of jail, and the two steal their son from his foster home, in addition to taking a highway patrolman hostage. As a massive dragnet starts to pursue them across Texas, the couple become unlikely folk heroes and even start to bond with the captive policeman.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"1974-03-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cssKLoKClpgqaaGD2z3cjXgzPSM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/csahjHhtJ9NzFKcxVcw7S4Pyfj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cssKLoKClpgqaaGD2z3cjXgzPSM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//csahjHhtJ9NzFKcxVcw7S4Pyfj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1593,"title":"Night at the Museum","description":"Chaos reigns at the natural history museum when night watchman Larry Daley accidentally stirs up an ancient curse, awakening Attila the Hun, an army of gladiators, a Tyrannosaurus rex and other exhibits.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Fantasy","Family","Comedy"],"release_date":"2006-12-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1ZVlzOBYCggLzvVYHK7Im6LohjC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pDsAAYf6Zn0yiAGJ6lYGs6hoZ4E.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1ZVlzOBYCggLzvVYHK7Im6LohjC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pDsAAYf6Zn0yiAGJ6lYGs6hoZ4E.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1100988,"title":"28 Years Later","description":"Twenty-eight years after the Rage virus outbreak, a heavily-defended island survives connected to the mainland by a single causeway. When one of the group leaves the island into the dark heart of the mainland, he discovers secrets, wonders, and horrors that have mutated not only the infected but other survivors as well.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Horror","Thriller","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2025-06-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6WqqEjiycNvDLjbEClM1zCwIbDD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/n5FygjEppOvac6yEaowi26nTyw3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6WqqEjiycNvDLjbEClM1zCwIbDD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//n5FygjEppOvac6yEaowi26nTyw3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1100782,"title":"Smile 2","description":"About to embark on a new world tour, global pop sensation Skye Riley begins experiencing increasingly terrifying and inexplicable events. Overwhelmed by the escalating horrors and the pressures of fame, Skye is forced to face her dark past to regain control of her life before it spirals out of control.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Horror","Mystery"],"release_date":"2024-10-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iR79ciqhtaZ9BE7YFA1HpCHQgX4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ht8Uv9QPv9y7K0RvUyJIaXOZTfd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org