n together for a speed-typing contest.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2012-11-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cTEQbm8JCHm5Ro13CcE4xDt6nTy.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4d4a0uDl8tI4EoIjYEyU54Xpkzu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cTEQbm8JCHm5Ro13CcE4xDt6nTy.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4d4a0uDl8tI4EoIjYEyU54Xpkzu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":58159,"title":"The Tortoise and the Hare","description":"The Tortoise and the Hare is an animated short film released on January 5, 1935 by United Artists, produced by Walt Disney and directed by Wilfred Jackson. Based on an Aesop''s fable of the same name, The Tortoise and the Hare won the 1934 Academy Award for Best Short Subject: Cartoons. This cartoon is also believed to be one of the influences for Bugs Bunny.","duration":"0:09:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1935-01-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iNawpyQYb30IqFl4AjNsYlPn1HM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/luNLDY3zc76PWVkKlOpSSlPAnYH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iNawpyQYb30IqFl4AjNsYlPn1HM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//luNLDY3zc76PWVkKlOpSSlPAnYH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":36492,"title":"Carnal Knowledge","description":"Two lifelong friends navigate complex sexual encounters and emotional entanglements, wrestling with societal norms and personal desires.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"1971-06-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jbDu1quaSjr8NAx105UED2QPQxP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/l7e1qP8Mq97W1Wg14FNnbz1OxmG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jbDu1quaSjr8NAx105UED2QPQxP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//l7e1qP8Mq97