 is determined to ensure that Fred has all the opportunities that he needs, and that he is not taken advantage of by people who forget that his extremely powerful intellect is harboured in the body and emotions of a child.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Drama","Family"],"release_date":"1991-09-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lY1dSP8rtLxtnTPS1KM6ywYQK6Z.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eXf4xhJEc9c2NElBrExmiWFe4Pz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lY1dSP8rtLxtnTPS1KM6ywYQK6Z.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eXf4xhJEc9c2NElBrExmiWFe4Pz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10330,"title":"Freaky Friday","description":"Mother and daughter bicker over everything -- what Anna wears, whom she likes and what she wants to do when she''s older. In turn, Anna detests Tess''s fiancé. When a magical fortune cookie switches their personalities, they each get a peek at how the other person feels, thinks and lives.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Comedy","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2003-08-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cTGeY2fdf0eLubvEFZAGcr2PfLZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/y6kn3tUb4qrNZvV4TDIIjskZ9eV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cTGeY2fdf0eLubvEFZAGcr2PfLZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//y6kn3tUb4qrNZvV4TDIIjskZ9eV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":667,"title":"You Only Live Twice","description":"A mysterious spacecraft captures Russian and American space capsules and brings the two superpowers to the brink of war. James Bond investigates the case in Japan and comes face to face with his archenemy Blofeld.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Adventure"],"release_date":"1967-06-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cpZAXIYA0lkZMpAt7d1MmH8ojNV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gIhS0VC7Y