pean city.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Thriller","Action"],"release_date":"2016-12-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cBrzOqgAJv1YG4Jww9dt1B54Sv8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5yprxs7ZyBr58RsTQJrKCVmqk8X.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cBrzOqgAJv1YG4Jww9dt1B54Sv8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5yprxs7ZyBr58RsTQJrKCVmqk8X.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":148284,"title":"Enthiran","description":"Dr. Vaseegaran creates Chitti, a powerful robot in his own image, but it is rejected by the scientific body AIRD due to its lack of human behaviour and emotions. After a lightning strike triggers emotions in Chitti, he begins to develop human-like feelings. However, Chitti falls in love with Dr. Vaseegaran''s fiancée, Sana, and turns against his creator, leading to dangerous consequences.","duration":"2:56:00","genre":["Action","Science Fiction","Adventure"],"release_date":"2010-10-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fvsSPqeVq4yhp7oZTGXA99uDQ1v.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hai6CSCLxULO1RThjDP3lWAqOtQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fvsSPqeVq4yhp7oZTGXA99uDQ1v.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hai6CSCLxULO1RThjDP3lWAqOtQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":92591,"title":"Bernie","description":"In small-town Texas, affable and popular mortician Bernie Tiede strikes up a friendship with Marjorie Nugent, a wealthy widow well known for her sour attitude. When she becomes controlling and abusive, Bernie goes to great lengths to remove himself from her grasp.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2012-04-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gLr8DBGveOCJAS469GnWTRSXsP9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rW5CetooG545jpkPNpD4FjFAXfe.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"ht