ng war between members of the Yakuza, the Japanese Mafia. They arrest one of their killers and are ordered to escort him back to Japan. However, in Japan he manages to escape, and as they try to track him down, they get deeper and deeper into the Japanese Mafia scene and they have to learn that they can only win by playing the game—the Japanese way.","duration":"2:05:00","genre":["Drama","Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"1989-09-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4xAxAvrcnelGOBA5mQsW0aEHpqW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/funhGWt9ee3Uwb6Ar8SGCCvbJdV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4xAxAvrcnelGOBA5mQsW0aEHpqW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//funhGWt9ee3Uwb6Ar8SGCCvbJdV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1214314,"title":"One More Shot","description":"Following the attack on the black site in Poland, Navy SEAL Jake Harris is ordered to escort terrorist suspect Amin Mansur to Washington D.C. for interrogation. Before the prisoner transfer process is complete, though, the airport is attacked by a group of heavily armed, well-trained mercenaries.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2024-01-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ay0PJQZizDXk0pzhoGX4v7K9h7A.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xiLFc19JANfAZHbecqoCFpmtiUV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ay0PJQZizDXk0pzhoGX4v7K9h7A.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xiLFc19JANfAZHbecqoCFpmtiUV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":967941,"title":"Wicked: For Good","description":"As an angry mob rises against the Wicked Witch, Glinda and Elphaba must unite one last time with honesty and empathy to fulfill their shared destiny and change the fate of Oz forever.","duration":"2:17:00","genre":["Fantasy","Adventure","Romance"],"release_date":"2025-11-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h