fe she’s always desired: she works and she is deeply in love with her husband Stefano, even if he doesn’t always have a job and they both need to struggle to keep on going. They are happy and always on each other’s side, but shortly after she finds out she’s pregnant, she gets fired and her world starts falling apart.  After having tried to have a baby for years, the joy of impending motherhood lasts only a few months. Begging for help but with no one ready to listen to her, completely desperate and shattered, Luciana decides to kidnap the managing director of her former company, asking for the justice she deserves.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2015-11-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7Um2N8gie2Qyc53BubttJdBZz0S.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dtqMPJWTpfo1XC42At1pvVeIyPw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7Um2N8gie2Qyc53BubttJdBZz0S.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dtqMPJWTpfo1XC42At1pvVeIyPw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":22021,"title":"Coffy","description":"After her younger sister gets involved in drugs and is severely injured by contaminated heroin, a nurse sets out on a mission of vengeance and vigilante justice, killing drug dealers, pimps, and mobsters who cross her path.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"1973-06-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jztSvvmOUEP8V85xadxMRoE5e2O.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sN00Cvlahl6JLC2TAUBL0jZOqD3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jztSvvmOUEP8V85xadxMRoE5e2O.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sN00Cvlahl6JLC2TAUBL0jZOqD3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13105,"title":"Mr. Mom","description":"Jack and Caroline are a couple making a decent living when Jack suddenly loses his job. They agree that he should stay at home and look after the house while Caroline works. It''s just that he''s never done it before, and really doesn''t have a clue...","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1983-07-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zzGgdKmUSnJx6cEiW3Nfh5ruOOy.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/QuTlgKKykL7j0PnZZd3LNFVhCX.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zzGgdKmUSnJx6cEiW3Nfh5ruOOy.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//QuTlgKKykL7j0PnZZd3LNFVhCX.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11282,"title":"Harold & Kumar Go to White Castle","description":"Nerdy accountant Harold and his irrepressible friend, Kumar, get stoned watching television and find themselves utterly bewitched by a commercial for White Castle. Convinced there must be one nearby, the two set out on a late-night odyssey that takes them deep into New Jersey. Somehow, the boys manage to run afoul of rednecks, cops and even a car-stealing Neil Patrick Harris before getting anywhere near their beloved sliders.","duration":"1:28:00","genre":["Comedy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2004-07-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dzloVSv0FGM8fs4L5w9yV60p0PT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5vO7R4xYlDipTp8gzfRbWegO8eb.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dzloVSv0FGM8fs4L5w9yV60p0PT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5vO7R4xYlDipTp8gzfRbWegO8eb.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8840,"title":"DragonHeart","description":"In an ancient time when majestic fire-breathers soared through the skies, a knight named Bowen comes face to face and heart to heart with the last dragon on Earth, Draco. Taking up arms to suppress a tyrant king, Bowen soon realizes his task will be harder than he''d imagined: If he kills the king, Draco will die as well.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Fantasy","Action","Adventure","Drama"],"release_date":"1996-05-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.