 Ledge","description":"A rock climbing adventure between two friends turns into a terrifying nightmare. After Kelly captures the murder of her best friend on camera, she becomes the next target of a tight knit group of friends who will stop at nothing to destroy the evidence and anyone in their way.","duration":"1:26:00","genre":["Thriller","Adventure"],"release_date":"2022-02-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bAoxTHZXJNsWxeH6fo6fdM5j7P8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/93XUO9rlMw21PeAyDKzzTLTzmjO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bAoxTHZXJNsWxeH6fo6fdM5j7P8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//93XUO9rlMw21PeAyDKzzTLTzmjO.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":686487,"title":"King Kong vs. Godzilla","description":"When an underhanded pharmaceutical company goes to a remote tropical island to steal King Kong for advertising purposes, they get more than they bargained for when the gigantic ape attacks an unsuspecting village and an enormous octopus.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Action","Science Fiction","Comedy","Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1963-06-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5nAYjMYxC8bHc7sKCFhfd6y3eMa.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/v4lxYywAyEuT974dVi22y8TGP0t.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5nAYjMYxC8bHc7sKCFhfd6y3eMa.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//v4lxYywAyEuT974dVi22y8TGP0t.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":619297,"title":"Sweet Girl","description":"A man vows to bring justice to those responsible for his wife''s death while protecting the only family he has left, his daughter.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"2021-08-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nprqOIEfiMMQx16lgKeLf3rmPrR.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cP7odDzzFBD9ycxj2laTeFWGLjD.jp