iary of a Teenage Girl","description":"Minnie Goetze is a 15-year-old aspiring comic-book artist, coming of age in the haze of the 1970s in San Francisco. Insatiably curious about the world around her, Minnie is a pretty typical teenage girl. Oh, except that she’s sleeping with her mother’s boyfriend.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"2015-08-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jUiH4T53kBjyflRgzVuD6aB8hQi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5YlUrdYKuscD7pwf3yy9duVLbui.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jUiH4T53kBjyflRgzVuD6aB8hQi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5YlUrdYKuscD7pwf3yy9duVLbui.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10890,"title":"Stripes","description":"Hard-luck cabbie John Winger, directionless after being fired from his job and dumped by his girlfriend, enlists in the U.S. Army with his close pal, Russell Ziskey. After his barely satisfactory performance in basic training, the irreverent Winger emerges as the figurehead for a ragtag band of misfits. However, his hijinks threaten to cause an international scandal when he inadvertently commandeers a military assault vehicle behind enemy lines.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Action","Comedy"],"release_date":"1981-06-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/RtNJPHoCYXLdc0ckyBd4E3Xlkf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/toyyN62VLUXoUudFbHPdrrmRFSZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//RtNJPHoCYXLdc0ckyBd4E3Xlkf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//toyyN62VLUXoUudFbHPdrrmRFSZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1492640,"title":"UNABOMBER","description":"Follow Ted Kaczynski''s transformation from Harvard prodigy into the infamous Unabomber. Subjected to controversial psychological experiments by Professor Henry Murray, Kaczynski''s troubled past resurfaces decades later when his manhunt, led by 