 artists and ideas led him into a high-stakes game of cat and mouse with the KGB.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2018-08-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7QRCqo0WZ42JYAuupnIuSzbSHZ5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5OF4zAdfQWKDTiiRpbZvZUsLioq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7QRCqo0WZ42JYAuupnIuSzbSHZ5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5OF4zAdfQWKDTiiRpbZvZUsLioq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":292141,"title":"The Right of Youth","description":"Court huntsman, Søtoft, is courting his daughter Else’s lady-in-waiting, Miss Engelke. That’s why it’s a bit of a punch in the stomach when, late one evening, he discovers his son Ove in close contact with her. Chamberlain von Plessen, who had been gossiping to Søtoft and is himself spying on the young couple, is going to set fire to the room they’re in. The hurt Søtoft wants to leave the young couple to their cruel fate – that is until he discovers that it’s not Engelke, but his daughter Else, who is trapped in the flames with her brother. (Stumfilm.dk)","duration":"0:33:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1911-01-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_facenull","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_facenull","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/null","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/null"},{"tmdb_id":102382,"title":"The Amazing Spider-Man 2","description":"For Peter Parker, life is busy. Between taking out the bad guys as Spider-Man and spending time with the person he loves, Gwen Stacy, high school graduation cannot come quickly enough. Peter has not forgotten about the promise he made to Gwen’s father to protect her by staying away, but that is a promise he cannot keep. Things will change for Peter when a new villain, Electro, emerges, an old friend, Harry Osborn, returns, and Peter uncovers new clues about his past.","duration":"2:21:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2014-04-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/k0hlAzTryCYX1O1LyC6P8tAa8s0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bU7nTmvmy0h3VUP01v1T2imgH6N.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//k0hlAzTryCYX1O1LyC6P8tAa8s0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bU7nTmvmy0h3VUP01v1T2imgH6N.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":68812,"title":"The Iceman","description":"The true story of Richard Kuklinski, the notorious contract killer and family man.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Thriller","Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2012-09-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kqsMRKkwJssTcp9chZzY161KNRO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3edygPSm9XdISHza8zqHUVAQHAD.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kqsMRKkwJssTcp9chZzY161KNRO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3edygPSm9XdISHza8zqHUVAQHAD.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":28260,"title":"Return of the Living Dead III","description":"Having recently witnessed the horrific results of a top secret project to bring the dead back to life, a distraught teenager performs the operation on his girlfriend after she''s killed in a motorcycle accident.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Horror","Romance"],"release_date":"1993-10-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gB6TPrzf8PwKFdkFuEQuKgG8Xyr.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lu4Eit7pR5I8hGHJmy3K9Re8FPo.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gB6TPrzf8PwKFdkFuEQuKgG8Xyr.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lu4Eit7pR5I8hGHJmy3K9Re8FPo.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":6283,"title":"MouseHunt","description":"Down-on-their luck brothers, Lars and Ernie Smuntz, aren''t happy with the crumbling old mansion they inherit... until they discover the estate is worth millions. Before they can cash in, they have to rid the house of its single, stubborn occupant—a tiny and tenacious mouse.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"1997-12-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3YV8gxpLA3WYkLaQcejI4uti1hf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aqBPrWOzXEO3rWEk3DYTHBjXNZb.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3YV8gxpLA3WYkLaQcejI4uti1hf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aqBPrWOzXEO3rWEk3DYTHBjXNZb.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2789,"title":"The Chronicles of Riddick","description":"After years of outrunning ruthless bounty hunters, escaped convict Riddick suddenly finds himself caught between opposing forces in a fight for the future of the human race. Now, waging incredible battles on fantastic and deadly worlds, this lone, reluctant hero will emerge as humanity''s champion - and the last hope for a universe on the edge of annihilation.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Action","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2004-06-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lt3NqorBMWn786m9bzqM0OLdMS8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bVO1r90diKfFLzvZ5D3qK6Z558O.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lt3NqorBMWn786m9bzqM0OLdMS8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bVO1r90diKfFLzvZ5D3qK6Z558O.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1586,"title":"Secret Window","description":"Mort Rainey, a writer just emerging from a painful divorce with his ex-wife, is stalked at his remote lake house by a psychotic stranger and would-be scribe who claims Rainey swiped his best story idea. But as Rainey endeavors to prove his innocence, he begins to question his own sanity.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2004-03-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dBSYDUZpps3LWru7ofUZAYoFgUj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.