pg"},{"tmdb_id":113160,"title":"My First Time","description":"Zachary is 20 years old. Dark and independent, he collects amorous conquests and school failure. Sarah is 18 years old. First class, fragile, she fills her emotional gaps with perfect control of his life. Nothing should close and yet, the year of the tank, for six months, they will live a love against which nothing can be, the true, the big one that marks a life forever.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2012-01-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fxFx6zIxySJ8yJxP7ubtK2605sA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3mtfNuPiORYsgvNBxoZhBmkHTDI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fxFx6zIxySJ8yJxP7ubtK2605sA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3mtfNuPiORYsgvNBxoZhBmkHTDI.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":112336,"title":"Hitchcock","description":"Following his great success with \"North by Northwest,\" director Alfred Hitchcock makes a daring choice for his next project: an adaptation of Robert Bloch''s novel \"Psycho.\" When the studio refuses to back the picture, Hitchcock decides to pay for it himself in exchange for a percentage of the profits. His wife, Alma Reville, has serious reservations about the film but supports him nonetheless. Still, the production strains the couple''s marriage.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2012-11-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ktY9QTrPToBZ1RlpSOcD7CaExdy.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zlG4QzB00VM6QHUmRkKaboCOgat.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ktY9QTrPToBZ1RlpSOcD7CaExdy.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zlG4QzB00VM6QHUmRkKaboCOgat.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12133,"title":"Step Brothers","description":"Brennan Huff and Dale Doback might be grown men. But that doesn''t stop them from living at home and turning into jealous, competitive stepbrothers when their single parents marry. Brennan''s constant competition with Dale strains his mom''s marriage to Dale''s dad, leaving everyone to wonder whether they''ll ever see eye to eye.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2008-07-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/247H2jS9Te9TTmKDcAMg3LN5gmI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nvggBbEraUTAVR6ffP3AaBUWSHs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//247H2jS9Te9TTmKDcAMg3LN5gmI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nvggBbEraUTAVR6ffP3AaBUWSHs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11808,"title":"U.S. Marshals","description":"U.S. Marshal Sam Gerard is accompanying a plane load of convicts from Chicago to New York. The plane crashes spectacularly, and Mark Sheridan escapes. But when Diplomatic Security Agent John Royce is assigned to help Gerard recapture Sheridan, it becomes clear that Sheridan is more than just another murderer.","duration":"2:11:00","genre":["Thriller","Crime","Action"],"release_date":"1998-03-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1gjmfxUd4JPhfoVZszyS9mLA5Uv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5ST0BydDSXtW5AtfDDhTVS13pTt.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1gjmfxUd4JPhfoVZszyS9mLA5Uv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5ST0BydDSXtW5AtfDDhTVS13pTt.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10413,"title":"Nowhere to Run","description":"Escaped convict Sam Gillen single-handedly takes on ruthless developers who are determined to evict a widow with two young children.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Action","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1993-01-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5VF6N8dPSSPeyQdQoQ53mxDcUjw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a2FGbyzk2dTAlu37iGeQBbUjLLE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5VF6N