ntasy"],"release_date":"2018-10-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/x04SgdgxFGeNk2SLUnv9aXEuzQT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8WTEFOwFBx0mHurnEfv27I0FOe2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//x04SgdgxFGeNk2SLUnv9aXEuzQT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8WTEFOwFBx0mHurnEfv27I0FOe2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":401545,"title":"Everybody Knows","description":"Laura, a Spanish woman living in Buenos Aires, returns to her hometown outside Madrid with her Argentinian husband and children. However, the trip is upset by unexpected events that bring secrets into the open.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Crime","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2018-05-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gJqQxpe03aIRZZjy8A4nbLtBpch.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1TuuM451os3NaltCwGfPCVL2BST.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gJqQxpe03aIRZZjy8A4nbLtBpch.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1TuuM451os3NaltCwGfPCVL2BST.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":270479,"title":"Ammutta Muddica al Cinema","description":"Film adaptation of the theatrical show Ammutta muddica performed by the trio composed of Aldo, Giovanni and Giacomo. The protagonist of the various sketches is the common everyday life, full of bizarre characters and comic situations.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2013-10-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kpD2d678E0gW2lw8iuziREtRCJ7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3T93MN5GKj0mcgYNFC57RuZIT8F.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kpD2d678E0gW2lw8iuziREtRCJ7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3T93MN5GKj0mcgYNFC57RuZIT8F.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":87499,"title":"The East","description":"An operative for an elite private intelligence firm finds her priorities irrevocably changed after she is tasked with infiltrating an anarchist group known for executing covert attacks upon major corporations.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2013-05-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kq99sRIMHlgIPHV8U4SHdWBZMRx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qTJPT1jFz94vSkmiHMUxQTfQsL7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kq99sRIMHlgIPHV8U4SHdWBZMRx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qTJPT1jFz94vSkmiHMUxQTfQsL7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":41154,"title":"Men in Black 3","description":"Agents J and K are back...in time. J has seen some inexplicable things in his 15 years with the Men in Black, but nothing, not even aliens, perplexes him as much as his wry, reticent partner. But when K''s life and the fate of the planet are put at stake, Agent J will have to travel back in time to put things right. J discovers that there are secrets to the universe that K never told him - secrets that will reveal themselves as he teams up with the young Agent K to save his partner, the agency, and the future of humankind.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Action","Comedy","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2012-05-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5AhpUb8CAP0jZ4Wrn7AsRUYjZxB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/90DdoEStzeObs96fsYf4GG544iN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5AhpUb8CAP0jZ4Wrn7AsRUYjZxB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//90DdoEStzeObs96fsYf4GG544iN.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":28932,"title":"F.I.S.T.","description":"Johnny Kovak joins the Teamsters trade-union in a local chapter in the 1930s and works his way up in the organization. As he climbs higher and higher his methods become more ruthless and finally senator Madison starts a campaign to find the truth about the alleged connections with the Mob.","duration":"2:25:00","genre":["D