.org/t/p/w342//pIFeu5gF7ofAxI9NqrWbJAjjKn6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":826510,"title":"Harold and the Purple Crayon","description":"Inside of his book, adventurous Harold can make anything come to life simply by drawing it. After he grows up and draws himself off the book''s pages and into the physical world, Harold finds he has a lot to learn about real life.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Family","Comedy","Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2024-07-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/biMJPdS7bGW7HQTQrHvXxMqOqdC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qtW6bWUEqfPLaD6KnetIlSG4adf.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//biMJPdS7bGW7HQTQrHvXxMqOqdC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qtW6bWUEqfPLaD6KnetIlSG4adf.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":300693,"title":"Truth","description":"As a renowned producer and close associate of Dan Rather, Mary Mapes believes she’s broken the biggest story of the 2004 election: revelations of a sitting U.S. President’s military service. But when allegations come pouring in, sources change their stories, document authenticity is questioned, and the casualties begin to mount.","duration":"2:05:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2015-10-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3jEuzzKf95v5e4GdTouBpyl6Dc9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qmpMRABYbQjgtxwJ6xMPc8KskzA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3jEuzzKf95v5e4GdTouBpyl6Dc9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qmpMRABYbQjgtxwJ6xMPc8KskzA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":245700,"title":"Mr. Turner","description":"Eccentric British painter J.M.W. Turner  lives his last 25 years with gusto and secretly becomes involved with a seaside landlady, while his faithful housekeeper bears an unrequited love for him.","duration":"2:30:00","genre":["History","Drama"],"release_date":"2014-10-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/74IaLYwgko2nTLj8Gz9ukQ4RIvC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rnVhl1PFSOoW5c6UhZJZt5TV98p.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//74IaLYwgko2nTLj8Gz9ukQ4RIvC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rnVhl1PFSOoW5c6UhZJZt5TV98p.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":48289,"title":"The Debt","description":"Rachel Singer is a former Mossad agent who tried to capture a notorious Nazi war criminal – the Surgeon of Birkenau – in a secret Israeli mission that ended with his death on the streets of East Berlin. Now, 30 years later, a man claiming to be the doctor has surfaced, and Rachel must return to Eastern Europe to uncover the truth. Overwhelmed by haunting memories of her younger self and her two fellow agents, the still-celebrated heroine must relive the trauma of those events and confront the debt she has incurred.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2010-09-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zKK43d0ilNFmhmLUARWow5WlHVr.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zlavkPAIzIIQppcU9vcQrKZjfmb.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zKK43d0ilNFmhmLUARWow5WlHVr.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zlavkPAIzIIQppcU9vcQrKZjfmb.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":20024,"title":"The End of the Affair","description":"On a rainy London night in 1946, novelist Maurice Bendrix has a chance meeting with Henry Miles, husband of his ex-mistress Sarah, who abruptly ended their affair two years before. Bendrix''s obsession with Sarah is rekindled; he succumbs to his own jealousy and arranges to have her followed.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"1999-12-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hO1UwCPxI5tpz21hzITij3DPwFY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xTp5cyp6qG0YTdI4AEz4ytjODOQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"http