ung woman discovers the widow might not be all that she seems.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Mystery","Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"2019-02-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/n67gpLtNFXqpGkM2ZdQoPLjTnI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9hBpFyJ3pGdupXbaC2L7nGvLMBn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//n67gpLtNFXqpGkM2ZdQoPLjTnI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9hBpFyJ3pGdupXbaC2L7nGvLMBn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":270946,"title":"Penguins of Madagascar","description":"Skipper, Kowalski, Rico and Private join forces with undercover organization The North Wind to stop the villainous Dr. Octavius Brine from destroying the world as we know it.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Family","Animation","Adventure","Comedy"],"release_date":"2014-11-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/msnknPOg9dx86b0YozXOFP8PgBI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dXbpNrPDZDMEbujFoOxmMNQVMHa.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//msnknPOg9dx86b0YozXOFP8PgBI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dXbpNrPDZDMEbujFoOxmMNQVMHa.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":125521,"title":"Slayers Return","description":"Lina Inverse and Naga the White Serpent are back! What begins as a routine bandit-stomping turns into the adventure of a lifetime involving magical golems, an ancient Elven weapon and even someone bent on destroying the world. It''s a predicament only Lina and Naga could get themselves in to.","duration":"1:00:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1996-08-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1SeydkGlChbUrYJeV95TNSLQsFt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fNQx9YD4nxpcWvriVm1paIxbMwB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1SeydkGlChbUrYJeV95TNSLQsFt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fNQx9YD4nxpcWvriVm1paIxbMwB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":88557,"title":"Pokémon the Movie: White - Victini and Zekrom","description":"The Kingdom of the People of the Earth once ruled over the land, but now all that remains is the Sword of the Earth. in the city of Eindoak. Satoshi, Iris, and Dent arrive in Eindoak during a harvest festival''s Pokémon Tournament and meet the legendary Pokémon Victini who wishes to share its powers of victory to someone. Elsewhere in the city, a descendant of the People of the Earth named Dred Grangil has arrived who seeks to revive the kingdom''s power with the Sword of the Earth, bringing them back into power over the land, and Satoshi and his friends must stop him before he destroys the land along with Victini.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2011-07-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zpD9VRmZ1Zv7ZMsrNmutRrt0LZU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/J5AsLGUAqMgq0MjoyWldqqMPs1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zpD9VRmZ1Zv7ZMsrNmutRrt0LZU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//J5AsLGUAqMgq0MjoyWldqqMPs1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":75674,"title":"Act of Valor","description":"When a covert mission to rescue a kidnapped CIA operative uncovers a chilling plot, an elite, highly trained U.S. SEAL team speeds to hotspots around the globe, racing against the clock to stop a deadly terrorist attack.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","War"],"release_date":"2012-02-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bHefJgSTO3JOZy9fETN6cWpvbMX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1Xcd5ci69pVXMPP02DU11Ffq0yY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bHefJgSTO3JOZy9fETN6cWpvbMX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1Xcd5ci69pVXMPP02DU11Ffq0yY.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12109,"title":"It''s All Gone Pete Tong","description":"A comedy following the tragic life of the legendary Frankie Wilde. The story takes us through Frankie''s life from being one of the best DJs alive, through a subsequent battle with a hearing disorder, culminating in his mysterious disappearance from the scene.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Music"],"release_date":"2004-09-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/o3prcL5cI97VFmhN6yVDgnulz8R.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4AvbVwbejmSMKGEdLmVYDLAss1i.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//o3prcL5cI97VFmhN6yVDgnulz8R.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4AvbVwbejmSMKGEdLmVYDLAss1i.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12079,"title":"Spun","description":"Over the course of three days Ross, a college dropout addicted to crystal-meth, encounters a variety of oddball folks - including a stripper named Nikki and her boyfriend, the local meth producer, The Cook - but all he really wants to do is hook up with his old girlfriend, Amy.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2003-02-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/57CjdO0N8erYJq234HCyYwkhq5K.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jiwNobUsd29ooowQyTeh0cvPBFL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//57CjdO0N8erYJq234HCyYwkhq5K.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jiwNobUsd29ooowQyTeh0cvPBFL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10650,"title":"Sudden Impact","description":"When a young rape victim takes justice into her own hands and becomes a serial killer, it''s up to Dirty Harry Callahan, on suspension from the SFPD, to bring her to justice.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Thriller","Crime","Action","Drama"],"release_date":"1983-12-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vjA6MbA8aI4A3GSN1wWSsi9OGNl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fSADY