th a CIA operative to aid Afghan mujahideen rebels fighting the Soviets.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","History"],"release_date":"2007-12-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7k6VuqGQsAgxJBtnLiGOTtkznRU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/45FghqcdSYRWK7PsHUInaFPNd8l.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7k6VuqGQsAgxJBtnLiGOTtkznRU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//45FghqcdSYRWK7PsHUInaFPNd8l.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5486,"title":"A Bay of Blood","description":"An elderly heiress is killed by her husband who wants control of her fortunes. What ensues is an all-out murder spree as relatives and friends attempt to reduce the inheritance playing field, complicated by some teenagers who decide to camp out in a dilapidated building on the estate.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Horror","Thriller"],"release_date":"1971-09-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2E2tfSguMHWrzbc29j1yKWifKDv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cTqmAcZwaEY609QDCLpgBlwijn9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2E2tfSguMHWrzbc29j1yKWifKDv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cTqmAcZwaEY609QDCLpgBlwijn9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":699,"title":"For Your Eyes Only","description":"A British spy ship has sunk and on board was a hi-tech encryption device. James Bond is sent to find the device that holds British launching instructions before the enemy Soviets get to it first.","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["Adventure","Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"1981-06-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/z7Jp7HAsY7MqXzPYzTjJnmOQk2r.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xV4Nnr6DjjERlqNikqDQX8LUgua.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//z7Jp7HAsY7MqXzPYzTjJnmOQk2r.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xV4N