 an elite group of assassins, Bishop may be the best in the business - with a unique talent for cleanly eliminating targets. When Harry McKenna, his close friend and mentor, is murdered, Harry''s son comes to him with vengeance in his heart and a desire to learn Bishop''s trade, signaling the birth of a deadly partnership.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2011-01-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dYb6kgvoGjUH59n2uB4eV9xqmKR.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/k37axEHszFP9WOVvbozxF0r7X7g.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dYb6kgvoGjUH59n2uB4eV9xqmKR.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//k37axEHszFP9WOVvbozxF0r7X7g.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":17689,"title":"The Gauntlet","description":"Phoenix cop Ben Shockley is well on his way to becoming a derelict when he is assigned to transport a witness from Las Vegas. The witness turns out to be a belligerent prostitute with mob ties—and incriminating information regarding a high-ranking official.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Drama","Action","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"1977-12-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rkTCdSSwFQsTyZi5Z25XWQlNS97.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hYXkHixmH2W4hXA0qVJpT4ONPt1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rkTCdSSwFQsTyZi5Z25XWQlNS97.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hYXkHixmH2W4hXA0qVJpT4ONPt1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":16550,"title":"Storytelling","description":"College and high school serve as the backdrop for two stories about dysfunction and personal turmoil.","duration":"1:27:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2001-11-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oYUOT1Ijrpy5cDcyNdlQw1sTfvY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5hSpaT8x0LQy7G5TXb6vGWQrRSU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oYUOT1Ijrpy5cDcyNdlQw1sTfvY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5hSpaT8x0LQy7G5TXb6vGWQrRSU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":450001,"title":"Master Z: Ip Man Legacy","description":"Following his defeat by Master Ip, Cheung Tin Chi tries to make a life with his young son in Hong Kong, waiting tables at a bar that caters to expats. But it''s not long before the mix of foreigners, money, and triad leaders draw him once again to the fight.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2018-12-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eLhiX8PNCDiIe36WFz0mkIY3vxX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6VxEvOF7QDovsG6ro9OVyjH07LF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eLhiX8PNCDiIe36WFz0mkIY3vxX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6VxEvOF7QDovsG6ro9OVyjH07LF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":440626,"title":"Sobibor","description":"The film is based on a real story that happened in 1943 in the Sobibor concentration camp in German-occupied Poland. The main character of the movie is the Soviet-Jewish soldier Alexander Pechersky, who at that time was serving in the Red Army as a lieutenant. In October 1943, he was captured by the Nazis and deported to the Sobibor concentration camp, where Jews were being exterminated in gas chambers. But, in just 3 weeks, Alexander was able to plan an international uprising of prisoners from Poland and Western Europe. This uprising resulted in being the only successful one throughout the war, which led to the largest escape of prisoners from a Nazi concentration camp.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["War","Drama"],"release_date":"2018-05-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zjVz2XCXKwb0FX8qge1LbTd80H.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dnexT2if0lRTp8jsGSOY4JVAnnj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zjVz2XCXKwb0FX8