nals fight for their lives, including the gladiator-style The Running Man, hosted by the ruthless Damon Killian, where “runners” attempt to evade “stalkers” and certain death for a chance to be pardoned and set free.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1987-11-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ssQ7IcGmgUJdFLv8cHY3vC3OR4f.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/GTAUOhO4BN0peJVvxGEQydJvUO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ssQ7IcGmgUJdFLv8cHY3vC3OR4f.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//GTAUOhO4BN0peJVvxGEQydJvUO.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":629017,"title":"Run Hide Fight","description":"A 17-year-old girl uses her wits, survival skills, and compassion to fight for her life, and those of her fellow classmates, against a group of live-streaming school shooters.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2021-06-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hUfnYsVMmXcbcwzWHr62jTtpdkE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wlP25H14OvKoFORIwuKomZzioA5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hUfnYsVMmXcbcwzWHr62jTtpdkE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wlP25H14OvKoFORIwuKomZzioA5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":412656,"title":"Chaos Walking","description":"Two unlikely companions embark on a perilous adventure through the badlands of an unexplored planet as they try to escape a dangerous and disorienting reality, where all inner thoughts are seen and heard by everyone.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Fantasy","Science Fiction","Adventure"],"release_date":"2021-02-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qCPLtXrTB10UsgAFxsWOB44gDPu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xAYGdGBGptNkisXRpmhZSry6SPF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qCPLtXrTB10