s interested in the material except for Alonzo Hawk, a corrupt businessman who wants to steal the material for himself.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Comedy","Family","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1961-01-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lVceRZ2dc1XJQQBfLuwzhUWPhz1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gCnuDDqoyaBdeeItQ4BjKtYpzF6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lVceRZ2dc1XJQQBfLuwzhUWPhz1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gCnuDDqoyaBdeeItQ4BjKtYpzF6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11543,"title":"Kingpin","description":"After bowler Roy Munson swindles the wrong crowd and is left with a hook for a hand, he settles into impoverished obscurity. That is, until he uncovers the next big thing: an Amish kid named Ishmael. So, the corrupt and the hopelessly naive hit the circuit intent on settling an old score with Big Ern.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1996-07-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/t8HtbS9tWWUbqI5J7hIYCspgkGI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lVpejjxzBujSjLpxQ7hGe1s0wP2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//t8HtbS9tWWUbqI5J7hIYCspgkGI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lVpejjxzBujSjLpxQ7hGe1s0wP2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":6069,"title":"The Witches of Eastwick","description":"Three single women in a picturesque village have their wishes granted, at a cost, when a mysterious and flamboyant man arrives in their lives.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Comedy","Fantasy","Horror"],"release_date":"1987-06-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5xgtdWDqBhc2nD5e6zlgyjeQ6XD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/p5OivnZuXfy5E3BKKFIeSidmwys.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5xgtdWDqBhc2nD5e6zlgyjeQ6XD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/