ted to the poacher’s whereabouts, the warden and the poacher team up to fight back and escape across the treacherous lake before the ice melts.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2025-10-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gQimJqYMKCkwHIo8wwYKhmnCfBr.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5Byv6nznAb2Izd0gHpODOXnuSbo.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gQimJqYMKCkwHIo8wwYKhmnCfBr.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5Byv6nznAb2Izd0gHpODOXnuSbo.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":594718,"title":"Sputnik","description":"At the height of the Cold War, a Soviet spacecraft crash lands after a mission gone awry, leaving the commander as its only survivor. After a renowned Russian psychologist is brought in to evaluate the commander’s mental state, it becomes clear that something dangerous may have come back to Earth with him…","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Drama","Horror"],"release_date":"2020-07-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/90Hjx5iXwNRIqm3MvgYMKNuHoQe.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eAUzmhP54bE1vPXaY7FbuZREJlR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//90Hjx5iXwNRIqm3MvgYMKNuHoQe.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eAUzmhP54bE1vPXaY7FbuZREJlR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":392794,"title":"The Dancer","description":"A young woman from the American Midwest, Loïe Fuller became the toast of the Folies Bergère at the turn of the 20th century and an icon of the Belle Epoque. Inventor of the breathtaking Serpentine Dance, she was a pioneer of modern dance and lighting techniques. It was her complicated relationship to her protégé - Isadora Duncan – that precipitated the downfall of this early 20th century icon.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2016-09-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_an