en an eerie children''s book manifests in their home.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Drama","Horror"],"release_date":"2014-05-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/t18ocAG0cpgC1AP288SseqmXqB5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qt3fqapeo94TfvMyld8P7gkpXLz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//t18ocAG0cpgC1AP288SseqmXqB5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qt3fqapeo94TfvMyld8P7gkpXLz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":136400,"title":"2 Guns","description":"A DEA agent and an undercover Naval Intelligence officer who have been tasked with investigating one another find they have been set up by the mob -- the very organization the two men believe they have been stealing money from.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Action","Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"2013-08-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/swyPgOP2lffHfMjeZKNnNFR9P88.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ptURGAFktibhk7DEAbMazlmNqWa.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//swyPgOP2lffHfMjeZKNnNFR9P88.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ptURGAFktibhk7DEAbMazlmNqWa.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":75948,"title":"The Sorcerer and the White Snake","description":"The Sorcerer and the White Snake is an ancient Chinese fable about a woman demon who falls in love with a mortal is brought to life through the latest advances in CGI and action techniques.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Action","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2011-09-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oIXnmpQXADWUF8JXSjKNlSw78qk.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5Jfv3CtMULd41C5jpLR8PGAMgE3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oIXnmpQXADWUF8JXSjKNlSw78qk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5Jfv3CtMULd41C5jpLR8PGAMgE3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":72197,"title":"The Pirates! In an Adventure with 