al guides for the future, the Gen-X quartet soon begins to realize that reality isn''t all it''s cracked up to be.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"1994-02-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wPW1cMe2XyeLnm2DNDudoDXVSwt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qGDhodtpkpxkrFqokenGNJlzt6w.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wPW1cMe2XyeLnm2DNDudoDXVSwt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qGDhodtpkpxkrFqokenGNJlzt6w.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":481157,"title":"In Her Hands","description":"A young man from a modest family gets the chance of a lifetime to reveal his hidden talent for piano but can he find the strength and courage to live up to the challenge?","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2018-12-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dss5tC7D0tqQT3A2oTp9U3SVgp5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bBr8agu2JGoRb4Ztfzuk23B1wRj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dss5tC7D0tqQT3A2oTp9U3SVgp5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bBr8agu2JGoRb4Ztfzuk23B1wRj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":348672,"title":"About Endlessness","description":"A reflection on human life in all its beauty and cruelty, its splendor and banality, guided by a Scheherazade-esque narrator. Inconsequential moments have the same significance as historical events. Simultaneously an ode and a lament, presents a kaleidoscope of all that is eternally human, an infinite story of the vulnerability of existence.","duration":"1:16:00","genre":["Drama","Fantasy","Comedy"],"release_date":"2019-11-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sP3TdFwhwLbodffXDfZvybyUdCc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fRIBlFJiMNm7DkphQgcHgDS2Pvx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sP3TdFwhwLbodffXDfZvybyUdCc.jp