 by her husband, George, that they should stop to meet his family in North Carolina. Madeleine''s affluent lifestyle clashes with the family, but she befriends George''s wide-eyed and pregnant sister-in-law, Ashley, who is nearing her due date. Through the family, Madeleine gains greater insight into George''s character.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2005-08-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bgglizDnM6MFm0F216VI7l0SoyJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/asC6UOPrR6OlNMiyXbeXWu08SOG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bgglizDnM6MFm0F216VI7l0SoyJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//asC6UOPrR6OlNMiyXbeXWu08SOG.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":623520,"title":"Z","description":"A family find themselves terrorized by their eight-year-old son''s imaginary friend.","duration":"1:23:00","genre":["Horror","Thriller"],"release_date":"2019-09-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/f7x2aH3C6u6fgpKqqXZ5mCdihaf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5kFQrl8fCIrQEXqFUc6bBUylrFs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//f7x2aH3C6u6fgpKqqXZ5mCdihaf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5kFQrl8fCIrQEXqFUc6bBUylrFs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":45132,"title":"Super","description":"After his wife falls under the influence of a drug dealer, an everyday guy transforms himself into Crimson Bolt, a superhero with the best intentions, though he lacks for heroic skills.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Comedy","Action","Drama"],"release_date":"2010-11-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5OGrBmi0fWAE6b1R6uv5EnuWOaL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jZrRMGSajZQehg8mz74A5A00L3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5OGrBmi0fWAE6b1R6uv5EnuWOaL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jZrR