ngerous mountain road, the Englishman decides to dole out some bodily harm of his own.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1999-10-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mKm56aTBr34ciZTpTWX6WoPubUY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/efAnFInZYrenNvBlLIXN2oLYyNc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mKm56aTBr34ciZTpTWX6WoPubUY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//efAnFInZYrenNvBlLIXN2oLYyNc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":584,"title":"2 Fast 2 Furious","description":"It''s a major double-cross when former police officer Brian O''Conner teams up with his ex-con buddy Roman Pearce to transport a shipment of \"dirty\" money for shady Miami-based import-export dealer Carter Verone. But the guys are actually working with undercover agent Monica Fuentes to bring Verone down.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2003-06-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/90ooE5SbUEO0OVJHewNO7pgySb6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6nDZExrDKIXvSAghsFKVFRVJuSf.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//90ooE5SbUEO0OVJHewNO7pgySb6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6nDZExrDKIXvSAghsFKVFRVJuSf.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":635744,"title":"Jarhead: Law of Return","description":"Major Ronan Jackson, an accomplished fighter pilot for the Israel Defense Forces and son of a U.S. Senator, is shot down while flying through Syrian airspace. After miraculously surviving the crash, Jackson is taken captive by a group of Hezbollah militiamen. A squad of elite soldiers, led by Gunnery Sergeant Dave Torres, risk their own lives in the hopes of saving an ally they''ve never met.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["War"],"release_date":"2019-10-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kTtBDUeDZATzrTUlqHUG0ZWjg9m.jpg","poster_path":"