rns, unearthing evidence of the occult, Harker discovers a personal connection to the merciless killer and must race against time to stop him before he claims the lives of another innocent family.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Crime","Horror","Mystery"],"release_date":"2024-07-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6ToGkmqn0KG0UGGGUAC1Ww0e5CM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1EwNyiiNFd863H4e8nWEzutnZD7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6ToGkmqn0KG0UGGGUAC1Ww0e5CM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1EwNyiiNFd863H4e8nWEzutnZD7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":27854,"title":"For Whom the Bell Tolls","description":"Spain in the 1930s is the place to be for a man of action like Robert Jordan. There is a civil war going on and Jordan—who has joined up on the side that appeals most to idealists of that era—has been given a high-risk assignment up in the mountains. He awaits the right time to blow up a crucial bridge in order to halt the enemy''s progress.","duration":"2:50:00","genre":["War","Romance","History","Drama","Adventure"],"release_date":"1943-07-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pzLZHOPZPy3aBmakttW5Mo6M76V.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uoNTHrpeOgIuWsC5Eucx5Sp483D.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pzLZHOPZPy3aBmakttW5Mo6M76V.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uoNTHrpeOgIuWsC5Eucx5Sp483D.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9535,"title":"Analyze This","description":"Countless wiseguy films are spoofed in this film that centers on the neuroses and angst of a powerful Mafia racketeer who suffers from panic attacks. When Paul Vitti needs help dealing with his role in the \"family,\" unlucky shrink Dr. Ben Sobel is given just days to resolve Vitti''s emotional crisis and turn him into a happy, well-adjusted gangster.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime"],"release_