over what really happened out there.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2003-04-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nbQccqxcpAV1dwofccLeM3c6qzn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jtyF4NF9fQlyGP8cgU1mK3DLUTB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nbQccqxcpAV1dwofccLeM3c6qzn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jtyF4NF9fQlyGP8cgU1mK3DLUTB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9779,"title":"The Sisterhood of the Traveling Pants","description":"Four best friends (Tibby, Lena, Carmen &amp; Bridget) who buy a mysterious pair of pants that fits each of them, despite their differing sizes, and makes whoever wears them feel fabulous. When faced with the prospect of spending their first summer apart, the pals decide they''ll swap the pants so that each girl in turn can enjoy the magic.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2005-06-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2WackFzjJHGa1Fd2dZJu4VIQMdU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wNshlUT6IZEz2AF3iZrlb2mX0pR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2WackFzjJHGa1Fd2dZJu4VIQMdU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wNshlUT6IZEz2AF3iZrlb2mX0pR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8765,"title":"Nirvana","description":"Jimi, a computer game designer, finds that his latest product has been infected by a virus which has given consciousness to the main character of the game, Solo. Tormented by the memory of his fled girlfriend Lisa and begged by Solo to end its useless \"life\", Jimi begins a search for people who can help him both to discover what happened to Lisa and to delete his game before it is released.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Thriller","Action","Drama"],"release_date":"1997-01-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6MIcir1IlXCCLGfyg1V