e and Harry Monroe have no jobs and no prospects, so they decide to flee the city and find work elsewhere, landing jobs wearing woodpecker costumes to promote the opening of a bank. When their feathery costumes are stolen and used in a bank robbery, they no longer have to worry about employment — they''re sent to prison.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"1980-12-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/33ToWRPVOnrx6GKXHZMNUE3ulLW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ehCdQewg9SxjhnimJrKwNKbr80C.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//33ToWRPVOnrx6GKXHZMNUE3ulLW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ehCdQewg9SxjhnimJrKwNKbr80C.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10818,"title":"Water Lilies","description":"Set during a sultry summer in a French suburb, Marie is desperate to join the local pool''s synchronized swimming team, but is her interest solely for the sake of sport or for a chance to get close to Floriane, the bad girl of the team? Sciamma, and the two leads, capture the uncertainty of teenage sexuality with a sympathetic eye in this delicate drama of the angst of coming-of-age.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2007-05-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/an06c8GBu9W55aU3UTUSBKxKBFu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oNrs9disgGDtOORToDt5dIqYFBi.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//an06c8GBu9W55aU3UTUSBKxKBFu.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oNrs9disgGDtOORToDt5dIqYFBi.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10354,"title":"True Crime","description":"Boozer, skirt chaser, careless father. You could create your own list of reporter Steve Everett''s faults but there''s no time. A San Quentin Death Row prisoner is slated to die at midnight – a man Everett has suddenly realized is innocent.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller","M