ckdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/19B3vwsPwLzHvSAo9uxC70QEkqW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7kNcpmP1Pe9fWLKEbEOX5GEWueC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//19B3vwsPwLzHvSAo9uxC70QEkqW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7kNcpmP1Pe9fWLKEbEOX5GEWueC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":96599,"title":"Eden","description":"After a night out with friends, Hyun Jae accepts a late night ride home from a young fire fighter. What begins as a night of promise quickly turns into a nightmare when she is abducted and imprisoned outside Las Vegas as a sex slave.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"2013-03-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/phUPfeWUxoaW5AylEby4kcuva1r.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6MWSeVg9KESHpS3wXz4uwSlpd3f.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//phUPfeWUxoaW5AylEby4kcuva1r.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6MWSeVg9KESHpS3wXz4uwSlpd3f.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":24808,"title":"Something Wicked This Way Comes","description":"In a small American town, a diabolical circus arrives, granting wishes for the townsfolk, but twisted as only the esteemed Mr. Dark can make them. Can two young boys overcome the worst the devil himself can deal out?","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Fantasy","Mystery","Horror"],"release_date":"1983-04-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/28BYjdzw6nJjFMIKjfUu1JA6tNC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/94dMO6kAawyFUk0sCDGIjAnchED.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//28BYjdzw6nJjFMIKjfUu1JA6tNC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//94dMO6kAawyFUk0sCDGIjAnchED.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":18405,"title":"The Last House on the Left","description":"When athletic teen Mari Collingwood opts to hang out with her friend Paige in town rather than spend an evening in with her parents vacationing at the family''s remote lake house, it marks the beginning of a night no one is going to forget.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller","Horror","Drama"],"release_date":"2009-03-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/114yPZmKgsQVTSt0BDx5WagBOvW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2Y35XCUS8U8vC8vs0HDEVkPu1BM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//114yPZmKgsQVTSt0BDx5WagBOvW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2Y35XCUS8U8vC8vs0HDEVkPu1BM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14484,"title":"Body Shots","description":"The Los Angeles club scene is a place of booze-fueled decadence and debauchery. In a night full of possibilities, eight 20-somethings take to the clubs seeking good times, companionship and maybe a little sex. But in the harsh light of the morning after, their worlds are thrown into a spin of confusion when hungover Sara accuses hard-partying Mike of date rape. Loyalties are tested as each among them is forced to take sides.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1999-10-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3wuouE2sw2ezhiuqF7SpAyLZB3s.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kusTc8rcKscsMapZL5zN1XZd0Nf.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3wuouE2sw2ezhiuqF7SpAyLZB3s.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kusTc8rcKscsMapZL5zN1XZd0Nf.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13062,"title":"Boundin''","description":"On a high mountain plain lives a lamb with wool of such remarkable sheen that he breaks into high-steppin'' dance. But there comes a day when he loses his lustrous coat and, along with it, his pride. It takes a wise jackalope - a horn-adorned rabbit - to teach the moping lamb that wooly or not, it''s what''s inside that''ll help him rebound from life''s troubles.","duration":"0:05:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Music"],"release_date":"2003-11-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/creJJVuDkR0MI240P9U3eTrcQkf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bQBFIwb77jrsXiH7TQVFu7onwN7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//creJJVuDkR0MI240P9U3eTrcQkf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bQBFIwb77jrsXiH7TQVFu7onwN7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9870,"title":"Forgetting Sarah Marshall","description":"When actress Sarah Marshall dumps aspiring musician Peter Bretter for rock star Aldous Snow, Peter''s world comes crashing down. His best friend Brian suggests that Peter should get away from everything and to fly off to Hawaii to escape all his problems. After arriving in Hawaii and meeting the beautiful receptionist Rachel Jansen, Peter is shocked to see not only Aldous in Hawaii, but also Sarah.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2008-04-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/s39aQY3dK1s6ARrUKP5yeq824nR.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/d4elOzyhNWVlxpG7BwigrumkFTe.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//s39aQY3dK1s6ARrUKP5yeq824nR.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//d4elOzyhNWVlxpG7BwigrumkFTe.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8224,"title":"8MM","description":"A small, seemingly innocuous plastic reel of film leads surveillance specialist Tom Welles down an increasingly dark and frightening path. With the help of the streetwise Max, he relentlessly follows a bizarre trail of evidence to determine the fate of a complete stranger. As his work turns into obsession, he drifts farther and farther away from his wife, family and simple life as a small-town PI.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Thriller","Crime","Mystery"],"release_date":"1999-02-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eEP8pyCmldfbnml0SFMvPK7kE4x.jpg","poster_path":"https://ima