American settler kills his family''s murderer which unleashes the fury of a notorious gang leader. His cowardly fellow townspeople then betray him, forcing him to hunt down the outlaws alone.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Drama","Western"],"release_date":"2014-05-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iXQNyhk1rFtFd9Fo9gUYiw9hlv0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xQsv3OI8UT6s9Rn3C0WxO24bnEx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iXQNyhk1rFtFd9Fo9gUYiw9hlv0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xQsv3OI8UT6s9Rn3C0WxO24bnEx.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":34016,"title":"She''s Out of My League","description":"When he starts dating drop-dead gorgeous Molly, insecure airport security agent Kirk can''t believe it. As his friends and family share their doubts about the relationship lasting, Kirk does everything he can to avoid losing Molly forever.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"2010-03-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/i80wifLk9w3q4Pq9UOPlfrsjKY1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mpYHjyPX0DAxbsnWKmSK5jZ1s4T.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//i80wifLk9w3q4Pq9UOPlfrsjKY1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mpYHjyPX0DAxbsnWKmSK5jZ1s4T.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":20943,"title":"The Ugly Truth","description":"A romantically challenged morning show producer is reluctantly embroiled in a series of outrageous tests by her chauvinistic correspondent to prove his theories on relationships and help her find love. His clever ploys, however, lead to an unexpected result.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2009-07-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/75nC94NsD3PWGJ2JhQivnF6eBOM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2rq96Ihbqb1eU3TEBVtgFlqbeX7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"htt