uration":"1:43:00","genre":["Action","Fantasy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2020-12-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8tNX8s3j1O0eqilOQkuroRLyOZA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1UCOF11QCw8kcqvce8LKOO6pimh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8tNX8s3j1O0eqilOQkuroRLyOZA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1UCOF11QCw8kcqvce8LKOO6pimh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":392207,"title":"The Invisible Guardian","description":"When the naked body of a teenage girl is found on the banks of the River Baztán, it is quickly linked to a similar murder one month before. Soon, rumours are flying in the nearby village of Elizondo. Is this the work of a ritualistic killer or is it the basajaun, the ‘invisible guardian’ of Basque mythology?  Inspector Amaia Salazar leads the investigation, taking her back to the heart of the Basque country where she was born, and where she hoped never to return. Shrouded in mist and surrounded by impenetrable forests, it is a place of unresolved conflicts and a terrible secret from Amaia’s childhood that will come back to haunt her.  Faced with the superstitions of the village, Amaia must fight the demons of her past to confront the reality of a serial killer on the loose. But as she is drawn deeper into the investigation, she feels the presence of something darker lurking in the shadows…","duration":"2:09:00","genre":["Thriller","Crime","Mystery"],"release_date":"2017-03-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/60XJOemSR9LQRDgBMRN7qkdLsPH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uxR7CqLRdQ2QuOPP9ymunPrRBCq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//60XJOemSR9LQRDgBMRN7qkdLsPH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uxR7CqLRdQ2QuOPP9ymunPrRBCq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":172386,"title":"Return to Nim''s Island","description":"Fourteen year old Nim, more determined than ever to protect her island and all the wildlife that call it home, faces off against resort developers and animal poachers. Soon she realizes she can’t depend on her animal cohorts alone and must make her first human friend – Edmund, who’s run away to the island from the mainland – to save her home.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Family","Adventure"],"release_date":"2013-03-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/auLEgC09Pvwkzul8lwEkcWnlSC2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9LPDKDZQyGlQQphTna5kRHe4nrE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//auLEgC09Pvwkzul8lwEkcWnlSC2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9LPDKDZQyGlQQphTna5kRHe4nrE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":76338,"title":"Thor: The Dark World","description":"Thor fights to restore order across the cosmos… but an ancient race led by the vengeful Malekith returns to plunge the universe back into darkness. Faced with an enemy that even Odin and Asgard cannot withstand, Thor must embark on his most perilous and personal journey yet, one that will reunite him with Jane Foster and force him to sacrifice everything to save us all.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2013-10-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5o88bbqcV5STn56jqOeovaaWbAE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wp6OxE4poJ4G7c0U2ZIXasTSMR7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5o88bbqcV5STn56jqOeovaaWbAE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wp6OxE4poJ4G7c0U2ZIXasTSMR7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":26177,"title":"Annie","description":"Things seem pretty bad for a young girl living a \"hard-knock life\" in an orphanage. Fed up with the dastardly Miss Hannigan, Annie escapes the run-down orphanage determined to find her mom and dad. It''s an adventure that takes her from the cold, mean streets of New York to the warm, comforting arms of bighearted billionaire Oliver Warbucks - with plenty of mischief and music in between.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Music","Family","Comedy"],"release_date":"1999-11-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xXbEXEYJrEcMJ4RKbTeLtrlCMl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/y0XWZC1A7PbWf1gwmvbvhY9uWM2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xXbEXEYJrEcMJ4RKbTeLtrlCMl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//y0XWZC1A7PbWf1gwmvbvhY9uWM2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":19124,"title":"Blind Fury","description":"A blind Vietnam vet, trained as a swordfighter, comes to America and helps to rescue the son of a fellow soldier.","duration":"1:26:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"1989-08-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fa8kC5StEx4Ne78McOMEwlzyDnS.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ufbA7v7b2xt85Cf1tocr69cwuCO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fa8kC5StEx4Ne78McOMEwlzyDnS.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ufbA7v7b2xt85Cf1tocr69cwuCO.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4141,"title":"Shoot ''Em Up","description":"A man named Mr. Smith delivers a woman''s baby during a shootout, and is then called upon to protect the newborn from the army of gunmen.","duration":"1:26:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"2007-07-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1bYY2WUsHyCl66gQAGoF40JIryW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hZ4p0MvSUWnCCL0IUn47UXTVPCs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1bYY2WUsHyCl66gQAGoF40JIryW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hZ4p0MvSUWnCCL0IUn47UXTVPCs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":960700,"title":"Fullmetal Alchemist: The Revenge of Scar","description":"The Elric brothers meet their toughest opponent yet — a lone serial killer with a large scar on his forehead.",