orpse with false papers off the coast of Spain would fool Nazi spies into believing the Allied forces were planning to attack by way of Greece rather than Sicily.","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["War","History","Drama"],"release_date":"2022-04-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oZtoyj3rhOST8FUtIXUqblIYmCv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tfdfh1mK24VujxT5z11732asxdR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oZtoyj3rhOST8FUtIXUqblIYmCv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tfdfh1mK24VujxT5z11732asxdR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":24122,"title":"The Rebound","description":"Upon discovering her husband''s infidelity, Sandy leaves the suburbs and moves into the city. There, she befriends Aram, a guy whose wife only married him so she could get a green card. Sandy hires Aram to be her nanny, and it isn''t long until Aram and Sandy find out they get along wonderfully and start to date. But is their relationship real or is it, in fact, just a rebound for both of them?","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"2009-09-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xoWErrVQWvkgi9jCUwUlRb5ZKnb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/j82RTG8dNyOYhIKspjk5Z0bEmdi.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xoWErrVQWvkgi9jCUwUlRb5ZKnb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//j82RTG8dNyOYhIKspjk5Z0bEmdi.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":18983,"title":"Godzilla, King of the Monsters!","description":"During an assignment, foreign correspondent Steve Martin spends a layover in Tokyo and is caught amid the rampage of an unstoppable prehistoric monster the Japanese call ''Godzilla''. The only hope for both Japan and the world lies on a secret weapon, which may prove more destructive than the monster itself.","duration":"1:21:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Horror"],"release_date":"1956-04-27","backdrop_path":"