th their lives in jeopardy, Emma Cullen and other desperate residents turn to bounty hunter Sam Chisolm for help. Chisolm recruits an eclectic group of gunslingers to take on Bogue and his ruthless henchmen. With a deadly showdown on the horizon, the seven mercenaries soon find themselves fighting for more than just money once the bullets start to fly.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Adventure","Action","Western"],"release_date":"2016-09-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4qxZJRYe4ezA5J1sidnV7vuaYaz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ezcS78TIjgr85pVdaPDd2rSPVNs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4qxZJRYe4ezA5J1sidnV7vuaYaz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ezcS78TIjgr85pVdaPDd2rSPVNs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":162282,"title":"A Perfect Family","description":"Leone is a rich and powerful man whose loneliness drives him to hire a cast of actors to play the family he never had. On Christmas Eve, reality and make-believe start to get blurred.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2012-11-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pNPYEC5hTUAQkzgDsnKu4ti4qaR.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tkmvXoqQnzqkF66315TrsjSDilG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pNPYEC5hTUAQkzgDsnKu4ti4qaR.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tkmvXoqQnzqkF66315TrsjSDilG.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":16186,"title":"Diary of a Mad Black Woman","description":"Charles, an attorney, and Helen, his devoted wife, seem to have everything – money, a beautiful mansion – the American Dream. However, as Helen prepares to celebrate their 18th wedding anniversary, her life takes an unexpected twist when she comes home to find her clothes packed up in a U-Haul van parked in the driveway. Charles is divorcing her and kicks her out. Helen moves in with her grandmother Madea, an old woman who doesn''t take any lip from anyone. Madea helps Helen through these tough times by showing her what is really important in life. Helen is forced to rediscover love, life, and religion in her pursuit for happiness.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"2005-02-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ds88sDzCE13ZmGBtCfPsltd9qC1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4w36ckDhsWFPD9XaHOOJb1ru7JZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ds88sDzCE13ZmGBtCfPsltd9qC1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4w36ckDhsWFPD9XaHOOJb1ru7JZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10576,"title":"Psycho II","description":"Norman Bates is declared sane and released from the facility in which he was being held, despite the complaints of Lila Loomis, sister of his most famous victim. Is he really cured, or will he kill again?","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Horror","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"1983-06-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6w4WKcZc0Qqi1fm9LfaIER7Hr0L.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sJAPRj3vHmjV4z97YK84iDovYlm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6w4WKcZc0Qqi1fm9LfaIER7Hr0L.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sJAPRj3vHmjV4z97YK84iDovYlm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1001835,"title":"Wifelike","description":"A grieving detective in the near-future hunts down criminals who trade artificial humans on the black market. In the fight to end AI exploitation, an underground resistance attempts to infiltrate him by sabotaging the programming of the artificial human assigned as his companion to behave like his late wife. She begins to question her reality as memories of a past life begin to surface in a world where nothing is as it seems.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2022-08-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600