lowing their entrenched British stuffiness out the window.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2008-11-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yxpWmblcrFeX0uLvDbLJYBJqYvy.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/k9bGewoi6SWPTFQfUbn6ve06TY9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yxpWmblcrFeX0uLvDbLJYBJqYvy.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//k9bGewoi6SWPTFQfUbn6ve06TY9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14462,"title":"The Manchurian Candidate","description":"Years after his squad was ambushed during the Gulf War, Major Ben Marco finds himself having terrible nightmares. He begins to doubt that his fellow squad-mate Sergeant Raymond Shaw, now a vice-presidential candidate, is the hero he remembers him being. As Marco''s doubts deepen, Shaw''s political power grows, and, when Marco finds a mysterious implant embedded in his back, the memory of what really happened begins to return.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama","Mystery"],"release_date":"2004-07-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/266RMJ7qurwYgnKmy8zuWN81e2D.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4xEWtEbKK2EXMZ8UPff8hDCSiVW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//266RMJ7qurwYgnKmy8zuWN81e2D.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4xEWtEbKK2EXMZ8UPff8hDCSiVW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12117,"title":"Instinct","description":"In a prison for the criminally insane, deranged anthropologist Ethan Powell is set to be examined by a bright young psychiatrist, Theo Caulder. Driven by ambition and a hunger for the truth, Caulder will eventually risk everything—even put his very life on the line—in a harrowing attempt to understand the bizarre actions of this madman.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1999-06-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uqa2PKpMzN