 the fate of the forest hanging in the balance.","duration":"1:20:00","genre":["Adventure","Fantasy","Animation","Science Fiction","Family"],"release_date":"2001-07-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lnwNzJdU4gMlgoQlaT8HgSI2OpD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/thz83PS9twtVBEEAM59J1bh75nU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lnwNzJdU4gMlgoQlaT8HgSI2OpD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//thz83PS9twtVBEEAM59J1bh75nU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10881,"title":"Avalon","description":"In a future world, young people are increasingly becoming addicted to an illegal (and potentially deadly) battle simulation game called Avalon. When Ash, a star player, hears of rumors that a more advanced level of the game exists somewhere, she gives up her loner ways and joins a gang of explorers. Even if she finds the gateway to the next level, will she ever be able to come back to reality?","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Action","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2001-01-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cf8qwkSTSuHrRH9yIKfM6QYoCtB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jg4lqIDSXXqPmmZyyAFdJ7bel8t.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cf8qwkSTSuHrRH9yIKfM6QYoCtB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jg4lqIDSXXqPmmZyyAFdJ7bel8t.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8346,"title":"My Big Fat Greek Wedding","description":"A young Greek woman falls in love with a non-Greek and struggles to get her family to accept him while she comes to terms with her heritage and cultural identity.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2002-04-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3d8Y4q172YFp2obUdfMjyErB7eU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ztc05ym0T3stnBpRHdxEs3Zwsmp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3d