ys.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2005-06-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/t5dM0pTUTZ8X3ubmUp3hOuOpdcO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uMb26IjDgdq8p4H3XNO1CAsjT4m.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//t5dM0pTUTZ8X3ubmUp3hOuOpdcO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uMb26IjDgdq8p4H3XNO1CAsjT4m.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":6947,"title":"The Village","description":"When a willful young man tries to venture beyond his sequestered Pennsylvania hamlet, his actions set off a chain of chilling incidents that will alter the community forever.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Drama","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2004-07-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lxwCRTWWfCisuarrFFUhW43eBnW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/v7UvYtKfIVaHLaHwVgfalyrK7Ho.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lxwCRTWWfCisuarrFFUhW43eBnW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//v7UvYtKfIVaHLaHwVgfalyrK7Ho.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2133,"title":"The Perfect Storm","description":"In October 1991, a confluence of weather conditions combined to form a killer storm in the North Atlantic. Caught in the storm was the sword-fishing boat Andrea Gail.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Drama","Adventure","Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2000-06-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tO1wEUOSmZLyttwkhOMzUxTiR7k.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vJPoxqgpfFNbGi0HyoNsjFeLCio.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tO1wEUOSmZLyttwkhOMzUxTiR7k.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vJPoxqgpfFNbGi0HyoNsjFeLCio.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":302,"title":"Swimming Pool","description":"A British crime novelist travels to her publisher''s upmarket summer house in Southern France to seek solitude in order to work on her next book. However, the unexpected arrival of the publisher''s daughter induces complications and a subsequent crime.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2003-05-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/q0kZOxL6OMSeDlT6SRNKCJYStlF.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/10xMAznUxI0LZPYyPxA9WjJsThr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//q0kZOxL6OMSeDlT6SRNKCJYStlF.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//10xMAznUxI0LZPYyPxA9WjJsThr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":807356,"title":"Watcher","description":"As a serial killer stalks the city, Julia — a young actress who just moved to town with her husband — notices a mysterious stranger watching her from across the street.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Horror","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2022-06-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2cQMVHBaP1wK0UBX5SGDahB3lp3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dXCjoI3jdtBrwPHgVsyNLkl8Rvs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2cQMVHBaP1wK0UBX5SGDahB3lp3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dXCjoI3jdtBrwPHgVsyNLkl8Rvs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":579047,"title":"Reminiscence","description":"Nicolas Bannister, a rugged and solitary veteran living in a near-future Miami flooded by rising seas, is an expert in a dangerous occupation: he offers clients the chance to relive any memory they desire. His life changes when he meets a mysterious young woman named Mae. What begins as a simple matter of lost and found becomes a passionate love affair. But when a different client''s memories implicate Mae in a series of violent crimes, Bannister must delve through the dark world of the past to uncover the truth about the woman he fell for.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Mystery","Science Fiction","Thriller"],"release_date":"2021-08-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p