ie","description":"Eliza and Debbie are two sisters who don''t always get along. But their relationship is put to the test when Debbie''s life is in danger, and Eliza might have to give up her power to talk to animals....","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Family","Comedy","Adventure","Animation"],"release_date":"2002-12-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xAsjesWKuxkMub8w8GRoMjZYRZm.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nmWpcUQtWHC4kjVCygiFEDR1wCY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xAsjesWKuxkMub8w8GRoMjZYRZm.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nmWpcUQtWHC4kjVCygiFEDR1wCY.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5653,"title":"Luther","description":"During the early 16th century, idealistic German monk Martin Luther, disgusted by the materialism in the church, begins the dialogue that will lead to the Protestant Reformation.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2003-10-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5tsQ6QrKa7to3S2DCosSOYrJ6OE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5Z3wlA8sKdd3tPTZW8N1q3YEd5f.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5tsQ6QrKa7to3S2DCosSOYrJ6OE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5Z3wlA8sKdd3tPTZW8N1q3YEd5f.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1139829,"title":"Orion and the Dark","description":"A boy with an active imagination faces his fears on an unforgettable journey through the night with his new friend: a giant, smiling creature named Dark.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Comedy","Fantasy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2024-02-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zLj0peaxy5y2SlC6wNIQ4V0pfqg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/N2ddXhBX5kqwA9flbm2yqFtX6b.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zLj0peaxy5y2SlC6wNIQ4V0pfqg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://i