spicion of the town''s doctor when his lab assistant is found dead from a case of acromegaly, which took only four days to develop.  As the doctor investigates, aided by the scientist''s new female assistant, they discover that something is devouring local cattle and humans in increasingly large quantities.","duration":"1:20:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Horror"],"release_date":"1955-10-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mJhEzR254JifF0wjKj48hcqabus.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4mFsbUObsmbTe0rZCXBFPLfDbRt.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mJhEzR254JifF0wjKj48hcqabus.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4mFsbUObsmbTe0rZCXBFPLfDbRt.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1907,"title":"The Beach","description":"Twenty-something Richard travels to Thailand and finds himself in possession of a strange map. Rumours state that it leads to a solitary beach paradise, a tropical bliss - excited and intrigued, he sets out to find it.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Drama","Adventure","Romance","Thriller"],"release_date":"2000-02-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/f7sQHmdZdPHaRVt3428XmdoZ8Hs.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4y7LxD8TSi6AtsM2xSYqUm1gu7u.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//f7sQHmdZdPHaRVt3428XmdoZ8Hs.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4y7LxD8TSi6AtsM2xSYqUm1gu7u.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":940139,"title":"Here","description":"An odyssey through time and memory, centered on a place in New Jersey where—from wilderness, and then, later, from a home—love, loss, struggle, hope and legacy play out between couples and families over generations.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2024-10-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zrms2WPltCxTPoiNFNPtTih6NMf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/79euHUJJtf