ung woman who dreams about a jaguar that licks her naked body and sleeps by her side. Her past is bathed in blood and weird passions. Now she''s met the man of her wildest dreams. He''s dark, tough and mysterious. He likes robbing banks, trafficking in corpses and spicing it all with voodoo rituals. Together, the duo sets off toward Mexico destined to become the most feared outlaws in the continent.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"1997-10-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kznmEv5dOczfbEw8ZC3KTpY4T5c.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/37oOHBE3bQUzKScnx9s9QhVLFXz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kznmEv5dOczfbEw8ZC3KTpY4T5c.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//37oOHBE3bQUzKScnx9s9QhVLFXz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9032,"title":"Big Daddy","description":"A lazy law school grad adopts a kid to impress his girlfriend, but everything doesn''t go as planned. Now he''s forced to grow up while navigating the challenges of fatherhood.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1999-06-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fl3no3IMXGjZAUa2iU9aBzlid5m.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lEYg1X8RjqNB5NWEtodcbK7vm1G.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fl3no3IMXGjZAUa2iU9aBzlid5m.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lEYg1X8RjqNB5NWEtodcbK7vm1G.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":59118,"title":"The Prey","description":"A robber escapes from prison with a single objective in mind: to track down his former cellmate, a serial killer who intends to pin his crimes on him. A cop is sent after the robber who, despite his best efforts, soon becomes Public Enemy Number One. As the protagonists are driven to their limits, it becomes increasingly unclear who is the hunter and who is the prey.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2011-04-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/exPAVv84rMP1LgtghB8a8bW6ZJS.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vv30WTTkdstFcOW82EigWQNBHik.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//exPAVv84rMP1LgtghB8a8bW6ZJS.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vv30WTTkdstFcOW82EigWQNBHik.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":47406,"title":"Arabian Nights","description":"The final part of Pasolini''s Trilogy of Life series is rich with exotic tales of slaves and kings, potions, betrayals, demons and, most of all, love and lovemaking in all its myriad forms. Mysterious and liberating, this is an exquisitely dreamlike and adult interpretation of the original folk tales.","duration":"2:11:00","genre":["Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1974-06-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fp315t2MuJs3jOPPsoY2Jv7ZdPQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zDrAREfrNvq5O10lHDDh529i143.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fp315t2MuJs3jOPPsoY2Jv7ZdPQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zDrAREfrNvq5O10lHDDh529i143.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":26389,"title":"From Paris with Love","description":"James Reese has a good job as an ambassador''s aid in France, but his real passion is a side gig—working in a minor role in the CIA. He would love to be a full-fledged agent and can''t believe his luck when he lands an assignment with Charlie Wax. Trigger-happy Charlie soon has James crying for his desk job, but when he learns that the same guys they''re trying to catch are after him, James realises that Charlie may be his only hope of survival.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2010-02-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fra7Gk8xHPWaY4g8p6ue0o2yKOJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/poVoLKLxUqsTLSntA40Po2F78dZ.jpg","s