omerate behind a box of cereal gone stale, and receiving an apology along with dozens of freebies, the duo hatch an illegal coupon club scheme that scams millions from mega-corporations and delivers deals to legions of fellow coupon clippers. On the trail to total coupon dominance, a hapless Loss Prevention Officer from the local supermarket chain joins forces with a determined U.S. Postal Inspector in hot pursuit of these newly minted “Queenpins” of pink collar crime.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"2021-08-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4t8T9NCte10R5CAXVhHDnmkPd3X.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/p5Uz76EOwj9rAsdGxYL8IZGPV2B.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4t8T9NCte10R5CAXVhHDnmkPd3X.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//p5Uz76EOwj9rAsdGxYL8IZGPV2B.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":517088,"title":"Being the Ricardos","description":"Lucille Ball and Desi Arnaz face a crisis that could end their careers and another that could end their marriage.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2021-12-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4wfA61Mi6E8GncUn8ze4w0jz0Za.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oztBLWdRk5gApYmNdADXvXkLT5m.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4wfA61Mi6E8GncUn8ze4w0jz0Za.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oztBLWdRk5gApYmNdADXvXkLT5m.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":156236,"title":"Cycling with Molière","description":"Serge Tanneur is at the pinnacle of his acting career when he decides to turn his back on show business and become a hermit living off of France’s Atlantic coast. Three years later, Gauthier Valence, a beloved TV actor, shows up on the island to offer Serge a role in his directorial debut – a rendition of Molière’s classic play, “The Misanthrope”. Serge refuses at first, but then suggests that 