ving Victor to be a private detective, his two new companions tag along, while he attempts to thwart the murderous attentions of his unhappy client.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Action","Comedy"],"release_date":"2010-06-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pcRb4kQ8AtmCyskyOZkOT6k0Bul.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ejKD5DQ7jouzEkz1fx5Fr8li2ZA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pcRb4kQ8AtmCyskyOZkOT6k0Bul.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ejKD5DQ7jouzEkz1fx5Fr8li2ZA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":41592,"title":"StreetDance 3D","description":"In order to win the Street Dance Championships, a dance crew is forced to work with ballet dancers from the Royal Dance School in exchange for rehearsal space.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Music","Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2010-05-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9c8uXCaljHjRcHabsUmnXaH6tv7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oqWSenAtDQsWjMLVTMEDvcCtafU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9c8uXCaljHjRcHabsUmnXaH6tv7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oqWSenAtDQsWjMLVTMEDvcCtafU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":25330,"title":"Dutch","description":"To get to know his girlfriend''s son, a man volunteers to pick him up from a prep school... only to learn that her son''s not the nicest kid.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Adventure"],"release_date":"1991-07-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xZZ1dV4K5rvPxc1pBXV8cSX1agn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/diBUesRJ2w6ilSbAizpk062Sajh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xZZ1dV4K5rvPxc1pBXV8cSX1agn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//diBUesRJ2w6ilSbAizpk062Sajh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":22423,"title":"Guilty by Suspicion","description":"Owing to his alleged involvement with communist parties, film director David Merrill is forbidden from working in Hollywood. He decides to fight for his rights and faces numerous challenges.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1991-03-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/y0aXFiCRAKOLsRG5kmY7V0EP0Nz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fUpxydE70PNWr7Tu5WpefNnTv2i.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//y0aXFiCRAKOLsRG5kmY7V0EP0Nz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fUpxydE70PNWr7Tu5WpefNnTv2i.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":22274,"title":"Quiet Chaos","description":"Pietro is a successful businessman with a wife and a daughter. One day he helps his brother save two women from drowning at the beach. When he returns home he finds that his wife has died. Now Pietro has to take care of his daughter, Claudia. When he drives her to school soon after, he decides to wait for her all day in front of the school, and soon that''s what he does every day.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2008-02-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jilAAQ4NNFyna5wlgp5DFOJxr2w.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3wx2fd6UnFBQRKV6dTBKhRze4ep.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jilAAQ4NNFyna5wlgp5DFOJxr2w.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3wx2fd6UnFBQRKV6dTBKhRze4ep.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":17880,"title":"Because of Winn-Dixie","description":"A girl, abandoned by her mother when she was three, moves to a small town in Florida with her father. There, she adopts an orphaned dog she names Winn-Dixie. The bond between the girl and her special companion brings together the people in a small Florida town and heals her own troubled relationship with her father.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Family","Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2005-02-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/