ered by a TV crew. Former winner Gladys Leeman wants to make sure her daughter follows in her footsteps; explosions, falling lights, and trailer fires prove that. As the Leemans are the richest family in town, the police are pretty relaxed about it all. Despite everything, main rival (but sweet) Amber Atkins won''t give up without a fight.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1999-07-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xXSDhhyC853VgF7OCDKpXKeA5Md.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iMMvFvHhURa4cWv6CxhpwIDjme2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xXSDhhyC853VgF7OCDKpXKeA5Md.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iMMvFvHhURa4cWv6CxhpwIDjme2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8512,"title":"Devil in a Blue Dress","description":"In late 1940s Los Angeles, Easy Rawlins is an unemployed black World War II veteran with few job prospects. At a bar, Easy meets DeWitt Albright, a mysterious white man looking for someone to investigate the disappearance of a missing white woman named Daphne Monet, who he suspects is hiding out in one of the city''s black jazz clubs. Strapped for money and facing house payments, Easy takes the job, but soon finds himself in over his head.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Thriller","Crime","Drama","Mystery"],"release_date":"1995-09-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/n6SFCz0OsyZ800ZSlaD5WpNmqCj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yZ9vNEKOkd0GWWozsopW3SqflYQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//n6SFCz0OsyZ800ZSlaD5WpNmqCj.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yZ9vNEKOkd0GWWozsopW3SqflYQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":616073,"title":"Return to Horror Hotel","description":"Return to Horror Hotel is an anthology feature with 4 segments. One is about giant a bedbugs, one is about a magical charm that turns girls beautiful, one is about a WWII sailor who hasn''t aged and one is about a terrorizing severed hand.","duration":"1:23:00","genre":["Horror","Science Fiction","Comedy"],"release_date":"2019-06-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bAROb1jil1K8PpbdKhLYPp28kNc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/neZSuPSMJjOo2mEiufHqM8wqXyS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bAROb1jil1K8PpbdKhLYPp28kNc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//neZSuPSMJjOo2mEiufHqM8wqXyS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":552269,"title":"Joe Bell","description":"The true story of a small town, working class father who embarks on a solo walk across the U.S. to crusade against bullying after his son is tormented in high school for being gay.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2020-09-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3RqArFlgVq2LV7kz2OKl3tQijSq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9HfQD60w6f6PPkfdiI6ipJSw0bD.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3RqArFlgVq2LV7kz2OKl3tQijSq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9HfQD60w6f6PPkfdiI6ipJSw0bD.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":266082,"title":"Girlhood","description":"Oppressed by her family setting, dead-end school prospects and the boys law in the neighborhood, Marieme starts a new life after meeting a group of three free-spirited girls. She changes her name, her dress code, and quits school to be accepted in the gang, hoping that this will be a way to freedom.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2014-10-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yJ9HQ4OrFouSj8kRF9opf8s7yGE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qZ52DlSVguX0WHYoiOD464IIONd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yJ9HQ4OrFouSj8kRF9opf8s7yGE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qZ52DlSVguX0WHYoiOD464IIONd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":252838,"title":"The Wedding Ringer","description":"Doug Harris is a loveable but socially awkward groom-to-be with a problem: he has no best man.  With less than two weeks to go until he marries the girl of his dreams, Doug is referred to Jimmy Callahan, owner and CEO of Best Man, Inc., a company that provides flattering best men for socially challenged guys in need.  What ensues is a hilarious wedding charade as they try to pull off the big con, and an unexpected budding bromance between Doug and his fake\r best man Jimmy.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2015-01-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aan0KdhVgJfAwUJ3n2HDFOWcxZ2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ciR2suRkfJen9lQvfz22lgCj7g7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aan0KdhVgJfAwUJ3n2HDFOWcxZ2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ciR2suRkfJen9lQvfz22lgCj7g7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":157827,"title":"Louder Than Bombs","description":"Three years after his wife, acclaimed photographer Isabelle Reed, dies in a car crash, Gene keeps everyday life going with his shy teenage son, Conrad. A planned exhibition of Isabelle’s photographs prompts Gene''s elder son, Jonah, to return to the house he grew up in — and for the first time in a very long time, the father and the two brothers are living under the same roof.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2015-10-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9tdXnZ2iM2KXrlID0RMSUnrynsA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/26hoecTKEAXswDwk4nUE4SEcPg2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9tdXnZ2iM2KXrlID0RMSUnrynsA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//26hoecTKEAXswDwk4nUE4SEcPg2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":23273,"title":"Too Much","description":"Oscar dreams of becoming an actor or a stuntman. To contact a manufacturer he stages an accident and consequently injures 