r pilot Lt. Chris Burnett photographs something he wasn''t supposed to see and gets shot down behind enemy lines, where he must outrun an army led by a ruthless Serbian general. With time running out and a deadly tracker on his trail, Burnett''s commanding officer, Admiral Reigart, decides to risk his career and launch a renegade rescue mission to save his life.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Action","Drama","Thriller","War"],"release_date":"2001-11-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lEdy2A62qCwJPffMLVyByRxUpfd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fZReMWU3zszvaktDUqOoWCzHssZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lEdy2A62qCwJPffMLVyByRxUpfd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fZReMWU3zszvaktDUqOoWCzHssZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":38568,"title":"Howl","description":"It''s San Francisco in 1957, and an American masterpiece is put on trial. Howl, the film, recounts this dark moment using three interwoven threads: the tumultuous life events that led a young Allen Ginsberg to find his true voice as an artist, society''s reaction (the obscenity trial), and mind-expanding animation that echoes the startling originality of the poem itself. All three coalesce in a genre-bending hybrid that brilliantly captures a pivotal moment-the birth of a counterculture.","duration":"1:24:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2010-08-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tUAdGt5trb0H3kKCdHWGdLyt3Rt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4gy0rUIaaao1nx6pr1Dj1WpslcO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tUAdGt5trb0H3kKCdHWGdLyt3Rt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4gy0rUIaaao1nx6pr1Dj1WpslcO.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14815,"title":"The Wind and the Lion","description":"At the beginning of the 20th century an American woman is abducted in Morocco by Berbers, and the attempts to free her range from diplomatic pressure to military intervention.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Drama","History"],"release_date":"1975-05-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4rw8hb8Idl48PXLss01sXbYnwDf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3QLqEZL1kBBfKjVz3nAm5vJruRZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4rw8hb8Idl48PXLss01sXbYnwDf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3QLqEZL1kBBfKjVz3nAm5vJruRZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10806,"title":"In & Out","description":"A midwestern teacher questions his sexuality after a former student makes a comment about him at the Academy Awards.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1997-09-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AlgiBrqgx9R21fJVORCDdrti7Z8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jUTQp6cPgfOX4St2WfaeUvxZCts.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AlgiBrqgx9R21fJVORCDdrti7Z8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jUTQp6cPgfOX4St2WfaeUvxZCts.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9715,"title":"Hope Floats","description":"Birdee Pruitt has been humiliated on live television by her best friend, Connie, who''s been sleeping with Birdee''s husband, Bill. Birdee tries starting over with her daughter, Bernice, by returning to her small Texas hometown, but she''s faced with petty old acquaintances who are thrilled to see Birdee unhappy -- except for her friend Justin. As he helps Birdee get back on her feet, love begins to blossom.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Romance","Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"1998-05-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9zgnuwIK6JAc6giVsscq9H82li1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6PRFM09xjGSWpXObW87CT5JELGJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9zgnuwIK6JAc6giVsscq9H82li1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6PRF