:"2019-09-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jTab4cf4X1dJJVS4F8UOGuesvPd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zBhv8rsLOfpFW2M5b6wW78Uoojs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jTab4cf4X1dJJVS4F8UOGuesvPd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zBhv8rsLOfpFW2M5b6wW78Uoojs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":533533,"title":"TRON: Ares","description":"A highly sophisticated Program called Ares is sent from the digital world into the real world on a dangerous mission, marking humankind''s first encounter with A.I. beings.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Adventure","Action"],"release_date":"2025-10-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pUNfHmVqfwRdILhCkU8TdysVOXo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/chpWmskl3aKm1aTZqUHRCtviwPy.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pUNfHmVqfwRdILhCkU8TdysVOXo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//chpWmskl3aKm1aTZqUHRCtviwPy.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":369230,"title":"Them Who?","description":"David loses his white collar job, his fiancée and his house after one night with con man Marcello. He tracks him down to exact revenge, but ends up becoming his disciple in order to win back everything.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2015-11-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qbpfEMjf2q3kdJBhz1fShhASor.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e9XQYbmL3EEDDcQOx7e3hB2UjnE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qbpfEMjf2q3kdJBhz1fShhASor.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e9XQYbmL3EEDDcQOx7e3hB2UjnE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":77221,"title":"Black Gold","description":"On the Arabian Peninsula in the 1930s, two warring leaders come face to face. The victorious Nesib, Emir of Hobeika, lays down his peace terms to rival Amar, Sultan of Salmaah. The two men agree that neither can lay claim to the area of no man’s land between them called The Yellow Belt. In return, Nesib adopts Amar’s two boys Saleeh and Auda as a guarantee against invasion. Twelve years later, Saleeh and Auda have grown into young men. Saleeh, the warrior, itches to escape his gilded cage and return to his father’s land. Auda cares only for books and the pursuit of knowledge. One day, their adopted father Nesib is visited by an American from Texas. He tells the Emir that his land is blessed with oil and promises him riches beyond his wildest imagination. Nesib imagines a realm of infinite possibility, a kingdom with roads, schools and hospitals all paid for by the black gold beneath the barren sand. There is only one problem. The precious oil is located in the Yellow Belt.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Adventure","Drama"],"release_date":"2011-12-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/krkiarKAcnw9dSFpxf9qfJWSuu3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9ikn974ObBFOnIre7JE4tDwQnGd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//krkiarKAcnw9dSFpxf9qfJWSuu3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9ikn974ObBFOnIre7JE4tDwQnGd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14676,"title":"A Man Called Horse","description":"In 1825, English peer Lord John Morgan is cast adrift in the American West. Captured by Sioux Indians, Morgan is at first targeted for quick extinction, but the tribesmen sense that he is worthy of survival. He eventually passes the many necessary tests that will permit him to become a member of the tribe.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Western","Drama"],"release_date":"1970-05-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nea3UGrcrMZ6t7jrynpbDkWdIC1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gvo0LMk5EWwsypsXl2i25D83ztm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nea3UGrcrMZ6t7jrynpbDkWdIC1.jpg","small_poster_path":"h