rn retelling of Little Red Riding Hood.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime","Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"1996-08-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/q86f264W90GIUeg1Ovf4T1PIBA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/m0pAARUq3foDWFsrUmlYDHtNPE9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//q86f264W90GIUeg1Ovf4T1PIBA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//m0pAARUq3foDWFsrUmlYDHtNPE9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10361,"title":"Ginger Snaps 2: Unleashed","description":"Brigitte has escaped the confines of Bailey Downs but she''s not alone. Another werewolf is tailing her closely and her sister''s specter haunts her. An overdose of Monkshood - the poison that is keeping her transformation at bay - leads to her being incarcerated in a rehabilitation clinic for drug addicts where her only friend is an eccentric young girl by the name of Ghost.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Horror","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2004-01-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lhiLBuFJcRC0wkjsj04vfAfZWPm.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/no1Qw1jMGrH77fIuWxwYZ7BIhHa.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lhiLBuFJcRC0wkjsj04vfAfZWPm.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//no1Qw1jMGrH77fIuWxwYZ7BIhHa.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":6,"title":"Judgment Night","description":"Four young friends, while taking a shortcut en route to a local boxing match, witness a brutal murder which leaves them running for their lives.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1993-10-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lIuseocAIWrEq8zl4EBCBH96e4z.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3rvvpS9YPM5HB2f4HYiNiJVtdam.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lIuseocAIWrEq8zl4EBCBH96e4z.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://imag