ase_date":"1984-07-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/84J4XwvJ0tb7pmgqLQ87TgQHnyN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/v8aETLufi4WIinhQ994oWkehtaC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//84J4XwvJ0tb7pmgqLQ87TgQHnyN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//v8aETLufi4WIinhQ994oWkehtaC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9315,"title":"Flightplan","description":"Flying at 40,000 feet in a state-of-the art aircraft that she helped design, Kyle Pratt''s 6-year-old daughter Julia vanishes without a trace. Or did she? No one on the plane believes Julia was ever onboard. And now Kyle, desperate and alone, can only count on her own wits to unravel the mystery and save her daughter.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama","Mystery"],"release_date":"2005-09-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/59vrJSluVcM4bs9nnGMYnXX569o.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oNjZFzbe7PfF3TxztNHDkinOPyB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//59vrJSluVcM4bs9nnGMYnXX569o.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oNjZFzbe7PfF3TxztNHDkinOPyB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4380,"title":"Shall We Dance?","description":"A bored estate lawyer spots a beautiful woman in the window of a ballroom dance studio. He secretly starts taking dancing lessons to be near her, and then over time discovers how much he loves dancing. His wife, meanwhile, has hired a private detective to find out why he has started coming home late smelling of perfume.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"2004-10-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dbk1GH7eRmUrs8y9WFQP1corti2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aGIyiQv08Gw1HO5BV1yrwCWtGHC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dbk1GH7eRmUrs8y9WFQP1corti2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aGIyiQv08Gw1HO5BV1yrwCWtGHC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":17707,"title":"Brokedown Palace","description":"Best friends Alice and Darlene take a trip to Thailand after graduating high school. In Thailand, they meet a captivating Australian man, who calls himself Nick Parks. Darlene is particularly smitten with Nick and convinces Alice to take Nick up on his offer to treat the two of them to what amounts to a day trip to Hong Kong. In the airport, the girls are seized by the police and shocked to discover that one of their bags contains heroin.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Mystery"],"release_date":"1999-08-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iwcvWOyT04GHLSevuFROL3SGSb6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pWxoggA0KCS5oMPDOjIDYZYzryE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iwcvWOyT04GHLSevuFROL3SGSb6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pWxoggA0KCS5oMPDOjIDYZYzryE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15363,"title":"Something New","description":"Kenya McQueen thought she had it all: a successful career, good friends and family. There was just one thing she didn''t have under control: her love life. All that changes when she meets sexy, free-spirited Brian Kelly. But when her ideal man arrives on the scene, Kenya must decide between the relationship everyone expects and the romance no one expected.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2006-01-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/z3rXaWnmQTJJw9ioNxRQ23rYXHw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lcwB60GqQaWUgUw1CCE5gm5XHI1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//z3rXaWnmQTJJw9ioNxRQ23rYXHw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lcwB60GqQaWUgUw1CCE5gm5XHI1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12182,"title":"Nick and Norah''s Infinite Playlist","description":"Nick cannot stop obsessing over his ex-girlfriend, Tris, until Tris'' friend Norah suddenly shows interest in him at a club. Thus begins an odd night filled with ups and downs as the two keep running into Tris and her new boyfriend while searching for Norah''s drunken friend, Caroline, with help from Nick''s band mates. As the night winds down, the two have to figure out what they want from each other.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Comedy","Music","Romance"],"release_date":"2008-10-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/q9m40JSqittqMWYQet2TCzVWSPO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cndxWgZEHnSUtytrMjal97ye34E.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//q9m40JSqittqMWYQet2TCzVWSPO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cndxWgZEHnSUtytrMjal97ye34E.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10159,"title":"The Rundown","description":"When Travis, the mouthy son of a criminal, disappears in the Amazon in search of a treasured artifact, his father sends in Beck, who becomes Travis''s rival for the affections of Mariana, a mysterious Brazilian woman. With his steely disposition, Beck is a man of few words -- but it takes him all the discipline he can muster to work with Travis to nab a tyrant who''s after the same treasure.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Adventure","Action","Comedy","Thriller"],"release_date":"2003-09-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/i7ClLxhjClTCXGBt3FLC4hbEvU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cwNeP2fz0vqNhmKIcSgLD0xc6g2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//i7ClLxhjClTCXGBt3FLC4hbEvU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cwNeP2fz0vqNhmKIcSgLD0xc6g2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4513,"title":"30 Days of Night","description":"This is the story of an isolated Alaskan town that is plunged into darkness for a month each year when the sun sinks below the horizon. As the last rays of light fade, the town is attacked by a bloodthirsty gang