    '[{"tmdb_id":61984,"title":"Space Battleship Yamato","description":"In 2199, five years after the Gamilons began an invasion of Earth, the planet has been ravaged by the aliens'' bombs. The remnants of humanity have fled underground to escape the irradiated surface. One day, former pilot Susumu Kodai discovers a capsule sent from the planet Iscandar that tells of a device that can remove the radiation from the Earth''s surface. The Earth Defense Force rebuilds the battleship Yamato with a new type of propulsion system to make the 148,000 light year trip to Iscandar in hopes of saving the Earth. Within one year, the radiation will drive the rest of humanity to extinction.","duration":"2:11:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Action","Adventure","Drama"],"release_date":"2010-12-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xaQhFVDeWf78FzZw214yU42w0YZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qlRJcIFiVwA6X58LOGNuMP1io2H.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xaQhFVDeWf78FzZw214yU42w0YZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qlRJcIFiVwA6X58LOGNuMP1io2H.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":48186,"title":"The Boy Who Cried Werewolf","description":"A Californian family inherits a castle in Romania. This is especially exciting to the son, who is obsessed with monsters. And he is not disappointed.","duration":"1:26:00","genre":["Family","Fantasy","TV Movie","Comedy"],"release_date":"2010-10-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1tmcsKQo0QzAzpvm1Akmkmxstjq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/i7lny9FF2ylyPDwdF70ImmSbOv3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1tmcsKQo0QzAzpvm1Akmkmxstjq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//i7lny9FF2ylyPDwdF70ImmSbOv3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":29920,"title":"Easy Money","description":"When JW becomes a drug runner in order to maintain his double life, his fate becomes tied to two other men: Jorge, a fugitive on the run from both the Serbian mafia and the police, and mafia enforcer Mrado, who is on the hunt for Jorge.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2010-01-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vjdKZJ5F9lZmSRrgXERcnDuCAgx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ezx8LhhpZd6U4sd0lXyCEUhIBUc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vjdKZJ5F9lZmSRrgXERcnDuCAgx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ezx8LhhpZd6U4sd0lXyCEUhIBUc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":26515,"title":"Pumpkinhead","description":"When a group of teenagers inadvertently kill his only son, Ed Harley seeks the powers of a backwoods witch to bring the child back to life.","duration":"1:26:00","genre":["Fantasy","Horror"],"release_date":"1988-06-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vCNXAsuDHxHT1ylHqTDSDqaehUG.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gx7Gej5Srp3E13oqy1Kghtox2VZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vCNXAsuDHxHT1ylHqTDSDqaehUG.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gx7Gej5Srp3E13oqy1Kghtox2VZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14195,"title":"Cecil B. Demented","description":"A young lunatic director and his devoted cult of cinema terrorists kidnap a Hollywood movie goddess and force her to star in their radical underground movie.","duration":"1:28:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"2000-08-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cC8Pdc2DMkU7RoHxmGYCQIS8Bm7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gCXUA9BUOSDmOFVfkVBF4v15Td6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cC8Pdc2DMkU7RoHxmGYCQIS8Bm7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gCXUA9BUOSDmOFVfkVBF4v15Td6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":6957,"title":"The 40 Year-Old Virgin","description":"Andy Stitzer has a pleasant life with a nice apartment and a job stamping invoices at an electronics store. But at age 40, there''s one thing Andy hasn''t done, and it''s really bothering his sex-obsessed male co-workers: Andy is still a virgin. Determined to help Andy get laid, the guys make it their mission to de-virginize him. But it all seems hopeless until Andy meets small business owner Trish, a single mom.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2005-08-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3Wej7JW8Ikrzbm6h0lmSdeOYMmu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mVeoqL37gzhMXQVpONi9DGOQ3tZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3Wej7JW8Ikrzbm6h0lmSdeOYMmu.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mVeoqL37gzhMXQVpONi9DGOQ3tZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2655,"title":"What Lies Beneath","description":"Norman and Claire Spencer are a seemingly happily married couple who uncover a terrible secret… a secret so disturbing it threatens to destroy them.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Drama","Horror","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2000-07-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dN0Y9PpPjW8pX4ZcdxarzswI2K6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2L3Cn0CizbSy2E9KJt1SiOSyb6p.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dN0Y9PpPjW8pX4ZcdxarzswI2K6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2L3Cn0CizbSy2E9KJt1SiOSyb6p.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1027073,"title":"In the Land of Saints and Sinners","description":"In a remote Irish village, a damaged Finbar is forced to fight for redemption after a lifetime of sins, but what price is he willing to pay? In the land of saints and sinners, some sins can''t be buried.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2023-10-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4kmNLwmVeT3xMciSRefE6SCi2hX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/443c0xNTLackGkFOKfbPClKMpIk.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4kmNLwmVeT3xMciSRefE6SCi2hX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//443c0xNTLackGkFOKfbPClKMpIk.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":429203,"title":"The Old Man & the Gun","description":"The true story of Forrest Tucker, from his audacious escape from San Quentin at the age of 70 to an unprecedented string of heists that confounded authorities and enchanted the public. Wrapped up in the pursuit are a detective, who becomes captivated with Forrest’s commitment to his craft, and a woman, who loves him in spite of his chosen profession.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2018-09-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8bRIfPGDnmWgdy65LO8xtdcFmFP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a4BfxRK8dBgbQqbRxPs8kmLd8LG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8bRIfPGDnmWgdy65LO8xtdcFmFP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//a4BfxRK8dBgbQqbRxPs8kmLd8LG.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":97899,"title":"A Magnificent Haunting","description":"An aspiring actor discovers that his spacious new apartment comes complete with eight friendly ghosts.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Drama","Fantasy","Comedy"],"release_date":"2012-03-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uFdQiyy0kJyH4vUsYij0g2mi3nc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jgkbT5b0TNGRoRdVAww7mVTlkOo.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uFdQiyy0kJyH4vUsYij0g2mi3nc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jgkbT5b0TNGRoRdVAww7mVTlkOo.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13193,"title":"Saved!","description":"Mary is a good Christian girl who goes to a good Christian high school where she has good Christian friends and a perfect Christian boyfriend. Her life seems perfect, until the day that she finds out that her boyfriend may be gay — and that she’s pregnant.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2004-06-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ehy1Q7v1xnmi9E55jQ9X7OX2Dr1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nmf2tFTcRJZVEQ9e3mgLH5gAQYs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ehy1Q7v1xnmi9E55jQ9X7OX2Dr1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nmf2tFTcRJZVEQ9e3mgLH5gAQYs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10955,"title":"Ripley''s Game","description":"Tom Ripley - cool, urbane, wealthy, and murderous - lives in a villa in the Veneto with Luisa, his harpsichord-playing girlfriend. A former business associate from Berlin''s underworld pays a call asking Ripley''s help in killing a rival. Ripley - ever a student of human nature - initiates a game to turn a mild and innocent local picture framer into a hit man. The artisan, Jonathan Trevanny, who''s dying of cancer, has a wife, young son, and little to leave them. If Ripley draws Jonathan into the game, can Ripley maintain control? Does it stop at one killing? What if Ripley develops a conscience?","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2002-09-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2yHD9xcjRYbrjzANIwJC7DdsEEJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eVhycD9GBWPwnttygKYDi9hllAy.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2yHD9xcjRYbrjzANIwJC7DdsEEJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eVhycD9GBWPwnttygKYDi9hllAy.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10295,"title":"Miami Supercops","description":"In 1978, $20 million was stolen from a Detroit bank. One of the robbers was caught, one was found dead, and the third disappeared. The money was never found. Seven years later, the robber who was caught was released from jail. He immediately went to Miami, only to be found dead the next day. Now FBI agents Doug Bennet and Steve Forest have been called in to investigate the case while posing as Miami police officers. Somewhere in Miami the third robber is hiding with his $20 million, and he has a seven-year head start on the authorities.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Action","Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"1985-12-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sS0MhzRDPAUxT412DqAyhhs6yFY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/j0zfJkOfQr4DfcxjjeCVFjirKpu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sS0MhzRDPAUxT412DqAyhhs6yFY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//j0zfJkOfQr4DfcxjjeCVFjirKpu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":7131,"title":"Van Helsing","description":"Famed monster slayer Gabriel Van Helsing is dispatched to Transylvania to assist the last of the Valerious bloodline in defeating Count Dracula. Anna Valerious reveals that Dracula has formed an unholy alliance with Dr. Frankenstein''s monster and is hell-bent on exacting a centuries-old curse on her family.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Horror","Adventure","Action"],"release_date":"2004-05-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/d72ROyJqXQtw2OupW0l15eicRAF.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gsFun8nATm52aGHeT8ueAel98nE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//d72ROyJqXQtw2OupW0l15eicRAF.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gsFun8nATm52aGHeT8ueAel98nE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":3036,"title":"Mary Shelley''s Frankenstein","description":"Victor Frankenstein is a promising young doctor who, devastated by the death of his mother during childbirth, becomes obsessed with bringing the dead back to life. His experiments lead to the creation of a monster, which Frankenstein has put together with the remains of corpses. It''s not long before Frankenstein regrets his actions.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Drama","Horror","Science Fiction","Romance"],"release_date":"1994-11-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qhZgRQB6ExVcbFXXGL3ISvshfJm.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bOwCAQsZlEKrwhPi1ejY6BS8jpL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qhZgRQB6ExVcbFXXGL3ISvshfJm.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bOwCAQsZlEKrwhPi1ejY6BS8jpL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":171,"title":"The Party 2","description":"A young French teenage girl after moving to a new city falls in love with a boy and is thinking of having sex with him because her girlfriends have already done it.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"1982-12-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fsPJRCb3n1tTaraMY0QoA8taXUb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pbkccDoxH1H1VdqWcQYycZxHTIK.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fsPJRCb3n1tTaraMY0QoA8taXUb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pbkccDoxH1H1VdqWcQYycZxHTIK.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":75,"title":"Mars Attacks!","description":"A fleet of Martian spacecraft surrounds the world''s major cities and all of humanity waits to see if the extraterrestrial visitors have, as they claim, \"come in peace.\" U.S. President James Dale receives assurance from science professor Donald Kessler that the Martians'' mission is a friendly one. But when a peaceful exchange ends in the total annihilation of the U.S. Congress, military men call for a full-scale nuclear retaliation.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Comedy","Fantasy","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1996-12-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ELsTifJ2lu4vsMhoHeZ5EnncHw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hll4O5vSAfnZDb6JbnP06GPtz7b.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ELsTifJ2lu4vsMhoHeZ5EnncHw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hll4O5vSAfnZDb6JbnP06GPtz7b.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":821792,"title":"Bull","description":"Ten years after he was last seen, a vicious mob enforcer returns home to find his son and methodically track down the gang that double-crossed him. His quest for revenge soon leads to a savage showdown between his wife and her mob boss father.","duration":"1:27:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2021-11-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/MMuVHuGhDpxkX6SjYsHKdco0Wi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oapxWncDc5ztrge3ycpvaZIMcf3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//MMuVHuGhDpxkX6SjYsHKdco0Wi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oapxWncDc5ztrge3ycpvaZIMcf3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":798362,"title":"The Marsh King''s Daughter","description":"Helena, a woman living a seemingly ordinary life, hides a dark secret—her father is the infamous ''Marsh King'', the man who kept her and her mother captive in the wilderness for years. After a lifetime of trying to escape her past, Helena is forced to face her demons when her father unexpectedly escapes from prison.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Thriller","Crime","Mystery"],"release_date":"2023-09-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/c7MRmF3LMiBWokedmdQl3roTUv2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bcuEjrwhp5HgEUnFe5lc4xpEqzt.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//c7MRmF3LMiBWokedmdQl3roTUv2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bcuEjrwhp5HgEUnFe5lc4xpEqzt.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":788929,"title":"Lamb","description":"An Icelandic couple live with their herd of sheep on a beautiful but remote farm. When they discover a mysterious newborn on their land, they decide to keep it and raise it as their own. This unexpected development and the prospects of a new family brings them much joy before ultimately destroying them.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Drama","Fantasy","Horror"],"release_date":"2021-08-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/96uOMED23ZLBtb0HQQ5Urr3qMRp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gP9yviboTGWGolqUZKIB1UkF1C2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//96uOMED23ZLBtb0HQQ5Urr3qMRp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gP9yviboTGWGolqUZKIB1UkF1C2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":740985,"title":"Borat Subsequent Moviefilm: Delivery of Prodigious Bribe to American Regime for Make Benefit Once Glorious Nation of Kazakhstan","description":"14 years after making a film about his journey across the USA, Borat risks life and limb when he returns to the United States with his young daughter, and reveals more about the culture, the COVID-19 pandemic, and the political elections.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2020-10-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hbrXbVoE0NuA1ORoSGGYNASagrl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3L1Ml5RWjFVfVq3rQENvgFymT0U.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hbrXbVoE0NuA1ORoSGGYNASagrl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3L1Ml5RWjFVfVq3rQENvgFymT0U.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":326215,"title":"Ooops! Noah Is Gone...","description":"It''s the end of the world. A flood is coming. Luckily for Dave and his son Finny, a couple of clumsy Nestrians, an Ark has been built to save all animals. But as it turns out, Nestrians aren''t allowed. Sneaking on board with the involuntary help of Hazel and her daughter Leah, two Grymps, they think they''re safe. Until the curious kids fall off the Ark. Now Finny and Leah struggle to survive the flood and hungry predators and attempt to reach the top of a mountain, while Dave and Hazel must put aside their differences, turn the Ark around and save their kids. It''s definitely not going to be smooth sailing.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Animation","Adventure","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"2015-03-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zABJBMFSc19yLR0bzK6AvFxreVb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gEJXHgpiKh89Vwjc4XUY5CIgUdB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zABJBMFSc19yLR0bzK6AvFxreVb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gEJXHgpiKh89Vwjc4XUY5CIgUdB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":325348,"title":"Hardcore Henry","description":"Henry, a newly resurrected cyborg who must save his wife/creator from the clutches of a psychotic tyrant with telekinetic powers, AKAN, and his army of mercenaries. Fighting alongside Henry is Jimmy, who is Henry''s only hope to make it through the day. Hardcore Henry takes place over the course of one day, in Moscow, Russia.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2015-09-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/agxzi8QIXWnZgLxwHck8wdjfYk7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ik1uZyiMSxF9HqrgRKUNfMCfr3z.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//agxzi8QIXWnZgLxwHck8wdjfYk7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ik1uZyiMSxF9HqrgRKUNfMCfr3z.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":225728,"title":"Macbeth","description":"Macbeth, the Thane of Glamis, receives a prophecy from a trio of witches that one day he will become King of Scotland. Consumed by ambition and spurred to action by his wife, Macbeth murders his king and takes the throne for himself.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Drama","War"],"release_date":"2015-09-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gkJkemR5EUFYRrO6YFZFFMKZIru.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a5NEpil29Uns1wEYF8k99qVgj1T.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gkJkemR5EUFYRrO6YFZFFMKZIru.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//a5NEpil29Uns1wEYF8k99qVgj1T.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":200713,"title":"9 Month Stretch","description":"Ariane Felder is pregnant! This is surprising with her being a young hardened judge with strict morals.  But what is more surprising is that, according to paternity testing, the child''s father is none other than Bob, a criminal from the prosecution charged with an atrocious attack!  Ariane doesn''t remember any of what has happened, so she has no idea what to expect...","duration":"1:22:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2013-09-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sXC3ZolQ3J3h8XJnyt9QhiF3OIB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6vCLklvrl7ogr6DywSV3v5XyKk9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sXC3ZolQ3J3h8XJnyt9QhiF3OIB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6vCLklvrl7ogr6DywSV3v5XyKk9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":175168,"title":"Rape Zombie: Lust of the Dead","description":"After a nuclear attack in Tokyo, the female population is attacked by infected males who have become sex-crazed zombies, hungry for human flesh. Officeworker Momoko and nurse Nozomi seek shelter in a Shinto Shrine, where they meet housewife Kanae and school girl Tamae. With no choices left to them, the group of girls decides to take a stand and arm themselves with assault rifles and explosives to fight off hordes of horny zombies. What is the secret to killing the zombies for good?","duration":"1:13:00","genre":["Comedy","Horror"],"release_date":"2012-07-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/plbid03OmJkBd6UoOulKPexRq0I.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fyiGTyzQV3vcuwEAoOFRmoT2L1m.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//plbid03OmJkBd6UoOulKPexRq0I.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fyiGTyzQV3vcuwEAoOFRmoT2L1m.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":31597,"title":"Narrow Margin","description":"An L.A. District Attorney attempts to take an unwilling murder witness back to the United States to testify against a top-level mob boss. Frantically attempting 