n the very hitmen he hired also target his ex-girlfriend, he must fend off an army of assassin colleagues and win back the love of his life before it''s too late.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Action","Comedy","Thriller"],"release_date":"2024-09-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zGLQmrmIB56kMZPnzqReIOBay1B.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4bKlTeOUr5AKrLky8mwWvlQqyVd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zGLQmrmIB56kMZPnzqReIOBay1B.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4bKlTeOUr5AKrLky8mwWvlQqyVd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":404791,"title":"The 101-Year-Old Man Who Skipped Out on the Bill and Disappeared","description":"Drinking the tasty Folk Soda puts a spring in the 101 Year Old Man’s step and his next adventure takes him around the World and back to Sweden, during which time he is chased by the CIA, a Balinese debt collector and becomes an executive at a soft drink company.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Adventure","Comedy"],"release_date":"2016-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/VybC5bdEqZYfU3sSsvsTE4WOpV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eIDOtXucNE2F1mwTyw6JB8m74wU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//VybC5bdEqZYfU3sSsvsTE4WOpV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eIDOtXucNE2F1mwTyw6JB8m74wU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":74387,"title":"Goon","description":"Doug Glatt, a slacker who discovers he has a talent for brawling, is approached by a minor league hockey coach and invited to join the team as the \"muscle.\" Despite the fact that Glatt can''t skate, his best friend, Pat, convinces him to give it a shot, and Glatt becomes a hero to the team and their fans, until the league''s reigning goon becomes threatened by Glatt''s success and decides to even the score.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2012-01-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6oinIWHCsk081RcS6zaObeSyS1F.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xLmZCfJici1SdT6zmhDtGVWsXXi.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6oinIWHCsk081RcS6zaObeSyS1F.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xLmZCfJici1SdT6zmhDtGVWsXXi.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":601470,"title":"The Eyes of Tammy Faye","description":"From the 1960s to the 1980s, evangelist Jim Baker and his ambitious wife, Tammy Faye, rose from humble beginnings to build an empire based on big-time evangelical Christianity--only for the couple to fall from grace because of some all-too-human sins.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2021-09-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rskVKmBb83u7qbaASCxyJyLevkq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yL3IAfOxUH7h1Og9kxG3czxa4XV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rskVKmBb83u7qbaASCxyJyLevkq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yL3IAfOxUH7h1Og9kxG3czxa4XV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":571384,"title":"Come Play","description":"Oliver, a lonely autistic boy, seeks solace and refuge in his ever-present cell phone and tablet. When a mysterious creature uses the boy''s devices against him, his parents must fight to save their son from the monster beyond the screen.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Horror","Mystery"],"release_date":"2020-10-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/14ZaCEaHGe1wgGCbQaKAPp4YdWe.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9jy9OzZi0Oy8Hdv603QWujbfCwx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//14ZaCEaHGe1wgGCbQaKAPp4YdWe.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9jy9OzZi0Oy8Hdv603QWujbfCwx.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":340176,"title":"Tag","description":"As the sole survivor of a horrendous and rather mysterious accident, teenage Mitsuko''s day is off to a bad start. An unstoppable force of nature, a doomed field trip, and a strange case of amnesia easily coexist in a bizarre parallel universe, where a desperate Mitsuko is always on the run from something inexplicable, intangible, and utterly deadly. However, amid piles of fresh corpses, mounds of scorching bullet shells, and rivulets of fragrant adolescent blood, Mitsuko must fight to stay alive, before her already messed-up day becomes even stranger. But one question still remains: who or what is the enemy?","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Horror","Action","Science Fiction","Drama","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2015-05-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rch5tr1bpNyfeRJxARoU7I2a9KR.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1xqQv9PoOIVX4nHlKVQELaAHyvG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rch5tr1bpNyfeRJxARoU7I2a9KR.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1xqQv9PoOIVX4nHlKVQELaAHyvG.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":317198,"title":"Bad Hair Day","description":"Monica is desperate to be prom queen, but on the big night, her hair is an uncontrollable mess. Meanwhile, FBI agent Liz Morgan is on the hunt for a jewel thief who is looking for a stolen necklace, which Monica has in her possession. Soon, she and the agent chase the jewel thief, and she''s whizzed on a wild adventure in the city.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Comedy","Adventure","TV Movie","Family"],"release_date":"2015-02-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tzlgd1gzYxtzCfwoxT6lEls1v7s.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/i1Vum1dbHkFVF0aqb1cNR0OSkD0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tzlgd1gzYxtzCfwoxT6lEls1v7s.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//i1Vum1dbHkFVF0aqb1cNR0OSkD0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":303858,"title":"Money Monster","description":"Financial TV host Lee Gates and his producer Patty are put in an extreme situation when an irate investor takes over their studio.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"2016-05-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ct5kjqyBwzH6OSxuOIluChs3FFN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/DlgdAkAKirD01R1mBejhFjS6nQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ct5kjqyBwzH6OSxuOIluChs3FFN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//DlgdAkAKirD01R1mBejhFjS6nQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":66195,"title":"The Perfect Host","description":"Warwick Wilson is the consummate host. He carefully prepares for a dinner party, the table impeccably set and the duck perfectly timed for 8:30 p.m. John Taylor is a career criminal. He’s just robbed a bank and needs to get off the streets. He finds himself on Warwick’s doorstep posing as a friend of a friend, new to Los Angeles, who’s been mugged and lost his luggage.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Comedy","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2010-07-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3ubIRrPOmLg74gjgSUwXEXdHhSR.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tYqk1u5d3eARg5gV8cF4RZFZKKQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3ubIRrPOmLg74gjgSUwXEXdHhSR.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tYqk1u5d3eARg5gV8cF4RZFZKKQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":36736,"title":"The Drawn Together Movie: The Movie!","description":"When the mystery-solving musician Foxxy Love notices she and her fellow housemates can curse without being bleeped—something they''ve never been able to do before—she realizes their show has been canceled. Determined to get back on the air, the gang travels to Make-A-Point-Land in order to get a point (and get back on the air).","duration":"1:11:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Mystery"],"release_date":"2010-03-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eDHOYmzdV2AdXXIz0XjQbNJiTSw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/