ng a hitman to attempt to track him down to finish him off.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"1989-07-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xbGROemZqyVYrIlMOHKqmV2qmG0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xhjZPqqefyZQawSCnVUmCwkpaIw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xbGROemZqyVYrIlMOHKqmV2qmG0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xhjZPqqefyZQawSCnVUmCwkpaIw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5125,"title":"Rendition","description":"When an Egyptian terrorism suspect \"disappears\" on a flight from Africa to Washington DC, his American wife and a CIA analyst find themselves caught up in a struggle to secure his release from a secret detention facility somewhere outside the US.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2007-09-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hVgbeqLYbbrT23pryiR0Oz009CM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uW8gNhIJkNabd0AIafWqFRxB8Os.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hVgbeqLYbbrT23pryiR0Oz009CM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uW8gNhIJkNabd0AIafWqFRxB8Os.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1085218,"title":"Darkland: The Return","description":"Seven years ago, Zaid went to war against the Copenhagen underworld to avenge his dead brother. His identity as a respected doctor of cardiology and life as a family man is but a fading dream, and in prison Zaid suffers the loss of his son Noah, whom he barely knows. When a police agent approaches Zaid and offers him a deal to be released in exchange for infiltrating the Copenhagen underworld, he sees his chance to reclaim the remnants of the family life he left behind. But everything has a price, and Zaid realizes that he has now seriously endangered his son''s life. After all, once you become part of the underworld, is there any way out?","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Thriller","Action"],"release_date":"2023-04-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mkxDnIBYuXDvKJJ3moUPHs8vHhF.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/c8B4DsVcFVDLVmbpHMHU3RjLNAV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mkxDnIBYuXDvKJJ3moUPHs8vHhF.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//c8B4DsVcFVDLVmbpHMHU3RjLNAV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":802217,"title":"8-Bit Christmas","description":"In suburban Chicago during the late 1980s, ten-year-old Jake Doyle embarks on a herculean quest to get the latest and greatest video game system for Christmas.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Family","Comedy"],"release_date":"2021-11-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lMudh9ouUHsJ1jhKVSbx2ErGdzf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5YwaISdOwp8Zu6O7kwBeUn8a7Pu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lMudh9ouUHsJ1jhKVSbx2ErGdzf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5YwaISdOwp8Zu6O7kwBeUn8a7Pu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":515911,"title":"Lady J","description":"When a romance between a widow and a notorious libertine takes an unexpected turn, Mademoiselle de Joncquières becomes instrumental to one lover’s plans for revenge.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2018-09-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fIl89ylwVEb0JVy4rPPId9kiP3f.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bMws6ZcTwEynkst5PU3Z8OD9wiH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fIl89ylwVEb0JVy4rPPId9kiP3f.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bMws6ZcTwEynkst5PU3Z8OD9wiH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":457232,"title":"Lamborghini: The Man Behind the Legend","description":"Follow the launch of Lamborghini’s career as a manufacturer of tractors, a creator of military vehicles during World War II, and the designer of Lamborghini cars, which he launched in