2//fN3xeuVsPaiEKYm65uHSO9JVmeb.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11212,"title":"Baby''s Day Out","description":"Baby Bink couldn''t ask for more: he has adoring (if somewhat sickly-sweet) parents, lives in a huge mansion, and he''s just about to appear in the social pages of the paper. Unfortunately, not everyone in the world is as nice as Baby Bink''s parents—especially the three enterprising kidnappers who pretend to be photographers from the newspaper. Successfully kidnapping Baby Bink, they have a harder time keeping hold of the rascal, who not only keeps one step ahead of them, but seems to be more than a little bit smarter than the three bumbling criminals.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Comedy","Adventure","Family","Crime"],"release_date":"1994-07-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7bDfeFS4utVf2LNN5lr2pnVgRTb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/21U2jwl36hoTHsXB3fDuIQkcchu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7bDfeFS4utVf2LNN5lr2pnVgRTb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//21U2jwl36hoTHsXB3fDuIQkcchu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":967847,"title":"Ghostbusters: Frozen Empire","description":"The Spengler family returns to where it all started - the iconic New York City firehouse - to team up with the original Ghostbusters, who''ve developed a top-secret research lab to take busting ghosts to the next level. But when the discovery of an ancient artifact unleashes an evil force, Ghostbusters new and old must join forces to protect their home and save the world from a second Ice Age.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Fantasy","Adventure","Comedy"],"release_date":"2024-03-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5cCfqeUH2f5Gnu7Lh9xepY9TB6x.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e1J2oNzSBdou01sUvriVuoYp0pJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5cCfqeUH2f5Gnu7Lh9xepY9TB6x.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.or