te House (Secret Service Code: \"Olympus\") is captured by a terrorist mastermind and the President is kidnapped, disgraced former Presidential guard Mike Banning finds himself trapped within the building. As the national security team scrambles to respond, they are forced to rely on Banning''s inside knowledge to help retake the White House, save the President and avert an even bigger disaster.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2013-03-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mjYU7EwVeOtM39ArdWHZk78VhYm.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u3GTFGwesNBNd0t1hiLaEk1iqZU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mjYU7EwVeOtM39ArdWHZk78VhYm.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u3GTFGwesNBNd0t1hiLaEk1iqZU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14112,"title":"Auto Focus","description":"A successful TV star during the 1960s, former \"Hogan''s Heroes\" actor Bob Crane projects a wholesome family-man image, but this front masks his persona as a sex addict who records and photographs his many encounters with women, often with the help of his seedy friend, John Henry Carpenter. This biographical drama reveals how Crane''s double life takes its toll on him and his family, and ultimately contributes to his death.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2002-10-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/204u2koZm4kP2MwwYdALCd5i4Vi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/71CQUn4vtpDQtAPXtaLP7IGH0Sg.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//204u2koZm4kP2MwwYdALCd5i4Vi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//71CQUn4vtpDQtAPXtaLP7IGH0Sg.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10431,"title":"War","description":"FBI agent Jack Crawford is out for revenge when his partner is killed and all clues point to the mysterious assassin Rogue. But when Rogue turns up years later to take care of some un