n, the President of the United States is struck down by an assassin''s bullet. Eight strangers have a perfect view of the kill, but what did they really see? As the minutes leading up to the fatal shot are replayed through the eyes of each eyewitness, the reality of the assassination takes shape.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Drama","Action","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2008-02-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5c3RpVjkNzrguLUBHqOG1kFI5Kb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9xA1KaGoYQJveY3C87J41Au5Kkn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5c3RpVjkNzrguLUBHqOG1kFI5Kb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9xA1KaGoYQJveY3C87J41Au5Kkn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2075,"title":"Prizzi''s Honor","description":"Charley Partanna is a hitman who works for the Prizzis, one of the richest crime families in the US. When he sees Irene Walker, it''s love at first sight. But he soon finds that she, too, is a killer for hire. Charley can overlook his suspicions, but he can''t turn off his heart. And the couple must remember that even if they love each other, the Prizzis love only money.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"1985-06-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lW4nIRGJAglS6Pt7gTgRIrmSHA2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5azGfZXuUFYjYfz6etYOdlyLXwL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lW4nIRGJAglS6Pt7gTgRIrmSHA2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5azGfZXuUFYjYfz6etYOdlyLXwL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":214,"title":"Saw III","description":"Jigsaw has disappeared. Along with his new apprentice Amanda, the puppet-master behind the cruel, intricate games that have terrified a community and baffled police has once again eluded capture and vanished. While city detectives scramble to locate him, Doctor Lynn Denlon and Jeff Reinhart are unaware th