ter rescuing the Prince. The heroic duo meet in the Western Desert and a thrilling story unfolds.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Adventure","History","Action","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2015-02-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rnNkUJlo03a8D0utxiOrADstaMT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hrEbZNZQ385i4snYWyCDpYrEofO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rnNkUJlo03a8D0utxiOrADstaMT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hrEbZNZQ385i4snYWyCDpYrEofO.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":411999,"title":"OtherLife","description":"Ren Amari is the driven inventor of a revolutionary new drug. OtherLife expands the brain''s sense of time and creates virtual reality directly in the user''s mind. With OtherLife, mere seconds in real life feel like hours or days of exciting adventures. As Ren and her colleagues race around the clock to launch OtherLife, the government muscles in to use the drugs as a radical solution to prison overcrowding. They will create virtual cells where criminals serve long sentences in just minutes of real time. When Ren resists, she finds herself an unwilling guinea pig trapped in a prison cell in her mind. She must escape before she descends into madness, and then regain control of OtherLife before others suffer the same fate.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Crime","Mystery"],"release_date":"2017-06-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/arb8T0YFfLT5cUVIJPTMoHbmk12.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/stSDsKsb4fS6NPzuHwfAWD2jim8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//arb8T0YFfLT5cUVIJPTMoHbmk12.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//stSDsKsb4fS6NPzuHwfAWD2jim8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":286554,"title":"Two Night Stand","description":"After an extremely regrettable one night stand, two strangers wake up to find themselves snowed in after sleeping through a blizzard that put all of Manhattan on ice. They''re now trapped together in a tiny apartment, forced to get to know each other way more than any one night stand should.","duration":"1:26:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"2014-09-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dgZ5e1q6dGUYLUxepmZTmoGqwEy.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rz0YnlHieXP9SBuJU4ANBW8ttIw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dgZ5e1q6dGUYLUxepmZTmoGqwEy.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rz0YnlHieXP9SBuJU4ANBW8ttIw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":36834,"title":"Total Eclipse","description":"Young, wild poet Arthur Rimbaud and his mentor Paul Verlaine engage in a fierce, forbidden romance while feeling the effects of a hellish artistic lifestyle.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1995-11-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3FYltaTkmrFeVquPOXbAXgYVuqZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9ihmgsX9aDXZmwjvgrzJgH8FxNa.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3FYltaTkmrFeVquPOXbAXgYVuqZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9ihmgsX9aDXZmwjvgrzJgH8FxNa.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13703,"title":"Less Than Zero","description":"A college freshman returns to Los Angeles for Christmas at his ex-girlfriend''s request, but discovers that his former best friend has an out-of-control drug habit.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"1987-11-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6Otwiru3uklbKPavWLdOLsgLFJU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8pFMuyJJwJLqOJ3Ljq3M5BFGbTF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6Otwiru3uklbKPavWLdOLsgLFJU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8pFMuyJJwJLqOJ3Ljq3M5BFGbTF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11653,"title":"The Myth","description":"When a fellow scientist asks for Jack''s help in locating the mausoleum of China''s first emperor, the past collides violently with the present as Jack discovers his amazing visions are based in fact.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2005-05-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xChyWmjDeEH8zOVi9dwVrtIJEfd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iBDFnLkTZZxQlbb6IIeYkufnPCY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xChyWmjDeEH8zOVi9dwVrtIJEfd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iBDFnLkTZZxQlbb6IIeYkufnPCY.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":6081,"title":"Revenge of the Pink Panther","description":"Chief Inspector Jacques Clouseau is dead. At least that is what the world—and Charles Dreyfus—believe when a dead body is discovered in Clouseau''s car after being shot off the road. Naturally, Clouseau knows differently and, taking advantage of not being alive, sets out to discover why an attempt was made on his life.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime","Mystery"],"release_date":"1978-01-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qOxSzq4bAbsqCUjP9Na4PTCDAZe.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pvFiI8Kkq6JIf9uxDUU5FEvet7f.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qOxSzq4bAbsqCUjP9Na4PTCDAZe.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pvFiI8Kkq6JIf9uxDUU5FEvet7f.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":810873,"title":"Single All the Way","description":"Desperate to avoid his family’s judgment about his perpetual single status, Peter convinces his best friend Nick to join him for the holidays and pretend that they’re now in a relationship. But when Peter’s mother sets him up on a blind date with her handsome trainer James, the plan goes awry.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"2021-12-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2r0O6rOOSfsZ3bIpWTOt0Xabxkf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bfZPNzAwUQZ6FZQi1d136KLr3wl.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2r0O6rOOSfsZ3bIpWTOt0Xabxkf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bfZPNzAwUQZ6FZQi1d136KLr3wl.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":768520,"title":"A California Christmas","description":"With his carefree lifestyle on the line, a wealthy charmer poses as a ranch hand to get a hardworking farmer to sell her family’s land before Christmas.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2020-12-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cwWPWhdnqOBvGz3zRzD9zbhQQLZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/caCbdsdGHDJNMjSiA5X4mgIfe61.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cwWPWhdnqOBvGz3zRzD9zbhQQLZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//caCbdsdGHDJNMjSiA5X4mgIfe61.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":296271,"title":"The Devil Conspiracy","description":"A powerful biotech company has breakthrough technology allowing them to clone history’s most influential people with just a few fragments of DNA. Behind this company is a cabal of Satanists that steals the shroud of Christ, putting them in possession of Jesus’ DNA. The clone will serve as the ultimate offering to the devil. The Archangel Michael comes to earth and will stop at nothing to end the devil’s conspiracy.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Horror","Fantasy","Science Fiction","Thriller"],"release_date":"2023-01-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sp7MPK2K60LLd7A6zjHKsfgjFil.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gZCWgbIq2IBDRMJmdx5NeYbbigL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sp7MPK2K60LLd7A6zjHKsfgjFil.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gZCWgbIq2IBDRMJmdx5NeYbbigL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":16248,"title":"D.A.R.Y.L.","description":"Daryl is a normal 10-year-old boy in many ways. However, unbeknown to his foster parents and friends, Daryl is actually a government-created robot with superhuman reflexes and mental abilities. Even his name has a hidden meaning -- it''s actually an acronym for Data Analyzing Robot Youth Life-form. When the organization that created him deems the \"super soldier\" experiment a failure and schedules Daryl to be disassembled, it is up to a few rogue scientists to help him escape.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Family","Science Fiction","Adventure"],"release_date":"1985-06-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6Ld4ivkOa2tmvP2F0Fo4eRiuMkz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/87huhTOQijJy0pLhusZfest1MoZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6Ld4ivkOa2tmvP2F0Fo4eRiuMkz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//87huhTOQijJy0pLhusZfest1MoZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13990,"title":"The Wackness","description":"Set in New York City in the sweltering summer, The Wackness tells the story of a troubled teenage drug dealer, who trades pot for therapy sessions with a drug-addled psychiatrist. Things get more complicated when he falls for one of his classmates, who just happens to be the doctor''s daughter. This is a coming-of-age story about sex, drugs, music and what it takes to be a man.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2008-07-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5GlBEqiG0vpnnRWc7Vi5O4ao6Yi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gmtlqHZs8YBXcpMw4BgA3SGJfg8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5GlBEqiG0vpnnRWc7Vi5O4ao6Yi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gmtlqHZs8YBXcpMw4BgA3SGJfg8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9101,"title":"Down Periscope","description":"Maverick Navy Lieutenant Commander Tom Dodge will never be a textbook officer, but he''s a brilliant seaman who''s always wanted to command a nuclear submarine — he''s been given one last chance to clean up his record. Unfortunately, Admiral Graham, his nemesis, would rather sink the fleet than give Dodge his own boat. So, Graham stacks the deck against him and assigns Dodge to the Stingray, a diesel-powered WW2 submarine that can barely keep afloat. To make matters worse, Dodge''s crew is a collection of maladjusted, mistake-prone misfits. Then, he''s tagged the \"enemy\" in a crucial war game, and ordered to take on the U.S. Navy''s best.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1996-03-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/waytOOLxw9IDbo0hNKZLk1z4lzI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/brleKcHsirTw7lFqcgUMOfgL2nl.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//waytOOLxw9IDbo0hNKZLk1z4lzI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//brleKcHsirTw7lFqcgUMOfgL2nl.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":469055,"title":"In the Game","description":"A rebellious teenager must travel the country with his sick grandpa to get to his basketball game.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2018-03-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4T98tQeT8qiaSplZVOCfBPQXQx8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9KYEVSiRf6qWYO94NNfOw1BvO2x.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4T98tQeT8qiaSplZVOCfBPQXQx8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9KYEVSiRf6qWYO94NNfOw1BvO2x.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":430155,"title":"Coma","description":"A young and talented architect comes to his senses after a horrific accident only to find himself in the odd dystopian world. A world that is filled with the memories of all current coma patients. Just like a human memory this world is fragmental, chaotic and unstable. This is COMA: icecaps, rivers and cities can all exist in a space of a single room and laws of physics are no longer laws as they can be bent.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Adventure","Action"],"release_date":"2020-01-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ozUfK85XsZE6pQnU9vuz3vDADIJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1hVEsBS4vnozB1yAsMiqW0IMxyp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ozUfK85XsZE6pQnU9vuz3vDADIJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1hVEsBS4vnozB1yAsMiqW0IMxyp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":184098,"title":"Think Like a Man Too","description":"All the couples are back for a wedding in Las Vegas, but plans for a romantic weekend go awry when their various misadventures get them into some compromising situations that threaten to derail the big event.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2014-06-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cMSfVBqshJTDfdwr00hxkpuwjRA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yKI9Nof9MH3dNHM469hEfCjCbjJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cMSfVBqshJTDfdwr00hxkpuwjRA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yKI9Nof9MH3dNHM469hEfCjCbjJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13225,"title":"FernGully: The Last Rainforest","description":"When a sprite named Crysta shrinks a human boy, Zak, down to her size, he vows to help the magical fairy folk stop a greedy logging company from destroying their home: the pristine rainforest known as FernGully. Zak and his new friends fight to defend FernGully from lumberjacks — and the vengeful spirit they accidentally unleash after chopping down a magic tree.","duration":"1:16:00","genre":["Family","Fantasy","Animation","Adventure"],"release_date":"1992-04-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yEWh2uS2hYEMxfMKasrf0ysw874.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xkJxdeaibcrcsi1XHvT0IuOjdzB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yEW