arm, the agency''s secret training grounds, where he learns to watch his back and trust no one.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2003-01-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bwDTWOd0SCFWfRw8ophhykOgUBS.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xInKytrHV3EJeCAulOpn5Q0bMxh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bwDTWOd0SCFWfRw8ophhykOgUBS.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xInKytrHV3EJeCAulOpn5Q0bMxh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":615952,"title":"Armageddon Time","description":"In 1980, Queens, New York, a young Jewish boy befriends a rebellious African-American classmate to the disapproval of his privileged family and begins to reckon with growing up in a world of inequality and prejudice.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2022-10-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pqCfTRzYzojsyHvKtS6mHfC7Wc7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wMK717aDWhboXOiVbZ9sLBqLmKh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pqCfTRzYzojsyHvKtS6mHfC7Wc7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wMK717aDWhboXOiVbZ9sLBqLmKh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":95610,"title":"Bridget Jones''s Baby","description":"After breaking up, Bridget Jones'' happily-ever-after hasn''t quite gone according to plan. Fortysomething and single again, she decides to focus on her job and surround herself with old friends and new. For once, Bridget has everything completely under control. Then her love life takes a turn when she meets Jack. A week later, she runs into Mark before she finds herself pregnant, but with one hitch - she''s not sure of the identity of her baby''s father - Mark or Jack.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2016-09-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hTReEn9kCeZLxgQmC46hQszLKSq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5hHomngoPZrNoXOPlyaHV6eXaQW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hTReEn9kCeZLxgQmC46hQszLKSq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5hHomngoPZrNoXOPlyaHV6eXaQW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10770,"title":"The Sheriff and the Satellite Kid","description":"The town of Newnan are seeing little green men everywhere. The military have arrived and are on the lookout for UFOs. Everyone''s high strung and Sheriff Hall (Bud Spencer) is left to deal with the aftermaths of the hysteria. On his way home from patrol he happens upon a little boy claiming to be an alien by the name of H7-25. At first the sheriff doesn''t believe the boy, but with the mounting evidence, even he must eventually concede. Soon the military is after Sheriff Hall and H7-25, and it is up to the sheriff to keep the boy safe and beat up large swaths of soldiers so H7-25 can go home.","duration":"1:28:00","genre":["Comedy","Science Fiction","Action"],"release_date":"1979-08-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qviAZShx8MVNwZjk1MoFFEdLUnx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hQKM2cefRD80N21NMFeztk3PnAk.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qviAZShx8MVNwZjk1MoFFEdLUnx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hQKM2cefRD80N21NMFeztk3PnAk.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":531454,"title":"Eurovision Song Contest: The Story of Fire Saga","description":"Two small-town singers chase their pop star dreams at a global music competition, where high stakes, scheming rivals and onstage mishaps test their bond.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Music","Comedy"],"release_date":"2020-06-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jMO1icztaUUEUApdAQx0cZOt7b8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9zrbgYyFvwH8sy5mv9eT25xsAzL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jMO1icztaUUEUApdAQx0cZOt7b8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9zrbgYyFvwH8sy5mv9eT25xsAzL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":520900,"title":"The Personal History of David Copperfield","description":"A fresh and distinctive take on Charles Dickens’ semi-autobiographical masterpiece, The Personal History of David Copperfield, set in the 1840s, chronicles the life of its iconic title character as he navigates a chaotic world to find his elusive place within it. From his unhappy childhood to the discovery of his gift as a storyteller and writer, David’s journey is by turns hilarious and tragic, but always full of life, colour and humanity.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2019-11-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/udMUwcH9UBxwjvpRD3f0ExEJq89.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2epgo9k2Jrs7qrTL1Rork1mDSKT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//udMUwcH9UBxwjvpRD3f0ExEJq89.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2epgo9k2Jrs7qrTL1Rork1mDSKT.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":59859,"title":"Kick-Ass 2","description":"After Kick-Ass'' insane bravery inspires a new wave of self-made masked crusaders, he joins a patrol led by the Colonel Stars and Stripes. When these amateur superheroes are hunted down by Red Mist — reborn as The Mother Fucker — only the blade-wielding Hit-Girl can prevent their annihilation.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Crime"],"release_date":"2013-07-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dHBYguQvCDa00GMoidNYa7IOD8y.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1go2A3gdQjaMuHWquybgoJlQRcX.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dHBYguQvCDa00GMoidNYa7IOD8y.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1go2A3gdQjaMuHWquybgoJlQRcX.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15139,"title":"The Pagemaster","description":"Rich knows a lot about accidents. So much so, he is scared to do anything that might endanger him,