 of the Hornet","description":"Dj Steph is a young radio deejay on the rise, who gained a lot of popularity on social media and every evening hosts a radio show with a large following, during which he receives calls from his fans. One evening, a call chills him to the bone: a cold-blooded stranger announces on live radio that he plans to take his own life, making himself explode in the middle of the city.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"2020-11-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/w3eAsDs1HXWsz4GgcICR8rR4Mdm.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5pAAjVDpq4cCCsZsdivkCLMY6Hm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//w3eAsDs1HXWsz4GgcICR8rR4Mdm.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5pAAjVDpq4cCCsZsdivkCLMY6Hm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":328589,"title":"The Lady in the Van","description":"The true story of the relationship between Alan Bennett and the singular Miss Shepherd, a woman of uncertain origins who ‘temporarily’ parked her van in Bennett’s London driveway and proceeded to live there for 15 years.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2015-10-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wG9aQDcbHbk2vzIKwt4XXYroIsN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sqz4CGInI1bysFH674HYWtQSmYn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wG9aQDcbHbk2vzIKwt4XXYroIsN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sqz4CGInI1bysFH674HYWtQSmYn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":111479,"title":"CBGB","description":"A look at New York''s dynamic punk rock scene through the lens of the ground-breaking Lower East Side club started by eccentric Hilly Kristal in 1973 which launched thousands of bands.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Drama","Music"],"release_date":"2013-10-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tQbRiVWlznLEr7P6DIFrSvqgYE5.jpg","poster_path