nes, gallery owner Brooke Gatwick and her newscaster husband Owen Shore, face temptation, jealousy, twists and mystery when two seductive newcomers enter their lives.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Thriller","Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2021-03-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8sqvC5hU5QOkYHUnhZIoFKz87BA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ndFgjUUquqb0PCNH4IYemFoeo57.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8sqvC5hU5QOkYHUnhZIoFKz87BA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ndFgjUUquqb0PCNH4IYemFoeo57.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":587130,"title":"The Reckoning","description":"In the aftermath of the Great Plague and amidst the subsequent witch-hunts against women, a young widow grapples with the tragic death of her husband in a society completely consumed by fear and death. Because she rejects the advances of her landlord, she is falsely accused of being a witch and thrown in jail for a crime she didn’t commit. She must endure physical persecution at the hands of England’s most ruthless witch-hunter and face her own inner demons as the devil himself starts to work his way into her mind.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Horror","Drama"],"release_date":"2021-02-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/k7hTCPFCBT9wwqNE1qUuEnSQVa9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/i7P5DqW1wDNpX2Ug0kAFKJSL7bX.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//k7hTCPFCBT9wwqNE1qUuEnSQVa9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//i7P5DqW1wDNpX2Ug0kAFKJSL7bX.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":477018,"title":"The Translators","description":"Nine translators, hired to translate the eagerly awaited final book of a bestselling trilogy, are confined in a luxurious bunker.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2019-12-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/Hu6797iHrAizNSzWxvd8z7