n revenge.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1981-11-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/97f4GFF2Vv6v40Ee5S00nuvAr4i.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AqCOt1cWfKqCepxK7LIdT812idH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//97f4GFF2Vv6v40Ee5S00nuvAr4i.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AqCOt1cWfKqCepxK7LIdT812idH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":865559,"title":"Your Christmas or Mine?","description":"Students Hayley and James are young and in love. After saying goodbye for Christmas at a London train station, they both make the same mad split-second decision to swap trains and surprise each other. Passing each other in the station, they are completely unaware that they have just swapped Christmases.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2022-12-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pZxSWMjfjSSujRVj8xk8YlIZKoX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/A806wuTGJECDh9krhQAhnieQcLr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pZxSWMjfjSSujRVj8xk8YlIZKoX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//A806wuTGJECDh9krhQAhnieQcLr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":294272,"title":"Pete''s Dragon","description":"For years, old wood carver Mr. Meacham has delighted local children with his tales of the fierce dragon that resides deep in the woods of the Pacific Northwest. To his daughter, Grace, who works as a forest ranger, these stories are little more than tall tales... until she meets Pete, a mysterious 10-year-old with no family and no home who claims to live in the woods with a giant, green dragon named Elliott. And from Pete''s descriptions, Elliott seems remarkably similar to the dragon from Mr. Meacham''s stories. With the help of Natalie, an 11-year-old girl whose father Jack owns the local lumber mill, Grace sets out to determine where Pete came from, where he belongs, and the truth about this dragon.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Adventure","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2016-08-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ct9S0m2U2RTCFAVnq3y0nF0Tgb2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/A9x4Ogk8KUXTfU649NS6lS9TCmu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ct9S0m2U2RTCFAVnq3y0nF0Tgb2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//A9x4Ogk8KUXTfU649NS6lS9TCmu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":251981,"title":"The World of Kanako","description":"When Kanako, a model daughter and a brilliant student, disappears, her mother asks her ex-husband, a violent former policeman, to find her. As his investigation progresses, his idealized image of Kanako cracks: the girl hides a dark life that her father can not even imagine.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Mystery","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2014-07-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9CIPFIgFhKQd3ExuhQ0N3NmyxCl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/y7JSRcBg1Wm3ZoMI3xsRm6L6N0m.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9CIPFIgFhKQd3ExuhQ0N3NmyxCl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//y7JSRcBg1Wm3ZoMI3xsRm6L6N0m.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":53932,"title":"The Ages of Lulu","description":"Fifteen-year-old Lulu has never known any affection from her family. But when she goes to a rock concert with Pablo, a friend of the family, he introduces Lulu to her first sexual experience. Years later, Pablo and Lulu have married; Pablo has created a sheltered, private world for Lulu, into which nothing intrudes. However, Lulu tires of her cloistered existence, and begins hanging out in shady bars, looking for vicarious thrills and danger.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1990-12-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jz6QSRsQWQUsj8iIdcHltbKkBs3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/