30:00","genre":["Action","Comedy"],"release_date":"2003-02-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3Dj0PASsZymZ98X9m0iW39qCFaj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uKHXQGqnr1pVfKWv8vGPgWusWuE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3Dj0PASsZymZ98X9m0iW39qCFaj.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uKHXQGqnr1pVfKWv8vGPgWusWuE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5551,"title":"Space Cowboys","description":"Frank Corvin, ‘Hawk’ Hawkins, Jerry O''Neill and ‘Tank’ Sullivan were hotdog members of Project Daedalus, the US Air Force''s test program for space travel, but their hopes were dashed in 1958 with the formation of NASA and the use of trained chimps. They blackmail their way into orbit when Russia''s mysterious ‘Ikon’ communications satellite''s orbit begins to degrade and threatens to crash to Earth.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Thriller"],"release_date":"2000-08-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sUye6BrOjlpoAKRMjcP0YwiUvHW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hPzt1bbA1sUDQOl6Vujmyz2hjLN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sUye6BrOjlpoAKRMjcP0YwiUvHW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hPzt1bbA1sUDQOl6Vujmyz2hjLN.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":3101,"title":"I Love You to Death","description":"Joey Boca is the owner of a pizza parlour, and has been married to Rosalie for years. When Rosalie discovers that Joey is a womanizer and has been cheating on her for a long time, she goes to extreme lengths to punish him.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime","Romance"],"release_date":"1990-04-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/joBJxmTxjQNN9q14UoCMkTBiIMH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8LdWJLUfEa5JeUJ7SljJQMIJikZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//joBJxmTxjQNN9q14UoCMkTBiIMH.jpg","