end Keri Johnson, takes Jamie''s sweet brother Bill under his wing and manages what Sheriff Loomis couldn''t; eliminate Packard''s criminal gang the hard way...","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Action","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1986-10-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oRwBASyG34mwSpIR1CSao123Xi4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vHrNnqqRYWzkkrJV8MtmUGgC4Kk.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oRwBASyG34mwSpIR1CSao123Xi4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vHrNnqqRYWzkkrJV8MtmUGgC4Kk.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":723419,"title":"Mr. Harrigan''s Phone","description":"Craig, a young boy living in a small town befriends an older, reclusive billionaire, Mr. Harrigan. The two form a bond over books and an iPhone, but when the man passes away the boy discovers that not everything dead is gone.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Drama","Horror","Mystery"],"release_date":"2022-09-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jEdiZMbWkw8iWE8dBqLzyhwxAYd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gPn9e8eP7TeKQU4IeWAMzOajR40.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jEdiZMbWkw8iWE8dBqLzyhwxAYd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gPn9e8eP7TeKQU4IeWAMzOajR40.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":418970,"title":"Just to Be Sure","description":"Erwan, a strapping Breton who clears mines for a living, is shaken when he discovers that his father is not his father. Despite his affection for the man who raised him, he quietly sets out to find his biological father, and succeeds in locating Joseph, an endearing old codger he takes a liking to. Just when things look settled, another unexpected “bomb” hits Erwan in the form of Anna, an elusive nymph.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2017-09-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/588O5O6C0Wq8RfIctuthalUkW3n.jpg","