ation":"1:34:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Drama"],"release_date":"2011-10-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dOeQPKVa9verEARmAzzZd9qb5tp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9GH6VRhwI5SrD178aqPCI1Xpf4P.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dOeQPKVa9verEARmAzzZd9qb5tp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9GH6VRhwI5SrD178aqPCI1Xpf4P.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":47245,"title":"Journey with Papa","description":"Armando is the daddy, Cristiano is the adult son. Each of them lives his life in a different way respect the other: Armando is an old play-boy and often he \"buys\" his women with his money; Cristiano is a shy guy who lives in a community with other guys like him. The movie proceeds showing us, ironically, the differences, the different ways to think, to act, to treat the women between father and son.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1982-12-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/d0uISP0ZxxSEWeKcAxzdCfFo9mD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dAp4UQZIfQfJTyn7N4fdQdtSYRF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//d0uISP0ZxxSEWeKcAxzdCfFo9mD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dAp4UQZIfQfJTyn7N4fdQdtSYRF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10898,"title":"The Little Mermaid II: Return to the Sea","description":"Set several years after the first film, Ariel and Prince Eric are happily married with a daughter, Melody. In order to protect Melody from the Sea Witch, Morgana, they have not told her about her mermaid heritage. Melody is curious and ventures into the sea, where she meets new friends. But will she become a pawn in Morgana''s quest to take control of the ocean from King Triton?","duration":"1:15:00","genre":["Animation","Adventure","Family","Comedy"],"release_date":"2000-01-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rNOeiC5uruGnr5n7YW8hv