iful Mircalla Karnstein. Years of peace follow that grisly night until Mircalla reappears to avenge her family''s decimation and satisfy her desire for blood.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Horror"],"release_date":"1970-10-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wbherYlV9zGsivnNxzpldjkYkuC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6MTiYnp62i2kdweHjhchwJscQrj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wbherYlV9zGsivnNxzpldjkYkuC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6MTiYnp62i2kdweHjhchwJscQrj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10715,"title":"Looney Tunes: Back in Action","description":"Fed up with all the attention going to Bugs Bunny, Daffy Duck quits Hollywood, teams up with recently-fired stuntman Damien Drake Jr. and embarks on a round-the-world adventure, along with Bugs and The VP of Warner Bros. Their mission? Find Damien''s father, and the missing blue diamond... and stay one step ahead of The Acme Corp., who wants the diamond for their own purposes.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"2003-11-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iZiYzix7sMS0NEWsHURSzHF1wxt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/q0kntpdsHA0QdYjpQdNBqrVTdQq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iZiYzix7sMS0NEWsHURSzHF1wxt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//q0kntpdsHA0QdYjpQdNBqrVTdQq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10057,"title":"The Three Musketeers","description":"D''Artagnan travels to Paris hoping to become a musketeer, one of the French king''s elite bodyguards, only to discover that the corps has been disbanded by conniving Cardinal Richelieu, who secretly hopes to usurp the throne. Fortunately, Athos, Porthos and Aramis have refused to lay down their weapons and continue to protect their king. D''Artagnan joins with the rogues to expose Richelieu''s plot against the crown.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Comedy"],"release_date":"1993-11-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1M7eNvLkrAbhQDbcoBnVfzanHcT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mk8UH7JRmK8adcqJJpB1ygP7B1C.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1M7eNvLkrAbhQDbcoBnVfzanHcT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mk8UH7JRmK8adcqJJpB1ygP7B1C.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2428,"title":"The Greatest Story Ever Told","description":"From his birth in Bethlehem to his death and eventual resurrection, the life of Jesus Christ is given the all-star treatment in this epic retelling. Major aspects of Christ''s life are touched upon, including the execution of all the newborn males in Egypt by King Herod; Christ''s baptism by John the Baptist; and the betrayal by Judas after the Last Supper that eventually leads to Christ''s crucifixion and miraculous return.","duration":"3:19:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"1965-04-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/f6JjKDXn66XgNnYjBcKiwO4h3A7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/c21ON7BZn0jwdNl6ibZ1vhXJmpy.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//f6JjKDXn66XgNnYjBcKiwO4h3A7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//c21ON7BZn0jwdNl6ibZ1vhXJmpy.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2093,"title":"Amsterdamned","description":"A mysterious diver hiding in Amsterdam''s canal system embarks on a rampage of gruesome murders, terrifying city officials and leaving few clues for the city''s best detective, who doesn''t suspect that both his new girlfriend and twelve-year-old daughter may be closer than he is to finding the killer.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Action","Horror","Thriller"],"release_date":"1988-02-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cbo6XxLWVtZCJpKHx5IZ8C0q7OE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uNPQUEd