ge across hostile wasteland.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Horror","Thriller"],"release_date":"2013-08-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yadP27a0OsNINtPZxqgluxiuJc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uELzdTzPOpZwSFqBbwpjuKE7UW3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yadP27a0OsNINtPZxqgluxiuJc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uELzdTzPOpZwSFqBbwpjuKE7UW3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":58232,"title":"Chalet Girl","description":"While working a job at an exclusive ski resort to support her Dad, Kim learns to snowboard and is so good at it that she enters a competition with a huge cash prize. She has to dig deep to overcome her fears, but her life gets more complicated through her spoken-for boss, Jonny.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2011-02-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ovq99oayVGCKEBUPeqT1SvQQwDU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uzHIG8nXums3sCAiO4w5heZi3Hc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ovq99oayVGCKEBUPeqT1SvQQwDU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uzHIG8nXums3sCAiO4w5heZi3Hc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":49529,"title":"John Carter","description":"John Carter is a war-weary, former military captain who''s inexplicably transported to the mysterious and exotic planet of Barsoom (Mars) and reluctantly becomes embroiled in an epic conflict. It''s a world on the brink of collapse, and Carter rediscovers his humanity when he realizes the survival of Barsoom and its people rests in his hands.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2012-03-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hj5RynBrJB1Wlz84t3lJj9DuTJh.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lCxz1Yus07QCQQCb6I0Dr3Lmqpx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hj