rious hacker, but they must use their computer skills to find the evidence while being pursued by the Secret Service and the evil computer genius behind the virus.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"1995-09-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8fyeM5YyqSY7ZlyVr2Zyfsrmiib.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qfx2EENW1sOpKNVKLzr7VOhlxkt.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8fyeM5YyqSY7ZlyVr2Zyfsrmiib.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qfx2EENW1sOpKNVKLzr7VOhlxkt.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":7220,"title":"The Punisher","description":"When undercover FBI agent Frank Castle''s wife and son are slaughtered, he becomes ''the Punisher'' -- a ruthless vigilante willing to go to any length to avenge his family.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2004-04-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ziexSS07RmowuyqAdJMh1sGxjHg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7rmA1HwYp2GKM85BL0cVwCaosGr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ziexSS07RmowuyqAdJMh1sGxjHg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7rmA1HwYp2GKM85BL0cVwCaosGr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1713,"title":"Jungle Fever","description":"A successful and married black man contemplates having an affair with a white girl from work. He''s quite rightly worried that the racial difference would make an already taboo relationship even worse.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1991-06-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2YQfKfYX0mvHPnFMP5wiL1kYYBU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pw7cOdwCylBuiv6rvosBSkcgKEe.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2YQfKfYX0mvHPnFMP5wiL1kYYBU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pw7cOdwCylBuiv6rvosBSkcgKEe.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":826914,"title":"Muppets Haunted Mansion","description":"On Halloween night, Gonzo and Pepe are challenged to face their fears and stay in the Haunted Mansion until sunrise,  encountering many frightening, funny, and perhaps a little familiar, phantoms over the course of their stay.","duration":"0:52:00","genre":["Comedy","Family","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2021-10-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/b6olvKvBQwduyu1TQlHfyjTwjgm.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AeVMV8cMvNhn6aKozAH3pysvftm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//b6olvKvBQwduyu1TQlHfyjTwjgm.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AeVMV8cMvNhn6aKozAH3pysvftm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":504631,"title":"Mermaid Down","description":"A mermaid is ripped from the ocean by a fishing crew only to be tortured and to have her tail cut off. A seemingly helpful stranger intervenes, but then locks her away in an institution for mentally disturbed young women, where no one believes she is a mermaid. With no way out, she is forced to count on her survival instincts, and fight for her life at all costs.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Horror","Fantasy","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2019-10-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7cQKUEcRkw2EeK7KDn8eRqS3XkC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oB281saxibom0KC3Ndz81aJJtaa.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7cQKUEcRkw2EeK7KDn8eRqS3XkC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oB281saxibom0KC3Ndz81aJJtaa.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":278247,"title":"Walt Before Mickey","description":"Based on the book \"Walt Before Mickey\" covers the early years of Walt Disney''s career. The legendary Walt Disney had a tumultuous childhood, yet he was determined to overcome obstacles in his path, before the creation of his first iconic character: Mickey Mouse.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2015-08-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eyqQc3XeGYIpJa1SSkmRg6zXw3W.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/o1JYnewI5WTDAUAAlZdgnAzDdPs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eyqQc3XeGYIpJa1SSkmRg6zXw3W.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//o1JYnewI5WTDAUAAlZdgnAzDdPs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":258099,"title":"Just Before I Go","description":"Ted Morgan has been treading water for most of his life. After his wife leaves him, Ted realizes he has nothing left to live for.  Summoning the courage for one last act, Ted decides to go home and face the people he feels are responsible for creating the shell of a person he has become.  But life is tricky.  The more determined Ted is to confront his demons, to get closure, and to withdraw from his family, the more Ted is yanked into the chaos of their lives. So, when Ted Morgan decides to kill himself, he finds a reason to live.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2015-04-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/x6i6ktXpzsrFKyg5MOxTugxLB5v.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rEwXZIOh3CLVA5JJmxT5kaYY6ff.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//x6i6ktXpzsrFKyg5MOxTugxLB5v.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rEwXZIOh3CLVA5JJmxT5kaYY6ff.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":21610,"title":"Nighthawks","description":"When one of Europe''s most lethal terrorists shows up in New York, an elite undercover cop is assigned to take him down by any means necessary.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"1981-03-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ivc30gIDwLfAJLNDqjiVpX9Cn62.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2QgpCgOmlgvOPMMC0OrgCv5EKIf.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ivc30gID