940s in the small town of Jupiter Hollow, two sets of identical twins are born in the same hospital on the same night. One set to a poor local family and the other to a rich family just passing through. The dizzy nurse on duty accidentally mixes the twins unbeknown to the parents. Our story flashes forward to the 1980s where the mismatched sets of twins are about to cross paths.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1988-06-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fH08Brcs0QmunZJ2JoyLI9e4KLe.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dxbXbR1P44caMUKtBdq7sX6aSgw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fH08Brcs0QmunZJ2JoyLI9e4KLe.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dxbXbR1P44caMUKtBdq7sX6aSgw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12253,"title":"Biker Boyz","description":"A mythic motorcycle tale of father and son, this is the story of Manuel Galloway, also known as \"the King of Cali\", the president of a motorcycle club whose members are all African-American men, mostly white-collar workers who exchange their suits and ties at night and on weekends for leather outfits and motorcycle helmets.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Action","Drama"],"release_date":"2003-01-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pxz6PBvEGiaT2giDIXekjpfrhwl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/frb2Tk7DTBshZ61Or0D3M1kslWL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pxz6PBvEGiaT2giDIXekjpfrhwl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//frb2Tk7DTBshZ61Or0D3M1kslWL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11564,"title":"Class of 1984","description":"Andy is a new teacher at an inner city high school that is unlike any he has seen before. There are metal detectors at the front door and the place is basically run by a tough kid named Peter Stegman. Soon, Andy and Stegman become enemies and Stegman will stop at nothing to protect his turf and drug dealing business.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1982-08-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ke6cDBFg4IPb8MWjPOBlIhtosQ0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qIu9UGDLeACl7YGuAAgTFfQ0j8I.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ke6cDBFg4IPb8MWjPOBlIhtosQ0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qIu9UGDLeACl7YGuAAgTFfQ0j8I.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9718,"title":"Talladega Nights: The Ballad of Ricky Bobby","description":"The fastest man on four wheels, Ricky Bobby, is one of the greatest drivers in NASCAR history. A big, hairy American winning machine, Ricky has everything a dimwitted daredevil could want, a luxurious mansion, a smokin'' hot wife, and all the fast food he can eat. But Ricky''s turbo-charged lifestyle hits an unexpected speed bump when he''s bested by flamboyant Euro-idiot Jean Girard and reduced to a fear-ridden wreck.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2006-08-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qTVgXx0pgBmsGqc8wJsfbd71ppa.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3iCiTqsmJz1mO85AHzTiHNkRmb6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qTVgXx0pgBmsGqc8wJsfbd71ppa.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3iCiTqsmJz1mO85AHzTiHNkRmb6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":6637,"title":"National Treasure: Book of Secrets","description":"Benjamin Franklin Gates and Abigail Chase re-team with Riley Poole and, now armed with a stack of long-lost pages from John Wilkes Booth''s diary, Ben must follow a clue left there to prove his ancestor''s innocence in the assassination of Abraham Lincoln.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Mystery"],"release_date":"2007-12-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aqGVdM065tIcVmaMIeozk80lLf6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xxoIBbvmTj1ZttzV439jAvoovTw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aqGVdM065tIcVmaMIeozk80lLf6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xxoIBbvmTj1ZttzV439jAvoovTw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1094974,"title":"Take Cover","description":"A burned-out professional sniper finds himself trapped in an all-glass penthouse by a lethal competitor and must find a way to survive and escape with little to no cover between him and the killer.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2024-10-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1aOPPkXASkd2By3EKIw66Ilx5qF.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xNLiMNyFzKTL9PVIEulG55Hei8j.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1aOPPkXASkd2By3EKIw66Ilx5qF.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xNLiMNyFzKTL9PVIEulG55Hei8j.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":345911,"title":"Lights Out","description":"Rebecca must unlock the terror behind her little brother''s experiences that once tested her sanity, bringing her face to face with a supernatural spirit attached to their mother.","duration":"1:21:00","genre":["Horror","Mystery"],"release_date":"2016-07-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xxyAStrE7vVeKto3dGDAKAZRM68.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AjZXonSbqC3LdSr8xCUzMiQksrM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xxyAStrE7vVeKto3dGDAKAZRM68.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AjZXonSbqC3LdSr8xCUzMiQksrM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":77949,"title":"The Awakening","description":"In post–War England, a writer and sometime-ghost hunter investigates a reported haunting at a boys boarding school.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Horror","Thriller","Mystery"],"release_date":"2011-08-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1Rw3KOjmKY4QrJ9MKugIo3F5FjO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/txmiJkl8su0jkEABLIHZBqVHrTj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1Rw3KOjmKY4QrJ9MKugIo3F5FjO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//txmiJkl8su0jkEABLIHZBqVHrTj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":25627,"title":"The Living Dead at Manchester Morgue","description":"When a series of murders hit the remote English countryside, a detective suspects a pair of travelers when it is actually the work of the undead, jarred back to life by an experimental ultra-sonic radiation machine used by the Ministry of Agriculture to kill insects.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Horror","Science Fiction","Drama"],"release_date":"1974-11-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9xxF1MBsXJ3Y2EJQsqU61StzcNU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jfa3HmGdq1MZSLaJKtj1st1MDF7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9xxF1MBsXJ3Y2EJQsqU61StzcNU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jfa3HmGdq1MZSLaJKtj1st1MDF7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":17657,"title":"Ice Station Zebra","description":"A top-secret Soviet spy satellite -- using stolen Western technology -- malfunctions and then goes into a descent that lands it near an isolated Arctic research encampment called Ice Station Zebra, belonging to the British, which starts sending out distress signals before falling silent. The atomic submarine Tigerfish, commanded by Cmdr. James Ferraday, is dispatched to save them.","duration":"2:29:00","genre":["Thriller","Adventure"],"release_date":"1968-04-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/soKjkMeyySehYjaXuhkteiskSYE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/euPqp2J79zAomdgCcdpCmqjRHMy.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//soKjkMeyySehYjaXuhkteiskSYE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//euPqp2J79zAomdgCcdpCmqjRHMy.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":6687,"title":"TransSiberian","description":"A TransSiberian train journey from China to Moscow becomes a thrilling chase of deception and murder when an American couple encounters a mysterious pair of fellow travelers.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Thriller","Crime","Mystery"],"release_date":"2008-01-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dpSrTZIWeI3u025LSUOjV9FHFvf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dhTOda5CLp9tEdDzQZiqBTdv5lR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dpSrTZIWeI3u025LSUOjV9FHFvf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dhTOda5CLp9tEdDzQZiqBTdv5lR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1003580,"title":"Legion of Super-Heroes","description":"Kara, devastated by the loss of Krypton, struggles to adjust to her new life on Earth. Her cousin, Superman, mentors her and suggests she leave their space-time to attend the Legion Academy in the 31st century, where she makes new friends and a new enemy: Brainiac 5. Meanwhile, she must contend with a mysterious group called the Dark Circle as it searches for a powerful weapon held in the Academy’s vault.","duration":"1:24:00","genre":["Animation","Science Fiction","Action"],"release_date":"2023-02-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/n9pwLwQ4ClAoGenTwkkunfK2onH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3whQLi8RI7h2h2Si2KTDFJxfEcR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//n9pwLwQ4ClAoGenTwkkunfK2onH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3whQLi8RI7h2h2Si2KTDFJxfEcR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":733317,"title":"Monsters of Man","description":"A robotics company vying to win a lucrative military contract team up with a corrupt CIA agent to conduct an illegal live field test. They deploy four weaponized prototype robots into a suspected drug manufacturing camp in the Golden Triangle, assuming they''d be killing drug runners that no one would miss. Six doctors on a humanitarian mission witness the brutal slaughter and become prime targets.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Action"],"release_date":"2020-11-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cxwImFWajltfkBhsTEy8ZXiQ9NP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sENLgxCVtZqCMQIeuLep8FmdInr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cxwImFWajltfkBhsTEy8ZXiQ9NP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sENLgxCVtZqCMQIeuLep8FmdInr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":674944,"title":"The Occupant","description":"An unemployed executive is forced to sell his apartment. When he discovers that he still has the keys, he becomes obsessed with the family that now lives there and decides to recover the life he has lost, at any price.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"2020-03-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9BfKS8tA0rpMxTW99masRde1bIV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pNM2VmqS2FBL92EJ0fUPLgoij8x.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9BfKS8tA0rpMxTW99masRde1bIV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pNM2VmqS2FBL92EJ0fUPLgoij8x.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":222461,"title":"Wer","description":"A defense attorney begins to suspect that her client, who is charged with the murders of a vacationing family, might be more than meets the eye.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Horror","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2013-11-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rxf3zpKOxQTc0xobKewnGpFdNUt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hWkkgAuYIyXxNDUs5zydwEr9xfg.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rxf3zpKOxQTc0xobKewnGpFdNUt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hWkkgAuYIyXxNDUs5zydwEr9xfg.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":134597,"title":"The Collection","description":"Arkin escapes with his life from the vicious grips of \"The Collector\" during an entrapment party where he adds beautiful Elena to his \"Collection.\" Instead of recovering from the trauma, Arkin is suddenly abducted from the hospital by mercenaries hired by Elena''s wealthy father. Arkin is blackmailed to team up with the mercenaries and track down The Collector''s booby trapped warehouse and save Elena.","duration":"1:22:00","genre":["Horror","Thriller"],"release_date":"2012-11-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9wILyQxVRQZ7Ixfl1NGjKvcoC02.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qbhJiXi48fRQevHf56i2JmYqyJ7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9wILyQxVRQZ7Ixfl1NGjKvcoC02.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qbhJiXi48fRQevHf56i2JmYqyJ7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":61891,"title":"Anonymous","description":"Set against the backdrop of the succession of Queen Elizabeth I, and the Essex Rebellion against her, the story advances the theory that it was in fact Edward De Vere, Earl of Oxford who penned Shakespeare''s plays.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Drama","History","Thriller"],"release_date":"2011-10-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5fKDsHMfY3K7vV1JFECYaafnwwx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mRjdFP0kqCPaDKeXgQtsb7how6e.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5fKDsHMfY3K7vV1JFECYaafnwwx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mRjdFP0kqCPaDKeXgQtsb7how6e.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14671,"title":"Summer School","description":"A high-school gym teacher has big plans for the summer, but is forced to cancel them to teach a \"bonehead\" English class for misfit goof-off students. Fortunately, his unconventional brand of teaching fun field trips begins to connect with them, and even inspires ardor in some.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1987-07-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wy4yQpONIh1e5qyvi0j7a9ha8Kp.jpg","poster_path":"htt