n order to be reinstated to the bar and recover custody of her daughter, a hotshot lawyer, now in recovery and on probation, must take on the appeal of a woman wrongfully convicted of murder.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2013-11-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3G8dPy3q6qfEW2o4CCB3gDk2qJY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2u9raM4MWJTtGVQ7MeYwfgGouRl.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3G8dPy3q6qfEW2o4CCB3gDk2qJY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2u9raM4MWJTtGVQ7MeYwfgGouRl.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":82682,"title":"Gangster Squad","description":"Los Angeles, 1949. Ruthless, Brooklyn-born mob king Mickey Cohen runs the show in this town, reaping the ill-gotten gains from the drugs, the guns, the prostitutes and — if he has his way — every wire bet placed west of Chicago. And he does it all with the protection of not only his own paid goons, but also the police and the politicians who are under his control. It’s enough to intimidate even the bravest, street-hardened cop… except, perhaps, for the small, secret crew of LAPD outsiders led by Sgt. John O’Mara and Jerry Wooters who come together to try to tear Cohen’s world apart.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2013-01-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9LalKDfdttu9z8Ag1UKTTO66FzA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wAuQNTBFBu2yXZsX6yLhUPiwTlW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9LalKDfdttu9z8Ag1UKTTO66FzA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wAuQNTBFBu2yXZsX6yLhUPiwTlW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":78854,"title":"Easy!","description":"The life of a melancholy professor is turned upside down when he discovers that a rebellious teenager he is tutoring is actually his son.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2011-11-18","backdro