ieces. His only problem: His production capacity is way to small so he gets to produce the machines in his private house. His wife Bernadette is far from being happy about it. Her private life goes down the line so she decides to leave Guillaume and to finally have revenge she candidates for major against her husband...","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1978-03-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/msk2t0Lriy9vbGWPSEI1hH3ZcUJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lQ3IUf65maoUtVIhfHurD0KzduD.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//msk2t0Lriy9vbGWPSEI1hH3ZcUJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lQ3IUf65maoUtVIhfHurD0KzduD.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9333,"title":"Last Man Standing","description":"John Smith is a mysterious stranger who is drawn into a vicious war between two Prohibition-era gangs. In a dangerous game, he switches allegiances from one to another, offering his services to the highest bidder. As the death toll mounts, Smith takes the law into his own hands in a deadly race to stay alive.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Action","Crime"],"release_date":"1996-09-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2wpoSvwPkCMJeVTrjkMUAF5B1sW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2cWqlkXaKKdl32Waep4FwCQnyH0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2wpoSvwPkCMJeVTrjkMUAF5B1sW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2cWqlkXaKKdl32Waep4FwCQnyH0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":811,"title":"Silent Running","description":"After the entire flora goes extinct, ecologist Lowell maintains a greenhouse aboard a space station for the future with his android companions. However, he rebels after being ordered to destroy the greenhouse in favor of carrying cargo, a decision that puts him at odds with everyone but his mechanical companions.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Adventure","Drama"],"release_date":"1972-03-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5QTwfS9vcr22Nl7PCcUro7dEMFq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ahasZ5HILZHtlrl6cbXgpfk0y8H.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5QTwfS9vcr22Nl7PCcUro7dEMFq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ahasZ5HILZHtlrl6cbXgpfk0y8H.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":594767,"title":"Shazam! Fury of the Gods","description":"Billy Batson and his foster siblings, who transform into superheroes by saying \"Shazam!\", are forced to get back into action and fight the Daughters of Atlas, who they must stop from using a weapon that could destroy the world.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Comedy","Action","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2023-03-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kQV9sV0IbastbU5FYxuYwxfMawz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3GrRgt6CiLIUXUtoktcv1g2iwT5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kQV9sV0IbastbU5FYxuYwxfMawz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3GrRgt6CiLIUXUtoktcv1g2iwT5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":73454,"title":"X","description":"A veteran call girl and a runaway prostitute witness a murder which sends them on an out-of-control roller coaster ride through the twilight zone of sex-for-sale.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Romance"],"release_date":"2011-11-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AlqDoPCHBqrqRNpAWkAmltIFTR1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nvU6uTwSpMpitM6mnuYXb1LgxxX.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AlqDoPCHBqrqRNpAWkAmltIFTR1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nvU6uTwSpMpitM6mnuYXb1LgxxX.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11002,"title":"Greystoke: The Legend of Tarzan, Lord of the Apes","description":"A shipping disaster in the 19th Century has stranded a man and woman in the wilds of Africa. The lady is pregnant, and gives birth to a son in their tree house. Soon after, a family of apes stumble across the house and in the ensuing panic, both parents are killed. A female ape takes the tiny boy as a replacement for her own dead infant, and raises him as her son. Twenty years later, Captain Phillippe D''Arnot discovers the man who thinks he is an ape. Evidence in the tree house leads him to believe that he is the direct descendant of the Earl of Greystoke, and thus takes it upon himself to return the man to civilization.","duration":"2:23:00","genre":["Adventure","Drama"],"release_date":"1984-03-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/m7kARS3kMIEFaTtTeSY8w8GHtaF.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rdtEIdzqJTVhSLsjuR4U9t1KKxp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//m7kARS3kMIEFaTtTeSY8w8GHtaF.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rdtEIdzqJTVhSLsjuR4U9t1KKxp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10394,"title":"Gangster No. 1","description":"An old gangster is advised that Freddie Mays would leave jail after thirty years in prison. His mood changes and he recalls when he was a young punk and who joined Freddie''s gang—a man he both envied and ultimately betrayed.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Action","Drama","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2000-06-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8zmWwgtiPCWBzxCiRHdmBZoPvXc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/t8eUSsD2reaIR9qmklU7O2GCVn4.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8zmWwgtiPCWBzxCiRHdmBZoPvXc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//t8eUSsD2reaIR9qmklU7O2GCVn4.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1280450,"title":"Stolen Girl","description":"In 1993, Maureen’s six-year-old daughter Amina is snuck out of the country by her ex-husband, Karim. After years of unsuccessful attempts to find her, Maureen intersects with a professional retriever of internationally abducted children who promises to help her find Amina in exchange for her collaboration.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Thriller","Action","Adventure"],"release_date":"2025-09-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/l23DWcm586XAv97PDX6zZEH8Ofy.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/njU663VbT88zZjsJYizfWcam6sS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//l23DWcm586XAv97PDX6zZEH8Ofy.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//njU663VbT88zZjsJYizfWcam6sS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":840464,"title":"Greenland 2: Migration","description":"Having found the safety of the Greenland bunker after the comet Clarke decimated the Earth, the Garrity family must now risk everything to embark on a perilous journey across the wasteland of Europe to find a new home.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Adventure","Thriller","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2026-01-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cLFbDVfhllIMybpo2fkGNzehiQG.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/z2tqCJLsw6uEJ8nJV8BsQXGa3dr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cLFbDVfhllIMybpo2fkGNzehiQG.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//z2tqCJLsw6uEJ8nJV8BsQXGa3dr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":477033,"title":"Errementari: The Blacksmith and the Devil","description":"Basque Country, Spain, 1843. A police constable arrives at a small village in Álava to investigate a mysterious blacksmith who lives alone deep in the woods.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Drama","Fantasy","Horror"],"release_date":"2018-03-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sP3xtGBYcQejqkTn22aZz8c3U8v.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ltpi1uLkvx2BKHWwbpMjqdAtdHn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sP3xtGBYcQejqkTn22aZz8c3U8v.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ltpi1uLkvx2BKHWwbpMjqd