is new egg-sitting service. However, dastardly pirate bunny, Squint, who is seeking revenge on the herd, steals, camouflages and hides all the eggs. Once again, with Squint’s twin brother assisting, Manny, Diego and the rest of the gang come to the rescue and take off on a daring mission that turns into the world’s first Easter egg hunt.","duration":"0:25:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Family","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2016-03-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cwQ7IO6ZNBnlQ1b8zA7pXzkdT5S.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ysQqYp9G37Q114Nc6uvCHbDmaj6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cwQ7IO6ZNBnlQ1b8zA7pXzkdT5S.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ysQqYp9G37Q114Nc6uvCHbDmaj6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":295699,"title":"Everybody Wants Some!!","description":"A comedy that follows a group of friends as they navigate their way through the freedoms and responsibilities of unsupervised adulthood.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2016-03-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/31M4Rty4wAeRqVuykwJqTKIh0Ed.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vAIFZ8bw0spSvcIYgfuX99B3H2w.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//31M4Rty4wAeRqVuykwJqTKIh0Ed.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vAIFZ8bw0spSvcIYgfuX99B3H2w.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":44754,"title":"Margaret","description":"17-year-old Lisa feels certain that she inadvertently played a role in causing a traffic accident that claimed a woman''s life. In her attempts to set things right, she meets with opposition at every step. Torn apart with frustration, she begins emotionally brutalizing her family, her friends, her teachers, and, most of all, herself. She has been confronted quite unexpectedly with a basic truth: that her youthful ideals are on a collision course with the realities and compromises of the adult world.","duration":"2:30:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2011-09-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ugDpO1cu2RxL1URucxPLkT31KG3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zqBao8uRH6TQAJd13tqC22vPB76.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ugDpO1cu2RxL1URucxPLkT31KG3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zqBao8uRH6TQAJd13tqC22vPB76.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11890,"title":"Oscar","description":"Angelo \"Snaps\" Provolone made his dying father a promise on his deathbed: he would leave the world of crime and become an honest businessman. Despite having no experience in making money in a legal fashion, Snaps sets about to keep his promise.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1991-04-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6fAIKXVzkIil9NEyYuwvSivWvV9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rGJOzUwHlkx8MKy2oR2qEiT7g4G.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6fAIKXVzkIil9NEyYuwvSivWvV9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rGJOzUwHlkx8MKy2oR2qEiT7g4G.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11861,"title":"How to Make an American Quilt","description":"Soon-to-be-wed graduate student Finn Dodd develops cold feet when she suspects her fiancé is cheating on her. In order to clear her head, Finn visits her grandmother, Hy, and great aunt, Glady Joe Cleary, in Grasse, Calif. There, Finn learns that Hy and Glady Joe are members of a group of passionate quilters, and over the course of her visit she is regaled with tales of love and life by women who have collected rich experiences and much wisdom.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1995-10-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nOPCU3zmLTp1A6KpPtHTuAyzkf5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pI9UAemlWgdrnjRgYJsbTk8BSJc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.