t of Crime","description":"Fisher, an ex-detective, decides to take one final case when a mysterious serial killer claims the lives of several young girls. Fisher, unable to find the culprit, turns to Osbourne, a writer who was once respected for his contributions to the field of criminology. Fisher begins to use Osbourne''s technique, which involves empathizing with serial killers; however, as the detective becomes increasingly engrossed in this method, things take a disturbing turn.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1984-05-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zpkSkHXm81jlFgXmTmmGQ4TuUzo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sfg5KUOdR4bfoPiDf63LVG7mlfw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zpkSkHXm81jlFgXmTmmGQ4TuUzo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sfg5KUOdR4bfoPiDf63LVG7mlfw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":299,"title":"Ocean''s Eleven","description":"Danny Ocean and his gang attempt to rob the five biggest casinos in Las Vegas in one night.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Crime","Comedy","Thriller"],"release_date":"1960-08-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vJLSt7NvYP85nR4XJ8CxnMadf6G.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/A4R6u7SidBPVXMVzGSysCiRGTRz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vJLSt7NvYP85nR4XJ8CxnMadf6G.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//A4R6u7SidBPVXMVzGSysCiRGTRz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":527385,"title":"After the Wedding","description":"Seeking funds for her orphanage in India, Isabelle travels to New York to meet Theresa, a wealthy benefactor. An invitation to attend a wedding ignites a series of events in which the past collides with the present while mysteries unravel.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2019-08-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ofPRKAHbAhKHzo