-09-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/21i0STBZUzhdNqJ2SpiBFpUGWZw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3TfJL5jbyWFUOe1NB81iI8w7Gct.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//21i0STBZUzhdNqJ2SpiBFpUGWZw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3TfJL5jbyWFUOe1NB81iI8w7Gct.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2661,"title":"Batman","description":"The Dynamic Duo faces four super-villains who plan to hold the world for ransom with the help of a secret invention that instantly dehydrates people.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Action","Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"1966-07-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nOWOU0bdX76iF9XA1YPlInLbI4Y.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iBaHizz1sfMs4N03aHsGe7I2G6S.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nOWOU0bdX76iF9XA1YPlInLbI4Y.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iBaHizz1sfMs4N03aHsGe7I2G6S.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1619,"title":"The Way of the Gun","description":"Two criminal drifters without sympathy get more than they bargained for after kidnapping and holding for ransom the surrogate mother of a powerful and shady man.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2000-09-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iVpjSpgPlWMU1dSi5pOIg2BTlX1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wrjMMdgn1a4ChlaBmlzKnb78nr6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iVpjSpgPlWMU1dSi5pOIg2BTlX1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wrjMMdgn1a4ChlaBmlzKnb78nr6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1210938,"title":"Revelations","description":"A pastor who believes in divine revelation and a detective haunted by visions pursue a missing person case — exposing their own demons in the process.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Thriller","Crime","Mystery","Horror"],"release_dat