ory.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Family","Comedy","Adventure","Animation"],"release_date":"2017-03-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sN1sIv6YZTpdBr7D9mQBxGzRnLL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/swt9crREg1UcKgg3wGWfoFNlXOz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sN1sIv6YZTpdBr7D9mQBxGzRnLL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//swt9crREg1UcKgg3wGWfoFNlXOz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":25913,"title":"Balto: Wolf Quest","description":"Balto and his daughter Aleu embark on a journey of adventure and self discovery.","duration":"1:15:00","genre":["Family","Animation","Adventure"],"release_date":"2002-04-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/c9yWoqYOB0dA10CpsdEr5i9vK3R.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dZ958HnW3JO2pEZeedjmoZCV8Rn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//c9yWoqYOB0dA10CpsdEr5i9vK3R.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dZ958HnW3JO2pEZeedjmoZCV8Rn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15660,"title":"Mommie Dearest","description":"Renowned film star Joan Crawford''s abuse towards Christina, her adopted daughter, intensifies as her professional and romantic relationships turn sour.","duration":"2:09:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1981-09-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2vObOLMqve3TCcrhXZYCtNdg11b.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3Amv5uQfadEonn7SmYLfNnoeOSu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2vObOLMqve3TCcrhXZYCtNdg11b.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3Amv5uQfadEonn7SmYLfNnoeOSu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10635,"title":"Threesome","description":"At a sizable public college, high-minded student Eddy is forced to room with the slovenly Stuart, but the pair strike up a surprising friendship. When attractive co-ed Alex is assigned to live with the two male students because of her gender-neutral name, a roundabout love triangle ensues. Eddy secretly yearns for Stuart, who wants Alex, but she prefers Eddy. The complex situation leads to sexual experimentation and strained relationships.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1994-04-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xs7v0o0p4VWQ7BMa1XWYZ3coAor.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vR6qwjChOV4Z9940VA9chucNpne.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xs7v0o0p4VWQ7BMa1XWYZ3coAor.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vR6qwjChOV4Z9940VA9chucNpne.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2135,"title":"The Time Machine","description":"Hoping to alter the events of the past, a 19th-century inventor instead travels 800,000 years into the future, where he finds mankind divided into two warring races.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Adventure","Action"],"release_date":"2002-03-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/i0eOILDW8HipIkOUSKhB1dvZzNJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iYayQahkghlbAsfOQX8b5eBzGVy.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//i0eOILDW8HipIkOUSKhB1dvZzNJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iYayQahkghlbAsfOQX8b5eBzGVy.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":920125,"title":"White Men Can''t Jump","description":"Seemingly opposite street hoopers, Jeremy, an injury prone former star, and Kamal, a has-been prodigy, team up to take one final shot at living out their dreams.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2023-05-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oq597AkQ3AOcUO1RdaUS8N6fmrz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/i83Ykng2HVY5EF043zMmeQdLUQY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oq597AkQ3AOcUO1RdaUS8N6fmrz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//i83