de. Victim of three violent hold-ups in a year, which left no survivors, the company is on the verge of bankruptcy and its employees are extremely worried. Some even suggest a complicity between the robbers and the firm.  It is in this difficult context that a man, Alexandre Demarre, one morning presents himself to start his first day of work at Vigilante.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Action","Drama","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2004-04-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kjP6ghSTQAJmN0zzva0PuwLiK88.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/huGODrOTIElqmV3WuOHwo2IFZVv.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kjP6ghSTQAJmN0zzva0PuwLiK88.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//huGODrOTIElqmV3WuOHwo2IFZVv.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11894,"title":"Curly Sue","description":"Bill is a penniless drifter who scams strangers out of just enough money to feed himself and his partner in crime, an orphan girl known as Curly Sue. Bill and Curly Sue target Grey, a yuppie lawyer, but their con takes an unexpected turn when the successful woman begins to like the ramshackle duo. But there''s one problem—Grey''s jealous, conniving boyfriend, Walker.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Family","Romance"],"release_date":"1991-10-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/b7nNVBVKjuuvyoxj7WFvddI1ML3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cndkzlP5frVWxng5HLd4JvA2g2y.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//b7nNVBVKjuuvyoxj7WFvddI1ML3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cndkzlP5frVWxng5HLd4JvA2g2y.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11232,"title":"Kate & Leopold","description":"When her scientist ex-boyfriend discovers a portal to travel through time -- and brings back a 19th-century nobleman named Leopold to prove it -- a skeptical Kate reluctantly takes responsibility for showing Leopold the 21st century. Th