e transformed by one another.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2014-04-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/d3tf2jxjpZNw088CjKQLS3aBIYa.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lQPr7SXQosEeoT0ownuAONtszHT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//d3tf2jxjpZNw088CjKQLS3aBIYa.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lQPr7SXQosEeoT0ownuAONtszHT.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":31867,"title":"Repo Men","description":"In the future, medical technology has advanced to the point where people can buy artificial organs to extend their lives. But if they default on payments, an organization known as the Union sends agents to repossess the organs. Remy is one of the best agents in the business, but when he becomes the recipient of an artificial heart, he finds himself in the same dire straits as his many victims.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Action","Science Fiction","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2010-03-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wQLcXBc0b4yNT542qxcZfb0KM40.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1ZA5kEKuA6HgbyzZXXlyU4piNI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wQLcXBc0b4yNT542qxcZfb0KM40.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1ZA5kEKuA6HgbyzZXXlyU4piNI.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":27581,"title":"The Other Guys","description":"Unlike their heroic counterparts on the force, desk-bound NYPD detectives Gamble and Hoitz garner no headlines as they work day to day. When a seemingly minor case turns out to be a big deal, the two cops get the opportunity to finally prove to their comrades that they have the right stuff.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Comedy","Action","Crime"],"release_date":"2010-08-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nHyri67CN6juBR6hmOefCn9oGf8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wNEHNqo3MgHmj3B