ick and Gina, two wild but well-meaning spirits who help guide them through the lush jungles. The picturesque waterfalls and scenic mountainsides quickly give way to terror when Cliff and Cydney learn of a grisly murder that occurred nearby and realize that they''re being followed by chance acquaintances that suspiciously fit the description of the killers.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Thriller","Mystery","Adventure"],"release_date":"2009-06-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wQE7BCTo9sdGEG5hywmC0hz8NoZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ncuGG0hIlA03dQBJmdoT2LWgodG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wQE7BCTo9sdGEG5hywmC0hz8NoZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ncuGG0hIlA03dQBJmdoT2LWgodG.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10105,"title":"Saints and Soldiers","description":"Five American soldiers fighting in Europe during World War II struggle to return to Allied territory after being separated from U.S. forces during the historic Malmedy Massacre.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["War","Drama","History"],"release_date":"2003-09-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nTyyyUg8p5EWfze3haCzL6aKWfj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/A4LgmMTiRpkEzC6pxRcxE28IDov.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nTyyyUg8p5EWfze3haCzL6aKWfj.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//A4LgmMTiRpkEzC6pxRcxE28IDov.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":145197,"title":"Upstream Color","description":"A man and woman are drawn together, entangled in the lifecycle of an ageless organism. Identity becomes an illusion as they struggle to assemble the loose fragments of wrecked lives.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Drama","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2013-04-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/s1DqTGJ96V0Q8YxL9GZVkJi48jZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tQ4IWxSYIgZVWnQwLCG8r6sUraU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//s1DqTGJ96V0Q8YxL9GZVkJi48jZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tQ4IWxSYIgZVWnQwLCG8r6sUraU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":26866,"title":"Cartouche","description":"In the 18th century, Louis de Bourguignon is working with the Malichot''s gang, but their ways are too ''unethical'' for him. He creates his own band, acting under the name of Cartouche, making audacious robberies of the rich people, and even distributing the takings with the poor. Thus, cartouche attracts the people''s sympathies, Venus''s love, and hate from the Police and Malichot... Cartouche can escape all the traps they set at him - except the entrapments of love. Eventually, he will be saved by a woman, at her own cost.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Adventure","Comedy","Romance","Action"],"release_date":"1962-03-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aeNAF2tnhgjEyaFVjLxthCYvUn5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5j6hcUIXzG8ltLk2yQeFdhJx6jA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aeNAF2tnhgjEyaFVjLxthCYvUn5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5j6hcUIXzG8ltLk2yQeFdhJx6jA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":20497,"title":"Ballet Shoes","description":"An unusual explorer named Gum and his kindly niece adopt three orphans -- Pauline, Petrova and Posy -- and raise them as sisters in 1930s London. But the girls must fend for themselves when Gum doesn''t return from one of his adventures. Together, they nurture their passions for acting, aviation and ballet in this charming TV adaptation of Noel Streatfield''s novel.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Drama","Family"],"release_date":"2008-08-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vHC79hM1bQG5JR9E8nlZn3pwyPt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sG1ef5gIObTeItweZZxhSLJVs8B.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vHC79hM1bQG5JR9E8nlZn3pwyPt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sG1ef5gIObTeItweZZxhSLJVs8B.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":18736,"title":"The Lizzie McGuire Movie","description":"Lizzie McGuire has graduated from middle school and takes a trip to Rome, Italy with her class. And what was supposed to be only a normal trip, becomes a teenager''s dream come true.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Family","Comedy"],"release_date":"2003-05-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hgzX6YBJXI4fvosxvjnPrAmWPNu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cbmv5Amw3sI6ZVwHsNNxg3yZzIm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hgzX6YBJXI4fvosxvjnPrAmWPNu.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cbmv5Amw3sI6ZVwHsNNxg3yZzIm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":18269,"title":"Lady and the Tramp II: Scamp''s Adventure","description":"Lady and Tramp''s mischievous pup, Scamp, gets fed up with rules and restrictions imposed on him by life in a family, and longs for a wild and free lifestyle. He runs away from home and into the streets where he joins a pack of stray dogs known as the \"Junkyard Dogs.\" Buster, the pack''s leader, takes an instant disliking to the \"house-dog\" and considers him a rival. Angel, a junkyard pup Scamp''s age, longs for the safety and comfort of life in a family and the two become instant companions. Will Scamp choose the wild and free life of a stray or the unconditional love of his family?","duration":"1:09:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Romance","Adventure"],"release_date":"2001-02-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rPIVGon9dNpgMvlGKqG2tvIG8vo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nS3nhUZUSY8dWEsRmKILfiOC3F0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rPIVGon9dNpgMvlGKqG2tvIG8vo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nS3nhUZUSY8dWEsRmKILfiOC3F0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":531219,"title":"Roald Dahl''s The Witches","description":"In late 1967, a young orphaned boy goes to live with his loving grandma in the rural Alabama town of Demopolis. As the boy and his grandmother encounter some deceptively glamorous but thoroughly diabolical witches, she wisely whisks him away to a seaside resort. Regrettably, they arrive at precisely the same time that the world''s Grand High Witch has gathered.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Comedy","Fantasy","Family","Horror"],"release_date":"2020-10-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4lWr2j3ZSEe8qlt3W3ma8TiiMQB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/betExZlgK0l7CZ9CsCBVcwO1OjL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4lWr2j3ZSEe8qlt3W3ma8TiiMQB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//betExZlgK0l7CZ9CsCBVcwO1OjL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":118293,"title":"The Suicide Shop","description":"In a cold French city where suicide is a common urge, there is a colorful shop, managed for many years by the Tuvache family, where it is very easy to obtain the necessary tools to satisfy the sinister desires of so many depressed citizens.","duration":"1:19:00","genre":["Comedy","Animation","Music"],"release_date":"2012-09-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hpze9tNyZPFSqYeeSkn4hvXEXwB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yKaWOrawlOXv0RQsJNKAczCLeSq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hpze9tNyZPFSqYeeSkn4hvXEXwB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yKaWOrawlOXv0RQsJNKAczCLeSq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11358,"title":"Walking Tall","description":"A former U.S. soldier returns to his hometown to find it overrun by crime and corruption, which prompts him to clean house.","duration":"1:26:00","genre":["Adventure","Drama","Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2004-04-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kK9WAzCaxN5vxoTgO38wiPIe9ba.jpg","p