ia to wealthy British parents who never wanted her. When her parents suddenly die, she is sent back to England to live with her uncle. She meets her sickly cousin, and the two children find a wondrous secret garden lost in the grounds of Misselthwaite Manor.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Family","Fantasy","Drama"],"release_date":"2020-07-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/usIfpM7Lr3r9fWTvMGZ8HoD1f8f.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5MSDwUcqnGodFTvtlLiLKK0XKS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//usIfpM7Lr3r9fWTvMGZ8HoD1f8f.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5MSDwUcqnGodFTvtlLiLKK0XKS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":308409,"title":"The Commune","description":"A funny and moving story of family and free love set in a freewheeling 1970s commune. When Anna and Erik inherit a huge house, they gather a motley crew of cohabitants to reinvigorate their lives, forcing them to reconcile their new values with old habits.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2016-01-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qP3Iv3SfK63rJUeahjqBLtTGRGt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/evGoMMVXiIOQ1KwSMVnbzHBfX6I.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qP3Iv3SfK63rJUeahjqBLtTGRGt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//evGoMMVXiIOQ1KwSMVnbzHBfX6I.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":121734,"title":"Tad, the Lost Explorer","description":"Tad is a celebrity archaeologist and adventurer just like his hero Max Mordon... in his dreams! In reality, Tad is a Chicago construction worker. One day, however, he is mistaken for a real professor and takes his place on a flight to Peru in search of the lost city of Paititi.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Adventure","Family"],"release_date":"2012-08-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rg10dfOmhP42jTmVs0jRTPQ0WUE.jpg"