d runs off to find it. He returns a couple of days later and attacks Owen, savagely biting him before Jess is able to intervene. Owen is rushed to the hospital. His condition worsens, and no one can figure out why... until Jess discovers a disturbing cure...","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Horror","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2023-01-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tNWZ1fyKYl2zWRWsyXTTH7OwuQr.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gCUFtTvjK4gbmjVxhx8bhyOhAeW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tNWZ1fyKYl2zWRWsyXTTH7OwuQr.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gCUFtTvjK4gbmjVxhx8bhyOhAeW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":711017,"title":"Enforcement","description":"The exact details of what took place while Talib Ben Hassi was in police custody remain unclear. Police officers Jens and Mike are on routine patrol in Svalegården''s ghetto when news of Talib''s death comes in over the radio, igniting uncontrollable, pent-up rage in the ghetto''s youth, who lust for revenge. Suddenly, the two officers find themselves fair game and must fight tooth and claw to find a way out.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Action","Crime"],"release_date":"2020-10-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rVttzFfjuFABzVoafvUxwuGtgV8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9At4gHXspTVG89nUZBJNM5zGmHm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rVttzFfjuFABzVoafvUxwuGtgV8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9At4gHXspTVG89nUZBJNM5zGmHm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":460846,"title":"Security","description":"An ex-special services veteran, down on his luck and desperate for work, takes a job as a security guard at a run-down mall in a rough area of town. On his first night on the job, he opens the door to a distraught and desperate young girl who has fled the hijacking of a Police motorcade that was transporting her to tes