320028,"title":"An Italian Name","description":"Paolo is an outgoing and handsome real estate broker married to Simona, a beautiful woman from the rough outskirts of Rome who has become an author of spicy bestsellers and is pregnant with their child. Betta, Paolo’s sister and her husband Sandro organise a dinner party with Paolo, Simona and their childhood friend, the eccentric musician Claudio. During the lively gathering Paolo reveals what he would like to name his son, causing reactions to steam up and a torrent of revelations to follow reaching climactic proportions.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2015-01-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pULQ0mpwndS8Xj9yokTnqw1bugM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/f17lML6pYWA5OAQe9tHiM480sVc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pULQ0mpwndS8Xj9yokTnqw1bugM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//f17lML6pYWA5OAQe9tHiM480sVc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":59189,"title":"Phase IV","description":"Arizona ants mock the food chain on their way to a desert lab to get two scientists and a woman.","duration":"1:26:00","genre":["Horror","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1974-09-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qMxhl5NeeXj4Rs0stsGgC7GsB9C.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/h8aBtf6I3OkpqCMkDXtTbqgSOmk.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qMxhl5NeeXj4Rs0stsGgC7GsB9C.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//h8aBtf6I3OkpqCMkDXtTbqgSOmk.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":44244,"title":"Camp Rock 2: The Final Jam","description":"Mitchie can''t wait to go back to Camp Rock and spend the summer making new music with her friends and superstar Shane Gray. But the slick new camp across the lake, Camp Star, has drummed up some serious competition – featuring newcomers Luke and Dana. In a sensational battle of the bands, with Camp Rock''s future