hile also dealing with her romantic feelings for her coach, Joe.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2002-04-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vUe5v3l6ul7coxMv2oLwINeVgFi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2dzSBmFWWqt8NbnubJKIWU21Y86.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vUe5v3l6ul7coxMv2oLwINeVgFi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2dzSBmFWWqt8NbnubJKIWU21Y86.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":866678,"title":"Furioza","description":"A policewoman makes her ex-boyfriend an offer he can''t refuse: either he infiltrates and informs on a gang of hooligans, or his brother goes to jail.","duration":"2:19:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2021-10-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4G7216ezKodauyP7cvNswiEf33k.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sSIo1vG0IILxzHkLKmtFEoTbVE9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4G7216ezKodauyP7cvNswiEf33k.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sSIo1vG0IILxzHkLKmtFEoTbVE9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":396461,"title":"Under the Silver Lake","description":"Young and disenchanted Sam meets a mysterious and beautiful woman who''s swimming in his building''s pool one night. When she suddenly vanishes the next morning, Sam embarks on a surreal quest across Los Angeles to decode the secret behind her disappearance, leading him into the murkiest depths of mystery, scandal and conspiracy.","duration":"2:19:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Mystery"],"release_date":"2018-08-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/44dgugY6wBUFfJdaVOhNfr6E5g3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cJ9aKlEgTLYtpYjNqin06YqJRUl.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//44dgugY6wBUFfJdaVOhNfr6E5g3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cJ9aKlEgTLYtpYjNqin06YqJRUl.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":24869,"title":"Ink","description":"Invisible forces exert power over us in our sleep. A mercenary named Ink, on a literal nightmare mission, captures the spirit of 8-year-old Emma in the dream world. To save her, the dream-givers marshal all their resources, focusing on saving the soul of Emma''s tragically broken father.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Action","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2009-01-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bDB9NAjkB1J7ab3lgydj75aLo7o.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9vYyX7c8gZtxuqd6SiRukRb4gRd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bDB9NAjkB1J7ab3lgydj75aLo7o.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9vYyX7c8gZtxuqd6SiRukRb4gRd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":19366,"title":"Josie and the Pussycats","description":"Josie, Melody and Val are three small-town girl musicians determined to take their rock band out of their garage and straight to the top, while remaining true to their look, style and sound. They get a record deal which brings fame and fortune but soon realize they are pawns of two people who want to control the youth of America. They must clear their names, even if it means losing fame and fortune.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Comedy","Music"],"release_date":"2001-04-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wkQAYth62cJXsvqkYbDH8b1cqES.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mHOix87RdBO3YQuyvFFZAZxpt5P.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wkQAYth62cJXsvqkYbDH8b1cqES.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mHOix87RdBO3YQuyvFFZAZxpt5P.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11088,"title":"Heist","description":"Joe Moore has a job he loves. He''s a thief. His job goes sour when he gets caught on security camera tape. His fence, Bergman, reneges on the money he''s owed, and his wife may be betraying him with the fence''s young lieutenant. Moore and his partner, Bobby Blane, and their utility man, Pinky Pincus, find themselves broke, betrayed, and blackmailed. Moore is forced to commit his crew to do one last big job.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2001-11-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1acmRn1cnPnavQGQCrIJOERd6vX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xrwwSXFeW35wYsnobreXbGxHwUC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1acmRn1cnPnavQGQCrIJOERd6vX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xrwwSXFeW35wYsnobreXbGxHwUC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10380,"title":"An American Tail: Fievel Goes West","description":"Some time after the Mousekewitz''s have settled in America, they find that they are still having problems with the threat of cats. That makes them eager to try another home out in the west, where they are promised that mice and cats live in peace. Unfortunately, the one making this claim is an oily con artist named Cat R. Waul who is intent on his own sinister plan.","duration":"1:15:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Western","Adventure","Comedy"],"release_date":"1991-11-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8UpJ8svNnwVtpu8n62vGke8MOJf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/k4aLupAkHWwHiEDwvqsZFAnUYF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8UpJ8svNnwVtpu8n62vGke8MOJf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//k4aLupAkHWwHiEDwvqsZFAnUYF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":145220,"title":"Muppets Most Wanted","description":"After the success of their telethon and renewed fame, the Muppets go on a world tour and find themselves wrapped into an European jewel-heist caper headed by a Kermit the Frog look-alike and his dastardly sidekick.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Comedy","Adventure","Crime","Family"],"release_date":"2014-03-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_fa