pted fascist libertines round up 9 teenage boys and girls and subject them to 120 days of sadistic physical, mental and sexual torture.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Horror","Drama"],"release_date":"1976-01-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wP1wgntZ6VIja8hprxV6UKdQugk.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xnaDdiRfZlJaTf6JRc4in40eaeI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wP1wgntZ6VIja8hprxV6UKdQugk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xnaDdiRfZlJaTf6JRc4in40eaeI.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":715978,"title":"Into the Beat","description":"Katya is a young, outstanding and upcoming ballet dancer. In just a few weeks she is due to have a major audition for the New York Ballet Academy and Katya has good chances of getting a scholarship. But when she meets a group of street-dancers the girl dives into a completely new world.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2020-07-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uTendWR0h1w5Hkd4vmd7EeLdLhb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wHBGXcbZuEh6L4M0CjrmXsGBots.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uTendWR0h1w5Hkd4vmd7EeLdLhb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wHBGXcbZuEh6L4M0CjrmXsGBots.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":309924,"title":"After the Ball","description":"After the Ball, a retail fairy tale set in the world of fashion. Kate''s dream is to design for couturier houses. Although she is a bright new talent, Kate can''t get a job. No one trusts the daughter of Lee Kassell, a retail guru who markets clothes \"inspired\" by the very designers Kate wants to work for. Who wants a spy among the sequins and stilettos? Reluctantly, Kate joins the family business where she must navigate around her duplicitous stepmother and two wicked stepsisters. But with the help of a prince of a guy in the shoe department her godmother''s vintage clothes and a shocking switch of identities, Kate exposes the evil trio, saves her father''s company -- and proves that everyone can wear a fabulous dress.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2015-02-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uquCfeCjt19p3ozyQeXL6uT8rtJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wY4xxrH2Ue7FKifqMSFw9TYZDca.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uquCfeCjt19p3ozyQeXL6uT8rtJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wY4xxrH2Ue7FKifqMSFw9TYZDca.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":257445,"title":"Goosebumps","description":"After moving to a small town, Zach Cooper finds a silver lining when he meets next door neighbor Hannah, the daughter of bestselling Goosebumps series author R.L. Stine. When Zach unintentionally unleashes real monsters from their manuscripts and they begin to terrorize the town, it’s suddenly up to Stine, Zach and Hannah to get all of them back in the books where they belong.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Adventure","Horror","Comedy"],"release_date":"2015-08-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6mPe4rBHzDMal2oL6hVgOBkaHz9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aeZT9pqEgrmXOGdESFkAuVjX6kw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6mPe4rBHzDMal2oL6hVgOBkaHz9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aeZT9pqEgrmXOGdESFkAuVjX6kw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":22004,"title":"Trespass","description":"Two Arkansas firemen, Vince and Don, get hold of a map that leads to a cache of stolen gold in an abandoned factory in East St. Louis. What they don''t know is that the factory is on the turf of a local gang, who come by to execute one of their enemies. Vince sees the shooting, the gang spots Vince, and extended mayhem ensues. As Vince and Don try to escape, gang leader King James argues with his subordinate Savon about how to get rid of the trespassers.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"1992-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9eYY8elmuv69MOVTeZFPibeJELO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/GSeicpK571uoM2ZCRb1YyW2YMG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9eYY8elmuv69MOVTeZFPibeJELO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//GSeicpK571uoM2ZCRb1YyW2YMG.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":16996,"title":"17 Again","description":"On the brink of a midlife crisis, 30-something Mike O''Donnell wishes he could have a \"do-over.\" And that''s exactly what he gets when he wakes up one morning to find he''s 17 years old again. With his adult mind stuck inside the body of a teenager, Mike actually has the chance to reverse some decisions he wishes he''d never made. But maybe they weren''t so bad after all.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Comedy","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2009-03-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8urrLPW6HFaIuRhJ1G3iQ7usEo7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yEcfFXEWpuXcfsR9nKESVCFneqV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8urrLPW6HFaIuRhJ1G3iQ7usEo7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yEcfFXEWpuXcfsR9nKESVCFneqV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":16980,"title":"The Last Days of Disco","description":"Two young women and their friends spend spare time at an exclusive nightclub in 1980s New York.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1998-05-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fUsBSXkii0e4sEyEkXiPWXIpnuT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lReaAZCsA0GXvJrxzSMsFxwgh6F.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fUsBSXkii0e4sEyEkXiPWXIpnuT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lReaAZCsA0GXvJrxzSMsFxwgh6F.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13335,"title":"Harold & Kumar Escape from Guantanamo Bay","description":"Having satisfied their urge for White Castle, Harold and Kumar jump on a plane to catch up with Harold''s love interest, who''s headed for the Netherlands. But the pair must change their plans when Kumar is accused of being a terrorist. Rob Corddry also stars in this wild comedy sequel that follows the hapless stoners'' misadventures as they try to avoid being captured by the Department of Homeland Security.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Comedy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2008-04-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6purgydDOA74TsuAF0VJpp1hFYw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gmXKlm8c8O7JEISYP4WiWq2x3We.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6purgydDOA74TsuAF0VJpp1hFYw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gmXKlm8c8O7JEISYP4WiWq2x3We.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10483,"title":"Death Race","description":"Terminal Island, New York: 2020. Overcrowding in the US penal system has reached a breaking point. Prisons have been turned over to a monolithic Weyland Corporation, which sees jails full of thugs as an opportunity for televised sport. Adrenalized inmates, a global audience hungry for violence and a spectacular, enclosed arena come together to form the ''Death Race'', the biggest, most brutal event.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2008-08-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5mbFEJStH59cNFcF7VkRgsSxMqK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8ASwIBJSyUXUdlPLVjExnOghBar.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5mbFEJStH59cNFcF7VkRgsSxMqK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8ASwIBJSyUXUdlPLVjExnOghBar.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5289,"title":"Chaos","description":"In Seattle, detective Quentin Conners is unfairly suspended and his partner Jason York leaves the police force after a tragic shooting on Pearl Street Bridge, when the hostage and the criminal die. During a bank heist with a hostage situation, Conners is assigned in charge of the operation with the rookie Shane Dekker as his partner. The thieves, lead by Lorenz, apparently do not steal a penny from the bank. While chasing the gangsters, the police team disclose that they planted a virus in the system, stealing one billion dollars from the different accounts, using the principle of the Chaos Theory. Further, they find that Lorenz is killing his accomplices.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Drama","Action","Crime"],"release_date":"2005-01-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rR8c2J0i8j9tEjacHE8xgEDPDUS.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9cZNRnR9dwrBApBbpp781qJS84E.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rR8c2J0i8j9tEjacHE8xgEDPDUS.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9cZNRnR9dwrBApBbpp781qJS84E.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2612,"title":"Mr. Destiny","description":"Larry Burrows is unhappy and feels powerless over his life. He believes his entire life could have turned out differently had he not missed that shot in a baseball game when was a kid. One night he meets this mysterious man, who could change his fate by offering him that alternative life he always dreamed of. But as Burrows embarks on this journey of self discovery he realises that even this new life has its problems and drawbacks..","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Fantasy","Comedy","Science Fiction","Romance"],"release_date":"1990-10-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fey7Bj8CULtpAeuF76O17txzJ3z.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zlYxDFP9l1YcUnspNzuIa8KVo4N.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fey7Bj8CULtpAeuF76O17txzJ3z.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zlYxDFP9l1YcUnspNzuIa8KVo4N.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1428,"title":"Once Upon a Time in Mexico","description":"