s failed to kill himself so many times that he outsources his suicide to aging assassin Leslie. But with the contract signed and death assured within a week (or his money back), William suddenly discovers reasons to live... However Leslie is under pressure from his boss to make sure the contract is completed.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Comedy","Action","Drama"],"release_date":"2018-09-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7i6D8NmHoASGNlRTdnywwunopng.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/f4ANVEuEaGy2oP5M0Y2P1dwxUNn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7i6D8NmHoASGNlRTdnywwunopng.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//f4ANVEuEaGy2oP5M0Y2P1dwxUNn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":413730,"title":"Summertime","description":"A gay couple living in San Francisco takes in two strangers traveling from Italy to start a new life in America, discovering each other and forming the most unlikely of relationships along the way.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2016-09-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mZAX0T6Y4UzI5a9ptMQK17xZ45.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uoqQnRX7WQJoGlOWCXJasvWtBhv.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mZAX0T6Y4UzI5a9ptMQK17xZ45.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uoqQnRX7WQJoGlOWCXJasvWtBhv.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":86812,"title":"Sound of My Voice","description":"A journalist and his girlfriend get pulled in while they investigate a cult whose leader claims to be from the future.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Drama","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2011-01-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xEm9JBfXdQyVvJ2FEEpzZIICZBc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6wStc532wuBrW2NZM3TicEWDmaL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xEm9JBfXd