 plan a rebellion against the ruler, he finds himself in danger.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Drama","Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2010-02-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rf3XJjHoG7gvkiyHNWvPTf0vpNe.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/y1VWOEN0UXFiSgCNvWO3lQuzLx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rf3XJjHoG7gvkiyHNWvPTf0vpNe.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//y1VWOEN0UXFiSgCNvWO3lQuzLx.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":26170,"title":"Coogan''s Bluff","description":"Coogan, an Arizona deputy sheriff goes to New York to pick up a prisoner. While escorting the prisoner to the airport, he escapes and Coogan heads into the city to recapture him.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1968-10-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hMw0qFWdHEFMU4YY0OoLvF4gRVJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/A0dObkaXai6q46sIMSRI1MCcN7E.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hMw0qFWdHEFMU4YY0OoLvF4gRVJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//A0dObkaXai6q46sIMSRI1MCcN7E.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10307,"title":"Stigmata","description":"A young woman with no strong religious beliefs, Frankie Paige begins having strange and violent experiences, showing signs of the wounds that Jesus received when crucified. When the Vatican gets word of Frankie''s situation, a high-ranking cardinal requests that the Rev. Andrew Kiernan investigate her case. Soon Kiernan realizes that very sinister forces are at work, and tries to rescue Frankie from the entity that is plaguing her.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Horror","Thriller"],"release_date":"1999-09-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/i9tMK3nzmZJ8MBG92iIxGXHWDq4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sKS1Vuqj7OQpOumfs6ArC0TICTN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"ht