er_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ytaKNYpHdQnClTbWL2m19Xv6PXZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13074,"title":"Resurrecting the Champ","description":"Up-and-coming sports reporter rescues a homeless man (\"Champ\") only to discover that he is, in fact, a boxing legend believed to have passed away. What begins as an opportunity to resurrect Champ''s story and escape the shadow of his father''s success becomes a personal journey as the ambitious reporter reexamines his own life and his relationship with his family.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2007-06-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6NLpgjJYXVOCfQgNhE1cgWT7z7k.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rJKTZf2QIhUwvqsfkher1JlLCdZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6NLpgjJYXVOCfQgNhE1cgWT7z7k.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rJKTZf2QIhUwvqsfkher1JlLCdZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11114,"title":"Pete''s Dragon","description":"Pete, a young orphan, runs away to a Maine fishing town with his best friend a lovable, sometimes invisible dragon named Elliott! When they are taken in by a kind lighthouse keeper, Nora, and her father, Elliott''s prank playing lands them in big trouble. Then, when crooked salesmen try to capture Elliott for their own gain, Pete must attempt a daring rescue.","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["Fantasy","Animation","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"1977-11-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hoItQR25BE6qWLInEq1iRPgBDDZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/noShGNQKAgMqNanJL5EiZlf6LCp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hoItQR25BE6qWLInEq1iRPgBDDZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//noShGNQKAgMqNanJL5EiZlf6LCp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9358,"title":"Final Destination 2","description":"When Kimberly has a violent premonition of a highway pileup she blocks the freeway, keeping a few others meant to die, safe...Or are they? The survivors mysteriously start dying and it''s up to Kimberly to stop it before she''s next.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Horror","Mystery"],"release_date":"2003-01-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tKnmfO5lAyu8hpTZMyMaI4lhZpJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vnFgxRlLTA9fDNcGXLiHmgwmIEo.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tKnmfO5lAyu8hpTZMyMaI4lhZpJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vnFgxRlLTA9fDNcGXLiHmgwmIEo.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4918,"title":"The Fourth Protocol","description":"Led by Kim Philby, Plan Aurora is a plan that breaches the top-secret Fourth Protocol and turns the fears that shaped it into a living nightmare. A crack Soviet agent, placed under cover in a quiet English country town, begins to assemble a nuclear bomb, whilst an MI5 agent attempts to prevent its detonation.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"1987-03-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/48wk2XbofCCX5SJbgX1aF8jJUVa.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7CQdgXMGUHfej4hCoOIEUq8gMUW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//48wk2XbofCCX5SJbgX1aF8jJUVa.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7CQdgXMGUHfej4hCoOIEUq8gMUW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":633604,"title":"Yummy","description":"A young couple travels to a shabby Eastern European hospital for plastic surgery. The young woman wants a breast reduction. Her mother comes along for yet another face-lift. Wandering through an abandoned ward the boyfriend stumbles upon a young woman, gagged and strapped to an operating table; she is the result of an experimental rejuvenation treatment. He frees her, but does not realize he just caused the outbreak of a virus that will change doctors, patients and his mother-in-law into bloodthirsty zombies.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Horror","Com