iscover that the elderly couple is involved in something deeply disturbing.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Horror","Thriller"],"release_date":"2015-09-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/o51GktmDgLPLYFXn7iZDQxmNHPF.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hDrToKMpKYTdwdpOhshL8ko6WVp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//o51GktmDgLPLYFXn7iZDQxmNHPF.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hDrToKMpKYTdwdpOhshL8ko6WVp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":86331,"title":"Desire","description":"In a social context deteriorated by a countrywide economic crisis, the life of several people will be turned upside down after they meet Cécile, a character who symbolizes desire.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2011-10-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zbTaYrQzZaaEf1SZlv3RTZiUvZw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wxvvNXY3n0637cOcdeC61eyVAnC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zbTaYrQzZaaEf1SZlv3RTZiUvZw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wxvvNXY3n0637cOcdeC61eyVAnC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11354,"title":"The Upside of Anger","description":"After her husband runs off with his secretary, Terry Wolfmeyer is left to fend for herself -- and her four daughters. As she hits rock bottom, Terry finds a friend and drinking buddy in next-door neighbor Denny, a former baseball player. As the two grow closer, and her daughters increasingly rely on Denny, Terry starts to have reservations about where their relationship is headed.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2005-03-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bPkP368pQkRY3m89nP2nWYjIxRC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iS9lP4poDyvSGXyh199ZEXMPHrY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bPkP368pQkRY3m89nP2nWYjIxRC.jpg","