, Lloyd, both frown upon.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1997-04-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tL8c4Oz3fXqRP3oquUpHWqpEC6B.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ysfD96fF56BEzpktyDWChC8Epgs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tL8c4Oz3fXqRP3oquUpHWqpEC6B.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ysfD96fF56BEzpktyDWChC8Epgs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9339,"title":"Click","description":"A married workaholic, Michael Newman doesn''t have time for his wife and children, not if he''s to impress his ungrateful boss and earn a well-deserved promotion. So when he meets Morty, a loopy sales clerk, he gets the answer to his prayers: a magical remote that allows him to bypass life''s little distractions with increasingly hysterical results.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2006-06-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/n6eIm882V7cj0In0xp8QXNItoTp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oL0k5JA53PyoHSZqKb3cNkhwBCE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//n6eIm882V7cj0In0xp8QXNItoTp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oL0k5JA53PyoHSZqKb3cNkhwBCE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":503616,"title":"Second Act","description":"Value Shop assistant manager Maya Vargas wants only one thing for her 43rd birthday -- a promotion. While her résumé may not scream upper management, her track record certainly does; she is an innovator who listens to her customers and delivers results. When she loses the job to a college-educated candidate, Maya sets out to prove to Madison Avenue that street smarts are as valuable as book smarts -- and it''s never too late for a second act.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"2018-11-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aRAmr3Eg7pyiIAdCSkD9OT8UvR4.jpg",