rama","Romance"],"release_date":"2020-02-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kU5qE5b6ksL3osaqKCUlMS08Ays.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cdqZqIcWt0Ne2Io2OA9iWqqMuCA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kU5qE5b6ksL3osaqKCUlMS08Ays.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cdqZqIcWt0Ne2Io2OA9iWqqMuCA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":484718,"title":"Coming 2 America","description":"Prince Akeem Joffer is set to become King of Zamunda when he discovers he has a son he never knew about in America – a street savvy Queens native named Lavelle. Honoring his royal father''s dying wish to groom this son as the crown prince, Akeem and Semmi set off to America once again.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2021-03-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vKzbIoHhk1z9DWYi8kyFe9Gg0HF.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nWBPLkqNApY5pgrJFMiI9joSI30.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vKzbIoHhk1z9DWYi8kyFe9Gg0HF.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nWBPLkqNApY5pgrJFMiI9joSI30.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":433808,"title":"The Ritual","description":"A group of college friends reunite for a trip to the forest, but encounter a menacing presence in the woods that''s stalking them.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Horror","Mystery"],"release_date":"2017-10-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vaArQHq1lHFNppoJlMlv30Gs2fQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9022CYEGqYETCeXN1oE3uwYJWub.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vaArQHq1lHFNppoJlMlv30Gs2fQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9022CYEGqYETCeXN1oE3uwYJWub.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9515,"title":"The Matador","description":"The life of Danny Wright, a salesman forever on the road, veers into dangerous and surreal territory when he wanders into a Mexican bar and meets a mysterious stranger, Julian, who''s very likely a hit man. Their meeting sets off a chain of events that will change their lives forever, as Wright is suddenly thrust into a far-from-mundane existence that he takes to surprisingly well … once he gets acclimated to it.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Action","Comedy","Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2005-05-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jBxIfffFWY69oAx6CLQtKZ3xtYO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oJnlAGmrhsg4QrlVKGgP91J6WPu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jBxIfffFWY69oAx6CLQtKZ3xtYO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oJnlAGmrhsg4QrlVKGgP91J6WPu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":852427,"title":"Kompromat","description":"Mathieu, a member of the French institute in Irkutsk, is arrested overnight by the Russian authorities.  Imprisoned and accused of sexual abuse on his own daughter, he realises he is a victim of a Kompromat. With the help of the FSB, someone has built up a case to frame him. Isolated, he has no one to turn to. Proving his innocence is impossible: the only solution is to escape.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"2022-09-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xp6ZNacNFf9GmJe648fUqfbdyph.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6OimOLolZ94sy0KVmimRxqfxy8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xp6ZNacNFf9GmJe648fUqfbdyph.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6OimOLolZ94sy0KVmimRxqfxy8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":517096,"title":"Cosmoball","description":"Cosmoball is a mesmerizing intergalactic game of future played between humans and aliens at the giant extraterrestrial ship hovering in the sky over Earth. A young man with enormous power of an unknown nature joins the team of hot-headed superheroes in exchange for a cure for his mother’s deadly illness. The Four from Earth will fight not only to defend the honor of their home planet in the spectacular game, but to face the unprecedented threat to the Galaxy and embrace their own destiny.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Adventure"],"release_date":"2020-08-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/egonBOHhHBhXiigeiNth2x1YSTm.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eDJYDXRoWoUzxjd52gtz5ODTSU1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//egonBOHhHBhXiigeiNth2x1YSTm.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eDJYDXRoWoUzxjd52gtz5ODTSU1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":421471,"title":"Flower","description":"Rebellious, quick-witted Erica Vandross is a 17-year-old firecracker living with her single mom, Laurie, and her mom''s new boyfriend, Bob, in L.A.''s San Fernando Valley. When Bob''s mentally unbalanced son, Luke, arrives from rehab to live with the family, Erica finds her domestic and personal life overwhelmed. With Luke and her sidekicks Kala and Claudine in tow, Erica acts out by exposing a high school teacher''s dark secret.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2017-03-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lcgaDmokrKltbgwQu9Wf6X0qPTE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xYTI11qFnmx39LRhDOsGEabfqtp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lcgaDmokrKltbgwQu9Wf6X0qPTE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xYTI11qFnmx39LRhDOsGEabfqtp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":354285,"title":"The Sense of an Ending","description":"A man becomes haunted by his past and is presented with a mysterious legacy that causes him to re-think his current situation in life.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Mystery","Drama"],"release_date":"2017-03-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9IAYhWW3bsggQcnQ2SBZD2V1999.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_