, Andrea, is transgender and yearns for another life where he gets to live as the boy he knows himself to be. Clara instinctively strives to protect her son by escaping into their imaginations to defuse family tensions.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2022-09-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rjw4AXWCJ3AYmmM2CkNOD6LcGT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8zVoxTnEXEbCAv4BCJRvb54sJKl.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rjw4AXWCJ3AYmmM2CkNOD6LcGT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8zVoxTnEXEbCAv4BCJRvb54sJKl.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":604872,"title":"Skyfire","description":"Tianhuo Island is as beautiful as a paradise. It almost makes people forget that it is located in the \"Ring of Fire\" the world-famous Pacific Rim volcanic belt. The volcano erupts, and the fates of the people on the island are entangled.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Action","Adventure"],"release_date":"2019-12-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gUcoXuZoc7Z1RTQxgBXEsLQXjW8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dDf8M1yMwvBVe8VtOKxCpOog8CF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gUcoXuZoc7Z1RTQxgBXEsLQXjW8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dDf8M1yMwvBVe8VtOKxCpOog8CF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":268531,"title":"Captain Underpants: The First Epic Movie","description":"Based on the bestselling book series, this outrageous comedy tells the story of George and Harold,  two overly imaginative pranksters who hypnotize their principal into thinking he’s an enthusiastic, yet dimwitted, superhero named Captain Underpants.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Family","Comedy","Animation","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2017-06-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5ceIqlRzWH4x1IPU9OfjXHO2Kz6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vKSmaPct