e way, the two must learn to reconcile the past and work together if they are going to have any hope of getting Lily back before she is taken over the border and forced to become a prostitute.","duration":"2:15:00","genre":["Thriller","Western","Adventure"],"release_date":"2003-11-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/o8bs4oCB3qCooYfpMhXY4evNVLi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/86s5nw5F1G8lJtEowO0LBB4hoBW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//o8bs4oCB3qCooYfpMhXY4evNVLi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//86s5nw5F1G8lJtEowO0LBB4hoBW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9748,"title":"D.O.A.","description":"Dexter Cornell, an English Professor becomes embroiled in a series of murders involving people around him. Dexter has good reason to want to find the murderer but hasn''t much time. He finds help and comfort from one of his student, Sydney Fuller.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"1988-03-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yClc4f5aUjigBTP63NxysTwPt9i.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zelnD4ZCB7lBHHOr9Tyw7cepjt9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yClc4f5aUjigBTP63NxysTwPt9i.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zelnD4ZCB7lBHHOr9Tyw7cepjt9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":608980,"title":"Three Floors","description":"Follows the lives of three families who live in a three-story building in a Roman neighbourhood.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2021-09-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3E7SmCwoSbpBn7cfp10hQjsGk2U.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/59kVQe8wrHp845gBR9TDHzNwfeQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3E7SmCwoSbpBn7cfp10hQjsGk2U.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//59kVQe8wrHp845gBR9TDHzNwfeQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":6052