iles Redferne captures an evil warlock, but the conjurer eludes death with supernatural help. Flung into the future, the warlock winds up in the 1980s and plans to bring about the end of the world. Redferne follows the enchanter into the modern era and continues his mission, but runs into trouble in such unfamiliar surroundings. With the help of a young woman, can Redferne finally defeat the warlock?","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Horror","Fantasy","Action"],"release_date":"1989-06-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tVQjkTxxg7t17Fgp4qyii89pCH2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1QHjr4lBd3vBN4kEqdDFlnJbsa7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tVQjkTxxg7t17Fgp4qyii89pCH2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1QHjr4lBd3vBN4kEqdDFlnJbsa7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8845,"title":"Under Siege","description":"A disgruntled ex-CIA operative, his assistant and their assembled group of terrorists seize a battleship with nuclear blackmail in mind. They''ve planned for every contingency but ignore the ship''s cook, former Navy SEAL Casey Ryback—an error that could be fatal.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"1992-10-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ihBDaN7OwT7D9DVri8SmxCnuRLB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7tzVzgGKhLsQoiyDh2tiGcPeTpH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ihBDaN7OwT7D9DVri8SmxCnuRLB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7tzVzgGKhLsQoiyDh2tiGcPeTpH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4964,"title":"Knocked Up","description":"A slacker and a career-driven woman accidentally conceive a child after a one-night stand. As they try to make the relationship work, they must navigate the challenges of parenthood and their differences in lifestyle and maturity.","duration":"2:09:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2007-06-01","backd