ture when De Nomolos, a villain from the future, sends evil robot duplicates of the two lads to terminate and replace them. The robot doubles actually succeed in killing Bill and Ted, but the two are determined to escape the afterlife, challenging the Grim Reaper to a series of games in order to return to the land of the living.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1991-07-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4PMSgLOzPFgyzARQBhhX4vS9oOW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tldtDfLnPFOtTWp758EmIP2Hbz5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4PMSgLOzPFgyzARQBhhX4vS9oOW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tldtDfLnPFOtTWp758EmIP2Hbz5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":561362,"title":"Rust Creek","description":"When an overachieving college senior makes a wrong turn, her road trip becomes a life-changing fight for survival in rural Kentucky.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama","Action","Crime"],"release_date":"2019-01-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xmLLkEhqIw0Me0wgO9ZhtP0MW7U.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lrsPIRkKZWTKbd3C0sSj7a3lMES.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xmLLkEhqIw0Me0wgO9ZhtP0MW7U.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lrsPIRkKZWTKbd3C0sSj7a3lMES.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":326423,"title":"Barbershop: The Next Cut","description":"To survive harsh economic times, Calvin and Angie have merged the barbershop and beauty salon into one business. The days of male bonding are gone as Eddie and the crew must now contend with sassy female co-workers and spirited clientele. As the battle of the sexes rages on, a different kind of conflict has taken over Chicago. Crime and gangs are on the rise, leaving Calvin worried about the fate of his son. Together, the friends come up with a bold plan to take back their beloved neighbo