.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gbeeWu8rYaIYMyq9ayN1AepjNxP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//c2B8gl2ZLbelWxS0ZODPKGJxdWX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gbeeWu8rYaIYMyq9ayN1AepjNxP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9598,"title":"Babe","description":"Babe is a little pig who doesn''t quite know his place in the world. With a bunch of odd friends, like Ferdinand the duck who thinks he is a rooster and Fly the dog he calls mum, Babe realises that he has the makings to become the greatest sheep pig of all time, and Farmer Hoggett knows it. With the help of the sheep dogs, Babe learns that a pig can be anything that he wants to be.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Fantasy","Drama","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"1995-07-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/agkZziO4ZPAsVfKUrJD68lys08P.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zKuQMtnbVTz9DsOnOJmlW71v4qH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//agkZziO4ZPAsVfKUrJD68lys08P.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zKuQMtnbVTz9DsOnOJmlW71v4qH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1243381,"title":"Mary","description":"A miraculous conception. A merciless king. A murderous pursuit. Mary''s journey to give birth to Jesus unfolds in this biblical coming-of-age epic.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Drama","History","Action"],"release_date":"2024-12-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vfbxysLCXrvcI8NdzeQTR1Kxfky.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wpApuf1xky92ug8n5mP5aP7DiDy.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vfbxysLCXrvcI8NdzeQTR1Kxfky.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wpApuf1xky92ug8n5mP5aP7DiDy.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":43200,"title":"Basilicata Coast To Coast","description":"A musical comedy, a journey filled with unexpected twists and unexpected encounters, leading a group of musicians to set out to the rhythm of their m