tle":"Extraordinary Measures","description":"Working-class father John Crowley is finally on the fast track to corporate success when his two young children are diagnosed with Pompe disease—a condition that prevents the body from breaking down sugar. With the support of his wife, John ditches his career and teams with unconventional specialist, Dr. Robert Stonehill to found a bio-tech company and develop a cure in time to save the lives of his children. As Dr. Stonehill works tirelessly to prove the theories that made him the black sheep of the medical community, a powerful bond is forged between the two unlikely allies.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2010-01-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/o2AFwD4v62296mxkF74EMYL6P7j.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bmBCMoCc6OdINBOC7P6pOIs1MuO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//o2AFwD4v62296mxkF74EMYL6P7j.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bmBCMoCc6OdINBOC7P6pOIs1MuO.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":22804,"title":"Saw VI","description":"Special Agent Strahm is dead, and Detective Hoffman has emerged as the unchallenged successor to Jigsaw''s legacy. However, when the FBI draws closer to Hoffman, he is forced to set a game into motion, and Jigsaw''s grand scheme is finally understood.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Horror","Thriller"],"release_date":"2009-10-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gqR59DjJGr6i8mxRD1VfOzCueTI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jBr7bBPA4PYPaf4O6nfjYViyRWK.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gqR59DjJGr6i8mxRD1VfOzCueTI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jBr7bBPA4PYPaf4O6nfjYViyRWK.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":3172,"title":"Bandits","description":"After escaping from prison, Joe and Terry go on a crime spree, robbing banks through Oregon and California in order to finance their scheme