.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/39dr21LlR2uv7InD04aKbKIXiFW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//keCR4gDp2eqberCuYlEQ7ZzQ6g8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//39dr21LlR2uv7InD04aKbKIXiFW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":132232,"title":"Mama","description":"Guillermo del Toro presents Mama, a supernatural thriller that tells the haunting tale of two little girls who disappeared into the woods the day that their parents were killed. When they are rescued years later and begin a new life, they find that someone or something still wants to come tuck them in at night.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Horror"],"release_date":"2013-01-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cu3uaBqPORcfpKQWaIjA1GJbvEg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eo8BhR8Q5STmWE9sMLsEPagxmy6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cu3uaBqPORcfpKQWaIjA1GJbvEg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eo8BhR8Q5STmWE9sMLsEPagxmy6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":102780,"title":"Byzantium","description":"Residents of a coastal town learn, with deadly consequences, the secret shared by the two mysterious women who have sought refuge at a local boarding house, the Byzantium.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Drama","Fantasy","Thriller"],"release_date":"2013-04-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6T51pR8QFo6Lk1FejzvosVrfvLt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kFkfRnXz6Rk9tAKgUznJH1FURQ6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6T51pR8QFo6Lk1FejzvosVrfvLt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kFkfRnXz6Rk9tAKgUznJH1FURQ6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":72710,"title":"The Host","description":"A parasitic alien soul is injected into the body of Melanie Stryder. Instead of carrying out her race''s mission of taking over the Earth, \"Wanda\" (as she comes to be called) forms a bond with her host and sets out to aid other free humans.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2013-03-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1bDa2d9VqqBQlk42Gduu37Rz1ob.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1mfIZw6WgkCX310eoe0Ys14c3Fi.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1bDa2d9VqqBQlk42Gduu37Rz1ob.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1mfIZw6WgkCX310eoe0Ys14c3Fi.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11465,"title":"Great Balls of Fire!","description":"The story of Jerry Lee Lewis, arguably the greatest and certainly one of the wildest musicians of the 1950s. His arrogance, remarkable talent, and unconventional lifestyle often brought him into conflict with others in the industry, and even earned him the scorn and condemnation of the public.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Drama","History","Music"],"release_date":"1989-06-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/A4sFrTjB4JOrmCQLRqnfz91BQTK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cb0zpDUnHBj8PxWQG5L96m3rxrk.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//A4sFrTjB4JOrmCQLRqnfz91BQTK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cb0zpDUnHBj8PxWQG5L96m3rxrk.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8838,"title":"Mercury Rising","description":"Renegade FBI agent Art Jeffries protects a nine-year-old autistic boy who has cracked the government''s new \"unbreakable\" code.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1998-04-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5EkowLSlfQT50KbeHzhvbdyaIoI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/60AAso6I2TzQCy2SjqtzPni8csA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5EkowLSlfQT50KbeHzhvbdyaIoI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//60AAso6I2TzQCy2SjqtzPni8csA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1588,"title":"Bring It On","description":"The Toro cheerleading squad from Rancho Carne High School in San Diego has got spirit, spunk, sass and a killer routine that''s sure to land them the national championship trophy for the sixth year in a row. But for newly-elected team captain Torrance, the Toros'' road to total cheer glory takes a shady turn when she discovers that their perfectly-choreographed routines were in fact stolen.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2000-08-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3XpxR3cSQJou79KBQpPCcpZzmhj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bnVby0qI0dS7YunbShP7mw68HY3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3XpxR3cSQJou79KBQpPCcpZzmhj.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bnVby0qI0dS7YunbShP7mw68HY3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":934506,"title":"A Real Job","description":"Benjamin is a PhD student without scholarship support. Under the pressure of his parents, and in need of money, he becomes a substitute teacher in a middle school. Without training nor experience, and facing a declining public educational system, he discovers how tough this job can be. Hopefully, his supportive and committed colleagues will lead him to take a fresh look at the profession.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2023-09-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vaVr73LwlYEe5Mj4tXXXATePeNu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2KxpXV3fqM58jU5kaFWPChrrSgz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vaVr73LwlYEe5Mj4tXXXATePeNu.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2KxpXV3fqM58jU5kaFWPChrrSgz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":833326,"title":"Zero Fucks Given","description":"Cassandre, 26, is a flight attendant for a low-cost airline. Based in Lanzarote, she’s always willing to take on extra hours and carries out her duties with robotic efficiency. On the side, she just goes with the flow and floats be