o the enemy tribe to get some shampoo for his tribe. When the healer of the Clean Hairs tribe surprisingly kills two cavemen of his tribe, their imbecile chief assigns Pierre with curled hair and Pierre blonde to investigate the murder and find the criminal.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime","Mystery","Family"],"release_date":"2004-01-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rZPpxJhROE2Q6umzH6nxDUi1x9M.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qsGU6myn85MfqpNAxzJtxJ3VgrM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rZPpxJhROE2Q6umzH6nxDUi1x9M.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qsGU6myn85MfqpNAxzJtxJ3VgrM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12611,"title":"The Fury","description":"When a devious plot separates CIA agent Peter Sandza from his son, Robin, the distraught father manages to see through the ruse. Taken because of his psychic abilities, Robin is being held by Ben Childress, who is studying people with supernatural powers in hopes of developing their talents as weapons. Soon Peter pairs up with Gillian, a teen who has telekinesis, to find and rescue Robin.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Horror","Science Fiction","Thriller"],"release_date":"1978-03-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bgTgA6ZckxKMy0oQyEFenxmxdGK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uez7cenZAh9JORKyPq1AblMbe26.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bgTgA6ZckxKMy0oQyEFenxmxdGK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uez7cenZAh9JORKyPq1AblMbe26.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1537,"title":"Changing Lanes","description":"A rush-hour fender-bender on New York City''s crowded FDR Drive, under most circumstances, wouldn''t set off a chain reaction that could decimate two people''s lives. But on this day, at this time, a minor collision will turn two complete strangers into vicious adversaries. Their means of destroying each other might be different, but their goals, ultimately, will be the same: Each will systematically try to dismantle the other''s life in a reckless effort to reclaim something he has lost.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"2002-04-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lCPOmWoqtmVrI2yUNUw8iaOaTJn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8wh9WzTKo5pJw3EgHYWA60W7Kbl.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lCPOmWoqtmVrI2yUNUw8iaOaTJn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8wh9WzTKo5pJw3EgHYWA60W7Kbl.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1249213,"title":"Drop","description":"Violet, a widowed mother on her first date in years, arrives at an upscale restaurant where she is relieved that her date, Henry, is more charming and handsome than she expected. But their chemistry begins to curdle as Violet begins being irritated and then terrorized by a series of anonymous drops to her phone.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2025-04-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/akBGSguhkAj1TXOdZUcL11e1hpH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hSQPSW8aLjsMBfwqGjgJ6HozTkp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//akBGSguhkAj1TXOdZUcL11e1hpH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hSQPSW8aLjsMBfwqGjgJ6HozTkp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":960704,"title":"Fullmetal Alchemist: The Final Alchemy","description":"The Elric brothers’ long and winding journey comes to a close in this epic finale, where they must face off against an unworldly, nationwide threat.","duration":"2:22:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2022-06-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5hoS3nEkGGXUfmnu39yw1k52JX5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AeyiuQUUs78bPkz18FY3AzNFF8b.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w