342//oSTFMqFpVB4yq9SOIxBp8xZ9jh5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":245844,"title":"Blind","description":"Having recently lost her sight, Ingrid retreats to the safety of her home—a place where she can feel in control, alone with her husband and her thoughts. After a while, Ingrid starts to feel the presence of her husband in the flat when he is supposed to be at work. At the same time, her lonely neighbor who has grown tired of even the most extreme pornography shifts his attention to a woman across the street. Ingrid knows about this but her real problems lie within, not beyond the walls of her apartment, and her deepest fears and repressed fantasies soon take over.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2014-02-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4wAvP0n2n28Tv5xYv3YRr5meZre.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6ZFyh8OAxe9ePA8DAWzRps5LycY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4wAvP0n2n28Tv5xYv3YRr5meZre.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6ZFyh8OAxe9ePA8DAWzRps5LycY.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":105965,"title":"Beverly Hills Chihuahua 3: Viva la Fiesta!","description":"When Papi, Chloe, the pups, Uncle Pedro, and their owners move to a hotel, the smallest pup Rosa feels like she doesn''t fit in, and Papi wants to make her feel better by showing her how special she is.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"2012-09-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/h7WBvAHd6IqDsAycFWsqlcdt1i3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fK3U8xulldz6lhMDuz3LFB7ngWH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//h7WBvAHd6IqDsAycFWsqlcdt1i3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fK3U8xulldz6lhMDuz3LFB7ngWH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":56374,"title":"The Graduates","description":"Four thirtysomething college students share a flat in Florence: Leonardo pursues beautiful Letizia, Rocco moonlights