":9903,"title":"The Hoax","description":"In what would cause a fantastic media frenzy, Clifford Irving sells his bogus biography of Howard Hughes to a premiere publishing house in the early 1970s.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2006-10-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zLJT6nCsTPpo8vKEUwdpqXcSBAB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u5KESAGmNa5NLsSbpHVUDWT4ENR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zLJT6nCsTPpo8vKEUwdpqXcSBAB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u5KESAGmNa5NLsSbpHVUDWT4ENR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5072,"title":"Severance","description":"Seven employees of an international weapons manufacturer are treated to a team-building weekend at the company’s newly built luxury spa lodge. Things quickly go awry as the colleagues find their corporate weekend sabotaged by a deadly enemy.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Horror","Comedy","Thriller"],"release_date":"2006-05-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1lhFxRRadLuOirqN2THN7gZhJrs.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yg1XRTyH5knwh3Tnij2sUV0ZZ5w.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1lhFxRRadLuOirqN2THN7gZhJrs.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yg1XRTyH5knwh3Tnij2sUV0ZZ5w.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4351,"title":"Bordertown","description":"American corporations are using the North American Free Trade Agreement by opening large maquiladoras right across the United States–Mexico border. The maquiladoras hire mostly Mexican women to work long hours for little money in order to produce mass quantity products. Lauren Adrian, an impassioned American news reporter for the Chicago Sentinel wants to be assigned to the Iraq front-lines to cover the war. Instead, her editor George Morgan assigns her to investigate a series of slayings involving young maquiladora factory women in a Mexican bordertown.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2007-02-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fUdxWZPjTy7ghxp0wZVBfCvWhzV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/c0AR36VzvB5ileCoMfSlV9bFsVn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fUdxWZPjTy7ghxp0wZVBfCvWhzV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//c0AR36VzvB5ileCoMfSlV9bFsVn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":702936,"title":"Sniper: Assassin''s End","description":"Special Ops sniper Brandon Beckett is set up as the primary suspect for the murder of a foreign dignitary on the eve of signing a high-profile trade agreement with the United States. Narrowly escaping death, Beckett realizes that there may be a dark operative working within the government, and partners with the only person whom he can trust: his father, legendary sniper Sgt. Thomas Beckett. Both Becketts are on the run from the CIA, Russian mercenaries, and a yakuza-trained assassin with sniper skills that rival both legendary sharpshooters.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Action"],"release_date":"2020-06-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a5JHyN8fTrwBdqXg7Lur7ZKITqO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AiymaaYeAl9ZBoyUz2tz4k2XaKv.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//a5JHyN8fTrwBdqXg7Lur7ZKITqO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AiymaaYeAl9ZBoyUz2tz4k2XaKv.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":24556,"title":"The Land Before Time XI: Invasion of the Tinysauruses","description":"Littlefoot and his friends return in another adventure. But this time, they aren''t the smallest dinosaurs in the valley anymore.","duration":"1:22:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Fantasy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2005-01-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hpDimUxwxtBcU7zyYRoieCe8fVJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zREv4ST6lZUcxWIy2LPJKB011Gj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hpDimUxwxtBcU7zyYRoieCe8fVJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zREv4ST6lZUcxWIy2LPJKB011Gj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":20287,"title":"Extreme Prejudice","description":"Lean, mean Texas Ranger Jack Benteen locks horns with a former friend, Cash Bailey, now a ruthless drug kingpin. Though they''re on opposite sides of the law, they share a love interest in the sensual Sarita. When a crew of rogue soldiers descends upon the border town for an off-the-books mission, all roads lead to a bloody, to-the-death showdown, as loyalties shift and the lines between good and evil are blurred.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"1987-04-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/l48O8fatTpS1nccR2MtJnh4EqRb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fqN3duCLrjcsF8dfiP1XCCtlWZC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//l48O8fatTpS1nccR2MtJnh4EqRb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fqN3duCLrjcsF8dfiP1XCCtlWZC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4959,"title":"The International","description":"An interpol agent and an attorney are determined to bring one of the world''s most powerful banks to justice. Uncovering money laundering, arms trading, and conspiracy to destabilize world governments, their investigation takes them from Berlin, Milan, New York and Istanbul. Finding themselves in a chase across the globe, their relentless tenacity puts their own lives at risk.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Crime","Mystery"],"release_date":"2009-02-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rX7EDn70R2L0ijCPRbz5cjoQ73h.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fneofXacvudxNUKyM61UtoilHRI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rX7EDn70R2L0ijCPRbz5cjoQ73h.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fneofXacvudxNUKyM61UtoilHRI.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":476335,"title":"Shock and Awe","description":"A group of journalists covering George Bush''s planned invasion of Iraq in 2003 are skeptical of the presidents claim that Saddam Hussein has \"weapons of mass destruction.\"","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["History","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2017-12-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vLDz1V7CNRf5uue4eAgbJPRT99q.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/x8Y9lKNnroACauSxmVQRkACj2ow.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vLDz1V7CNRf5uue4eAgbJPRT99q.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//x8Y9lKNnroACauSxmVQRkACj2ow.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":288036,"title":"Sleeping with Other People","description":"Can two serial cheaters get a second chance at love? After a one-night stand in college, New Yorkers Lainey and Jake meet by chance twelve years later and discover they each have the same problem: because of their monogamy-challenged ways, neither can maintain a relationship. Determined to stay friends despite their mutual attraction, they make a pact to keep it platonic, a deal that proves easier said than done.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2015-06-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/40ZRzvdkuCPNCSbdcImc5o4JGdD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/thYomS3wTYDTRZaM98ADMfBiDxm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//40ZRzvdkuCPNCSbdcImc5o4JGdD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//thYomS3wTYDTRZaM98ADMfBiDxm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10743,"title":"Confidence","description":"What Jake Vig doesn''t know just might get him killed. A sharp and polished grifter, Jake has just swindled thousands of dollars from the unsuspecting Lionel Dolby with the help of his crew. It becomes clear that Lionel wasn''t just any mark, he was an accountant for eccentric crime boss Winston King. Jake and his crew will have to stay one step ahead of both the criminals and the cops to finally settle their debt.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Action","Comedy","Thriller","Crime","Mystery"],"release_date":"2003-04-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/g5woRbuOrwynegzoMKOg8GmMf0j.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yJzmAtY9DmhhjJwFnW0Zjlvz6yg.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//g5woRbuOrwynegzoMKOg8GmMf0j.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yJzmAtY9DmhhjJwFnW0Zjlvz6yg.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9302,"title":"Up Close & Personal","description":"Tally Atwater has a dream: to be a prime-time network newscaster. She pursues this dream with nothing but ambition, raw talent and a homemade demo tape. Warren Justice is a brilliant, hard edged, veteran newsman. He sees Tally has talent and becomes her mentor. Tally’s career takes a meteoric rise and she and Warren fall in love. The romance that results is as intense and revealing as television news itself. Yet, each breaking story, every videotaped crisis that brings them together, also threatens to drive them apart...","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1996-03-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wqD5zMFFITtzySK7fuYX42AtbJE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zF67qcf7skMHLpXnifodinUqCFr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wqD5zMFFITtzySK7fuYX42AtbJE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zF67qcf7skMHLpXnifodinUqCFr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9043,"title":"The Family Stone","description":"An uptight, conservative businesswoman accompanies her boyfriend to his eccentric and outgoing family''s annual Christmas celebration and finds that she''s a fish out of water in their free-spirited way of life.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2005-12-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yJav7yjKcYnP7C9QbFLECThWv4a.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nlqw53HmTP7o3b2NDttYNOtsK4V.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yJav7yjKcYnP7C9QbFLECThWv4a.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nlqw53HmTP7o3b2NDttYNOtsK4V.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":975043,"title":"Which Brings Me to You","description":"Two romantic burnouts, Jane and Will, are immediately drawn to each other at a mutual friend’s wedding. After a disastrous hookup in the coatroom, the two spend the next 24 hours together, trading candid confessions of messy histories and heartbreak, on the off chance that this fling might be the real thing.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2023-12-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dSSj6p3sUvc997V5zPJjfrVyFt0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gspoAZ5p7G7D83OU9UFOmKICejw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dSSj6p3sUvc997V5zPJjfrVyFt0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gspoAZ5p7G7D83OU9UFOmKICejw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":810389,"title":"The Visitor from the Future","description":"In a devastated future, the apocalypse threatens the Earth. The last hope lies with a man capable of time travel. His mission: to return to the past and change the course of events. But the time police hunts him down in every era. A race against time begins for the Visitor from the Future...","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Comedy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2022-09-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4KTuSuWPZphbJOFFceU55YXXIVT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bsMIi4W3MvLChEUk8tiiHffyhQm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4KTuSuWPZphbJOFFceU55YXXIVT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/