igures. By the time Harry learns that the murders are part of a sick game to predict such deaths, it may be too late.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1988-07-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/buhzGe9AqpB8da99iEEK7GxOhAU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/krxLLDnFuDtjagN7KrCjuH6QrcW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//buhzGe9AqpB8da99iEEK7GxOhAU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//krxLLDnFuDtjagN7KrCjuH6QrcW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10410,"title":"Hoffa","description":"A portrait of union leader James R. Hoffa, as seen through the eyes of his friend, Bobby Ciaro. The film follows Hoffa through his countless battles with the RTA and President Roosevelt.","duration":"2:20:00","genre":["Crime","History","Drama"],"release_date":"1992-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dineJzDZLuEXNNy261vFcJgqhxr.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aMGhaSkhkFwz33hKEsBrJ3ptx3g.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dineJzDZLuEXNNy261vFcJgqhxr.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aMGhaSkhkFwz33hKEsBrJ3ptx3g.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8966,"title":"Twilight","description":"When Bella Swan moves to a small town in the Pacific Northwest, she falls in love with Edward Cullen, a mysterious classmate who reveals himself to be a 108-year-old vampire. Despite Edward''s repeated cautions, Bella can''t stay away from him, a fatal move that endangers her own life.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Fantasy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2008-11-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/weAYfu6FfrNxEDJ3xH1XpgQcqUv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3Gkb6jm6962ADUPaCBqzz9CTbn9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//weAYfu6FfrNxEDJ3xH1XpgQcqUv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https: