e","description":"The Pickles family welcome a new arrival, Dil, whose constant crying and need for attention quickly exhaust the other toddlers. Seeking to return the \"broken\" baby to the hospital, the gang embarks on a journey in a Reptar Wagon that inadvertently veers off course, leaving them stranded in a vast, dangerous forest. While facing off against escaped circus monkeys and a predatory wolf, Tommy must overcome his own resentment to protect his brother and make it back home.","duration":"1:20:00","genre":["Adventure","Animation","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"1998-11-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cC9oBBqGcOdBheKre24YfthsptI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uZejGKCSd6nwfMx8U0Td37U2fTc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cC9oBBqGcOdBheKre24YfthsptI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uZejGKCSd6nwfMx8U0Td37U2fTc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13934,"title":"Mater and the Ghostlight","description":"Mater, the rusty but trusty tow truck from Cars, spends a day in Radiator Springs playing scary pranks on his fellow townsfolk. That night at Flo''s V8 Café, the Sheriff tells the story of the legend of the Ghostlight, and as everyone races home Mater is left alone primed for a good old-fashioned scare.","duration":"0:07:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Family","Horror"],"release_date":"2006-07-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cKO6MZ9uf6wRcMA0TldRCYxKYzx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/thZHluscCvT3SCzVckmFszOVVtM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cKO6MZ9uf6wRcMA0TldRCYxKYzx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//thZHluscCvT3SCzVckmFszOVVtM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":736790,"title":"Chupa","description":"While visiting family in Mexico, a lonely boy befriends a mythical creature hiding on his grandfather''s ranch and embarks on the adventure of a lifetim