lynn to retrieve the map. The map is useless without the legend piece to decipher it, which is located in Volubilis near the Roman ruins in Morocco. Flynn heads to Casablanca to the ruins where he is chased by a group of mercenaries leaded by General Samir. They too want to find the location of King Solomon''s mines. Flynn teams-up with Professor Emily Davenport working in the dig and they escape from General Samir and his men. While traveling to Gedi, they save the local Jomo from death and the trio faces a dangerous journey through the wild Africa.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Fantasy","Action","Adventure"],"release_date":"2006-09-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bQWaivEhhL37cCsnnhni9R33KGy.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4UxUdJUCLwirPdYzAsYg8ayKhGN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bQWaivEhhL37cCsnnhni9R33KGy.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4UxUdJUCLwirPdYzAsYg8ayKhGN.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":467824,"title":"Illang: The Wolf Brigade","description":"In 2029, an elite police squad combats an anti-reunification terrorist group while another enemy lurks nearby.","duration":"2:18:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2018-07-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/CX9O14p4SsAG8nz0BFhaDTSKH1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/71JMWqNDRz2Au59JYosfn5W8nuS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//CX9O14p4SsAG8nz0BFhaDTSKH1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//71JMWqNDRz2Au59JYosfn5W8nuS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":49021,"title":"Killer Elite","description":"Based on a shocking true story, Killer Elite pits two of the world’s most elite operatives—Danny, an ex-special ops agent and Hunter, his longtime mentor—against the cunning leader of a secret military society. Covering the globe from Australia to Paris, London and the Middle East, Danny and Hunter are plunged into a highly dangerous game of cat and mouse—where the predators become the prey.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Thriller"],"release_date":"2011-09-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/RzIuQRoXiO8WeFdjtnjUCzSymV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7O2U0WPFPSvNSUYZlhbnV081lBF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//RzIuQRoXiO8WeFdjtnjUCzSymV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7O2U0WPFPSvNSUYZlhbnV081lBF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11976,"title":"Legend","description":"Set in a timeless mythical forest inhabited by fairies, goblins, unicorns and mortals, this fantastic story follows a mystical forest dweller, chosen by fate, to undertake a heroic quest. He must save the beautiful Princess  Lili and defeat the demonic Lord of Darkness, or the world will be plunged into a never-ending ice age.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1985-08-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3g8rLMw0SbA0h2GHiOCBoqFTXVq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6n3PQSYpZRK5YPk2w8JEwED7AZk.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3g8rLMw0SbA0h2GHiOCBoqFTXVq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6n3PQSYpZRK5YPk2w8JEwED7AZk.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11862,"title":"Father of the Bride Part II","description":"Just when George Banks has recovered from his daughter''s wedding, he receives the news that she''s pregnant ... and that George''s wife is expecting too. He was planning on selling their home, but that''s a plan that—like George—will have to change with the arrival of both a grandchild and a kid of his own.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"1995-12-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lEsjVrGU21BeJjF5AF9EWsihDpw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rj4LBtwQ0uGrpBnCELr716Qo3mw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lEsjVrGU21BeJjF5AF9EWsihDpw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rj4LBtwQ0uGrpBnCELr716Qo3mw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9872,"title":"Explorers","description":"Middle schooler Ben spends his free time watching sci-fi films, playing video games and reading comic books. Surprisingly, his affinity for all things fantastical yields a real result – when he has a vivid dream about technology, his prodigy best friend Wolfgang manages to create a working spacecraft. Joined by their buddy Darren, the boys take off into outer space and encounter some very odd extraterrestrial life.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Adventure","Family"],"release_date":"1985-07-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ijNmO643l3HYM5k3i1L1ivSdWEb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oFJosj5ECYjf1jkvpTEjGNzPx2x.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ijNmO643l3HYM5k3i1L1ivSdWEb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oFJosj5ECYjf1jkvpTEjGNzPx2x.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":977223,"title":"Polite Society","description":"Martial artist-in-training Ria Khan believes she must save her older sister Lena from her impending marriage. After enlisting the help of her friends, Ria attempts to pull off the most ambitious of all wedding heists in the name of independence and sisterhood.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Comedy","Action","Drama"],"release_date":"2023-04-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aPvIX46VtxZDwu5bB2UcJ7xdpxs.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/Af1izSvHbGu6JiFTVzgfKxWQOfs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aPvIX46VtxZDwu5bB2UcJ7xdpxs.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//Af1izSvHbGu6JiFTVzgfKxWQOfs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":449755,"title":"Christmas Inheritance","description":"To inherit 