urse of the Judas Chalice","description":"While on a dangerous mission to recover the historic Judas Chalice, Flynn is saved by Simone. But when double-crossed by a respected professor and ambushed by a ruthless gang, Flynn realizes Simone''s secret, his true mission and a shocking discovery are all lying within a decaying New Orleans crypt.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Fantasy","Adventure","Comedy"],"release_date":"2008-10-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fWnWHEYVYDOMGSLfiRki2FyKGvB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qzpTcjPdhmKmEYx9oJO8y4ZZLU6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fWnWHEYVYDOMGSLfiRki2FyKGvB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qzpTcjPdhmKmEYx9oJO8y4ZZLU6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1724,"title":"The Incredible Hulk","description":"Scientist Bruce Banner scours the planet for an antidote to the unbridled force of rage within him: the Hulk. But when the military masterminds who dream of exploiting his powers force him back to civilization, he finds himself coming face to face with a new, deadly foe.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Action","Adventure"],"release_date":"2008-06-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xfBnQ4mgf1jYZsscJGJjr6ce0Ar.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gKzYx79y0AQTL4UAk1cBQJ3nvrm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xfBnQ4mgf1jYZsscJGJjr6ce0Ar.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gKzYx79y0AQTL4UAk1cBQJ3nvrm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":852448,"title":"I Came By","description":"A rebellious young graffiti artist, who targets the homes of the wealthy elite, discovers a shocking secret that leads him on a journey endangering himself and those closest to him.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2022-08-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/14wIOjYCtfbO9EHTqCbiU9