ium bequeaths the store to her, a dark and ominous change begins to take over the once-remarkable Emporium.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Family","Fantasy","Comedy"],"release_date":"2007-11-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uUG9jtLft9FDkIyfcR9KclY5Kuu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rdFgWATSVhhFtNYZUFsGcHzltcG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uUG9jtLft9FDkIyfcR9KclY5Kuu.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rdFgWATSVhhFtNYZUFsGcHzltcG.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1277884,"title":"Leave One Day","description":"Cécile is about to open her own gourmet restaurant, finally making her dream come true, when suddenly her father has a heart attack and she is called back to the village where she was born. Far from the hubbub of Paris life, she runs into her teenage crush. The memories come flooding back, destabilizing her certainties.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Music"],"release_date":"2025-05-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cEKnZxnCBiFWNfVl8eTi73cZFCM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/txzzgq2Rviv2Ljxnbh9Fy6gfDId.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cEKnZxnCBiFWNfVl8eTi73cZFCM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//txzzgq2Rviv2Ljxnbh9Fy6gfDId.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1109534,"title":"The Dive","description":"Two sisters go diving at a beautiful, remote location. One of the sisters is struck by a rock, leaving her trapped 28 meters below. With dangerously low levels of oxygen and cold temperatures, it is up to her sister to fight for her life.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Thriller","Adventure"],"release_date":"2023-08-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gknIloEJve4FgAzlKdOUZu1K9HT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1aLFglfGkTFG5p6KQg9o07EN3rl.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmd