ion","Drama","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"1995-02-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/i9opFwOh2DvFyjy8uQXC17UEUzL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hbkS4UpgHcGhLlGy9YCX4WIJ4lu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//i9opFwOh2DvFyjy8uQXC17UEUzL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hbkS4UpgHcGhLlGy9YCX4WIJ4lu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":689723,"title":"Dangerous Lies","description":"After losing her waitressing job, Katie Franklin takes a job as a caretaker to a wealthy elderly man in his sprawling, empty Chicago estate. The two grow close, but when he unexpectedly passes away and names Katie as his sole heir, she and her husband Adam are pulled into a complex web of lies, deception, and murder. If she''s going to survive, Katie will have to question everyone''s motives — even the people she loves.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Thriller"],"release_date":"2020-04-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tuqv0jb0o7sBOivgkagKJHuO6X4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6G1v6iFroz0Xw3VNxhMWjiS5hLa.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tuqv0jb0o7sBOivgkagKJHuO6X4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6G1v6iFroz0Xw3VNxhMWjiS5hLa.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":477044,"title":"Bergman Island","description":"An English-German filmmaking couple retreat to Fårö for the summer to each write screenplays for their upcoming films in an act of pilgrimage to the place that inspired Ingmar Bergman. As the summer and their screenplays advance, the lines between reality and fiction start to blur against the backdrop of the Island''s wild landscape.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2021-07-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e1X1veoQ5Hs45KoOjr80QMwVSgg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/q8bQfC7SbaTDVKywhCiNL