em designed and monitored by cats and dogs to keep the peace when conflicts arise. But when a tech-savvy villain hacks into wireless networks to use frequencies only heard by cats and dogs, he manipulates them into conflict and the worldwide battle between cats and dogs is BACK ON. Now, a team of inexperienced and untested agents will have to use their old-school animal instincts to restore order and peace between cats and dogs everywhere.","duration":"1:24:00","genre":["Family","Comedy","Action"],"release_date":"2020-09-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bLDpDWS67GVtfK35XfH3kCsliQR.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4BgSWFMW2MJ0dT5metLzsRWO7IJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bLDpDWS67GVtfK35XfH3kCsliQR.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4BgSWFMW2MJ0dT5metLzsRWO7IJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":715123,"title":"Books of Blood","description":"A journey into uncharted and forbidden territory through three tales tangled in space and time.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Horror","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2020-10-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oLA6GlYvfUAAzITiXo56NEKjVQE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bXLVZGgLgd7OwbfP6fC5GCfrxuD.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oLA6GlYvfUAAzITiXo56NEKjVQE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bXLVZGgLgd7OwbfP6fC5GCfrxuD.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":580532,"title":"Crisis","description":"Three stories about the world of opioids collide: a drug trafficker arranges a multi-cartel Fentanyl smuggling operation between Canada and the U.S., an architect recovering from an OxyContin addiction tracks down the truth behind her son''s involvement with narcotics, and a university professor battles unexpected revelations about his research employer, a drug company with deep government influence bringing a new \"non-addictive\" painkiller to market.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Thriller","Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2021-02-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gFDOQMQwo5UWegXE5kNEchn1eKx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ao4JajLcPITivfstlzENge3MPkq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gFDOQMQwo5UWegXE5kNEchn1eKx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ao4JajLcPITivfstlzENge3MPkq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":369781,"title":"Public Friends","description":"In order to make his little sick brother''s dream come true, Leo and his best mates organize a fake score...but on the d day, they make a mistake and the fake score becomes a real hold up.Here starts the extraordinary adventure of PUBLIC Amis.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2016-02-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/50Am0idc6sPz5cQZcwdmRfKMEZE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4DcYje54hmBsH3HK06PmMXp4fAu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//50Am0idc6sPz5cQZcwdmRfKMEZE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4DcYje54hmBsH3HK06PmMXp4fAu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":42589,"title":"Hi, Mom!","description":"Vietnam vet Jon Rubin returns to New York and rents a rundown flat in Greenwich Village. It is in this flat that he begins to film, ''Peeping Tom'' style, the people in the apartment across the street. His obsession with making films leads him to fall in with a radical ''Black Power'' group, which in turn leads him to carry out a bizarre act of urban terrorism.","duration":"1:27:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1970-04-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5mImDGZokUfdl6z7xZA7duFdWM7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/l4rge37nxK6nQFQVJxgdRaBG1xS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5mImDGZokUfdl6z7xZA7duFdWM7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://im