ust be responsible.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Horror","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2016-10-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/x9Jogr7lAtiAMyZH2sj6LECfeb6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u9NnEq4Be7hhwSvkNf6dOAD8ppi.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//x9Jogr7lAtiAMyZH2sj6LECfeb6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u9NnEq4Be7hhwSvkNf6dOAD8ppi.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":299824,"title":"Mojin: The Lost Legend","description":"Three tomb raiders retire from their roles and move to New York to enjoy the rest of their lives. However, they are asked to resume duty in order to find out the reason behind the loss of a loved one.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Drama","Horror","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2015-12-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6ilMT6VCADu5F1Xr9LjiVxQSXPp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/supoIHkh3dzDi1XmvK8tgGlkGNS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6ilMT6VCADu5F1Xr9LjiVxQSXPp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//supoIHkh3dzDi1XmvK8tgGlkGNS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":181812,"title":"Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker","description":"The surviving Resistance faces the First Order once again as the journey of Rey, Finn and Poe Dameron continues. With the power and knowledge of generations behind them, the final battle begins.","duration":"2:22:00","genre":["Adventure","Action","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2019-12-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/auJKGst3vXpJozHZh4nMFs0xWIU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/db32LaOibwEliAmSL2jjDF6oDdj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//auJKGst3vXpJozHZh4nMFs0xWIU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//db32LaOibwEliAmSL2jjDF6oDdj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":53174,"title":"Kokowääh","description":"Henry is a playboy who has no idea that he is the father of a beautiful, cute girl out of a One-night-Stand. Her mother left the daughter in front of Henry door after her husband realized after 8 years of marriage that he is not the father so their relationship now is breaking up... By the way: Kokowääh, is how a German (in this case an 8 Year old child) that has never heard the dish before - would pronounce \"Coq Au Vin\" (chicken in a wine sauce).","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2011-02-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oIFtnPkM3jqbq4kGlEjhARvhIxo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/s1xlGUJhPlqRa1FF6Uw73UXuEUS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oIFtnPkM3jqbq4kGlEjhARvhIxo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//s1xlGUJhPlqRa1FF6Uw73UXuEUS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":38167,"title":"Eat Pray Love","description":"A married woman realizes how unhappy her marriage really is, and that her life needs to go in a different direction. After a painful divorce, she takes off on a round-the-world journey to \"find herself\".","duration":"2:13:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2010-08-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/elzrIY3nfzWz4AXh0lxxBsXLCGI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gjR5zUeMGV6UNqtI0OuzqrLQcjU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//elzrIY3nfzWz4AXh0lxxBsXLCGI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gjR5zUeMGV6UNqtI0OuzqrLQcjU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2086,"title":"Nick of Time","description":"An ordinary man is suddenly forced into a plot to kill a politician in exchange for his kidnapped daughter''s freedom.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Thriller","Crime","Action"],"release_date":"1995-11-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u1JzntSiNw9vUCqYIOcNDajWwdZ.jpg","poster_path":"htt