tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/k5mNW8qutywD3GhAuaq33qcQR2y.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/phhp52CZZJiGYmiOTp9ZBDkGHB3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//k5mNW8qutywD3GhAuaq33qcQR2y.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//phhp52CZZJiGYmiOTp9ZBDkGHB3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":16246,"title":"Gone in 60 Seconds","description":"Insurance investigator Maindrian Pace and his team lead double-lives as unstoppable car thieves. When a South American drug lord pays Pace to steal 48 cars for him, all but one, a 1973 Ford Mustang, are in the bag. As Pace prepares to rip-off the fastback, codenamed \"Eleanor\", in Long Beach, he is unaware that his boss has tipped off the police after a business dispute.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"1974-07-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9Rw9dnT5PirFpNV8kP3ske75PYO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qYyeAodAOe4nHuzkHdN35ValzLT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9Rw9dnT5PirFpNV8kP3ske75PYO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qYyeAodAOe4nHuzkHdN35ValzLT.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":455656,"title":"#realityhigh","description":"When nerdy high schooler Dani finally attracts the interest of her longtime crush, she lands in the cross hairs of his ex, a social media celebrity.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2017-07-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/smgZYp49OB6xo4hZewxzryrh5xN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6WOWnBdR3I9gNhxbfStuUgpIv4O.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//smgZYp49OB6xo4hZewxzryrh5xN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6WOWnBdR3I9gNhxbfStuUgpIv4O.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":188222,"title":"Entourage","description":"Movie star Vincent Chase, together with his boys, Eric, Turtle and Johnny, are back…and back in business with super agent-turned-studio head Ari Gold. Some of their ambitions have changed, but the bond between them remains strong as they navigate the capricious and often cutthroat world of Hollywood.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2015-06-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uzobkEgGCfVzmXyXKH6Nbrby4Rm.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/28dqsx1jCxhR05DfH35ui13ywNZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uzobkEgGCfVzmXyXKH6Nbrby4Rm.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//28dqsx1jCxhR05DfH35ui13ywNZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":141043,"title":"A Long Way Down","description":"Four lost souls—a disgraced TV presenter, a foul-mouthed teen, an isolated single mother, and a failed musician—decide to end their lives on the same night, New Year''s Eve. When this disillusioned quartet of strangers meet unintentionally at the same suicide hotspot, a London high-rise with the well-earned nickname Topper''s Tower, they mutually agree to call off their plans for six weeks, forming an unconventional, dysfunctional family. They become media sensations as the Topper House Four and search together for reasons to keep on living.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2014-03-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cA2lXcl4rVKsRltJwVYRqpSqvhq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ibtYPDUQXKK2CIYzMEWgt1VNMlP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cA2lXcl4rVKsRltJwVYRqpSqvhq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ibtYPDUQXKK2CIYzMEWgt1VNMlP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":38356,"title":"Transformers: Dark of the Moon","description":"The Autobots continue to work for NEST, now no longer in secret. But after discovering a strange artifact during a mission in Chernobyl, it becomes apparent to Optimus Prime that the United States government has been less than forthright with them.","duration":"2:34:00","genre":["Action","Science Fiction","Adventure"],"release_date":"2011-06-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/h3js4rulxzKMOokM2oO5Kr0mBZU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/28YlCLrFhONteYSs9hKjD1Km0Cj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//h3js4rulxzKMOokM2oO5Kr0mBZU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//28YlCLrFhONteYSs9hKjD1Km0Cj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11938,"title":"Clockwise","description":"School headmaster Brian Stimpson is obsessed with timeliness, order, and discipline. Brian misses his train after meticulously preparing a speech for an education conference. With no one else to turn to, he asks young former student Laura Wisely for a ride. Laura, upset over a break-up, agrees to drive him in her parents'' car - which alarms her mother and father, who worry that she has run away with a married man and subsequently alert the police.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1986-03-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4oxpF2O8Hpnfc0xfc2aUNApcDDr.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uRetBG6n8ScyIdtkJNGngTqX75c.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4oxpF2O8Hpnfc0xfc2aUNApcDDr.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uRetBG6n8ScyIdtkJNGngTqX75c.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9460,"title":"Black Mask","description":"Super-soldier recruit Tsui Chik is forced to escape with his comrades after the project is canceled. Months later, he''s trying to have a quiet life as a librarian with his best friend, Inspector Shek Wai-Ho. However, a string of vicious gangland murders begins that has all the markings of Tsui''s former compatriots who seem to have turned to crime. Realizing that the police are helpless, he decides to take them on himself. With a disguise, Tsui becomes the mysterious superhero known only as Black Mask.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Action"],"release_date":"1996-11-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bHeNjLRJGuQjDXD5CzJzFm6aQF2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eEmG43S9o5C6XeFschoFQU4Bcub.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bHeNjLRJGuQjDXD5CzJzFm6aQF2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eEmG43S9o5C6XeFschoFQU4Bcub.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":432613,"title":"Marry Me, Dude","description":"Yassine asks his best friend Fred to marry him in order to avoid deportation...","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2017-10-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/o8s9MnlTJKkvz8KRC2Gi9SgvGRY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lYGkGZhNKajryEyYOrIF6snqIYZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//o8s9MnlTJKkvz8KRC2Gi9SgvGRY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lYGkGZhNKajryEyYOrIF6snqIYZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":371560,"title":"The Eyes of My Mother","description":"A young, lonely woman is consumed by her deepest and darkest desires after tragedy strikes her quiet country life.","duration":"1:16:00","genre":["Drama","Horror"],"release_date":"2016-12-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dUgO9cVENWQpDmZVzkWq2wXN5Od.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hoR1TAxIkO1rRHu3F7cWzKZqxq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dUgO9cVENWQpDmZVzkWq2wXN5Od.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hoR1TAxIkO1rRHu3F7cWzKZqxq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":172847,"title":"Scenic Route","description":"Stranded on an isolated desert road, two life-long friends fight for survival as their already strained relationship spirals into knife-wielding madness.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2013-08-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/