ipe the Picts from the face of the Earth and destroy their leader, Gorlacon.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Adventure","Action","Drama"],"release_date":"2010-02-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/idcccRSENk7fv4aRMHo7BY6jHoo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9ZdfrcP2QCqoRSk7JF06tDWtrhP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//idcccRSENk7fv4aRMHo7BY6jHoo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9ZdfrcP2QCqoRSk7JF06tDWtrhP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15050,"title":"Brainstorm","description":"Two brilliant research scientists have invented a device capable of recording and playing back sensory experiences only to have devastating results when one of them records their own death.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Thriller"],"release_date":"1983-09-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hog8OhWLCqUY3az5cKUAZfnZ3Od.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/afiRgLXIfH12NemvtthCkrwNtAu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hog8OhWLCqUY3az5cKUAZfnZ3Od.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//afiRgLXIfH12NemvtthCkrwNtAu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9440,"title":"Primary Colors","description":"In this adaptation of the best-selling roman à clef about Bill Clinton''s 1992 run for the White House, the young and gifted Henry Burton is tapped to oversee the presidential campaign of Governor Jack Stanton. Burton is pulled into the politician''s colorful world and looks on as Stanton -- who has a wandering eye that could be his downfall -- contends with his ambitious wife, Susan, and an outspoken adviser, Richard Jemmons.","duration":"2:23:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"1998-03-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8S0fdn8FumgyqEN2yQDeVfBFOk1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/RXEgVSEBkMnV8LkEGkBpuz3mkD.jpg","small_backdrop