ckdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jVgQzfKgJ7kCvviscQXpSPD208X.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jRwMdEb5bxwVARU2VmOADTflLfZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jVgQzfKgJ7kCvviscQXpSPD208X.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jRwMdEb5bxwVARU2VmOADTflLfZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9398,"title":"Zoolander","description":"Clear the runway for Derek Zoolander, VH1''s three-time male model of the year. His face falls when hippie-chic Hansel scooters in to steal this year''s award. The evil fashion guru Mugatu seizes the opportunity to turn Derek into a killing machine. It''s a well-designed conspiracy and only with the help of Hansel and a few well-chosen accessories like Matilda can Derek make the world safe for male models everywhere.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2001-09-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lIyyiBOuyokL82rPEDcZaMKleA3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qdrbSneHZjJG2Dj0hhBxzzAo4HB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lIyyiBOuyokL82rPEDcZaMKleA3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qdrbSneHZjJG2Dj0hhBxzzAo4HB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5842,"title":"Versus","description":"A group of ruthless gangsters, an unknown woman and an escaped convict have met, in The Forest of Resurrection, the 444th portal to the other side. Their troubles start when those once killed and buried in the forest come back from the dead.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Horror","Fantasy","Action","Thriller","Adventure"],"release_date":"2000-10-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rZjRoASxOOyafFruGRuDBzL7dZ8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dEk6Fpm4lkEBQBVpzTOLau7qgR9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rZjRoASxOOyafFruGRuDBzL7dZ8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/