r knew existed, comes into their lives, the sisters face some complicated truths about themselves and their family.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2005-10-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yNhmsmCqK6bTl4xUT28fJ1r6f61.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gmd2n3TuXewrbINp8Jfhwd5Jw6S.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yNhmsmCqK6bTl4xUT28fJ1r6f61.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gmd2n3TuXewrbINp8Jfhwd5Jw6S.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11665,"title":"Get Smart","description":"When members of the nefarious crime syndicate KAOS attack the U.S. spy agency Control and the identities of secret agents are compromised, the Chief has to promote hapless but eager analyst Maxwell Smart to field agent. He is partnered with veteran and capable Agent 99, the only spy whose cover remains intact. Can they work together to thwart the evil world-domination plans of KAOS and its crafty operative?","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Action","Comedy","Thriller"],"release_date":"2008-06-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u0yaNgikY92zkI0t3fiEGZP3UWq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sZUjbtUS8qxXp4mj90evnqPJqX7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u0yaNgikY92zkI0t3fiEGZP3UWq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sZUjbtUS8qxXp4mj90evnqPJqX7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1119878,"title":"Ice Road: Vengeance","description":"Big rig ice road driver Mike McCann travels to Nepal to scatter his late brother’s ashes on Mt. Everest. While on a packed tour bus traversing the deadly 12,000 ft. terrain of the infamous Road to the Sky, McCann and his mountain guide encounter a group of mercenaries and must fight to save themselves, the busload of innocent travelers, and the local villagers’ homeland.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Drama"],"release_date