h","description":"Asha, a sharp-witted idealist, makes a wish so powerful that it is answered by a cosmic force – a little ball of boundless energy called Star. Together, Asha and Star confront a most formidable foe - the ruler of Rosas, King Magnifico - to save her community and prove that when the will of one courageous human connects with the magic of the stars, wondrous things can happen.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Fantasy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2023-11-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ehumsuIBbgAe1hg343oszCLrAfI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nesuSdJakNkf0zs7OfoasB6Clxf.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ehumsuIBbgAe1hg343oszCLrAfI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nesuSdJakNkf0zs7OfoasB6Clxf.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":613093,"title":"Valley of the Dead","description":"During the Spanish Civil War, sworn enemies must work together when they encounter flesh-eating zombies created in a Nazi experiment.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Comedy","Horror","War"],"release_date":"2020-10-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/h6XfgbzQEV4sitsIVY63pawLI0s.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/avokvOwhjVR9GgISsSSgb2A343G.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//h6XfgbzQEV4sitsIVY63pawLI0s.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//avokvOwhjVR9GgISsSSgb2A343G.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":97605,"title":"Extracted","description":"Thomas Jacobs invents a way to watch people''s memories from the inside. Going against his morals, he accepts an offer to enter a heroin addict''s memories to literally see if he committed a crime. However,a malfunction causes his consciousness to become trapped inside the criminal''s mind. He remains a prisoner in the addict''s memories for more than four years until he discovers the possibility of escape.","duration":"1:25:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Thriller"],"release_date":"2012-03-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/WvmaStQ8bInvgFeViOgIBPTDM0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xJfdVG5wDt6LBQukvJmTeMOhbnz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//WvmaStQ8bInvgFeViOgIBPTDM0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xJfdVG5wDt6LBQukvJmTeMOhbnz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":6278,"title":"Reign of Fire","description":"In post-apocalyptic England, an American volunteer and a British survivor team up to fight off a brood of fire-breathing dragons seeking to return to global dominance after centuries of rest underground. The Brit—leading a clan of survivors to hunt down the King of the Dragons—has much at stake: his mother was killed by a dragon, but his love is still alive.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Adventure","Action","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2002-07-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gAozjuCvXYyrxhpkb0P4SuLnEkV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vZVXCj3jXzIPJUHLaQohzt2uTM3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gAozjuCvXYyrxhpkb0P4SuLnEkV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vZVXCj3jXzIPJUHLaQohzt2uTM3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4507,"title":"Jamon Jamon","description":"José Luis has a cushy corporate job at the lingerie factory his mom owns. After he falls in love and proposes to Silvia, a beautiful laborer on the underwear assembly line, his mom enlists Raul, a potential underwear model and would-be bullfighter, to seduce Silvia.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1992-09-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nmXzGIkLqChoPEAWauG9LdiNw37.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bxYSRl1vXGwaAD98aXSwZQ5hmAe.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nmXzGIkLqChoPEAWauG9LdiNw37.jpg","small_pos