ption":"The Shadow Mountains, 1983. Red and Mandy lead a loving and peaceful existence; but when their pine-scented haven is savagely destroyed, Red is catapulted into a phantasmagoric journey filled with bloody vengeance and laced with fire.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Fantasy","Action","Horror"],"release_date":"2018-09-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tNa19CK0CQZl5rxZ35QRdKAT2s0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/m0yf7J7HsKeK6E81SMRcX8vx6mH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tNa19CK0CQZl5rxZ35QRdKAT2s0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//m0yf7J7HsKeK6E81SMRcX8vx6mH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":109439,"title":"The Hangover Part III","description":"This time, there''s no wedding. No bachelor party. What could go wrong, right? But when the Wolfpack hits the road, all bets are off.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2013-05-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/o8ZS811VjYbBi4pRYwILLdWCVey.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vtxuPWkdllLNLVyGjKYa267ntuH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//o8ZS811VjYbBi4pRYwILLdWCVey.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vtxuPWkdllLNLVyGjKYa267ntuH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":64686,"title":"47 Ronin","description":"Kai—an outcast—joins Oishi, the leader of 47 outcast samurai.  Together they seek vengeance upon the treacherous overlord who killed their master and banished their kind.  To restore honour to their homeland, the warriors embark upon a quest that challenges them with a series of trials that would destroy ordinary warriors.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Drama","Action","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2013-12-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nyt0jlofZyjhRqiQkEp0cdoKaS3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xDHnmcroujCRG0ysYQaiswjbyHd.jpg","small_backdro